<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Install only necessary apps to avoid slowing down your store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQ Section (People Also Ask)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Is Shopify good for beginners?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, Shopify is designed for beginners and does not require coding knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. How much does Shopify cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shopify offers multiple pricing plans depending on your business needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Can I customize my Shopify store?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, you can fully customize your store using themes and apps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Do I need a developer for Shopify?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not necessarily, but for advanced features, professional Shopify Store Development services can help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Is Shopify suitable for large businesses?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, Shopify is scalable and supports businesses of all sizes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tech2globe-Blog-Banners-NEw-9.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2026-04-06 09:46:17','2026-06-01 11:30:26','2026-06-01 11:30:26'),(7,'What Is Quick Commerce and How Does It Work?','what-is-quick-commerce-for-sellers','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The way people shop online is evolving rapidly. Customers no longer want to wait days for delivery—they expect products within minutes. This shift has led to the rise of <strong>Quick Commerce (Q-Commerce)</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For businesses, this presents a massive opportunity to tap into high-demand, fast-moving markets. However, entering this space requires proper onboarding, setup, and operational expertise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is where services like <strong>Zepto seller registration</strong>, <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/quick-commerce-onboarding-services\">BigBasket seller registration</a></strong>, and other platform onboarding solutions become essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this guide, we’ll explain what quick commerce is, how it works, and how Tech2Globe helps businesses succeed in this fast-paced ecosystem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Is Quick Commerce?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quick commerce is a business model focused on delivering products to customers within <strong>10–30 minutes</strong> of placing an order.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is commonly used for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Groceries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Daily essentials</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personal care products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Snacks and beverages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike traditional eCommerce, quick commerce relies on <strong>hyperlocal fulfillment centers and optimized logistics</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Quick Commerce Is Growing Rapidly</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consumer behavior has shifted toward convenience and speed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Drivers of Growth</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Demand for instant delivery</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Urban lifestyle changes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mobile app adoption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advanced logistics infrastructure</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Business Opportunity</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quick commerce enables sellers to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reach nearby customers instantly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increase order frequency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve customer satisfaction</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Generate faster revenue cycles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Quick Commerce Works</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding the process helps businesses enter the market effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Seller Onboarding</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses must register on platforms through processes like:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Zepto seller registration</strong><