ng\"><strong>1. What is quick commerce?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quick commerce is a delivery model that provides products within minutes, usually through local fulfillment centers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. How can I register as a seller on Zepto or BigBasket?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need to complete documentation, verification, and product listing. Professional services can simplify the process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Is quick commerce suitable for small businesses?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, it helps small businesses reach local customers and increase daily sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. What products work best in quick commerce?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Groceries, daily essentials, personal care items, and FMCG products perform well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. How does Tech2Globe help with onboarding?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe provides end-to-end registration, catalog management, and growth strategies for quick commerce platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tech2globe-Blog-Banners-NEw-8.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2026-04-04 11:05:45','2026-06-01 11:30:26','2026-06-01 11:30:26'),(8,'What Are Google Shopping Ads and How Do They Work?','what-are-google-shopping-ads-and-how-do-they-work','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s highly competitive eCommerce landscape, getting your products in front of the right customers at the right time is critical. Traditional text ads are no longer enough—shoppers want to see products, prices, and reviews instantly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is where <strong>Google Shopping Ads</strong> come into play.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the right strategy and the support of a professional <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopping-ads-services\">google shopping ads agency</a></strong>, businesses can significantly improve visibility, attract high-intent buyers, and drive more conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this guide, we’ll break down what Google Shopping Ads are, how they work, and how Tech2Globe helps businesses maximize their performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Are Google Shopping Ads?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Shopping Ads are product-based advertisements that appear on search engine results pages (SERPs) when users search for products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These ads include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product image</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Title</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Price</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Store name</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reviews</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike traditional ads, Shopping Ads rely on <strong>product data feeds</strong> rather than just keywords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Google Shopping Ads Matter for eCommerce Businesses</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modern shoppers are visual and comparison-driven. They want quick information before making a purchase decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Challenges Businesses Face Without Shopping Ads</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low product visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Poor click-through rates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited product exposure</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High competition</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Shopping Ads Solve These Problems</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Showcase products visually</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Attract high-intent buyers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve click-through rates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Drive qualified traffic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Google Shopping Ads Work</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding how Shopping Ads function is key to success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Product Feed Submission</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your product data is uploaded to Google Merchant Center.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product titles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Descriptions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Images</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prices</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Availability</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Campaign Creation in Google Ads</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once your feed is approved, campaigns are created in Google Ads.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Set budget and bidding strategy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose campaign type</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Define targeting settings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Auction &amp; Ad Placement</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google determines when to show your ads based on:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product relevance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bid amount</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Feed quality</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your ads appear in:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Search results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shopping tab</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Partner websites</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Performance Tracking &amp; Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Key metrics include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click-through rate (CTR)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conversion rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost per click (CPC)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Return on ad spend (ROAS)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continuous optimization ensures better results over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Types of Google Shopping Campaigns</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Standard Shopping Campaigns</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Manual control over bids</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Suitable for experienced advertisers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Smart Shopping Campaigns</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated bidding and targeting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Uses machine learning for optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Real-World Use Cases of Google Shopping Ads</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Case 1: eCommerce Startup Increasing Visibility</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A new brand struggled with low traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimized product feed</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<l