ensures better visibility, improved customer experience, and higher conversion rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Can I manage my Myntra account myself?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, but it requires time and expertise. Many sellers prefer outsourcing for better efficiency and results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. How does Tech2Globe help Myntra sellers?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe provides end-to-end account management, including catalog optimization, inventory management, and growth strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. How can I increase sales on Myntra?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By optimizing listings, improving catalog quality, using competitive pricing, and leveraging professional account management services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Tech2globe-Blog-Banners-NEw-5.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2026-04-01 14:09:01','2026-06-01 11:30:26','2026-06-01 11:30:26'),(11,'What Is Amazon Marketing Services and How Does It Work?','what-is-amazon-marketing-services-and-how-does-it-work','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Selling on Amazon today is no longer just about listing products—it’s about <strong>visibility, strategy, and performance-driven advertising</strong>. With millions of sellers competing for attention, brands must invest in smart marketing to stand out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is where <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-marketing-services\">amazon marketing services</a></strong> play a crucial role.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this guide, we’ll break down what Amazon Marketing Services is, how it works, and how businesses can leverage it to <strong>increase visibility, drive conversions, and scale revenue</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Is Amazon Marketing Services?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon Marketing Services (AMS), now widely integrated into Amazon Ads, is a powerful advertising platform that allows sellers and brands to promote their products directly on Amazon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It helps businesses:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reach high-intent customers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve product visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Drive targeted traffic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increase conversions and sales</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In simple terms, <strong>amazon marketing services</strong> enable you to place your products in front of buyers who are already searching for similar items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Amazon Marketing Services Matters for Businesses</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon is one of the most competitive eCommerce marketplaces. Without proper visibility, even great products can remain unnoticed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Challenges Sellers Face</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low product visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High competition</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Poor conversion rates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Inefficient ad spend</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Amazon Marketing Solves These Problems</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Places your products at the top of search results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Targets relevant keywords and audiences</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimizes campaigns for better ROI</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provides measurable performance insights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Amazon Marketing Services Works</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding how <strong>amazon marketing services</strong> works can help you make smarter advertising decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Keyword Targeting</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon ads work primarily on keyword targeting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You bid on keywords relevant to your product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your ad appears when customers search for those terms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Higher relevance and optimized bids improve visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Ad Auction System</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon uses a bidding system similar to PPC advertising.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sellers bid for ad placements</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The highest bidder doesn’t always win—relevance matters</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimized campaigns reduce cost per click (CPC)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Ad Placements</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your ads can appear in multiple places:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search results (top and middle)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product detail pages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Competitor listings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Performance Tracking &amp; Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon provides real-time data such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click-through rate (CTR)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conversion rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advertising cost of sales (ACoS)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This allows continuous optimization for better results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Types of Amazon Ads You Should Know</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Sponsored Products</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Promote individual product listings to increase visibility and sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Sponsored Brands</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase your brand logo, headline, and multiple products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Sponsored Display Ads</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Retarget customers both on and off Amazon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Real-World Use Cases of Amazon Marketing Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Case 1: Startup Launching a New Product</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A new seller struggled to gain visibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Targeted Sponsored Product campaigns</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Result:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3x increase in product visibility</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Significant boost in early sales</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Case 2: eCommerce Brand Scaling Revenue</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An established brand wanted to expand market share.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sponsored Brand campaigns</li>\n<!-- /wp:li