were quickly managed, and 10 buildings were monitored efficiently with just 2 team members. A textbook example of efficiency powered by AI-based video analytics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs: Clear Answers for Smart Decision-Makers</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q1. Is your system compatible with our existing cameras?</strong><br>Yes! We support most IP and analog cameras.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q2. How fast does it detect threats?</strong><br>Under 3 seconds via our <strong>Real Time Detection</strong> engine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q3. Can we control everything remotely?</strong><br>Absolutely. Our mobile app and web dashboard offer full access.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q4. Is it expensive?</strong><br>No. Our modular pricing makes it affordable and scalable.<strong>Q5. What’s the biggest benefit?</strong><br>Less manual work, smarter security, real-time prevention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Final Thoughts: The Video Surveillance Revolution Is Now</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The world isn’t just evolving — it’s accelerating. From smart cities and connected retail to autonomous factories and secure campuses, intelligent surveillance has become a mission-critical necessity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Tech2Globe’s AI-Based Video Analytics, your cameras become more than just eyes — they become thinkers. Our powerful video monitoring system turns every frame into real-time intelligence, helping you not just react to threats, but anticipate them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Security is no longer reactive. It’s proactive. It’s predictive. It’s Tech2Globe.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph 