u with seamless installation, integration, and customized scaling to fit your specific use cases and business environment, right from deployment to growth. Watch out this space for further updates, as we will soon be revealing the name of our cutting-edge AI-powered surveillance tool, complete with must-know features, core benefits, how it can elevate your security infrastructure, ideal use cases, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Video-AI-Power.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-05-20 10:15:00','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(69,'Talk Smart, Sell Smarter: Experience Tech2Globe’s Virtual Assistants &amp; AI Marketing in Action at GITEX Berlin','talk-smart-sell-smarter-experience-tech2globes-virtual-assistants-ai-marketing-in-action-at-gitex-berlin','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Booth: Hall 5. A29 | Messe Berlin | 21–23 May 2025</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>That is the new capital of the digital future – and it is Berlin.</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In May 2025, the shape of Europe’s startup capital shifts to its global innovation hub with the much awaited debuts of GITEX Europe. With over 6000 CXOs, over 700 startups, and 1400 global tech companies, the continent will experience the biggest ever Tech showcase of emerging techs in European history.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe finds pride in leading this charge amongst the visionaries. We’re not just there at GITEX Europe, we’re actually setting the new frontiers of digital transformation from our home base at A29, Hall 5.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Who We Are: From Global Service Provider to Digital Intelligence Partner</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> has assisted more than 14 years to global enterprises to evolve, optimize, and grow in customized IT and digital solutions. From smart data ecosystems to AI-based customer experiences, we come together with technology, creativity and business smarts to create measurable impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Global Footprint:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>India (HQ)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>United States</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Canada</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Germany</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>UAE</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why GITEX Europe Matters (to You and to Us)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Europe is at a turning point. As the continent invests billions into AI regulation, digital infrastructure, and cybersecurity resilience, it’s becoming the most dynamic region for data-first innovation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>GITEX Europe 2025</strong> is a launchpad for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>EU Digital Sovereignty</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>GDPR-aligned AI adoption</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Smart eCommerce ecosystems</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cross-border virtual operations</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe is here to help your business ride this wave — not get swept by it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Tech Showcase at GITEX: Built for the Now, Ready for What’s Next?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Pillar</strong></td><td><strong>Experience at Booth A29</strong></td><td><strong>What It Solves</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>AI-Driven Data Management</strong></td><td>Live demos of real-time data orchestration platforms</td><td>Data silos, compliance complexity, and decision lags</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Virtual Assistants &amp; Automation</strong></td><td>Chat with multilingual AI agents in real-time</td><td>Operational costs, CX gaps, 24/7 support demands</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Digital Marketing Intelligence</strong></td><td>See how we use AI to predict and optimize campaigns</td><td>Poor ROI, blind targeting, low engagement</td></tr><tr><td><strong>E-Commerce Growth Stack</strong></td><td>Try our tech evaluation tools &amp; conversion audit kits</td><td>Cart abandonment, scaling issues, platform limitations</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pillar 1: Intelligent Data Management – Turn Chaos into Clarity</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“You can’t automate what you don’t understand. Data is step one.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modern enterprises struggle with fragmented, outdated, or unreadable data. Tech2Globe helps you build data architectures that think, act, and scale with your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How We Do It:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>🌐 Consolidation from ERP, CRM, POS, and cloud systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>🧠 AI-based data cleansing, tagging, and deduplication</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>🚦 GDPR-ready governance frameworks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>📊 Real-time dashboards for sales, ops, and CX insights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use Case:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A pan-European logistics firm used Tech2Globe’s data hub to consolidate tracking data from 6 countries into a single dashboard, reducing SLA breaches by 41% in three months.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pillar 2: Virtual Assistants That Do More than Talk</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our AI-powered virtual assistants aren’t just chatbots — they’re context-aware, multilingual workflow agents built to scale support, increase revenue, and enhance satisfaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What They Handle:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>E-commerce: Cart recovery, returns, product queries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Healthcare: Appointment scheduling, symptom triage</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Finance: KYC processing, account insights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li> SaaS: Tier-1 support, onboarding, user training</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Built With:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>NLP in 10+ languages (including DE, FR, NL)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Seamless CRM integration (Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Voice &amp; Text capability (Web, WhatsApp, Mobile)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Result:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A D2C skincare brand added €120K in recovered revenue in Q4 2024 through AI-driven WhatsApp VAs that engaged cart abandoners in under 30 seconds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pillar 3: Predictive Marketing Powered by Machine Learning</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Forget guesswork. Our AI Marketing Suite uses machine learning to create, optimize, and personalize customer journeys across every touchpoint.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What You’ll See at Tech2Globe’s Booth:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Live campaign optimization demo using real-time behavior</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dynamic audience segmentation with predictive scores</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A/B Testing automation with AI creative suggestions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Retargeting journeys optimized by intent</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Did You Know?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Brands using predictive marketing see:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>2.2X higher conversion rates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>35% more effective retargeting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>22% reduction in CAC</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Platform Integrates With:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta Ads, Google Ads, LinkedIn</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shopify, Magento, WooCommerce</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>HubSpot, Marketo, ActiveCampaign</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pillar 4: Next-Gen E-Commerce Consulting for Global Scale</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Europe’s multi-platform, multi-currency landscape, scaling e-commerce means mastering complexity. At GITEX, our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">e-commerce consultants</a> offer free platform audits and growth strategy maps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We Help With:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Marketplace entry (Amazon, eBay, Otto, Cdiscount)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CRO (Conversion Rate Optimization)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Subscription &amp; loyalty integrations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Warehouse + order management digitalization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Real Impact:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We helped a UK fashion brand:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Expand to 5 new marketplaces</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automate fulfillment</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve AOV by 28% using AI bundling strategies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Exclusive at GITEX: Micro-Talks &amp; Expert Clinics</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want quick wins and real talk? Join us for these bite-sized 15-minute sessions at our booth:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Session Title</strong></td><td><strong>What You’ll Learn</strong></td></tr><tr><td>“Data Detox: Fix Your Silos”</td><td>How to unify and clean messy data</td></tr><tr><td>“Chatbots that Convert”</td><td>Real examples of sales-focused VAs</td></tr><tr><td>“Don’t Waste Your Ads”</td><td>Using AI to lower CPC and boost CTR</td></tr><tr><td>“The AI-Powered Storefront”</td><td>Smart UX strategies for modern buyers</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Limited spots – drop by early or pre-book</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The European Shift: Why Businesses Must Digitize Now</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The EU is investing €127B under the Digital Europe Program and enforcing laws like the AI Act to regulate ethical AI use. Businesses that fail to adapt risk fines, fragmentation, and customer loss.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe supports companies by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offering GDPR-compliant solutions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Localizing CX for Europe’s multilingual market</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensuring data sovereignty through hybrid cloud setups</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Helping SMBs digitize quickly with plug-and-play tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Thought Leadership: Why AI without Strategy Is Just Hype</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Generative AI, ChatGPT, and LLMs are reshaping industries, but real ROI only comes when they’re embedded in business logic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>At Tech2Globe, we don’t just build tech. We align it with:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strategic OKRs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sales pipelines</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CX journeys</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Compliance regulations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We call it <strong>“Intelligent Transformation.”</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Fast Facts about GITEX Europe 2025</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Stat</strong></td><td><strong>Detail</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>Messe Berlin – South Entrance</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dates</strong></td><td><strong>21–23 May 2025</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Visitors</td><td>35,000+ business leaders</td></tr><tr><td>Startups</td><td>750+ from over 30 countries</td></tr><tr><td>Speakers</td><td>400+ (AI, eCommerce, Quantum, Cyber)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Stay Connected with Tech2Globe</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow our journey to Berlin and get exclusive behind-the-scenes content:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Want to Meet Us at GITEX? Pre-Book a Private Demo</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Skip the line. Book a 1:1 consultation or live demo slot with our team in Berlin now:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Thought: Build with Purpose. Scale with Intelligence.</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We don’t believe in digital for digital’s sake. We believe in using technology to create value, impact, and clarity in a chaotic business world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you’re:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A startup ready to scale</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A retail giant navigating AI disruption</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A CIO fixing fragmented data systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We’re ready to build with you.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See you at Booth A29 in Hall 5 – GITEX Europe 2025, Berlin, Germany.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download <a href=\"https://www.gitex-europe.com/app\">GITEX Europe mobile app</a> for iOS and Android for smooth navigation of the venue and its events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow Tech2Globe on:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tech2globe/posts/?feedView=all\">Tech2globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X: <a href=\"https://x.com/Tech2Globe\">Tech2globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tech2globe.software\">Tech2globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s power the intelligent enterprise — together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Experience-Tech2Globes-Virtual-Assistants-AI-Marketing-in-Action-at-GITEX-Berlin.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-05-16 10:53:24','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(70,'Tech2Globe at GITEX Europe 2025: Innovating Intelligence, Empowering Digital Growth','tech2globe-showcases-ai-and-innovation-at-gitex-europe-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;Stand No - H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2<br><strong>Dates:</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;May 21–23, 2025<br><strong>Venue:</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Messe Berlin – South Entrance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Welcome to Future of Smart Business</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a fast-moving digital economy, it’s not necessarily those who are the biggest that survive, it’s the smartest, fastest and most agile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we build those businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we gear up to walk into the shoes of over 6,000 global pioneers at GITEX Europe 2025, we welcome you into a world where data is clarity, automation is strategy, and where AI is your competitive advantage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are more than exhibitors. We are creators of digital intelligence, and Booth A29 is where the next transformation can begin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why GITEX Europe 2025? Why Now?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first-ever European edition of GITEX is underway in the middle of Berlin and has already earned the title of one of the most influential tech events of the decade. With significant support from the European Union, and the AI Act being among other projects, this is the platform for the next wave of trustworthy AI, data privacy progression and cross-border digital collaboration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is not just an exposition. It’s a tech summit, a solutions marketplace, and a policy innovation forum—and Tech2Globe is a proud participant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Presence at GITEX Europe 2025</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we help businesses open up new dimensions of efficiency, engagement and growth in four key areas of service:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Data Management: Make Data Your Superpower</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the age of AI, data is not just information—it’s intelligence. But most businesses are drowning in fragmented, outdated, or unused data. That’s where we come in.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">Data Management</a> solutions go far beyond traditional storage or reporting. We build data ecosystems—fully integrated, governed, and designed for real-time decision-making.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What We Offer:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Centralized Data Warehousing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Custom ETL Pipelines and Data Lake Architecture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Quality Audits &amp; Cleansing Automation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GDPR and Global Compliance-Ready Frameworks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Business Intelligence Dashboards &amp; Reporting Tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters to You:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eliminate information silos across departments</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enable instant insights from complex data streams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stay compliant in a rapidly evolving privacy landscape</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Empower your leadership team with live decision dashboards</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Turn static reports into predictive models that fuel future strategy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We don’t just manage your data—we activate it. With our help, your numbers will finally start talking business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Virtual Assistant Services: Automation with a Human Touch</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine a customer support system that never sleeps, a sales assistant that remembers every prospect, and a help desk that gets smarter with every interaction. That’s the power of our AI-powered Virtual Assistant Services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our VAs aren’t basic chatbots—they’re trained digital employees designed to engage, resolve, escalate, and convert. Built with advanced natural language processing (NLP), deep-learning algorithms, and customizable personas, these assistants adapt to your brand and your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>&nbsp;What We Provide:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI-Powered Customer Support Assistants</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Intelligent Scheduling &amp; Booking Agents</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conversational Sales Assistants</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>HR &amp; Recruitment Virtual Helpers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Industry-Specific Bots (Healthcare, Retail, SaaS, Education)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Integration with CRM, ERP, eCommerce, and Helpdesk Platforms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters to You:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduce response time by up to <strong>70%</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Achieve 24/7 global availability without adding headcount</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve customer satisfaction and lead conversion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Free up human teams to focus on high-value tasks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide multilingual, multicultural support at scale</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Virtual assistants are no longer futuristic—they’re foundational. We help you deploy them strategically.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. AI-Driven Digital Marketing: Predict, Personalize, Perform</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Digital marketing has changed forever. Algorithms have replaced guesswork. At Tech2Globe, we embrace this transformation head-on with AI-Driven Digital Marketing solutions that connect customer behavior, content, and conversion through intelligent automation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use machine learning models to optimize every layer of your marketing funnel—from who you target to when you reach them, what message you deliver, and how you scale it across channels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>&nbsp;What We Do:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI-Based Audience Segmentation &amp; Behavioral Profiling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Predictive Lead Scoring &amp; Conversion Modeling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dynamic Creative Optimization (DCO)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multichannel Automation: Email, Social, Paid, Programmatic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sentiment Analysis &amp; Feedback Loops</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hyper-Personalized Campaigns Using Real-Time Data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters to You:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reach the right person with the right message at the right time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increase campaign ROI by targeting high-intent micro-segments</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduce acquisition cost by leveraging AI insights</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automate campaign scaling across regions and platforms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Understand not just what’s working, but why it’s working</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Scale without breaking your supply chain or margins</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimize ad spend and retention strategies via data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Build a <strong>tech-enabled, customer-centric ecosystem</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re not a digital agency. We’re a digital intelligence engine. Our AI doesn’t just track performance—it drives it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. E-Commerce Consulting: From Storefront to Scalable System</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a saturated market, launching an e-commerce store is easy. Building a profitable, sustainable, and intelligent e-commerce business? That’s our domain.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we offer end-to-end <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">e-commerce consulting</a> that integrates technology, strategy, logistics, and AI. Whether you’re scaling from 10 to 10,000 orders/month or expanding into new global markets, we help you do it faster—and smarter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Expertise Includes:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>E-Commerce Platform Selection &amp; Setup (Shopify, Magento, WooCommerce, custom builds)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Inventory Management &amp; Logistics Integration</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Omnichannel Experience Design (Web, App, Marketplaces)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI-Powered Personalization &amp; Recommendations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data-Driven Conversion Optimization</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global Tax &amp; Compliance Consulting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>B2B &amp; D2C Strategy Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your e-commerce store isn’t just a site—it’s a system. We help you master that system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What to Expect at Booth A29?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re designing our presence at GITEX Europe 2025 not just to showcase what we do—but to show <strong>how it can directly benefit you.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s what you can expect when you visit:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience</strong></td><td><strong>Details</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Live Demos</td><td>Interact with our data dashboards, AI tools, and virtual assistant interfaces</td></tr><tr><td>Free Mini Audits</td><td>Bring your data challenges or ecommerce pain points—we’ll help live</td></tr><tr><td>Expert Talks</td><td>3 daily talks on AI in marketing, intelligent automation, and scaling smart</td></tr><tr><td>Workshop Stations</td><td>Get hands-on with our AI marketing engine and VA builders</td></tr><tr><td>Giveaways</td><td>Strategy templates, AI marketing playbooks, and consultation credits</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you want to explore how AI can reshape your marketing, see a virtual assistant in action, or discuss a cross-border ecommerce strategy—our team will be there with real solutions, not just sales pitches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Who Should Visit Tech2Globe?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A CMO tired of ineffective ad spend?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A CTO facing data sprawl and compliance chaos?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A Founder launching a digital-first business?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A COO automating processes to boost scalability?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A Customer Experience Lead looking to deploy AI that feels human?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Then you’ll find practical answers, tested tools, and a roadmap forward with Tech2Globe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let’s Build What’s Next—Together</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GITEX Europe 2025 is more than a technology showcase. It’s where vision meets execution, where buzzwords become business value, and where partnerships shape industries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we’re not interested in selling trends—we’re committed to solving real problems using intelligent, integrated, and innovative solutions across data, automation, AI, and digital commerce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Booth A29 is where it starts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Don’t Miss It!</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> at <a href=\"https://www.gitex-europe.com/\">GITEX Europe 2025</a></strong><br>Stand No - H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2<em> – Messe Berlin, South Entrance</em><br><em>May 21–23, 2025</em><br><em>Show Hours: 09:30 – 17:00 Daily</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Book a meeting with our consultants ahead of the event</strong><br><strong>Follow us for live updates</strong>: #Tech2GlobeAtGITEX<br><strong>Download the GITEX Europe app</strong> to find us on the interactive map and schedule a visit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Tech2Globe-at-GITEX-Europe-2025-Innovating-Intelligence-Empowering-Digital-Growth.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-05-12 10:51:53','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(71,'Step into the Future of Intelligent Business: Visit Tech2Globe at GITEX Europe 2025','tech2globe-at-gitex-europe-2025-for-future-ready-business-solutions','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Stand No - H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2 | Messe Berlin | 21–23 May 2025</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the rush to enter our age of intelligent automation, one fact is fast becoming undeniable. It’s not the largest or oldest organizations that succeed. It’s the smartest.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At GITEX Europe 2025, invite you to look beyond the buzz and see how the world’s real companies are using AI, data, and human-machine collaboration to solve hard problems, grow faster, and enrich customer engagements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not just a place, Booth A29 in Hall 5 at GITEX Europe 2025 is a transformation hub. A place to reboot how you perceive operations, marketing, service and commerce. No smoke, no mirrors. Just working solutions. Proven results. And experts who enjoy talking strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is why you should drop by – and what your team will take away.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Your Journey on Intelligent Growth: 4 Transformation Tracks</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ve reinvented the Tech2Globe booth experience as an immersive experience of four tracks of innovations. Select your pathway — or traverse them all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TRACK 1: Unlock Clarity – Data Management Lab</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“AI doesn’t start with algorithms. It begins with clean, connected data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data is not in short supply in most organizations today. They are missing data that is useful – integrated, available in real time, actionable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">Data Management</a> Lab, at Tech2Globe we will demonstrate to you how we assist businesses:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Clean legacy data systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Integrate silo platforms (ERP, CRm, CMS and others)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Creation of real time dashboards of all the stakeholders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Compliance to GDPR and cross-border rules</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Live Simulation:</strong> Watch us build a working data pipeline in minutes, from raw ingestion to visual analytics — using real (anonymized) business datasets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TRACK 2: Meet Your AI Teammates — The Virtual Assistant Studio</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Customer expectations are up. Service budgets are down. AI assistants are the bridge.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In our Virtual Assistant Studio, you’ll interact with <strong>fully functional AI agents</strong> built for specific industries — trained to handle everything from first-contact support to order tracking and appointment booking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These aren’t generic bots — they’re specialized, branded extensions of your team. Trained in your workflows, fluent in your tone of voice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Retail: Shopping help, returns, shipping FAQs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Healthcare: Patient triage, scheduling, secure info retrieval</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Travel: Itinerary updates, cancellations, loyalty programs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SaaS: Tier-1 support, onboarding, troubleshooting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Experience It Live:</strong> Talk to our AI agents in real time. See how they escalate complex cases, learn from interactions, and handle multi-language support — all while integrating with tools like Zendesk, HubSpot, and Salesforce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bonus: Ask us how to build your first AI assistant in under 30 days — even without in-house developers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TRACK 3: Marketing That Thinks for Itself — AI-Powered Growth Engine</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Your customers are moving fast. Is your marketing keeping up?”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today’s buyer journey is unpredictable — fragmented across devices, platforms, and moods. That’s why old-school campaign calendars and one-size-fits-all emails don’t cut it anymore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At our <strong>AI-Driven Digital Marketing Showcase</strong>, see how we’re helping brands:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Predict buyer intent in real-time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Auto-optimize ad spend with machine learning</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personalize content for each user, not each segment</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Measure lifetime value, not just clicks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Behind the Curtain:</strong> We’ll walk you through the actual AI models we use — including lookalike targeting, sentiment-aware creatives, and micro-moment bidding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Client Impact:</strong> One retail partner reduced CAC by 29% in just 60 days using our dynamic ad routing engine. Come see how.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TRACK 4: Smarter Stores, Happier Buyers — E-commerce Intelligence Zone</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Modern <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">e-commerce</a> isn’t about adding products. It’s about adding insight.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your store isn’t a catalog. It’s a living ecosystem — one that needs to adapt in real time, scale across channels, and optimize for every click, cart, and conversation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe’s <strong>E-commerce Intelligence Zone</strong>, discover how we empower growing and global brands to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Launch and scale online stores (Shopify, Magento, WooCommerce, headless)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use AI to power smart search, bundling, upsells</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimize for mobile UX, speed, and checkout</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Align e-commerce with ERP, fulfillment, and CX</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Live Comparison:</strong> We’ll walk you through two versions of the same store — one traditional, one AI-enhanced — and let the metrics do the talking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Don’t Just Browse — Book a Session with Our Strategists</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Across all four tracks, you’ll have access to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mini-workshops (15–20 mins) tailored to your business</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Real conversations with solution architects, not salespeople</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Walk-throughs of client case studies across industries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a challenge you’re wrestling with right now? Bring it. We’ll whiteboard solutions on the spot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Book your strategy slot ahead of time — our calendar fills fast during GITEX.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Who Will Get the Most from Visiting Tech2Globe?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Marketing &amp; Growth Leaders</strong> — looking to scale without hiring armies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Digital Transformation Heads</strong> — integrating AI and automation intelligently</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Founders &amp; Startups</strong> — needing scalable systems without enterprise bloat</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Retail &amp; D2C Brands</strong> — optimizing conversion and customer retention</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>CX Leaders</strong> — who want to balance automation and empathy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even if you’re just curious — this is your space to learn, question, test, and leave smarter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Tech2Globe? Why Now?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a>, we don’t sell promises. We implement systems. We train people. We get results. With clients in over 20 countries, and over a decade of experience across data services, AI development, digital marketing, and e-commerce enablement, we’ve become the trusted partner for brands ready to scale with intelligence — not guesswork.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GITEX Europe is your chance to experience it all firsthand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reason why GITEX Europe 2025 is not to be missed, particularly at Tech2Globe’s Booth A29, Hall 5.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Feature</strong></td><td><strong>What to Expect</strong></td><td><strong>Why It Matters</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Global Launchpad</strong></td><td>750+ startups, 100+ countries</td><td>Network with innovators &amp; deal-makers from around the world</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AI in Everything</strong></td><td>AI’s influence in real-world sectors</td><td>From AGI to AI ethics, witness the future unfold</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Future Forums</strong></td><td>C-suite conversations: CTOs, CISOs, COOs</td><td>Exclusive strategy-sharing to shape enterprise futures</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Regulatory Milestones</strong></td><td>The new AI Act &amp; Europe\'s AI Office</td><td>Understand compliance &amp; innovation in harmony</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hands-On Innovation</strong></td><td>Live AI, robotics, and digital showcases</td><td>Test, touch, and talk tech—right on the spot</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Details at a Glance:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> 21–23 May 2025<br><strong>Venue:</strong> Messe Berlin, <strong>Stand No - H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2</strong><br><strong>Hours:</strong> 9:30 AM – 5:00 PM<br><strong>Meeting Requests:</strong> info@tech2globe.com</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Don’t Watch the Future Happen. Build It!</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GITEX Europe is where leaders meet the ideas and technologies shaping tomorrow’s businesses. At Tech2Globe, we’re not just showcasing products — we’re solving real problems in data, marketing, support, and commerce. Problems you may be facing right now.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you’re a curious founder, an overwhelmed IT leader, or a growth marketer hungry for smarter insights — let’s talk.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You’ll walk away with ideas, action steps, and real tech that works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come find us. Let’s build what’s next — together<strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download <a href=\"https://www.gitex-europe.com/app\">GITEX Europe mobile app</a> for iOS and Android to get complete details of the event at your fingertips.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow Tech2Globe at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X: <a href=\"https://x.com/Tech2Globe\">Tech2Globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tech2globe/posts/?feedView=all\">Tech2Globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tech2globe.software\">Tech2Globe</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Blog-Images.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-05-05 10:33:16','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` VALUES (72,'Tech2Globe at GITEX Europe 2025: Driving Digital Evolution from Berlin to the World','tech2globe-at-gitex-europe-2025-driving-digital-evolution-from-berlin-to-the-world','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong>                   21–23 May 2025<br><strong>Venue:</strong>                  Messe Berlin – Stand No - H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2<br><strong>Show Hours:</strong>        09:30 – 17:00<br><strong>Event Theme:</strong>      A Bolder Digital Europe is Open</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Berlin is calling. Innovation is converging. And Tech2Globe is answering the call.</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe is poised to make a stir at GITEX Europe 2025 in one of the most powerful, future-focused technology events around the world. With the digital economy of Europe now ready to turn over a new leaf at tremendous speed, we’re proud to present our forward-thinking services backed by AI, ingenuity of man, and hard-won business acumen.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why GITEX Europe 2025 Matters</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GITEX Europe is not just another tech event — it’s a launchpad of the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>1,400+ global exhibitors</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>750+ disruptive startups</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>600+ top-tier investors</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100+ countries represented</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>14 dynamic content stages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>8 core tech conference tracks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gitex-europe.com/\">GITEX Europe 2025</a> makes its debut at Messe, Berlin, in Germany, as Europe’s largest technology and innovation expo, unites AI, sustainability, cybersecurity, digital marketing, and ecommerce innovation in one place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Tech2Globe Is Bringing to the Table?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At our booth (H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2), you won’t just find a list of services. You’ll experience interactive sessions, live demos, and conversations that spark real business transformation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Core Focus Areas:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Service Area</strong></td><td><strong>Highlights</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Data Management</strong></td><td>Big data architecture, real-time insights, governance, and GDPR-compliant systems</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Virtual Assistant Services</strong></td><td>AI-powered chatbots, 24/7 customer support, automated onboarding</td></tr><tr><td><strong>AI-Driven Digital Marketing</strong></td><td>Predictive analytics, AI agents for campaign automation, real-time personalization</td></tr><tr><td><strong>E-commerce Consulting</strong></td><td>Platform strategy, tech stack optimization, AI-based personalization &amp; pricing engines</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Defining the Data Frontier: Smarter Data Management for a Smarter Europe</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the age of information overload, organizations face:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Too much data, too little insight</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Disconnected data systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mounting compliance pressure (especially post-AI Act)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Rising demand for real-time analytics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe helps companies turn data chaos into clarity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What You’ll See at Our Booth:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Live interactive dashboards</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mini data audits to optimize your current architecture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Case Study: How a European retailer cut costs by 33% via real-time demand forecasting with our help</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join the Data Revolution at GITEX Europe 2025 — where we reimagine the value of big data through AI and automation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Virtual Assistants in the Age of AI Productivity</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/virtual-assistant-services\">Virtual Assistance Services</a></strong> are no longer just “nice to have.”<br>They are the <strong>frontline force</strong> in customer experience and business automation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Real-World Use Cases:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>E-commerce</strong>: Cart recovery &amp; product suggestions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>B2B SaaS</strong>: Automated lead qualification and demos</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Healthcare</strong>: Appointment booking &amp; triage</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tech support</strong>: 24/7 issue resolution for SaaS platforms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Our AI-Powered VA Platform Stands Out</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Trained on industry-specific datasets</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Seamless CRM integrations (Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multilingual and GDPR-compliant</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powered by <strong>AI conversational engines</strong> and NLP models</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Come, try it LIVE</strong> — Our team will walk you through a custom virtual assistant use case for your industry!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>AI + Human Precision = Productivity Unleashed</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modern enterprises need 24/7 support without the burnout. Our virtual assistant services blend AI capabilities with trained human agents for unmatched efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Multilingual Support</strong>: Ideal for European market outreach.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>CRM Integration</strong>: Instant updates, appointment scheduling, lead follow-ups.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>E-commerce Optimization</strong>: Live chat, cart recovery, and upselling support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Use Case:</em> A Munich-based SaaS firm increased lead conversion by 35% after deploying our AI-trained sales assistants.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The AI Marketing Revolution: Personalized, Predictive &amp; Profitable</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What You’ll Discover:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Predictive lead scoring for B2B</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lifecycle email automation powered by AI</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dynamic A/B testing engines</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hyper-personalized ad targeting based on AI-driven user behavior modeling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s not just AI in digital marketing. It’s AI running digital marketing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us at our Berlin booth to demo our next-gen AI Marketing Suite in action.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Rethinking E-commerce: It’s Not Just Selling, It’s Scaling</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The future of e-commerce isn’t just faster checkouts — it’s smarter everything.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What We Offer in E-commerce Strategy Consulting:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Platform Selection (Shopify, Magento, WooCommerce, etc.)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Headless Commerce Architecture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cross-border commerce compliance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personalized UX using machine learning algorithms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI-Powered Product Recommendations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A luxury fashion brand increased conversion rates by 47% after adopting Tech2Globe’s AI-powered personalization engine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come for a free <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-marketing-services\">e-commerce consultation</a> and discover new avenues to scale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Stay Connected – Download the GITEX Europe Mobile App</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For iOS (Apple Store): Search “GITEX Europe”</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For Android: Available on Google Play</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the app to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Browse the exhibitor list</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Schedule meetings with the Tech2Globe team</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Get directions to <strong>H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check live session updates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What to Expect at Our Booth: H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Live Strategy Sessions</strong>: Mini audits for data, e-commerce, or marketing stacks<br><strong>Interactive AI Demos</strong>: Conversational AI agents, live dashboards<br><strong>Giveaways &amp; Consultations</strong>: Win free consulting hours and downloadable playbooks<br><strong>Meet Our Experts</strong>: Engage with leaders behind successful transformations</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Checklist: Why You Can’t Miss GITEX in Berlin</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>☑Meet our AI-powered service teams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>☑Discover real-world client success stories</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>☑Learn from Europe’s boldest digital leaders</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>☑Explore future-facing innovations that <em>work today</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Else to Explore at GITEX Europe</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>C-Suite Power Panels</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>For COOs, CTOs, and CISOs</strong>: Discuss cross-border cybersecurity, AI governance, and digital policy transformation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conference Tracks (Top Picks)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>AI Everything Germany</strong>: Ethics, Generative AI, Deepfake Defense</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Industry 4.0</strong>: Smart factories, predictive maintenance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Green Tech</strong>: Digital sustainability solutions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Future Forums – Day 3 (23 June)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Client Story Snapshot</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Client:</strong> Mid-size B2B SaaS firm<br><strong>Challenge:</strong> High customer churn<br><strong>Solution:</strong> AI-driven onboarding + VA support<br><strong>Results:</strong> 24% drop in churn rate, 3x increase in upsells</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Berlin, Why Now?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Germany is Europe’s digital heart, and Berlin is its pulse. With GITEX Europe serving as the crossroads for AI, cybersecurity, and digital ecosystems, Tech2Globe is here to help you rethink what’s possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GITEX Berlin 2025 isn’t just another event — it’s a game-changer for decision-makers, tech architects, and industry leaders ready to move beyond buzzwords into real implementation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a pioneer in global tech expos, GITEX is known for igniting digital ecosystems and showcasing practical innovation. With a legacy built across Dubai and now expanding into Europe’s innovation capital, Berlin, we’re committed to making the future more accessible, ethical, and AI-enabled for businesses across the continent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you\'re a startup founder, digital executive, or tech visionary—you\'ll find your place, your partners, and your future at GITEX Europe 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Call: Let’s Talk in Berlin!</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re more than ready — are you?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Booth</strong>: H5.2-A99, Hall No - 5.2<br><strong>Dates</strong>: 21–23 May 2025<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Book a 1:1 meeting with our experts via the GITEX Europe Mobile App</strong><br><strong>Drop by for a live demo or just to talk tech</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tech2Globe: Your Trusted Partner for AI-First Digital Success</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From data management to ecommerce acceleration, we’re ready to transform the future — one intelligent solution at a time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See you in Berlin!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Tech2Globe-at-GITEX-Europe-2025-Driving-Digital-Evolution-from-Berlin-to-the-World.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-04-29 07:58:52','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(73,'Simplify Store Launches with Shopify Bulk Product Uploads','simplify-store-launches-with-shopify-bulk-product-uploads','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s world, everyone is chronically online; whenever we need anything, instead of going to the market, we search online for it. Try to find the best possible deals; as a business, it is essential to keep up with recent trends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Streamline your Shopify Store Setup with Bulk Product Uploads</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shopify has many powerful features that are great for new businesses. Its interface is user-friendly, making it easy for new business owners to set up their businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the best features is that, unlike other leading e-commerce platforms, business owners do not need to know coding. They can set up their businesses without any technical knowledge. In this article, we will discuss Shopify\'s features to determine whether it is worth it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Bulk Upload Products on Shopify: The Ultimate Guide for Streamlining Your Store Setup</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shopify is well-known among businesses for being user-friendly and straightforward. Setting up a store via Shopify is quite easy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can start by uploading basic information like your name and store name on the website. Then, you can get a 14-day free trial. Afterward, you will have to upload the product and its details manually.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">bulk products upload</a>, you will have to upload a CSV file. You can customize your online store by choosing different colors and home layouts. Set up payment and checkout rules and choose your payment options; here, you will also have to set up tax and shipping rules. You can set up shipping and delivery zones and buy an online domain according to your needs. Then, you can go live with your new online shop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bulk Import Shopify: The Ultimate Guide for Seamless Product Uploads</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shopify is an e-commerce platform that has garnered a great reputation among businesses that want to start selling their products online. One of the many reasons is that it is easy to upload products on the website in bulk without having any knowledge of coding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are mainly three ways to upload products to Shopify in bulk:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The first method is by using a CSV (Comma-Separated Value) file. Here, you need to prepare a spreadsheet consisting of different columns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Handle (unique product identifier)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Title</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Body (HTML) - description</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Vendor</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Type</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Published (TRUE/FALSE)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Option 1 Name (like \"Size\" or \"Color\")</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Option1 Value</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Variant SKU</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Variant Price</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Variant Inventory Qty</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are the columns that must be included in your spreadsheet; there are several optional columns that you can include as well. Next, import this spreadsheet and download the Shopify sample CSV file. Afterwards, format your file according to Shopify\'s requirements. Lastly, upload your CSV containing the product information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. The second method is for people who are well-versed in coding. You would be required to use Shopify’s Admin API to create products using programming.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. Lastly, you can also use third-party apps like “Matrixify” to upload bulk products on Shopify.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Features of Shopify</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let us take a quick look at the features of Shopify -</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Convenient store setup:</strong> The biggest benefit of Shopify is that it is extremely easy to set up an online business. Without Shopify, users would either need to have advanced technical knowledge or hire someone. With Shopify, business owners can customize their websites using the drag-and-drop website builder feature.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Managing the inventory has become super easy with the help of Shopify. In Shopify, you will get options to list your product based on size, color, fabric, and so on. As a customer, it makes browsing easier, and if the customer has something particular in mind, they can just use the multiple filters to find what they are looking for.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Secured Checkout Option:</strong> As a business owner, the payment gateway option must be secure. Otherwise, the users can get scammed or face other problems. Shopify has fraud prevention tools that are built to detect if the transaction feels suspicious. Shopify also has hundreds of payment gateway options from which users can choose.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Built-in SEO Tools: </strong>SEO tools are there to attract more customers for the business. Shopify has built-in SEO tools that are there to improve traffic and retain customers. Shopify comes with customizable meta tags and sitemaps to optimize SEO. Email marketing companies like Klaviyo and Mailchimp are seamlessly synced with Shopify to gather data on customer buying habits and preferences.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Pricing Plan: </strong>Shopify offers a flexible pricing range for everyone,e, whether they are small businesses or big enterprises.<br>month.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The price range starts at $5 a month. In this plan, users can create a product link to share everywhere, create a basic product listing, accept payment, and so on. However, the 5-dollar plan does not include a full website, which is ideal for influencers and small businesses testing an online business model.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The next plan is the $29 plan, best suited for new businesses. Here, the user can access a full online store and list unlimited products. The user can also create two staff accounts and receive 24/7 support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Growing businesses can choose the $79 plan, which is an upgrade from the $29 plan. In this plan, users can access professional-grade reports and create up to 5 staff accounts. They also get international domains and gift cards. This plan is ideal for businesses that make at least $10K a </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Advance Shopify plan costs around $299 per month. It allows businesses to have up to 15 staff accounts, has the lowest credit card rates, and has third-party calculated shipping charges. This plan is ideal for businesses making up to $50K per month.<br><br>Lastly, there is Shopify Plus, which costs around 2K a month. Only big enterprises use this, but it comes with an unlimited staff account and many facilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For businesses, they must have some type of online presence where they can sell their products online. This is because, by selling their stuff, they can do business with a larger audience from every corner of the world. With Shopify, you can do it with ease and customize your website on your own. For people who are not tech-savvy, there are many <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify development companies in the USA</a></strong>. These <strong>Shopify development companies </strong>will help you set up your online business through Shopify.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How to bulk upload products in Shopify?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Anyone can upload bulk products on Shopify by uploading a CSV file or can use 3<sup>rd</sup> party apps to do the job.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How can I bulk edit products on Shopify?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can edit your bulk products on Shopify through CSV files.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How to bulk update Shopify product statuses?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quickest way to update a Shopify product status is to use the Shopify bulk editor. For large updates, users can also use CSV files.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Shopify-Product-Upload.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-04-23 06:31:54','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(74,'E-commerce in 2025 - Navigating Challenges &amp; Seizing Opportunities','e-commerce-in-2025-navigating-challenges-seizing-opportunities','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this new digital era, e-commerce has become an essential part of modern life as it has sped up the process of buying and selling goods and services over the internet. It has also helped people to communicate and build better terms with businesses</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why is understanding digital marketing important for growing e-commerce?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding <strong>digital marketing </strong>has become a key to pushing e-commerce businesses forward. Companies that fail to leverage digital marketing tools to boost their businesses might fall behind.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Digital marketing is an easy way of gaining the attention of a global audience, building brand awareness, and driving sales at a relatively low cost compared to traditional marketing methods. In this marketing method, businesses use electronic devices and the Internet to connect with potential customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Digital marketing</strong> involves all kinds of marketing efforts that use online channels like search engines, social media, email, websites, and mobile apps to promote products, services, or brands</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The role of <strong>digital marketing</strong> in accelerating e-commerce business is immense, as in the modern business landscape, it has become an essential pillar for the growth and success of e-commerce businesses. Online shopping has gained popularity in recent years due to which has intensified the competition among digital business platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leveraging <strong>digital marketing</strong> tools, e-commerce businesses can stand out and attract potential customers. <strong>Digital marketing</strong> helps to convert leads into sales through a variety of strategic techniques.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top 10 challenges facing e-Commerce in 2025</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2025 e-commerce has reached new heights, it is more dynamic, competitive, and opportunity-rich than ever before. With rising to new heights, e-commerce platforms are facing new challenges as customer expectations are also getting higher around speed, personalization, and sustainability. Now fast shipping has become a baseline requirement whereas 2-3 years ago it was considered as a perk. It has become a challenge for the companies to provide personalized experiences. Whether you\'re scaling a new store or refining an established brand, overcoming obstacles is a key to long-term success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are the top 10 challenges facing e-Commerce in 2025 — and how to overcome them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Rising Customer Accretion Costs</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Paid advertising is becoming more expensive and less effective due to rising competition and stricter data privacy rules that’s why brands can no longer rely on ads alone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leveraging digital marketing tools such as social media marketing and PPC can help to grow business without spending a lot of money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Adapting to Data Privacy Regulations</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tracking user behavior is increasingly difficult due to new privacy laws worldwide and regulations like GDPR, CCPA.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shift to collecting <strong>zero-party data</strong> by offering value exchanges like quizzes, preference centers, and gated content, while being transparent about data usage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Customer Retention and Loyalty</strong> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Acquiring a new customer is more expensive than keeping an existing one, but modern consumers are more likely to switch brands based on price, shipping time, or customer service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>E-commerce support service </strong>and <strong>e-commerce solution</strong> help to handle the online selling process, streamlining both the customer experience and the back-end operations for the seller. These simplify the complex process of running an online business and building good relationships with customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Supply Chain Disruptions</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From global conflicts to natural disasters, supply chains remain unpredictable. Diversify suppliers, embrace local manufacturing where possible, maintain safety stock for key products, and offer transparent communication with customers about expected delays.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Cart Abandonment</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2025, the global cart abandonment rate still hovers around 70%. Slow sites, complex checkouts, and surprise costs are the main culprits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Optimize checkout with one-click purchasing, flexible payment options (including Buy Now, Pay Later), transparent pricing, and proactive cart recovery emails or SMS reminders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Keeping Up with Changing Technology</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Augmented reality (AR), AI-driven personalization, and voice commerce are reshaping consumer expectations. Brands that lag behind will lose ground.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continuously audit your tech stack, prioritize customer-centric innovation, and adopt flexible platforms that allow easy integration of new features.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Sustainable Business Practices</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shoppers increasingly prioritize eco-conscious brands, and in 2025, sustainability isn\'t just a nice-to-have — it\'s a decision-making factor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Focus on sustainable packaging, ethical sourcing, carbon-neutral shipping options, and clear communication of your efforts through your website and marketing materials.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Global Market Expansion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cross-border commerce is a tempting growth avenue, but navigating foreign taxes, shipping, language barriers, and cultural differences can be daunting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use localized storefronts, accept multi-currency payments, partner with international logistics providers, and invest in geo-targeted marketing for each region.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>9. Standing Out in Saturated Markets</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Almost every niche has become hyper-competitive, and consumers face endless options for similar products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Focus on <strong>brand differentiation</strong> — craft a compelling brand story, refine your visual identity, offer niche-specific experiences, and invest in authentic influencer partnerships to humanize your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>10. Handling Customer Expectations Around Delivery</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The \"Amazon effect\" has permanently raised expectations for fast, cheap (or free) shipping. Small and mid-sized eCommerce businesses often struggle to compete.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Be transparent about shipping times at the checkout stage, offer multiple delivery options (standard, express, eco), and leverage 3PL (third-party logistics) networks or local micro-fulfillment centers to speed up delivery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To <strong>conclude</strong>, to navigate a successful e-commerce business in 2025, leveraging digital marketing tools such as <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ecommerce-seo-services\">PPC management services</a></strong> and <strong>social media marketing</strong> is necessary. They help to promote brands and products at low cost. Also to face daily challenges like dealing with customers and technical issues it is crucial to seek help from <strong>e-commerce support services</strong>; they also help in building better relations with customers. A <strong>complete e-commerce solution</strong> is a complete package that helps to grow your business in this competitive digital era. Lastly, it depends on the businesses and the companies how they leverage these digital tools to overcome challenges to grow and take their businesses to new heights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How can businesses overcome e-commerce challenges?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses can overcome e-commerce challenges by enhancing website security, optimizing user experience, and offering multiple payment options. Using a <strong>complete e-commerce solution </strong>and<strong> e-commerce support service</strong> are essential as they help to simplify the complex process of running an online business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How can small businesses succeed in e-commerce in 2025?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Small businesses can succeed in e-commerce in 2025 by focusing on niche markets, leveraging AI for personalized customer experiences, optimizing mobile-first websites and leveraging <strong>digital marketing</strong> tools including e-commerce social media marketing and PPC</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What is the future of e-commerce in the next 5 to 10 years?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The future of e-commerce will be shaped by AI-driven personalization, seamless omnichannel experiences, voice and AR shopping, and hyper-fast delivery. Enhancing security and transparency will influence buying decisions.<strong> PPC management services</strong>, <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ecommerce-seo-services\">E-commerce social media marketing service</a></strong> and global access will redefine how consumers connect with brands and products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What is the new trend in e-commerce?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A major trend in eCommerce is the rise of AI-powered personalization. Also, social media marketing via platforms like TikTok and Instagram and immersive shopping through AR and VR are new e-commerce trends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Which type of e-commerce is most profitable?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most profitable e-commerce is business to Customer e-commerce especially in sectors like fashion, electronics, and beauty. Also, business to business e-commerce can be highly profitable because of larger transaction sizes and recurring orders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Ecomm-2025.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-03-22 12:50:00','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(75,'Robots Meta Tags And X-Robot Tags: A Comprehensive Guide','robots-meta-tags-and-x-robot-tags-a-comprehensive-guide','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robot Meta Tags and X- X-Robot Tags both are HTTP headers that are used in order to control search engine crawlers like Googlebot or Bingbot. Both the Meta tags and X-Robot tags determine which content the crawler bots can index or interact with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Robots Meta Tag And X-Robots-Tag Made Clear</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robot <strong>Meta Tag </strong>is a header of the HTML content while X- Robot Tag is an HTTP header that can control non-HTML files like PDFs, Images, Videos, and so on. Both of them are super important SEO tool that determines how search engines interact with the content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Features of Robot Meta Tags</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robot Meta Tags are nothing but an HTML element, it provide directives to search engine spider Bots like the Googlebot. The directives are regarding index or how to handle a web page. The <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/technical-seo\">Robot Meta Tag</a> instructs search engines on how to index, crawl, or display the content of the page. The Robot Meta tag goes to the top of the webpage. An example of how the Robot Meta tag looks like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&lt;meta name= “robots” content=” noindex” ;&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Features of X- ROBOT Tags</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>X-Robot Tags </strong>are quite similar to the Robot Meta Tags with minor differences. X-Robot Tags are part of the HTTP response header; they instruct the search engine regarding indexing actions. X-Robot Tags applies to all types of files, such as; PDFs, HTML, Images, and so on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When a crawler wants to access information about a webpage it sends a HTTP request to the server. The server sends an HTTP response to the request. If the developer attaches <strong>X-Robot Tag </strong>to the webpage then the tag remains present in the header of the HTTP response. The crawler bot then determines whether it is allowed to crawl through the webpage or not by reviewing the X-Robot Tag.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“noindex” = Excludes specific files from search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“nofollow” = This makes sure that crawler bots cannot follow planted links. “none” = It corresponds to “noindex”, “nofollow”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Meta Robots Tag &amp; X-Robots-Tag Explained</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X- Robots Tags and Robot Meta Tags are extremely powerful and efficient SEO tools that control what search engine bots can crawl through. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses of Robot Meta Tags</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Robot meta tags are primarily used to act as a tool of communication between you and your search engine. This allows you to control bot crawlers, display page content, and index. Some examples of this would be:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Following Certain Links on the Page</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Show a snippet of the page on the SERPs (Search Engine Results pages)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Index a page</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In simple terms Robot Meta Tag influences the behavior of a search Bot if they visit your webpage; this is essential in being able to control what appears in search engine results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Robot Meta Tag Influences SEO?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The role of <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/technical-seo\">Robot Meta Tag in SEO</a> cannot be exaggerated; they are essential in regulating search engines crawl, and so on. This becomes essential for visiting large sites that are frequently updated. It is also helpful because there are certain types of websites that you do not want to rank in your search results, such as; Admin or Login pages</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pages that are in the development stage</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pages with content that has been copied from others</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Confirmation pages like, thank you and congratulations pages</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It would be wise to combine other directives like X- Robot tags to help with technical Search Engine Optimization and prevent performance-harming index and crawlers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Name Attribution</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Name attribution indicates the specific crawler that the given directive applies to. In most cases Robot Meta tags target all the crawlers; to target specific crawlers, you will have to use name attribution. For example,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Name = “Googlebot” to target crawlers in Google only.<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Name = “Bingbot” for crawlers and indexes in Bing only.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Name Attribution offers granular control for the user where he can do things like block Bing but allows Yahoo. It is helpful to comply with regional search engines</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses of X-Robot Tags</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X-Robot Tags are vital in determining the ability of search engine crawlers to crawl on non-HTML elements.  This helps search engines from indexing different files like PDFs, and videos. Without X- Robot Tags it would be difficult, to prevent crawlers from crawling through all the resources. This is the major usage of X-Robot Tag but there are a few other uses as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dynamic Index Control where the web page can be hidden from specific users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It can prevent search engines like Google and Bing from using text snippets or cached copies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time-based index removal; this is great for sites where jobs are posted and need to be removed periodically.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It would be wise to combine other directives like X- Robot tags to help with technical Search Engine Optimization and prevent performance-harming index and crawlers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How X-Robot Tags influence SEO?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The X-Robot Tag is an extremely powerful SEO tool that determines how search engines will crawl, index, and display your content. X-Robot Tags are different and more powerful than Meta tags because they work on all types of files, unlike Meta Tags which only work on HTML files.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X-Robot Tags enforces it to the server level making it one of the most powerful and essential SEO tools. X-Robots directly influence the visibility of the webpage by preventing it from appearing as a search result.&nbsp; It can hide duplicate content as well; with the new <strong>Google duplicate content guidelines</strong>, this can prevent web pages from getting banned by Google.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Can block low-value pages to ensure that the Googlebot only focuses on important content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specific directive for different search engines.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How are meta tags used to control web crawlers?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta tags help web crawlers like Googlebot and bingbot by instructing them process and index a webpage. Meta tags are HTML element, they are placed on the HTML header of the web page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the difference between X-robots-tag and robots meta tag?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although these two SEO tools are quite similar one of the major difference is that Robot Meta Tags are only effective on HTML files, whereas X- Robot Tags are effective on both HTML and Non HTML files. The location of X-Robot Tag HTTP response header, on the other hand the location of the X- Robot tags is in the HTML header. The file level control of Robot Meta Tags is limited whereas the control of X- Robot tags is ingrained.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why do we use * in a robots.txt file?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>X-Robot Tags are vital in determining the ability of search engine crawlers to crawl on non-HTML elements.  This helps search engines from indexing different files like PDFs, and videos. Without X- Robot Tags it would be difficult, to prevent crawlers from crawling through all the resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is robots.txt in SEO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The X-Robot Tag is an extremely powerful SEO tool that determines how search engines will crawl, index, and display your content. X-Robots directly influence the visibility of the webpage by preventing it from appearing as a search result.  It can block low-value pages to ensure that the Googlebot only focuses on important content.  Robot.txt gives specific directive for different search engines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Meta-Bot-X-Robots.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-03-09 12:46:42','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(76,'What to Expect at IndiaSoft 2025?','what-to-expect-at-indiasoft-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prepare for a vibrant show highlighting the most recent developments in Indian technology at IndiaSoft 2025. The event includes a broad spectrum of developments from artificial intelligence, machine learning, and cybersecurity to IoT, blockchain, fintech, and cloud computing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Along with startups and top IT organizations, <strong>IT solution provider companies in India</strong>, allowing delegates to investigate intriguing joint ventures and market prospects. IndiaSoft 2025 is the go-to tool for comprehending developing IT trends in India, presented by the Electronics and Computer Software Export Promotion Council (ESC) of India.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key highlights of IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Diverse Exhibitors: </strong>Many exhibitors, including software developers, mobile app developers, cloud computing providers, cybersecurity solutions, healthcare IT organizations, and more. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Innovation Showcase: </strong>AI, AR/VR, robots, smart city solutions, and tech trends exhibited. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Networking: </strong>B2B meetings, conferences, panel discussions, and specialized networking sessions to meet global clients and partners. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Startup Pavilion:</strong> A showcase for potential tech startups. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>International Participation: </strong>Many foreign buyers and delegations exploring Indian IT sector business potential. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Knowledge Sessions</strong>: IT industry trends, problems, and best practices presented by experts. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Digital Transformation:</strong> How technology is changing industries and driving digital transformation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Focus Areas at IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This year IndiaSoft will highlight groundbreaking advancements in the IT sector:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Machine learning and artificial intelligence </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Artificial General Intelligence Machine learning is evolving into a more specialized and easily available tool. For companies of all kinds, for example, cloud-based artificial intelligence systems are facilitating the deployment of AI tools and technology. Furthermore in development are specialized task-oriented machine learning models meant for fraud detection or medical diagnostics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Developments in Cybersecurity</mark> </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hackers are aiming at people and companies using ever more sophisticated methods. This method requires verification for each access attempt, based on the assumption that no user or tool can be considered trustworthy by default. For companies trying to guard against cyberattacks, it\'s turning into a basic tactic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Cloud Computing and Software-Based Solutions</mark> </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moving data and apps to the cloud provides scalability, flexibility, and cost savings; hence, companies are doing more and more of this. As such, SaaS solutions catered to particular sectors and company demands are starting to show up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">FinTech &amp; Blockchain </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses are leveraging technology to provide creative financial services as robo-advisors, online loans, and mobile payments. Furthermore, the technology behind cryptocurrencies is being applied for a range of purposes, like supply chain management, digital identity, and voting systems..</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">IoT and intelligent technologies </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Connecting more gadgets to the internet creates a vast data bank and market of possibilities. In sectors including smart homes, wearable technology, and industrial automation, this is inspiring creativity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Benefits of Attending IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meet Top IT Providers: </strong>Connect with leading IT solution provider companies in India offering cutting-edge software and IT services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Global Networking: </strong>Engaging foreign IT experts, buyers, and decision-makers can help you to grow your network.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Business Growth: </strong>Discover fresh business prospects, alliances, and joint ventures with top industry leaders.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unique Product Showcases: </strong>Discover the most recent developments in IoT, fintech, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>B2B Meetings: </strong>Attend pre-arranged meetings to network with possible partners and customers. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Knowledge from Professionals:</strong> Insights Panel debates and keynote presentations by world IT luminaries will provide you useful industry knowledge.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Visit Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025 – Let’s Build the Future Together!</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See our innovative IT solutions and join Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025! We provide quality, from digital marketing techniques that propel expansion to custom software development tailored for your company. While our AI-enabled lead-generating system guarantees excellent conversions, our eCommerce consulting services help companies expand effortlessly. Let\'s go over how our experience could improve your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Visit us at Stall No. D131, Hall No. 4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meet us on 19, 20, 21 March 2025</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Book a meeting today and discover the future of IT solutions with Tech2Globe!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/indiasoft-2025-a-global-hub-for-it-solutions/\">IndiaSoft 2025: A Global Hub for IT Solutions</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tech2globe-invites-you-to-experience-innovation-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Tech2Globe Invites You to Experience Innovation at IndiaSoft 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tech2globe-invites-you-to-experience-innovation-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Tech2Globe Invites You to Experience Innovation at IndiaSoft 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-to-Expect-at-IndiaSoft-2025-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-19 12:01:47','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(77,'IndiaSoft 2025: A Global Hub for IT Solutions','indiasoft-2025-a-global-hub-for-it-solutions','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Events like IndiaSoft provide companies, startups, and even multinational firms a stage to highlight what they have!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With its goal of encouraging creativity and corporate success, IndiaSoft is expected to have even more influence this year. As such, it keeps enhancing India\'s standing in <strong>global IT solutions</strong> by linking innovators and business leaders all over.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Improving corporate processes, boosting security, and simplifying technology usage define IT solutions. Among other fields, they address software development, cybersecurity, cloud services, artificial intelligence, and digital tools for companies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, we urge you to join us at IndiaSoft 2025 whether your objective is to expand your company, choose appropriate technology partners, or explore fresh IT industry chances!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What You Need to Know About IndiaSoft 2025?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft 2025 is a must-attend event for anyone looking to explore <strong>IT Solutions in India</strong> and beyond. Hosted by the Electronics and Computer Software Export Promotion Council (ESC), this premier international ICT exhibition will take place from March 19th to 21st, 2025, at Bharat Mandapam, New Delhi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Celebrating its 25th edition, IndiaSoft 2025 is expected to unite 700+ international delegates from 80+ countries and 1,500+ IT and IT enterprises. This event presents unmatched networking and growth chances for every kind of organization looking for modern technology partners, an entrepreneur looking for financing, or a startup hoping for worldwide exposure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft 2025 will feature:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Innovation Showcase –</strong> A stage for innovative IT solutions, goods and services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>B2B Networking –</strong> Links companies all over by means of thousands of pre-arranged encounters.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Startup Initiative – </strong>Unique chances for new technological businesses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Global Market Insights – </strong>Direct interaction with world tech leaders.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Vision of IndiaSoft for 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft 2025 has a big goal: to make a place where businesses and creators from all over the world can meet, connect, and grow. This vision is about encouraging significant cooperation that drives technical development, not only about conventional networking. The event will highlight innovative ideas, including IoT, cloud computing, and artificial intelligence, proving that these technologies are revolutionizing sectors and promoting digital transformation. IndiaSoft 2025 presents a special chance to investigate new alliances, unleash development potential, and interact with <strong>global IT solutions</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">India’s Growing IT Landscape</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What makes this event so big is how rapidly India is becoming, or should we say has become, a hub of IT innovation. Be it software development or IT services, the companies here are excelling in every corner of the technology landscape. As a result, this event serves as a powerful reminder of how India is emerging as a true leader in the global IT solutions arena, driving both local and international business growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn some interesting facts about India’s IT Landscape:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Indian IT industry reached $245 billion in FY 2023, projected to hit $350 billion by 2026.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>IT exports totaled $194 billion in FY 2023.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>BPO and IT services lead the industry.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cities like Bangalore, Hyderabad, Chennai, and Thiruvananthapuram are key tech centers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"Digital India\" boosts digital literacy and infrastructure.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>India has a growing number of tech unicorns like Paytm.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>India’s expanding internet user base fuels more online services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Opportunities IndiaSoft 2025 Brings for Businesses and Entrepreneurs</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With IT spending projected to increase by 11.2% from year 2023 to total almost $160 billion in 2025, India\'s IT industry offers great investment prospects. This boom draws worldwide companies to invest in India\'s growing digital economy.<br><br>Global companies may also set up operations or cooperate in India using its sizable market, trained workforce, developing economy, and government programs like \"Make in India,\" which encourage foreign investment, particularly in IT.<br><br>Using artificial intelligence, automation, and data analytics for efficiency and innovation, key sectors including healthcare, banking, and education are gaining from IT solutions. Over 90% of hospitals use EHRs; there is a 38% increase in telemedicine, and AI-driven diagnostics help detect diseases. Algorithmic trading, personalized banking, and 90% accurate AI-powered fraud detection all help finance. Online courses, adaptive learning systems, and VR training simulations abound in education—30M+ students. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft 2025 is the ideal event for companies seeking investment, startups seeking global visibility, or businesses seeking new technology partners. Don\'t miss this chance to get to meet, network, and develop with top global IT solution innovators.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Connect with us at IndiaSoft 2025, March 19-21! Find us at stall D131, Hall 4. We look forward to discussing your needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tech2globe-invites-you-to-experience-innovation-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Tech2Globe Invites You to Experience Innovation at IndiaSoft 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/join-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025-innovation-insights-and-impact/\">Join Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025: Innovation, Insights, and Impact</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/big-announcement-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Big Announcement: Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025!</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IndiaSoft-2025-A-Global-Hub-for-IT-Solutions.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-18 07:25:10','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(78,'Tech2Globe Invites You to Experience Innovation at IndiaSoft 2025','tech2globe-invites-you-to-experience-innovation-at-indiasoft-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A gateway to limitless opportunities, IndiaSoft 2025 is more than just an event. This is the reason <strong>Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft</strong> is ready to showcase expertise, meet industry leaders, and explore new possibilities. Attracting over 50,000 attendees and 700+ foreign buyers from 80+ countries, the event brings companies and technology together in one location.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We\'re not just participating as an exhibitor at the event this year; we\'re getting involved, making connections that are valuable, and sharing important ideas. Trust us, we’re so ready to share our expertise, build new connections, and support business growth through innovation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Grand Showcase of Indiasoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hosted by ESC (Electronics and Computer Software Export Promotion Council) since 2001.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Serves as a hub for tech giants and users worldwide.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Attracts over 1,500 IT and tech companies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offers a platform for industry leaders to engage with potential buyers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cultivates business alliances and disseminates insights into innovative technologies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tech2Globe\'s Role at Indiasoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At IndiaSoft 2025, we’re here to do more than just showcase our services—we’re here to create impact. Tech2Globe is stepping forward as a trusted partner in:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">Digital marketing</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/software-development\">Software development</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development\">Ecommerce consulting</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI Enabled Lead Generation&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses change with time, and their problems change as well; we provide workable, scalable, results-orientated answers. Our aim is to enable companies to expand effectively, whether that means improving internet presence, creating contemporary software, or using artificial intelligence to generate premium leads.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft\'s emphasis on artificial intelligence, machine learning, robots, cybersecurity, and more excites us to be part of the conversation—examining new ideas, creating relationships, and influencing the future of tech-driven company solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why Visit Tech2Globe\'s Booth?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Participating with <strong>Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft</strong> 2025 provides a special chance to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Experience Innovation:</strong> Find out how creative ideas from Tech2Globe could revolutionize your company\'s processes and stimulate expansion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Personalized Consultations:</strong> Talk about your particular company requirements with our professionals and investigate customized options meant to satisfy your goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, see for yourself the impact our services may have on your company by attending live demos of them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">A Special Thanks to the Organizers</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We truly appreciate ESC India organising Indiasoft 2025, a top platform bringing together IT and IT organisations from all across to network, cooperate, and create ideas. We also extend our deep appreciation to <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/gurmeet-singh-esc/?originalSubdomain=in\">Gurmeet Singh</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/veersagar/?originalSubdomain=in\">Veer Sagar</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vikas-gupta-esc-new-delhi/?originalSubdomain=in\"> Vikas Gupta</a> for their exceptional leadership and dedication in making this event a remarkable success. Their efforts continue to drive growth and innovation in the industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Be Part of the Future at Indiasoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We cordially welcome you to be a part of<strong> Indiasoft 2025</strong> and explore revolutionary technological developments with us. Visit our booth, D239, Hall No. 4, and explore the knowledge of our team which may help your company grow further.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/big-announcement-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Big Announcement: Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025!</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/join-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025-innovation-insights-and-impact/\">Join Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025: Innovation, Insights, and Impact</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-answer-engine-optimization-aeo-and-how-it-differ-from-seo/\">What is Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), and How it Differ from SEO</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Tech2Globe-Invites-You-to-Experience-Innovation-at-IndiaSoft-2025.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-14 12:15:43','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(79,'Join Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025: Innovation, Insights, and Impact','join-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025-innovation-insights-and-impact','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Maintaining competitiveness for companies hoping to flourish depends on keeping ahead of technology developments as the digital terrain changes. IndiaSoft 2025, set for March 19–21 at the Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi, India, is one of the main events capturing this innovative attitude. This event provides a worldwide stage for <strong>IndiaSoft 2025 exhibitors</strong> to present their most recent creations and create important relationships.<br><br>We are delighted to announce that Tech2Globe, a leading provider of IT consulting and digital solutions, will be present at IndiaSoft 2025. With over 14 years of expertise, we specialize in delivering customized solutions in online marketing, e-commerce, IT consulting, and BPO/KPO services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why Attend IndiaSoft 2025?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft is now a top worldwide networking event in the scene of international IT. Sponsored by the Electronics and Computer Software Export Promotion Council (ESC) since 2001, it serves as a central hub for tech titans and consumers globally as the IT fraternity presents the strength of their software and tech industries on a global arena.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Along with a significant number of foreign attendees, the event attracts over 1,500 IT and IT businesses, providing a wonderful venue for industry leaders to interact with possible customers from all over the world and India. This engagement promotes corporate collaborations and spreads firsthand knowledge of innovative ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025: What to Expect</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tech2Globe News</strong>: At IndiaSoft 2025, we are set to showcase a range of innovative solutions designed to empower businesses in the digital age. Our prime offerings include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Digital marketing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer a full suite of services, including SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, SMO, Influencer, and PR. Our team of professionals is dedicated to delivering measurable results that drive traffic, generate leads, and maximize ROI. Whether you\'re a startup or an established brand, we tailor our marketing solutions to fit your unique business needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Delivered 500+ successful campaigns with high ROI.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A team of 50+ certified professionals in SEO, PPC, and SMM.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tailored marketing plans ensuring 30-50% growth in online visibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leveraging analytics for higher conversion rates and engagement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost-effective solutions with transparent pricing and no hidden charges.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Software development</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The eCommerce industry requires a promising software development approach. As a trusted partner, we specialise in Shopify, WordPress, Wix, CMS, PHP, React, and Mobile App development. Our team delivers innovative and scalable solutions. Plus, we offer strategic and data-driven insights, so you get a customized plan that ensures measurable results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Custom software development for Healthcare, Finance, Retail, Telecom, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Expertise in Ruby on Rails, SharePoint, Java, Ajax, and PhoneGap.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specialising in eCommerce, CMS, web applications, and enterprise portals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Robust development with a focus on security, scalability, and performance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>From planning and UI/UX design to deployment and maintenance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Ecommerce consulting</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When growth revolves around a strong eCommerce presence, Tech2Globe is what you need. With our expertise in Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra, Ajio, Tata Cliq, Tata Lux, Etsy, Walmart, and Global Selling, we ensure complete market penetration and optimisation. Moreover, we understand that every business expects efficiency in operations and maximises profits. So, with our strategic approach and your vision, our eCommerce consulting takes a bigger leap towards success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Successfully supporting 30+ eCommerce businesses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specialised in Magento, Shopify, WooCommerce, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product updates, inventory management, and order fulfilment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensuring smooth store performance and minimal downtime.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI Enabled Lead Generation Platform</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, most of the lead generation process is AI-driven. Consequently, we have integrated advanced automation into our AI-Enabled Lead Generation service to enhance efficiency and accuracy. You can rely on us, and our team of professionals will ensure high-quality lead acquisition. As industry experts, we will guide you through every step of the way, optimising strategies for the best results. Our focus in this specialised area is delivering data-driven, targeted, and conversion-focused lead generation solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automate and optimise lead acquisition for better conversions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Identify and engage high-intent prospects with precision.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Develop, track, and prioritise leads for higher sales efficiency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sync effortlessly with your existing CRM for smooth operations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>B2B &amp; B2C Lead Generation, drive results across multiple business models.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Networking Opportunities</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s an ideal platform to explore strategic international business partnerships and gain exposure to global market dynamics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More than just a product showcase – a convergence of ideas and partnerships.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Representatives from over 80 countries, fostering global networking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A prime platform to explore strategic international business collaborations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gain insights into global market dynamics and emerging trends.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Innovation Showcase</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The event provides a platform for participants to release creative IT goods and services for greater visibility and reach, therefore enabling Indian and worldwide businesses to offer new and innovative technology to a varied worldwide and local audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Join Us at IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We invite you to visit our booth, Stall Number: D131, Hall No. 4, at IndiaSoft 2025 to explore how Tech2Globe can assist in transforming your business through innovative digital solutions. As one of the <strong>IndiaSoft 2025 exhibitors</strong>, we offer expertise in enhancing your online presence, streamlining operations, and exploring new technological avenues. Our team is here to guide you every step of the way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For more information or to schedule a meeting with our team during the event, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> or call us at +91-9899675039 (India).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t miss this opportunity to engage with industry leaders, discover groundbreaking technologies, and propel your business to new heights. We look forward to seeing you at IndiaSoft 2025!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/big-announcement-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Big Announcement: Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025!</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-answer-engine-optimization-aeo-and-how-it-differ-from-seo/\">What is Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), and How it Differ from SEO</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-search-max-is-search-max-the-next-big-thing-in-google-ads/\">Google Ads Search Max: Is “Search Max” the Next Big Thing in Google Ads?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Join-Tech2Globe-at-IndiaSoft-2025-Innovation-Insights-and-Impact.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-13 13:37:07','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(80,'What is Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), and How it Differ from SEO','what-is-answer-engine-optimization-aeo-and-how-it-differ-from-seo','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Do you know how AEO differs from SEO? While SEO boosts website rankings, AEO provides direct answers in search results and voice search. Want to optimize both? Read our latest blog explaining the core differences and best practices of SEO vs. AEO to learn more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among industry professionals, be it digital marketers and website owners, search engine optimization (SEO) has been a beneficial approach for a long time. With the rise of SEO vs. AEO, however, some marketing campaigns have grown by huge amounts, leveraging both strategies for better visibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AEO is now seen as a game-changer in digital marketing, complementing SEO consistency in driving visibility. However, their approach has a huge difference, especially in how they deliver information—SEO focuses on rankings, while AEO provides direct answers. To understand AEO advantages and how you can optimize it without compromising SEO, continue reading for expert strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AEO provides direct answers in search results and voice search, unlike SEO which drives website traffic.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nearly 50% of searches are expected to be voice-based by 2025, making AEO crucial for visibility in voice assistants.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimizing for AEO boosts chances of appearing in featured snippets, positioning content as the primary answer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Schema markup aids search engines in understanding content, enhancing visibility in answer boxes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AEO builds credibility and user trust, complementing SEO and maintaining brand relevance in both traditional and AI-driven searches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is AEO vs SEO?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In simple terms, AEO vs. SEO is about how content reaches users. AEO focuses on optimizing for answer boxes and voice search results, ensuring quick, direct answers. Meanwhile, SEO remains essential for improving website rankings and driving traffic. Both strategies play a vital role in <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing</a>, enhancing visibility and engagement in different ways.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) is the process of organizing and improving information so that it gives users quick, appropriate answers right in the search engine results pages (SERPs). AEO seeks to have information shown immediately in answer boxes, snippets, and voice search replies, unlike conventional SEO, which emphasizes ranking websites higher to draw clicks. Without leaving the search results page, these quick responses enable consumers to locate the required information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Especially voice assistants like <a href=\"https://assistant.google.com/\">Google Assistant</a>, Siri, and Alexa, AEO evolved from the fast changing consumer expectations and the emergence of AI-driven search technology. Natural language is used by people more and more for searches; AEO enables content to properly answer these question-based searches. Here are Interesting facts about AEO:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nearly 60% of Google searches end without clicks, making AEO essential.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Almost 50% of searches could be voice-based by 2025, reinforcing AEO’s importance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AEO optimization can increase organic visibility by over 100%.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Implementing schema markup enhances AEO rankings in search results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Elements of AEO</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s the AEO features overview:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Featured Snippets:</strong> Short replies at the top of SERPs for question-based queries.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Knowledge Panels: </strong>Summarizes significant information on notable people, places, and organizations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>People Also Ask (PAA):</strong> Displays similar queries in drop-down style.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Voice Search:</strong> Essential for voice-activated devices to give single-answer material.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How does it work? </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An example to help you understand how AEO works: Imagine you ask your voice assistant, \"What’s the best way to remove coffee stains from clothes?\" Instead of listing multiple websites, it reads out a direct answer like, \"Blot the stain, apply baking soda and vinegar, then wash as usual.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) at work. Unlike traditional search results, AEO ensures that content is structured to provide immediate, concise, and relevant answers—whether through voice search, featured snippets, or answer boxes. Businesses optimizing for AEO increase their chances of being the go-to source for quick solutions, enhancing brand visibility even if users don’t visit their website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Benefits of AEO in Digital Marketing</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Improved SERP visibility: </strong>Content in highlighted snippets or knowledge panels is more authoritative and relevant to user inquiries. These appearances build brand authority without clicking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Voice Search Engagement Improved: </strong>Voice search is becoming more popular, especially with mobile devices and smart home assistants. AEO helps you become the go-to answer for voice-based queries by linking your content with quick information seekers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Authority and credibility increased:</strong> Your material appearing in answer boxes and highlighted snippets establishes your business as a trustworthy information source, which boosts SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Matching User Expectations: </strong>AEO advises structuring material to be digestible and instructive. These methods satisfy consumers\' expectations and build trust between the brand and its audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Differences Between AEO and SEO</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although both Search Engine Optimization (SEO) and Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) target raising the visibility and relevance of a website in search results, they address various facets of search engine results pages (SERPs). From creating traffic to offering straight responses, knowing the difference between AEO vs SEO can assist companies in optimizing their material to satisfy both conventional and new user expectations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Features&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</strong></td><td><strong>Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Primary Goal</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Rank higher in SERPs to drive organic traffic to a website.</td><td>Provide direct, concise answers to user queries, often appearing in featured snippets, knowledge panels, or voice search results.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Focus</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Optimizing website content and structure to align with search engine algorithms.</td><td>Optimizing content to directly answer specific questions and provide quick, valuable information.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Content Type</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Long-form content (blog posts, articles, web pages) that comprehensively covers a topic.</td><td>Short, concise answers, often in question-and-answer format, lists, or bullet points.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Keywords</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Targets a range of keywords, including long-tail keywords and related terms.</td><td>Focuses on specific question-based keywords and phrases that users are likely to ask.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Intent</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Addresses a broad range of user intents (informational, navigational, transactional).</td><td>Focuses on answering specific questions and providing immediate solutions.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Search Platform</strong></td><td>Primarily targets traditional search engines like Google, Bing, and Yahoo.</td><td>Optimizes for AI-driven search engines, voice assistants (Siri, Alexa), and featured snippets.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Metrics</strong><strong></strong></td><td>Tracks website traffic, keyword rankings, bounce rate, and time on page.</td><td>Measures visibility in featured snippets, voice search results, and click-through rates on direct answers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Aspects</strong></td><td>Emphasizes website structure, page speed, mobile-friendliness, and technical SEO elements.</td><td>Focuses on structured data markup (schema.org) to help search engines understand the content and provide direct answers.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Evolution</strong></td><td>Traditional SEO practices are evolving to incorporate AEO principles.</td><td>AEO is emerging as a crucial component of a comprehensive digital marketing strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Does AEO Impact the Future of SEO?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some marketers worry that Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) might reduce website traffic since users get answers without clicking. However, AEO isn’t a threat—it complements SEO.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As zero-click searches rise, brands can stay visible by appearing in direct answers, building trust even without clicks. Instead of just driving traffic, AEO focuses on engagement and credibility. Optimizing for both ensures a strong presence in search results.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, AEO encourages concise, user-friendly content that search engines favor. By aligning SEO with AEO, businesses can capture attention, enhance authority, and drive awareness, making it a powerful strategy for digital success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Optimize for Both AEO and SEO Effectively</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are the main techniques to maximize for both AEO and SEO:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Emphasize addressing user inquiries. </mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find typical queries in your area of expertise and organize your content accordingly. Indicate direct responses for particular searches using headers, for example: “how to guides”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Use question-based phrases and long-tailed keywords.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Long-tail keywords, particularly for voice searches, match natural language queries. Relevant questions consumers are looking for in your sector may be found using tools like <a href=\"https://answerthepublic.com/\">Answer The Public</a> and Google\'s People Also Ask feature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Apply a schema. Markup for Structured Information </mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Helping search engines to grasp the context of your material depends on structured data—schema markup. Markup styles like FAQ schemas or How To schemas increase the likelihood that your comments would show up in voice responses or snippets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Knowledge panels and featured snippets. </mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Arrange your material such that it clearly addresses concerns inside the first 100 to 200 words of a page, as highlighted snippets are more likely to show up. Where appropriate, enhance readability with lists, bullet points, and tables.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Offer authoritative, high-quality content.</mark> </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google loves material with great E-A-T (experience, expertise, authority, and trustworthiness). To increase the possibility for AEO rating, make sure your material is accurate, well-researched, and well-evaluated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Add summaries and visuals.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Charts, infographics, and images can enhance the appeal of the material and increase its likelihood of selection for the answer boxes. For increased AEO appeal, summarize responses inside headers and at the start of articles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) prioritizes the user\'s purpose and desire for quick responses, rather than serving as a replacement for SEO. Stressing AEO and SEO can help you to improve exposure, increase brand authority, and keep a competitive edge in search results. Adopting AEO and SEO guarantees that you will attract user attention on the SERP and translate it into devoted consumers, therefore enabling you to address their demands in many different ways.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding how to modify SEO for AEO and using these techniques will help you succeed in the search of the future, in which the relevancy and quality of responses really count.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/big-announcement-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025/\">Big Announcement: Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025!</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-search-max-is-search-max-the-next-big-thing-in-google-ads/\">Google Ads Search Max: Is “Search Max” the Next Big Thing in Google Ads?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/amazons-2025-title-policy-update-new-product-title-requirements-effective-january-21-2025/\">Amazon’s 2025 title policy update – New product title requirements effective January 21, 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Add-a-subheading-900-x-506-px-900-x-506-px-30.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-13 10:37:05','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(81,'Google Ads Search Max: Is “Search Max” the Next Big Thing in Google Ads?','google-ads-search-max-is-search-max-the-next-big-thing-in-google-ads','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google is always changing its advertising strategy; the most recent excitement involves a new match type known as Search Max. Recently observed by advertisers, this capability suggests a potential growth of Google\'s AI-powered automation in search advertising. Still, is this the next major change in Google Ads or only another experiment? Let’s break it down.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What You Need to Know?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search Max merges Broad Match, Performance Max, and Dynamic Search Ads, handing Google’s AI more control.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More automation expands reach but can spike CPCs and waste ad spend.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google selects URLs and adjusts ad copy, so landing pages must be conversion-ready.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Currently in beta for select advertisers, but a wider rollout is likely.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Testing Search Max against traditional campaigns is key to measuring its effectiveness.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI expands reach beyond standard keywords, making negative keyword management essential to avoid wasted spend.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Google Ads Search Max?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A new campaign type called Google Ads Search Max combines Dynamic Search Ads, Broad Match, and Performance Max into one automated campaign. Built to optimize reach and efficiency, it lets Google\'s AI oversee landing page choice, keyword matching, and ad content changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While this automation increases reach and improves performance, it also decreases advertiser management, potentially leading to less precise targeting and increased expenses. Currently in beta testing, Search Max captures Google\'s continuous effort toward artificial intelligence-driven advertising. Advertisers must regularly monitor performance, adjust landing sites, and refine negative keywords if they are extensively used to maintain efficiency. Ensuring budget effectiveness and campaign success depends on adjusting to this shift.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Does Search Max Work?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While details are limited, here’s what we know about working of Google Ads Search Max:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>It’s in Beta Testing: </strong>Search Max is currently available only to select advertisers, appearing in match type reports.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>AI Controls Keyword Matching: I</strong>nstead of manually selecting keywords, Google’s AI expands your reach by automatically matching searches to your ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Automated Ad Copy &amp; URL Selection: </strong>AI tweaks your headlines, descriptions, and landing page choices to improve conversions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>More Machine Learning, Less Control: </strong>Search Max could redefine how advertisers manage PPC campaigns, making automation the new norm.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why Search Max Matters for Advertisers?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If fully implemented, Search Max could change the way businesses run Google Ads campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Broader Reach</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search Max expands beyond traditional keyword-based targeting. It may allow ads to appear for a wider range of search queries—even ones advertisers didn’t originally target. This could increase brand visibility and attract new customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI-Powered Optimization</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google’s machine learning will take the lead in refining ad targeting. Instead of manually adjusting bids, keywords, and placements, AI will analyze user intent and behavior to decide when and where ads should appear. This could improve efficiency, but it also reduces advertisers’ control over campaign performance, making it harder to fine-tune targeting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">New Strategy Adjustments</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since Search Max operates differently from traditional search campaigns, advertisers may need to rethink their campaign structures. Standard keyword-based strategies might not work the same way, requiring businesses to test and adapt new approaches.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Potential Benefits and Challenges</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below, find the benefits of Google Ads Search Max as a fully automated search campaign solution:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Improved Conversion Rates – </strong>AI-driven improvements may increase the relevancy of advertisements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reduced Manual Labor – </strong>Automated matching may lessen the requirement for significant keyword research.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Expanded Reach – </strong>Greater visibility may result in increased traffic and conversions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Challenges to consider:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Loss of Control – </strong>Advertisers might have less control over exact search term targeting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Higher Costs – </strong>Broader reach could mean increased ad spend without guaranteed returns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Algorithmic Uncertainty – </strong>As with Performance Max, Google’s automation may not always align with advertiser goals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Shift Towards Automation in Google Ads</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As Google Ads constantly adds AI-driven tools like Smart Bidding, Responsive Search Ads, and Performance Max campaigns, its inclination for automation is clearly evident.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Ads\' automated algorithms let companies change in real time depending on predefined criteria. By automatically updating ad status, budgets, bids, and more, these guidelines minimize handwork. If an advertisement falls off the first page of search results, for instance, you may design a rule to automatically raise the offer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Search Max, automation takes an even bigger role. While this may improve efficiency and expand reach, advertisers must closely monitor performance to ensure AI-driven changes align with their goals, as broader targeting could mean higher costs and unpredictable conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, to stay competitive and maximize ad performance, advertisers need to keep a close watch on the latest Google Ads’ new feature, Search Max.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Weak pages might affect conversions and raise expenses, so we advise you to check performance, improve targeting, and maximize your landing pages. Having excellent landing pages is more important than ever since Search Max is automating search term matching and ad delivery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Need assistance changing your plan? Let\'s talk. We will ensure your campaigns are tuned in, producing actual results rather than merely feeding Google\'s AI more ad money with no return.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tiktok-restored-in-the-usa-after-brief-ban-what-you-need-to-know/\">TikTok Restored in the USA After Brief Ban: What You Need to Know</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-in-2025-what-to-expect-from-paid-search/\">Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/the-process-that-affects-a-websites-visibility/\">The Process That Affects a Website’s Visibility</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Google-Ads-Search-Max-Is-Search-Max-the-Next-Big-Thing-in-Google-Ads.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-12 06:54:40','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(82,'Amazon’s 2025 title policy update - New product title requirements effective January 21, 2025','amazons-2025-title-policy-update-new-product-title-requirements-effective-january-21-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are you selling on Amazon? Then you need to know about Amazon’s latest product title policy update, now applicable across all Amazon stores globally. This change sets new limits on character length and keyword repetition, ensuring clear, customer-friendly listings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon titles have always been important to product visibility and customer engagement. With the right image, reviews, and prices, it makes a significant impact on customers when they search for a product, leading to better rankings in Amazon’s SERP (Search Engine Results Page).&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, considering the importance of clear and concise product listings,<strong> Amazon’s title policy change</strong> suggests that for better customer experience, search accuracy, and compliance, the titles must be short, relevant, and free from excessive keywords. Conversely, titles with lengthy descriptions, repetitive keywords, or unnecessary special characters will not be approved or displayed properly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why is Amazon Updating its Title Policy?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The aim of Amazon’s title policy update is to enhance the shopping experience by making product titles more user-friendly and professional. Many shoppers encounter titles with excessive keywords or overly long descriptions, which can be confusing and reduce trust. This makes it important to mention that 90% of best-selling products use at least 50 characters wisely, demonstrating the effectiveness of concise and relevant titles. As a result, this further clarifies why Amazon\'s title policy changes are necessary to maintain clarity and consistency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What Are the Crucial Changes in the New Policy?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Character Length Restrictions</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The latest update sets a 200-character cap for most categories, while some apparel items are restricted to 125 characters. Although Amazon has always promoted concise titles, many sellers have relied on longer titles for better indexing. With the new 80-character limit, Amazon is now enforcing stricter guidelines, ensuring product titles remain relevant&nbsp; and easy for customers to read.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Special Characters Are Restricted</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has tightened its rules on special characters in product titles, restricting most symbols except for pipes “|” and dashes “-.” Characters like !, $, ?, and _ are now banned unless they are part of a registered brand name. Some, like ~ and #, are allowed in specific cases, such as product identifiers. Additionally, Amazon strictly prohibits decorative symbols to keep listings clear and professional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Limits on Keyword Repetitio</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon’s updated title policy now restricts the use of the same word to a maximum of twice, except for prepositions, articles, and conjunctions. This change makes it harder for sellers who rely on repeated keywords to optimize their listings. Additionally, during Amazon’s AMA on Jan. 8, it was confirmed that plurals and variations of a word also count as duplicates, requiring sellers to refine their keyword strategies carefully.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Impact of Amazon New Title Rules on Your Listings</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn how Amazon new product title requirements can affect your listings:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Amazon Will Flag Non-compliant Titles</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your product titles do not meet the new requirements, such as exceeding the 200 character limit, using restricted special characters, or repeating words too many times—Amazon will flag them as non-compliant. This means your listings may not appear as expected in search results until corrected.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">14-Day Window for Brand Owners to Update Titles</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For flagged titles, brand owners will receive suggested corrections from Amazon through the Review Listing Updates tool. You will have 14 days to accept or modify these suggestions to bring your titles into compliance. If you don’t optimize the title, Amazon will automatically update the titles according to the new guidelines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> Listings Will Remain Active During Compliance Updates</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even if Amazon flags a title for non-compliance, it won\'t immediately remove or deactivate your product listing. Instead, it will remain active, allowing you to continue selling while you make necessary updates. However, failure to comply in time may impact your product\'s visibility and discoverability in search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Optimize Amazon Product Titles for 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sellers must go beyond compliance with the new standards in place to guarantee their titles function. As follows:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Add the Appropriate Keywords</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Investigate keywords carefully to find terms your clients use. For best effect, start the title with the most crucial keywords. When possible, incorporate synonyms and alternative words to broaden the audience and prevent the title from being excessively complex.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Use Detailed Yet Concise Language</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While avoiding needless terms or phrases like \"best seller,\" include important specifics, such as brand name, product type, size, color, and vital characteristics. Although Amazon accepts 200 characters, community insights point to typically greater outcomes from sticking under 150 characters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pay Special Attention to User Intent</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Know the intentions, and look for those that your clients seek. Create titles emphasizing durability, comfort, or practicality—benefits or use cases that speak to your readers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Use Formatting Guidelines&nbsp;</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unless otherwise directed by Amazon, capitalize the initial letter of important terms, use numerals for numbers, and spell out measurement units. Good formatting guarantees compliance and helps consumers to trust you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Test and Maximize&nbsp;</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Test versions of your titles using resources such as Amazon\'s \"Manage Experiments\" capability. Little tweaks like reordering keywords or enhancing readability may have a big effect on CTR and conversion rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Harmonize Readability with SEO</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keywords are important, but readability is also crucial. Natural and human-friendly titles especially help develop confidence with customers. Success depends on finding the proper mix between SEO and readability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, the new Amazon title policy is here! It’s time to review your listings and make the necessary changes to ensure Amazon doesn’t flag your products and they continue to perform well. If you need further assistance in understanding this new policy, our eCommerce professionals are ready to help. Write to us or give us a call—get a response within 24 hours!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-in-2025-what-to-expect-from-paid-search/\">Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-50-digital-marketing-interview-questions-and-answers-for-2025/\">Top 50 Digital Marketing Interview Questions and Answers for 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.1. What are the rules for Amazon titles?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1.</strong> Product names are what Amazon needs to meet character restrictions, eliminate promotional language, and cut out special characters. To guarantee compliance and prevent listing limits, titles ought to be clear, relevant, and formatted following category rules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.2. Can I change the title of my Amazon listing?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>You may change your product title in Seller Central by a flat file upload. Upload the file, check for mistakes, and wait 24 hours to guarantee correct reflections of updates after revisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.3. How long can an Amazon title character be?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3.</strong> Although Amazon usually only allows 200 characters for product names, some categories could have fewer restrictions. Review category-specific rules to ensure your listings stay current and help prevent compliance problems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.4. Can I include special characters in my product titles after the update?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> Amazon\'s revised policy restricts the use of special characters in product names. If your brand name calls for them, look for notifications in Seller Central and change titles to keep compliance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Amazons-2025-title-policy-update-New-product-title-requirements-effective-January-21-2025.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-11 13:59:20','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(83,'Big Announcement: Tech2Globe at IndiaSoft 2025!','big-announcement-tech2globe-at-indiasoft-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What is the IT exhibition in India 2025 that’s making everyone excited<strong>? IndiaSoft 2025</strong>! And guess what? Tech2Globe is all set to be a part of it!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organized by ESC, this event seeks to build commercial connections, promote worldwide networking, and highlight technology advancements. It offers industry information, helps startups, and arranges B2B meetings to enable Indian and foreign IT firms to network, work together, and investigate tech-based new prospects.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tech2Globe’s announcement</strong> brings exciting news for businesses looking to elevate their digital presence. Reputable brand in IT consulting, web development, and online marketing, we are ready to highlight our knowledge once more this year. The team encourages everyone to interact, share ideas, and explore new development tactics having years of expertise and solid industry contacts. This is therefore the ideal chance for you to push your business forward.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">An Introduction to the Event</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organized by the Electronics and Computer Software Export Promotion Council (ESC), IndiaSoft is a major worldwide IT event first held in 2001. It will rightfully mark its silver jubilee in 2025. As a result, the event will be even more significant. To attend the event, you must register in advance and reach bharat mandapam, New Delhi, where it is scheduled to take place from March 19 to March 21, 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With exhibitors from over 80 countries, this event fosters global networking and business collaborations. Moreover, it showcases a wide range of technologies, including AI, robotics, fintech, and edtech, offering IT companies a platform to launch innovations. Supported by the government, IndiaSoft strengthens India’s position in the tech industry while creating valuable opportunities for professionals, investors, and businesses worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Highlights of the Show</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As the Indian IT sector is on the rise, with spending expected to reach $160 billion by 2025, events like IndiaSoft create valuable opportunities for growth and collaboration. This premier tech expo serves as a hub for industry leaders to showcase groundbreaking innovations and explore new business prospects.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover all the highlights and experiences lined up for you at IndiaSoft 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Exhibitors get strong exposure and a lively networking atmosphere with 50,000+ local visitors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Over 1500 Indian electronics and IT exhibitors and 700+ foreign participants from 80+ countries make it a global networking event.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The event offers 4000+ pre-organized B2B meetings to help guests form new business ties.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Over 100 new IT product releases are scheduled, offering participants unprecedented access to cutting-edge tech.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Indian IT investments, government initiatives, and worldwide business trends are revealed during the event, giving participants global market exposure.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Attendees may meet tech leaders from developing states, discover new technology, and see India\'s development hubs in action.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tech2Globe at the Forefront of IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our experience at IndiaSoft 2024 was nothing short of remarkable. And now, we’re back! <strong>Tech2Globe’s announcement</strong> of participating in IndiaSoft 2025 showcases how ready we are to push boundaries, explore new opportunities, and continue driving digital transformation. All thanks to the incredible platform provided by ESC India, we had the opportunity to showcase our expertise and connect with global businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Be ready to meet our experts at IndiaSoft! There will be Harpreet Singh Sethi (CEO and Founder, Tech2Globe), Sarbjeet Singh (Director of Operations), and Sahil Verma (Director of Sales) to provide you real-world solutions, market insights, and doable tactics to help you expand your company. Don\'t miss the chance to interact with them and explore fresh prospects!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, learn about our&nbsp;growth and evolution since we started in 2014. From our wide spectrum of offerings, we will be highlighting four primary areas: digital marketing, software development, eCommerce consulting, and lead generation. Each of these represents a vital branch of our tech-driven expertise, designed to help businesses scale and thrive:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Our Solutions for Evolving Business Needs</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Digital marketing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As the online presence matters, the only thing that can up the game is digital marketing. And to apply all the right strategies, our professionals ensure that every campaign delivers results. In addition, we will provide you with advice and techniques on how to take control of search results pages, start discussions on social media, and turn website visitors into potential customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta Ads</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta Ads</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Online Reputation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Influencer Marketing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Software development</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our software development team makes digital works of art that not only work perfectly but also help your business grow. These can be anything from unique apps to strong workplace solutions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you\'re building a website from scratch or enhancing your digital presence, we specialize in Shopify, WordPress, Wix, CMS, PHP, React, and Mobile App development. As your trusted web builders, we ensure that every project is tailored to your business needs, setting you up for long-term success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our services include the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>E-Commerce Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enterprise Portal Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content Management System</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Web Application Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>ECommerce Solutions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>IT Staffing Services</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Android Apps Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>iPhone iPad Apps Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mobile Apps Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Windows Apps Development</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Ecommerce consulting</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Build an online store using professional solutions meant to provide your consumers a flawless shopping experience. From simple website design to safe payment methods, our area of expertise is eCommerce solutions, which transform guests into devoted consumers. Whether your new store is opening or you are improving an existing one, we offer the tools and knowledge to enable your success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Marketplaces:</strong> Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra, Ajio, Tata Cliq, Tata Lux, Etsy, Walmart Global Selling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>eCommerce Platforms: </strong>Magento, BigCommerce, Jet.com, WooCommerce, Shopify, Walmart, CDiscount, Prestashop</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Custom &amp; Platform-Based Development: </strong>NopCommerce, Magento, Shopify, WooCommerce</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Marketplace Storefronts</strong>: Amazon Webstore, eBay Store Design</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scalable Solutions: </strong>BigCommerce, Volusion, 3DCart, OpenCart</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI Enabled Lead Generation Platform</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our AI-powered lead creation uses complex algorithms to find good prospects, improve marketing, and increase sales. We help businesses get the right customers by carefully studying how customers act and how the market is changing. Experience better lead creation that saves you time, gets more people involved, and easily boosts your sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Experience Innovation &amp; Connections at IndiaSoft 2025</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IndiaSoft is about growing connections, sharing ideas, and embracing innovation not only about displays. Here’s what you can look forward to at our booth:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Expert Insights &amp; Trends: </strong>Learn from our sector professionals the newest ideas and tactics influencing the digital world.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Hands-On Tech Demonstrations:</strong> Interactive demos and seminars meant to provide you useful, real-world applications lets you explore our innovative ideas.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meaningful Networking:</strong> Whether you own a company, like technology, or may be a partner, network with like-minded experts to find prospects that propel achievement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Join Us on These Dates</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We would appreciate your attendance at the IndiaSoft 2025 event as we get ready to seize the dynamic possibilities of the digital sector. Join us at Stall Number: D131, Hall No. 4, where we’ll discuss innovative strategies, tailored solutions, and the latest industry trends to help you grow a sustainable business.<br><br>See us on March 19, 20, and 21, 2025, and learn how our professional support will enable you to keep ahead in the always-evolving digital terrain.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hope to see you at the event! Stay connected with us on social media for exclusive updates and sneak peeks!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tiktok-restored-in-the-usa-after-brief-ban-what-you-need-to-know/\">TikTok Restored in the USA After Brief Ban: What You Need to Know</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-in-the-age-of-ai-revolutionizing-strategies-for-success/\">Digital Marketing in the Age of AI: Revolutionizing Strategies for Success</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Big-Announcement-Tech2Globe-at-IndiaSoft-2025-3.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-11 06:40:32','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(84,'The Process That Affects a Website\'s Visibility','the-process-that-affects-a-websites-visibility','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO and optimization of a web page help achieve good search results. Additionally, they play a key role in enhancing the visibility of the web pages of any business. However, there are several factors that count as influential, i.e., the<strong> process that affects the visibility of a website</strong>, resulting in higher traffic and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this blog, we have explored techniques that enhance the <strong>web page visibility improvement </strong>strategies. Our aim is to help those who can\'t find effective solutions or want to learn diverse ways to improve a website\'s visibility through mindful approaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why You Need the Improvement of Web Page Visibility</mark> </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The primary reason behind improving website visibility is to ensure that every page, be it a product page or a service page, gets maximum traffic from customers that convert into sales and increase revenue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I<strong>mprovement of a web page visibility</strong> can result in overall website health as more audiences interact with your content. Also, higher visibility increases your chances of appearing at the top of Google search results, making it easier for people to find your services or expertise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Apart from ensuring relevant audiences, pages with increased visibility bring traffic, meaning your site receives quality visitors who are more likely to engage and convert. So win the trust of your customers by enhancing your site presence and increasing your sales with perfect search engine optimization techniques.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Improve Your Website’s Visibility on Google - SEO </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Implementation of effective <strong>web page visibility improvement</strong> strategies is a way for businesses to achieve stronger online presence and long-term overall success. Below, the information discusses the right techniques to improve a website’s visibility on Google.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s important that you publish or choose content that is relatable to what people are looking for. This task requires a thorough keyword research.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s best to use tracking tools to monitor, like Google Analytics, Google Search Console, the performance of your site and make required changes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, to improve your content marketing plan, create content that is useful and interesting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use social media to attract more people and get them to visit your page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on getting backlinks from trustworthy websites that are of high quality.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Practicing the approaches above, if done correctly and consistently, can definitely show positive results, leading to higher organic traffic and improved online presence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Web Page Visibility Improvement Strategies for Google Rankings </mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enhancing website visibility requires strategic planning. Consequently, <strong>improvement of a web page’s visibility </strong>involves the implementation of different strategies, which together contribute to better search engine performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Fast-Loading Websites &amp; Mobile-Friendly Experience</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Slow-loading websites affect the user experience, leading to a critical process<strong> that affects the visibility of a website</strong>. To make sure the visitors to your page can easily navigate your site, optimize so that they can understand the content quickly. No matter if the user is using a desktop or browsing through their mobile device, both of the experiences must give seamless performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Enhancing On-Page SEO</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On-page SEO means optimizing website elements, a way that enhances the performance of a web page in search rankings. The specific ways you can improve these are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta Descriptions &amp; Tags</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Title &amp; Subheading Tags</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Eye-Catching Titles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword Discovery </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword Overlap Issue</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Audience Interaction </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Website Performance Check </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search Index Management </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Valuable Content &amp; Ideal Word Count</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google always, from the start, has given priority to content that is informative and relative to the topic. The content is written in a structured format, and the word count varies accordingly. Also, the content alone is not enough, which is why SEO optimization such as meta tags, relevant keywords, among other things, is crucial.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Boosting Click-Through Rates (CTR)</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A higher CTR not only helps in getting excellent website traffic but also signals to search engines that your content is relevant, which can improve rankings. This is why focusing on the<strong> improvement of a web page’s visibility, for example</strong>, through compelling headlines, engaging meta descriptions, and strategic keyword placement is essential.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Smart Keyword Strategy</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a long time, a good SEO approach has been to use targeted keywords to create highly optimised content. Keyword optimization has many parts, such as doing a lot of study and staying away from cannibalization, which together make for a complete and effective strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Fixing Technical Website Issues</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are the issues that are often related to website speed, indexing, and mobile responsiveness. Thus, this strategy requires collaborating with your developer, discussing and planning on resolving errors and improving performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Building Strong Backlinks</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On a scale from 1 to 100, domain authority indicates a website\'s rank in search engine result pages (SERPs), and backlinks significantly affect website exposure. Page authority is a great metric for understanding how well specific pages are doing in search engine rankings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Structuring Pages for Better Google Ranking</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a website owner or marketer, you must know about Google algorithms that crawl your site regularly, testing whether the content and structure of your web pages meet SEO standards. To add, <strong>improvement of a web page visibility</strong> at an optimal level requires the right structure of the pages for better indexing and user experience. Make sure to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use important terms in URLs, meta titles, descriptions, and image tags.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use internal links to make crawling easy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Do a technical SEO check to make sure the whole site is covered.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Expanding Website with Additional Pages</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To improve the visibility of the web page, it is important to add pages like blogs, FAQs, and dedicated service sections. This will help the users visiting your website to know more about you, as well as bring traffic and engagement to your site. Ultimately, it helps to enhance user experience. However, it is also important to choose the right content to add on the pages to strengthen the internal links.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Leveraging Online Listings for More Exposure</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The more places you list your business, the better your chances of standing out from competitors. The popular platforms which can help you includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Facebook – Engage with your audience and share updates.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram – Showcase products and services visually.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>LinkedIn – Build professional connections and credibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Yelp – Gain customer reviews and trust.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google My Business – Improve local search rankings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Getting Verified on Google</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The process of enhancing Google website crawl efficiency starts with business submission on Google Maps through Google My Business entry. Your business ownership claim becomes possible by doing three simple steps on a new account. The final step for listing verification requires you to enter the physical code Google delivers by mail. The procedure increases both your local online presence and your ability to rank better in search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Writing Attention-Grabbing Page Titles</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Websites gain better exposure through page naming with appropriate keywords. Your material needs outstanding headlines which avoid extravagant claims and misleading promises to gain impressive visibility within the competition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Partnering with Industry Influencers</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your aim should be to approach influential bloggers and opinion leaders who lead established communities of followers in your industry. Consider implementing the following strategies:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your website should invite expert bloggers to create guest content, thus enabling them to share it with their audience while bringing new possible candidates to your website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In their social media reviews or compilations, these influencers should place emphasis on demand while linking to your website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The author recommends authoring a guest post for their site with a link that should appear either in the author bio section or within the written text.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Always return kindness through mutual support and pay back the help received. Wise collaborations should result in mutual advantages and enhance web page visibility through beneficial partnerships. When you collaborate with others through this method, your network expands as you obtain a bigger audience and improve your internet presence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Optimizing Visual Content</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s widely true that people learn and engage more through images than text as it makes the content more interesting. This ultimately leads to better visibility of the web page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose a clear and relevant file name.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Compress images to improve loading speed.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add descriptive captions for better context.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use alt text and title text for accessibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include images in your XML sitemap for better indexing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Maximizing Google Ads Potential</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Ads are paid advertisements that bring targeted traffic to your website or business. Thus, Google Ads help improve visibility and attract potential customers efficiently. So, ensure you choose appropriate keywords and ad copy for the web page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Providing Top-Notch Customer Support</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google and other directory listings greatly benefit from positive evaluations. The number and quality of your reviews have a significant influence on user engagement; a larger number of positive reviews increases the likelihood of attracting clicks. For this strategy, <strong>improvement of a web page’s visibility example </strong>could be responding to reviews, encouraging customer feedback, and showcasing testimonials.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Growing Presence on Social Media</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, social media plays a crucial role in enhancing web page visibility. Studies show that around 52% of online brand discovery happens through social media channels. As most internet users use social media platforms, it is a key way that they notice your brand or service first. Thus, use these platforms effectively for greater traffic and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Encouraging Shareable Content</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your content needs to captivate viewers to the extent that they naturally distribute it across their social networks. Attract viewers with exciting graphics, compelling message tags, and popular subject material that resonates with your audience. Your content becomes more visible when you create valuable material that connects with your audience because people share it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tapping Into Local Media Channels</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share fascinating tales about your company or forthcoming events to interact with local media sources and increase website traffic for further information. Additionally, drawing fresh visitors to your website is advertising in newspapers and local magazines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Capitalizing on Small-Scale Opportunities</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add a link to your website in your email signature, on advertising flyers, on bills, and on receipts. This will help you promote it every chance you get. The more people who see or notice your URL, the higher the chances of getting more visitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Fix Search Visibility Loss? </mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you experiencing a sudden decline in organic traffic and rankings? If yes, then you need to focus on some key factors along with corrective measures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some ways that can help SEO professionals to fix search visibility loss, leading to <strong>improvement of web page visibility</strong>, includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Stay Updated With Search Engine Algorithm Changes</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everything from ranking web pages to displaying search results is the work of search engine algorithms, which change multiple times every year. Thus, your main focus should be on core updates and Google spam updates, which always prioritize human-written, problem-solving content for the audience—meaning no plagiarized or AI-generated material.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best way to stay updated is by monitoring Google\'s Search Central Blog and setting up Google Alerts for \"<a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-november-2024-core-algorithm-update/\">Google algorithm update</a>.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Address Any Technical Glitches</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unseen technical issues can seriously hurt your SEO visibility. For example, if your server goes offline while a Google bot is crawling, it can affect how your site is indexed. Too much downtime? You might get hit with Google penalties. Another culprit? Misusing the canonical tag. This tag tells Google which version of a page to index, and without it, your rankings can take a dive.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, website updates can mess with your settings or cause compatibility issues. Lastly, if you redesign your site without optimizing, you might change URL structures, delete pages, or mess with internal links, all of which impact SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Check for Any Hosting Problems</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not only can server downtime affect your SEO, but hosting problems can also cause significant drops in visibility. In this case, reaching out to your host, that is, the provider managing your website’s server, can help you fix the SEO issues. Discuss your concerns with them and explore a possible solution, if necessary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Analyze Your Competitors’ Strategies</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Analyzing your competitor’s strategy is important, even if you think you have done everything possible to improve a web page\'s visibility. This is because you can uncover a potential strategy hidden in their approach that you may employ for better performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may do this by reviewing top competitors’ websites, content they are creating that is performing well, and determining where any new links are coming from.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Evaluate Your Featured Snippets</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To evaluate your featured snippets, track their performance using Google Search Console and analytics tools. Check CTR, impressions, and rankings. Analyze if the snippet answers queries effectively and aligns with user intent. Optimize by refining content, adding structured data, and ensuring clear, concise answers to improve visibility and engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Review and Recover Lost Backlinks</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lost backlinks from influencers or top sites? Then, it’s time to check what’s missing. It may have been replaced by a competitor’s link—analyze the reason. Use this insight to reconnect with the source and create high-quality, relevant content that adds value. Strengthening these connections will help improve your website’s authority and visibility over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hope our comprehensive guide on “<strong>Process That Affects the Visibility of a Website</strong>” will help you enhance your online presence so you can achieve your digital marketing goals. Be it the right strategies for improving rankings or recovering lost traffic because of search visibility loss, you can get the best solution for each when you outsource your SEO needs to us. Our digital marketing professionals will ensure you get the optimal strategies for perfect website growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients/\">How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-in-2025-what-to-expect-from-paid-search/\">Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">FAQs</mark></strong> </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.1. How can I increase the visibility of my website?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. There are various potential strategies that can help in <strong>improvement of web page visibility</strong>, but the key ones involve keeping track of SEO trends, following best practices, optimizing content, and lastly, building quality backlinks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.2. How to improve visibility index?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. To improve the visibility index, it is crucial to analyze and optimize your website’s SEO performance. Otherwise, outsource the task to an SEO professional who can better enhance the rankings by using advanced techniques. Tools that can help include Google Search Console, Ahrefs, and SEMrush.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.3. What are two factors that can affect visibility?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. The two factors that affect the visibility the most are: quality of content and backlink profile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.4. What must you do when visibility improves?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. After your web page visibility improves, ensure that you still stay updated with algorithm updates, conduct regular keyword research, and technical audits. Also, analyze user behavior for further optimizations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Process-That-Affects-a-Websites-Visibility.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-02-06 07:11:25','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(85,'Digital Marketing in the Age of AI: Revolutionizing Strategies for Success','digital-marketing-in-the-age-of-ai-revolutionizing-strategies-for-success','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong><em>Check out the use of AI in digital marketing outlined in this article, along with real-life examples. Also, learn what further advances of Artificial Intelligence in digital marketing could imply to your company.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways:</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A study reveals that 66% of Gen Zers are keen to use AI in digital marketing to enhance their experience with products or websites.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI tools like Google Ads and Facebook Ads Manager can help in enhancing targeted ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>When it comes to creating content for social media, using AI tools like Canva can simplify the process.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Witness the impact of AI in online marketing, like performance tracking, personalization, customer experience, and AR &amp; VR.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is AI taking over digital marketing? Yes, absolutely. AI being the driving force behind innovation, with 88% of marketers already using it in their work and 62% integrating it into their strategies, the transformation has already begun. Personalized Marketing Campaigns, Enhanced Data Analysis, Social Media Management, and Predictive Analytics are just a few ways AI tools add value to agencies offering <a href=\"https://www.stage.tech2globe.co.in/digital-marketing-services\"><strong>digital marketing services.</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, the main purpose of the integration of AI in digital marketing is to increase efficiency and achieve better results faster than work effort and cost. Some of the ways AI makes marketing better include precise targeting in pay per click, smart optimization for content SEO, and intelligent interaction for social media.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is AI in Digital Marketing?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI in digital marketing is an effective solution for improving the total effectiveness of the various elements of digital marketing, such as targeting &amp; personalization with Google Ads, ChatGPT, HubSpot, etc. Marketers or companies who wish to enhance their marketing strategies shall benefit because it helps to target potential customers in a more effective way, minimize unnecessary costs, and ultimately increase profits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s how AI shaping the evolution of digital marketing:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>How It All Started: </strong>The use of AI in digital marketing back then was limited to preliminary functions, where it was used to process automated emails and to identify simple data patterns. By the late 1990s, the simplest kinds of recommendation systems emerged, aimed at making proposals based on the data provided by users.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Chatbots and Virtual Helpers: </strong>In the 2000s and early 2010s, self-sufficient intelligent conversational agents, such as chatbots and virtual helpers, emerged. These self-serve tools not only enhanced customer satisfaction but also reduced response times. Moreover, they let businesses always be accessible, so customers’ interactions were easier.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Using Data to Predict Trends: </strong>Over recent years, there has been an advancement of intelligent tools that analyze trends and customer behaviors. As the marketers have embraced the concept, they are in a position to make informed decisions on what they need to do based on the desires of the customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Benefits of AI in Digital Marketing</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below mentioned are the top 5 benefits of AI in digital marketing focusing on how AI benefits digital marketing:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Understanding your audience better: </strong>AI helps you look at a lot of data and anticipate what each customer will do or decide to buy. This enables you to effectively execute marketing campaigns according to a specific target audience. As a result, with the right strategies based on AI, marketers can easily turn a lead into a sale at the best times to increase results.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Increased Productivity:</strong> You are able to simply automate a number of chores that are repetitive by using AI. In addition to boosting production, this will save a significant amount of time and resources.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Effective Marketing: </strong>During the marketing process, AI eliminates the need for assumptions. Artificial intelligence-driven data analysis and services can help you create a more successful digital marketing plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Increased ROI: </strong>AI improves your ability to make decisions and assists you in producing content that excels in performance. As a consequence of its benefits in better understanding the audience, you are able to create best digital marketing efforts, which ultimately results in a greater return on investment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improved User Experience: </strong>Using artificial intelligence in marketing allows you to present the correct material to the right audience. Since they discover what they need, this raises consumer satisfaction. Also, research indicates that companies using artificial intelligence in their marketing plans are more likely to motivate customers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI in Action: Successful Use Cases</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are some of the real-life AI in digital marketing examples, that can help you understand the actual working of AI tools in online marketing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Cosabella’s AI-Powered Advertising Success</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Industry:</strong> Retail Apparel &amp; Fashion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Use Case:</strong> Social Media &amp; Ad Management</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cosabella introduced an AI tool called \"Albert\" to manage their digital marketing campaigns, including paid search and social media. Hence, when they started automating some processes, such as ad optimization and the formation of customized ads, they experienced significant improvements. Their return on ad spend (ROAS) was up by 50%, while the cost of advertising was down by 12%. The switch to AI-based decisions was so beneficial that the company’s marketing director liked it more than other approaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Netflix’s Approach to Personalized Viewing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Industry: Entertainment</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use Case: Personalization in Marketing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Netflix uses AI to make the viewing experience feel personal. It collects information about user behaviors and programs to choose what to display to a certain user, how to display thumbnails, and how to advertise programs. All these minor differences have a significant impact. Their recommendation systems increase their annual revenue by over $1 billion by making users stay engaged longer and watching longer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Challenges and Ethical Considerations</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, AI-powered digital marketing has changed a lot about advertising. But what about the ethics behind using AI?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Privacy: </strong>The most important limitation of AI is the capability in handling large data volumes hence escalating the probability of data or privacy infringement, potentially jeopardizing the safety of clients, which is undesirable. Therefore, it will remain your duty as the marketing experts to ensure that user consent and data protection are prioritized in the production process.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Transparency And Accountability: </strong>The second one is regarding integrity. Bearing the above points in mind, when it comes to transparency make sure that all your information is clearly stated. For accountability it refers to offering information as to why users are seeing specific ads or recommendations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Avoiding Bias: </strong>A bias arises when an AI system gives an unequal outcome because of the wrong input or errors made at the time of formulating the algorithm. Therefore, eliminating all these biases is essential in order to make AI-powered <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/is-the-digi-web-store-safe-heres-what-you-need-to-know/\">digital </a>marketing ethical. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Customer Interaction: </strong>More than the traditional customer service methods, now chatbots are the ones who first interact with the customer. Therefore, it is necessary to explain what they are capable of and to brief the user about their functionality.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI-Powered Tools Driving the Digital Marketing Revolution</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Top 5 digital marketing AI tools to use in 2025:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">ChatGPT for research and writing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among the best and simplest AI technologies available is ChatGPT. You need a relentless helper skilled in managing every chore presented to you, even with everything on your plate. These are virtual team members who can support your delivery of improved customer experiences.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Grammarly for editing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is ideal for your content team—just input your text, and it will correct your grammar. Additionally, it offers features like plagiarism detection and AI detection. It also helps you check readability, tone, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Canva for Social media graphics</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Good visuals mean excellent engagement for user experience, thus using Canva for your social media can help. It offers you templates, graphics, animations, and more, along with the option to provide extensive customization. To unlock its AI-powered features, you need to get its Pro subscription<strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">HubSpot’s AI-Powered CRM&nbsp;</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an AI-driven CRM that lets marketers focus on high-value prospects. Moreover, it nurtures them with personalized content at the best times by predicting their future behavior based on an analysis of consumer data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">SEMrush’s AI-Powered SEO Toolkit</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEMrush’s AI tools provide automated SEO audits that identify on-site issues. However, its AI-driven keyword recommendation engine helps marketers identify new opportunities based on current search trends. The real-time competitor analysis offered by SEMrush’s AI also gives businesses a significant edge.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Partner with Tech2Globe: Embrace the Future of Digital Marketing with AI</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To effectively employ AI in your work, you need the guidance of experienced professionals. AI is not a universal solution, but experts can customize it to meet your specific needs. Thus, finding the right partner, like someone with years of expertise and affordable services, is essential. If you\'re searching for one, your search ends here!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe Web Solution</a> Design an excellent AI Marketing Strategy. They have specialists who will help you unlock the range of AI in digital marketing from information seeking to information exploration. Further, it is a trustworthy and top-notch artificial intelligence digital marketing firm that offers strategic solutions for all your business requirements. Get in touch with them and find out how they can assist you in achieving that magical, AI-infused, digital marketing plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/tiktok-restored-in-the-usa-after-brief-ban-what-you-need-to-know/\">TikTok Restored in the USA After Brief Ban: What You Need to Know</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Digital-Marketing-in-the-Age-of-AI-Revolutionizing-Strategies-for-Success-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-24 10:16:21','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(86,'TikTok Restored in the USA After Brief Ban: What You Need to Know','tiktok-restored-in-the-usa-after-brief-ban-what-you-need-to-know','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> The TikTok ban in the U.S. has not been confirmed yet, but it has also not been restored. What does the 75-day delay ordered by Trump actually mean? Here, we cover the full story behind the recent TikTok ban in the U.S.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On January 18, 2025 the Supreme Court ordered that TikTok must balance national security matters or face sale termination. As the ban threat grew Google and Apple took TikTok off their app markets until they could resume serving US users. However, the new order gives stakeholders more time to negotiate and work toward a resolution, with the possibility of a sale to US-based entities on the table.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The app\'s current US status remains unclear even though it has received relief for now. The app\'s fate will remain insecure until both parties resolve their issues within 75 days.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tik Tok Ban in the United States</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Late Saturday night, TikTok users in the U.S. were hit with a surprising issue: instead of the usual video feed, a pop-up message appeared. It explained that a new law had banned TikTok and mentioned, \"President Trump has indicated he will work with us on a solution to reinstate TikTok once he takes office.\" The message ended with a hopeful, \"Please stay tuned!\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But by Sunday afternoon, TikTok was back up and running.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The company then released a statement, thanking President Trump for assuring service providers that they wouldn\'t face penalties for supporting TikTok. Essentially, the law targets companies like Apple, Google, and Oracle, penalizing them for distributing or updating TikTok content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Reasons for the TikTok Ban in the U.S.</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TikTok, one of the most popular apps worldwide, raises concerns about Chinese government data access and privacy due to its Chinese ownership. Here are the main reasons for the ban:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data Privacy Risks: </strong>User data worries emerge because TikTok shares operations with China.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>National Security:</strong> People worry that TikTok may let the Chinese government secretly watch or influence American social media users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Addictive Content:</strong> Many people express worry about the mental effects the app creates among its young users because they become easily addicted to it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Misinformation: </strong>Everybody worries about the effect TikTok has on public thinking because users keep sharing wrong info on the site.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Donald Trump Delays TikTok Ban</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>President Donald Trump has signed an executive order delaying the enforcement of a TikTok ban in the United States for 75 days. This order temporarily protects the app and its business partners from legal penalties while efforts continue to address national security concerns. The move comes after the law set to ban TikTok on January 18, 2025, raised concerns over potential data collection by the Chinese government, as the app is owned by ByteDance, a Beijing-based company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The 75-day delay allows for time to find a solution that balances national security issues while also preserving the platform, which is used by around 170 million Americans. As a result of the executive order, companies that work with TikTok, such as Oracle and Akamai, will not face penalties for continuing their partnerships.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Who Might Be the Next Owner of TikTok?&nbsp;</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As the debate over TikTok\'s future in the U.S. continues, many are asking: Who’s going to buy the platform? While ByteDance, TikTok’s parent company, has long insisted it’s not for sale, there are several big names interested in taking over. Here’s a look at potential buyers:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Elon Musk: </strong>Although rumors surfaced about Musk considering a purchase, TikTok called it \"pure fiction.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kevin O’Leary: </strong>The Shark Tank investor is part of a group seeking to buy TikTok, possibly without its famous algorithm.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>MrBeast (Jimmy Donaldson):</strong> The YouTube sensation is also in the running, with several investors backing him.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Frank McCourt:</strong> The former owner of the Los Angeles Dodgers has reportedly secured $20 billion for a potential bid.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Impact of TikTok Ban on Creators and Influencers</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A ban on TikTok might have a significant impact on American creators and influencers who depend on the platform for visibility and revenue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Many stars have developed their identities on TikHub thanks to its special algorithm, which grants users a lot of free reach.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If banned, artists would have to move to Instagram and YouTube, where they would need time to rebuild their following.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To avoid becoming too dependent on any one app, they need to spread their viewers across a number of different channels.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keeping in touch with your audience through email lists and personal websites can help you stay involved outside of social media.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Even though the ban is still uncertain, creators can stay strong and keep their businesses growing by taking proactive steps.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-analytics-benchmarking-metrics/\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/use-dedicated-search-optimization-services-for-organic-growth/\">Use Dedicated Search Optimization Services for Organic Growth</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best thing is to just wait and watch as the speculation or uncertainty is not leading to anything. There are rumors that suggest different outcomes. And for influencers and creators, it is advised to stay prepared and keep on checking the latest updates. However, the 75-day extension is still a temporary relief.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For more insights on what can happen, stay connected with us.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.1. Who banned TikTok in the U.S.?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On January 18, 2025, the United States government formally prohibited the use of TikTok.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.2. Why is TikTok banned in the United States?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The government is concerned that China may use TikTok to gather information and propagate propaganda, which could pose a risk to national security. The government has therefore prohibited the app.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.3. What does Trump\'s executive order mean?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Trump\'s ruling allowed TikTok an additional 75 days to get its affairs in shape. This suggests that users in the United States may continue to use the app while they devise a solution.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.4. Can banned TikTok accounts be recovered?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, TikTok is working on restoring access to accounts so that people may utilize them again.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.5. In which countries is TikTok banned?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Several countries, such as India, Afghanistan, and Iran, prohibit the use of TikTok. Some nations, like the United States, Canada, and Australia, only allow government officials to use TikTok.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/TikTok-Restored-in-the-USA-After-Brief-Ban-What-You-Need-to-Know-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-23 10:28:46','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(87,'Top 12 Call Center Security Measures and Predictions for 2025','top-call-center-security-measures-and-predictions','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Do you know that a cyberattack occurs every 39 seconds (According to a University of Maryland study), which means the highest protection levels are necessary? Thus, it is the time to consider what call center security practices may be expected in 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Highlights</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Since call centers always require computers, the call center\'s security will be aimed at preventing unauthorized access to the system.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can also enhance your security system and protect clients\' data with the help of <strong>call center service</strong>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Moreover, call center support </strong>may minimize tragic security mishaps besides winning over its customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Call Center Security?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact center security is a process that aims to prevent unauthorized users from gaining access to sensitive customer information and keep that data available in a call center setting. In this context, the role of <strong>call center service </strong>is to keep customers\' faith and protect the call center\'s and the organization\'s reputations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Importance of call center security:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It entails safeguarding the system against illegal data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover,<strong> call center support </strong>protects consumers from damage and preserves the company’s trust and image.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Furthermore, call center support protects consumers while maintaining the company\'s trust and reputation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It Protects customers’ personal information (Name, location, etc.) from theft.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Last but not least, strong security keeps customers away from fraud and cybercrime.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">12 Call Center Security Measures to Look Out For 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">MFA, Multi- Factor Authentication, Becomes the Standard</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Passwords are ineffective in guarding private consumer information. By asking users to confirm their identity using many techniques—such as biometrics or one-time codes—multi-factor authentication (MFA) provides another degree of protection. MFA is predicted to be a regular practice in all contact centers by 2025, drastically lowering unwanted access.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">End-to-End Encryption</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every day, call centers handle delicate consumer data. End-to-end encryption guarantees that exchanges and data transfers stay secret and unreachable to hostile parties, safeguarding this data. As encryption techniques become more sophisticated, we will probably see general acceptance in the sector by 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Biometric Verification Gets Momentum</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Set to replace conventional identification techniques include fingerprint scanning, voice recognition, and face recognition. Also, by accelerating the verifying process, biometric authentication increases security and enhances the consumer experience. Call center operations will revolve mostly around biometric technologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">AI-Powered Threat Identification</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming security by seeing dangers in real-time. Tools driven by artificial intelligence may examine trends, find abnormalities, and identify dubious behavior. So advanced artificial intelligence technologies should actively reduce hazards and offer call centers actionable information by 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Safe Remote Work System</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The move to remote work during the epidemic highlighted weaknesses in conventional security systems. Call centers must spend on secure virtual private networks (VPNs), endpoint protection, and safe access protocols to protect remote agents as remote and hybrid working models continue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Frequent Cybersecurity Employee Training</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Still, one of the biggest reasons for data breaches is human mistakes. Call centers will provide frequent employee training programs as a top priority from 2025 so staff members may learn security procedures and manage sensitive data and phishing attempts identification. Constant education guarantees that staff members stay the primary line of protection against cyberattacks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Modern Data Masking Methodologies</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data masking hides sensitive data—such as credit card numbers and social security information—during processing or transmission. Advanced data masking technology will allow call centers by 2025 to reduce exposure to sensitive data, therefore lowering the risk of breaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Compliance with Changing Rules</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data privacy regulations such as the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) have set standards for protecting consumer data. Thus, more stringent worldwide rules are predicted to surface in coming years, forcing call centers to change their compliance plans constantly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Zero-Trust Security Models Dominate</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Operating on the idea of \"never trust, always verify,\" the zero-trust model method guarantees ongoing authentication and authorization for all users, devices, and apps. As a result, zero-trust systems will be a pillar of call center security policies by future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Tokenized Secure Payment Processing</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Call centers handling payment information have to choose safe payment processing techniques. Tokenization guarantees that real data stays inaccessible by substituting unique tokens or IDs for sensitive information. Tokenization will be expected, of course, in safe payment systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Predictive Analytics for Avoidance of Fraud</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Predictive analytics finds possible fraud threats by using machine learning and past data. Thus, call centers will employ predictive analytics technologies by 2025 to aggressively resolve vulnerabilities, stop illegal activities, and guard client accounts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Cloud Safety Improvements</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Securing these platforms is the first concern as more contact centers move to cloud-based solutions. In the next year, improved cloud security measures—including smart firewalls, intrusion detection systems, and safe API integrations—will be absolutely vital. Furthermore, cloud providers will supply more strong capabilities to let call centers protect data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Security Challenges for Inbound and Outbound Call Centers in 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To solve these problems, we need strong tools for verifying identities, safe ways to make calls, and constant tracking of all outgoing communication.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the<strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/inbound-call-center\">inbound call center</a></strong>, dealing with customer queries and support, the challenges can include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>preventing data breaches during call recordings and ensuring secure access for remote agents.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Phishing attacks aimed at stealing credentials are another growing threat.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To solve these problems, multifactor authentication and encrypting communication lines are necessary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the other hand, <strong>outbound call centers</strong>, which focus on customer outreach, face unique challenges:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Telephonic and computerized programs are not immune to virus attacks, and other agents may con the clients into releasing their details to them.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, following data protection laws such as GDPR and CCPA in the letter is still relevant.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, it is necessary to have powerful means for identification, secure phone connections, and other means for monitoring all outgoing calls instantly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Protect Your Call Center with Tech2Globe’s Reliable Security Solutions</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, what matters for the future of the <strong>inbound call center</strong> is how safe and private they can make their team and customers feel. Our long list of call center security trends and forecasts stresses the importance of strong security and privacy systems, which will become a key factor in making customers happier and returning. However, the <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/outbound-call-center-solutions\">outbound call center</a></strong> must also put advanced security steps at the top of its priorities to keep customer data safe and maintain their trust. So in 2025 and beyond, cybersecurity and its predictions must be implemented more carefully than ever.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are a reputable service provider who can tailor your call center services to meet all call center requirements. Thus, our team can assist in developing dependable and industry-leading security solutions and systems for call centers of various sizes, scales, and complexity. Request a quotation to find out how we assure call center security.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-healthcare-data-entry-is-going-to-change-the-face-of-the-healthcare-industry/\">How Healthcare Data Entry is going to Change the Face of the Healthcare Industry in 2025?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-a-comprehensive-google-analytics-report-for-your-client/\">How to Build a Comprehensive Google Analytics Report for Your Client?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients/\">How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.1. What is the trend in cybersecurity in 2025?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.1. The use of AI and ML in cybersecurity can be observed in call centers in 2025. It can also make the industry more aware of what could then become threats and how best to prevent them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.2. What is the average cost of a data breach?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.2. The total mean cost of data loss per incident is $4.88 million across the global industries. Still, data varies in different sectors and segments, which directs our attention toward how the threat landscape has evolved and how we can counter these threats with proper practices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.3. What can be the best step to form a call center security strategy?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.3. Concisely, the best thing to do to secure your call center should be to ensure that it is surrounded by multiple layers of security, where you should not be a definite target for any cybercriminals. Therefore, you should request routine security assessments and also facilitate your employees on security matters. Consult with professional service providers for better guidance and help through the process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Q.4. What are the best security questions for call centres?</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.4. Most of the time, security questions that ask for detailed, personal information are the best ones for call centers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"What is your mother\'s maiden name?\",&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"What was the name of your first pet?\",&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"In which city were your parents married?\", \"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>“What are the last four digits of your social security number?\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"What is your current billing address?\".&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Top-12-Call-Center-Security-Measures-and-Predictions-for-2025-3.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-23 07:41:10','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(88,'How Healthcare Data Entry is going to Change the Face of the Healthcare Industry in 2025?','how-healthcare-data-entry-is-going-to-change-the-face-of-the-healthcare-industry','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The healthcare industry has been one of the most essential sectors in the world for a very long time. Its continuous growth and advancement are clearly evident. Consequently, the change in technology has also transformed healthcare, leading to more efficient and accurate <strong>data entry</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How is the current data collection? What will happen in the healthcare industry in the next year? Finding answers to these questions becomes crucial for providers to work and improve patient outcomes. Also, data entry of each patient whose healthcare data is collected accurately is vital for ensuring effective treatment and care.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the effort to explain the importance of efficiency, we highlight changes in data analytics in healthcare. Moreover, understand how <strong>medical data entry services</strong> can help to simplify the work with minimum effort, offering health staff time to focus on patient care.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Healthcare Statistics from Recent Years</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The global healthcare market is set to grow significantly, reaching $8.96 trillion in 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>India’s healthcare sector has seen rapid growth, now valued at $372 billion.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Some of the trends include; integrated care systems and personal control through digital solutions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Like other innovations, AI continues to transform the healthcare sector as well.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, rising costs remain a challenge for quality and accessibility worldwide.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Top Healthcare Data Entry Changes on the Horizon for 2025</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Other than providing analytics for actionable insights, healthcare data entry bridges gaps between patients and providers. Additionally, it helps you find the right hospital, estimate costs, and confirm insurance coverage with ease. Read on to understand what else it can do:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Brings Clarity with Effective Solutions</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Health analytics is indeed the way forward in the healthcare industry; it now provides real solutions to reduce overhead expenses. Team members can quickly obtain electronic systems to document, store, and monitor patient records. These tools enhance the capacity to analyze diseases simultaneously, thus minimizing errors in ratings and subsequent impacts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, wearables and IoT apps enhance people’s abilities in self-managing diseases and communicating with physicians in real-time. Providers can use technologies like image processing and mobile platforms to implement data efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Healthcare Transparency and Service Planning</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the help of data analytics, the growing amounts of claims data and EHR data can make things more transparent and improve care for a specific medical service. The reason is to cut down on waste, especially regarding time and resources, primarily focused on planning a service. Moreover, health data gives you an exact number for the price of a service compared to how well it works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Data Analytics for Personalized Medicine</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The medical industry is producing and collecting incalculable amounts of data but is facing difficulty with storing and appropriately utilizing it. Thus, it will be easier to analyze these electronic health records with clinical and socioeconomic information. Also, it is useful to apply analytics to study the treatment patterns. Data analysis provides significant help in creating the concepts of the development of personalized medicine.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Analyzing Data Analytics to Identify and Address Health Issues</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With healthcare data analytics tools, you can look at the check-up records of patients and public health data to find the problems you want to focus on. It can be based on a country or area, like population growth or age. Additionally, health data can also figure out what makes people not want to get care. This will help in developing a plan to improve care in the areas that are giving you trouble.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Genomics and health data management software.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provides genomic services through Next-Generation Sequencing (NGS) and organizes Health Information through Electronic Health Records (EHR).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improves clinical research effectiveness using tools supported by vendors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Establishing customized programs for diagnosing or treating a disease.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Building personalized diagnostic or therapeutic strategies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Identifying actionable genetic variants for personalized diagnosis or therapy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Precision Medicine Contributes to an Increase in the Quality of Care.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Precision medicine analyzes data using healthcare data analytics, genetics, and healthcare IT. Much money is spent on research on precise medicine by the government and businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It has the potential to accelerate scientific discoveries while also providing doctors and clinicians with more tools to further their treatment approaches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It takes a fresh approach to considering the patient\'s genes, lifestyle, and environment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, it helps doctors comprehend patients\' complicated health systems and diagnose accurately.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Helps to Improve the Treatment of Computational Medicine</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Computer models, analytics, and quantitative methods are used in computational medicine to diagnose and isolate illness causes. A skilled healthcare data analytics assistance provider builds models to solve unanswered medical problems if you have enough clinical data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can understand illness development.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can solve medical puzzles with improved data insights.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Understand how the environment affects patient health.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Understanding how biological systems go from healthy to harmful.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Medical Data Entry Services Can Help With Change?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Healthcare groups also require assistance of<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/medical-data-entry-services\"> <strong>medical data entry services</strong></a>, as performing the work quickly is often a concern. Technology has advanced all life sectors. It is now possible to observe that most hospitals use digital tools that enhance the speed of the data collection process among patients and doctors. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understand the benefits of <strong>medical data entry services</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Accuracy: </strong>One of the perks of medical data entry is that if you do it right, it can make your healthcare documents better and more reliable. Data analyzing is one of the best aspects of these services. If you check your data correctly, you can reduce or eliminate mistakes and inconsistencies in your records.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Enhanced Efficiency: </strong>You can expect a significant boost in output if you hire good data entry services. These service providers use modern technology like OCR (optical character recognition), which frees up your workers to work on more critical tasks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cost Savings: </strong>By hiring someone else to do your data entry, you can save time and money, which you can spend entering data manually. Using efficient data entry services, you don\'t have to hire and train new employees (or buy expensive software and hardware).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data security: </strong>Effective data entry services ensure your medical information is kept safe and follows privacy rules. Also, improved security measures like encryption and secure servers, you can rest easy knowing that your private data is safe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Time-saving: </strong>Lastly, these services can help you save time by easing the process of entering data. It lets healthcare workers focus on giving excellent care to patients instead of spending hours typing data by hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every industry changes with each passing year. Similarly, the healthcare industry will witness transformations in 2025. If you think that keeping up with the demands is a challenge in-house, outsourcing healthcare data entry services will give you efficiency and a pathway to results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a recognized data entry service provider, we have served numerous clients, which makes us the leader. Therefore, if you want more effective solutions, partner with Tech2Globe. Our team has professional and qualified healthcare data entry specialists to provide accurate service based on your needs. We also ensure the confidentiality of patients\' information through our medical data entry services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://How Tech2Globe Helped a Startup Data Analytics Need with Power BI?\">How Tech2Globe Helped a Startup Data Analytics Need with Power BI?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search\">Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-a-comprehensive-google-analytics-report-for-your-client/\">How to Build a Comprehensive Google Analytics Report for Your Client?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What is the role of data entry in a hospital?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>A data entry job entails gathering data in a health facility, such as patient details and history, and arranging the results. For instance, the information the patient gives by providing their data will be recorded appropriately by the staff for future purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. What is a dataset in healthcare?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2.</strong> A data set is a group of related sets of information built up of separate things that a computer can handle. Moreover, a data set can often be just one database table or statistical data grid.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. Which type of data is most commonly used in healthcare?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Electronic health records (EHRs) are the most common type of Healthcare data. However, the other healthcare data type may include: Administrative data, Claims data, Patient/disease registries, and Health surveys.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. What is an example of qualitative data in healthcare?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>Qualitative information in health care: Watching and listening to people in certain places to discover how and why they might feel that way. Questions like \"Are you a smoker or not?\" or \"Do you agree or disagree with this statement?\" are examples of qualitative data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-Healthcare-Data-Entry-is-going-to-Change-the-Face-of-the-Healthcare-Industry-in-2025.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-22 12:17:12','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(89,'How Tech2Globe Helped a Startup Data Analytics Need with Power BI?','how-tech2globe-helped-a-startup-data-analytics-need-with-power-bi','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Particularly in <strong>data analytics</strong>, startups typically face distinct difficulties. With limited resources and a pressing need for reliable insights, a developing company requires a partner that understands these obstacles and offers appropriate solutions to get through them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This story will illustrate how we helped a growing startup convert its data issues into profitable and practical elements. Thus, by utilizing Microsoft Power BI, which is supported by our <strong>data management services</strong>, we were able to help them find a solution that fits those requirements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">About Client</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The client, an e-commerce startup based in the United States, focuses on young, successful buyers. They aim to attract customers who seek high-quality goods and value exceptional service, ensuring an impressive shopping experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Requirement of the Client&nbsp;</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The client needed a reliable business intelligence tool to help them understand the growing data from inventory, customer interface, and sales. They were searching for a simple solution that would be able to merge this data into an understandable analysis to support decisions. Therefore, they required a specialist to assist them in using Power BI as their knowledge was limited. Overall, their goal was to utilize this tool to measure performance, identify trends, and fuel their online sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The challenges Our Client Was Facing</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In their search for a dependable <strong>data analytics</strong> solution, they were facing the following problems to cope with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It was difficult for the company to gather and interpret data from multiple sources, including inventory, sales, and any client contact.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>They could not accumulate information and have an overall picture of company performance since their data was divided among several technologies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Besides, they lacked the knowledge and resources to install and manage a highly sophisticated tool like Power BI.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The company could not identify trends and get the best out of its inventory without quality data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why was Power BI Was the Perfect Fit?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Based on an analysis of the startup\'s needs, our company suggested utilizing Microsoft Power BI. Why?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Power BI is user-friendly; anyone with little expertise can utilize this tool.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With the enablement of customizable dashboards, the firm can develop specific dashboards that reflect the various KPIs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thus, Power BI might elaborate on whether to manage large datasets or small compilations as the company grows.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Our Data Analytics Solutions Helped?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Knowing the client\'s difficulties, our Power BI development team collaborated to produce a reporting solution that fit their needs. To guarantee they had a clear, whole image of their company performance, we aggregated data from their inventory systems, sales platforms, and customer interactions onto one single platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, we provided several suggestions for the development of the dashboard, making it fascinating and easy to use. These consisted of changes to the layout, flow and interactivity in the form of graphic features as well as the combined reports.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Tech2Globe team enhanced the reporting tool\'s UI/UX design. Other things that we did were revamping the charts and graphs for better comprehension and making the links between tables more dynamic. Plus, it refined the user experience to ensure it could be easily navigable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By simplifying their data analytics process, the client gained insightful knowledge from their data. Additionally, they quickly recognized patterns, managed their inventory more effectively, and ultimately drove their company’s expansion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Results</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This task was a real game-changer as the result of our partnership. This is because it did not only meet expectations but also made a positive shift.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Team members saved a lot of time by automating the process of combining data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With data insights, the company can find things that aren\'t working and make the most of its stock.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Power BI simply grew with the company to handle more data sources.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Outsource Power BI Development Services to Tech2globe</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, this case study gives hope that with the right tools and the right partners any startup or even a small business person who finds data analytics a challenge will prove useful. Therefore, if you need to simplify your data analytics and improve the efficiency of your <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">data management services</a></strong>, outsource it to us. Our knowledgeable and adept Power BI analysts will help you get through any difficulty.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-a-comprehensive-google-analytics-report-for-your-client/\">How to Build a Comprehensive Google Analytics Report for Your Client?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-ads-in-2025-what-to-expect-from-paid-search/\">Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients/\">How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-Tech2Globe-Helped-a-Startup-Data-Analytics-Need-with-Power-BI.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-20 07:16:07','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(90,'Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search','google-ads-in-2025-what-to-expect-from-paid-search','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Wondering what the latest updates in Google Ads are? It is important to keep timely track of the changes as this will be the core responsibility of any digital marketer. Thus, to help you stay informed, this blog explores what stood out in 2024 and what trends might shape <strong>Google ad camp</strong> in 2025. Along with these updates, learn about \'<strong>Google Ads: How It Works</strong>\' if you’re a beginner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Ads is a platform where PPC campaigns are run and is a&nbsp; powerful way to reach potential customers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The 2 main aspects of<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://ads.google.com/intl/en_in/home/how-it-works/\"><strong>Google Ads configuration</strong> </a>are targeting and budgeting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can create a Google Ads account easily, but after that, you\'ll need to deposit a minimum amount to fund your balance before your ads can start running.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In 2025, while the automation of work by AI may be more prevalent in marketers, there is likely to be more use of integrated marketing for campaigns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the field of marketing, <strong>Google ad camp</strong>, short for Google ad campaign, is a way to reach the right audience. Therefore, learning about the new updates is advisable to understand what is happening with Google Ads. It assists marketers in optimizing their campaigns and managing their promotional efforts efficiently.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, advertising approaches on Google, such as PPC services, further strengthen the fact that marketing is a continuously evolving activity. Therefore, understanding what PPC paid search, especially Google Ads, will look like in 2025 is crucial for preparation, ensuring you won’t face any sudden surprises!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Google Ads: How it Works?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before we get into the details of understanding trends in Google Ads, below find the mechanics of what are <strong>Google ads and how it works</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Customer Search: </strong>Basically, anyone who has a particular requirement or focus will go to Google seeking for a solution. For instance, a user may enter “organic products” into the search bar when searching for a variety of skincare remedies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Advertisers Bid on Keywords: </strong>Advertisers identify literal keywords that relate with their business and bid for them. For instance, suppose an advertiser wants clients interested in buying organic products; they will bid on that particular keyword. The bid shows how much the advertiser will pay each time internet users click it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ads Display in Search Results: </strong>Google will display ads based on the \"ad rank,\" which is determined by an advertiser’s bid and the quality of their ad. For example, shopping ads for products like organic will show at the top, followed by text ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ad Rank and Quality Score: </strong>Google measures the performance of ads through \'ad rank\', which is an advertiser\'s bid amount and quality score. Quality ad relevance is based on its expected click-through rate and quality of the landing page for the ad.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Ads Auction: </strong>An auction happens whenever you enter a keyword into the Google search box. Google compares the two kinds of advertisers bidding on the same keyword based on ad rank and displays only the highest-ranking ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Optimize Campaigns: </strong>Advertisers can choose many keywords into relevant ad groups, where the ads are appropriate to the search queries, and link the landing pages with the keywords.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Set Up Ads in Google Ads?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now you know how ads on Google work, but what about the setup process that makes it all work? If you need help in the <strong>Google ads configuration </strong>or are embarking on your first campaign, here is a brief <strong>Google ads tutorial</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 1: Create a Google Ads Account</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First you have to visit the Google Ads website and sign in using your Google account. After signing in, set up your account details by providing some basic information, such as payment methods and initializing your account, with a minimum balance of $10.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdfEQpoIi27JF41F3QpYkqskzsJj8cQfDkM9O31fpFojaA9q5Jyk-gUyTRZtAsomDwgFUuDmXUBRQcM4L2ueahcyMe5XoDXjKovHJDro4jI0iPX0ihRHyqXxc29Ezm5xQ1ySLJc?key=4oMobDtC_MCbomyI7AlaF2sc\" alt=\"Google ad account create \"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 2: Start a New Campaign</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To begin with, click on “New Campaign” and know the objective you have for starting it, where they include the “Sales” and “Website Traffic” goals. Next, select a campaign type that will suit your business needs, such as if you click “Search Ads”, your ads will be displayed on the Google search results page. This will help target the right people for your ads because Google AdSense automatically matches your content with users’ search queries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXchwSVknu0JL0RLHGYSGm8aTH19tjotUOV-8caD792yf_wUde0hnbkouVwyTsF4bje5LO7gxXgQQLzLAO2u4x92JRFKbF0AKsY9UQxptQbXQBYYE7q-s83rWf0ODdP4oqguQL3liw?key=4oMobDtC_MCbomyI7AlaF2sc\" alt=\" New Ad Campaign\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 3: Set Up Your Campaign</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose the “Search Network” to make sure your ads appear on the search network, untick the “Display Network” if necessary. This makes it easier for you to target any ad at people who are actually looking for specific terms. Also, you can enter the target locations and audiences that will guarantee the efficiency of your ads; time and space.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdD3KMYe7OkQfbebM2lWXzC3uwrLsb3TVPvBt23KmbQgvZQcSTHpuDv7M9xOI6K81PmDDxsjm8SPUZj_ZVHLpUOymnZ9P1wrHlmsgSRD6VrJdNdkwyMgEqg7H_IVtuH_KBUKzzkTw?key=4oMobDtC_MCbomyI7AlaF2sc\" alt=\"Set Up Your  Campaign\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 4: Select Keywords for Your Ad</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the best results with your campaign, first identify the Keywords using the Google Keyword Planner taking into account their popularity and rivalry. The use of this tool is going to allow you to spot keywords that your audience searches for. When you have the list of the targeted keywords, incorporate them into your campaign to enhance the ad reaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfM4g22jkb-IvalBBJasgHDernUxzB77AhVlatskeTAMMuhzgSGv2KtAatiWt8EuY-77YTh_vn0cK0r9gEFVaxa9d1Vsh07W8brKRQlJ4FSBNwZaWqytQOLZGjcyVEsJjzkO2z_?key=4oMobDtC_MCbomyI7AlaF2sc\" alt=\"Keywords for the Ad\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 5: Create Ad Content</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Create sensitive and attractive headlines and descriptions that will reach your audiences and appeal to what they want. Ensure you incorporate a ‘click here to buy’ button or any similar button that every potential customer should follow. This will help generate interest and the all-important click-through rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 6: Set Your Budget</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To set your budget right from the onset, decide on your daily or total campaign budget. After that, select the bidding strategy, like shifting to “Conversions”, that will allow you to get even better results and guarantee the practical work of your campaign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdoInZPo0m_V3A88oNYJeJSFGEyX3ua91GKc0OonzAuPDPy3_jnuN82nx_PwEUxTyba2MK1nhSq1Jg92LWeY2bYdI1y4Wu0o6WW0_Atkxex0DW05n63gPXJnwVYlmgiJ4Gxo9Ku?key=4oMobDtC_MCbomyI7AlaF2sc\" alt=\" Set Your Budget\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 7: Track and Optimize Performance</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To set up conversion tracking, link your Google Ads account with Google Tag Manager and your website. This makes it possible for you to monitor the necessary imperatives and also the campaign effectiveness. Always track the results and implement some changes to improve the effectiveness of further actions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By following the steps of the above <strong>Google Ads tutorial</strong>, you can start your first successful campaign and reach your target audience effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Did 2024 Reshape the Game for Google Ads Specialists?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2024, Google ads specialist witnessed the following changes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Improved Relationships Between Google Ads and Advertisers</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In recent years, relationships between Google Ads advertisers and agencies have faced some strain. However, things are improving. Despite past challenges with inconsistent ad reps and feature rollouts, Google’s communication on new features has become clearer, thanks to Ginny Marvin. She’s played a key role in improving PPC community relations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Google Ads Shifts Toward More Control and Flexibility for Advertisers</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This past year, Google has altered its method, providing equal emphasis on traditional campaign styles alongside new prohibitions for advertisers. For example, data visibility and negative keywords are examples of Google’s reaction to the requirements of advertisers. Additionally, keeping Search and Shopping while minimizing Performance Max\'s overlap provides more flexibility in campaign setup.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Core Skills for Google Ads Success Amid AI and Automation</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even though the competition in the Google Ads space has increased by incorporating machine learning and algorithmic campaigns, the basics of running great Google Ads campaigns do not significantly differ. Despite the trends towards AI and automation, Google Ads specialists are vital to know things such as conversion tracking, accurate keywords, ads’ titles and descriptions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Predictions for Google Ads and Paid Search in 2025</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some key factors that may bring the changes in Google Ads and Paid Search:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The Growing Impact of Performance Max and Demand Gen.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When Performance Max exited beta and became available to the public, it was initially met with skepticism. However, today, many advertisers believe it can outperform other campaigns in the right scenarios. Looking ahead, we anticipate Demand Gen (which will soon integrate Video Action Campaigns) will become a key player in 2025, complementing Performance Max as an upper-funnel strategy. This shift will be driven largely by Meta-first advertisers, as the approach aligns closely with paid social campaigns, emphasizing captivating creative assets and optimized landing pages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Building Stronger Stakeholder Relationships.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last year was a year of changes, and more advertisers started experiencing that they can do much more than ad accounts. In the future, the elaboration of industry-stakeholder relations will develop further. Close cooperation with clients, business owners, and other CMOs will help achieve crucial necessities like offline conversions for lead-gen and product feeds in the eCommerce business. Understanding how to make these appeals will be vital for attaining common KPIs considering revenue and development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Google\'s Legal Challenges and Its Impact on Ads.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google has become a topic of the legal segment more frequently. However, Google is still a leading search engine and the cash cow that drives most of Alphabet’s revenue through advertising. Therefore, it’s unlikely that Google Ads will be significantly impacted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Get More Leads with a Google PPC Campaign</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have a team of PPC experts who are skilled and have extensive experience. We have proven with our results how we drive success. Thus, be it Google PPC campaigns or <strong>Amazon PPC services</strong>, you can trust that we deliver exceptional performance and growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, considering <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-ppc-services\">Amazon PPC service</a></strong>, it\'s like having a store manager who knows exactly when to put products on sale to attract more customers. For example, if you\'re launching a new product or want to push your best-seller, our strategy adapts to make sure you get the most out of your budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, if you’re thinking, “Are Google Ads Still Worth It in 2025?”Remember that ads on Google have taken businesses from local visibility to global reach, helping companies grow from small startups to industry leaders. (Examples: Wealthsimple, Docebo, Upwork, MeUndies, Copper, Dollar Shave Club, and Zendesk)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hope you find our guide on “Google Ads in 2025: What to Expect From Paid Search” useful and informative. From how Google Ads works to what to expect in 2025, we’ve covered it all. For more insights on how our<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-services\"> <strong>PPC services</strong></a> can help you “get that click,” reach out to our experts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-a-comprehensive-google-analytics-report-for-your-client/\">How to Build a Comprehensive Google Analytics Report for Your Client?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients/\">How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What is the future of paid search?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Paid search will indeed continue to evolve and have a significant future. To stay updated, read the latest trends, subscribe, and keep up with the changes. The major change will be the increasing role of AI in ad optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. Does paid search improve SEO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Both are useful in the process. For instance, paid search helps generate traffic and collect information necessary for enhancing keyword targeting. Moreover, the overall relevance of content to help it rank organically without incurring additional costs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. How do I optimize my paid search?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>There are different ways, and that is where the secret of Google’s algorithms to prioritize your campaigns lies. However, the main factors that help optimize paid search are key phrases, a complex process, and ad texts (and the landing page itself).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. Is paid search worth it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>Yes, it is, and the most effective way. If you are a business owner and want to make the audience engage and click on your ads, outsourcing PPC services can be the best option. It will bring the excellent results with the help of professionals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Google-Ads-in-2025-What-to-Expect-From-Paid-Search-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-17 06:49:40','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(91,'How to Build a Comprehensive Google Analytics Report for Your Client?','how-to-build-a-comprehensive-google-analytics-report-for-your-client','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> The results are more effective when you share and explain the data to your clients through Google Analytics reports. This blog will help you learn what it takes to build a GA4 report and how to save and share it correctly. Also, remember to explore the FAQs section at the end, where we have answered questions related to analytics reports.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Analytics is a service developed by Google in 2005, thanks to the efforts of Urchin Software Corporation and Paul Muret, a crucial programmer. As we all know, the Google team is always working on improvements. For instance, GA4 in 2020 came with new features, integrated features, and measures to protect users’ privacy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consequently, when it comes to preparing the digital marketing report, the integration of Google Analytics is essential, as it covers everything and makes the DM report more comprehensive. And, being the leading agency, we understand the effort that goes into creating a perfect report that includes all key metrics and presents data to clients clearly, without confusion. Therefore, we cover all the report types in GA4, how to build one, and showcase it to your partners, including the purpose, to make it easier for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is the Purpose of Google Analytics Reports?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The main reason for having Google Analytics reports is that it is convenient to have all the information in one place. Prominent organizations like Amazon, NASA, and Epson (a leading electronics company) rely on Google Analytics, are among the firms that use Google Analytics due to their aptitude for providing reports on key performance indicators.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>A helpful tool for all types of businesses: </strong>Whether your main aim is lead generation or e-commerce success, Google Analytics reports satisfy various objectives. Reports may be prepared especially around them and offer industry standards depending on the industry category you pick for building a GA4 property.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Gives clear ideas for future decisions: </strong>With GA4\'s new capabilities, such as privacy tracking and cookieless tracking, modern marketers will have an analytics platform that fits the future.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Best way to show clients what’s working: </strong>You can share the results with your clients by customizing them accordingly, ensuring there’s no risk if the outcomes are not as expected. However, if there’s still a discrepancy, discuss the issues openly and explain the reasons.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Create Google Analytics GA4 Report for Clients?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building a comprehensive digital marketing report requires Google Analytics GA4, customized to meet client requirements and align with their objectives. Follow the steps below, along with the accompanying image, to create one easily.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 1: Access the Report Builder</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To begin creating a report in GA4, select the Reports section. From there, select Library at the bottom of the left navigation panel (note: this requires an Editor role). Once in the Library, scroll down to the Reports table. You can either click + Create new report and choose Create overview report or hover over an existing overview report and select Edit or Make a copy to customize it further.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfaE5qV3ZifbklQpwcPnp_okrvH2upUzBEkmN40IJL9xNccGQlBSYsaMRNudodqQACM590L188eKp4tKxHK5YIMNyklFysZZOgeLL8F1dhMzAUUdYzhoNkb9FenUAEbu8rcsNRx?key=0vE8dCldXo6jTN7nKDx7oV-i\" alt=\"Access the Report Builder\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 2: Select a Base Report</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After that, choose one of the reports which have the “Overview report” category in the table. Also if you attempt to create a new Analytics Google report, always make sure to define the purpose of the report and the audience that it is going to serve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 3: Customize Report Contents</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To open the Report Builder, use the Cards section to add, rearrange, or remove summary cards. You can drag cards to adjust their order, click the \"x\" to delete cards, or use + Add Cards to include new summary cards from detail reports. Secondly, change general settings of the Report Template to address the client’s needs by linking or unlinking reports as necessary. Make sure the design and structure are relevant to the client’s goals and that the scientific and technical brief offers the client an appropriately targeted summary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 4: Set as Reports Snapshot (Optional)</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To make the report the default Reports snapshot, open the report in the Library navigation and choose Set as Reports snapshot from the menu. This will make the selected report the home view, which means it will be the first thing you see when you log in to your Google Analytics account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 5: Linking and Unlinking Reports</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The linked reports get the update from Google by default. However, if you wish to handle these updates individually, you can click on ‘Unlink’ placed right beside the name of the template. Remember that this is a one-way process and linking is only possible prior to the reports being saved, after which unlinked reports will be standalone and will need to be updated manually thereafter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 6: Preview and Save</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once done, click on Save to effect the changes you have made. You should look at the alert that seems to indicate that changes made have been applied to the right collections successfully.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc5qH3Q53VRRM4Rtj4e8-cVj2RXq_0cTgyxIdGf-rmiTXEFqptJ2RcKtF4IsaN2rBXuyjbSkxpNQzF4ZRdDeou5ssFvapW9cvn4-ncm7iyXtgotkpfyyEhucgqQhqAqcX6xLCggbw?key=0vE8dCldXo6jTN7nKDx7oV-i\" alt=\"Preview and Save\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 7: Share the Report and Request Feedback</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, you just need to share the<strong> Google report</strong> (GA4 report) with the client. Make sure to include a brief explanation of what it is about, specifying the month, data, or year covered. It’s best to schedule a virtual or in-person meeting (if possible). Give them some time to review it and ask for their thoughts, genuinely listening to their concerns (if any).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLP4y94r3DSNUUDr5e8rCxhbU8vPEJcT5evO8x0Ac88LHeOOB3bVCK3KN6JjRpl7Aub0s-NPc4xFEou78KPLcIDd3O0U9pVhwqezTHmiKHX-WcKflmETb4Fr_aj3Ra-x_UICFzFQ?key=0vE8dCldXo6jTN7nKDx7oV-i\" alt=\"Google report\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Why Does GA4 Fall Short for Customised Reporting Needs?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reasons why the GA4 report may not be ideal is because of these minor limitations:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Limited Customization:</strong> One of the most significant disadvantages of GA4 dashboards is that you cannot add guiding elements such as texts, comments, or annotations to explain certain KPIs or figures to clients and their businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>No Color Options: </strong>One functionality missing in GA4 that is quite valuable for earlier versions of GA is the inability to add colors to figures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Lack of Branding: </strong>Another disadvantage of GA4 is that it does not let users add logos or brand colors, which makes reports’ appearances inconsistent.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Design Restrictions: </strong>Nevertheless, what is clear is that design elements can become necessary if the reports are used in large organizations or for specific products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Challenges with Public Sharing: </strong>When reports are shared publicly, GA4\'s lack of customization features can hinder effective communication and the professional presentation of data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What are the Types of Google Analytics 4 Reports?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Google Analytics 4 reports are mainly categorized into 2 types: Standard Reports and Explorations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">1. Standard Reports</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In<strong> <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/analytics/devguides/collection/ga4\">Google Analytics GA4</a></strong>, developing a standard report is quite easy to do. This report is located under the ‘Home’ tab on the left menu bar where all available reports are compiled under the ‘Reports’ tab. Check the image below for guidance:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When clicking on it, you get different types of reports, such as Report Snapshot, Acquisition, Engagement, User, and many more. All these categories offer basic and easy solutions to create simple reports and share them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4311,\"width\":\"806px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-12.png\" alt=\"Report Snapshot\" class=\"wp-image-4311\" style=\"width:806px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The subcategories presented under the Lifecycle and User sections have specific roles and functions. For example, Acquisition shows how users got to your website, and for this reason, it’s perfect for evaluating marketing operations. At the same time, the User collection is more about identifying particular users and detailing their behaviors and characteristics if you need to better understand your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">2. Explorations</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike standard reports, which give an average understanding of your data, \"Explorations\" are meant for richer analysis. They provide more sophisticated approaches to learning more about users\' behavior and characteristics to be used in creating special reports. The image below highlights where \"Exploration\" is located in the left sidebar. To do a new search, click on the Blank card with the plus sign + or choose one of the templates in the gallery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeEQiHT6v7Wrb1nKv5BHz0xOgJpvndmNK2iNX9CdfeB084SklDQyi3fo7llV4UU3asSrZiOir3LmjEJomLmeqdztFuXSGf-EaOpJXOW0xnbR73ino5S3VyV2rdHCCw6QhZA2T9ZUQ?key=0vE8dCldXo6jTN7nKDx7oV-i\" alt=\"Explorations\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Explorations provide several methods for analysing data:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Free-form Exploration: </strong>Organize your information in any way you like.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cohort Exploration:</strong> Study groups of users over time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Funnel Exploration:</strong> Determine where people get lost in a process.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Segment Overlap:</strong> Show the same user segment or a different one and how.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>User Exploration: </strong>Focus on individual user journeys.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Path Exploration:</strong> Visualize the steps users take across your site or app.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>User Lifetime:</strong> Examine long-term user behavior and value.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Showcase Your Google Analytics Findings?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It won’t be wrong to accept that each client is different from the other and has different objectives and aims. However, it focuses on one central principle of performing the deal – the aspect of results. Ensure that when presenting your reports, you choose an understanding, assertive demeanor that will be easily relatable to them. In addition, we would like to mention that some clients may not be aware of GA4 due to its relative complexity and several novelties.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If that seems cumbersome, use <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-google-data-studio-and-how-to-create-a-report-on-it/\">Looker Studio</a> to simplify your work. You can swiftly import your data with ease. Customisable widgets and configurable tooltips help you build KPI reports and gradually explain metrics to your clients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcjRWPijwikwZKGQUXH2uKogc-HRyemRYNzhBSxaf7-oSXSkZLdJIWWAmmo-ONbGkzfazR-KjtJS-EJ70mHYhSHjmHhUQGii8RUyxqayTQQGAEfA-lU8hTJGxMd4FOeeQQXvNgBsA?key=0vE8dCldXo6jTN7nKDx7oV-i\" alt=\"Looker Studio\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you\'ve completed your analysis, you can export the findings in several formats:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Sheets</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TSV (Tab Separated Values)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CSV (Comma Separated Values)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PDF</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PDF (all tabs)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s how you can share access of a GA4 Report:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firstly, select Admin from the Google Analytics page.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose the account and select \"Account Access Management.\"&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enter the email address of the individual you wish to share access with.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select the user\'s role.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ask the recipient to approve the request after clicking Add.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How We Can Help Crafting Customized Google Analytics Reports?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Of course, generating qualitative Google Analytics reports for clients could be demanding because of procedural complications such as tool constraints and data inconsistency. That is where our professional digital marketers come in to offer their assistance. They are familiar with all the intricacies of creating detailed Google Analytics reports and are up to speed with GA4. Therefore, we can provide a specialized report service and industry expertise that can result in accurate information. Contact us for additional info and to discuss the extra services we can offer you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-analytics-benchmarking-metrics/\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients/\">How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-your-social-media-marketing-strategy/\">How to Build Your Social Media Marketing Strategy?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions:&nbsp; FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What is a Google Analytics report?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>A Google Analytics report is a documented file providing information about the website performance, how the visitors interact with the site and their source. It is useful for businesses to analyze data and monitor their goals and objectives. Additionally, it helps enhance their visibility across the internet and improve user engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. What are the 6 basic reports of Google Analytics?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>&nbsp;The basic reports of Google reports Analytics are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Audience - </strong>Concerns about the information of the people visiting your site, including their age, gender, interests, location, and device type.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Landing page - </strong>One of the screens features your refined pages using sessions, engagement, goals, or revenues.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mobile overview - </strong>It analyzes data comparing bounce rate, page/session, and average session duration for tablets, desktops, and mobile devices.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Acquisition - </strong>The All Campaigns report helps compare the efficiency of advertising campaigns marked with UTM tags.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Traffic acquisition - </strong>Concerned with the origins of users and the way they engage with your site or application.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>User Acquisition - </strong>Cater to first-time users and ask them how they learned about your site or application.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. How to build a report in Google Analytics?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3.</strong> By following simple and easy steps, such as accessing the library, selecting templates, customizing metrics, using filters and dimensions, and ultimately saving after previewing the report, you can share it with the stakeholders you want.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. How do I extract a report from Google Analytics?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> To extract or download the Google Analytics report you want, go to the “Reports” section and select the desired “Report.” Then, customize the reports and click the Share button. Then, choose the download option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-to-Build-a-Comprehensive-Google-Analytics-Report-for-Your-Client-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-16 06:18:12','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(92,'How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients?','how-seo-agencies-can-deliver-value-to-enterprise-clients','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Do you know what features make SEO agencies a reliable companion to enterprise clients? If not, then this guide will help you understand that beyond simple needs and basic business requirements, they provide clarity, openness, dependability, and quantifiable performance. Therefore, learn how SEO experts use enterprise SEO for meaningful change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enterprise SEO is for large-scale organizations, like e-commerce giants, MNCs, and media outlets.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Scale and complexity make enterprise SEO different from traditional SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Informational yet easy communication, paired with a goal-oriented approach, helps big businesses trust and rely on enterprise SEO.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, enterprise SEO focuses on time management and innovative solutions that complement current business strategies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you may know, it is essential to build a sustainable relationship with the enterprise clients to enhance identification and credibility. This is because it forms the initial key point as far as their satisfaction and future loyalty are concerned. In this way, knowing what the enterprise client wants, that is effective, timely, and honest communication, flexibility, and commitment, an <strong>SEO agency</strong> acts as a vital link between the client’s team and stakeholders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, it confers power; it allows employees to get experience in the operations of huge businesses, and there has to be a cash component. Furthermore, understand how a reputable digital marketing agency can help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Enterprise SEO?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enterprise SEO is a broad approach for businesses that operate globally or nationally. It involves optimizing major websites with considerable amounts of content. Moreover, these businesses often have websites with a vast number of pages; for example, Salesforce, which is a multinational enterprise,&nbsp; has over 2 million indexed pages and a workforce spread across different countries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO for a big-scale business differs significantly from SEO for a small company that sells handmade stationery through a Shopify shop. Considering Enterprise SEO, size is more important than return on investment (RoI). The resources available to small firms are limited. Because of this, they have to be clever and use different tools to get the same effects. In other words, return on investment (ROI) is their primary measure of success.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The difference between traditional SEO and Enterprise SEO:</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Traditional SEO&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Enterprise SEO</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Accurate for small to medium-sized websites.</td><td>Large, complex websites with multiple domains and subdomains</td></tr><tr><td>Require smaller team, manual processes.</td><td>Requires a larger team, advanced tools and automation.</td></tr><tr><td>Focus on keyword-rich content.</td><td>Comprehensive content strategy, including various content formats and distribution channels.</td></tr><tr><td>Manual link building</td><td>Scalable link building strategies</td></tr><tr><td>Lower budget</td><td>Higher budget for tools, resources, agency fees, etc.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Benefits of Partnering with SEO Agencies for Enterprise Success</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing to an experienced <strong>SEO agency</strong> is best when there is limited in-house expertise and no time to take care of complex SEO tasks or if your business is scaling rapidly and looking for a professional solution. To help you understand more about SEO Agencies for Enterprise Success, we have discussed 6 benefits of Enterprise SEO below.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Strategic and Simple Communication</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The task of an SEO company involves focusing on developing and maintaining good communication with the enterprise clients. It is far more effective to have a quick 15–minute Teams call at the right time rather than exhausting the client with an extensive email thread or an overwhelming report. But, still, detailed emails are appropriate when the recipient requires additional context. Before reaching out, an agency should always evaluate: Is this urgent, and is this the best way to address it?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Goal-Oriented Approach</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Getting more visitors and higher results is helpful, but good SEO does more than that. For example, to increase sales, keep customers, and increase market share, professionals make sure their work aligns with key business goals. If your suggestions aren\'t directly related to these goals, they might not work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO experts look for problems in the technical, content, or off-page pillars and look at the bigger picture. They start by learning about their clients\' quarterly or yearly goals and figuring out who needs to be involved in carrying them out. SEO experts also get results that matter because they work well with others and see how their methods fit into the bigger picture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Flexibility to Evolving Needs</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The markets are dynamic, and so is SEO. Enterprise clients value agencies that stay agile and focused on results. It\'s not about how many hours you\'ve spent—it\'s about addressing top priorities right now. Yes, it can sometimes be frustrating, but good SEO agencies adapt to shifts that must be made. All this way, agencies are not the hindrance but rather the advantage and contribution to the process.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Transparency and Reliability</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Honesty and clear communication aren\'t just morals for SEO pros; they\'re also long-term strategies for success. A good agency having the right expertise will admit the mistake and deal with delays builds confidence. For instance, holding accountability for missed targets while discussing both improvements and setbacks without hesitation demonstrates integrity.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Timely Execution of Plans</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enterprise SEO work requires organization and coordination of several processes where a shift in one component may negatively impact other components. The objective is to work quickly and accurately to avoid developing constraints within the workflow. Any given enterprise SEO professional appreciates efficiency because time is of the essence. Hence, a quick reply or simple text like ‘We are on it; you will hear from us within (time frame)’ creates overall reliability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Innovative Solutions to Challenges</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An SEO agency understands that enterprise clients do not readily share first-party data with anyone. However, restricted availability doesn’t have to mean restricted options. A significant area of strength is demonstrated by agencies where they do competitive analysis, using enhanced equipment and tools and exploiting open-source information.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What Do We Value as a Recognised Digital Marketing Agency?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being one of the most popular digital marketing agencies, we always pay attention to how we can get to know the client and provide them with the best results. Therefore, placing our strength in SEO has been of great benefit for acquiring the online presence that the businesses require.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you become our partner, we ensure you receive all the benefits outlined in this guide, along with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Clear and inspiring communication.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Quick replies to questions and concerns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Planning for future strategies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Adapting work according to feedback.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Honesty and transparency in every interaction.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Efficiency that values our time and resources.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our significant Enterprise SEO strategies for large-scale success cover the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technical SEO</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Link building</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content marketing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create more quality content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO workflow</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Backlink strategy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this guide, we attempted to explain to you ‘How SEO Agencies Can Deliver Value to Enterprise Clients’. All these benefits, we hope, will urge you to turn to our Enterprise SEO services to attain your ultimate objectives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you’re wondering whether Enterprise SEO is right for your company, don’t hesitate to connect with our experts, who make us the trusted <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">Digital Marketing Agency</a>.</strong> They’ll answer your questions and provide tailored advice if needed. Moreover, you can discuss your goals or project requirements to explore how our solutions can help.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-the-difference-between-graphic-design-and-ux-and-ui-design/\">What Is the Difference Between Graphic Design and UX and UI Design?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-become-a-social-media-manager/\">How to Become a Social Media Manager?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-build-your-social-media-marketing-strategy/\">How to Build Your Social Media Marketing Strategy?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What are enterprise SEO services?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Technical operations, improving on-site components for continuous better web page performance, keyword identification, optimizing content, link building, etc., are the principle services offered by enterprise SEO services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. How enterprise SEO will help your business?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Imagine you have a busy workload. Still, the hectic demands are depriving you or your staff of focusing on the actual SEO efforts, leading to confusion and overwork in managing things. Outsourcing enterprise SEO can help alleviate this burden, and along with that, you get expert guidance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. What is the pricing structure for SEO services?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Pricing structures of each SEO agency can vary based on the scope and complexity of services offered. You may check out our SEO packages available on the Digital Marketing Services page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. What is the difference between enterprise SEO and local SEO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4</strong>. Local SEO gives consumers the desired information when they want it. Without a website, local SEO assists your company in expanding and generating more online leads-driven traffic. Corporate SEO is a deliberate, broad method of search engine optimization.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-SEO-Agencies-Can-Deliver-Value-to-Enterprise-Clients-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-15 07:48:03','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(93,'How to Build Your Social Media Marketing Strategy?','how-to-build-your-social-media-marketing-strategy','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you make an excellent <strong>social media marketing strategy</strong>, you should focus on reaching your goals and keeping your audience interested. And you can only do that if you have a clear head and are ready to learn new things to make every social media plan work. Remember that one person can\'t just put this plan together; it needs creative ideas from everyone, whether they come up with them on their own or are inspired by reading and studying. The <strong>social media strategy </strong>must also solve problems and be attractive to win over the audience quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But before you look at the steps to build a social media marketing plan, you should know what social media marketing is and why it\'s essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Social Media Marketing?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media marketing uses social media—the platforms on which consumers create social networks and distribute information—to develop a company\'s brand, boost sales, and drive website traffic. Furthermore, SMM allows businesses to connect with new customers and keep in touch with old ones, but it also has built-in data analytics that helps marketers see how well their efforts are working and find even more ways to connect.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Steps to Build Social Media Strategy</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media has developed into a vibrant economy by linking billions of people globally. It\'s a wealth of possibilities for companies if you can adequately negotiate them. Diving in without a plan is like sailing without a compass. Therefore, follow this step-by-step guide:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 1: Clearly state your objectives.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clearly state your goals before you publish anything. Do you want to raise brand recognition, improve website traffic, or enhance sales? Moreover, creating particular, quantifiable, reasonable, pertinent, and time-bound (SMART) goals helps direct your work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understand with an example:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Growth: </strong>Within three months, raise Instagram followers by twenty percent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Engagement: </strong>By quarter\'s end, find yourself with a 10% Facebook engagement rate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well-defined goals will be your lighthouse, ensuring every campaign and article supports your aims.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 2: Know your readership</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you don\'t know about the audience you’re targeting, your content won\'t appeal. Therefore, investigate audiences carefully to find:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Demographics: </strong>Age, gender, locality, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Interests: </strong>Values, tastes, and pastimes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Behavior: </strong>What kind of content do they interact with when engaged online?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Get data using Google Analytics, social media insights, and surveys. Consequently, you can better customize your plan the more you know.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step: 3 Select appropriate platforms.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not every social media network was developed equally. Every platform serves diverse uses and fits different groups. As follows:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Facebook is great for sharing varied material and creating communities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram is ideal for visual narrative via photographs and videos.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>LinkedIn is best for professional involvement and B2B networking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being everywhere at once will cause you to get stretched thin. Thus, pay close attention to sites your target market visits most often.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 4: Create interesting content</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any social media plan\'s foundation is content. Emphasize producing excellent, worthwhile, and exciting content to stand out. Moreover, combining your content types will help to keep your viewers intrigued:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Share instructional advice, tools, or lessons.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Post inspirational movies, success stories, or quotations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For entertainment purposes use memes, challenges, or relevant stories.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Highlight your goods or services, but keep it understated and balanced.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recall that images are what social media feeds on. As a result, invest in short-form movies, good photography, and striking graphics to immediately draw attention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 5: create a content calendar.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media marketing requires consistency. By helping you to prepare and plan, a content calendar guarantees a consistent flow of updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your calendar ought to show:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Date and time posting details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Post layouts include photos, videos, carousels, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hashtags and captions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tools abound to simplify scheduling: Buffer, Hootsuite, Later, etc. Your schedule will be orderly, so you will never miss a chance to interact with your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 6: Make use of insights and analytics.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data cannot be lied to. Track your campaigns\' and post\'s performance with analytics. Vital benchmarks to track are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Engagement rate:</strong> Likes, comments, shares, and clicks define an engagement rate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reach and impressions: </strong>Your content was seen by how many?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Conversations: </strong>How many people registered or made purchases—desired activities?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social sites like Facebook Insights, Instagram Analytics, and LinkedIn Analytics offer detailed reports. Knowing what works and what doesn\'t can help you adjust your approach for better outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 7: Involve Your Readers</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media is about talking, not only about broadcasting. To create authentic relationships, respond to comments, address inquiries, and participate in debates. Additionally, accepting comments from your audience demonstrates that you care and promotes loyalty and trust.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quick tips include surveys, Q&amp;A sessions, or user-generated content initiatives to promote involvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 8: Add Paid Advertising.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although natural reach is essential, sponsored social media advertising will help your efforts be more enhanced. Similarly, most systems include sophisticated targeting choices to guarantee your adverts find the appropriate audience. Try:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strengthened posts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advertising on a carousel.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TV commercials.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Projects for lead generation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Start small; track the results; then, depending on performance, scale.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 9: work with influencers.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One efficient approach to increase your profile is influencer marketing. Working with reputable leaders in your field will help your brand be more widely known. Therefore, select influencers with actual involvement and who share your ideals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencer relationships may provide notable outcomes involving a co-branded giveaway, sponsored article, or product review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Step 10: Stay updated and adaptable.</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Algorithms and trends in social media are constantly shifting. Six months ago, something worked; now it might not be. Keep yourself updated on the most recent changes and be ready to modify your plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, to keep your approach current and relevant, follow industry blogs and webinars and recreate with new features like Instagram\'s Threads or TikHub Shop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Final Thoughts</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating a winning social media marketing strategy is an adventure rather than a destination. Thus, establishing clear goals, knowing your audience, and producing interesting content can help you develop a plan that satisfies your needs and strengthens close ties with your readers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our specialty is assisting companies to improve their social media game. Our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">SMO Services</a></strong> are here to help you throughout the process, regardless of your starting knowledge or desire to improve your current plan. So, are you ready to change your social media profile? Let\'s get in touch and help your business to shine online!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-the-difference-between-graphic-design-and-ux-and-ui-design/\">What Is the Difference Between Graphic Design and UX and UI Design?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-become-a-social-media-manager/\">How to Become a Social Media Manager?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-to-Build-Your-Social-Media-Marketing-Strategy.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-14 06:27:23','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(94,'How to Become a Social Media Manager?','how-to-become-a-social-media-manager','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the rise in social media marketing jobs, it is essential to have prior knowledge and practical experience to become a social media manager. Handling a social media account for work or a business is very different from handling your account. An excellent social media manager knows about the latest platforms, trends, and tools that help them plan posts, keep an eye on data, and more. Working in social media means being open to learning new things and changing with the times. It can also lead to more business possibilities.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To answer your query—How do I become a social media manager?—we have covered the important steps required to succeed in this role in this blog.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What\'s a Social Media Manager?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A social media manager is a professional responsible for representing a company\'s viewpoint across various social platforms across the internet. Creating content and reacting to comments are responsibilities that fall under their purview. When it comes to their assigned organization, Social Media Managers are constantly on the lookout for possibilities to boost brand awareness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What Does a Social Media Manager Do?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your responsibilities may include the following if you are interested in working as a social media manager:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Increasing the number of followers and boosting engagement: </strong>Raise a brand\'s visibility across all social media channels by encouraging more interaction with posts through likes, comments, and shares. You could be required to develop both textual and graphic postings to accomplish both goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Content and campaign strategy: </strong>In this role, your task can be developing and, on occasion, implementing social media marketing initiatives that support the overarching goals of a company\'s marketing strategy. In addition, you can reuse user-generated content or develop ideas for current and timeless content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data analysis: </strong>In addition to working creatively, you will also spend time analyzing data to determine the performance of a company\'s postings and content. One example is social listening, which involves keeping tabs on customer and rival reviews posted via social media.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Reporting metrics to key stakeholders:</strong> You can be asked to tell about your accomplishments—or any issues that develop—to your marketing team and even the company\'s stakeholders since companies want to know your work has an impact. They will likely track various measures, including your ability to gain followers, boost engagement, and create engaging content and campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Posting and monitoring social media sites: </strong>The number of social media channels that fall within your purview may vary according to the size of your team. Then, you should consider scheduling content and seeing how your following react. Responding to followers\' comments and messages is another potential responsibility of yours.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Maintain cohesion of the brand: </strong>Check that all of the company\'s written and digital content uses the same tone and voice. Also, you need to ensure that everything associated with the brand represents the organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Get Started as a Social Media Manager?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To make it easy for you, here are some simple yet important steps on<strong> how to be a social media manager</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Develop Crucial Skills</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a subset of marketing, social media management calls for pertinent industry knowledge, including project management, organization, effective copywriting, flexibility, and the capacity to operate alone and within a larger team.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So think over your own experience level and skill set. Are there areas where you might improve your skills to fit the requirements of a social media manager? There are several alternatives to gain marketing skills even if you\'re interested in becoming a social media manager without experience, for instance, online certificate courses or educational videos on YouTube.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Understand Marketing Analytics</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s time to learn more about social media sites and how they work once you have a good background in general marketing. Before becoming a social media manager, you must know the leading platforms\' pros and cons. These include Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, Twitter, YouTube, and Pinterest. Learn how to use the tools on each site for things like social listening, analytics, organizing and posting content, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Gain Work Experience</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Real-world scenarios are a great approach to practice social media management. Therefore, start by applying for internships or finding small businesses or NGOs that require social media managers. Depending on your comfort level, you may work for free while learning or charge clients as a freelancer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Creating Impressive Portfolio</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you decide to work as a freelancer or a full time employee, your portfolio is the best way to highlight your social media management knowledge. Here\'s how you may create a portfolio capable of impressing employers or potential clients:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Introduce yourself and briefly describe your experience.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide an overview of your best content.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide an overview of three or four projects that highlight your expertise.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include engaging visuals to make them stand out.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Showcase how your social media projects perform through analytics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Explain how you develop strategic ideas.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add client testimonials if possible.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>List your strengths and services.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember that your portfolio need not be professional. Also, passion projects and side ventures may be exciting and valuable ways to learn social media management. Therefore, when you start applying for jobs, ensure you know how to construct a CV showing your new talents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> Offer Best Services to Attract Clients</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you\'re ready to become a social media manager, being able to market yourself as a personal brand will help potential clients and companies understand how you can sell their goods or services. It would help if you tailor your resume to different jobs, including projects related to the ones you\'re looking for. You can also make your CV stand out by focusing on the most critical skills for the job.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Become a Social Media Manager Without a Degree?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the correct actions, one may naturally become a social media manager without a degree.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with perfecting essential tools including social media networks, analytics dashboards, and scheduling applications. Through free or reasonably priced online courses available on sites like Coursera or Udemy, learn the foundations of copywriting, graphic design, and content development. You can also participate in online groups, attend webinars, and network with digital marketers. For instance, LinkedIn and other sites let you highlight your experience and land employment prospects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, keep up with the trends. Rapid changes in social media mean monitoring industry blogs and engaging in pertinent debates to stay competitive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Top Social Media Management Courses Online</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, here are some top online courses of social media management you can take up:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta Social Media Marketing -&nbsp; Coursera</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Social Media Management -&nbsp; Coursera</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Social Media Marketing Certification Course - HubSpot Academy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The Social Media Marketing &amp; Management Masterclass 2024 - Udemy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Final Thoughts</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hope our blog on “How to Get Started as a Social Media Manager” has answered your queries and provided you with practical solutions. We’ve covered all the essential aspects you need to focus on to kickstart your journey as a social media manager.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, if you’re looking for <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">SMO services</a></strong> for your brand, reach out to us. Our expert SMO team, comprising skilled professionals offers comprehensive marketing solutions for social media platforms like Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and more. Whether it’s building your online brand reputation or driving results through influencer marketing, we’re here to deliver exceptional results with our customized solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-the-difference-between-graphic-design-and-ux-and-ui-design/\">What Is the Difference Between Graphic Design and UX and UI Design?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-analytics-benchmarking-metrics/\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/How-to-Become-a-Social-Media-Manager.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-13 11:34:54','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(95,'What Is the Difference Between Graphic Design and UX and UI Design?','what-is-the-difference-between-graphic-design-and-ux-and-ui-design','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The field of design is incredibly vast, requiring creativity, technical skills, and a knack for problem-solving. Among the most commonly confused terms are graphic design and UX and UI design. It’s fascinating to note that the Global Graphic Design market size is USD 49125.2 million. Consequently, interest in UI and UX design is also increasing among aspiring professionals because of the growing demand for user-friendly digital experiences.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, when we talk about “What is UX graphic design”? Though they overlap in some respects, UX (user experience) design and graphic design are separate design disciplines with different focuses and goals. Continue reading to understand the differences more clearly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Graphic Design?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Graphic design is the skill of using images to get a word across to people. It\'s a creative process that uses both art and technology to get its point across. Focusing on both looks and usefulness, graphic designers try to improve the graphic design user experience<strong> </strong>by ensuring that their work is exciting and straightforward to understand. Moreover, images, text, color, and other visual aspects are used to make content that can be found in different formats.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Role of a Graphic Designer</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Graphic designers tell visual stories. Their main objective is to convey a brand\'s message properly through typography, color, images, and layout.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Important duties:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Designing logos, banners, pamphlets, and ads comes under crucial responsibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, building images for marketing campaigns, packaging, and websites.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Similarly, guaranteeing uniformity in branding on all media.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Working with clients to grasp their concepts and convert them into visual designs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To add, graphic designers, to realize their creative ideas, use InDesign, Illustrator, and Photoshop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is UX Design?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When someone uses a product or service, their experience, or UX, is what they go through. User experience design, or UX design, makes goods or services that give people crucial experiences. Additionally, it includes branding, usability, function, and design, among other things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4288,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-10.png\" alt=\"UX design\" class=\"wp-image-4288\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Role of a UX Designer</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A UX designer guarantees a good user experience and efficient meeting of user demands for a product. Though aesthetics still play a part, unlike graphic designers, UX designers prioritize function over form.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Important duties:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conducting user research to grasp audience wants and behavior.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Prototyping and designing user flows and wireframes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, testing designs through usability testing and feedback.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, they work with developers and stakeholders to carry out ideas.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, UX designers aim to create a product that is user-friendly and easy to use so that consumers may reach their objectives with minimum effort.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is UI Design?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Emphasizing appearance or style, user interface (UI) design is the method designers use to create interfaces in software or digital devices. Interfaces should be created by designers so that people find them pleasing and easy to use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4289,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-11.png\" alt=\" user interface (UI) design\" class=\"wp-image-4289\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Role of a UI Designer</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A UI designer closely collaborates with UX designers to turn practical needs into aesthetically pleasing interfaces. Also, they guarantee that every section on the screen complements the general design language of the product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Important duties:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firstly, creating aesthetically pleasing software, applications, and website user interfaces.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, choosing buttons, typeface, and color palettes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, guaranteeing harmony in design aspects on every screen.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Finally, working with developers help to apply ideas properly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>UI designers frequently rely on technologies such as Figma, Sketch, and Adobe XD to construct and polish their ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Difference Between Graphic Design and UI/UX Design</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though all three professions call for design knowledge and creativity, their goals and methods vary greatly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Aspects</strong></td><td><strong>Graphic Design</strong></td><td><strong>UX Design</strong></td><td><strong>UI Design</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Focus</td><td>Visual communication and branding.</td><td>Meanwhile, enhancing user experience and solving user problems.</td><td>Designing visually appealing and interactive interfaces.</td></tr><tr><td>Outcome</td><td>Static designs like posters, logos, and ads.</td><td>On the other hand, user-friendly product experiences.</td><td>Interactive, visually engaging digital designs.</td></tr><tr><td>Tools Used</td><td>Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign.</td><td>Similarly, Figma, Axure, Miro.</td><td>Likewise, Figma, Sketch, Adobe XD.</td></tr><tr><td>Primary Skills</td><td>Creativity, color theory, typography.</td><td>User research, problem-solving, prototyping.</td><td>Visual design, interactivity, typography.</td></tr><tr><td>Interaction with Users</td><td>Minimal user interaction.</td><td>Focuses on user needs and feedback.</td><td>In addition, Designs user-facing elements.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Which Role is Better for You?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing between graphic design and UX and UI design depends on your skills, interests, and career goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Graphic Design: </strong>If you like dealing with branding, are driven to generate images, and have a creative bent, this sector is perfect. Additionally, those who want to concentrate on visual narrative and aesthetics may find this work appropriate.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>UX Design:</strong> If you appreciate knowing user behavior, problem-solving, and improving the user-friendliness of products/services, this one is ideal. For people who are analytical but also creative, it fits nicely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>UI Design:</strong> Furthermore, UI design works great for those that enjoy combining utility with design. UI design may be your calling if you have an eye for detail and like building exciting interfaces.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although graphic design, UX design, and UI design seem similar initially, they serve various facets of the design process. UX design stresses user experience, graphic design concentrates on visual appeal, and UI design closes the distance with interactive interfaces.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, knowing these variations may help you decide which route fits your interests and talents if you\'re considering a career in design. Also, whichever role you decide on, each of these fields has fascinating chances for development, creativity, and meaningful influence.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you’re searching for <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/graphic-design-services\">Graphic Design Services</a> for your projects, branding, marketing, or any other requirements, we are here to help. Our expert team offers creative, professional, and reliable services at affordable rates. Hence, share your needs with us, and we’ll ensure to bring your ideas to life and make them perfect for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium/\">Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"http://Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. Is graphic design and UI/UX design the same?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>UI/UX designers tend to consider how a product works with the customer as a whole, while graphic designers focus on different parts of visual design. A lot of the time, graphic design is only one part of the customer experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. Can a graphic designer become a UI/UX designer?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Yes, but it\'s not an impossible goal. People who work as graphic designers already know how to design things; they must brush up on their UX design skills.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. Which is better, UI or UX designer?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>UX Design is something you should consider if you like graphic design, interaction design, visual design, or user-centered design. In contrast, UI design is something you should consider if you\'re more interested in fixing problems, understanding how people use products, and building them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. Does UI/UX require coding?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>You don\'t have to code to be a UI and UX designer, but that doesn\'t mean you shouldn\'t learn coding to upgrade your skills. While it\'s fine to focus only on design, knowing how to code as a creator can be very helpful.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/What-Is-the-Difference-Between-Graphic-Design-and-UX-and-UI-Design.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-10 08:13:51','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(96,'Top 10 Duplicate Content Checker Tools (Free + Premium)','top-10-duplicate-content-checker-tools-free-premium','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether your business owner, marketer, or blogger, creating original content is crucial for audience confidence and SEO success. Duplicate content comprises search engine results in addition to running afoul of plagiarism allegations. Here, a <strong>duplicacy checker</strong> becomes really essential. These technologies safeguard the integrity of your content by pointing out possible overlaps and guaranteeing uniqueness. Fortunately, there are several free and paid duplicate content checkers available to save you effort. Let\'s explore the top 10 tools you should give thought to keep the originality of your work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Copyscape (Free and Premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Copyscape offers both free and premium services. Among the most often used <strong>content duplicacy checkers </strong>available in the market is Copyscape. Its simple interface lets you copy text or scan published web pages to find duplicates throughout the internet. For companies that need bulk-checking, the premium edition provides deeper scanning and API connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4270,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-2-1024x524.png\" alt=\"Copyscape\" class=\"wp-image-4270\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Copyscape Premium Pricing:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>$4.95 per month for up to 10 pages.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>$0.25 per month for each additional page (up to 500 pages).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Siteliner (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Siteliner is a <strong>web page duplicate content checker. </strong>It will search your website for duplicate pages that are contained inside its domain. It is made available by the developers of Copyscape, which is a well-known search engine that detects instances of plagiarism and duplicate material.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Even though this service is free, it can only look over up to 250 pages per month.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It also has a special package that is easy on the wallet and lets site owners scan up to 25,000 pages for just one cent each.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Grammarly (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Grammarly is mostly known as a grammar checker, but the paid version comes with a strong tool for finding plagiarism. It checks your work against billions of web pages and academic sources to make sure it is unique.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4271,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-3-1024x370.png\" alt=\"Grammarly \" class=\"wp-image-4271\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Grammarly Free offers just a grammar checker, a spell checker, and a punctuation checker.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Grammarly Premium, i.e., Monthly Plan: $30 and Annual Plan: $144, offers plagiarism checker, an AI-powered writing assistant, and several other features writers might find useful.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Quetext (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deep search technology by Quettext examines your text to find plagiarism and artificial intelligence, fix writing problems, and provide easily available citations. Also, writing without it is not something you would want.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4269,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-1-1024x372.png\" alt=\"Quetext\" class=\"wp-image-4269\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Quetext is free for users to checks of up to 2,500 words,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>However, the Pro Plan of Quetext costs $9.99/user/month for checks of up to 100,000 words. Also, you get additional features like DeepSearch™ technology for enhanced accuracy, citation assistance for academic work, and detailed plagiarism reports with highlighted matches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">DupliChecker (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For students and casual content creators, DupliChecker is a valuable tool as it finds a mix between simplicity of use and thorough plagiarism detection. Its free plan, easy-to-use design, and rigorous reporting help to ensure the uniqueness of written work by means of which it is accessible and successful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4268,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-1024x430.png\" alt=\"DupliChecker\" class=\"wp-image-4268\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Free plan of Duplichecker offers limited checks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The Paid plans of Duplichecker start from $5/month.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Plagiarism Checker X&nbsp; (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Plagiarism Checker X 2024, you can see if any of your study papers, blogs, projects, or websites are plagiarized. Check how close two pieces of content are in just a few seconds with better speed and accuracy. It works with Windows 11, 10, 8, 7, and Vista.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4273,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-4-1024x450.png\" alt=\"Plagiarism Checker X\" class=\"wp-image-4273\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Free Version: </strong>There is no limit at all. There is no limit on how many times you can check for plagiarism with Plagiarism Checker X, whether you use the \"free version\" or the paid version.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Professional:</strong> A one-user license costing $39.95 offers built-in word/PDF compatibility, text comparison, online similarity check, and unlimited words.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Business:</strong> And $147.95 for a five-user license with all the qualities of the Professional version.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">SmallSEOTools Plagiarism Checker (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The SmallSEOTools duplicate checker looks for possible plagiarism by comparing the text you provide against a collection of online sources. It’s an excellent tool for an <strong>SEO check duplicate content</strong> review, ensuring originality before publishing. Students can use it to verify the authenticity of their work, while teachers can rely on it to ensure their students\' submissions are plagiarism-free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4274,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-5-1024x445.png\" alt=\"SmallSEOTools Plagiarism Checker\" class=\"wp-image-4274\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SmallSEOTools lets you check for plagiarism for free, but only for 1,000 words at a time. You can run more than one check, but to share more than one file, you will need to complete a CAPTCHA.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Pro Version: </strong>$14.80/Monthly, $9.80/Month (Billed Yearly).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Unicheck &nbsp; (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Especially for academic institutions\' expert writers, Unicheck is a potent and flexible plagiarism-detecting tool. Its sophisticated features, all-around capabilities, and simplicity of use make it a necessary protection for preserving academic integrity and guaranteeing the originality of written work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4275,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-6-1024x503.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4275\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Customized pricing for educational institutions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Paid personal plans begin at $15 per month.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Copyleaks&nbsp; (free and premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Copyleaks provides plagiarism-checking features in addition to AI detection. You may test an online plagiarism detector free by enrolling for a Copyleaks account. Copyleaks can scan English, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Arabic, Russian, German, Greek, Chinese, and Japanese among other more than 100 languages. However, remember that scanning will only be conducted in the same language you provide the content in.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4276,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-7-1024x509.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4276\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>personalized pricing for companies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Individual paid plans starting at $19/month.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">PlagScan ( premium)</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>PlagScan is an online plagiarism detection tool that compares uploaded text to various databases to identify potential matches. It offers a flexible interface, detailed reports, a side-by-side view, and support for all common file formats, allowing users to control reporting, verification results, and source lists.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4278,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-8-1024x508.png\" alt=\"PlagScan\" class=\"wp-image-4278\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pricing Details:</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PlagScan offers free trials for both students and organizations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For the paid version, Plagcan charges a price starting from $5.99.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Choose the Right Duplicate Content Checker Tool?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When choosing the right duplicate checker tool, consider factors such as what you expect from the tool, whether a premium option is necessary, or if the free version meets your needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Requirement: </strong>What kind of text do you need to watch? It might be enough to use a free tool to check small pieces of text. But if you need to check big files or more than one language, you might need to pay for a tool with more advanced features.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Budget: </strong>What will you pay for a duplicate content checker? Tools come at various prices. Compare prices before buying.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Workflow: </strong>What do you mean to do with the duplichecker tool? You might want to choose a tool with a payment plan if you need to check content often.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These Duplicate Content Checkers are among the best and can help you verify whether the content is copied from other sources or not. Knowing this is crucial because plagiarized content can not only negatively impact search rankings but also harm the reputation and quality of your content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Having a strong commitment to originality, our content writers focus on both quality and marketing the content effectively to help your business grow and thrive. Opt for our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing\">Content Marketing Services</a> </strong>to eliminate the worry of plagiarized content. We will provide you with high-quality content with originality and impeccable accuracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-analytics-benchmarking-metrics/\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Top-10-Duplicate-Content-Checker-Tools-Free-Premium.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2025-01-07 13:15:00','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(97,'Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics','google-analytics-benchmarking-metrics','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using a helpful benchmarking tool, Google Analytics allows you to evaluate your website in relation to Google\'s performance standards. In the Google Analytics property, you have access to, you can enable and adjust this tool if you are interested in knowing whether your website is above or below the average for benchmarking measures. This feature was first introduced in 2014 by Google to help anyone compare and improve strategies. Consequently,<strong> Google Analytics benchmarks by industry</strong> are vital for understanding relative performance and refining digital marketing efforts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unaware how you can track and compare your performance with Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics? This blog will help you understand how benchmarking in GA4 can help your business perform better, how to use it, and much more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GA4 industry benchmark can help you as an essential reference point to know what’s happening with your competitors and how your performance compares</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Aggregate benchmark data only becomes available when minimum thresholds are reached.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Benchmarks give relevant comparisons based on data from similar companies in your sector.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, daily benchmark data allows you to make daily comparisons of metrics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Benchmarking in Google Analytics?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Benchmarking in Google Analytics is a feature you can use to compare your data with aggregated industry statistics from other businesses who contribute their data. Having this information gives you significant context, which enables you to establish relevant goals, receive insight into trends that are occurring throughout your business, and determine how well you are doing in comparison to your competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Google Analytics Benchmarks by Industry</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For companies monitoring their online performance, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) has revolutionized their approach. However, to grasp data, you must know how your measurements stack against industry standards.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, while sectors like banking or healthcare could have lower rates owing to more specialized content, businesses like eCommerce frequently have average bounce rates of 40-60%. Comparatively, conversion rates differ significantly; retail sites average about 2.8%, but travel and hospitality hover near 4%.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With added capabilities like cross-device tracking and event-based measurement, GA4 gives these comparisons depth. This lets companies better target marketing, probe user behavior, and increase return on investment. Aligning the performance of your website with <strong>GA4 industry benchmarks</strong> helps you to find areas for development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How To Use Google Analytics Benchmarks?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Finding Benchmarking</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sign in to your Google Analytics account and begin at the \"Home\" page. To find the measuring icon, look in the upper right part of the overview card. It seems like a small medal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To make sure your Google Analytics property is opted-in for benchmarking the functionality visible in your reports, Navigate to \" Admin\" and choose \"Account Details,\" which is under \"Account.\" After that, make sure the \"Modeling Contributions &amp; Business Insights\" option is turned on.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4258,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Untitled-design-32-1024x577.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4258\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Selecting a Metric</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, you\'ll need to add the benchmark measure to the overview card to get the measuring data. To do this, first choose one of the metrics on the card. Then, click \"Benchmarking\" to see all the available metrics.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4247} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/AD_4nXeyGK0Ke8uBH3oySZezTl4o-hTiDtnko6LVnTEfFacNhCahKowL4IeM9eBY3M8CicH0UuXIzHuz9IM6_JWjj8aFq9n_RkIzyISclZlYmlil-I1vW7aUbqwZdnUJP2tGl5vTjqGTAg.png\" alt=\"Google Analytics Benchmarking \" class=\"wp-image-4247\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Choosing a Benchmark Metric</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After selecting a benchmark metric, the chart will display benchmarking data. This shows how your website compares to the benchmark. Over 30 benchmark indicators are accessible in Google Analytics. Highlights include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For conversion-focused sites: User and session key event rates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users, average revenue, and ARPU for ecommerce websites</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To understand engagement: engagement rate, average session time, new user rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Understanding Benchmark Data</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you choose the \"Engagement Rate\" benchmark measure, the chart will show the performance of your website relative to the benchmark. However, if you select the \"Engagement Rate\" benchmark metric, the chart will illustrate your website\'s relative performance to the benchmark.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Changing Peer Groups</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Click the benchmarking icon to change the comparison by selecting another peer group. This allows you to evaluate the performance of your website according to several industry verticals. If your website falls into several categories, you might discover that changing peer groups reveals any variations in the benchmark statistic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Google Analytics Benchmarking Metrics Example</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Benchmarking is essential to know your site\'s performance when utilizing Google Analytics. For instance, if you manage an eCommerce site, you may compare your average session length or conversion rate with industry averages. Assume your sector\'s typical conversion rate is 2%, but you are hitting 3%. That is a favorable sign. Another relevant example is the bounce rate; if the bounce rate of your website is more than 50%, it might indicate problems with interaction.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Analytics Benchmarking, especially <strong>GA4 industry benchmarks</strong>, is an invaluable tool for elevating your digital strategy. Understanding your important KPIs and matching your performance to industry norms can help our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/seo-services\"><strong>SEO service</strong></a> identify areas for development, create reasonable targets, and adjust your website and marketing campaigns. Therefore, get in touch with us today if you want assistance using these insights to increase your online profile!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What metrics can I benchmark?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Metrics you can benchmark include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>New user rate&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average engagement time per session&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average engagement time per user&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Event count per user&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Engagement rate&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bounce rate&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Daily active users / Monthly active users (DAU / MAU)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Daily active users / Weekly active users (DAU / WAU)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Weekly active users / Monthly active users (WAU / MAU)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average revenue per user (ARPU)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average revenue per paying user (ARPPU)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First-time purchaser rate (FTP rate)&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sessions per user&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Active users&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pageviews&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conversions&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add to carts per user</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Checkouts per user</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Total ad revenue per user</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Transactions per purchaser, and&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Transactions per user</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. How does Google benchmark work?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Google Benchmark compares your website\'s performance with those of similar companies. Therefore, you can easily monitor site performance, user experience, and mobile friendliness, etc., thereby enabling companies to know the areas that require work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. What is the most important metric in Google Analytics?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Among the most fundamental yet crucial measurements available in Google Analytics 4 would be \"The Users metric.\" It counts the distinct visitors your website attracted during a designated period.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. What is a good engagement rate in Google Analytics 4?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> Google Analytics 4 defines a healthy engagement rate of about 50–60% among all firms. According to LinkedIn Ads benchmark statistics, businesses view a decent monthly engagement rate of about 600.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/youtube-keyword-research-in-2025-everything-you-need-to-know/\">YouTube Keyword Research in 2025: Everything You Need to Know</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-5-on-page-seo-techniques-for-2025/\">Top 5 On-Page SEO Techniques for 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Google-Analytics-Benchmarking-Metrices.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-31 08:24:01','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(98,'YouTube Keyword Research in 2025: Everything You Need to Know','youtube-keyword-research-in-2025-everything-you-need-to-know','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>This blog explores how creators on YouTube can boost their reach and engagement through comprehensive YouTube Keyword Research, factors important to consider when researching high search volume YouTube keywords, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Key Takeaways</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Factors like search volume, competition, and relevance matter a lot when conducting keyword research for YouTube.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>YouTube keyword research tools like TubeBuddy, VidIQ, and Ahrefs help in finding keyword searches and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keep a keen eye on competitors\' keywords to ensure you don’t fall behind.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use YouTube popular keywords so that it reaches a wider audience and improves your video’s visibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your videos are not performing well on YouTube, it may be because you are not including the right keywords and tags in your YouTube videos. Consider YouTube keywords not only as a way to optimize your content but as a tool to understand your audience better and improve engagement. Hence, if you’re on your way to learning <strong>how to find YouTube keyword search volume </strong>and make use of these to boost your video rankings, continue reading.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is YouTube Keyword Research?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube Keyword Research is an activity that involves searching for the right keywords that bring views and engagement. Often, it is done using tools like TubeBuddy, Ahrefs, and other keyword research tools. Moreover, researching <strong>keywords for YouTube</strong> is essential for those who are targeting a specific audience or niche.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Important Factors of YouTube Keyword Research</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may improve the ranking of your video on YouTube by selecting the appropriate keywords, both primary and secondary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Research on keywords needs to be done based on the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Search volume:</mark><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> </mark></strong>You should select keywords that have a high search volume since they will bring more audience to your video.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Competition:</mark> </strong>High-ranking keywords on YouTube have a low difficulty level.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Relevancy:</mark><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\"> </mark></strong>It is always preferable to choose keywords that are related to the information you are searching for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Primary keyword: </mark></strong>Choose a term that best describes the nature of your company and use that as your primary keyword.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Secondary Keyword:</mark> </strong>You should prioritize keywords that are really pertinent to the Primary keyword you are using.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, if you have a personal finance video, you can choose your primary keyword as “<em>personal finance tips</em>” and secondary keywords as “<em>budgeting basics</em>,” “<em>how to save money</em>,” and “<em>financial planning for beginners</em>.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How To Find Youtube Keyword Search Volume?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose YouTube tags or keywords for views that are relevant, popular, and specific to your content. Here’s how you can find YouTube keyword search volume:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube keyword search volume is a metric that showcases a keyword’s popularity and indicates whether you can use it in your content strategy to make it more discoverable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">&nbsp;</mark><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Use tools specifically for YouTube.</mark></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Designed for YouTube creators, tools like TubeBuddy and VidIQ offer an understanding of keyword search traffic. Thus, enter your keyword to see the degree of popularity and competitiveness these tools display. Additionally, these realizations will help you choose keywords with a decent mix of search volume and competitiveness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"> Google Videos Trends</mark></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Trends provides insightful information on subjects, including videos. Under the filter options, choose the \"YouTube Search\" option and enter your keyword to see over time changing interest in that phrase. However, if you are thinking about seasonal content or trendy subjects, this is quite useful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Third-Party Tools &amp; Keyword Planner</mark></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though mainly utilized for Google searches, Google Keyword Planner and other tools like Ahrefs may nevertheless offer an estimated search volume that often corresponds with YouTube trends. These programs also point out related terms you can use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some of <strong>YouTube’s Popular Keywords</strong> include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>ASMR</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lofi</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>NBA</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Andrew Tate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shakira</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ukraine</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some popular hashtags on YouTube include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>#YouTube, #Vlog, #Tutorial, #Music, #Funny, #DIY, #Travel, and #Fitness.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Do YouTube Keyword Tools Work?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube is not just about uploading videos; if it doesn’t give the audience what they want, it means you are just wasting your efforts. Thus, search for trending keywords, topics, and phrases that will help you optimize your videos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, to make this possible, YouTube keyword tools are essential, and for additional support, you can take assistance from our advertising and marketing professionals to maximize your earnings and reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some of the best YouTube keyword tools include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Trends</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TubeBuddy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>vidIQ</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keywordtool</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keywords Everywhere</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword Tool Dominator</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ahrefs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword Planner</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TubeRanker</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But how exactly do these tools work? Let’s look at TubeBuddy as an example.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TubeBuddy is widely used by creators. Here’s how TubeBuddy works:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>This tool helps you choose which phrases are worth focussing on by displaying search volumes and degrees of competitiveness for every keyword.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It also provides pertinent tags depending on your selected keyword, therefore maximizing your video for related searches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, every keyword has an SEO score assigned by TubeBuddy, which indicates it\'s possible to rank and helps you rank phrases that would improve the performance of your video.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, this tool reveals trending content in your niche by matching your keywords with those used by rivals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">YouTube AutoSuggest</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Like Google, YouTube features autocomplete, a tool that proposes just popular terms. Therefore, typing a keyword related to your niche will provide a list of ideas related to the term.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, if you type \"PPC Campaign,\" then you get suggestions like \"PPC Campaign Setup,\" and \"PPC Campaign Amazon.\" Note that YouTube autocomplete is best to look for long-tail keywords. See the example below:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfQ-oend_h1inNQHhWidEemgPvGLccR9vxP3osZQlQpLdC4e53nJnVQ-nWUv7YapWXt_YOK0rft8QpmiXHVyS4KcbxEs-N02T8VC7Nh82rH22jssuTkjroLh4ILK9drRXCDRDmr?key=JusDQ098ADBd9QYNpBvYhAi-\" alt=\"PPC Campaign Amazon\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Check Competitors\' Keywords</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you need to discover new profitable keywords or have run out of your most effective ones, studying your competitors\' campaigns is a great strategy. By analyzing the keywords used in their video titles, descriptions, and tags, you can understand what’s working for them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Firstly, when you go to a competitor\'s channel, click on the videos tab and then choose \"most popular\" to sort the videos. This is how you can get a list of the best videos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeSNPVoDJWGQEDAfwXWHoeDJq0ZZN9MVVu8u9j1ugm65fRqq7nIR4v87z_OjHpWvb-nJfdYWHeS1o4HV-twRNlyH0mLUOyGWNRZW3Mk_aLi8pNNjOxqmwSsgv02HI11kNvp8QLa2w?key=JusDQ098ADBd9QYNpBvYhAi-\" alt=\"click on the videos tab\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. Now, pick a video and look at the keywords that are used in its title and description.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXewrhgbdsLvbLAz6L7iIuHLnlO-dOMrknJIoyAsy2UK8uItQiYdEb1Oxc3Qx50Pajl0b7yHu3na2DkbCmSJKX0FiA34ErdITr6KAR9SzYOt8oyF4KNtKJCA9rHuNVXVq40ozfM?key=JusDQ098ADBd9QYNpBvYhAi-\" alt=\"click on the subscribe\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. You have a list of keywords that you can use to make the videos more relevant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. After that check the HTML page for the YouTube Video tags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5. Right-click on the page and choose \"view page source\" to look at the video tags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6. Type \"keywords\" into the search box (CTRL+F). The terms that show up next to \"keywords\" are the video tags that your competitor uses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7. You can also find your competitors\' video tags differently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>8. Install plugins for Chrome. This will let you see video tags on the page itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Leverage the Expertise of Professionals&nbsp;</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hope you find these techniques helpful in discovering top-ranking keywords. With over 15 years of experience in providing <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/youtube-advertising-services\"><strong>YouTube Advertising Services</strong></a>, our expertise also revolves around these strategies and beyond. So, if you’re looking for reliable support to boost your YouTube presence, reach out to us today. We’ll make sure you receive clear, informative answers to your queries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-become-a-digital-marketer-in-2025-a-comprehensive-guide/\">How to Become a Digital Marketer in 2025: A Comprehensive Guide</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024/\">Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/YouTube-Keyword-Research-in-2025-Everything-You-Need-to-Know-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-27 11:17:32','2026-06-01 11:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:27'),(99,'How to Become a Digital Marketer in 2025: A Comprehensive Guide','how-to-become-a-digital-marketer-in-2025-a-comprehensive-guide','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the advent of new technology and techniques, digital marketing has changed how companies interact with their consumers and presents an interesting career path for everyone. Right now is the ideal moment to start your journey into digital marketing in 2025. The terrain is always changing, so this guide will offer you complete information on <strong>how to become a digital marketer </strong>and develop the core skills.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Digital Marketing?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before learning how to become a digital marketer, one should consider the reasons for the professional worth of digital marketing. Digital marketing lets companies reach worldwide audiences more precisely, effectively, and quantitatively than they could have in past years. Demand for talented digital marketers has exploded as more companies use online channels. Also, digital marketing provides a broad spectrum of specialities that might fit your interests and abilities, whether your areas of interest are content development, social media, SEO, or paid advertising.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Understanding Digital Marketer\'s Core Skills</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding the fundamental abilities needed is the first step towards becoming a digital marketer. Digital marketing covers a range of fields with unique skill sets. But all digital marketers must possess certain rudimentary skills as well:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any digital marketer must be able to maximize content to rank highly on search engines. Hence, your firm basis in SEO will come from knowing how to leverage keywords, maximize on-page components, and create backlinks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In the digital sphere, content is king. Crucially, one must know how to provide interesting, educational, and excellent material that appeals to and keeps consumers. This covers blogs, social media materials, videos, infographics, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Digital marketing cannot function without platforms like Google Ads, Facebook Ads, and PPC (Pay-Per-Click) advertising. Thus, setting up, running, and maximizing sponsored ad campaigns can enable companies to create leads and reach a larger audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Excellent means of client connection include social media sites Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, and LinkedIn. Using these sites to increase a company\'s online visibility should be second nature to a digital marketer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Email marketing is still among the best means of contacting consumers, even though social media is becoming increasingly important. Knowledge of email list building and segmenting, message crafting, and outcome analysis is useful.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data drives decisions in digital marketing, and analytics and data interpretation help explain them. Analyzing performance indicators such as website traffic, conversion rates, and ROI can help a successful digital marketer home plans and enhance outcomes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Get the Essential Training</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although a degree in business, marketing, or communications can assist, it is not required to be a digital marketer. Developing the correct information and abilities is highly important when your focus is<strong> how to start digital marketing</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online courses, certificates, and materials abound to enable your learning of digital marketing. Numerous sites provide both free and paid training courses, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Covering a broad spectrum from search engines to social media and content marketing, Google provides a free course titled \"Fundamentals of Digital Marketing\".</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>HubSpot Academy provides free inbound marketing, email marketing, social media strategy, and SEO training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From prominent colleges and business leaders, Coursera and Udemy provide a vast array of digital marketing courses. From SEO to analytics and content marketing, you may learn about subjects all around.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube is a great free tool for learning, and many seasoned digital marketers publish advice and courses there.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Practical Experience is Essential.</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learning digital marketing better by doing it is how one should accomplish it. You should begin practicing once you have some theoretical understanding. These are some approaches to getting practical knowledge:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Launch Your Own Blog or Website. Practicing digital marketing is among the finest methods for learning about it. Create a blog or website, then use social networking, content marketing, and SEO techniques to increase your readership. This will clarify the difficulties companies have in digital marketing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Another approach to getting real-world experience is freelancing with digital marketing services on Upwork or Fiverr. Starting small, you may provide content development, social media management, or SEO optimization.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, many businesses now provide digital marketing internships. These give great Experience and a chance to get knowledge from seasoned experts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Volunteering to support a small business or non-profit group\'s digital marketing initiatives may also give helpful expertise. This allows you to oversee actual campaigns and witness your ideas come to pass.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Specialise in a Niche Within Digital Marketing</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although you should have a broad awareness of digital marketing, as your career develops, you would like to focus on a specific sector. Concentrating on one topic can help you to become an expert and demand more pay or consultation fees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among the quite common specialities in digital marketing are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An SEO specialist is someone who just works to raise the search engine results of a website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content Marketer. Someone who generates and oversees content to captivate consumers and boost conversion rates.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A PPC specialist is a marketer overseeing paid advertising campaigns across Google Ads and Facebook.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A social media manager is a professional who manages social media accounts and develops plans to boost interaction and follower count.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Create a Portfolio</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, the growing Experience calls for you to create a portfolio highlighting your efforts. This will help prospective companies or customers to view your skills and output capability. Additionally, your portfolio can comprise optimized websites, case studies, blog entries, and ad campaigns you oversaw.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Network and Create Your Brand</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Networking is quite an effective tactic in digital marketing. Attend trade shows, join internet groups, and make LinkedIn contacts with professionals. In addition to keeping you updated, networking might result in freelance work or employment prospects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building a personal brand is also vital in digital marketing. Share your observations and experiences on LinkedIn, Medium, or Twitter. Over time, you will become a thought leader in the field, which will open doors to fresh prospects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Final Thoughts</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By 2025, becoming a digital marketer is an exciting prospect with many employment options. Understanding the fundamental abilities, acquiring practical experience, keeping up with trends, and focusing on a niche can help you create a successful career in this always-changing industry. Whether your dream is to establish your own digital marketing firm, work as a freelancer, or just work for a corporation, the future of digital marketing is bright, and with the correct strategy, you may be part of this exciting and fulfilling sector.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Look up for our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\"><strong>digital marketing services</strong></a><strong> </strong>if you need to learn more about digital marketing, how it works, what it involves and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-50-digital-marketing-interview-questions-and-answers-for-2025/\">Top 50 Digital Marketing Interview Questions and Answers for 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide/\">Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-are-the-5-ps-of-marketing/\">What Are the 5 Ps of Marketing?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/How-to-Become-a-Digital-Marketer-in-2025-A-Comprehensive-Guide.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-26 05:30:47','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(100,'Google Rolls Out December Spam Update 2024','google-rolls-out-december-spam-update-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Google is once again in the spotlight with its December 2024 spam update. This update that affects all the languages of Google search is primarily based on hunting down sites that violate Google’s spam policies.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Does This Matters?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google announced the spam update on the 19th December, 2024 which will concern spam for the month of December, 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google states that this process will take about one week in total to complete.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any site being at odds with Google spam policies may see their ranking deteriorate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Websites can regain trust over time as Google\'s systems recognize compliance with their spam policies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Google Spam Update?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google spam update is a consistent change to the algorithm which helps decrease the chances of spam content appearing in search results. These changes improve search results by penalizing sites that cheat in order to get a higher rank. Sites that knocked their results through keyword tossing, cloaking, or employing content of inferior quality could possibly undergo equally remarkable change.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The last Google Spam update, before December spam update 2024, was in June, which rolled out on June 20, 2024, and completed on June 27, 2024.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Overview of Google December 2024 Spam Update</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A key element of these improvements is SpamBrain, Google’s AI-driven spam-prevention system. Periodically, Google refines this tool to better identify spam and adapt to emerging forms of spammy behavior. Such constant transformation helps to retain the strength of their systems in terms of providing optimum and superior search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the key measures for these updates relates to the use of an AI-based spam-prevention tool called SpamBrain, created by Google. Occasionally, Google redesigns this tool to enhance the ability to recognize spam and adapt to emerging forms of spammy behavior. It is made possible through continuous enhancement whose goal is to keep their systems adaptive to the task of providing quality search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdOjYblbFBwzqqmzApQ4koXxa7AqPQkispbQR4Ftg3y24t_fcuF6yClna0NWkCc-4wKBGRB9U2CyHJr2Pk3VjeP3vQoD47bWT64w-wCarMl0FzpIwYVYg4TO1xEKcy7Wkzg_j_s?key=FDq6GEdxlByxqkBZk1E8W-9a\" alt=\"Google spam update December 2024\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As mentioned, there are strict rules and policies concerning spam on Google, and any website found guilty of this is in serious trouble. Some of these sites may find themselves slipping a few places down the ranking; others may end up not even ranking on the results list. However, Google encourages site owners to address issues like insufficient content, as it can impact a site\'s ranking and overall user experience. Depending on the sincerity of the website owners who agreed to cooperate with their spam policies, it is possible to regain trust over several months and years since Google search engine robots are sensitive to such cooperation of websites.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-november-2024-core-algorithm-update/\">Google Rolls Out November 2024 Core Algorithm Update</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-50-digital-marketing-interview-questions-and-answers-for-2025/\">Top 50 Digital Marketing Interview Questions and Answers for 2025</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/essential-magento-2-commands-every-developer-should-know/\">Essential Magento 2 Commands Every Developer Should Know</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What’s Next?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Seventh Algorithm Update of 2024: </strong>This marks the seventh update this year, featuring four core updates and three spam updates in March, June, and December 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mixed Reactions: </strong>While some websites may benefit significantly, others might face challenges adapting to these updates.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Recovery is Possible: </strong>With consistent effort and adherence to Google\'s guidelines, sites can recover their rankings over time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Impact on Rankings:</strong> If you\'ve noticed fluctuations in your website\'s rankings, this latest spam update could be the cause.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To sum up, the December 2024 Google spam change indicates that SEO is constantly changing. Because of this, we advise digital marketers to be adaptable and know about the newest trends. In addition, businesses need to change their plans based on this new information. Believe it or not, this strategy is essential for bouncing back from Google\'s spam updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Google-Rolls-Out-December-Spam-Update-2024-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-21 07:03:37','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(101,'Top 50 Digital Marketing Interview Questions and Answers for 2025','top-50-digital-marketing-interview-questions-and-answers-for-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Getting ready for a digital marketing interview? This guide will help you increase and highlight your knowledge. Whether your career is just beginning or you want to advance, we have assembled the best <strong>50 digital marketing interview questions</strong> and answers to provide you with a significant advantage. Being current on industry trends, tools, and tactics is essential because technology is changing quickly. Explore these <strong>digital marketing interview questions for freshers</strong> or experienced to help you feel what you could run across in your next interview. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>50 Digital Marketing Interview Questions and Answers</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Digital Marketing Fundamentals</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. What do you understand about Digital Marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1.</strong> Digital marketing refers to the marketing of products and services available through web browsers, social networks, emails, and search engines. It uses data and technology to reach certain audiences based on factors like demographics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. How would you differentiate between direct marketing and branding?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Direct marketing aims to get an immediate response by concentrating on a particular product or call to action. On the other hand, branding contributes to building long-term familiarity and credibility among its target beneficiaries in achieving a company’s brand image and value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. What types of digital marketing methods are widely used in the industry?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Popular digital marketing methods include content marketing, email marketing, pay-per-click (PPC) advertising, affiliate marketing, SEO, and social media marketing. Every channel links with viewers in different, focused ways.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. Why do you think digital marketing has grown so much more compared to traditional offline methods?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> The flexibility, reach, and capacity to monitor and maximize digital marketing campaigns in real-time help explain its recent development. Plus, it is usually more affordable and lets companies interact directly with their target market online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.5. What are a few drawbacks of using digital marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.5. </strong>Digital marketing can be very saturated, has to evolve from time to time and systems, and requires a team of talented people. Privacy and data protection are also significant issues in marketing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.6. What is new with the trends in digital marketing this year?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.6. </strong>These are the most significant trends this year: artificial intelligence personalization, voice search, short-form video content, celebrity endorsements, and long-term branding. All of these trends stem from the changing nature of customers caused by new technologies emerging in the marketplace.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.7. Which digital marketing tools are most popular among professionals today?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.7. </strong>Famous resources include HubSpot for automation, Google Analytics for insights, SEMrush for SEO, and Canva for visuals. These instruments enable more precise and effective tracking, developing, and maximizing campaigns for marketers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.8. How would you go about categorizing the different aspects of digital marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.8. </strong>One may classify digital marketing as inbound, such as content marketing and outbound like PPC or display advertisements. Also, each of these groups offers individual phases of the client’s process and purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.9. Can you explain the four C\'s in the context of digital marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.9. </strong>Customer, Content, Context, and Conversation are the four C\'s. These Cs are mainly about knowing customers and creating the right content. Also, making sure it reaches the right audiences, and having deep conversations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.10. What typical pitfalls should marketers avoid in digital marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.10.</strong> Typical mistakes that can be avoided include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Skipping target audience research.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Depending too much on old tactics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Discounting data insights.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Overloading audiences with content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>SEO and Traffic Generation</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.11. What are the best ways to boost a website\'s traffic?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.11. </strong>To increase website visitors, it is important to aim on 3 important things, i.e., engaging content, targeted keywords, and regular SEO practices. Other things that can help are:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>email marketing,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>backlinks, and&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>social media.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.12. Can you explain the difference between on-page and off-page SEO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.12. </strong>On-page SEO includes improving aspects of the website itself, including: headers, meta tags, and content. On the other hand, off-page SEO emphasizes outside tactics: backlinks, to increase the website\'s authority and exposure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.13. What are the primary factors for local SEO that help in ranking locally?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.13. </strong>For good local SEO, emphasize maximizing Google My Business, obtaining local citations, and getting favorable customer reviews.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.14. How would you perform effective keyword research for a new campaign?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.14. </strong>The first step is to identify the target audience\'s interests and use tools like Google Keyword Planner to find relevant terms. After that, analyzing competitors\' keywords helps select high-impact, low-competition keywords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.15. Can you explain the term backlinks and its importance in SEO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.15. </strong>Any link from your site from another site that testifies that your site is reliable is a backlink. That is why you should have good backlinks because search engines will see that your site is useful. It will increase its score and, subsequently, increase its visibility on top search engine results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.16. Where do you turn/get information on what the current changes/updates with Google’s algorithm are?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.16. </strong>To be on the safer side, one has to continue reading Google news, that is, have to be updated with Google’s updates. It is also best to follow SEO blogs and attend webinars relevant to the business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.17. How would you use Google Analytics to analyze and enhance a site’s traffic?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.17.</strong> Google Analytics is more suitable for details such as the bounce rate, users, and traffic origin. These aspects facilitate observing the source of visitors and which page produces the best results.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.18. What’s the impact of voice search on SEO, and how would you optimize for it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.18.</strong> Voice search is all about natural language and local searches. To get the most out of local SEO, it will be right to focus on conversational keywords and, if organizing content, have straightforward answers to questions that would form the basis of voice search.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.19. What strategies would you use to make content both SEO-friendly and engaging?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.19. </strong>There are many strategies that can be applied. However, some of the best are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Adding relevant keywords,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>using headers and visuals to break up text, and&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>add engaging CTAs to keep readers interested.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.20. Why is mobile optimization so critical for SEO success?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.20. </strong>Nowadays, everyone uses a mobile phone or cell phone, so Google gives priority to sites with a mobile-friendly interface. This improves users\' experience, reduces bounce rates, and shows good results in search rankings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Social Media, Content Marketing, and Engagement</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.21. How do you create content that has the potential to go viral?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.21. </strong>Emphasize emotive storytelling, cover topical subjects, and include original insights to produce viral material. Furthermore, promoting sharing is appealing images and a relevant tone, which increases the likelihood of the material becoming popular.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.22. How would you structure a social media strategy for a brand?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.22. </strong>Every good social media plan must comprise goals, audience identification, chosen platforms, and content plan. These make the strategy periodically reviewable, and the changes made help achieve the best results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.23. Could you explain the key elements of a successful content marketing plan?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.23. </strong>There are five elements in a successful content marketing strategy: the creation of goals, audiences, contents, channels, and measurements. All the parts ensure that the content found is relevant, passed to the appropriate audience, and aligned with brand goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.24. What role does storytelling play in building brand identity?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.24. </strong>Storytelling humanizes a brand, allowing audiences to connect emotionally. When telling a real story, one can reveal values while making a brand credible, unique, and emotionally appealing to the audience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.25. How can visual content be used to improve social media engagement?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.25. </strong>The content, in the form of pictures, videos, and infographics make people catch their attention and relay messages swiftly. Also, they tame complex information and make the post more shareable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.26. What do you see as essential for growing a strong social media community?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.26. </strong>Assembling a social media community is a time-consuming and proactive process that demands that participants be reliable and have fundamental interactions. Caring for the followers, promoting the conversations, and producing the content that the target audiences might like will generate trust and interaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.27. How would you leverage user-generated content for brand promotion?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.27. </strong>The use of user-generated content increases the level of credibility because it is associated with customers\' usage. Here, they can share personal stories, images, and any reviews of experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.28. Can you explain why a content calendar is important and how to create one?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.28. </strong>A content schedule guarantees constant publication and effective resource planning. Create one by defining objectives, organizing topics, timing postings, and coordinating essential dates.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.29. How would you adapt content strategies for different social media platforms?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.29. </strong>Every single platform has its own set of customer expectations. Everyone needs to tone, style, and format content to reach their audience, such that you post short videos for TikTok, business-like posts for LinkedIn, and aesthetic stories for Instagram.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.30. What\'s your approach to measuring the effectiveness of content marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.30. </strong>Best approach to measure effectiveness is to focus on engagement, conversion rates, and traffic. The analysis is done relatively frequently to make corrections and monitor KPI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conversion Rate Optimisation (CRO) and Customer Experience</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.31. What steps would you take to increase a website’s conversion rates?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.31. </strong>If the conversion rate were to be increased, then it would be feasible to strengthen the usability, call to action, and social proof. Another is that implementing different page elements and optimizing the ‘page’ load time are also important ways of increasing conversion rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.32. Could you explain the concept of a conversion funnel?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.32. </strong>Now, a conversion funnel refers to the program that users pass through from when they know the product to when they decide to make the purchase. And it is divided into segments, like awareness, interest, desire, and action, to nudge users towards purchase<strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.33. How does UX design impact conversions, and what role does it play in CRO?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.33. </strong>In particular, UX design concerns users\' involvement with a specific site. Having an overall clean layout and design will undoubtedly benefit the visitors, making them more inclined to convert, while CRO will keep everything within a layout to help increase conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.34. What elements make a landing page effective at driving conversions?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.34. </strong>An effective landing page has a compelling headline, clear benefits, a strong call-to-action, and social proof. Therefore, simplicity and removing any possible source of distraction make the end user only concentrate on the conversion objective at hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.35. How do you optimize calls-to-action to encourage clicks?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.34. </strong>The use of action language, contrasting colors, and correct positioning of the buttons achieves the maximization of the Call to Action. It also allows us to see what phrases are more effective and which buttons look the best to the users.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.36. What’s the importance of A/B testing in CRO, and how would you approach it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.36. </strong>&nbsp;It runs different versions of a page simultaneously to see what causes better results. The aspects of the experiment include the headlines, some images, and call-to-action buttons by trying out different things and justifying every change using data analytics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.37. How does page load speed affect conversion rates, and what can be done to improve it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.37. </strong>Faster load speed improves the overall experience, causing fewer bounce rates and improving the conversion rates. Preventing images from loading by reshooting them to fit the screen size, using browser caching, and reducing how much code is used are some of the best ways to speed up the page\'s load times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.38. Could you discuss the role of trust signals in improving conversion rates?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.38. </strong>Customer reviews, certifications, and secure payment icons are some trust signs that ensure visitors feel comfortable with their decisions. It can be asserted that outstanding trust indicators increase conversion rates by enhancing credibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.39. How would you approach reducing bounce rates on a website’s key pages?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.39. </strong>To reduce bounce rates, one has to ensure they provide quality and related content and ensure downloads are fast and easy to find their way around. Good headings, great visuals, and an unproblematic design contribute to keeping people on the site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.40. What methods do you use to ensure a seamless and enjoyable user experience?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.40.</strong> The best in this situation are prioritizing intuitive navigation, mobile responsiveness, and clear CTAs. Such unified content, fast loading, and easy navigation result in a pleasant experience for each guest when dealing with the site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Analytics, Feedback, and Adaptation</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.41. What are the key metrics you focus on when evaluating digital marketing success?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.41. </strong>Conversion rate is the percentage of visitors who complete the intended action, CPC is the amount you pay per click, CTR represents the clicks per impression, and CAC is the amount you spend before acquiring a customer. At the same time, ROI reports the profit made from marketing investments. These give information on the campaign\'s effectiveness, the activities users are interested in, and the overall profitability of a campaign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.42. How would you interpret different traffic sources to gain insights into user behavior?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.42.</strong> In terms of understanding the traffic sources like organic, paid referral, and social, users’ interests and preferences, as well as engagement, ways can be found to improve the strategies and find out the best channel to convert the visitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.43. Can you explain customer lifetime value (CLV) and why it matters?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.43. </strong>CLV reflects the total profits a customer makes with a particular brand over their lifetime. It is essential for explaining customer commitments, directing retention management, and allocating resources to the best customer segments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.44. How would you go about creating a digital marketing dashboard to monitor performance?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.44. </strong>Before performing this task, it is correct to choose metrics linked with campaign objectives, incorporate analytics data into the work, and illustrate the findings with the help of graphics. This, in turn, creates a clear real-time visibility of performance to enable the right decisions to be made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.45. How do you analyze conversion rates across different digital marketing channels?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.45. </strong>To compare conversion rates for each of the channels requires factoring in the likelihood of the audience to convert, the type of content, and overall marketing campaign objectives. It helps determine the efficiency of the channels used in running the business to avoid areas that require enhancement to improve outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.46. How would you use feedback from customers to refine a digital strategy?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.46. </strong>This information is sourced from the customers and helps to identify the areas they find most painful or that they have the most preference for. From this feedback, recommendations, whether concerning content, user experience, or messages, can quickly be made with an attempt at aligning the content and message with the customer across the different touch points.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.47. How do you handle negative comments or feedback on social media?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.47.</strong> In this case, it is desirable to immediately and calmly state the issue and its solution. It also helps offend the customer, provides an apology, and shows the company is concerned with the customer and willing to do business with him/her regardless of the disgusting behavior.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.48. Could you discuss how predictive analytics can be applied to digital marketing?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.48. </strong>Descriptive analytics analyzes past data to provide trends. It can predict customer behaviors, improve ad relevance, and create content tailored to the latter’s preferences, which raises its conversion rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.49. What role do customer reviews play in shaping a brand’s online reputation?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.49. </strong>Customer feedback directs brand associations, affects SEO position, and fosters trust. Positive reviews bring in new customers; when responding to negative reviews, a brand reaffirms its reliability and dedication to change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.50. How would you address a social media or PR crisis and manage its impact?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.50. </strong>First, it will be best to acknowledge the issue and provide updates. Effective, emotionally insensitive remarks and appropriate remedial measures reduce the adverse impact, bring confidence, and shield the brand image.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In conclusion, these <strong>digital marketing interview questions and answers</strong> offer a well-rounded preparation guide, helping you stay updated with essential skills and industry trends. Moreover, one cannot underestimate the complexity of the digital space, but with our professional <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing services</a>, </strong>you shall be in a position to give your brand a boost with ideas on how to capture the audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\">Also Read:</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/what-is-google-data-studio-and-how-to-create-a-report-on-it/\">What is Looker Studio (Formerly Google Data Studio) and How to Create a Report On It?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-november-2024-core-algorithm-update/\">Google Rolls Out November 2024 Core Algorithm Update</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-protect-your-instagram-account-from-hackers/\">How To Protect Your Instagram Account From Hackers?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-50-Digital-Marketing-Interview-Questions-and-Answers-for-2025.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-20 06:15:13','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(102,'What is Looker Studio (Formerly Google Data Studio) and How to Create a Report On It?','what-is-google-data-studio-and-how-to-create-a-report-on-it','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>This blog explores everything from A to Z about<strong> what is Google Data Studio Or Looker Studio</strong>, how it proves beneficial, and, most importantly, how to use Data Studio to create a report. Additionally, learn how it can help check SEO performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Did you know? Presently, over 9,400 companies use<strong> Data Studio </strong>or Google Looker Studio (its updated name) for data visualization! But why? What makes Google Studio such a well-loved tool? Simply put, it doesn’t require extensive expertise, and once you know how to use it, you’ll quickly be able to create impressive reports that stand out. Plus, its amazing features—like customizable templates, data visualization, and data blending—make it even more powerful and versatile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, Google’s Data Studio brings together Google Analytics and Google Ads, simplifying your reporting process and, ultimately, making it super easy to track and visualize everything in one place.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Google Data Studio OR Looker Studio?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Data Studio is a free tool that helps users, especially marketers and business owners, turn data into easy-to-understand reports and visual dashboards. Your team can save time and money with Data Studio because it only takes minutes to make, read, and share reports. As a result, Data Studio helps your business and team make decisions faster and get better results because it is easy to use and can do several things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, reporting software can be very expensive, which can hurt your bottom line. However, Google keeps meeting the needs of individuals by providing a free way to report data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Features of Google Data Studio</strong> <strong>OR Looker Studio</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To understand why so many people are switching to <strong>Google Studio</strong> <strong>or Looker Studio</strong>, let\'s look at some of its standout features:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Multiple Data Source Integration</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data Studio allows you to import data from many sources—Google Ads, Analytics, YouTube, Sheets, and even databases like MySQL or BigQuery. Therefore, one view with flawless integration will show all necessary data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Interactive and Customizable Visuals</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Users can showcase data in a way that makes sense to their audience with this tool\'s different chart types, such as bar charts, pie charts, line graphs, tables, and more. It\'s easy to change the way images look with interactive tools like filters and date range choices.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Real-Time Data Refresh</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike static reporting, Google Data Studio automatically updates reports with the latest data from connected sources. This is ideal for real-time insights, especially in dynamic industries where numbers change frequently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Collaboration and Sharing</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Visualization Studio </strong>allows you to share reports with others easily. You may set permissions to enable particular people to see, modify, or comment. Also, shared reports are live, which means that any changes to the data will be available to all viewers in real-time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Fully Customizable Design</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tailor your reports to reflect your business or personal style. To make reports seem distinctive and on-brand, you may customize colors, fonts, and layouts, as well as include your logo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the Benefits of Using Data Studio?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among the many advantages of Data Studio, here are the primary ones:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Access a wide variety of widgets</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Data Studio enables you to add infinite widgets, unlike Google Analytics, which restricts reports to 12 charts. This adaptability lets you publish data in several formats: heat maps by area, pie charts, time series graphs, and more. Different measurements allow each widget to be tailored, enabling more data display and report design. Because of its adaptability, Data Studio is an excellent solution for companies trying to produce more dynamic, instructive reports. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcBT1QdI5pTxcKlLwWoXM0L6KYEuI8nPrmxjnTdMOWUraTz_8Igmz_S7bEPoM3yZWXaDmi4qadWpm0c22eHv5gdO0jxPYxA69Pg5TwpOA4oLVisZa_W7UfuqMr1z1r0LQavei4KtBA_iAQM-6Mh_BwIQLCl?key=IuR0aKcsziYppQgLAk1cuw\" style=\"\" alt=\"Data Studio Report\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Connect Data from Various sources</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of Google Data Studio\'s most potent abilities is gathering data from up to 12 sources in one report. To produce thorough reports covering all aspects of your company, you can easily mix data from Google Analytics, Google Ads, YouTube, CloudSQL, Search Console, and more. Thus, this feature makes <strong>Visualization Studio</strong> a powerful, all-in-one reporting tool. Thus, you can showcase the value of digital marketing with professional, aggregated reports—all for free—to decision-makers. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4183,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-1024x543.png\" alt=\"Looker Studio connectors\" class=\"wp-image-4183\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Share Data Studio reports effortlessly</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With its similar sharing capabilities as Google Docs, Google Looker Studio simplifies teamwork. You can share a link to your report instead of files so team members, account managers, or decision-makers may quickly access and change it. Moreover, changes occur in real-time. Hence, everyone views them as they take place.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdU-gYb7weBKSAGK8Ps2ahpA8lJRdZpA_ziWsbvryJVqUJlRFFuvwXJNpFbjtKHI78ej-da4d4kqVNi4mq-pysJnUWhZkzdZPSTxU6oec1Kv8MAXuXiExWVCVfTBH8R35DgZgEOBtYpQs64N-Vf6cJ5lT6o?key=IuR0aKcsziYppQgLAk1cuw\" style=\"\" alt=\"Share Data Studio reports\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Make reports that are easy for anyone to understand</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Data Studio provides the freedom to produce reports of any length—from one page to several pages—that fit the demands of your business. From fonts and colors to themes and widget layouts, perfect every element to ensure your report is aesthetically pleasing. Moreover, each page allows you to add up to 10 widgets, giving team members and decision-makers both a whole picture.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Add interactive features to enhance user engagement</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You cannot use only one dimension in your charts and graphs. Distribute your reports digitally so company executives can easily select the necessary information. Users may easily see data with this interactive feature. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcT5mWqEpOhXDtxyTNX8rJCPGnW93VFMoLcNOhjGSgKJf0D695e742GPxT67Tm1-pMMxACvdRX92UGb2RqvwR0bnwb_zcnZU6sU4lSJrTJTK4-7OFBarWGtobYPeN9Ra0jVtaqd6feIYIPb0j2BVWNNSiiS?key=IuR0aKcsziYppQgLAk1cuw\" style=\"\" alt=\" Data Studio reports\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Use free templates in Data Studio</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Insights Studio provides ready-made templates for those unfamiliar with Google Analytics or reporting to simplify report creation. The platform comes prepackaged with templates for Google Analytics, YouTube, Google Ads, and many more services. It even comes with layouts for specialized businesses, such as ecommerce.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img style=\"\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcMHYc5s1fVwz_Hrt_tdNcDUD_K6eZjy_CutFIOl6yqzMcZvYiYGRuI9IZk4uOCawWt10SZLuxlUveArqTdILEtagGFTDGzEzKAoctcBiY3q1wHUpnUAB2fUu7Py2vtVNt7Pxd1zKXHcq97hFV3oXDdOGTa?key=IuR0aKcsziYppQgLAk1cuw\" alt=\"Data Studio integration\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Ultimate Guide: How to Use Google Data Studio <strong>OR Looker Studio</strong>?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Log In/Sign In</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visit Google Data Studio or <a href=\"https://lookerstudio.google.com/navigation/reporting\">Looker Studio</a> and sign in with your Google Analytics, Google Ads, or Search Console account details.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once logged in, you’ll see the main overview page. To access your dashboard, select the \"Home\" tab.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Explore the Data Studio Dashboard&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The example image below shows what sample reports look like and highlights the types of insights you can gather from your custom reports.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4181,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1-1024x543.png\" alt=\"Google Data Studio performance\" class=\"wp-image-4181\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Reports and Data Sources</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As shown above, you will find data sources and reports on the <strong><a href=\"https://lookerstudio.google.com/navigation/reporting\">Data Studio Dashboard</a></strong>. Clear data visualizations made possible by reports help you to grasp your data. In the meantime, data sources serve as connectors, tying your report to outside information such as Google Analytics or Google Ads.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Link Your First Data Source</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data sources are the bridge between a Data Studio report and your raw data. Additionally, each data source comes with specific features and pre-built connectors, making it simple to connect and pull in the data you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With over 500 supported data sources, you have many options to choose from. Also, some of the most popular ones include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Analytics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Ads</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Search Console</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>BigQuery</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>YouTube Analytics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PostgreSQL</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search Ads 360</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Create a Report on Google Data Studio <strong>OR Looker Studio</strong>?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow these simple steps to create a report that stands out:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Choose a Data Source</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Click \"Create,\" then choose \"Data Source.\" Here, you choose the platform from which to retrieve the data. For well-known sources such as Google Analytics, Ads, YouTube, Sheets, and even outside choices, including MySQL, BigQuery, and more, Google provides a vast array of connections.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose your preferred data source.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Turn on any important permissions.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>After linking, your data source will appear, and you can begin creating.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdcBZcDHwiUsAwV44OOwKFBzTECFCY9occDt1fwHwLHtzjGletSPaldxKc7vphiapJ_FKwRwJ0BGPQyzVbEohn8tP0IcWfNum6NjnDO8z_T-3JeCGEXgkFHv7S3jL_MKLmgEqbcZFMWzPWPkj9cUUuInu2c?key=IuR0aKcsziYppQgLAk1cuw\" alt=\"Google Analytics Data Studio\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Create a Blank Report or Use a Template</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Data Visualization tool offers the ability to start from nothing or use a pre-made framework.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Templates let you save time and inspire layout and design.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Visit the Template Gallery and peruse possibilities for using a template.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remember that the templates you may personalize come pre-built with layouts, charts, and widgets.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, choosing an empty report gives you ultimate creative control over every component.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Customize Your Report Layout</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s time for creativity; now you are the editor. Key customization options are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Add Charts and Tables: </strong>Click the \"Add a Chart\" option to select from several graphics, including bar charts, pie charts, scorecards, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Drag and Drop Fields:</strong> Every data source you link contains fields like \"Page Views\" or \"Click-Through Rate.\" Bring these fields into your selected chart.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Apply Filters:</strong> Filters let people access certain data subsets. You may apply a filter, for instance, to examine just the data from a given date period.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 4: Style Your Report</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Styling allows you to match the report with your branding. Therefore, to create a unified report, adjust fonts, colors, and borders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To alter the general color scheme, see the \"theme and layout\" page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add logos and images if you are writing a report for a customer using their brand colors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select a somewhat aesthetically pleasing font type. Additionally, maintaining a limited font type will make the report more professional.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 5: Add Interactive Elements</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Interactive components add interest and user-friendliness to reports. As a result, you might incorporate these components:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Let viewers choose the date range they wish to investigate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dropdown menus let consumers view the data they find relevant for things like area, product category, or campaign.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users may click on particular data points to access further information, including a breakdown of a given category.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 6: Review and Share Your Report</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After creating your report, carefully review it to ensure the accuracy of the data. Lastly, when you are ready to share:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click \"Share\" at the top of the page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select rights for every visitor so they may see, change, or remark.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For immediate access, forward the URL to clients or team members.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use Google Data Studio to Monitor SEO Performance?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a digital marketing firm, we use Google Data Studio to improve our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing services</a></strong>. Specifically, it gives us useful information about how SEO is working and how our competitors are planning their campaigns.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, Google Studio helps you monitor the following SEO practices, but its capabilities extend beyond these:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Check your website traffic</strong> - The traffic on a website is essential to understand how well your site is performing. Moreover, Data Studio helps with this by tracking the number of visitors and analyzing their behavior, showing which pages they visit most and how they interact with your content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Keep track of where your keywords ran </strong>- You have to access your keyword results by connecting to your Google Search Console account. Once you\'ve done so, you may generate a customized report displaying your main search terms, keywords\' position, average number of searches per month for each keyword, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Watch your backlinks and how anchor texts are used</strong> - Google Data Studio may assist you in grasping the distribution of your anchor text and the source of links on your website. However, you must link to your Google Search Console account to accomplish this.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Review your competitors\' SEO strategies</strong> - For competition analysis, Google <strong>Reporting Studio </strong>is a great tool that lets you view competitor rankings, target keyword performance, and source links. Additionally, connecting your Google Search Console provides data showcasing top competing sites, keyword placements, search volumes, and backlink comparisons.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-light-green-cyan-color\"><strong>Also read:</strong></mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/google-rolls-out-november-2024-core-algorithm-update/\"><strong>Google Rolls Out November 2024 Core Algorithm Update</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/professional-website-design-services-in-melbourne-elevate-your-brand/\"><strong>Professional Website Design Services in Melbourne – Elevate Your Brand</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-industries-using-google-ads-for-lead-gen/\"><strong>Top 10 Industries Using Google Ads for Lead Gen</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies trying to perform data reporting and visualization will find great value in Google Data Studio. This tool is helpful for data-driven decision-making by aggregating several data sources into one simple display. Furthermore, the interactive tools and customization let you easily fit every report to your requirements, therefore facilitating clear and efficient communication of ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are ready to improve your data reporting, spend some time exploring Visualization Studio and begin creating your first report. With minimal effort, you will quickly discover how this tool can transform your perspective on data sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-is-Looker-Studio-Formerly-Google-Data-Studio-and-How-to-Create-a-Report-On-It.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-12-19 11:40:59','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(103,'Google Rolls Out November 2024 Core Algorithm Update','google-rolls-out-november-2024-core-algorithm-update','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Google announced on November 11, 2024, a new core update will start to be released. This comprehensive core algorithm upgrade emphasizes the ongoing refining of search results.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>November 2024 Core Algorithm Update: What you Need to Know?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google\'s November update focuses on matching content with what users are looking for. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It prioritizes pages with rich snippets and visuals in search results. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Websites that are spammy or have low-quality content may see their rankings drop. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>New competitors could show up, so monitor industry SERPs closely.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To avoid content cannibalization, make sure your pages aren\'t competing for the same keywords.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The November 2024 Core Algorithm Update is here. Like previous updates, it brings changes that could affect how visible a site is, how much traffic it gets, and how SEO strategies are used in various industries. This update, which came out in early November, will likely be fully rolled out over two weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google States: </strong>“Today we released the November 2024 core update. We’ll add it to our ranking release history page in the near future and update when the rollout is complete.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, Google informed about the change and said it would add more information to its search progress report.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“This update is designed to continue our work to improve the quality of our search results by showing more content that people find genuinely useful and less content that feels like it was made just to perform well on Search.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google has said in the past that sites that were affected by the helpful content change in September 2023 shouldn\'t expect significant improvements right away. The core algorithm update for November 2024<strong> </strong>is<strong> </strong>still relatively new, so how it will affect results and traffic is still being determined. It may take some time for this to become clear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Stay Ahead of the November 2024 Core Update?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The November 2024 core update aims to improve how Google judges the quality and usefulness of content. Even though changes to rankings are the most clear effect of an algorithm update, you should also pay attention to other things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To help SEOs safeguard against impacts of core algorithm update for November 2024, here are some actionable strategies:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Focus on High-Quality Content</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google is focusing especially on content with actual value for users. Creating complete and useful content that addresses actual user purposes is the greatest approach to being ready for any update from Google. Low-quality content—content that fails to provide solutions, information, or good readability—doesn’t just disappoint users; it can also harm your site\'s reputation as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Monitor User Intent Shifts</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s algorithm constantly changes to match content better with users\' wants. Monitor how user questions may change over time, and make sure your content fits those new wants. You can do this by updating the old content. Additionally, track which topics get more searches with analytics tools, then change your content approach to suit those subjects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Optimize for SERP Layout Changes</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s layout updates can significantly change how your page appears. Optimization is a must, especially for rich snippets, movies, and other graphic components that can show up in the search results. Plus, it will help in raising the quality of content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Watch Out for Spammy Competitors</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, the November 2024 Core Algorithm Update<strong> </strong>will continue to go after spammy or low-quality sites. On the other hand, if your site has real, high-quality content, your results will probably go up. But keep an eye on the ranks of your rivals, especially those who might be using unethical SEO methods.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Combat Content Cannibalization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content cannibalism means when different pages on a site compete for the same keyword, and it can hurt rankings. To keep this from happening, make sure that each page has its own topic by auditing it often. One page might be about \"best fitness equipment,\" but other pages might be about something else, like \"affordable workout tools.\" If pages overlap, merge them or edit them to make the site more authoritative and clear for search engines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Emphasize the User Experience (UX)</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s algorithm depends much on a flawless user experience. Make sure your website loads quickly, is navigable, and is mobile friendly. Good UX keeps users interested, which might help to improve rankings. To enhance UX, you can follow three main practices:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure your website is fully mobile-responsive, with readable designs and a flexible layout that adjusts seamlessly to smaller screens.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use efficient code and lower the images’ size to make loading faster.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Simplify menus and create clear call-to-action buttons to help users locate information quickly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Look at Changes After an Update:</strong> Use tracking tools to find any significant changes in your rankings after an update. Focus on making pages that have dropped a lot of positions better by reevaluating and improving their quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you notice a significant drop in your rankings following the update, Google suggests you:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Review traffic trends before and after the update using Google Search Console.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on pages that saw a steep ranking decline, especially those with a drop of 20 positions or more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, simplify menus and create clear call-to-action buttons to help users locate information quickly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To put it simply, Google\'s November 2024 core update focuses on creating content that addresses real user needs and solves their problems. It\'s important to prioritize writing for people, not just for SEO rankings. This means conducting thorough research, providing genuine and relatable solutions, and avoiding AI-generated or plagiarized content. Creating helpful, reliable, and people-first content is the key.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your rankings drop, it doesn\'t necessarily mean something is wrong with your pages. Google provides a list of questions to ask yourself if the November 2024 Core Algorithm Update negatively impacts your site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, these updates are likely to improve your website\'s ranking. However, inevitable swings are typical, and particular pages may see a decline in ranks or organic traffic. Still, it\'s crucial to remember that changes are part of an ongoing effort to improve search quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/T2G-Blogs-28.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-11-14 12:42:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(104,'Use Dedicated Search Optimization Services for Organic Growth','use-dedicated-search-optimization-services-for-organic-growth','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All businesses know today that the world of digital commerce is highly competitive, thus businesses should always guarantee their web presence to be strong, memorable, and positive. After having created a website, there is more to doing so than getting the site to appear on the search engines. This is where dedicated <a href=\"https://opositive.io/services\"><strong>search optimization services</strong></a> come into the scenario.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here, in this article, let’s discuss all about SEO services as to how useful they are, what advantages they provide and how to select the best one for incremental online growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf7WgoLg-GvDLtUo6ez7b3Hit-Bqq9j7OfgmuI9i6WpCge4dYf2XdrY5sgMHqgBl0YLQR2yQ4Pdkb9V6BAwAIjBXmyexBErKQQ_Mu6SQGc67k4n2IvHVKZ4uwNXCLxBvKp0xP_uiw?key=3yle3Nw4h8iODRlYSdK7_3x6\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Are Search Optimization Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search optimization services are professional services aimed at improving the site’s positions in the search engines, such as Google, Bing, and Yahoo. These services focus on improving various elements, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On-Page SEO: Better results obtained by optimizing the content and the HTML and improving the metadata describing the site.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Off-Page SEO: The second and third goals are: Link building, boosting the domain authority, and growing the brand mentions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technical SEO: Optimizing website’s loading time, usability and structure on different devices, as well as convenience for search engine crawlers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Local SEO: Delivering volume for location-related searches to better appeal to the audience in your region.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">But –&nbsp;Why Businesses Need Search Optimization Services?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The vast majority of online experiences—93%, to be exact—begin with a search engine. Without effective search optimization, your website risks getting lost in the vast sea of competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Using SEO Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Boosts Organic Traffic</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Professional SEO services use proven strategies to rank your website higher on SERPs, driving more organic traffic. Studies show that 75% of users never scroll past the first page of search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Increases ROI</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike paid ads, which require continuous investment, organic traffic generated through SEO provides long-term benefits.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Enhances User Experience</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search optimization needs to be viewed as being more than just rankings, and as being more about the user. SEO also enhances usability in such ways as faster loading and mobile friendliness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Strengthens Brand Credibility</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First page ranking on Google creates trust among potential customers. Exclusive SEO services make your website the most sought after resource on your topic of specialty.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Components of Effective Search Optimization Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Keyword Research and Strategy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fundamental concept of SEO is keyword – its selection and further use as a tool for reaching out to the target audience. SEO services can use SEMrush and Ahrefs to perform keyword research and identify such keywords as high volume and low competition relevant to your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Content Creation and Optimization</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High-quality, relevant content is key to engaging users and earning backlinks. Services include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Blog writing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Website copy optimization.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Creating multimedia content like videos and infographics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Backlink Building</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Backlinks remain one of Google’s top-ranking factors. SEO services are therefore aimed at identifying and obtaining good quality links from quality domains.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Technical SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO services should help a site to be free of common problems such as broken links, slow speed, or poor mobile compatibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Analytics and Reporting</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Monitoring and evaluation are conducted on a regular basis to document control and adjustment for better performance of techniques. Choose those services that offer a deep analytics of traffic, ranks, and users’ engagements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Best Search Optimization Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Selecting the right service provider can make or break your SEO efforts. Here’s what to look for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Proven Track Record</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search for an SEO company that has a record of positive SEO marketing campaign performances. Try to identify cases or interviews that support their work; basically, try to get proof about their credibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Customizable Packages</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is particularly important for every business to understand that no two businesses are the same, and therefore one cannot use a blanket solution for the problem. Make sure that your service provider offers solutions to your individual requirements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Transparency</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do not work with agencies promising to deliver overnight rankings or ones that do not reveal their approach. Ethical companies give accurate results and update the customer honestly about the time it will take.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Expert Team</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most effective SOS makes use of professional personnel that are conversant with on page, off page, and technical SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Use of Advanced Tools</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inquire whether they employ social media marketing tools such as Google Analytics or Moz or SEMrush for campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Trends That Will Shape Search Optimization Services in 2025</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. AI Optimization &amp; Integration in SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Artificial intelligence has quickly taken over the SEO domain. Whether it’s keyword search or generating content, AI powered tools like ChatGPT and RankBrain are reshaping the way search engine marketers work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Voice Search Optimization</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks to developments in voice recognition, it is becoming increasingly important to focus on voice queries. It is vital to have longer and more exact keywords as well as the phrases people use in real life in this niche</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Core Web Vitals</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>User experience considered as metrics such as loading speed, interactivity, and visual stability has made Core Web Vitals a priority for the search optimization services provided by Google.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Video SEO</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With platforms, especially YouTube, dominate the search which is why it is increasingly important to optimize video content for SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Local SEO Growth</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the increase of the mobile searches done on “near me” phrases, local SEO is always an important aspect of the general search engine optimization services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Common Mistakes to Avoid When Using Search Optimization Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Focusing Solely on Rankings: </strong>Ranking well is great but it should be done on parameters that make the brand or site attractive and bring in the returns such as conversion rates.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ignoring Technical SEO: </strong>Ignoring features that are directly linked to technical SEO such as load speed and mobile optimisation will limit growth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Chasing Low-Cost Providers: </strong>Many companies offering affordable SEO services include black-hat strategies that may result in penalties. Invest in a reputable agency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Lack of Patience: </strong>SEO takes time. Anticipating a quick return is not realistic and means making bad decisions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Dedicated Search Optimization Services Are a Smart Investment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Expertise at Your Fingertips</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO is a complicated process, and certainly one that is always in a state of flux. Using the services of professional seos means that you keep up to date with the new changes in the algorithms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time-Saving</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being in control of SEO in-house has some drawbacks. Outsourced means help you to flexible concentration on your business processes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Better Results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The professional services use better tools and experience to implement lasting and efficient solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing a tailored search optimization service like <strong>Opositive</strong> for your business is one of the wisest things that any company can ever do. These services range from increasing organic traffic to enhancing user experience and overall credibility making it a complete package when it comes to digital growth.Thus, choosing the best service provider and promptly recognizing the new trends, <a href=\"https://writeupcafe.com/seo-ecommerce-and-content-marketing-a-winning-combination\">SEO</a> will allow achieving truly impressive results and become long-term and effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/image.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-11-10 16:21:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(105,'Top 5 On-Page SEO Techniques for 2025','top-5-on-page-seo-techniques-for-2025','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine that you are searching for flight information online, you will get thousands of results right? The web browser will rank different web pages on search engine result pages (SERPs). You will prefer to click the top-rated link. Well, do you know the reason behind why some websites appear on top of the SERPs?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is mainly due to on page seo, which has the power to increase your websites search engine ranking and attracts numerous customers to your website.&nbsp; So, to increase your page’s online presence and increase the ranking consider partnering with Opositive a trusted <a href=\"https://opositive.io/services/on-page-seo\"><strong>on page seo</strong></a><strong> </strong>service provider in India. With their on page SEO techniques your website will rank top on the SERPs. To know more about the top on page SEO techniques for 2025 read on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why On-Page SEO Is Important</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On-page SEO plays a key role in helping search engines know the structure and content of your website. Elements like blogs, URLs, meta tags, keywords, and titles tell search engines if your site matches what users are searching for and whether it provides value. If it does, search engines will show it to users looking for relevant answers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Having a good-looking website is not enough. You need to optimize these elements to keep up with the web browser’s changing algorithms. Since search engines focus on user experience and helpful content, optimizing your site will help it rank better and attract organic traffic. Below let us see the importance of on page SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Including relevant keywords in titles, headers, meta tags, and descriptions helps match your content with search queries, driving traffic to your site.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On-page SEO helps in increasing your chances of ranking higher on search engines and improves your website’s visibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search engines prioritize mobile-friendly sites. On-page SEO makes your site mobile-compatible. This will increase the user experience and ranking of your website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Proper website optimization helps users navigate your site easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Well-optimized on-page elements give your business a competitive advantage and establish your brand as trustworthy in your field.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Top 5 On-Page SEO Techniques&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now you know the importance of on-page seo. Let us now know some SEO techniques to increase your website traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Publish High-quality Content</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quality of the content plays a major role when it comes to SEO. Great content can perform well even without SEO, while poor content will struggle regardless of optimization. Good content becomes even more powerful with SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>High-Quality Content Checklist</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Good content should be:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Original - No copied or rewritten content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Exclusive - Content should not be published elsewhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Textual - Accompany non-text content like images and videos with descriptive text.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Helpful - Content that provides meaningful insights to readers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Unbiased -Provide a balanced view on topics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understand search intent by researching common queries and tailoring your content to match user needs. Review top results for content type, detail, and presentation, then create better, more informative, and user-friendly content to improve rankings. For expert help in creating high-quality content, Opositive can guide you to success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Optimize Page Titles for SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Optimizing your website’s titles is essential for<strong> on page seo</strong>. Search engines analyze the title tag first when crawling your pages to determine the page\'s content. This helps search engines rank your page based on keywords, competition, and other factors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every page must have a distinctive title that clearly describes its content. For instance, a title like “Essential On-Page SEO Tips” is far more effective than “index.html”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tips for Optimizing Page Titles:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Use keywords early - Place target keywords at the start, but avoid keyword stuffing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Keep titles short and clear - Aim for under 70 characters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Use numbers and power words - This makes titles more appealing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Optimize Page Content for SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content SEO is a key component of on-page <a href=\"https://www.thedigitalwebsupport.com/seo-services.php\">SEO</a>, concentrating on optimizing content with your target keywords. Before publishing any content, such as text, images, or videos, the first step is keyword research. This allows you to gain insights into what your audience is looking for, ensuring your content aligns with their expectations and needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After choosing your main keywords, make a list of related and long-tail keywords to use in titles, descriptions, headings, and body text. Web browsers look for both keyword and topic relevance, so including related terms improves your content’s relevance. You can easily find related keywords using web browser’s suggestions like “People also ask,” and “Related Searches.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Add Internal Links for Better SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Internal linking, which means linking to other pages on your website, is a great SEO practice. It helps search engines discover your other pages, highlights your most important content, and encourages users to stay longer on your site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best Practices for Internal Linking:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Link to pages when it’s helpful to your readers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Limit internal links to about 15 per page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Add links within the main content, not just in the footer or sidebar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Link older posts to newer ones and vice versa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Most important pages of your website need to have more internal links.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Optimize Meta Descriptions for SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta descriptions are shown in the search engine result page. They should be descriptive, up to 200 characters, and unique for each page. This is your chance to encourage users to click your link and visit your site over others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While web browsers may not always use your custom meta description, they may choose an automated one if it seems more relevant to the searcher.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tips for Optimizing Meta Descriptions:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Avoid using auto-generated descriptions as they can be unclear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Add your target keywords to the description to enhance relevance and gain user’s attention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Wrapping it Up</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On-page SEO plays a crucial role in boosting your website\'s visibility and ranking in search engine results. Implementing effective techniques will help you improve user experience, attract more visitors, and boost your site’s authority.Partnering with experts like <a href=\"https://opositive.io/\"><strong>Opositive</strong></a> can help ensure your site stays optimized for the best results. With their expertise, you can implement tailored strategies to enhance your website’s performance, keeping it ahead of the competition. Focus on these <strong>on page seo</strong> techniques, and watch your site rise through the SERPs, gaining more organic traffic and increasing conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Screenshot-2024-12-31-155911.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-31 10:18:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(106,'How To Protect Your Instagram Account From Hackers?','how-to-protect-your-instagram-account-from-hackers','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> For many, <strong>hacking Instagram accounts</strong> is starting to cause increasing worry. This is, thus, the moment for you to guarantee the security of your account by acting preventively. Discover why Instagram accounts get hacked, how to restore a hacked Instagram account, how to guard your account, and more on this blog.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hacking is a common threat that often occurs in various forms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can keep your account safe by following best practices like keeping solid passwords and enabling two-factor authentication.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can spot signs that hackers compromise your account by receiving verification emails, being unable to log in, and seeing strange posts on your profile.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Avoid weak credentials if you want to keep your account safe. Use password strength tools to check if your password is strong.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Utilize Instagram\'s security checkup feature and seek support from Instagram to recover your account if you suspect it has been hacked. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether your account has been hacked or not, you may have heard people around you, influencers, or content creators you follow mentioning, \"<strong>My Instagram was hacked</strong>!\" This might leave you wondering, \"<strong>Is it common to get hacked on Instagram</strong>?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With a total of over 2 billion users on Instagram, it’s easy to see how your account could be vulnerable to hacking.<strong> </strong>Did you know Instagram accounts are targeted more than any other online account?<strong> </strong>In fact, according to StationX, 85% of Instagram users have had their accounts compromised.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, there are a number of reasons why hackers hack accounts, such as distributing spam, scamming your followers for money, trying to steal their data, etc. So what steps can you take to guard against account hacking? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Is It Common to Get Hacked on Instagram?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If we talk about cyberattacks, nearly 4,000 new incidents occur every day. Instagram accounts are a frequent target for hackers and are often among the most affected social media platforms. Hackers use personal data, take over accounts for nefarious intent, or utilize them in phishing and spam activities. Securing accounts—personal or professional—especially if you are a content producer, influencer, or company owner, becomes more crucial as Instagram\'s appeal keeps rising. Professionals can help you improve the security of your account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why is My Instagram Account Hacked?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We now know that hacking is a common issue, but why do hackers hunt for Instagram accounts? <strong>Hacking an Instagram account</strong> is not as simple as it looks, as it requires skills in social engineering, knowledge of various hacking tools, and the ability to exploit vulnerabilities in the platform.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, hackers often target accounts for reasons such as stealing personal information, gaining access to followers, or using accounts for spam and phishing attempts.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some signs that can help you to identify that your Instagram account has been hacked:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram sends verification emails.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unable to login</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strange posts on your profile</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unauthorized account email change</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A suspicious login notice appears.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strange messages from your account to friends and followers </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Protect Your Instagram Account from Hackers 2024</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Check out these amazing tips to prevent hackers from accessing your Instagram.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Choose a strong password</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enable two-factor authentication</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Secure your email account</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Remove access from any suspicious third-party apps</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Choose a strong password</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hacking and scam attempts are increasing because more people are making Instagram accounts. The main problem? No strong passwords. You should use auto-generated passwords and a password organizer to improve your protection. For this reason, you won\'t need to remember hard passwords. With a password manager, you can access your passwords from any computer or phone, even when you\'re not online.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, ensure that each of your accounts has its unique password. Hackers will only access some of your information if you use this method. Once you have a password, use a tool like \"How Secure Is My Password\" to see how strong it is. Finally, ensure that the texts you receive are real, and never give your password to someone you don\'t know or trust.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Enable two-factor authentication</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using a two-factor login (2FA) makes your account even safer. Once it\'s turned on, you must enter your password and a code sent to your phone or email when logging in. In other words, someone who knows your password will still be unable to access your account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Instagram, go to your profile, tap on the three horizontal lines in the upper right area, choose \"Settings,\" then \"Security,\" and finally \"Two-Factor Authentication.\" This will turn on 2FA. After that, set it up by following the on-screen instructions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcl1OEKwbFe4SGPzhvH9r8immUYRcQE1qqqejpebgp53PvTd_UJyzTdc_fek0K4fMlcThU5cze4BoGGhLzXLxD1zgEPGwDMB4YJ-ssMnI3JuO2B7GKDzqKLC4IOpFCTSR9CmIbI7_UM5xhiYrcjq9Xhbxi0?key=eWoiTIZwTI0zpkOZGXe_rw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Secure your email account</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Think about how your Instagram and other accounts link to your email. Access to one gives access to all. Therefore, use two-factor authentication or email encryption to safeguard your email. These simple barriers can help you keep hackers out of Instagram.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Remove access from any suspicious third-party apps</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many use Instagram to log in to other applications such as picture editing tools, gaming, and dating sites. However, these applications may still have access to your social network profile and account information, even if you last used them some time ago. If hackers breach their database, your information faces danger. This is why one should give much thought before allowing access to any outside app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Go to your Instagram profile on a desktop computer, click the settings icon, and choose \"Apps and Websites\" to control these apps. You will find a list of applications you have access to here. Should you discover any dubious programs, you may quickly select \"View and Edit\" or \"Revoke Access.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, before you find yourself saying, \"<strong>My Instagram was hacked</strong>!\" follow all the above practices to stay safe from cyberattacks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How do Instagram Accounts Get Hacked?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are some common reasons for account hacking:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Weak credentials: </strong>Instagram always asks users who are signing in for the first time to use strong passwords, yet many of us opt for simple ones so we don’t forget them or choose something easy to remember. Due to this lack of complexity, cybercriminals can easily crack or guess these weak passwords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Public data breach:</strong> Public data breaches happen when hackers leak credit card numbers and email addresses—sensitive data. If someone uses your Instagram password elsewhere, hackers can access multiple accounts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Falling for a phishing scam</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A cybercriminal’s goal with phishing scams is to trick victims into disclosing personal information by pretending to be someone else and creating a false sense of urgency. For example, in an Instagram phishing attack, the scammer might pose as an Instagram representative and urge you to log in to resolve an “urgent” issue. The message contains a link to a fake website mimicking Instagram’s login page. If you enter your credentials, the scammer gains access to your account for malicious purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Instagram Security Checkup Feature</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Instagram\'s Security Checkup tool, keeping your account safe is easier than ever. This tool gives you specific steps to improve security and keep your account safe from people who shouldn\'t be able to use it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Here is how to use the Instagram security checkup feature: </strong>Go to Instagram\'s settings. Afterwards, go to \"Security\" and choose \"Security Checkup.\" The feature will show you how to check for unauthorized logins, review your account details, and change your recovery choices, such as your email or phone number. As an extra safety measure, you can also turn on two-factor identification.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Recover a Hacked Instagram Account?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you think someone has taken access to your Instagram account, you may get it back by following these steps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Check Your Email Account for a Message from Instagram</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you get an email from Instagram at security@mail.instagram.com saying someone changes your email address, click the \"revert this change\" option in the message to undo it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Request a Login Link from Instagram</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If other details, like your password, have changed, you can request a login link directly from Instagram. Here\'s how:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the login screen, tap \"Forgot password\" (on iOS) or \"Get help logging in\" (on Android).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdFtL3T53kwQdFoXm8aOsIx1Njbli3BTtDmok9cnSG6rswxfhSvGAY7nXP1vQ8jq6iOb5VBAfZvmQe-DJSzH9XDnhhHFWMbxgRInHYhoGEGEIwmRnR_GpFZGDAD_ff3BmqKyttoahecO9cf7NB16duUSdDs?key=eWoiTIZwTI0zpkOZGXe_rw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Next, it will direct you to the \"Trouble Logging In?\" page on iOS or the \"Login Help\" page on Android.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXc1I6DoUnSLkiKokNIC13vVVd0a-g9fdT00Dsb34Lji-79AwyHHFMDzB1ot6OyDvh0k4MwjPSBugIc91GWKNSy4QQakzzrIXrtrZfceSWmpkU2pEDEGiw77dLE30tfulxhm5gmU2ucbKr1eFo8Y4rRd0VQN?key=eWoiTIZwTI0zpkOZGXe_rw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enter your email address and then tap “Send Login Link” and follow the on-screen instructions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Request a Security Code/Support&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re unable to recover your Instagram account with the previous steps, report your hacked account. On the “Help Us Recover Your Account” screen, choose “I can’t access this email or phone number,” fill in your details, and click “Request Support.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdcihvNNYcLtCmm5Q1emkkojv3ndK0WHu78eZySCmS5EuoeahkfooQnee2_oY018J2pZaueQP_qE9NY5bO2_jO0TKoI9qIY7-RUIU4Zf6CVf10aTj_kbBd3kFYow-80RyFHg9VAT-L0srizAzRZjy-LnLOx?key=eWoiTIZwTI0zpkOZGXe_rw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you submit your request, Instagram\'s Security Team will send an auto-response email asking you to verify your identity. It will ask one or two of these things:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram can ask for a snapshot of you holding a handwritten code paper.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Please provide the email or phone number you signed up with, along with the type of device (iPhone, Android, iPad, or other).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being cautious and careful is the only way to keep hackers from your Instagram account. Many Instagram users wonder, \"<strong>Why is my Instagram account hacked?</strong>\" This question usually comes up after a security breach, but knowing its causes can help keep it from happening again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We understand how crucial it is to stay safe online. Therefore, remember these tips, and you\'ll be well on your way to protecting your Instagram account.&nbsp;<br>Contact our experts to learn about our <strong>SMO services </strong>and how we can help protect your account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/my-instagram-was-hacked.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-28 14:00:31','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(107,'Are There Rules About Politics On Instagram Reels','are-there-rules-about-politics-on-instagram-reels','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Instagram’s new setting, which limits political content from people you don’t follow, is now enabled by default as Meta shifts focus away from hard news and politics. Both Instagram and Threads are actively reducing political content in your feed. In this blog, you\'ll find everything you need to know about these changes and what they mean for your experience. Also, learn how to turn off Instagram\'s political content filter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram\'s rules say that it can\'t post some kinds of political content, mainly ads and false information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Users should be careful about what they say about politics so they don\'t spread fake information or hate speech.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses and influencers must clearly name any paid political content to follow the rules of the site.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Instagram political content settings </strong>can easily be changed by following simple steps. Thus, helping you to limit or don’t limit the content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, it\'s important to know about Instagram\'s constantly changing rules, especially around election times.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram Reels has quickly become one of the most popular ways to share short, engaging videos. The app lets users be creative by letting them do things like dance challenges and trip vlogs. Oh, but what about <strong>instagram political posts</strong>? Instagram has specific guidelines that <strong>limit political content Instagram</strong> users can share. It\'s essential to know Instagram\'s rules on political material, especially on Reels, since more and more people are using social media to talk about politics. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why is Meta reducing political content?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg acknowledged in January 2021 that users were growing weary of political content and confrontations dominating their social media experience, stating, \"One of the top pieces of feedback we’re hearing from our community right now is that people don’t want politics and fighting to take over their experience on our services.\" However, it wasn\'t just a response to user preferences. Following the January 6, 2021, attack on the U.S. Capitol, Meta faced increasing criticism for allegedly fueling misinformation, hate speech, and partisan bias. As a result, Meta implemented significant changes to reduce the visibility of political and social content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeHYOHADLl3toZgWwWBaSSDEYHl7qDnW-oEDhNopa5TaSYNU76QRAmH8hSmroLdAFS98hAM9pY7czN41GDqCK7wEcYv6rCXgQ6Ycq-oNS_xAezoVWI65tPLbn89V7iXbl8QQq6DqGiQ_dQn61-RhGGAsEw?key=us2ORVOz1xysTkTI0BL7kA\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does Meta mean by “political” content?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta\'s way of describing and controlling political content has been varied and is still changing. A representative for Meta told CNN that political material usually includes things related to politics or the government, like posts about laws or social problems. This meaning is flexible and likely to change based on what users, groups, and experts say. The app\'s settings make it even clearer that political content consists of posts about states, elections, or social issues that touch everyone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Adam Mosseri, who runs Instagram, said that the tool that checks political posts only works for public accounts. Instagram\'s blog says that accounts that post much political content may be labeled as political. Professional accounts can check their status to see if they are qualified for recommendations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta has tried to remove political content from its sites, but its new app, Threads, which came out in 2023, has a more open policy. Topics, a new part of Threads that shows what\'s popular, can include political material as long as it doesn\'t break Meta\'s Community Guidelines. Meta told TechCrunch that these topics are meant to reflect current talks and are not personalized suggestions. This way, political debate can happen within the rules that are already in place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Get Around Instagram\'s New Limits On Political Content?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before discussing <strong>instagram and threads political content</strong>, it\'s essential to know that all content—including Reels—must follow Instagram\'s community policies. These rules maintain the platform free from damaging behavior, a respectful environment, and a safe condition. If Users who consistently violate these guidelines, Instagram may delete their accounts and content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Important areas of the community rules that mainly apply to<strong> limit political content Instagram </strong>consist of the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram forbids hate speech and any material attacking someone based on traits including race, ethnicity, national origin, sex, gender, sexual orientation, religious affiliation, or handicap.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content urging violence or threats against others is forbidden.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram has stepped up its initiatives to counter false information, particularly during election seasons. This covers collaborating with fact-checking agents and labeling material identified as misleading or inaccurate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These general guidelines apply to all posts—including Instagram Reels. Regarding Instagram<strong> political posts </strong>, the platform goes a few additional miles.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Role of Instagram\'s Algorithm in Political Content</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Instagram algorithm is a big part of how much political content people see. Instagram doesn\'t ban political content, but its algorithms give more weight to posts that get likes, comments, and shares. However, if your content is marked as spreading false information, hate speech, or abuse, it may not be as crucial to the system, meaning fewer people will see it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This can be annoying for people who want to talk about politics, but it shows how important it is to follow Instagram\'s rules to get the most views.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Stop Instagram Filtering Suggestive Content?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The controversial content control tool is turned on by default in the <strong>Instagram political content settings</strong>, but it\'s easy to turn it off. To do this, go to your profile and tap the three-line button in the upper right corner. This will take you to the \"Settings and Activity\" or \"Settings and Privacy\" feature, based on your location. In the \"What you see\" section, scroll down and tap \"Content preferences\" or \"Suggested content,\" based on your location. After you click on \"Political content,\" you\'ll see two choices, which are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>— <strong>Reduce political content from accounts you don\'t follow:</strong> By default, you\'ll see fewer political or social topics in your suggested content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>— <strong>Allow more political content from accounts you don\'t follow:</strong> You may encounter more discussions on political or social topics in your suggested content if you select this option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best Practices for Sharing Political Content on Instagram Reels</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What, thus, are the best guidelines to follow if you intend to post political content on Instagram Reels?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Before disseminating political news or assertions, be sure your sources are reliable. This will help lower the possibility of your material being detected as false information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Under Instagram\'s political ad rules, you must correctly label your Reels as advertising when endorsing a political candidate or cause.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Political material frequently starts a conversation; hence, even if you disagree with a commenter, you should interact with them politely.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Track the performance of your Reels. Instagram\'s algorithm could affect the visibility of your stuff. Keep an eye on your Reels, and if you notice a drop in reach, check if you violate any policies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Instagram Reels app is fun for sharing material, like political thoughts and commentary. But it\'s essential to follow the platform\'s community guidelines and know that political material has its own rules.&nbsp;<br>Our<strong> SMO services</strong> are here to help you with your social media plan by offering expert advice on handling and creating content. Whether you\'re using Instagram Reels to connect with your audience or support a political cause, we can guide you on best practices to optimize your content. Additionally, if you\'re looking to<strong> stop Instagram filtering suggestive content,</strong> we can assist in that too by navigating Instagram’s setting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Are-There-Rules-About-Politics-On-Instagram-Reels.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-28 12:17:55','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(108,'How to Add Music to Instagram Story?','how-to-add-music-to-instagram-story','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To honor the achievement of 400 million daily users, Instagram added a feature for users to add soundtracks to Instagram stories in June 2018. Copyright rules, however, prevent access to it in some countries. Instagram first introduced the music feature in stories in the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, Canada, France, Sweden, Australia, and New Zealand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As of 2024, the Instagram music feature is now available in over 90 countries. What is the coolest thing about including music on Instagram? You can also <strong>add music to Instagram posts</strong> by uploading it to Instagram\'s music library or combining it with a streaming site like Spotify, Apple Music, or SoundCloud.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Steps for Adding Music to Instagram Story</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 1: Log into Your Instagram Account</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Firstly, open your Instagram app and log into your account. Once on the home screen, swipe right or press the \"+\" icon at the top to choose \"Story\" from the given choices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Alternatively, to access the stories function, click on your profile image in the page\'s top-left corner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"363px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdnYiBHhhX-Sl_kMW-Yo3n7nq6YcBvTVXNwfwqAHbpX5_KkBoBHRkcvYYvvvNNAirVL7PA5Pd1tMK-3W3PGPFlvVPQwxH4npseYh1SB0RsyZ_Rjcd0xo65pqWadSlQlHHd-iB5y-OC_TAAR8Te3-Ih1D4nn?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:363px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 2: Create Your Story Content</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tapping the circle at the bottom of the Story Creation Interface lets you snap a picture or video. Swiping up on the screen and choosing the desired photo or video allows you to easily upload media from the gallery on your phone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recall that your story may last up to 15 seconds, but Instagram will automatically split it if you upload many recordings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"297px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeFQQfHmpoGNDtiswoGMrUDkLnsfERi0kwPCA78GgOdDEvCGsGnXVgewoF_P2hP1np5x0Rr1r30ZclAueRJW0z8e7tyi_AHLPwoZSN-ppUhBhP_wDI0EL8w7gl3DY09kr325DHX9Po5aAtDztNJLZP562D-?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:297px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 3: Tap on the Sticker Icon and Select \"Music.\"</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After capturing or selecting your content, it\'s time to add some music. Tap the square sticker icon at the top of the screen (it looks like a smiley face post-it). Find and tap the “Music” option from the list of sticker options. It should be near the top, mainly if you’ve used it before.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfH2ufv1qb4xnsMRcbNrnckNLrn3LE9AWWoGpVpjMs5dHir1bO3nUQiXKlG71gBgt08MFzFoXsY8xjeQWOfPAhAjOjesaAtVd2_LzGLrFWcbtl1IdRhRfAHg8O98WPlW8D1nejq68IOPWUtDZJ71Q4aO4PH?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" width=\"284\" height=\"579\"></td><td><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdaGdxVAQ5CFGQ-DxpwbBxf5B0wbRI-1v5FS1kPX79nIEHDSldXUlagvDjDuOg0yk2tKSmnXyWjLsy08Giki5nubtG7OmWnA5cfag9cOjikD7Roxnw903tztA_8av-oy3f-jxIWQrnBKWMDanHZEcZvzDQo?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" width=\"279\" height=\"579\"></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 4: Search for the Perfect Song</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A search bar will appear once you press the Music sticker, allowing you to peruse Instagram\'s extensive music collection. Type a song or artist\'s name into the search field to find them specifically. Additionally, you may explore music based on categories like:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moods in trend: cheerful, serene, dramatic, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Genres: Pop, hip-hop, rock, country, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram frequently features trending and popular tracks to help you select the ideal tune for your Story more quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"336px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdT3iGbenrc4V1LbJ68YENqyXuRALXfen_wY0PUw1vpfM5LIMtlgvE3K9dfHPd9mCzO7AeRX0x21mvckPqYZvXz4ILwImYrCZmFWe8viF08BuL-tZ7eq15eV8NMuwjAGi_mUXYI_Pq2LUqIxPq-QRp4_N8z?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:336px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 5: Select a song section.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram will automatically choose a 15-second section of a song you have selected for your Story. The slider at the bottom of the screen lets you choose the precise segment you wish to play if you desire another lyric part of the music.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"297px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdayKYGZ_CvsTHkhu_JpZOdIUcvdXHuXfxB4lKapxp7uCeJDlHn4IjgYI4y9BFWv3zZMv70VIzXfWIILAFKeejOQUy9k-jL3xAdCA-sF9vH2wpZypZrHnuk3XYylHMw2Qba_HZm_HHr98fS2DMbMVpLYsFL?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:297px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Step 6: Personalize the Musical Show.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram lets you choose how the music is shown on your Story once you have selected the song and the segment you wish to include. There exist a few choices:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram may show words that complement the music, producing a karaoke-like impression. You can match your look with several font styles and colors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Display the song\'s album cover if you don’t want to show the lyrics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Minimal Display. You could choose a little music symbol with the song\'s and artist\'s names.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you\'re happy with the appearance of the music, you may move and enlarge it precisely as any other sticker on your Story.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 7: Share Your Story</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your work once you are satisfied!&nbsp; Tap the \"Your Story\" button at the bottom of the screen to post the Story for all your followers to see.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"350px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcXk3NikIxFOlxF46_wY06Z2GibPbapt6iMsgK9A0H4zNyz5tn7y0Nt6DlmzuG_OPILIILnNPFo0rVvTo9uHicgZhCsHys2CQ4F_GMAgx0ZnegTd2tEOx1X7kkClIH2Ryk_KVfJZFDqixuM3NOYiK37uRSS?key=H3A6zYOgmCzKbbxCnuF-iA\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:350px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The benefit of Adding Music to your Instagram Story</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s quickly go over why adding music to your Instagram Story is quite helpful. Here are several causes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Improved Engagement:</strong> A Story with catchy music or a pertinent soundtrack can more successfully grab the interest of your audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Creates Mood: </strong>Whether it\'s a workout update, a humorous clip, or a peaceful scenario, the appropriate music may help your Content create the ideal tone.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Makes Content Memorable: </strong>Viewers are more likely to remember your Story when music is included. Hence, it is an excellent benefit for companies and influencers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Add One Song to Multiple Instagram Stories?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to <strong>add one song to multiple Instagram stories</strong>? It\'s a great way to keep your vibe constant and improve your work! Here\'s how to do it:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To begin, create your first story by choosing the image you want to add music to. Then, tap the sticker icon and select \"Music\" to add your desired song. Pick out a song and make any necessary changes. Post your first Story when you\'re happy with it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To use the same song in your next story, simply repeat the process. Instead of selecting a new track, tap on the “Music” sticker again and search for the same song. You can adjust the part of the song for each Story, giving a fresh feel while keeping the overall theme consistent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Add Song to Instagram Posts?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2022, Instagram made it possible to include music with image posts. Before this update, the function was limited to Stories and Reels. Additionally, remember that the Instagram web browser on a PC does not allow you to <strong>add songs to Instagram posts </strong>or stories.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow these easy steps to <strong>add music to Instagram post</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To start a new post, open the Instagram app and tap the plus sign (+).&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select a picture or video.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In the upper right corner, tap Next and then Next again.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose the \"Add Music\" Option.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select the song you want to add from the music library. You may also choose your favorite part of the song by sliding the bar at the bottom.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, click the \"share\" button. If you prefer to, add a location, caption, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Troubleshooting Common Issues</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sometimes, by <strong>adding music to Instagram Story,</strong> you can encounter problems like the music not playing, the sticker not appearing, etc. However, you can fix these issues with the following solutions:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Music Option Missing:</strong> If you don\'t see the music sticker, the option might not be available in your area. Therefore, before posting your video to Instagram, add songs using other applications like Spotify or Apple Music.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Song Not Playing:</strong> Sometimes, there are problems whereby the song won\'t play in your story. Try restarting the program or reinstalling it. Deleting the app cache will also help to fix this problem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Music Clip Too Short: </strong>If the part of the music you like to utilize is too short, think about making a longer video and uploading it in chunks to enable you to run the song over multiple Story clips.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Including music in your Instagram Story is a straightforward yet practical approach to increasing your Content\'s exciting and memorable quality. Thus, look at the music feature next time you share on Instagram.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are an influencer or a business brand wanting to promote your products and services on Instagram, adding trending music can help you stand out and increase your chances of going viral. Our <strong>SMO services </strong>can further enhance your social media presence, ensuring your Content reaches a wider audience and drives engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Blog-Images-2024-10-28T184324.988.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-25 13:18:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(109,'What Are the 5 Ps of Marketing?','what-are-the-5-ps-of-marketing','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>We will break down each of the five Ps in this guide using real-world examples to enable you to understand their application. Also, explore their importance and how to use them effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Promotion is a strategy through which customers learn about your product or service. Some say this is the most important of the 5 Ps. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The price you set for your product is essential to balance what customers are willing to pay.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, products or services are the foundation of your marketing plan. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remember that how you reach your market and grow revenue depends on Distribution channels.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Considering marketing, the five Ps offer a solid basis for creating plans that can enable a company to flourish in today\'s competitive climate. Like most of us, if you own a business, you want to know how to present your goods, draw in business, and create unique brand recognition. In this case, the<strong> 5Ps of marketing </strong>come into play: <strong>Product, Price, Place, Promotion, and People</strong>. Knowing each of these components helps companies concentrate and align with their marketing objectives. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the 5 P’s of Marketing?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>5 ps of marketing</strong> are critical to an effective marketing mix plan. This mix refers to brands\' activities to sell their products and services, which are organized around five basic components: product, place, pricing, promotion, and people.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The 5Ps were first used in the late 1940s but were only a 4-part model: <strong>price, product, place, and promotion. Afterward, \"people\" were added</strong>. Most agree Kotler is the \"father of modern marketing.\" He is also well-known for standardizing the definition of the marketing mix.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXd0SpgW_WgEqoiDrfkxSg5vAUzGo5jqeYC0_EjNFq8qUsEB6zdRp2Xot9WXUg38vo_IwooFFvCEf-KFuByJPI0aTvAWLChXOvwpPNqLMmf88SfW-_BtDrOUXCwZ8VFtoKer_iejsTDdW4gkS72JOtqJk6SK?key=2L3IVZ3qLOsPgtK_SM7eyw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Product: What are you selling?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first P is the most important—your product. This speaks to the items or services your business provides. It covers the actual goods and its design, features, and packaging. This is where your value proposition—that exceptional edge your product offers over others on the market—fits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, consider Apple and its iPhone. The iPhone is a status symbol, a handy tool with a flawless interface with other Apple products, and not just a phone. Apple stresses the gadget and its ecosystem, therefore acquiring a competitive advantage in the smartphone industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Price: What\'s It Worth?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Price comes next; this is the price consumers would be ready to pay for your item. Pricing policies could change based on the state of the market, level of competition, and apparent worth of your item. Attracting your target market depends on deciding whether to price low to compete on cost or high for a luxury appeal. Getting the pricing right is, therefore, vital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, Starbucks has become very skilled in premium pricing. Though Starbucks\' coffee cup costs more than a regular café, customers are ready to pay for the brand, the experience, and the supposed quality. Starbucks can charge a premium without losing consumers by concentrating on branding and customer experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Place: From where are you selling it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Place describes the distribution of your goods, both geographically and elsewhere. It\'s all about getting your goods in front of the proper audience at the appropriate moment. Whether your company runs a physical store, online, or both, your success depends on knowing where your clients will likely purchase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, Amazon exemplifies excellent location optimization. Since they are practically totally online, consumers can easily buy from anywhere globally. They provide convenience, but their sophisticated logistics system guarantees that items get to consumers rapidly. Many companies find that selecting the correct sales platform makes or breaks their marketing campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Promotion: How Are You Getting the Word Out?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Promotion encompasses all the means of contact you use with your target market. This might call for PR initiatives, social media, advertising, etc. Moreover, the objective is to increase knowledge of your product and inspire its purchase. As a result, your promotion approach should be catered to your target and the message you wish to transmit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, Coca-Cola is a well-known firm for its outstanding marketing plans. Coca-Cola is adept at getting its message in front of its consumers, whether it means through its worldwide holiday marketing or engaging social media content. Their marketing frequently arouses feelings and reminiscence, which helps the brand to be more approachable and exciting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. People: Who\'s Involved in the Process?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The last P, People, speaks about your clients and the personnel behind your offering. Having the correct personnel guarantees that every customer touchpoint—marketing to customer service—delivers a consistent and favorable experience. Driving commercial success is primarily dependent on your staff and partners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, Zappos, an online shoe retailer, has built its brand around exceptional customer service. Their customer-centric attitude distinguishes them from their rivals. Employees at Zappos are taught to surpass expectations so that every time they connect with the business, consumers enjoy buying.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Importance of 5 P’s of marketing</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The biggest advantage the five Ps of marketing provide is improved capacity for focusing on your primary marketing goals. They do this by laying a structure that directs all of your projects and promotes harmony. Once you have set your basic pillars, it is far easier to find the areas of your company that call for further help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you find it difficult to sell, you can decide to study your ability to reach your target market or the product costs. For you, the five Ps of marketing make all the business functions easier.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Example of the 5 P\'s of Marketing</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sarah wants to open a kayak rental shop for tourists who love outdoor adventures. Here’s how she can use the 5 Ps to set up her business:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Product: </strong>She will offer hourly kayak rentals for visitors. Customers will sign a waiver, and a security deposit will be required in case of any damage to the kayaks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price:</strong> Sarah will keep her prices low to attract budget-friendly tourists. She can also give a 10% discount to groups that book through local hotels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Promotions: </strong>She will create social media accounts on Facebook and Instagram to promote her business. Sarah can also advertise on travel websites and blogs to reach more potential customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Place: </strong>The kayak rental shop will be located near popular tourist spots and public transportation for easy access.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>People: </strong>Sarah will hire friendly staff who enjoy meeting travelers and providing excellent customer service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Use the 5 P’s Effectively?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. The product must meet the needs of the Market.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Making sure that your product meets actual client demands is critical to success. Thus, do your homework by conducting market research, customer interviews, behavioral data analysis, and buyer persona creation. Also, dig deep to understand your audience\'s goals, pain spots, and preferences and include them in the final product.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A deep understanding of your product\'s value proposition is essential for marketers. You must clearly explain how features and capabilities solve consumers\' problems. Additionally, product expertise helps SaaS marketers create engaging messaging and differentiated growth plans.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Be strategic; set competitive, fair pricing.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pricing is integral to marketing because it affects demand and how people think about a product. To set prices correctly, you need to consider operational costs, market conditions, customer behavior, and how your company will be perceived. For some businesses, giving unique products at a higher price works well, while cost-plus or subscription plans work better for others. Competitive research helps you stay strong in the market. Additionally, consider using strategies like bundles, subscriptions, and dynamic prices to get the most value.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Expand strategically; reach broader market audiences.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need to use strategic distribution through the right platforms to reach and engage your audience. First, plan to roll out in key places, then move on to new areas. Language and cultural differences can significantly affect how a product is advertised and how much it costs. Study the market extensively to learn about the differences between regions and adjust your ads as needed.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, join forces with media, channels, and leaders influential to your area. Event marketing, both in person and online, also provides valuable chances to interact with people in real life and make digital contacts that can be scaled up through workshops.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Choose targeted channels for effective promotion.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a marketer, an integrated promotional strategy drives audience awareness and nurtures relationships, keeping your funnel performing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Optimize your promotion efforts across channels by:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Paid Media:</strong> Use targeted ads for top-of-funnel demand, measuring ROI regularly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Content Marketing:</strong> Create blogs, videos, e-books, and more to engage and establish authority.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Earned Media/PR:</strong> Invest in PR for reviews and media mentions to build credibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Email Marketing: </strong>Use automated drip sequences to nurture leads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Social Media:</strong> Distribute content and engage audiences organically.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Event Marketing:</strong> Host in-person and virtual events, driving engagement with automation tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Know your audience; engage them meaningfully.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People include your internal teams implementing plans and your exterior audiences. Along with good recruiting practices, you and your marketing staff need chances to upskill and use the correct engagement marketing technologies.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most significantly, great marketers care about their audience. Therefore, approach your ideal client by considering:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Demographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Psychographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Habits</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Needs, wants, and goals</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Challenges and pain spots</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Content tastes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Buying process</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Sample Marketing Plan Template</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While creating a marketing plan from the start might take time, company success depends on having one. By giving you a clear framework to establish your objectives, target audience, and methods, a sample marketing plan template will help you to streamline the process.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Usually including information on market analysis, budget allocation, and key performance indicators (KPIs) help you monitor progress. Also, you may search for free plan templates online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fundamentally, Product, Price, Place, Promotion, and People—the five Ps of marketing—guide companies toward successful plans. Perfecting every component helps businesses satisfy consumer expectations and gain a competitive advantage in the market. Maintaining the five Ps in mind can help your company remain on target and flourish, whether adjusting your pricing model, honing your product offering, or strengthening your marketing plan.<br>We provide various marketing options through our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">SMO services</a></strong> to propel your company forward if you need professional assistance implementing these ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/What-Are-the-5-Ps-of-Marketing-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-23 10:03:38','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(110,'How do I fix HTTP error 503?','how-do-i-fix-http-error-503','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are you seeing the \"HTTP Error 503: The service is unavailable\" on your screen? No worries, because this problem isn’t uncommon, and you can fix it easily. In this blog, we’ll explain everything about HTTP Error 503, from its causes to simple steps you can follow to resolve it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Error 503 is a part of the 5xx error codes developed by the Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To fix the issue, first try to restart the server or clear the cache if using it on iPhone or Android.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The common reasons for the server down can be overload on the website or server maintenance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you can’t handle the 503 error or the problem is taking too long to resolve, it’s best to seek professional help, as the issue can be more complex.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The error is not a permanent problem and can be fixed, but it may require you to be patient.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While online browsing, we can encounter different error codes that stop us from viewing websites. Similarly, one of them is <strong>HTTP error 503</strong>, which is caused by a performance issue. Other common causes can be maintenance or overloaded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you run a big eCommerce site or a little blog, downtime brought on by this mistake may compromise your SEO results as well as user experience. More importantly, though, how do you address a 503 error exactly? Let’s understand! </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the 503 error?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>HTTP Error 503 is a common error code. To define, it means the server you are trying to access is not available at the moment. 503 Service Unavailable Error can occur due to reasons like server overload, scheduled maintenance, faulty plugins, or DDoS attacks. You can fix it yourself through server restarts or by waiting for a resolution; otherwise, you can seek professional help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>503 Error Variations</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are different ways that the <strong>503 http</strong> error can show up, but it always comes with the 503 code. Depending on how your website is set up and your computer, you may see these differences:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>503 Service Unavailable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>503 Service Temporarily Unavailable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Error 503 Service Unavailable</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>HTTP Error 503</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>HTTP Server Error 503</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The server is temporarily unable to service your request due to maintenance downtime or capacity problems. Please try again later.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the Reason for Error 503?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The HTTP 503 Service–An \"unavailable\" error message shows up when a server can\'t handle a request for several reasons, such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Maintenance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Overload</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>DDoS attack</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firewall configuration</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Plugins or theme files </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Here are some things you can try:&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A bad plugin, theme, or CDN might create problems. Therefore, deactivate them to test whether it works. You can reactivate each individually to find the perpetrator.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your browser and server communicate in real-time via the WordPress Heartbeat API. Too much activity slows sites. Limit or deactivate its frequency via an API plugin.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your site may need extra power for traffic or massive procedures. Upgrade your server\'s RAM or CPU with your hosting provider. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Review your error logs to determine the issue. You may also activate WP_DEBUG in WordPress to see faults on your site and find the problem faster.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firewalls that restrict genuine traffic might generate issues. Check and reset the firewall settings to ensure they\'re not too restrictive or misconfigured.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check your website\'s code for problems or recent updates that caused issues. Check file alterations, especially after site updates or feature installations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Fix 503 Service Unavailable Error in 7 Steps?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The steps you can follow to fix the error 503:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Check Your Server Logs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. Reset Your Server</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. Check for server overload.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. Turn off temporarily disabled plugins</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5. Check DDoS Attacks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6. Fix DNS problems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7. Wait and Observe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Check Your Server Logs.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reviewing your server logs comes first in identifying the mistake. These logs offer comprehensive details on the operations of your site and enable the precise identification of the problem. Search the logs for trends or abnormalities that might point to an issue, including a spike in traffic or a plugin failing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Reset Your Server</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many transient problems, including HTTP 503 issues, may be fixed with a basic server restart. Try restarting the web server if your website is housed on a shared or dedicated server to refresh all currently functioning systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here\'s how to accomplish it:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For Linux servers, you can use commands like sudo systemctl restart apache2 or sudo systemctl restart nginx.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For Windows servers, you can restart it through the IIS Manager.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Restarts can assist in the release of any resources connected to malfunctioning systems, thereby enabling your server to be once more available.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Check for server overload.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Should server overload become a problem, you will have to act to lighten the burden. Here are some activities you might engage in:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you share hosting, consider switching to a VPS or dedicated server where resources are more reliable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make use of a Content Distribution Network (CDN). By helping to disperse the traffic burden among several servers more fairly, a CDN such as Cloudflare lessens the demand on your main server and thereby strains it less.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Turn off temporarily disabled plugins</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Occasionally, they cause conflicts, resulting in a 503 fault. Deactivate all of your plugins and observe whether the site comes back online to determine whether a broken plugin is a source.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is the process:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to the Plugins part of your administrative dashboard and turn off every plugin if you can access it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use FTP software like FileZilla to access your site files if you are shut out of the dashboard.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to wp-content/plugins and rename the plugins folder to something different, such as plugins_backup. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This will instantly turn off every plugin on your website. Furthermore, re-enable the plugins one by one once your site is back up to find the troublesome one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Check DDoS Attacks</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you suspect a DDoS assault, you must get in touch with your hosting provider right once. Filtering harmful traffic or running firewalls meant to guard against these types of assaults can help lessen the attack.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using solutions like a Web Application Firewall (WAF) will also assist in guarding your site from DDoS attacks and other security concerns. Strong defense against such assaults comes from services like Sucri or Cloudflare.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Fix DNS problems.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By rendering your server unavailable, improper DNS settings might result in an HTTP 503 error. Verify that your domain is referring to the correct server, and double-check that your DNS records are set up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Check your DNS setup to be sure it is accurate with DNSChecker. Give the DNS time and check back later if it is spreading slowly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Wait and Observe.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sometimes, all you can do when the server is just swamped with traffic is wait. Throughout this period, keep checking your server logs and resources. You could also arrange Pingdom and other monitoring systems to get real-time warnings if your site fails.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Fix the 503 Error in WordPress?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reach Out to Your Hosting Provider</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Disable Plugins Temporarily</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimize Resource Usage</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Change Your Website Theme</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Activate Debug Mode</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Review Server Logs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Restore a Backup</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Reach Out to Your Hosting Provider</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Directly contacting technical support teams will enable you to solve even the most complicated reasons of ongoing 503 http errors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Disable Plugins Temporarily</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Plugins that are out of date, badly written, or use too many resources can accidentally cause websites to fail with 503 service unavailable messages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instead of trying to figure out which add-on might be the problem, website owners should turn off all of them at once and wait to see if their site works again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Optimize Resource Usage</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When they\'re not being used, some apps waste computer resources. This slow overloading can finally go too far and lead to 503 errors. Before you remove useful WordPress plugins and lose all of their features, try adding a plugin that controls resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Change Your Website Theme</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WordPress themes can cause bugs or errors leading to 503 warnings. Switch to a lightweight default theme; if the error persists, investigate customizations or wait for fixes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Activate Debug Mode</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When manual troubleshooting fails, enable debug mode in WordPress by adding define(\'WP_DEBUG\', true); to your wp-config.php file. Next, connect to your site using an FTP client and search for wp_debug_logs in the file directory to find the error logs. Review these logs for detailed error messages related to plugins or themes that may be causing issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Review Server Logs</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hosting providers record detailed server activity logs that track every process and action occurring behind the scenes. These granular records are basically breadcrumb trails, which can reveal sequential issues that eventually snowball into service disruptions. Gaining insight from server logs requires expertise.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Restore a Backup</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Restoring your website from a full backup gives you a fresh start. The system automatically backs up your software settings and data daily or weekly. This allows you to return to a fully functional version of your website before the issue occurs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Fixing HTTP error 503 on iPhone and Android</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The method to fix HTTP Error 503 is generally the same for both iPhone and Android devices. However, the only difference might be the exact menu locations for clearing caches or updating software.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Be it an Android or iPhone, firstly, you may try restarting the device or clearing the cache (temporary storage of web data) and cookies (small files that store your browsing information); if that doesn’t work, check if the website is down by trying to access it on another device. If you\'re on Wi-Fi, switch to mobile data or vice versa.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, ensure your phone\'s software and apps are updated to avoid compatibility issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though they are annoying, HTTP 503 problems are usually transient and treatable with the correct strategy. Following the advice in this guide will help you to find the main reason and quickly fix the problem.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If the issue persists, reach out to us. <strong>Our web development services </strong>can help you fix HTTP Error 503 by optimizing server configurations, improving website performance, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. What is 503 Error?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>It is a server-side error code. It indicates that the website or service you are trying to access is not available. This usually happens when a server is temporarily unavailable or overloaded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. How long does a 503 error last?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. </strong>Most of the time, the 503 service offline error goes away when the traffic slows down. If the mistake keeps happening, though, for a long time, it could mean that your server has a more serious problem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. What are the troubleshooting steps for 503 errors?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Troubleshooting a 503 error usually starts with refreshing your server and then restarting your web browser. If your website operates on different servers, kindly restart each one to have them operational again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4. Is the 503 error permanent?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>No, it is not permanent and usually temporary. In most cases, a 503 error will resolve itself once the server is able to handle requests again. Also, remember not to save responses, as clients might see outdated error pages even after you\'ve fixed the issue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.5. What is Error 503 backend fetch failed?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.5. </strong>This means Varnish is ready to serve your backend, but it has not yet been properly set up to accept new requests. This problem often happens when Varnish gets a request while your server is still releasing or restarting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/How-do-I-fix-HTTP-error-503.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-17 10:56:05','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(111,'What are the 7 functions of marketing and explain each?','what-are-the-7-functions-of-marketing-and-explain-each','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Any effective company plan depends on marketing in some form. It covers several purposes that cooperate to support goods and services, grasp consumer wants, and increase sales. We will discuss the<strong> 7 marketing functions</strong>—in this blog. Understanding these roles helps companies to develop a coherent marketing plan that appeals to their target market and stimulates expansion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>By adding value and interacting with customers, a successful marketing campaign may boost growth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product management, a key marketing function, ensures that products meet customer wants and market trends.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>When making decisions, data management helps organizations anticipate changes and optimize marketing efforts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Smart pricing shapes perceptions and draws customers while ensuring profitability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Marketing shows buyers what they\'re getting for their money and has always been used to sell goods and services, given that it changes the way consumers act and has a lot of power to do so. However, for a business to be successful, it needs to have the right marketing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>7 functions of marketing</strong> are the most important parts of the marketing process that make it work better and faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, digital ads can boost brand awareness by an impressive 80%, making your brand more recognizable among potential customers. Additionally, pay-per-click (PPC) ads are a game-changer, often generating a 200% return on investment—meaning you earn $2 for every $1 spent.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Effective marketing tactics not only attract more website visitors but also enhance conversion rates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Service and Products Management</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product and service management is the creation, enhancement, and maintenance of goods or services satisfying consumer demands. Market research first serves this purpose by pointing up market gaps; next, the design or modification of products helps to close such gaps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The process starts with knowing consumer needs and market trends, which then direct product creation. Constant monitoring and adjusting guarantees that the product remains competitive and relevant. For instance, Apple and other tech firms frequently change their iPhones in response to consumer comments and technical developments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters</strong>: Not one bit of marketing will work if you fail to provide what your target market needs. Effective product management guarantees that companies offer value, the basis of consumer happiness and loyalty.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Information Management in Marketing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This capability centers on gathering, organizing, and evaluating consumer, competitor, and market condition data. The information acquired directs decisions for various marketing purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies obtain data using a variety of techniques, including competition analysis, client comments, and questionnaires. They then examine the facts to grasp consumer behavior, preferences, and market prospects. The development of marketing plans that appeal to the target audience depends on this information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters: </strong>Good tactics result from well-informed choices. Effective data management and interpretation help companies spot fresh prospects, predict changes in the industry, and hone their marketing campaigns to keep ahead of the competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Advancement</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Promotion is the actions companies do to let possible consumers know the worth of their goods or services. It covers public relations, social media marketing, advertising, and sales campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies employ several methods to advertise their goods depending on the most engaged target market. For younger audiences, for example, social networking sites like Instagram and TikHub are excellent; email marketing can be more successful for older consumers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why it Matters: </strong>Good marketing increases awareness, develops brand familiarity, and motivates possible consumers to buy. Even the finest items might be overlooked without robust marketing plans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Cost of Payment</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pricing is figuring out just how much to charge clients for a good or service. It\'s about discovering a price that both reflects the worth of the product and is competitive, not only about meeting expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pricing policies are affected by a number of elements, including rival pricing, manufacturing costs, market demand, and product perceived value. Companies have to balance providing consumers with a price they are ready to pay with optimizing earnings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters: </strong>Price shapes the impression of a good. If your product is too low, clients might believe it is of poor quality; if it is too high, you could lose business to rivals. A well-considered price plan may help a product be positioned on the market and affect its success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Place of Distribution (Place)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Distribution is essentially about ensuring that the product is in front of consumers at the correct moment and location. Whether via brick-and-mortar shopfronts, internet platforms, or both, it determines where and how to market the goods.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Distribution plans rely on the kind of product and the target market. For fast-moving consumer goods (FMCGs), for instance, supermarkets and convenience stores must be abundantly accessible. Conversely, luxury items can be found in a few shops or via special internet retailers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters: </strong>Should consumers find it difficult to get items, even the greatest ones won\'t sell? Whether your target market purchases online, in-store, or both, efficient distribution guarantees that the product is available where they do<strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Selling</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Selling is the technique used to convince possible consumers of your products or services. This might call for automated sales systems, internet sales, or direct contacts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The selling process begins with an awareness of consumer wants and proving how the good satisfies a need or solves a problem. Sales techniques might call for Internet, retail, or personal selling. Many times, businesses provide extra services, including product recommendations, to help consumers make wise purchases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters: </strong>Selling is the last stage of the marketing process in which all the earlier activities unite to produce income. A fantastic product and strong marketing campaigns won\'t result in sales without a good selling plan in place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Financing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In marketing, financing is the process of obtaining money required for the development, promotion, and distribution of products. It also includes providing consumers with credit arrangements or financing schemes that simplify their purchase of the product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies have to control their money if they are to fund marketing projects properly. Providing various payment choices can assist in boosting sales since more reasonably priced goods appeal to consumers. For large-ticket purchases like electronics or vehicles, for instance, corporations may offer deferred payment choices or installment plans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why It Matters: </strong>Companies could find it difficult to apply their marketing plans without proper financing. Likewise, giving consumers financing choices will help to greatly increase sales by increasing the accessibility of items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any company\'s success depends on the <strong>7 functions of marketing</strong>—product management, marketing information management, promotion, pricing, distribution, selling, and financing—which are linked and indispensable. Every ability helps to create a link between the business and its consumers so that the correct items find the proper people at the correct price and at the appropriate time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding these marketing purposes helps companies to develop successful plans that not only satisfy consumer wants but also stimulate profitability and expansion. Long-term success depends on your ability to master these fundamental skills regardless of size—small startup or big company.<br>Keep researching related subjects or contact us, our<strong> social media optimization services </strong>can assist you in customizing these techniques to your particular objectives if you want more ideas on how to apply these marketing activities in your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/What-are-the-7-functions-of-marketing-and-explain-each.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-10 11:10:52','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(112,'Meta Provides a Comprehensive Overview of Its Social Impact Efforts','meta-provides-a-comprehensive-overview-of-its-social-impact-efforts','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta recently released its “Responsible Business Practices Report” on September 20, 2024. This report reflects their work during the 2023 Fiscal Year. It discusses many things, such as how AI is developing, how it sees the metaverse, affects the environment, connects with different sources, protects teens, and much more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The 144-page study mainly introduces AI and Meta\'s work to make AI tools easier for many people.&nbsp; Moreover, it has policies, programs, important measures, and findings that support Meta\'s responsible business strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Some of the key highlights of the report:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>AI: </strong>Meta released LLaMA, an open-source artificial intelligence model with downloads of around 170 million times. Meta also started the AI Alliance to promote responsible artificial intelligence development.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Teen Safety:</strong> It has developed initiatives to improve internet teen safety, like Lantern and Take It Down. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Human rights: </strong>Meta conducted a Human Rights Salient Risk Assessment, focusing on individuals at higher risk of vulnerability or marginalization.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Sustainability: </strong> Meta maintains net-zero emissions in its global operations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Forest restoration: </strong>Meta collaborated with Texan by Nature, the Texas Longleaf Team, and other organizations to restore 2,000 acres of longleaf pine forest.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Meta has to Say!</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Meta is moving our offerings beyond 2D screens toward immersive experiences like augmented and virtual reality to help build the metaverse, which we believe is the next evolution in social technology. All of our technologies share the vision of helping bring the metaverse to life. Across our work, we are innovating in AI technologies to build new experiences that help make our technology more social, useful and immersive.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Meta’s Commitment to Responsible AI Development</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Firstly, Meta talks about its ten years of experience working on AI development and stresses the importance of finding a balance between growth and care. The company is sure that AI will significantly help society by making things more efficient and pushing science progress forward. On the other hand, Meta thinks responsible development is significant. This means making open, answerable AI systems that have built-in safety features to reduce risks. Setting safety standards requires that governments and businesses work together. Meta\'s goal for AI is to create general intelligence, open source it in a responsible way, and make it easy for many people to use so that other businesses can also gain from its AI models.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe7SzcvJLWFJeL4UJgdqOiXXC27bWxWEoFuvUoQg6phkv6IOyERSRJgGM-j4TmH3OJNiSZrgroh2yUwY3YRcWx7Is61f-Qr2fxvi9qnAIwUf2Gc_5VstYn4GEjGVp3k4lPUHZfn1z-hL3vBoqwCjYC4mL-g?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Meta’s Core Principles in Action</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The report later talks about Meta’s core values in a more relatable way. These ideas cover providing everyone a voice, enabling people to communicate, and guaranteeing online privacy and safety. Through adverts, they hope to make their services accessible and available.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeZBTHS3Egrq2btKmTyofoMmq6k6hdnipEcR3pe5YBuexrRktYHZlhDx0UKv-DF2BhWZZY3i1Je1zyWLRseIvZ1TEpE23beVfsiysJH4LWIDKp8mL43mjT3MYVz6QxXEhHW_ktpmdJUV45yd11cVpRj8cAI?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Meta’s Commitment to Human Rights</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you continue with the report, you will find that Meta is committed to advancing its mission by upholding human rights. Their actions apply to the United Nations Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights (UNGPs). The Human Rights Policy of Meta supports their efforts using relationships with international organizations. Moreover they guarantee the responsible application of human rights across their business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXczDy3e0bONbsTT7_jZpprzaCh71s7yOCQbi7W8YDkK1pe5BJm9S3XpRNrq-jxtfen-7McWugiyou6Uv9r5tlPD8PugOq_g_F1uEnxeLeFxm4zzOcwHXXsBGfxGA930j_HlvGpSxp_vfuij7Cl0om12Y2gm?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Meta is Tackling Climate Change?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta knows climate change is a big problem and is trying to improve things for the Earth. They are dedicated to making communities healthy and more robust. Meta works with groups like Yale to determine what people think and feel about climate change. They look at what millions think to determine what makes people act. This helps them make better policies and programs that can make the changes needed to protect the earth for the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdrWnMI1idleHUm7a4tyqtonVycgmVM5VHS6czz4K3Vnbk4gBdwO8383pjcsLxb3I1Dbpx7_M-hVUjzWX6zcDrSijzcmYeq-9Ny04yiKFukIPDo7RyeC-nruEkCTLzFt1uRNer1c077bxF7cpX2KACYGOWZ?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Meta\'s Efforts to Reduce Their 2023 Carbon Footprint</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the report, Meta is showing its carbon footprint for 2023, which adds up to 7.5 million metric tons of CO₂. About 99% of this comes from things like buying things and services. Also, they have taken steps to lessen their effect by eliminating 53,050 tonnes of CO2 to balance out the emissions they make directly. Finally, it shows that Meta is trying to leave less of an impact on the earth and fight climate change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfUbUkCAbvVyxInFf6ZhOHGqmfwMQBNkrOd4yoPTmSlmxFn3Oa0w4VIFFuG0u2aMR6z7f1uwPzzEtl1hsVi3HK0gicF0J0tOJk7EU96137l71RY9qHiMhG4k_UFU-sOCVQyiUe_Q0ydpSKepQbIwjsLZgpf?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How is Meta Making the Internet Safer for Teens?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The report also showcases how Meta is focused on creating a safe online space for teens. It\'s no surprise that Meta has made more than 50 tools to help teenagers use their platforms safely and appropriately. These tools have great features, such as parental settings, age verification, and secret accounts created automatically for users under 16.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta also sends youngsters reminders to take breaks and works hard to stop the exploitation of children. To ensure their sites are safe for young users, they also work with professionals who study mental health and how individuals act online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcE1ZtHC9375A8U0MWg-jQwFsMYtGSpWNyULmPHf5_a2dTNJzOWTKolQFb0u7T4d5zTqEc4iHvGH61AfDxGaLc-B6QDpqd7WdfmSZdxOHfY8eZdPJ3UtWzOZlua1E6Mft9EFLjMy2CYqH6WSfiiz65ihxoR?key=iR0o2PbOKYK98f0fCvJXNg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All the above points are a few highlights from Meta’s “Responsible Business Practices Report.” The 144-page document goes into more detail about their projects, strategies, and relationships. It shows how they work to make the internet safer, promote human rights, encourage responsible growth, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta\'s Responsible Business Practices Report presents a thorough view of how the business uses its enormous resources and worldwide influence to propel good changes. From artificial intelligence research and teen safety to human rights and environmental sustainability, Meta\'s activities show a dedication to being a good corporate citizen.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though Meta\'s path towards ethical business practices is far from over, the development shown in its most recent report gives optimism for a time when social good will coexist with technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Meta-Provides-a-Comprehensive-Overview-of-Its-Social-Impact-Efforts.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-02 05:50:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(113,'Google Removes Cache Feature From Search Results','google-removes-cache-feature-from-search-results','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are all Google cached results gone? Yes, cache links have existed since Google\'s beginning but have now been formally erased. Google recently made a huge change to its search results by removing the Cache feature, which has long been useful for users and SEO professionals. In this blog, learn why Google decided to remove cached results and the repercussions of this decision.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Facts</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The cache feature was removed on September 24, 2024. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The last major update to this feature occurred on September 11, 2024, when Google added links to the Internet Archive. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The affected groups include the general public, SEO professionals, and researchers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google stated that the removal was due to the improved reliability of web page loading.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Back in January 2024, Google stirred things up by removing the cache link from search results, marking the start of the end for the cache feature we all used to rely on. At present, the cache operator has officially been put to rest, just nine months after that initial change.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Danny Sullivan, Google’s Search Liaison, acknowledged the sentimental value of the cache feature but noted that with the way the web has evolved, it was time to say goodbye. Now, users will have to turn to other tools, like the URL Inspection tool in Google Search Console, to see how Google views their pages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Google’s Cache Feature?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s Cache feature provides a backup of a webpage, capturing its raw HTML content as it appeared during one of Google\'s crawls. These backed-up pages make up the entirety of Google Cache.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may have used Google Cache to see older versions of websites that are no longer available or aren\'t loading properly. However, it can also help you solve issues with your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Does Google Remove the Cache?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Google, the internet has significantly improved over time, and most pages now load consistently and swiftly. That\'s why they concluded this functionality was superfluous.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They may provide an alternative by including a link to the Wayback Machine, a technology that allows you to see websites at various times. Search results now include this functionality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, you may see previous versions of websites using the Wayback Machine service. Seeing a page\'s progress over time is a helpful feature. Recently, Google replaced the outdated cache function in its search results with links to the Wayback Machine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Does This Impact Users?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Users can no longer use Google’s “<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\">cached</mark>” feature to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Access unavailable pages:</strong> They can’t click the “Cached” link on the Google search results page to see a saved version of a page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Get around article paywalls:</strong> Before, users could read some paywalled articles for free by using cached pages, but that option is now gone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Does This Impact SEO Professionals?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Removing this feature could impact SEO professionals who tracked changes over time, raising concerns about Google\'s focus on real-time content. The challenges SEO professionals may face:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Verifying proper indexing: </strong>They may struggle to confirm if Google has indexed their page correctly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tracking indexing dates: </strong>Without the cached version’s timestamp, they can’t see when Google last indexed their page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Conducting competitor analysis: </strong>They may find it harder to compare a competitor\'s live page with its cached version, especially if that competitor has recently improved their rankings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Detecting misleading cloaking practices: </strong>If a website owner shows search engines one version of a page while presenting users with a different one, Google’s cached version could help reveal this trick by showing what the search engine saw during indexing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To bridge the void created by the deletion of the cache, Google has moved to offer substitute options:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google stated on September 11, 2024, that its \"About this result\" box now includes links to earlier versions of webpages from the Internet Archive\'s Wayback Machine.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With this change, users can quickly access older versions of websites, which will be very helpful for research.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Changes to Google Cache Feature</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First, the “cache:” search operator is no longer functional in Google Search. Therefore, users can no longer retrieve cached versions of web pages using this command.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>URLs from “webcache.googleusercontent.com”, which were once used to access cached pages directly, now redirect users to search results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, Google has updated its documentation to eliminate all references to the cache feature. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Alternatives to Google Cached Pages</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You have other options besides Google\'s \"cached\" function to access older versions of pages. Here are a few alternatives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>URL Inspection Tool</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The URL Inspection Tool is a search console from Google (GSC) tool that provides information about your site\'s Google-indexed pages. This information contains:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The time and date that Google last crawled the page</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If the page might be indexed by Google</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The page as seen by Google during its indexing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offers more precise information about how Google indexed a page than Google\'s cached pages.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rich Results Test Tool</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s Rich Results Test tool allows you to live-test a page for rich results, which are special content that makes it stand out on the SERP. URL Inspection tool and Rich Results test tool are somewhat similar. However, below are the features that set Rich Results Test Tool apart:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Crawls live URLs of pages in real-time. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You have the option to verify any webpage URL through the Rich Results Test tool. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Other Search Engines\' Caches</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search engines such as Bing and Yahoo! continue to offer the ability to access cached versions of websites. Users can see these caches by searching for the page on these platforms and choosing the cached version from the search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Wayback Machine</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wayback Machine is an online archive of pages that appeared on various dates, and the Internet Archive owns it. Users may view how pages appeared at different times by using it as a historical record of the internet. And monitor any modifications to them over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Search engine caches, whether maintained by Google or not, only provide access to a single historical version of a page, which is its appearance at the time of the previous cache update.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, Google is always up to something new. It is sad to say goodbye to Google’s cache feature, which has been one of the oldest tools in its arsenal. However, with different alternatives available for its various functions—be it the URL Inspection Tool or the Rich Results Test Tool for checking website performance, or the Wayback Machine to access archived pages if you are having trouble loading sites—we have options to explore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to stay updated with similar news and information, follow us, as we will keep you informed about the latest trends and updates in the digital landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Google-Removes-Cache-Feature-From-Search-Results-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-10-01 12:21:42','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(114,'Meta Launches New Developer Hubs To Facilitate External Projects','meta-launches-new-developer-hubs-to-facilitate-external-projects','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In September 2024, Meta announced that developers can now easily access content, resources, and platforms through the Meta for Developers hub and revamped centers for Meta Horizon and Social technologies. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What you need to know about Meta’s latest initiative:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta has revised its developer resources, which now fall into three categories, to provide system builders with more targeted help and direction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Meta Horizon – </strong>For those building immersive experiences for Meta Quest and Meta Horizon OS platforms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Social technologies – </strong>Incorporating Facebook, Messenger, Instagram, WhatsApp, Threads, and enhancing cross-platform social integrations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>AI –</strong> Insights into Meta’s rapidly evolving AI platforms and how external developers can effectively utilize Meta’s AI tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are Meta’s Developer Hubs?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta’s Developer Hubs are comprehensive platforms designed to provide developers with the resources to build, innovate, and integrate solutions using Meta’s wide array of tools and technologies. These centers are a component of Meta\'s more significant effort to allow outside developers to use its technologies more efficiently, generating fresh creative possibilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From artificial intelligence technologies and machine learning to augmented reality (AR), virtual reality (VR), and even e-commerce, every hub caters to particular facets of development. The concept is to establish a centralized area where developers may locate whatever they need—from community forums, documentation, and APIs to troubleshooting help<strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Meta has to say?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Our goal with the new Meta for Developer marketing hub and revamped developer centers is to help developers build successfully for their future and grow their business globally with Meta by leveraging our industry-leading and open technologies and a vast ecosystem of tools and tailored solutions.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta constantly adds new platforms to help developers access and use its tools. For example, Meta is creating separate areas for its VR, AR, and AI tools, which will make it easier for developers to find and use these technologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are big changes for developers. Also, Meta\'s augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) experiences are changing quickly, and the company is also making progress on its artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure, with many parts of it being made public. Meta provides clearly defined developer hubs to make it easier for outside developers to find the right resources and use its tools more effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an essential part of Meta\'s plan for long-term growth. Meta\'s tools will become more critical as more developers build on them. Furthermore, this is especially true as VR and AR become more popular. As these technologies become more popular in the future, letting outside developers build on Meta\'s foundation will be very important for its continued growth and power in the tech world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Meta’s Developer Hubs Matter for External Projects</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the hardest things for developers working on external&nbsp; projects is getting the right tools and information to build well. Thus, Meta\'s Developer Hubs are meant to solve this by aggregating all the elements into one location. But why should this concern you as a developer, and how may these hubs support your outside initiatives?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Access to Industry-Leading Technologies</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, Meta\'s platform has long been a leader in AR, VR, and AI, and now it\'s open to developers to use these tools. Additionally, developers may access innovative technologies through the Developer Hubs. For instance, Meta\'s Spark AR platform, which allows developers to build AR effects for Facebook and Instagram, is now fully accessible through the hub.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Ecosystem of Tools and Support</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meta\'s new hubs provide a comprehensive ecosystem supporting your project from inception to conclusion, not only about offering tools. You never travel the development road alone with a strong support system covering documentation, community forums, and direct developer help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Global Growth Opportunities</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The possibility of the worldwide development of Meta\'s Developer Hubs is among its most fascinating features. In fact, Meta has a huge user base—billions of individuals connect across its platforms daily. This gives a developer an unmatched chance to create for a worldwide market. Whether you\'re developing a VR experience for the Oculus platform or an AR filter for Instagram, Meta\'s hubs provide the necessary tools. Also, they offer the assistance needed to grow your project worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Collaboration and Innovation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The new hubs also support cooperation and creativity, in addition to providing developers with tools. By using the hubs, developers may interact, exchange ideas, and even engage in project cooperation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Get Started with Meta’s Developer Hubs?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The process is straightforward if you\'re ready to start working on your next project. You may start like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firstly, visit the official Meta Developer Hub website for resources, documentation, and everything you need to get started.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"252px\",\"height\":\"auto\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfYuyYQAf2BKbSVeObOwfgVHe7y06ijR97m1ZIzS-4x4YKq-zaZvnwSsMH8FdgcYvWNg_QLtUF5NwCt1eOAYRxd4_fREGrvy34nr2xE4zRvoqtNzNU8f2ozwNzYVnGXZIaL9pdkkWE0VGgojun1f2U2F_Qy?key=AABzUhpv12Z6GyVLofyfLg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:252px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Secondly, Meta offers various platforms for work, including AR, VR, artificial intelligence, and more. Choose the platform suitable for your project objectives.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, explore the Resources by using Meta\'s extensive community forums, tutorials, and documentation. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, become a member of the Community. Join Meta\'s developer community to ask questions, exchange ideas, and work with other developers. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What’s Next?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can conclude that “Meta is always focused on empowering developers.” The Meta developer platform team will continue improving the developer hub and centers. This will enhance the overall experience for all developers working with Meta technologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Developers can check out the new Meta for Developers hub on the official Meta website. For the latest news and insights, visit our blog section to stay updated and informed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Meta-Launches-New-Developer-Hubs-To-Facilitate-External-Projects.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-27 07:26:16','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(115,'How to Use Hashtags Effectively on Social Media?','how-to-use-hashtags-effectively-on-social-media','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Whether you are a marketer, content producer, or business owner, knowing what a hashtag is and its importance is absolutely vital. Hashtags increase the exposure and reach of your works. Therefore, it is quite important to know how to properly include them into your work. Continue reading and learn to use hashtags to reach a broader audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hashtags group together pieces of content that are similar, making it easier for people to find relevant posts on social media sites.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A hashtag is useful because it makes content more visible and searchable and reaches more people.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Different social media platforms, including Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, etc., use different guidelines for using hashtags.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use relevant and <strong>good hashtags for instagram</strong> to increase brand visibility and reach more people globally.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learning<strong> how to use hashtags </strong>in social media is essential for marketing professionals and those entering the field. According to a RadiumOne study, 75% of social media users use hashtags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hashtags boost brand awareness and engagement on social media. Hashtags, also known as the pound sign (#), help captive audiences find your content. First popular on Twitter (now X), hashtags are now used on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and Threads as ‘tags’. Many hashtags now serve as search engines for information and questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is a Hashtag?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A hashtag is made up of a pound sign (#) and a string of letters or numbers that link together groups of similar online content. On most social media sites, people put hashtags in the written content, caption, or text of a post. Moreover, adding a hashtag to your post helps people find it by grouping it with similar content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Significance of a Hashtag</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>significance of a hashtag</strong> in social media is crucial, as it helps organize and categorize content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hashtags help label and find niche social media content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>They make all your content searchable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>They also help social media users find and interact with content about common interests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Finally, they help content reach more people and be discovered globally.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use Hashtags for Your Social Media Posts?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These simple, followable hashtag use rules will help you make sure you use hashtags most effectively and maximize the outcomes of your social media marketing initiatives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Keep it Simple</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The social media universe abounds with hashtags. Most likely, using a long and difficult-to-spell or pronounce hashtag will not help you. But, a generic, never-used, or confusing hashtag will also not produce the desired outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your hashtag should be simple to spell, short, and exact. It should provide your readers with a clear concept of conversational topics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The secret is determining subjects pertinent to your readership. Therefore, you have to locate the hashtags that fit your business and material, which are already under discussion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Use Popular Hashtags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Trending hashtags are popular hashtags that are currently popular or most talked about at a specific time, often centered on major news topics in industries. Engaging with trending hashtags in content updates can reach a larger audience and increase a brand\'s visibility. However, it\'s crucial to add value to your posts to avoid being ignored.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Avoid Excessive Hashtags</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media strategy requires hashtags. They increase brand exposure so you can reach a huge audience with your product. Each social media platform has its hashtag strategy, and crossing it may reduce engagement.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Avoid using more than 2 hashtags per tweet due to character count restrictions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use two popular and one custom hashtag on Facebook.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keep Instagram hashtags to 9 per post for better engagement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limit LinkedIn hashtags to 5 to avoid spamming by LinkedIn Algorithm.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use 2 hashtags on Pinterest for relevant content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use 4-5 hashtags on TikTok for increased reach.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Make Sure a Hashtag is Relevant</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Check the social media platform to make sure your hashtag isn\'t misused. Choose a hashtag that won\'t be taken negatively or used by another brand for advertising.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After following hashtag best practices, online interaction, brand awareness, and sales increase, therefore, consider your audience when choosing hashtags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ask others if they use it and what they say.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, tweeting with a negative hashtag may not be the best way to stand out.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Furthermore, researching and avoiding unknown mistakes is smarter.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Be Specific</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During special events and Twitter chats, marketers use hashtags to reach their community. Use unique hashtags to engage the audience and get others to join the conversation. You can\'t expect retweets with generic hashtags like #marketing or #digitalmarketing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Boost Brand Interaction</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hashtags have the amazing power to link your brand with many well-known and very visible subjects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, using the correct hashtags will let you interact with new viewers who find your social media page. Careful use of hashtags helps you increase customer relations and reach targeted consumers. Your followers will interact with you more likely on social media, and they will feel more at ease with your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, including keywords inside your hashtags will not improve your online profile. Your hashtags should be original and conversational. Enhancing your brand\'s social media marketing strategy depends critically on the efficient use of hashtags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Find Effective Hashtags Through Influencers?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There\'s a difference between general hashtags and complicated or unfindable ones. Thus, start by studying hashtags used by influencers in your niche to find effective ones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re new to a niche, you probably know which influencers are attracting your audience. But how can you find them if you\'re focusing on other tasks?<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencers are the most respected and considered in a specific market segment. These people include famous bloggers, YouTubers, and celebrities. Use a great database of B2B influencers to create marketing impact, but make sure they\'re relevant to what you do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use Hashtags Across Social Media Platforms?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Hashtags on X (Twitter)</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using relevant hashtags on X (formerly Twitter) can boost engagement if done sparingly. One or two hashtags per tweet is fine. Consequently, using two hashtags and asking followers to retweet can increase engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, Hashtags on X make your post searchable. It can help you find conversations to join. Explore trending hashtags for more platform impact. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img width=\"621\" height=\"459\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfd-kO6_F4GCDx7t1NjclBKMvmmXCRoY_p0kM8hWZnuLakwz8R-INOfyHTiZCEUGp-HYpM0V_1MJAqsrnvFHeI73ncKwm6n4Y5URDPaoXq-TPe9RXErEf4Z596z5VfikYXyl8sLuODEhb5g-VLpHg?key=RVWwxYoiefavTod_zmW3lg\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2 . <strong>Hashtags on Instagram</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Good hashtags for Instagram </strong>boost reach and engagement. Therefore, to reach the most people, use up to 10 or 11 relevant and popular hashtags for Instagram Stories or Reels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Specifically, popular, location, niche, content-related, and branded hashtags work well on Instagram.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Regular Instagram posts can have 30 hashtags. You probably don\'t need that many, but knowing that more is okay lets you experiment. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img width=\"642\" height=\"435\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcnQ69Lew_Bfo8J7Xodp5vzLJsmydr2TR0GGVrz9nK6PT-LIGlsmXvBYhZKB4J5or4F6us4ypxLQGScq-MVpkoTcMIhCzcn5Yj4urNuYP6kknefTfQK7GMOJ6hCKQIpxKPEaqpziS4ryagyztlW?key=RVWwxYoiefavTod_zmW3lg\"></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. <strong>Hashtags on Facebook</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook posts can benefit from using hashtags to increase organic reach, but they are less popular than other channels. It\'s recommended to use only one or two hashtags, as more can appear unprofessional and bother readers. Relevant hashtags can be found by typing a keyword into the search bar. Reposting top-performing posts with relevant hashtags can also attract new followers interested in your product or service. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img width=\"350\" height=\"436\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcm0gL0LCdn6mVYhGJCHrSSZ1k2zjao7GtRGtWQu-1UMnKxun6Be62nEjNPpdM6sJyiNmDoKWHjcd5G9qZUfnHP-ZfsDJsVNo0zRGQtD9XDuj-4f1-is9ZSxHv-YonD-_nVBPkrVWJV8x-xnPH0?key=RVWwxYoiefavTod_zmW3lg\"></strong> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The common question you may come across is:<strong> how to add hashtags to reels after posting on Facebook? </strong>Here’s how you can follow the steps to add hashtags to a Facebook Reel after posting:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firstly, go to the posted Reel on your Facebook page,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Then, click on the three dots in the top right corner,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>select \"<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\">Edit Post</mark>,\"&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add your hashtags in the caption field before hitting \"<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\">Save</mark>.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. <strong>Hashtags on TikTok</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>TikTokers categorize videos with hashtags. Consequently, your video will appear alongside other relevant videos with these clickable hashtags. Hashtags on TikTok, like other social media platforms, increase reach and help the algorithm choose which users see your content on the ‘For You’ page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, TikTok captions are limited to 4,000 characters, so experiment with hashtags. Mix popular and niche hashtags to maximize reach. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><img width=\"556\" height=\"581\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe_O6ZpceZBlkyIqidEVcVdwbIc_1gKdOEIwjjlwqJraR3XC5e--1V33BrLe28H_TOdkOFOw87PDRDA6LTBqcIccOEwlX103jw8YqHO3CpowTPTspacGMTbiUjeA62CtJSsevChM2UaswdJ3Xl7?key=RVWwxYoiefavTod_zmW3lg\"></strong> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Research Tools for Finding Hashtags</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Other research tools are designed for the specific purpose of refining information related to hashtags. Therefore, check out these tools to assist you in finding successful hashtags within your particular niche.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>RiteTag: </strong>The instant hashtag suggestions that RiteTag provides are available for real-time engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Hashtagify.me: </strong>It is a tool that gives you the ability to search for the popularity of hashtags as well as trends with them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keyhole: </strong>The search function that Keyhole offers is completely free, and it also provides you with real-time data on a variety of different factors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Copyai: </strong>Copyai\'s hashtag generator employs artificial intelligence to generate hashtags on your social media posts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Hashtagforlikes: </strong>It is a tool that searches for live statistics in order to assist you in creating campaigns for Instagram and TikTok social media platforms. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/6-necessary-kpis-for-your-influencer-marketing-campaign/\"><strong>6 necessary KPIs for Your Influencer Marketing Campaign  </strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-do-paid-social-ads-competitor-analysis/\"><strong>How To Do Paid Social Ads Competitor Analysis?</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you now have an understanding of What is a Hashtag and how you can use it to enhance your social media strategy?<br>No matter how long you\'ve been using social media or if you\'re new to it, our <strong>SMO services </strong>will help you get good at all of them. Specifically, from Instagram and Facebook to YouTube and TikTok, we can help you get more people to interact with you and reach more people.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/How-to-Use-Hashtags-Effectively-on-Social-Media.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-25 06:19:17','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(116,'6 necessary KPIs for Your Influencer Marketing Campaign','6-necessary-kpis-for-your-influencer-marketing-campaign','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are you getting ready for an influencer marketing campaign? Then, give these important KPIs top priority: ROI, engagement rate, brand awareness, referral traffic, conversions, and click-through rate. Understand why knowing KPIs is so important for your success and how the correct tools will help you to improve it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Around 50% of consumers rely on influencers before they make a purchasing decision.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It is important to remember that influencer campaigns should generate more revenue than costs because ROI matters.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Public Awareness as a KPI</strong> can greatly enhance how well your brand is known.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, if you find out which influencers work best for you, you can keep working with them. This helps build strong brand ambassadors and loyal customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Awario, HypeAuditor, and Affable.ai are among the best influencer marketing campaign tools that will make your analyzing process easier.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to the Influencer Marketing Benchmark Report 2024, there has been a huge rise in influencer campaigns. By the end of the year, the industry will have grown to an amazing $24 billion! Influencer marketing is clearly booming and full of potential since 85% of people who tried it found it useful, and 60% increased their budgets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencer marketing can now be used to promote almost anything and reach your target audience. This is especially true now that AI has made it easier to find and work with the right influencer for your<strong> KPI goals for influencer marketing campaigns</strong> and optimize strategy on different platforms ( Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, etc.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>KPIs can draw on industry standards or campaign performance from past efforts. Measuring your return on investment (ROI) will define success for any marketing campaign, just as for any other one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is an Influencer Marketing Campaign?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A brand and an influencer work together on an influencer marketing campaign to get the influencer\'s followers to buy a product or use a service. Individuals with a sizable social media following who are trusted by their followers are known as influencers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some examples of influencer marketing campaigns include:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Giveaways and contests: </strong>You can give away free stuff or services at a discount.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Product collaborations: </strong>It can include unboxing videos, reviews, and content before the product comes out.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the key KPI goals for influencer marketing campaigns?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You should consider <strong>KPI goals for influencer marketing campaigns</strong> before setting your KPIs. Think about what you want to get before you hire an influencer. What did you get out of your last influencer campaign? Would you like to change anything to make it work better?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your influencer campaign\'s strategy, content, and channel will be based on your main goals, so give them some thought. So, do you want to raise your brand awareness, get more leads and conversions, or make more sales?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It would help if you also thought about your social media platform. How does your brand get people to interact with it? What platform do the people you want to reach use? Where are your successes coming from, whether they\'re free or paid?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Top KPIs for Measuring Influencer Marketing Campaign Success</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Return on investment (ROI)</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most important KPIs for any marketing campaign is the return on investment (ROI), which measures how profitable the campaign is. This metric not only shows that the campaign was successful, but it also gives you the power to run another one!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The goal is to get a positive ROI, which means that your income must be higher than your costs, such as the cost of your influencer and any other expenses that come with them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember that ROI isn\'t always about \"profit.\" Earned Media Value (EMV) is another metric that marketers like to use to figure out how much money influencer campaigns make.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to ROI, Facebook and Instagram tend to provide strong ROI for business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The formula to calculate the return on investment (ROI) for an influencer marketing campaign is:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\">ROI = (Revenue Generated - Total campaign cost) / Total campaign cost&nbsp;</mark></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Engagement rate</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engagement is another important KPI because it shows how your campaign was received. Traffic and reach show how many people saw your content, but audience and engagement show how well it was received.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Engagement is important because it shows how well your campaign is reaching your audience, how relevant you are, and how loyal your customers will be.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, most experts agree that a rate of engagement of 1% to 5% is good for campaigns. This means that for every hundred times your message is seen, people will interact with it at least one to five times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Formula, i.e., generally used to calculate engagement rate by post:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\">ER (%)</mark></strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\"><strong> = (Total engagements on a post / Total followers) * 100%</strong></mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color\">Average ER (%) </mark></strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-green-cyan-color\"><strong>= ER (%) / Total Posts</strong></mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Brand awareness and Public Awareness as a KPI&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencers can boost brand awareness by reaching a large audience. You need to start here to increase brand awareness and build relationships.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Brand awareness KPIs</strong>,<strong> </strong>like sentiment and reach, are top-of-funnel metrics that reveal how your brand is perceived. Even if influencers have smaller followings, their audience should be genuinely interested in your product, making them valuable for smaller brands or niche industries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Track impression data on your campaign-specific blog posts, social posts, videos, and other content. GA4 and social media analytics can help.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Referral traffic</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Traffic is a key part of any online marketing plan because it tells you how many people are actually seeing your content.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you look at traffic, you can get a good idea of how far the campaign reached and how well it did overall.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, if you see a rise in traffic without a corresponding increase in conversions, it suggests that there might be an issue on the page. You might need to adjust your landing page or experiment with A/B testing for content or call-to-action buttons to determine what resonates best with your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some traffic metrics you can monitor:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Number of new visitors</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Total sessions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sources of referral traffic</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Total page views</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average time spent on site</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Conversions</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to the Influencer Marketing Benchmark Report 2024, 56% of the main purpose of running influencer campaigns is to create User Generated Content (UGC). UGC can enhance brand trust and influence purchasing decisions, which indirectly supports conversion goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We marketers know that the main goal of any campaign is to get more sales and growth.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To easily see how the influencer marketing campaign led to conversions, keep track of sales before, during, and after the campaign. Then, look at how sales changed while the campaign was going on.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Setting up promo codes, affiliate links, UTM parameters, landing pages, and link tracking for the campaign will give you a more advanced method. This will help you keep track of where customers who bought during the campaign came from.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Click-through-rate</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CTR keeps track of how many times a possible customer clicks on a link. Additionally, Google Campaign Manager lets you create your own links for influencer marketing campaigns. Track how well each influencer is doing by giving them their unique link. Test which Instagram Stories, ads, and bio links work best by making your own.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tracking CTR is very important. Customers may not be interested in what you have to offer if they aren\'t visiting your website. Moreover, a high CTR brings more people to a website, which lowers the sales funnel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Low CTR could be because of bad design. Images are very important for Instagram and other social media campaigns. Therefore, make appealing campaign ads with the help of apps or professionals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits Of Measuring KPIs For Your Influencer Campaign</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The vital advantages of knowing KPIs for your influencer campaign:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Improves performance tracking and return on investment (ROI) analysis.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>KPIs should be set at the start of your creator collaboration to assess marketing performance accurately. This includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Counting the campaign\'s number of followers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Assessing your brand\'s engagement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Calculating the partnership\'s revenue.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Brand awareness KPIs</strong> help you make data-driven marketing decisions that affect your brand\'s reach, reputation, and bottom line.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Helps you improve influencer campaigns and work with the best influencers.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are two key reasons why your influencer campaign might not be delivering results: either your content isn’t resonating with the audience, or you’re working with influencers who don’t align with your brand values.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, if you run a fitness brand and your influencers post content about fad diets or unrealistic workout routines, your campaigns are unlikely to connect with your audience. Measuring KPIs like engagement, impressions, and audience insights helps fine-tune your approach, ensuring you collaborate with influencers who resonate with your brand’s mission.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Allows you to compare and measure influencers against each other.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By keeping track of KPIs, you can compare and contrast how well different influencer marketing campaigns are working. Also, tracking and analyzing data from many campaigns helps you find patterns, trends, and the best ways to do things that get great results.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Handy Tools for Influencer Analytics</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even the most dedicated marketer would need help analyzing each influencer\'s performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Awario</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Awario keeps track of reach, number of mentions, and share of voice. A list of the influencers and posts that mentioned your brand the most and got the most views is also possible through this tool.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can set up alerts for keywords related to your brand name. This will give you a mention feed with social media posts about your brand that you can sort by date, platform, hashtags, and other factors. Amazingly, you can also keep an eye on how often people post.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>HypeAuditor</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This app helps you discover Instagram, YouTube, and TikTok influencers that fit your marketing campaigns well. You can look for influencers who know your brand or whose followers are like the ones you want to reach. Consequently, you can also look for experts in a niche who make real content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Affable.ai.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Affable.ai is a marketing platform that lets you check out the influencers on your list of possible business partners. It works for people with many followers on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, Twitter, YouTube, and more. Their age, location, number of followers, language, and other things can be found. It can also create, improve, and run campaigns with influencers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>GRIN</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most detailed information about how well a social post works can be found in GRIN. It looks at things like clicks, engagement rate, and conversions. This information will help you determine whether your campaign with influencers worked.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GRIN can also check your marketing campaigns\' budget, revenue, conversions, and media value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Emplifi.io</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Emplifi.io is an AI-powered tool that makes it easier to manage and analyze your social media audience. This platform has many functions, such as looking at each follower and influencer profile and giving you marketing campaign ideas and strategies. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-purple-color\"><strong>Also Read:- </strong> </mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-use-hashtags-effectively-on-social-media/\"><strong>How to Use Hashtags Effectively on Social Media?  </strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-to-do-paid-social-ads-competitor-analysis/\"><strong>How To Do Paid Social Ads Competitor Analysis?</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Optimize Your KPIs with Effective SMO Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ever thought influencer marketing was just about handing out freebies? There\'s more to it! It\'s a great way to connect with your audience and drive genuine results. If you’re ready to make your campaigns work harder for you, our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\"><strong>SMO service</strong></a> is here to help turn those efforts into real success!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/kpi-goals-for-influencer-marketing-campaignc.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-23 13:29:05','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(117,'How To Do Paid Social Ads Competitor Analysis?','how-to-do-paid-social-ads-competitor-analysis','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are your social media ads falling short, leaving you behind the competition? Wondering what your competitors are doing that makes their ads more successful? If yes, it’s time for a <strong>social media ads competitor analysis</strong>. Learn how to conduct this analysis across various platforms and why it\'s essential for your brand’s success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can make better ads for your brand by looking at the ads that other companies are running.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Avoid making the same mistakes over and over again by analyzing your competitors. This will save you time and effort.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Knowing what your competitors do will help you figure out what your customers really want.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, analysis of competitors’ ads keeps you up to date on trends and gives you ideas for new projects.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When was your most recent competitor check? Are they on anything fresh? What tactics are they employing for their marketing efforts? Ignoring the activities of your competitor runs the danger of lagging. Social media advertising is the second largest segment of digital advertising, and with 26.8% of internet users aged 16 to 64 discovering products and services through social media ads, conducting a competitor ads analysis is crucial to gaining an edge over them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to <strong>paid social ads competitor analysis</strong>, it\'s important to be proactive, not just reactive, for your business to succeed.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is social ads competitor analysis?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social ads competitor analysis is the process of studying your competitors\' ads on social media to understand what works for them. By looking at their best ads, you can learn about their strategies, the kinds of ads their audience likes, and the messages they use. As a result, you can make ads for your own brand that work better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The importance of competitive analysis in advertising</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need to learn and change faster than your competitors if you want to beat them and become the best in your field. By looking at the ads of your competitors, you can make your products, services, and marketing plans better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Getting to know and understanding the advertising strategies of your competitors can help you make your brand stand out from others.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, you can use a competitor\'s ads analysis to see what works and what doesn\'t in your ads. Afterward, you can make a better plan. The regular review of this process lets you keep up with changes in the market and new players to watch out for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Following are the benefits of <strong>social media ads competitor analysis</strong>:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shows the keywords rivals are focussing on and their expenditure levels. Finding PPC campaign gaps for your clients finally helps them save money.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Helps your agency modify marketing standards to identify chances to improve the strategy of your client.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Consequently, it shows how to present your client\'s company to grab their interest with ideas, changes, and new trends.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, understanding the ad copy and creative approach of your competitors gives your clients a competitive edge. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Research Your Competitor’s Ads on Social Platforms?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Identifying Your Competition</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before you can do a <strong>competitor analysis for social ads </strong>, you need to know who your competitors are.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t skip this step, even if you\'re a well-known company that knows a lot about your competitors. New companies that move into or grow into an industry all the time could now be competitors.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can use what your sales and marketing teams already know about competitors to find them, but some great tools can help. For instance, SEMRush lets you look into ads, and Google Ads Auction Insights enables you to compare the performance of your ads, bidding strategy, and campaign to those of your competitors.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Discover Competitor Ads on Facebook</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A Facebook feature called Facebook Ads Library lets you see not only the ads that a page is running on Facebook but also the ads that are showing up on Instagram, Messenger, and Facebook\'s Audience Network, which is where ads show up on news websites and apps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Visit Facebook Ads Library.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose location, category, and keywords. You can use brand names as keywords to find ads from competitors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>For example, enter “Canada,” “All Ads,” and “Hootsuite” to see Hootsuite\'s Canadian ads. View all Hootsuite ads in Canada from the past 7 years, including date, type, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Ads Library allows users to view their competitors\' ads, including their timing, location, and messaging approach. Users can apply filters to search for specific media types. Furthermore, the report feature helps filter ads focusing on politics, elections, or social issues by advertiser, spending amount, or geographical location. Also, users can filter ads by location to see how direct competitors are promoting their products to target audiences, but this filter is only available by country.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Explore Competitor Ads on Instagram</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An Instagram study found that 81% of respondents used Instagram to research products and services. Therefore, don\'t you want them to find your business over a competitor\'s? Create an amazing ad to attract Instagram\'s 1 billion monthly active users and grow your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The Instagram app offers a Meta Ad Library. The Ad Library displays all Instagram and Facebook ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To view a competitor\'s Instagram ad, tap the three dots in the upper-right corner, select “About This Account,” and tap “Active Ads” to access the account\'s ad library.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tap the magnifying glass icon in the app, enter a competitor\'s name, and visit the business\'s Instagram account to search directly. Click “<strong>About This Account</strong>” and then “<strong>Active Ads</strong>” to view the company’s ads in the Meta Ad Library. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Primarily, check their ad placement and what type of media they’re creating.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Analyze Competitor Ads on TikTok</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Maybe the toughest thing to do is search competitor ads on TikTok. Though difficult to find and well hidden, TikTok Ads are not cause for concern. Here are the guidelines you should apply:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Begin with TikTok Creative Centre.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Visit the top right menu, select “Campaign Inspiration,” and click “Top Ads Dashboard.”</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>This section lets you search by Country, Industry, Campaign Objective, and other filters.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can also search for \"caption keywords\" to see how many ads target a specific audience in your country for a product.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you can\'t find what you\'re looking for in the TikTok Ads Library, consider the following: The advertiser might not be running ads or targeting your region, or your search filters may not align with any active ads. Additionally, political or election-related ads are excluded, and ads that are too recent might not appear, as the library data can take up to 24 hours to update.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Review Competitor Ads on LinkedIn</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To track competitor LinkedIn ads, start by visiting their page. Then, access their Posts section to view their current ads. For a broader perspective, scroll down to check out older ads they’ve run.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, to understand ad engagement, copy the ad\'s URL and view likes, comments, and shares to determine which ads resonate best with the audience. This process helps you track and manage your competitor\'s LinkedIn presence effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Search Competitor Ads on X (Twitter)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Twitter Ads Transparency Centre is a useful tool that you can use to look into your competitors\' ads. The ads transparency center can help you because it can show you how many ads are run by country or industry. However, it doesn\'t show you the exact ads that your competitors are running.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Role of SMO services in competitor analysis for social ads&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You\'ll probably be wondering how to apply the time spent researching the ads of your competitors on social media platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fortunately, the best way to improve your social media marketing is to look at the ads that your competitors are running and copy those. Specifically, those strategies can be used in your own ads if you see some similarities between their best ones. Consequently, the longer you spend testing your ad campaigns, the less time this research will save you by the end. Through <strong>paid social ads competitor analysis</strong>, you can learn more about what makes a good ad that gets people to click on it. <br>Moreover, through detailed insights into ad performance, audience engagement, and trending content, our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">SMO services</a></strong> allow you to identify what’s working for your competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/How-To-Do-Paid-Social-Ads-Competitor-Analysis.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-20 11:22:32','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(118,'Top 10 Common Mistakes in AI Writing: How to Avoid AI-Generated Content Pitfalls','common-mistakes-of-ai-writing','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Do you feel like AI-generated content lacks the human touch? You’re not alone! If you’ve noticed your content sounding robotic or generic, it might be due to <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">over<strong>-common</strong></span> AI words. This blog is here to guide you through some common pitfalls in AI writing and offer tips on infusing your content with that much-needed human flair. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI content creation has made it simple for content creators and marketers using tools like ChatGPT and Gemini to quickly and effortlessly create content. But just how accurate is the content these tools offer? 75% of consumers worry about false information from artificial intelligence, claims Forbes Advisor.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI content creation tools are transforming how we approach content research and creation. However, these advancements can quickly backfire if you’re not mindful of the <strong>common mistakes of AI writing</strong>. Despite <strong>artificial intelligence’s role in writing</strong> to enhance productivity, it fails to avoid frequent pitfalls that can derail your content strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re not careful, AI-generated material can negatively impact your audience. If you run a business, for instance, it could cause misalignment with your brand\'s voice; if you create content, it could result in an inconsistent and impersonal message. By understanding and addressing these common errors, you can maximize the benefits of AI:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Not Understanding How AI Works.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ignoring Audience and Market Needs in AI Content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Overlooking the Importance of Consistent Tone.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Relying on AI for Complete Content Creation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Using Inaccurate Prompts in AI Tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Neglecting Legal and Ethical Considerations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Failing to Confirm Content Uniqueness.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Neglecting Ongoing Updates and Adaptation for AI Tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mistake of Not Reviewing and Editing AI-Content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Overlooking Cultural and Regional Sensitivities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Not Understanding How AI Works</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First on our list of “<strong>common mistakes of AI writing</strong>” is not knowing how to use AI tools. Several AI tools can help you generate content, such as ChatGPT, Jasper, Copy.ai, Writesonic, etc. But what’s their use if you don’t know how?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don’t worry; it’s not like you have to be an expert to use a generative AI tool. Still, knowing how it works is helpful. Many people don\'t bother to learn how AI works, making it hard for them to use it effectively.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, these are a few things to remember before using AI to create content:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose the right tool.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Define your goals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Give clear instructions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Review and edit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check for errors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Ignoring Audience and Market Needs in AI Content.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s important to keep your audience and target market in mind even when you use an AI writer to write content. Every content marketing campaign has a persona or ideal customer profile that tells you how to write your content. For example, if you’re writing for top executives, you’ll want detailed and technical content. But if your audience is everyday people, keep the language simple and easy to understand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Overlooking the Importance of Consistent Tone.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another common <strong>AI art mistake</strong> is not optimizing for tone of voice and needing consistency with your brand. This is a big mistake in AI content creation as well. If you don\'t consider these important things, your content will look like it was put together without much thought.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, consider to specify, in the prompt, the particular tone you want your content to have, such as friendly, enthusiastic, informational, professional, and so on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Relying on AI for Complete Content Creation.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There’s nothing wrong if you <strong>use AI to write</strong> specific content, but the problem arises when you rely on it entirely. This means you may skip researching the topic or fail to find relevant references and statistics to support your content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, AI tools can help you save time and generate content in seconds, but they often lack the depth and creative innovation the human touch provides. However, AI tools excel at producing short-form content. For instance, you can use them to create social media posts, product descriptions, and video descriptions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, AI writing assistants are meant to make your work easier, not take it over. You might want to rely on AI to make your content, but your audience will probably notice. Also, using AI too much can make you less creative and worse at writing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Using Inaccurate Prompts in AI Tools.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want the best results from <strong>artificial intelligence in writing</strong>, enter accurate prompts. Users frequently make the mistake of not entering precise prompts, one of the most common AI mistakes we see. For the tool to better understand your requirements, it is important to enter accurate inputs, depending on the type of content you want. Following the utilization of the keywords, the tool will then search for data within its algorithms to generate the content that you desire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Neglecting Legal and Ethical Considerations.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Following certain legal and moral rules in content marketing is very important, just like in any other business. Not taking these things into account can not only hurt your search rankings but could also lead to much worse problems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you break someone else\'s copyright, plagiarize, use biased data, breach their privacy, or spread false information, it can hurt both them and your business. AI tools that make content are trained on data, and this data could be biased or false. This is why it\'s important to use a trustworthy AI content tool that gives you only original content that doesn\'t need to be attributed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you use copied content, it could hurt your search rankings right away. So make sure you use a plagiarism checker on the content that AI made before you publish it.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Failing to Confirm Content Uniqueness.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are different things that take away the uniqueness of the content if it is AI-generated. Whether it\'s the use of<strong> common AI words</strong> like \"delve,\" \"testament,\" \"realm,\" \"dynamic,\" \"elevate,\" \"tapestry,\" and \"embark,\" or over-optimizing content for search, these factors can negatively impact both your rankings and the interest of your readers.&nbsp; Therefore, make sure the content is good and that SEO basics are used correctly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Neglecting Ongoing Updates and Adaptation for AI Tools.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many company owners using artificial intelligence tools sometimes overlook that, like any program, generative AI tools also need constant learning and adaptation. One of the <strong>common mistakes of AI writing</strong> is not ensuring the tool is functioning as it should help satisfy users\' modern needs. Ignoring the need to update and optimize your AI tool might cause the tool to perform badly. Thus, ensure your tool is customized to match market trends and routinely trained on fresh datasets.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>9. Mistake of Not Reviewing and Editing AI-Content.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI tools can write content that sounds convincing on a wide range of topics. However, they often include false information, especially when the topic is technical or complicated. Another common <strong>AI art Mistake</strong> is making details look real but needing to be true to life. Refrain from believing that everything the AI writes is true! It is very important to check any numbers, claims about science, product information, or other concrete facts in the output twice.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>10. Overlooking Cultural and Regional Sensitivities.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Marketing today must prioritize diversity, equity, and inclusion. However, AI-based content creation makes these factors easy to overlook. An AI tool may not produce diverse or culturally sensitive content if not trained on diverse data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is crucial to check the content for cultural, racial, and gender bias and to avoid offending any group. Be careful that the tool doesn\'t take your text input out of context and create something negative for your brand.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong>In the end, use simple language that people can understand. It is possible to make your content less AI-driven and more human-written, but it can be hard to do. If you need help, our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing-services\"><strong>Content Marketing Services</strong></a> can help you avoid common <strong>AI art mistakes </strong>and make content that is interesting and informational to people.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Common-Mistakes-in-AI-Writing.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-16 06:44:14','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(119,'How are Shopping Ads Created?','how-are-shopping-ads-created','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>What are the steps for setting up Google Shopping campaigns and how are shopping ads made? This guide shows you how to set up Google Shopping ads from scratch, step by step. Before you start Shopping ads, you should also learn about the pre-campaign setup and how much it costs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You need to set up a Merchant Center account before you can run and manage Google Shopping ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure your shopping ads work well by connecting Google Ads and Merchant Center.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Several steps need to be taken to make a shopping ad, such as selecting the country of sale, inventory filters, ad networks, ad devices, bidding and budget, and so on.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Making a Google Ads account is free, but you\'ll have to pay to use it to promote or advertise something.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As an online store owner, you might want to advertise your goods to get more people to visit your website and buy them. And why not? Paid ads can get 50% more conversions than organic search traffic. This helps online stores increase sales and get a better return on investment (ROI). <br><strong>Google Shopping ads</strong> are a great way to get more people to see your products and attract more online shoppers. Thus, you need to use shopping ads to get good leads for your business. People who are ready to buy can find your business easily through a<strong> Google Shopping Campaign</strong>. It can also help your products get to the top of search results.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are Google Shopping Ads?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Shopping ads are perfect for online retailers to increase product visibility and sales. These ads, part of <strong>Google Shopping advertising</strong>, are more visual than text ads and are specifically designed for shoppers searching for products. Moreover, they can appear in various places, including search results, the Shopping tab, Google Images, Maps, and Google Search Partner websites. Here\'s an example of Google Shopping ads in Google Search results.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"642\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdXRItEBE_IibLHzIMyneFvYWTJZrueb3waBGnpFsZC23rfIUlzmZRtLOXEaBKfAKzeCO4xdTOYMn06hh5qL_LvilIVF9bwomUxh_m3a3hnb-jwLBjSCZ83kiELZyGhR-f1QUbCatTEqjJmxlfm_TpdHdhN?key=FcCyBbl62yygBGX8EEvQ6A\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pre-Campaign Setup for Google Shopping Ads</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Perform these three important things before you start running your Google Shopping ads to make sure your campaign works well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Sign up for a Merchant Center account</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You have to register for a Merchant Center account if you want to start with<strong> Google Shopping advertising</strong>. Additionally, you\'ll launch your shopping ads and add your items using this account.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create an account</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Visit the Google Merchant Center website</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enter Business Information</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Upload your products</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Create a shopping feed with your products</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After creating your Merchant Center account, create a shopping feed with your products. Google will display your products in paid listings using this shopping feed. You must fill out a Google spreadsheet with the following information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product ID</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product title</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Link to product</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Image link</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Price</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Link your Google Ads with the Merchant Center</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Linking your Google Ads account to your Merchant Center account marks the last step you have to finish before beginning to create Google shopping ads. Following these guidelines will help you to link these two from your Merchant Center account:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click the Tools icon.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>See Settings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click Linked profiles.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose Google advertisements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click Links accounts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enter your Google Ads client ID and send a link request.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Create Google Shopping Ads?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below are 9 crucial steps to follow for creating effective and profitable <strong>Google Shopping advertising</strong>, ensuring your Google product Ads campaign is set up for success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Create a new Shopping campaign</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To create Shopping ads on Google, start by setting up a new campaign. Here’s how to do it:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sign in to your Google Ads account.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click on \"<strong>Campaigns</strong>.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click the plus button and select \"<strong>New Campaign</strong>.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose \"<strong>Shopping</strong>\" as your campaign type.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click \"<strong>Next</strong>.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enter a descriptive name for your campaign.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, instead of naming it “<strong>Ad 1</strong>,” use a name like “Elegant Summer Dresses” to make it clear and easily identifiable. You can always change the name later if needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Choose your Merchant Center account</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After creating your campaign, select the Merchant Center account for the products you want to promote. Your Merchant Center account is already linked so that you can choose the linked account. Remember that you can\'t change your Merchant after you\'ve set up your campaign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Set your country of sale</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you set up your Google Shopping ads, you must also specify your country of sale. To add, you must select the country from which you will sell your product. Also, if you sell internationally, you should list each country you sell to in this section.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Choose an inventory filter</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After that, consider using an inventory filter for your Google Product Listing Ads to control which products will appear. This filter is useful if you limit the products featured in your campaigns. For instance, if you want to advertise only your summer collection, you can set the filter to exclude winter coats and boots, ensuring your ads focus on the right items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Set up your bidding</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learning how to create Google Retail ads teaches you that bidding is crucial. Therefore, you must choose a bidding method. For this purpose, bidding options for Google Shopping ads include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost-Per-Click (CPC)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost per thousand viewable impressions (vCPM)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost per thousand impressions (CPM)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Determine your budget</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, how much are you willing to spend on your campaign? Consider your company\'s needs and advertising objectives when establishing a daily budget. Also, how many clicks and leads your business can obtain is directly related to your budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. Choose ad networks</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose where your ads will appear when you set up your Google Shopping advertising. These can be shown on the Display Network, the Google Search Network, or sites that partner with Google Search. However, if you only want to see search results, uncheck the boxes for Google Search Partner sites and the Display Network. This will ensure that your ads only appear when people search on Google.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. Select ad devices</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consequently, Launching Shopping ads on Google will cause your ads to show on all devices, including desktop computers, tablets, and smartphones. You can adjust the settings to restrict where your ads show, though if you feel they should not show a specific device. Usually, you will display your ads on all devices in order to attract people most likely interested in your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>9. Set Locations</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Setting your location marks the last step you will need to follow in this guide on designing Google Shopping ads. Your ads can be set up to show just search results for consumers found in locations you service. For instance, if you sell goods in the Northwest, you can arrange your ads to show only for Northwestern residents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, by including your location specifics, you can help reduce ad waste from people clicking on your ads in a location you do not service. Click save once you have your area to start your ad!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Much Does Google Shopping Ad Cost?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You only have to pay for Google Product Listing Ads when someone clicks on them and is taken to your website or a landing page hosted by Google. To begin with, these steps will show you how to pay for Google Shopping ads:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to your Google Ads account</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click the Billing icon</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click Summary</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you have a manual payment account, click Add funds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you have an automatic payment account, click Make a payment </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, getting people to notice and click on your Google Retail ads can take some time. After three days, if you still don\'t see any results, you can look for possible issues.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Need help launching your Google Shopping campaign ?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To conclude, Google Shopping ads (free Google product listings) are great for reaching interested consumers. We are here to assist you in creating these ads if you are not sure how to do so. To create winning campaigns that drive results and increase your sales, our team of Google Ads Certified professionals provides<strong> PPC services</strong>—including <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-ppc-services\">Amazon PPC services</a>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Blog-Images-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-13 07:27:48','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(120,'Search Google Or Type URL: Step-by-Step-Guide 2025.','search-google-or-type-url-step-by-step-guide','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Have you ever wondered if it’s faster to<strong> </strong>search Google or type a url? You can try both, as both processes aim to serve information. However, searching on Google gives you options, while search or type url<strong> </strong>takes you straight to the site you are searching for. Continue reading and find out which suits you best.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you search Google or type a url, you can use Google\'s search bar to find the information you need. Use quotes to show exact words.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>  If you type a specific URL into the address bar, you can skip search results and go straight to a page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To search or type url only for a particular website, use \"site:.\" This makes it easier to find content in a specific domain.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It helps you find things faster by guessing what you\'re looking for based on where you are, what you\'ve searched for before, and what\'s popular right now.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2025, fast internet and quick search skills will be essential as the digital world evolves. When you Search google or type a url<strong> </strong>to connect to sites directly into your life is essential for information, entertainment, and communication.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unlike other search engines, Google\'s search page shows results from multiple sources. Internet searches gather all relevant links, and the user clicks on the best one. Furthermore, you can also filter or use advanced search operators to eliminate more results. Another method is to search or enter website into your browser\'s address bar. Check the URL, including the “http:” prefix like “https://” or “//.” Type “Enter” to visit. Be careful when retyping a URL in the address bar to avoid spelling errors and entering an unauthentic URL.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to Search On Google?</mark><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">&nbsp;</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A simple guide on how to search on Google:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 1:</strong> In your web browser, type \"google.com\" in the address bar and hit \"Enter.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 2:</strong> On the Google homepage, the search bar is in the center. Click on it to start typing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 3:</strong> Type keywords directly related to your search. Moreover, keep your query specific and concise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 4:</strong> Press \"Enter\" or click the magnifying glass icon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 5: </strong>Look at the search results page. Ads appear first, followed by regular search results with a title, link, and description.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 6:</strong> Click on a result to view the full page. Use your browser’s back arrow to return to the search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 7: </strong>Apply filters or advanced search options if you need to narrow down your results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Similarly, to<strong> </strong>search or enter a website on Google, type its full URL or copy and paste it directly into the search bar. For example, if you want to explore the website Tech2globe, you can type “tech2globe.com” into the search bar. This will display all of the pages and categories the website offers, helping you quickly locate the information you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Omnibox?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>User-friendly <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/omnibox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Omnibox</a> lets users search Google or enter a URL to find information online. Also known as “Google search or type the web address”. This feature simplifies Google search for beginners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Omnibox lets users search the web, calculate, convert units, and more. This saves time when searching for information or navigating websites.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Omnibox users see default suggestions like “<strong>Google search or type the web address</strong>” in their browser\'s address bar. Some devices display “search or<strong> </strong>type the web address” instead of “Google search or<strong> </strong>type the web address,” but the function is the same. It provides quick web access with a few keystrokes.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to type a URL?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Usually, typing in a URL does not produce the web page with a Google search. It guides you to a specific website only. Typing a URL follows this format:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 1:</strong> To begin, launch your web browser, such as <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.android.chrome&amp;hl=en_IN&amp;gl=US\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Chrome</a>, Mozilla Firefox, or Safari.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 2:</strong> Look for the address bar at the top of the browser window, where the website’s current URL is displayed.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 3:</strong> Click on the address bar to activate it. Type in the full URL of the site you want to visit, making sure to include “http://” or “https://” for a secure connection, like “https://www.tech2globe.com”.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>  <strong>Step 4:</strong> Finally, press Enter on your keyboard or click the arrow beside the address bar to go to the  website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Difference between search on Google and Type a URL: How they differ</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>For your better understanding about both processes, i.e., Google search or type url, refer from the table below:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basis of Differentiation</strong></td><td><strong>Search on Google</strong></td><td><strong>Type a URL</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Purpose</td><td>Finds information on the internet based on keywords.</td><td>This one directly accesses a specific webpage.</td></tr><tr><td>Process</td><td>Uses algorithms to index and rank web pages.</td><td>Enter the exact address of the desired webpage.</td></tr><tr><td>Result</td><td>Multiple relevant search results.</td><td>A single webpage.</td></tr><tr><td>Efficiency</td><td>Can be time-consuming for broad searches.</td><td>Directly accesses the desired webpage.</td></tr><tr><td>When to Use</td><td>When you don\'t know the exact URL of the webpage you\'re looking for, or when you want to explore different options.</td><td>When you know the exact URL of the webpage you want to visit, or when you want to bookmark a specific webpage for future reference.</td></tr><tr><td>Examples</td><td>Searching for \"best pizza in New York\" would return a list of restaurants.</td><td>Typing \"www.nytimes.com\" directly accesses The New York Times homepage</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Which is better: search on Google or Type a URL?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Which search option is best? The information you need determines whether you search Google or type a URL. Google search helps you quickly find the correct information online for a specific question or topic.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, type it and visit directly, even if you know the URL. In case of<strong> </strong>search Google or type a url, directly eliminating senseless search results is possible with typing URL. It is not even better for web browser users who want to visit famous websites, articles, books, or the internet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google search can be helpful when you need more information, a different perspective, or new information. Instead, it adapts and handles multiple search queries. Thus, broad and narrow topic searches are possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>URLs are sometimes typed faster. Therefore, search or enter website if you frequently visit the selected website or need more information from this reliable source. This method works well for handling sensitive data or logging into secure platforms where security and privacy are essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use keywords to search Google or type a URL. Google Search is suitable for intensive research, but URLs are better for directly accessing known resources.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How to search for a specific word or phrase in Google?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To search Google or type a URL<strong>, </strong>type your search into the search bar to look for a given word or phrase on Google. The results will reveal pertinent matches for your search. You can quote an exact phrase in quotations if you so want.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, if you want to find the best coffee shops nearby, type “best coffee shops near me” into the search bar and hit enter. The search results will display a list of top coffee shops close to your location.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To narrow your search to a specific website, type “site:” followed by the website\'s URL and the word or phrase you\'re searching for. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4213,\"width\":\"618px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image-1024x712.png\" alt=\"Effective Google search techniques\" class=\"wp-image-4213\" style=\"width:618px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, if you want to find articles about \"digital marketing\" on www.tech2globe.com, type “site:tech2globe.com digital marketing” in the search bar and press enter. The results will show only articles from that website that mention \"<a href=\"https://www.thedigitalwebsupport.com/\">digital marketing.</a>\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is Google Autocomplete Predictions?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4228,\"width\":\"496px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Search-operators-in-Google.png\" alt=\"Search operators in Google\" class=\"wp-image-4228\" style=\"width:496px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A permanent and natural aspect of the Google search engine, Google autocomplete prediction is genuine since it helps users quickly locate the most pertinent information.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google autocomplete predictions rely on the popularity of the search terms to create the phrases that appear there.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How does Google Autocomplete Predictions Work?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google allows us to exclude popular threads; as a result, the pool of hints in the autocomplete will immediately become noticeably smaller.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you are using Google search or enter a website, the auto-complete algorithm works on its own. Moreover, Google Autocomplete uses a complex algorithm to predict what you\'re searching for by analyzing a number of factors, including:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your location</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your search history</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Trending topics&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The language you use</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How often a keyword is searched&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The time of day (Google considers when a keyword is searched)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your social media presence</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How Search on Google or Type a URL Improve Website Experience?</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What if you still need to learn that Google can do more for you than you think when finding information? Now you may have an understanding to use the browser more efficiently by using the Search Google or type a URL feature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Regularly interacting with Google will teach you more tricks and tips that will make your internet use easier.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is a quick and easy way to search Google or type a URL for any website that will give you better results for a specific topic. You will spend much less time going through the results if you set up the searches beforehand. The only thing you need to do is change the search string to fit your needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-green-cyan\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-green-cyan\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-vivid-green-cyan-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Also Read:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/write-a-review-on-google/\"><strong>How to write a Google Review?</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/add-me-to-search-engine/\"><strong>A Tutorial on Add Me to Search: How to Create a People Card</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/youtube-copyright-disclaimer-a-step-by-step-guide/\"><strong>YouTube Copyright Disclaimer: A Step-by-Step Guide</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Conclusion</mark></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, the decision of “Google search or type url” depends on the information you have or the information you want to search for. If you already know it, it might be faster to type in the website\'s URL. Conversely, Google can be faster if you don\'t know where to look for the information because it will show you a bunch of websites that might have it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need to understand the significant difference between the processes like search Google or type a url. You can use the power of the world\'s biggest search engine, Google, to find websites that match your search query. Without the help of a search engine, when you search or enter website’s URL, you go straight to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#c01f29\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#c01f29\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#c01f29\" class=\"has-inline-color\">FAQ’s</mark></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q. Should you search Google or type a URL?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.</strong> It entirely depends upon what you are searching for. Google\'s search algorithm is extremely powerful, delivering accurate and relevant results. When you know which website you want to visit, typing a URL is the better option.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q. How do I search Google for a URL?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A. </strong>To search Google for a URL, follow these steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Open your web browser.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click on the address bar at the top.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Type the website\'s URL.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Press enter, and you will be directed to that official site.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q. Is Google an URL?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A. </strong>No, Google is not a URL itself; it is a search engine where you can type keywords to search for different websites, images, news, etc. Google does have a URL, i.e., https://www.google.com, which is the address you type into your web browser to visit the Google website. A URL refers to the Uniform Resource Locator, which is a link to specific resources on the internet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q. What does type URL mean?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.</strong> You can avoid searching by using the \"type URL\" option, which leads you straight to the exact website or page you\'re looking for. This might not offer substitute options in the event that the website is down or unavailable, and it might require you to know the precise URL of the page you\'re looking for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q. What is 20 in a URL?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A. \"20\" is commonly used as a space character in URLs, encoded as %20 to distinguish words or characters. The URL would be encoded as https://example.com/my%20file, for instance, if it contained spaces, such as https://example.com/my file. Spaces and other special characters are correctly transmitted over the internet thanks to this encoding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you find this information on “Google search or type a URL” helpful? Follow us for more updates and stay informed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Search-Google-Or-Type-URL-Step-by-Step-Guide-2025.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-09-09 11:40:47','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(121,'What’s Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) &amp; How To Do It','whats-generative-engine-optimization-geo-how-to-do-it','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>You may have heard of SEO\'s importance in improving your website’s ranking. Now, it’s time to learn a newer concept called GEO, i.e., Generative Engine Optimization. In this blog, discover what it is about, how it works, and, most importantly, how it will impact SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With GEO, you use AI to create content that connects with your audience, and LLMs understand it better online.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GEs may affect the economy of content marketers in the future.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO aims for better rankings, whereas GEO prioritizes creating content that generates richer AI-driven responses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The 9 main techniques of GEO can help in maximizing and improving website content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Teams from Princeton University, Georgia Tech, the Allen Institute for AI, and IIT Delhi did a study that examines which strategies work best to make websites more visible in different search engines like Gemini, Google SGE, Bing, ChatGPT, and others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is interesting because old-school SEO methods might not work as well with these new generative engines that give direct, complete answers and could make websites get less organic traffic.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because of this, SEO experts need to understand and adapt to this new way of doing things since Google will use this kind of AI in the coming years. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4025,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/image-1-1024x577.png\" alt=\"What is Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)?\" class=\"wp-image-4025\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GEO is a new way to optimize search engines, which works with generative engines (GE), which are search engines based on artificial intelligence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Optimizing content on your site so that a language learning model (LLM) can better read it and use it as a source is what it means in simple terms.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Examples of Generative Engines</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some popular examples of Generative Engines:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Gemini (Formerly Bard)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gemini is an artificial intelligence tool that Google created. It was first called Bard. As a generative language assistant, it can understand and answer complicated questions and develop valuable and exciting content on its own.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gemini aims to give more accurate and human-like answers using advanced natural language processing and machine learning methods. Also, you can even use it in place of Google Assistant.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Bing Chat</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Microsoft created Bing Chat, a search engine that gives consumers accurate and pertinent search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Developed by OpenAI, Bing Chat uses a modified form of ChatGPT to offer its conversational features, enabling the chatbot to answer questions and participate more naturally and informatively in conversations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, Bing adds artificial intelligence elements to improve the search experience by providing direct and customized answers to user questions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google SGE</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SGE (Search Generative Experience) is a project by Google to add AI-based natural language generation to its search results. It tries to figure out what the user is trying to say by using advanced language models and coming up with answers that are clear, helpful, and appropriate for the situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Impact of GEO on SEO</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This change will affect businesses and individuals, particularly in traffic and SEO. Digital marketing has seen traffic declines before. Contentsquare\'s 2024 Digital Experience Benchmark Explorer discovered that 55% of websites in various industries had less traffic in 2023 than in 2022.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, with AI search, many expect traffic to drop even more as ‘zero-click’ results, especially those with less specific intentions, rise at the top of the funnel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The logic is simple: AI\'s response to these more general inquiries will likely satisfy the user, reducing their likelihood of clicking and visiting your site. Therefore, as many businesses rely on traffic and online visibility to generate conversion and sales, GEs have a high potential to affect the economy of content marketers. However, content creators can boost visibility in AI-driven search environments by understanding and using GEO methods.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Differences Between SEO and GEO </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s now understand how SEO and GEO are different from one another:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4026,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/image-2-1024x577.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4026\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Focus</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content optimization for generative engine artificial intelligence algorithms is GEO\'s primary focus. On the other hand, traditional SEO uses factors like keywords, backlinks, content quality, UX, and page loading speed to improve rankings on SERPs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Response</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we\'ve seen, generative engines produce multimodal responses that combine data from different sources and formats. This differs from traditional SEO, which focuses on finding the most relevant link-based results to the query.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Queries</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SERPs often couldn\'t meet the demand when searching with long, detailed queries. Therefore, they provide content they consider more broadly relevant to the query. With Generative Engines (GEs), these platforms now generate responses using specific long-tail keywords, providing more precise user solutions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>SERP Positioning Relevance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Under SEO, a site\'s average search result page ranking is often the yardstick for visibility. This information is less important for generative engines, which give structured, rich responses as a top priority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to do Generative Engine Optimization?</strong> </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4027,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/image-3-1024x577.png\" alt=\"How to do Generative Engine Optimization? \" class=\"wp-image-4027\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Research customer-relevant topics: </strong>Find out what your audience is interested in and what questions they are asking. To perform this practice you can use keyword research tools. After that check how often these questions are asked on Google. Additionally, see if there\'s a connection between the two that makes sure your audience would ask these questions to an AI tool.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Create or improve custom content: </strong>Create or improve high-quality, relevant, and engaging content to answer the questions. Some of the GEO academic journal\'s ideas should inform optimization or creation. Moreover, the writing should be authoritative and include reliable sources, quotes, and industry language to demonstrate trust and expertise.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use structured data: </strong>Schema markup gives your content context and structure, which makes it easier for generative AI to understand and index.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prioritize user intent:</strong> Consider the user\'s intent when crafting your content. It will help you better fulfill their search query. Doing so will also help you keep up with the ever-changing algorithms. Doing so will also help you keep up with the ever-changing algorithms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Share your content:</strong> LLMs train on blog posts and Reddit and Quora content. Thus, you can use these channels to influence stories that answer relevant questions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Utilize social media: </strong>You can improve/increase the exposure and interaction with your content by sharing it on social media. This is because, when it comes to indexing and ranking content, generative AI also considers social media signals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Effective Strategies for GEO Optimization</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The researchers assessed nine GEO techniques to maximize website content for generative engines. These are a combination of traditional SEO strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Authoritative:</strong> It changes the style of the source text to make it more convincing and trustworthy so claims can be made with confidence.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Keyword Stuffing: </strong>Like other traditional SEO strategies, this method changes the content to include more keywords from the user\'s query.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Statistics Addition:</strong> Changes the content to include quantitative statistics instead of qualitative discussion as much as possible. However, provide evidence(source) based on data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cite Sources: </strong>This feature adds relevant citations from trustworthy sources to back up claims and give credit where credit is due throughout the website\'s content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quotation Addition: </strong>Quotes from relevant sources make the website content seem more real and in-depth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Easy to Understand: </strong>Simplifies the website\'s language and structure, making it easier for the generative engine and users to understand and enjoy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fluency Optimization:</strong> This makes the website text flow better and easier to read so you can read it without any problems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":8} -->\n<ol start=\"8\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unique Words: </strong>This feature gives website content interesting and unique words that make it stand out and make it more appealing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":9} -->\n<ol start=\"9\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Technical Terms: </strong>Uses jargon and technical terms specific to the field or industry to show expertise and appeal to particular groups of people. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s hard to deal with these sudden changes, right? But don\'t give up everything and change your content strategy all at once. Things are still in their early stages. Follow us and stay updated on GEOs and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Whats-Generative-Engine-Optimization-GEO-How-To-Do-It.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-28 11:00:23','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(122,'How Do I Set Up My First Campaign on Google Ads?','how-do-i-set-up-my-first-campaign-on-google-ads','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp; Are you looking to set up your first <strong>Google ad campaign</strong> but don’t know how to? In this blog, we have included a complete <strong>Google ads tutorial</strong>. From signing in to a Google ad account and campaign goals to setting up billing, we have explained each step accordingly. Also, learn about<strong> Google ads and how it works</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Ad Campaigns enable you to organize your ads and keywords, thus facilitating targeting the correct audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google PPC campaigns are economical since you only pay when someone clicks your advertisement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Selecting the correct keywords and clearly defining objectives are essential components of a good Google PPC campaign.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most crucial part of digital marketing, the <strong>Google ad campaign</strong>, is essential for several individuals and businesses. Be it Small/medium-sized businesses, large enterprises, services-based businesses, NPOs, or anyone looking to promote their product/services, Google ad campaigns can help them provide highly targeted advertising.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, setting up an ad campaign on Google can be challenging for beginners. If you are a small business starting with pay-per-click advertising, you will probably have to build and manage your Google ads account independently. Continue reading, and let us guide you through easy steps to make this process easy. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Google Ad Campaign?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Ad Campaigns is a group of ads, keywords, and bids that share a budget, settings for targeting people in certain places, and other things. Campaigns are a common way to organize the different types of goods and services you offer. Additionally, you can run one or more ad campaigns on your Google Ads account.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Google Ads: How it works?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below we have thoroughly explained your question, i.e., what is <strong>Google ads and how it works</strong>?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Originally called Google AdWords, Google Ads is an online advertising tool that allows you to promote your goods or services across Google\'s web presence, like its search engine, affiliate websites, and YouTube. For example, if you search for something like \"buy shoes online,\" you might see ads at the top of the search results. These ads are created by businesses using Google Ads to reach people who are looking for what they offer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, how do Google Ads work? At first, businesses draft an advertisement and choose keywords—specific words or phrases connected to their offering. If you run a coffee shop, for example, you might select terms like \"morning latte\" or \"fresh coffee.\" Your advertisement might appear in Google\'s search results when someone searches for these terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The bidding process comes second. This is where businesses choose their pay level upon a click on their advertisement. Google decides whether and where your advertisement will show on the page based on your bid amount, quality, and other factors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your advertisement will appear in search results, websites, or YouTube videos once it is live. A click-through is the process by which individuals view your advertisement and click on it, thus guiding them to your website or a designated page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since Google ads enables businesses to reach people looking for goods or services like theirs, it is an excellent tool for them. Businesses can get their ads in front of the proper audience by choosing appropriate keywords and creating a budget. Moreover, Google ads are inexpensive for drawing clients since you only pay when someone clicks your advertisement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Steps to Create Google Ad Campaign</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the help of this step-by-step <strong>Google ads tutorial</strong>, you can run Google ads easily.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Create a Google Ads Account</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Making a Google Ads account comes first among things you have to do.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to ads.google.com&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click the blue Start now button in the upper right corner.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select the email you want to register under.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Follow the instructions to create and confirm your new Google Account.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once registered, you will come upon a screen asking for your primary advertising goal. Google then seeks to seize control over your account. We are thus here to provide professional advice so you won\'t need Google\'s assistance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Set Campaign Goals</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can begin configuring your<strong> Google PPC campaign</strong> using a range of goal-based choices now that you have turned over to “Expert Mode”. These choices include Sales, Leads, Website Traffic, Product and Brand Consideration, Brand Awareness and Reach, and App Promotion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Select Campaign Type</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The choice of the kind of campaign you wish to start comes next. You have the choice between six different campaign types:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Search - </strong>Search campaigns display text ads on Google\'s SERPs. Searches trigger these ads. Choose keywords related to your product or service to target these search queries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Display - </strong>Google can place text, video, and image ads on over 2 million websites (and counting). Display campaigns can target keywords, audiences, placements, and more. These campaigns also boost brand awareness and re-engage website visitors as they browse.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Video - </strong>Google is the most popular search engine, but YouTube is second. And Google owns YouTube. YouTube video advertising campaigns can be created using Google Ads. Like Display, there are many targeting options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>App - </strong>Google Ads app campaigns are your only reasonable option for app promotion. You can advertise your app on Google Search, YouTube, the Display Network, and Google Play with App campaigns. After setting up these automated campaigns, sit back and watch the installs and upsells.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Smart -</strong> Intelligent campaigns can boost your account if appropriately used, but they should not be your first step.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two additional options are Shopping and Discovery, but if you recently registered for your account, these campaign forms will not be accessible. Starting with a shopping or discovery campaign will require hovering over one of those choices with your mouse follow the link to \"Skip and create this type of campaign later.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Configure General Settings</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Campaign settings are divided in these sections:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>General Settings - </strong>Here you will first give your campaign a name. After that, you should concentrate on <strong>Google ads configuration </strong>by deciding on the network you wish your ads to show on. Your choices consist of Search and Display. Although Display is a different kind of campaign, right now we only want to create a Search campaign. Keep the search box checked and deselect the display box to guarantee this.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Location - </strong>To begin, choose the regions where you would like your advertisements to appear. You can target a global audience or a specific geographic area down to the zip code level. By default, you have the following options: United States and Canada, All countries and territories, United States, and Enter another location. To target locations at the city, state, zip code or radius level, select the “Enter another location” option and then click on Advanced Search.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Languages - </strong>This one is easy to understand. Choose the language or languages spoken by your customers. Google will restrict your ads to be displayed to individuals who speak the languages you\'ve selected. Ensure your advertisement text aligns with the chosen languages, and you\'ll be ready.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Audiences - </strong>You have the choice to include audiences in your campaign. Viewers can be included in either the observation or targeting tier. This is a more complex choice and unnecessary to delve into now, particularly if you are initiating your initial Search campaign. We will keep that section unchanged for the time being and proceed forward.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Define Budget and Bidding Strategy</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When setting up your <strong>Google PPC campaign</strong>, the budget setting is fairly straightforward. Choose your campaign\'s daily budget here. First, calculate your monthly campaign investment and divide it by the number of days your ads will run. If you run ads daily, divide by 30, Monday through Friday, divide by 20, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the <strong>Google ads configuration</strong>, set your campaign\'s bidding strategy in Bidding. Google suggests a bidding strategy based on the result you want to focus on, with default options like Conversions, Conversion value, Clicks, and Impression share. Choosing Conversions may seem obvious, but these default options often lead to an automated bid strategy. Automated bid strategies have advantages, but most new advertisers may not like them. Instead of letting Google choose, choose your bid strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Set Up Ad Schedule</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can specify the times and days your ads will be eligible to display in your ad schedule. This might differ from one company to the next depending on factors like operating hours, products and services offered, and available funds.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Add Ad Extensions</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the last part of the campaign settings screen, you\'ll find <strong>Google ads configuration</strong> for ad extensions. It is strongly suggested that you set up all three main types of extensions listed below.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Sitelink Extensions</strong> <strong>-</strong> Add up to 4 links to your ads with Sitelinks. These links can take customers to pages on your website that explain your business and products.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Callout Extensions - </strong>Highlight competitive advantages, discounts, and promotions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Call Extensions - </strong>If your business generates leads or sales by phone, you need one. This shows your phone number in your ads and lets mobile users call you without visiting your website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":8} -->\n<ol start=\"8\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Set Up Ad Groups and Keywords</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After you have your Google Ads campaign setup, the next step is to create ad groups. Ad groups consist of collections of relevant keywords that share an ad or ads. Think about your primary offering first when deciding on keywords. You may use Google\'s Keyword Planner to build your campaign.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":9} -->\n<ol start=\"9\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Create Ads</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now that you’ve set up your first ad group, it’s time to create your ad. Here’s a quick guide to get you started with your <strong>Google PPC campaign</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Final URL</strong> -<strong> </strong>Your ad will link to this page on your website. This page should promote the product or service in your ad. Does no page or landing page on your site match what you\'re promoting? Use your homepage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google allows up to three headlines per ad - </strong>Your headline can only be 30 characters, so be creative and concise. Also, your headlines should at least mention your product or service and include a call to action.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Display Path - </strong>Your ad\'s URL includes the display path. This path does not need to match the final URL. Use this field to show customers what page to see after clicking your ad. We recommend using your keywords, such as product or service, here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Up to two 90-character descriptions are allowed. You can elaborate on your product and business here.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":10} -->\n<ol start=\"10\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Set Up Billing</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Setting up your billing information is the final step in creating your new account and initial campaign. There isn\'t much complexity to this procedure. Google lets you pay with various methods, including bank accounts, credit/debit cards, and more.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To build your campaign to its full potential, you can follow this <strong>Google ads tutorial</strong>. Still, if you have any questions or encounter challenges while following the steps above, we are here to assist you in making your Google Ads campaign successful. You may also reach out to us if you\'re looking for <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-ppc-services\"><strong>Amazon PPC services</strong> </a>or need additional support with your campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions: FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.1. Is Google Ads campaign free?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>No, running a Google Ads campaign is not free. However, you can use it for free; you only pay when someone clicks on your ad. One can also make several decisions from here. The campaign will determine whether you should create a monthly PPC budget or an average daily one.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.2. Is Google Ads campaign worth it?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Google Ads are worth it since they offer businesses of all kinds a reasonably cheap approach to reach an almost limitless, targeted audience. You can start, stop, pause, or even change your bids anytime—they are pretty flexible.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.3. Can you run Google Ads on your own?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Google Ads are worth it since they provide companies of all kinds a reasonably low cost method to reach an almost infinite, targeted audience. Anytime you start, stop, pause, or even change your bids—they are rather flexible.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Q.4. How to run a Google ad campaign?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> Simplified steps for you to start a Google ad campaign:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose your campaign objective and a new campaign to start your goals.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose your location and language, switch to expert mode, select your campaign type, and set your ad calendar.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create your ad using up to 15 headlines per one and optional ad attributes like callouts and site links to make it unique.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Testing new variants will help even your best-performing ads to get better.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can maximize your landing page and then start your campaign live.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/How-Do-I-Set-Up-My-First-Campaign-on-Google-Ads.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-23 10:06:12','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(123,'7 Benefits of Using Performance Marketing','7-benefits-of-using-performance-marketing','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Performance marketing is a digital marketing and advertising strategy in which retailers only pay for results. Whatever is decided upon by the brand and agency is the outcome. Potential outcomes could include but are not limited to, new leads, clicks, bookings, sales, app downloads, and more. Therefore, using performance based marketing is ideal for retailers to gain a great deal of free brand exposure along the road, in addition to the advantage of only paying when results are achieved.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cost efficiency is one of the factors you can get from it. Apart from that, businesses can get several other benefits from performance based marketing by partnering with us. Tech2Globe is a hub of contemporary IT business solutions that add transformative changes to your business. We are a prominent <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/performance-marketing\"><strong>performance marketing</strong></a> agency delivering comprehensive and personalized services that cater to your needs. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Why is performance marketing so valuable? </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Knowing where your money went is crucial when you\'re on a tight budget. One of the most significant <strong>benefits of performance marketing </strong>is the ability to track your ROI simply. By reviewing campaign data, you can immediately determine whether your ad is compelling and adjust your ad spend appropriately. It also saves opportunity costs by allowing you to estimate the cost of a campaign before launching it. This reduces risk; the fewer unproductive initiatives you launch and cancel, the lower the cost.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Like with any marketing plan, performance marketing has its drawbacks. While data has immense promise, many marketers miss out because they don\'t know how to convert it into meaningful insights.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Meanwhile, marketers face persistent challenges with ad fraud. Recent research indicated that the worldwide cost might exceed $30 billion. How can you be sure your ad reaches genuine users if you don\'t have the necessary tools to counteract it? Not to mention the high costs associated with performance marketing. Cheaper metrics, such as pay-per-click and cost-per-lead, have a lesser chance of conversion; just clicking on your ad does not ensure they would purchase your products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, performance marketing is fully trackable, realizable, and transparent. It will help your business to identify where to invest and which partners to work with. You can estimate the number and invest properly to get what you want.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To be a successful business today, developing a comprehensive digital marketing strategy is essential rather than just focusing on a single aspect. When you partner with a performance marketing agency like Tech2Globe, you can get a complete strategy for establishing and raising your business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Seven Benefits of Performance Marketing</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today, we\'ll take you through more prominent and noteworthy benefits of performance marketing. The following are the benefits of this concept of <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing\">digital marketing</a> compared to conventional ways: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Instantaneous ROI Evaluations</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s quite simple to track and measure results using performance marketing. Businesses will be able to track their success each time a user clicks on an advertisement, joins the company\'s email list, or completes any other required activity. This makes tracking the return on investment (ROI) of a campaign quite easy at any given time. Additionally, businesses will be able to quickly ascertain the whole cost of their digital performance marketing strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>Expanded Brand Awareness</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s a valuable strategy for expanding brand reach since it allows businesses to reach a more varied and expansive audience than they might with conventional advertising methods. This is especially true for anyone using affiliate marketing, as the outcome might be reaching a specific audience, increasing website traffic, and producing more revenue. Because performance marketing can take many different forms, it helps merchants expand their company\'s potential reach by allowing adverts to be displayed across a myriad of channels and outlets, opening up new markets for their brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Improved KPI Alignment</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Key performance indicators (KPIs) are, of course, essential to a brand\'s capacity to accomplish its objectives. Performance marketing allows merchants to target these metrics directly, regardless of the goals sellers have in mind. These goals can include raising conversion rates, increasing retail sales, or improving customer retention. Moreover, businesses can be confident that these marketers will put in a lot of effort to get outcomes because a digital performance marketing agency is concentrated on generating observable advantages for a company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>Capacity to Mix Up Sources of Income</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When one marketing channel isn\'t yielding the desired results, you may swiftly switch to another by using performance marketing, which makes it a flexible approach to digital marketing. Furthermore, it is incredibly advantageous since it frees merchants from having to spend all of their advertising funds on pointless strategies when there are now more reliable ways to bring in money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong>Quicker and Better Outcomes</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Merchants can get better outcomes faster when they customize their spending to meet specific goals (as is done with performance marketing). In addition, sellers can be certain that they will get the most out of every dollar they spend on performance campaigns because performance marketers have a stake in producing the greatest outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>Pay Just for Outcomes</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Retailers pay marketing companies a certain amount up front in more conventional marketing agreements. By turning this framework on its head,<em> performance marketing</em> allows marketers only to bill the client when the intended action or objective is completed. In comparison to conventional marketing and advertising methods, performance marketing is an excellent tool for helping sellers make the most of their spending. Rather than making an upfront payment without expecting any results, retailers pay only when the intended goals are met. Consequently, this marketing strategy means that clients only pay when certain criteria are fulfilled; thus, it doesn\'t matter if shops are trying to improve website traffic, expand an email list, boost app downloads, produce sales, or anything else.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><li><strong>Models of Pay-As-You-Go</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Performance marketing approaches not only limit retailers to paying for campaign results, but they also frequently set up charges that are applied only when a specific action is taken by the merchant. This may seem like a simple detail, but for smaller businesses, especially those with tighter marketing expenditures, it can mean the difference between success and failure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Performance marketing can be a game-changing strategy for many brands looking to achieve results. To put it simply, merchants may increase their reach, engagement, sales, and conversions at a lower cost, with a reduced risk and a considerably higher return on investment, by utilizing performance marketing. Businesses would be wise to consider updating many of the methods they use to generate online results, given how quickly the eCommerce industry is evolving. Performance marketing might be the solution they\'ve been looking for. Get in touch with <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\"><strong>Tech2Globe</strong></a> for a free consultation to learn more about how performance marketing can help your brand achieve its goals and improve its bottom line. Together, we can help your business grow from where it is to where it wants to be.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/7-Benefits-of-Using-Performance-Marketing.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-21 07:55:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(124,'What is Data Conversion: Techniques, Tools, and Best Practices?','what-is-data-conversion-techniques-tools-and-best-practices','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>This blog covers everything you need about data conversion, including its types, benefits, and challenges. Also, learning how to <strong>convert to data</strong> using different techniques and tools can help your business grow and succeed. Don’t forget to check out the best practices to face data challenges.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>When working with various formats, <strong>data conversion software </strong>can help you save time and make fewer mistakes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Assess your data requirements to determine whether converting data will improve your processes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Consider growth; using data conversion tools can help your business stay organized as it grows.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data Conversion has intriguing facts that are hard to ignore. For instance, the global data conversion service market is expected to grow significantly from 2022 to 2030 because of data-driven strategies adopted by businesses of all sizes. As a result, the<strong> data conversion services </strong>market could reach USD multi-million by 2029 due to its strong CAGR.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you wondering how this will impact your business? Imagine you have access to customer insights, market trends, and operational errors. However, having a deeper understanding of all this information lies in how you convert it to data, especially when all of it is in different languages! Here, data conversion can help to translate the same information into a clear, unified language. However, it can do more than just that; continue reading to know more about the conversion of data. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Data Conversion and its Types?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data conversion refers to the process of converting data while maintaining its accuracy and integrity. It can be complex or simple, depending on the amount and variety of data types involved. However, each conversion effort is unique.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Types of Data that you can convert:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Structured data: </strong>A particular format or model—like those found in relational databases—is defined here. Examples comprise XML documents, CSV files, and SQL data. Additionally, structured data is the easiest to convert because its format is predictable and consistently ordered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Semi-structured data</strong>: Follows particular guidelines that allow it to be converted even if it is not as orderly as structured data. Because they have tags or markers to split semantic elements, formats like JSON or YAML fit this group.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Unstructured data:</strong> From text files and emails to multimedia content, it comes in many forms. Although unstructured data lacks a predefined data model, its conversion is more complex; nevertheless, advanced parsing and processing methods make it possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Files in a binary format</strong>: Images or compiled programs—may also be converted. Usually, the process consists of encoding or decoding to translate binary data into another binary format or from binary data to text formats and vice versa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the Benefits of Data Conversion?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While conversion of data is used to update or migrate databases to newer formats, its advantages extend far beyond that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>More excellent quality of the data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cost Savings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increases the efficiency of the operations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It is possible to simplify data that is both large and complex.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It makes the database accessible to the user.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Allows for the saving of time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Examining structured data is one method that can be utilized to gather business intelligence.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>That could potentially increase the profitability of the company.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The loss of data and breaches of data can be avoided.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The Process of Data Conversion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you may have understood, conversion of data is the method of transforming data from one form to another. Although it can be difficult, using automated tools speeds things up and increases accuracy. Here\'s what the process may involve, generally:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Planning the Conversion:</strong> A thorough plan built on the user\'s requirements comes first. This proposal lists the data that needs to be converted, from which it is coming, and what form it should be in the following conversion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Extracting the Data:</strong> Once the plan is in place, the data is pulled from its source. This involves copying the information, including letters, numbers, and symbols, from the old system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Transforming the Data:</strong> After that, the extracted data is changed/converted into a format that matches the format of the new system. This includes changing how you write dates, adjusting numbers, or restructuring information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Loading the Data:</strong> The converted or new data becomes part of the new working method.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Conversion Challenges and Best Practices</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are some of the main obstacles companies usually face during the conversion of data, and some solutions are available to deal with them efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Loss of Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Problems with transformation, insufficient backups, or human mistakes can all lead to data loss during conversion. Therefore, you must proactively address this issue by implementing thorough data backups, rigorous testing, and detailed audit logs; otherwise, the entire exercise could become useless.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Transforming and Mapping Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Transforming data from one format to another can be daunting, especially when dealing with numerous systems or databases. What can you do? It is best to conduct comprehensive planning, documentation, and monitoring to ensure accurate data interpretation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Problems with Compatibility</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Format or structure changes can interrupt processes, so businesses must ensure that converted data is compatible with target systems before beginning data conversion. Also, you should upgrade your system later on and do extensive testing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Security Concerns with Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, data quality issues can occur during data movement or conversion. Thus, applying data governance best practices in conjunction with thorough validation and quality checks is the most excellent approach to reducing risk.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Limitations on Time and Money</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Time and money are two of the most common constraints on data conversion projects. There is a higher chance of data-related issues, and efficient use of resources is required when projects are rushed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Conversion Techniques</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Changing data calls for more than one step and sequence. Therefore, companies apply several methods to modify, enhance, and translate their data. The most often used techniques consist of:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>File Format Conversion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Changing the method of storage calls for translating between several file formats. To facilitate analysis, for instance, translate a spreadsheet file—such as Excel.xlsx—into a database file—such as.csv.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Character Encoding Conversion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Computers represent text characters using several systems. Moreover, changing between these systems—from Latin-based English to Asian languages—guarantees accurate text display and handling.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Date and Time Formatting</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data analysis and reporting depend on standardizing how dates and times are listed. This entails altering formats from \"2023/11/25\" to \"November 25, 2023.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Unit Conversion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When data includes measurements, you usually need to convert between various units—like inches to centimeters or pounds to kilograms—for consistency and compatibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Numerical Data Conversion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Changing the representation of numbers can affect calculations and data interpretation. For more exact computation, for example, converting a whole number to a decimal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Type Conversion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some operations depend on changing how data is categorized—from text to numbers or vice versa. For a \"yes/no\" text field, translate it into a true/false value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data cleaning</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is all about correcting mistakes, inconsistencies, and missing values. This can also cover handling outliers, standardizing data forms, and deleting duplicates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Error Handling</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dealing with unforeseen problems during data conversion is crucial. Thus, error handling techniques—such as recording mistakes for later inspection and repair—help preserve data integrity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Conversion Tools</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data conversion software</strong> can improve data profiling, business research and planning, and the speed of complicated transformations. We can generally classify these instruments into three categories:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Scripting Tools:</strong> Scripting tools lay at the core of data conversion techniques. They cover methodical data manipulation using Python or SQL scripts. However, scripting demands in-depth technical knowledge and can be time-consuming for large datasets, offering exact control over the conversion process. Thus, this approach is best for smaller-scale or highly specialized data transformations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>On-premise ETL Tools:</strong> These instruments, stored in the server of the business and local registering system, automate the continuous data normalizing process and replace the necessity for code writing. The <strong>data conversion services</strong> company has to get a license or buy a copy from the software vendor to apply these data conversion tools.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cloud-based ETL Tools:</strong> Finally, scalable and reasonably priced alternatives are cloud-based ETL tools. Organizations can access strong data conversion capabilities free from the weight of managing on-site hardware and software by using the cloud infrastructure and knowledge of the software vendor. Companies looking to quickly expand their data operations or those with variable data volumes will find this method especially helpful.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Are Data Conversion Tools Worth the Investment?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Honestly, it depends. A few essential considerations help determine whether data conversion tools are worth the expenditure. First, what type of data do you handle? Text, pictures, or something else? Conversion is useful to maintain everything operating in different formats.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Think then about how you combine <strong>data conversion software </strong>across several platforms. Do you now use several databases or programs? By guaranteeing everything fits together naturally, data conversion can help. Have you thought about the time and effort automated process saves?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finally, is your present scalable approach? Could it expand with your company? If not, a tool purchase may be the solution. Analyze the expenses against the advantages—time savings and error avoidance, among other things.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is it hence worth it? If these points speak to you, the response might be yes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether your organization is dealing with structured or unstructured data, we manage data quality and guarantee accurate, consistent, and error-free data conversion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our team converts documents and images by offering you powerful conversion features that provide a comprehensive range of data conversion services and ensure accurate data entry.<br>However, we go beyond essential services by offering data management, extraction, and <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\">online data entry services</a></strong>. You can count on us to turn your data into something valuable for your business\'s growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/What-is-Data-Conversion-Techniques-Tools-and-Best-Practices.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-20 10:24:51','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(125,'Five ways to improve your Amazon product\'s ranking using SEO','five-ways-to-improve-your-amazon-products-ranking-using-seo','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Wondering why your product isn’t ranking or unsure which strategy to implement for better results? No worries! In this blog, you’ll find the top 5 strategies to improve your <strong>Amazon SEO ranking</strong>. Plus, learn how to boost your listings and increase sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Research keywords carefully to identify pertinent terms for your Amazon listings, so enhancing search engine results and sales.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Clear keyword-rich product titles and description details will help improve Amazon\'s SEO and draw consumers in.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality images will help products stand out since their visual appeal greatly influences customer purchase decisions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As of 2024, there are 9.7 million ( approximately) sellers on Amazon. With Amazon stores looking to grab opportunities to rank higher in consumer searches, they are constantly seeking solutions on <strong>how to optimize Amazon listings</strong>. Undoubtedly, with so many sellers to compete with, it is not easy to stand out and capture attention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, with the right implementation of each Amazon SEO strategy, success will become more attainable. Whether it\'s the product title, images, description, reviews, branding, or pricing, everything matters in making your product stand out to buyers and encouraging them to make a purchase. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Working of Amazon SEO</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most shoppers start their Amazon journey by typing specific items or phrases into the search bar. This simple action opens a world of possibilities, allowing them to explore a vast range of products. For a different approach, Amazon\'s organized departments, like Pet Supplies, Sports Items, or  Home Decor, offer a structured way to browse.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What Amazon SEO can do:</strong> Interestingly, anyone selling on Amazon can benefit from search engine optimization (SEO). From small resellers to established brands, <strong>Amazon product listing optimization </strong>with relevant keywords can increase visibility and sales. Additionally, sellers enrolled in the Amazon Brand Registry have an extra advantage with tools like Search Query Performance and Top Search Terms that provide in-depth insights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Refining the Search and Discovering Products:</strong> To narrow down results, shoppers can use filters based on factors like shipping speed, customer reviews, and price. Amazon also helps customers discover new items through curated collections featuring bestsellers, recent releases, and trending products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Comparing and Buying:</strong> Once the search yields results, customers can compare prices, shipping options, and product details side-by-side. Moreover, a product\'s popularity within its category is indicated by the Amazon Best Sellers Rank (BSR).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Paid Advertising: </strong>To gain an edge over competitors, many sellers use Amazon\'s Sponsored Products ads. These paid advertisements highlight products, capturing shoppers’ attention and driving traffic to product listings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>SEO Optimization Tips to Rank on Amazon</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Relying on just one <strong>Amazon SEO strategy </strong>isn’t effective and won’t lead to success. To truly excel, you need to follow comprehensive approaches. Your audience won\'t be able to discover your products unless you raise your Amazon rankings. Here are some ways to enhance your Amazon SEO ranking:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conduct Thorough Keyword Research</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Optimize Product Title and Description</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use High-Quality Images</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on Pricing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Build a Strong Brand Presence</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Conduct Thorough Keyword Research</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keywords are like the backbone of SEO. Yes, you read that right because keywords form the foundation for all SEO strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, how do you start keyword research? Firstly, you should target keywords for product titles, descriptions, ads, etc. Here’s how you can do it:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enter multiple keywords in the “Amazon search box.” You may take ideas from the drop-down menu and create a comprehensive list of keywords for your offers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check competitor offers for words and phrases that could improve your content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO tools and <strong>Amazon PPC service</strong> can help you find keywords, related phrases, demand, and strategy data. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Secondly, remember to use short-term and long-term keywords. Short-tail keywords are broad, general search terms like “dresses” or&nbsp; “shoes” with high search volume but intense competition, making it challenging for smaller sellers to rank high. Whereas long-tail keywords are more specific, for example, “men\'s waterproof running shoes with good arch support,” with lower search volume but less intense competition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Optimize Product Title and Description</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The title of your product is like a digital shopfront sign. You have one chance to get a customer\'s attention and get them to click. When writing titles, you should consider what the buyer cares about the most. Thus, you must include essential details:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Product type: Clearly state what the product is.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Brand name: If you have a strong brand, include it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Key features: Highlight unique selling points like color, size, material, or function.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, instead of a generic \"Blue T-Shirt,\" try \"Soft Cotton Men\'s T-Shirt - Navy Blue, Regular Fit.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, consider what details you want to see before buying. Ensure you use the keywords best for your product and audience. Remember that Amazon lets you use up to 200 characters, but try to stick to around 60 for the best visibility. With <strong>Amazon product SEO</strong> in mind, put the most important keywords at the top.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, when it comes to “Product descriptions,” avoid keyword stuffing and focus on highlighting the product’s USPs, benefits, and features. Here’s what your product description must include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Core features: Make what your product does clear.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Benefits: Describe how these features make life better for the customer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Details about the materials and specs: Give detailed information about what\'s in the product.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How to take care of it: Help people care for the product.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With or without a warranty: Trust and believe in yourself.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Use High-Quality Images</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you know that images are more likely to be remembered than words? This is a concept of the image superiority effect. Consequently, a high-quality image of your products can make customers stop and take notice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customers can learn important things about a product from pictures that are hard to say with words alone.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Include several pictures that show the item from different points of view.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Emphasize important parts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure the pictures are sharp, clear, and well-lit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To make backgrounds, use plain white.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure the item takes up at least 85% of the frame.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find out the best ways to take professional photos of the products you want to sell, like jewelry or clothes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Focus on Pricing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s hard to find the right price for your product because you want to make money and stay competitive at the same time. Here are some essential tips that will help you:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To make sure you\'re making a profit, figure out how much your product costs, including shipping and handling. This is one thing that Amazon\'s Revenue Calculator can help you with.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Take into account other fees, like Amazon\'s selling fees, referral fees, and any other costs that come with selling your product.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Next, look at the prices of similar items to get a sense of the market.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find out what makes your product different from others on the market and change the price to reflect that. One example of a premium product might cost more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, try different prices to see how they affect sales and profits.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t forget that price is only one part of the puzzle. Moreover, you can get a lot more sales if you have competitive prices, a good product listing, and good marketing through <strong>Amazon product listing optimization</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Build a Strong Brand Presence</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building a brand presence is our final tip to optimize your <strong>Amazon SEO strategy</strong>. People are more likely to trust and stick with a brand they know, increasing conversion rates and making your site more visible in search results. How to do it:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Amazon Brand Registry:</strong> The Amazon Brand Registry (Amazon SEO) helps your items appear on the first page of Amazon product searches. In addition, it helps keep fakes of your brand away.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Consistent Branding: </strong>This means creating a unified and recognizable brand image across all your product listings. Therefore, this involves maintaining a cohesive look and feel that reflects your brand\'s personality and values. Thus, you can use the same logo consistently, Adhere to a specific color scheme, Maintain a consistent style, and design packaging that reflects your brand image.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Encouraging Reviews: </strong>To make customers leave positive feedback, send them a polite email to follow up and ask for feedback once they receive their order. You may also add an easy-to-find link to the review page to make it simple for them. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>A+ content: </strong>When a product listing has A+ Content, which adds pictures, charts, videos, and other things to the product description, you can keep shoppers interested and make good sales. That rise in sales tells Amazon that your product is relevant, which is good for your Amazon SEO.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let Tech2Globe Help you optimize Amazon product SEO</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Success on Amazon depends on<strong> Amazon product listing optimization</strong>. Your listings might not draw enough buyers without appropriate SEO techniques, which affects sales and profitability. Therefore, it is imperative to either work with a seasoned SEO agency or learn to master Amazon ranking strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Having more than 15 years of experience, our area of expertise is improving visibility and increasing sales by optimizing product listings. Our seasoned staff has a history of enhancing the Amazon SEO ranking for our customers. For more information or queries, feel free to contact us. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/What-are-the-benefits-of-hiring-a-Shopify-development-agency.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-19 08:13:29','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(126,'Google\'s Latest Tool Identifies Missed SEO Opportunities','googles-latest-tool-identifies-missed-seo-opportunities','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> You might have noticed perpetual <strong>Google SEO changes</strong> recently, with regular algorithm updates causing ranking fluctuations. When we thought we had everything under control, Google unveiled the latest tool to help us understand it all. Let\'s discover how the latest <strong>SEO opportunities</strong> will allow you to achieve higher search rankings and increase site traffic.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google\'s new tool provides <strong>SEO recommendations.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The new feature displays optimization options in the Search Console.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It is being rolled out gradually, and not all sites have received it.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data from Google\'s indexing, crawling, and serving systems highlights new <strong>SEO opportunities </strong>on the Search Console overview page. Although the Search Console already displays this information, the new feature streamlines it by offering direct recommendations. This advice helps you focus on SEO projects:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Utilizing organized data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Adding sitemaps.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Finding popular search terms and pages.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best thing is that Google\'s new tool will help <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/seo-services\">SEO Services</a></strong> by using its customized recommendations and optimizing their approaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s a glimpse of how these new <strong>SEO recommendations </strong>look like in search console:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcuzghEgWDMkl6UnVHMr2kF5Omx2FBvPiX6rfUpHUcZ2opVMhgeX0cVbgST_JjwdJgVpbt2m9qTWHjTN38NOmBtlWUh4OnjFZg1qm7os_o61Ykavx4V-UJ7OFoQ3TP1njHJ89s9I6lbgHIyu1oRT0R3ZiM?key=hcjoO42we3LpEvFcH-AcWg\" alt=\" SEO recommendations\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Availability of the Feature</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This feature isn’t available to everyone right now. Here’s why:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google\'s new tool is still being tested.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Not all websites will get suggestions right away.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Also, the tool will be gradually rolled out over the next few months.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Even after the full rollout, not every website will qualify for suggestions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ultimately, suggestions are based on website data and can change over time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>When was Google Search Console last updated?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you ever wondered when <strong>Google Search Console was last updated</strong>? Almost all of Google Search Console\'s reports are updated in the background instead of in real-time. In other words, Google runs a \"batch processing\" script every so often—usually every three to four days, but it depends on the report—to process all the data and update the reports.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because of this, most reports will show a \"Last Update\" from a few days ago, which means the batch process was last run. So, any new information gathered after that will appear in the next update.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Will it Help Online Marketers?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Simple Optimization</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First of all, Simplified Optimization provides a clear road map for improving your website\'s Google Search performance through practical advice catered to your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Efficiency in Time-Saving</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, identifying areas that need work lets you concentrate on your SEO activities. Good task prioritizing will help you to save significant time and money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Following Google\'s Guidelines</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, knowing Google\'s search ranking elements helps you to decide on optimal improvements. Also, understanding what Google values allows you to match your material and website layout.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Spotting Growing Patterns</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finding popular pages and trending search terms also helps you stay ahead of the competitors. This knowledge lets you quickly modify your material and quickly seize higher search traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Developing SEO Skills</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, Simplified Optimization provides great learning chances regardless of your SEO knowledge, regardless of whether you are an experienced professional or a newcomer. Thus, it is time for you to discover fresh approaches to maximize your search engine optimization skills.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember that these are just \"suggestions,\" even though Google\'s new tool garners a lot of interest. You should only feel obliged to implement some of the recommended adjustments. We advise you to start trying this feature and see how it complements your website plan. Furthermore, as we still have to wait for other SEOs to share their experiences, this tool has yet to show what it can do; thus, monitoring its development is crucial.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, keep informed about the most recent <strong>Google SEO changes</strong> and practical advice with us!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Google-Search-Console-last-updated.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-08 06:13:56','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(127,'Data Cleansing vs. Data Enriching: What\'s the Difference?','data-cleansing-vs-data-enriching-whats-the-difference','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are you confused between data cleansing and data enrichment, or do you think both these processes are the same? The answer is no, they are not. Although both work to&nbsp; maintain accuracy and reliability. To learn more, read our blog that has all the information you need to understand these crucial processes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In order to guarantee that insights are comprehensive, data enrichment adds pertinent external data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data cleansing ensures that the information is accurate and trustworthy by removing any mistakes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moreover, businesses can benefit from better decision-making and more effective marketing with good data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Did you know businesses lose $9.7 million yearly because of insufficient data? This global problem affects all businesses, from big ones to small ones, underscoring the importance of reliable data enrichment and <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data cleansing services</strong></a>. But what does \"bad\" data mean? It\'s not just misspelled words or missing numbers. Instead, insufficient data might be spread out on different platforms in different formats, be formatted or encoded in a way that doesn\'t make sense, or be old and useless.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, data quality is essential in the business-to-business (B2B) sector, especially for Sales Development Representatives (SDRs). That\'s because they know how crucial it is to get leads and meet sales goals. However, it\'s not always easy to get from raw data to actionable insights. Trusting the information is challenging because every step of the process can introduce mistakes or biases. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Cleansing: Cleaning Up Your Data&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data cleaning is the process of eliminating or fixing wrong, corrupt, or badly formatted data and eliminating duplicates in a dataset. This kind of mistake can happen whenever data is combined or exported into a new form.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you have a lot of data, it can be hard to find mistakes like labeling or duplication. However, a data cleaning protocol can eliminate or reduce these errors, giving you the good data you need to make data-based decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Example: </strong>Imagine you have a big database of email addresses or SMS subscribers, and you need to extract certain information for a marketing campaign, such as the area codes your subscribers reside in. After reviewing all that data, you should know what to do next. On the other hand, you notice that the phone numbers in your list aren\'t all formatted the same. Some have dashes, some have brackets, and some skip the area code altogether. Resolving these discrepancies is known as data cleaning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Enrichment: Adding Value to Your Data</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The IBM Big Data &amp; Analytics Hub claims that poor data costs the US economy $3.1 trillion annually. Furthermore, Ovum Research shows that inadequate data can cost companies at least thirty percent of their sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, data enrichment is essential to improving data quality by adding relevant external data. Also, it enriches your dataset with prospect/customer data like:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Demographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firmographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Social media profiles</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Behavior-based intent data</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By adding this information to your data, you gain better insights and understanding of your audience or customers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>For example,</strong> let\'s say a lead has dealt with a company before but has never subscribed to the mailing list. This time, the lead decides to join the mailing list and enters their correct first and last name into the business database, but they forget to include their address.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this case, a tool that uses socio-demographic data to enrich data could compare the data entered with correct postal records and add address data automatically, raising their lead score.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Importance of Data Cleansing and Data Enrichment</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quality of the data is essential to the success of data-driven marketing, the generation of leads, and the overall customer experience. Without accurate data, your marketing campaigns will not be able to perform to their full potential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, there are seemingly an infinite number of benefits to having accurate customer data:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make your profiles better so that you can send relevant offers to the right prospects.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure you send mail, etc., to the right person and address.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cut down on the waste from marketing to emails, addresses, etc., that don\'t exist.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Add more information to your data to learn more about your customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Take more charge of the whole B2B customer journey</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Big Data should be made more valuable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the data augmentation and deep learning technology available today, you can clean and enrich your data with minimal effort. Because of this, you won\'t have to worry about manually updating records whenever there is a change in customer information, which is a massive benefit as your CRM expands.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Are Data Cleansing and Enrichment Different?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basis of Differentiation</strong></td><td><strong>Data Cleansing</strong></td><td><strong>Data Enrichment&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Meaning</td><td>Which fixes existing data errors, inconsistencies, and gaps, ensures data quality and improves data consistency.</td><td>Which adds missing information and fills gaps in the data, further enhances data richness and adds more details.</td></tr><tr><td>Focus Areas</td><td>Focuses on cleaning and standardizing existing data.</td><td>Focuses on enhancing data richness and adding more details.</td></tr><tr><td>Applications</td><td>Primarily used to clean and standardize existing data.</td><td>Use it to augment existing data with additional relevant data.</td></tr><tr><td>Purpose</td><td>Ensures accurate and reliable data for analysis.</td><td>Expands the scope and usefulness of the data.</td></tr><tr><td>Benefits</td><td>It can add missing information in the data.Personalized and targeted marketing campaigns.Improves decision-making and strategy.</td><td>Provides accurate and consistent dataEliminates duplicate, incomplete, and inaccurate data.Improves the workflow of data processing.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Prioritizing Data Quality: Cleansing vs. Enrichment  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, both practices are important for maintaining data quality and accuracy. Let’s understand more about it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CRM software has always been on the rise. In 2018, it soared in popularity with a staggering 16% growth rate, solidifying its position as one of the software market\'s most dynamic sectors. This phenomenal momentum continues today (in 2024).&nbsp; In fact, analysts predict that the CRM software market will maintain a stellar growth rate of 13.4% from 2023 to 2032, with a projected revenue exceeding a whopping $80 billion by 2025.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even though CRM has many benefits, bad data quality can really hurt your business\'s growth, income, and ability to make accurate predictions. Also, if the information in your CRM system is wrong or missing, it might prevent you from getting qualified B2B leads.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because of insufficient data, your sales development team may encounter trouble filling the sales funnel with qualified leads, and your forecasts are off, which means you miss out on opportunities.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, your business goals may not be met in the end.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, two important things you can do to deal with these problems and ensure the quality of your data are data cleansing and data enrichment. By using these steps to maintain and improve your data, you can lessen the adverse effects of insufficient data and set your business up for better results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Common Issues to Address  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to optimize data management effectively, remember and avoid certain things when using data enrichment and <strong>data cleansing services</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Avoid Data Silos</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is easy to keep data in different databases. For example, marketing uses marketing automation, sales uses CRM, and customer service uses a different system. Systems that aren\'t connected block a company-wide view. Instead, putting all of this information together into a complete picture of the customer and situation makes things much better.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Discard Unnecessary Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After all the work involved in gathering data, there is sometimes an inclination never to delete it. From a compliance standpoint, though, this can cause trouble. Eliminating outdated data—those of individuals unsubscribed from your email list—helps you keep your business GDPR compliant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Continuously Clean and Enrich Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to research, B2B data deteriorates at 70% annually; thus, if you neglect to clean and update your data regularly, you risk setting your sales and marketing team up for failure. Just-in-time data cleansing is the process by which businesses clean and examine their data on a project or campaign basis.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Both of these concepts are important for managing and ensuring data quality because they help clean and check all of your data as it moves through the data pipeline. Moreover, meaningful analytics and business decisions based on data need to be able to be cleaned and added to data continuously and effectively.<br>Schedule a call with our team to learn how we can assist you in managing your data with our data cleansing and <strong>enrichment services</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Data-Cleansing-vs.-Data-Enriching-Whats-the-Difference.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-07 13:16:18','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(128,'How to Optimize Your Data Strategy with Professional Data Management Services','how-to-optimize-your-data-strategy-with-professional-data-management-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Behind every successful data management initiative lies an excellent data strategy. This blog explores tips for optimizing data management with examples. Also, discover how expert information management services can enhance accuracy and efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You don\'t have to worry about internal costs and training when outsourcing data management services. Instead, you can focus on keeping your data organized and safe. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Setting clear goals that align with company goals is integral to implementing a data strategy well.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Monitoring KPIs and their effects on the business ensures that things are always getting better and aligned with strategic goals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine being in charge of a ship across a vast ocean with no map or compass to help you. It can feel like that when running a business without a data strategy. You might feel lost and unsure of the direction to take.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a leading <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data management company</strong></a><strong>,</strong> Tech2Globe knows that data is more than just numbers on a page. It\'s critical for making astute company choices. We can guide you through the maze of information - from gathering it to storing it securely and, most importantly, making good use of it - thanks to our experience in integrated solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let us study together what a data strategy is and how keeping track of your data can help your company. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are Data Management Services?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data Management services cater to the need of organizing, storing, and maintaining data efficiently. Also, by outsourcing these services, you take the burden of in-house costs and training out of your head. Moreover, you get the time to work on other tasks while a professional manages your data and optimizes your strategy, ensuring accuracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Data Strategy?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A data strategy is a plan that outlines how an organization should manage and use data assets to make decisions. It includes the technology, processes, and people involved in data management. Generally, data strategy involves rules and guidelines to handle data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Best Practices for Developing a Data Management Strategy  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Define Clear Objectives: </strong>Developing a good data strategy starts with clearly defining your goals for your approach. Moreover, a successful data strategy and efficient application of it depend on matching your general company goals with these objectives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To begin with, recognize the main limitations and factors that influence your company. For example, consider your finances along with the capabilities and expertise of your current employees. This can assist in identifying which parts of your data strategy are possible for your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, to accomplish specific goals as specified in your data strategy, you might have to invest in higher-tier services or bring an expert proficient in a particular coding language on board.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Link Data Sources:</strong> As the organization has grown, data management has become decentralized without a management strategy, making it a nightmare.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, standardize data architecture and connect disparate systems. Once you do this, taking business ownership of data management and aligning data use with business strategy is more accessible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organizations with fragmented legacy systems face insurmountable data retrieval and use gaps. Due to their inability to disclose how and where their data was obtained, they risk non-compliance with new regulations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can link, replace, or combine your systems. Most importantly, your data systems should support your business strategy. Second, they should provide data coherence, visibility, deduplication, and archive technologies to protect more while storing less. Lastly, it must be adaptable to future growth.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Outline your Data Delivery Plan: </strong>Once your data is under control, what structure and delivery method would best maximize business use? This is important if your business runs several ERP, CRM, and e-commerce systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data delivery is bringing pertinent information into the correct systems and hands. The GDPR and other data privacy rules call for accurate reporting. Moreover, businesses have to reveal their data acquisition, management, and protection policies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Systems that let users make data-driven business decisions—that is, ones using customer data reports to enhance current products and develop new ones to satisfy consumer needs—are what you need. Additionally, systems using sustainability data process management to reach and measure organizational goals are essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Infrastructure and Technology: </strong>First, people and culture drive a successful data strategy, but the right tools and technologies enable data management. Therefore, your tools and technologies should support your data strategy goals and business ecosystem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, a good data strategy considers a company\'s technical debt—outdated servers, systems, and technology that could pose a risk. Consequently, the plan should detail how the business will incrementally update systems, considering budget projections and financial growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adopt Uniform Guidelines for Data Governance:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consider a company that heavily uses customer data for marketing. For instance, they track demographics, purchases, and website behavior. However, this valuable data could be scattered, inconsistent, or inaccurate without a data governance framework. Imagine a filing cabinet full of unorganized customer cards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To address this issue, a data governance framework solves it. Think of it as clear customer data filing guidelines. Specifically, it assigns responsibilities for data accuracy (like a \"data filing clerk\"), sets security standards (to prevent unauthorized access), and ensures everyone can easily access the information they need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, a company needs skilled data analysts and a strong data governance team. Moreover, you need customer data experts who can organize it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Measure the Success of Data Strategy?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to maximize the information you have? The secret is to monitor how successful your initiatives in data management are. Monitoring important business metrics, including key performance indicators (KPIs), helps a <strong>data management company </strong>to enhance its data strategy and reach its general objectives constantly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Accuracy and quality of data:</strong> Inaccurate data can generate false information that harms your company. Conversely, effective data management relies on verifying and validating your data sets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Consumption:</strong> How frequently do users of your data access and apply it? Monitoring this helps you appreciate how dependent on data your team is and how it generally supports improved corporate decision-making.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Compliance with Laws.</strong> Like GDPR is ensured by regular audits of your security policies, data collecting methods, and data asset use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Business Impact: </strong>Track how your method of data governance influences daily operations and corporate results. This could call for anything from better client experiences to more income.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Strategy Tools   </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Professional data management services employ advanced tools to ensure that every strategy is efficient, maximizing the value and accuracy of your data. What are these advanced tools? Let’s learn about them:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Tableau: </strong>Data scientists can do more with Tableau than just show numbers. It lets them put together different graphs and charts to tell a clear story. Plus, it helps break down barriers to information in your company by letting everyone see data. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Power BI: </strong>Businesses that want to get the most out of their data will love Power BI. It cuts right through the complex parts of data analysis so that you can find those valuable pieces of information faster and with less effort.  Through the information it provides, you can make clear information reports that can help everyone in your organization make decisions based on data. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Google Analytics: </strong>With its sophisticated analytics to grasp consumer behavior and enhance business decisions, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) is essential for data strategy. It guarantees businesses can use their data for more business impact.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong> Informatica:</strong> By means of more timely, accurate, complete, accessible, useful, and valuable data, Informatica advances our objective of reusability. That enables us to follow industry standards, increase data openness, lower fines\' risk, and so protect privacy and security.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong> TensorFlow: </strong>TensorFlow is an open-source platform for machine learning that uses data flow graphs. It is used a lot by data scientists, software developers, and teachers. In a graph, the nodes are the mathematical operations, and the edges are the tensors, which are multidimensional data arrays that flow between them. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Of course, figuring out how to make a data strategy for your business can be hard. There\'s a lot on your plate right now, but you know you need to plan for the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can do both better with a strong data strategy! Without a doubt, companies that can change quickly will succeed. You can stay successful now and be ready for what comes next with a good data plan that gives you the information you need to make intelligent choices on the go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Need some help getting your data strategy off the ground? We have professionals here to help you through the process. We can also help you with our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>ecommerce product data entry services</strong></a><strong> </strong>so you can focus on running your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/image_2024_08_06T11_48_46_104Z.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-06 12:53:35','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(129,'What Are the Benefits of Online Data Entry Services?','what-are-the-benefits-of-online-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>In the past, data entry was done manually, but now, every information is entered online. This blog focuses on the primary benefits of online data entry services and how they can accelerate your business operations while ensuring accuracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Online or digital data entry organizes various information types efficiently.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Outsourcing data entry enhances security and reduces errors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Professionals and modern technology improve accuracy and productivity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you trying to keep up with all you have on file? You\'re not alone. Like yours, many companies handle tons of data every day. Most businesses consider data to be essential for success, but maintaining accuracy can prove difficult.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, securely and precisely handling large volumes of data can be quite challenging, particularly for company expansion. Hiring and teaching internal staff members <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>online data entry</strong></a> data can be costly and time-consuming.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, what can you do? Your data-related issues may be answered by outsourcing online data entry. Prepare yourself to release your staff to concentrate on more critical chores and lighten the load. These services are manned by professionals with the most recent technology who can securely and quickly handle your data. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Online Data Entry?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online data entry is the best way to organize data. It can involve all sorts of information, medical records, or survey responses. Its process includes receiving data, entering it into a system, and proofreading it before finalizing it. These services only exist with skilled employees, requiring efficient scanners and modern technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of Online Data Entry </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Data security</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Feeling stressed about losing important documents or worried about information leaks? Relax! These services use special servers with top-notch security features. Imagine a server like a high-security vault, but even better! Not just anyone can access your information. These servers have strict rules about who can enter. Thus, this is like a secret code that scrambles your data. Even if someone got the information, they wouldn\'t be able to understand it!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Cost-effective</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Information entry services store your information electronically, eliminating the need for printing and buying a lot of paper.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, fewer mistakes mean less money wasted.&nbsp; How? Manual data entry can be prone to errors, which can cost you money down the road. With electronic data storage, information is entered accurately once, saving you the hassle (and expense) of fixing mistakes later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Data entry experts</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experts in professional services execute your assigned tasks. They implement strategies to make the process smooth and successful. They also keep up with the latest technologies, employing the best techniques and delivering the desired result. However, you must first assign them a small task to test their proficiency and confirm that they don’t just brag about their professionalism but also prove that what they do is the best!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Scalability</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All of us know that every business has its own needs. A startup or small business might not need to process a lot of data every day, but some midsize or large businesses do. These companies would need online data input services every day. In some industries, the amount of data may change with the seasons, making it challenging for the company to hire a full-fledged in-house team. Having a team of data experts work for you could cost a lot and even cause you to lose money. Outsourcing, on the other hand, lets companies handle data entry tasks \"as needed\" and quickly scale up or down with little notice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Improve productivity</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine searching through stacks of paper for hours to find one document. Annoying, right? This is what poor data management can do to your employees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Information that is inaccurate or unavailable can slow your team down. Thus, data input services save the day by making information accessible. Lastly, your employees get the benefit of working on more valuable tasks for your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Save time</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you hire professionals to do data entry for you, you give your employees more free time. Think about all the important things they could be doing instead of typing away!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, since your team isn\'t stuck on data entry anymore, your whole business works better. It\'s like everyone suddenly gets an extra hour in the day!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s also known that these services can turn things around quickly. Their fast, accurate data entry ensures you know what you\'re working with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Latest tech</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fact that data entry outsourcing companies have access to technology that you probably wouldn\'t have, particularly without a large financial investment, is perhaps the biggest benefit of outsourcing compared to doing data entry in-house. The quality varies from device to device, but many small companies use basic scanners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Along with state-of-the-art scanning technology, outsourcing companies frequently use a variety of technologies that speed up operations and improve accuracy. This gives them the power to transform documents, extract relevant data, make data searchable based on certain criteria, and guarantee data accessibility from various places.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Accuracy &amp; Precision</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, having access to more advanced technology typically means that things are more accurate. OCR and ICR can intelligently read and understand information. They can find and digitize even handwritten notes, making filing and searching easier than ever. Regular methods cannot achieve the same levels of accuracy as these methods. Reliable outsourcing service providers also check the final results carefully to ensure they are correct and of high quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Outsource Online Data Entry Services?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though there are several reasons to outsource data entry services needs, the most crucial one is that it saves money and time. Outsourced data entry lets you concentrate on your primary business operations and let the professionals handle data entry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accessing the newest tools and technologies is another principal advantage of outsourcing. Moreover, working with a reputable service provider helps you be sure you\'re using the most current techniques since data entry is a fast-developing area.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At last, outsourcing data entry services lets you know your sensitive information is in good hands. Also, service providers have strict security systems in place to guard your data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hire Tech2Globe for your data entry outsourcing needs if you\'re seeking an affordable and dependable <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data management service</strong></a>. With everything organized, you can rest easy, save money, and reduce wasted time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/profitable-business-strategy.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-06 00:52:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(130,'The Ultimate Guide to Choosing the Right Data Management Service Provider','the-ultimate-guide-to-choosing-the-right-data-management-service-provider','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are in-house data management practices costing too much, wasting effort and time? Don\'t worry; you can outsource them to a reliable data management company and avail of all the benefits. But how do you choose the right service provider? In this blog, we\'ve made it easy for you to find the one that matches your needs. Consider all the things mentioned here before making your decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data management maintains the important records and documentation of a business. Effective data management guarantees that data can be located as needed as well.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Outsourced data management allows you to benefit from field-based industry experts. It thus releases employees to concentrate on more strategic development initiatives.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Before deciding on a data management system, you should give several factors some thought, including experience, data security they provide, and more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you considered using an<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>outsource data management service</strong></a>? ​There are a lot of companies that offer these services, so it can be hard to pick the right one.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, getting the right data management service provider for your business can make all the difference. They can give you an edge over your competitors, help you run your business better, and get more out of your data. However, it would help if you didn\'t rush into this. Thus, take your time to make a wise decision, i.e., after considering everything. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Outsource Data Management Services? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply put, when you outsource tasks, you get access to experts in that field. It can be beneficial if the job requires expertise or needs skills that you don\'t have on staff.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can free up your employees to work on more strategic projects that drive growth by giving them tasks that take a lot of time or require specialized knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, some functions can be complex to handle internally because of a lack of skills or resources. So the service provider can handle all of those things efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Elements of Choosing a Data Management Provider. </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experience is crucial. Thus, look for a service provider with a solid history of delivering data management tools. Also, their staff ought to be aware of a few key issues:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data architecture</strong>: They should allow one to design and create the framework that will enable simple data organization and storage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keeping your data safe is vital: </strong>Look for a team that gives top security priority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Knowledge in the field: </strong>One should know the guidelines relevant to their sector. Changing your data needs as your company expands will help you to adapt.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Considerations Before Making a Decision </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your Data Management Needs</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s important to know what your company needs from its data before you start looking for data management service providers. First, you need to figure out what kinds of data your business handles. These are some common groups:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Structured data:</strong> Here, customer names, addresses, and account numbers are set up in a way that makes sense. It\'s simple for computers to store and look at.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unstructured Data:</strong> This is information that isn\'t well organized, like emails, posts on social media, and pictures. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Transactional Data: </strong>This type of data records business activities like logins, purchases, and payments. It helps keep an eye on performance and trends.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Analytical Data:</strong> This data has been processed and used to learn more. It comes from a lot of different sources.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Provider’s Approach to Data Security &amp; Privacy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data security should be a top priority when choosing a data management service provider, no matter what your business is. To keep your information safe, do the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first thing you need to do is learn about the security features of the provider. Ask in-depth questions about:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What specific methods and tools do they use to keep your data safe?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How do they encrypt data while it\'s being sent and stored? </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How do they restrict access to your data?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To protect privacy even more, do they offer ways to hide or anonymize private data?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What Practices Provider Follows?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You shouldn\'t make big decisions based on wrong information and shouldn\'t let your business depend on messy or wrong data either. When picking a provider, make sure you ask about how they handle data quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get good data, here are some essential things to ask about:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data Profiling:</strong> Understanding the traits of your data is what data profiling is all about. The service provider should be able to look at your data and tell you about data types, missing values, and possible errors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data Cleansing:</strong> A process of eliminating mistakes and gaps in your data. The company that provides it should have the right tools and know-how to find and fix these problems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data deduplication:</strong> Too many duplicate records can make your data hard to read and affect your analysis. The service provider should be able to get rid of these copies so that the data is clean and correct.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data validation: </strong>It means making sure that your data is correct and complete. The service provider should have ways to ensure your data is accurate and true to life.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Service Provider\'s Disaster Recovery Strategy</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Unexpected events can throw off even the best-laid plans. Thus, looking for a data management service provider with a strong recovery plan is important. Talk in-depth about the outsourcing company’s plan for what to do in a disaster. Furthermore, this should include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Backing up your data: How often does the service provider back up your data? When you back up your data more often, you lose less if something terrible happens.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Where your backups are stored: Where do you keep your backups? It\'s best to keep backups safe from your primary systems so they don\'t get damaged by the same disaster that affects them.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recovery procedures: If something goes wrong, how will the service provider get your data and systems back up and running? You need a clear recovery process if you want to get your business back up and running quickly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Management Services Provided&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The services offered by a data management service provider can significantly impact your data strategy. While data integration is essential, look for providers offering a broader range of services:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Profiling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Cleansing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Transformation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Enrichment</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, good governance is essential. It makes sure that your data is correct, consistent, and safe. Moreover, companies that want to get helpful information from their data should ask the provider about their analytics tools:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Machine Learning:</strong> Machine learning can help you find patterns and trends in your data that you might not have seen before. This can help you make better decisions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Predictive modeling:</strong> Using past data, providers can make models that can tell what will happen in the future, giving your business an edge over the competition.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are many ways to find a good service, but these are some of the most important things you must consider.<br>We are an excellent option if you seek a top provider to outsource data management services. Also, we specialize in offering <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>ecommerce product upload services</strong></a> and provide data conversion, processing, entry, and more to deliver the best results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/data-management-service.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-05 12:30:57','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(131,'Automate Data Extraction from Websites to Excel with Our Expert Data Extraction Service','automate-data-extraction-from-websites-to-excel-with-our-expert-data-extraction-service','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Looking to extract crucial data from websites to Excel but confused about which method to use? No worries! In this blog, explore different methods for data extraction and learn why data scraping is important.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure accuracy by automating data extraction as you can quickly get data from different documents and ensure it is correct.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses save time, money, and labor by getting well-organized, and better data from automated tools that scrape data from websites to Excel.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Different methods have pros and cons that depend on your technical knowledge and the project\'s needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating quality lead lists, investigating the market, or looking at your rivals all depend on gathering data from the internet. Our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction services</strong></a><strong> </strong>enable you to quickly compile this important data. If Excel is part of your tech stack, you can use its great processing and analytics tools to turn the extracted data into insights that you can use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is not always as easy as clicking a button; you must import your data before you can use Excel to examine and arrange it. However, this process doesn\'t have to be hard for you. Let’s show you how to get data from a website and put it into Excel.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What is Automated Data Extraction?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sales comparisons can be a slog when you\'re sifting through a lot of data, which is why Automated data extraction can pull your sales history directly from various property documents, regardless of format. This saves you time and ensures accuracy by eliminating manual data entry.&nbsp; Furthermore, you can process CRE models and generate error-free reports right away.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why Scrape Data from Websites to Excel?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can all agree that web scraping is very useful. A handy automated tool can work for you, so you don\'t have to spend hours precisely copying and pasting data point by point. Imagine a small robot that quickly searches the web for all the information you need while you sit back and enjoy your time off.&nbsp; Moreover:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You receive outcomes that are unimaginably quick and trustworthy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses can save time, money, and labor by using accurate results. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Makes clean, well-organized, and superior data accessible.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Methods to Extract Data From Websites to Excel&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After analyzing different methods for scraping data from a website into Excel and consulting with experts, we came up with the best options:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Manual copying and pasting: </strong>This is one way to get data from websites into Excel:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can use a scraper or manually get data from a website.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To use Excel, copy and paste data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This method is quick, simple, and doesn\'t need any technical know-how. You can also copy and paste by hand if you don\'t have a lot of data, but there are some limits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can only use this method if you scrape data from a table. If not, you might end up with unstructured data that you can\'t look at.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What\'s wrong with this method? It doesn\'t work for long projects with lots of details. Also, copying and pasting information from different websites by hand can take much time and may not be current.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Web queries:</strong> Power Query is another way to do it. Additionally, the built-in feature in Excel lets you scrape data straight from the web, making it very useful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web queries are easier to use than other methods. You can use them for free; they\'re pretty easy, and you don\'t need any extra software. How to use them:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Start Excel and go to the \"Data\" tab.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>There is a section on the left called \"Get &amp; Transform Data.\" In this section, click on the \"From Web\" button.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Type in the website\'s address, then click \"OK.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Excel will look at the website for a moment to see if there are any tables it can pull out. A small window will appear, showing a sneak peek of the website. Click \"Import\" when you can add the data to your Excel sheet.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web queries are excellent for quick jobs, but there are some things you should remember. Unstructured data is data that isn\'t neatly organized in tables. They also can\'t work with websites whose content changes constantly (dynamic websites) or whose layouts are complex to understand. Also, scraping data from one website at a time can take a while since you have to wait for Excel to finish each import.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Excel’s VBA: </strong>Visual Basic for Applications, or VBA, is a programming language that comes with Excel and lets you make your automations, such as data scraping.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>VBA sounds powerful, but you\'ll need to know how to code to use it well. VBA might be hard to understand if you haven\'t used programming languages. Therefore, to give you a general idea of how it works:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First, you\'ll need to enable the Developer tab in Excel. It\'s kind of hidden by default, but you can find it under File &gt; Options &gt; Customize Ribbon. Just check the box next to \"Developer,\" and it\'ll appear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Go to the Developer tab and click on \"Visual Basic.\" This brings up a new window with a code editor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must add a \"Module\" in this window so your code can live there. You\'ll also have to write the code that will scrape the website. The code you use here can change based on the data you need and how the website is made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finally, once you have your code written, press F5 to run it and see it in action!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some negative aspects of VBA:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Learning Curve: As we already said, you need to know how to code to use VBA. If you are new to programming, the learning curve can be steep.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited Data Types: Some types of data may not work with VBA. That is, it may not be able to handle all website data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Script-Heavy Websites: If the website you want to scrape has many scripts, you may need to install extra tools (libraries) for VBA to work correctly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This means that VBA can automate web scraping, but it works best for people who know how to code. If not, you might want to look into other choices that are easier to use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Specialized web scraping tools: </strong>Want to get any kind of information from a website? Web scraping tools are the only thing you need. It\'s easy, quick, and, best of all, these tools don\'t require any code to scrape. They can even do extra things, like <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data enrichment services</strong></a>, which add more information to your data, or email writing, which helps you write emails quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The right web scraping tool can make all the difference. Additionally, there are a lot of them out there. Therefore, focus on these must-have features:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Excellent Scraping: </strong>The best tools can get data from various websites, from big ones like LinkedIn to smaller, more specific ones. They should be able to get the information you need quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Boosters:</strong> With data boosters, you can give your data a vitamin boost. Try to find tools to add to your data by getting extra information from other sources. For a fuller picture of what you\'re scraping, this can help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Excel: </strong>It should be easy to send your data to Excel. Also, there\'s no need for coding or complicated steps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Money-Saver: </strong>The best tool would be a free plan that lets you try it out before you pay for it. Also, all price options should be easy to see and understand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Working together as a Team: </strong>The best tool will work well with other apps and platforms you already use, so you won\'t have to switch between them as often.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our <strong>data extraction services</strong> will do all the work for you. Our experts can automatically pull helpful information from different websites, saving you time and effort. This eliminates the slowdowns that come from collecting data manually and ensures you have all the data you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Automate-Data-Extraction-from-Websites-to-Excel-with-Our-Expert-Data-Extraction-Service-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-05 07:23:11','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(132,'How Can Outsourcing Data Management Services Grow Your Business?','how-can-outsourcing-data-management-services-grow-your-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Managing your business data is as crucial as growing the business itself because data is what drives success. This blog covers everything you need to know about outsourcing data management services to a reliable partner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Discover several reasons driving the growing need to outsource data management services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Outsourcing business processes offers significant cost savings and efficiency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improved data quality and security are key benefits of outsourcing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you new to outsourcing and want to know how it helps a business grow? Then you are at the right place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>Data management</strong></a> outsourcing is a widely known practice. Several businesses opt to outsource these services to reduce costs, which in turn helps them save money on expenses related to salaries and overhead.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, offshoring is only beneficial when you find a suitable provider—the team that can coordinate, collate, and maintain your data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, you can pass over responsibility for data storage and related tasks like product updates, system updates, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Outsourcing and How Does It Work?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As your business blossoms, the need for expert support will also grow. Undoubtedly, you deserve the dream team which will help you propel your success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing business processes to remote specialists can offer you many benefits. This is because you can delegate tasks to qualified professionals. Moreover, You get the time to focus on yourself and your core strengths – growing your business and making a profit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether or not to outsource all of your business is up to you. One very practical approach to scale a business and save money is to outsource a part of it, such as data entry management.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Reasons for Outsourcing Data Management Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing your data management plan can be the best option due to the following reasons:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Increased Data Volumes</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every department in your company has access to diverse data types and needs to maximize value.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Traditional models require IT to prepare data for each use case and maintain databases or files. As data grows, an organization may forget what it has, where it is, and how to use it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>New Roles For Analytics</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As your company uses data-driven decision-making, more people must access and analyze data. Without analytics experience, naming conventions, complex data structures, and databases can be difficult.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If data conversion takes too long, analysis won\'t happen, and the data\'s value is lost.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Compliance Requirements</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You might be aware of the fact that constantly changing compliance requirements make it challenging to ensure whether the data is correct or not.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, quickly understanding what data to use is crucial for any organization. This includes PII intake, tracking, and monitoring for compliance and privacy regulations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Advantages of Outsourcing Data Management Services</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Did you know? Businesses spend up to 55% of their budget on information management. What if this cost can be reduced significantly without compromising the work? This may sound like a pipe dream, but outsourcing has made it simple to lower your expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can grow your business through effectively outsourcing Data handling services. Let\'s learn about its advantages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Cost-savings</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managing data can be a real headache. It requires constant attention and resources, which can affect your profit margins.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can hand off data handling to a team of experts. They will perform every required task on your behalf, such as developing innovative products or simply winning over new customers. So, you have to focus on the big picture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Better data quality</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quality of the data cannot be compromised. It is the most important factor that guarantees the correctness and relevance of your information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can be sure that a third-party provider of data maintenance will deliver you excellent services when you outsource. Additionally, they can access methods and instruments to keep the highest caliber data standards.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Enhance the visibility of analytics</strong>.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data quality and governance issues are often hidden. As a result, knowing what\'s going on across the company can be difficult with an in-house team.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An outside team that offers <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data management service</strong></a> can assess your data\'s quality and consistency. They spot issues before they arise, ensuring that all departments in your company have the information they need to achieve your goals efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Improved data security</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IBM once reported that data breaches cost an average of $4.35 million. This proves that costs associated with cybersecurity incidents can add up quickly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What can you do? Enjoy the benefits of professionals\' state-of-the-art security measures. Before storing any data, they will check that the cloud storage is secure and encrypted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your data is stored in a separate location, so if your servers experience any problems, you won\'t lose access to it.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Making data-driven decisions</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>More data means more chances of making the right decisions. Still, collecting and evaluating data is complicated and may present particular problems.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your outsourced experts will use the knowledge they gain from the analysis to assist you in developing solid plans that will significantly help your decision-making.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Scalability</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A major benefit of outsourcing these services is the flexibility to grow or shrink as needed. Your outsourced partner can easily manage the additional work without interfering with your business as it expands.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, a business can adjust its IT resources up or down as needed with data management outsourcing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Outsourcing is a Smart Business Move</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing data will also improve your knowledge and insight because your partner will be keeping up with data handling trends, standards, and systems. They may constantly enhance their skills, learn new processes, and innovate their services to stay competitive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Risk mitigation is another benefit of outsourcing. It helps you avoid system implementation and management errors. Moreover, a partner experienced in data system troubleshooting will support you, and people will be ready to fix problems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing offers flexibility. Scalable services are available. You only pay for what you need; your provider can adapt if needed. Help you increase, modify, or decrease your plan. Also, moving from a fixed full-time salary to a variable cost will give you more money to invest in other business areas.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies are finding it increasingly challenging to manage, analyze, and secure all the data they collect and store. It can also take a lot of time and cost a lot of money. Hiring professionals to do this work can save you money and get better results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Partner with us, India\'s leading <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data management company</strong></a><strong>,</strong> and free yourself from these challenges. Focus on building success for your business and leave the meticulous task to our experts. Prime features of our services include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flexible teams for your needs and budget.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The latest security infrastructure for business-critical data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Professional team dedicated to your project.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>24/7 support for all your questions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A dedicated manager who updates you on projects.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/How-Can-Outsourcing-Data-Management-Services-Grow-Your-Business.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-02 12:08:40','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(133,'Modernizing Data Extraction – 10 Effective Strategies to Follow','modernizing-data-extraction-10-effective-strategies-to-follow','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Modernization of data has become crucial to thriving in the current economy. Read this blog to learn how modernizing data extraction by employing effective strategies can bring your business to the next level.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Data Extraction Services use AI-powered tools to automate data extraction.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Implement machine learning to improve accuracy and efficiency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With web scraping technologies gather data from websites for right analysis and decision-making.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make use of cloud-based data warehouses for scalable storage and real-time access.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data is valuable for companies or it would be right to say that companies love data. However, they need the right <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction</strong></a> tool to handle all the collected information. This information, like what people buy or how they use websites, is valuable because it helps them make better choices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, the information companies get comes in all sorts of shapes and sizes. To keep on top of it all, they use special or “modernized” tools and programs to sort it out and make sense of it.There are several effective strategies for modernizing organizational data. These strategies can be hard to carry out internally, but <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction services</strong></a> can help organizations do better by putting them into action. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Data Modernization?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get the most out of their data, businesses are turning to data modernization. This is not a one-time fix; it\'s a process with several steps that change how you achieve your data. What is the goal? Make a huge difference in how well you can use data to make decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, data that has been kept separate for a long time in places called \"data silos.\" It\'s hard to get a clear picture because of these silos, which are often connected to old systems. Data modernization takes care of these problems, which moves towards a cloud-based model. This change from \"edge to cloud\" makes accessing data easier for everyone in the organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why is Data Modernization Important?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At present times, data gives us a competitive edge. Thus, businesses need to be quick and flexible to build new skills and get new products and services. They need to analyze data to get the insights that lead to new ideas and more sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, research shows that leaders who put data first do much better than their competitors. They release new products and services faster and beat their revenue goals. Therefore, it can be a challenge for companies that are slower to change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Strategies for Modernizing Data Extraction</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modernizing data extraction is essential for organizations looking to stay competitive in a data-driven world. Moreover, effective and professional <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction services</strong></a> can help you leverage all of these strategies:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. AI and Automation in Data Extraction</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the past, data retrieval was a laborious, manual procedure. You may think of different groups of people wasting hours going through documents and entering data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, AI has completely changed operations and information extraction is no exception. AI now enables automated document processes to extract and convert data into useful form in a matter of seconds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Machine Learning Algorithms</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The second strategy on our list is machine learning algorithms for data extraction. With the help of these algorithms, you can handle complicated data sets. As a result, you can increase accuracy and efficiency. Thus, if you come across rapid and dependable data retrieval, it is possible due to these technologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Utilize Web Scraping Technologies</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organizations can save website data in files or spreadsheets through a process called data scraping, also known as web scraping. It extracts data from the web so that the person doing the scraping can use it themselves or so that other websites can use it, too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The general process of web scraping involve:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find the target site</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Collect target page URLs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Request page HTML from these URLs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Locate HTML content using locators.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Save the data in JSON, CSV, or another structured format.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Adopt ETL Solutions</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ETL-Extract, Transform, Load. It is a popular and established model. Through this method, organizations:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Get the raw data from outside or inside sources, and then use the transformation to get to the final dataset for processing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Later, after the cleansing of data, it is loaded into business intelligence (BI) tools or more storage systems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to most organizations, it is a good way to do things as only the necessary data is loaded for analysis.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Integrate APIs</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What is the role of APIs in data extraction? The standard and safe interface known as an API (application programming interface) enables programmes to interact and collaborate with one another.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mostly, APIs access data from different platforms and services. Therefore, you don\'t need to manually update or retrieve data using this type of API interface; it\'s purpose-built for that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Use Cloud-Based Data Warehouses</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cloud-based data warehouses let you store, process, integrate, clean, load and do other things with structured and semi-structured data in a public cloud environment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, it provides real-time cloud analytics using data from many different sources. Consequently, it is faster than an on-premises data warehouse. Thus, business users can get better insights more quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The 3 popular cloud data warehouse solutions: Amazon Redshift, Google BigQuery, and Panoply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. Enhance Data Quality Management</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Locate the issues and ensure everything functions properly before things worsen. The task is to evaluate the system\'s functionality, user comments, and data quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, reviewing also makes errors, missing data, or information that has to be changed easier to find. Look at user reviews; is finding what they need simple for them? By monitoring, you can keep improving how you handle your data. ​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. Data Governance Plan</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you\'re working on other data tasks during the data modernization process, it\'s easy to forget about regulatory requirements. That\'s why you need a governance plan.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A governance plan says who owns the data, keeps it safe, and can access it.&nbsp; As a result, your data is more likely to stay safe and legal while you work on updating and changing it. Although, this is possible when you have a strong governance plan and the right people and systems in place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>9.&nbsp; Leverage Big Data Technologies</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s not simple to deal with big data, but some tools can assist you. There are four main groups of these tools: data storage, data mining, data analytics, and finally, data visualization. The best part? These tools can work together in real-time, thus, you can use your data to find insights quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>10. Continuous Monitoring and Optimization</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply put, keep an eye on things, fix any problems, and ensure everything works well. Additionally, another job is to keep the tools that extract data up to date. Thus, you can change them for better performance (optimization) and fix any issues. Finally, the whole process of extracting data runs smoothly with monitoring and optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of Data Modernization</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data modernization makes it easier and faster to find information. It cleans up data by getting rid of duplicates, inconsistencies, and mistakes. What if a store used \"client\" instead of \"customer\"? Data modernization would fix that!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine: One big store uses data modernization to make its inventory more efficient. They got rid of product data that was duplicated or didn\'t match up and added data about the suppliers. Similarly, it gets easier for them to guess how much demand there will be and keep enough stock on hand. Because of this, they start making more money, and their customers are happier.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are here to help you modernize your data extraction process. Furthermore, our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>web data extraction services</strong></a> encompass everything you need, including centralized data cataloging, governance, insights, collaboration, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With our services, you will be well on your way to successfully modernizing data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Modernizing-Data-Extraction.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-02 11:45:01','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(134,'How Data Entry Service Gives Advantage To Grip On Your Business Successfully?','how-data-entry-service-gives-advantage-to-grip-on-your-business-successfully','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>This guide covers everything you need to know about <strong>data entry services.</strong> Learn how a professional data entry company gives you an advantage to enhance your business operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated information entry significantly enhances accuracy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strategic decisions rely on accurate, up-to-date data.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Outsourcing data entry saves time and resources.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Expert data entry improves data security and efficiency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All online activities depend on data. Be it making websites or handling transactions, data is vital. However, raw data from various sources is messy and useless. This puts focus on data entry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, companies of all-sizes need to enter data. Internal teams often get stuck on this task, which takes their attention away from more important tasks. Also, managing data in-house can be pricey, especially for new businesses. Thankfully, data entry companies offer a solution. Hiring a professional company to do your data input can save you money and help your business grow. E-commerce businesses can benefit the most from cheap<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>data entry services</strong></a>. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is a Data Entry Service?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the present time, converting data needs to be dependable. You need a service you can trust that can turn your private or public data into a format that you can understand. Moreover, the purpose of a data entry service is to take care of everything. It makes sure the process goes smoothly in a way that a beginner would normally struggle with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hiring someone to do your data processing can help your company grow. You can make more money, keep better track of your leads, and stay more organized. Thus, you can\'t ignore all of these advantages. In many types of businesses, especially marketing ones, the back office has a lot of work to do. As a result, if you don\'t plan and run your business well, work can become too stressful and make things harder for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcRRUDeCHRf5fPDN6chjsOAhKs5V0YIlOiIfBT4QyP4OBX14PuwGt9kM0Scw23MZWRjSahG1tz-MjHoYRf35rAPUfmXg-coVWBVG-HpYiUAfyUXnCrUkRdyGtWXWuy0O0ZeXbYiXUUNgLOOH-yx6SMwug0?key=bkDsjuSkLE9l_kMl7y9DNw\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Importance of Data Entry for Businesses</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ever thought about how important data entry is for your business? You can grasp the importance when considering that automated data input significantly enhances accuracy, achieving between 99.95% and 99.99%, whereas human input ranges from 96% to 99%.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Make wise Decisions:</strong> Business decisions need to be made quickly and with a lot of data these days. Therefore,&nbsp; you need correct and up-to-date information to make smart choices. It shows how things are going in the business, how customers act, and what the market trends are. Consequently, you can make smart strategic decisions now that you have this information.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Expert Planning:</strong> Strategies are based on data. When you\'re looking for new ways to grow your business or just want to keep it safe, strategic planning is based on data. Outsourcing <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>online data entry</strong></a> ensures that the planning data is correct. This gives you the courage to face problems and take advantage of chances that will help your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Business Challenges with In-House Data Entry</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facing data processing challenges while running a business is familiar. However, overcoming these challenges with <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>online data entry</strong></a> services is what matters. Read on to learn about the challenges of in-house data processing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Resource-Heavy:</strong> Doing information entry in-house can take a lot of time and requires a dedicated team. This means that you have to spend a lot of your valuable human resources on it. However, this valuable staff could be put to better use by focusing on core business tasks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mistakes Happen, But They Cost:</strong> When people enter data by hand, they can make mistakes that have big effects. As the amount of data you have grows, these mistakes can get worse, putting the accuracy of your data at risk. Also, it may affect everything from customer satisfaction to financial reporting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Problems with Growth and Too Much Data:</strong> As your business grows, so does the amount of data you need to handle. Information entry processes that are run in-house often need help to keep up with this growth. As a result, it can cause bottlenecks and make it harder to handle the growing needs of data management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5 Benefits of Data Entry Services&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How can you conquer these challenges? How does a data management outsourcing company boost your business success? Let’s answer your questions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s how outsourcing can contribute to your business growth. Learn about its benefits and then make your decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cost Saving: </strong>Hiring and setting up staff is more expensive when you perform data entry in-house. However, through outsourcing, you only pay for the services you need, so you don\'t have to pay for a team of people to work for you. This will help you save a lot of money that you can use to make your business better in other ways.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Faster and more responsive operations:</strong> Professionals who do data processing for clients put accuracy and speed first. They use the newest technology and methods and work 24/7 to process your data. This gives your internal team more time to work on strategic tasks. As a result, your business can run more smoothly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Expert Touch:</strong> Companies that do data entry hire people who are good at managing and processing data. They enter your information correctly and come up with new ways to make it better. Also, better data quality helps people make decisions, and businesses do better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Your Data is Safe: </strong>Nowadays, data security is very important. Therefore, you can relax if you hire a reputable company to do your data recording. To protect your data from cyberattacks, they clean, process, and protect it with customized encryption and data embedding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Business Solution: </strong>Lastly, your internal team has more time and resources to focus on important business tasks. Spending more time on research, analysis, and strategic projects can lead to completing more work. Plus, you get more brand recognition and long-term growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are clear and compelling reasons to use data entry outsourcing services, right? If you hire professionals to enter your data, you\'ll get better results. Also, you can save money and have more time to focus on growing your business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our name is well known for our specialized skills and ability to use the latest technology. Partner with us and leverage the benefits of accurate entry of data. As a leading data processing services company, we offer professional <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>product data entry services</strong></a>, along with image, financial, restaurant menu data entry, and more.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Get in touch with our experts and position your business for success in this competitive world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/How-Data-Entry-Service-Gives-Advantage-To-Grip-On-Your-Business-Successfully-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-08-01 13:26:52','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(135,'Outsourcing Product Data Entry : Your Ultimate Guide To Selecting The Right Partner','outsourcing-product-data-entry-your-ultimate-guide-to-selecting-the-right-partner','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the future, companies will need data in all its forms to understand their clients, streamline their processes, and seize new chances. However, its management and organization are seriously challenged by the enormous data flow.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is when <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>data entry services</strong></a>—including <strong>online data entry—</strong>become essential. It offers much-needed assistance to businesses trying to manage data overload by converting and entering data from different sources into digital formats to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Assist businesses in keeping their records well-organized and up-to-date in order to guarantee efficient operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. Lay the groundwork for decision-making that is driven by data. This will enable businesses to make well-informed decisions regarding their products, services, and strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. In order to protect the privacy of customers and to build trust, it is important to ensure compliance with data protection regulations. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The Growing Demand for Product Data Entry Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Due to the rapid growth of e-commerce in 2024, there is a significant increase in the demand for product data entry. As the internet grows, many businesses seek new ways to boost their online presence. Since the start of ecommerce, stores have put pressure on corporations. Beyond online shopping, e-commerce includes B2B, B2C, and C2C transactions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, as technology and innovation improve the market, online shopping has become more efficient, convenient, and trustworthy for customers. At first glance, the e-commerce sector appears simple and easy. Nevertheless, the truth is hidden behind the complex working structure and attention to fine details for keeping the online business streamlined.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Behind-the-scenes ecommerce has effective product-uploading services that appear on the front end of an online business.&nbsp; For instance, consider a busy online marketplace where customers are searching for a popular electronic gadget like a wireless earbud. Incomplete or inaccurate product listings due to poor data entry can make customers frustrated. Thus, they may choose to shop elsewhere. As a result, this highlights the critical role of efficient product information entry services in maintaining online operations and ensuring a positive customer experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Should You Outsource Product Data Entry Services?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hiring a professional to oversee the whole process from start to finish is essential when you upload data for many products to your ecommerce website. Moreover, hiring a professional service provider can help you save both time and energy. If you outsource some of your work, you\'ll have more time to focus on other critical business areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;Outsourcing product data entry should be considered for the reasons listed below:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The right service provider will be able to complete the task with far more accuracy in comparison to anyone else. This is because of the knowledge and experience they have. Besides, outsourcing these services to publish product details on your e-commerce website doesn\'t cost much.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Secondly, by partnering with an external service provider, you can enjoy a team that operates as an extension of your own.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Furthermore, the external service provider ensures expert management of your data. These professionals are adept at handling various aspects of data entry, including product descriptions, categorization, imagery, etc.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ultimately, you get more time to complete important and core business activities. Strategies for customer retention and loyalty can be your main areas of concentration. Also, professional data entry service providers have enough experience to handle product data. They promise to protect your data by using efficient security measures.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Advantages of Outsourcing Data Entry for Products</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note that the advantages of outsourcing the data entry of e-commerce products exceed the disadvantages. Thus, you will realize that outsourcing this task to another company is a wise decision. Find out what the benefits are.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enjoy more free time to focus on what matters for your business.</strong> Put the time you save by outsourcing to good use and see your staff\'s productivity levels rise.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Better data management.</strong> With the help of seasoned data entry professionals and specialists, outsourcing allows you to manage product data with more flexibility.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cost-effective service. </strong>This is one of the undeniable advantages of product data entry outsourcing. You can track the progress of your project and enjoy the fruits of timely completion. Professionals will be on your side to handle all the related tasks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Data security and accurate product information</strong> uploaded in a secure environment ensure that your product data is not compromised.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Selecting the Right Data Entry Outsourcing Partner&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the other hand, businesses can protect themselves from the dangers of outsourcing by following below guidelines when selecting an outsourcing partner:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Nature of your business</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A service provider should be chosen based on the type of business you run. Plus, the information you are willing to share with them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Choosing Software</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are many risks associated with sharing sensitive product information with a third-party service provider. Therefore, in the case of data entry of products on an e-commerce site, you can inquire and check various programs of service providers. Later, choose the one that caters to your data entry needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prioritize Ease of Service</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When outsourcing your data entry requirements, consider the ease of service. This will help you stay ahead of the game, manage the site and technology well, and keep your customers happy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Operations Management</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ensure that an expert manages operations on your behalf and accurately updates your e-commerce site. This requires appropriate product specifications, images, and testimonials.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Choose Tech-Savvy Partner</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When outsourcing data entry tasks for products, it is critical to ensure that your service provider uses the most recent technologies for updating product data. Moreover, they must be open to new, creative ideas and processes related to product entry of data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ecommerce product data entry services are evolving as we explore their nature. Additionally, integrating advanced technologies like AI and machine learning will define future trends in <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>online data entry</strong></a><strong>.</strong> As companies look to cut costs without sacrificing quality, the necessity of outsourcing these services will become clearer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are thinking about outsourcing data entry or would like more in-depth information, our experts are here to help. For a smooth transition into the future, we provide a free consultation to assist you in making informed decisions about your data entry needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Outsourcing-Product-Data-Entry-Your-Ultimate-Guide-To-Selecting-The-Right-Partner.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-30 07:57:27','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(136,'What Are the Benefits of Online Data Entry Services?','benefits-of-online-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>In the past, data entry was done manually, but now, every information is entered online. This blog focuses on the primary benefits of online data entry services and how they can accelerate your business operations while ensuring accuracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Online or digital data entry organizes various information types efficiently.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Outsourcing data entry enhances security and reduces errors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Professionals and modern technology improve accuracy and productivity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you trying to keep up with all you have on file? You\'re not alone. Like yours, many companies handle tons of data every day. Most businesses consider data to be essential for success, but maintaining accuracy can prove difficult.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, securely and precisely handling large volumes of data can be quite challenging, particularly for company expansion. Hiring and teaching internal staff members <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>online data entry</strong></a> data can be costly and time-consuming.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, what can you do? Your data-related issues may be answered by outsourcing online data entry. Prepare yourself to release your staff to concentrate on more critical chores and lighten the load. These services are manned by professionals with the most recent technology who can securely and quickly handle your data. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Online Data Entry?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online data entry is the best way to organize data. It can involve all sorts of information, medical records, or survey responses. Its process includes receiving data, entering it into a system, and proofreading it before finalizing it. These services only exist with skilled employees, requiring efficient scanners and modern technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of Online Data Entry  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Data security</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Feeling stressed about losing important documents or worried about information leaks? Relax! These services use special servers with top-notch security features. Imagine a server like a high-security vault, but even better! Not just anyone can access your information. These servers have strict rules about who can enter. Thus, this is like a secret code that scrambles your data. Even if someone got the information, they wouldn\'t be able to understand it!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Cost-effective</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Information entry services store your information electronically, eliminating the need for printing and buying a lot of paper.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, fewer mistakes mean less money wasted.&nbsp; How? Manual data entry can be prone to errors, which can cost you money down the road. With electronic data storage, information is entered accurately once, saving you the hassle (and expense) of fixing mistakes later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Data entry experts</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experts in professional services execute your assigned tasks. They implement strategies to make the process smooth and successful. They also keep up with the latest technologies, employing the best techniques and delivering the desired result. However, you must first assign them a small task to test their proficiency and confirm that they don’t just brag about their professionalism but also prove that what they do is the best!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Scalability</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All of us know that every business has its own needs. A startup or small business might not need to process a lot of data every day, but some midsize or large businesses do. These companies would need online data input services every day. In some industries, the amount of data may change with the seasons, making it challenging for the company to hire a full-fledged in-house team. Having a team of data experts work for you could cost a lot and even cause you to lose money. Outsourcing, on the other hand, lets companies handle data entry tasks \"as needed\" and quickly scale up or down with little notice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Improve productivity</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine searching through stacks of paper for hours to find one document. Annoying, right? This is what poor data management can do to your employees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Information that is inaccurate or unavailable can slow your team down. Thus, data input services save the day by making information accessible. Lastly, your employees get the benefit of working on more valuable tasks for your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Save time</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you hire professionals to do data entry for you, you give your employees more free time. Think about all the important things they could be doing instead of typing away!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, since your team isn\'t stuck on data entry anymore, your whole business works better. It\'s like everyone suddenly gets an extra hour in the day!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s also known that these services can turn things around quickly. Their fast, accurate data entry ensures you know what you\'re working with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Latest tech</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fact that data entry outsourcing companies have access to technology that you probably wouldn\'t have, particularly without a large financial investment, is perhaps the biggest benefit of outsourcing compared to doing data entry in-house. The quality varies from device to device, but many small companies use basic scanners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Along with state-of-the-art scanning technology, outsourcing companies frequently use a variety of technologies that speed up operations and improve accuracy. This gives them the power to transform documents, extract relevant data, make data searchable based on certain criteria, and guarantee data accessibility from various places.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Accuracy &amp; Precision</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, having access to more advanced technology typically means that things are more accurate. OCR and ICR can intelligently read and understand information. They can find and digitize even handwritten notes, making filing and searching easier than ever. Regular methods cannot achieve the same levels of accuracy as these methods. Reliable outsourcing service providers also check the final results carefully to ensure they are correct and of high quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Outsource Online Data Entry Services?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Though there are several reasons to outsource data entry services needs, the most crucial one is that it saves money and time. Outsourced data entry lets you concentrate on your primary business operations and let the professionals handle data entry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accessing the newest tools and technologies is another principal advantage of outsourcing. Moreover, working with a reputable service provider helps you be sure you\'re using the most current techniques since data entry is a fast-developing area.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At last, outsourcing data entry services lets you know your sensitive information is in good hands. Also, service providers have strict security systems in place to guard your data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hire Tech2Globe for your data entry outsourcing needs if you\'re seeking an affordable and dependable <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>data management service</strong></a>. With everything organized, you can rest easy, save money, and reduce wasted time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Benefits-of-Online-Data-Entry-Services.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-26 14:23:19','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(137,'Top 8 Data Extraction Issues and How to Solve Them','top-8-data-extraction-issues-and-how-to-solve-them','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>In order to help you avoid experiencing headaches in the future, this article provides information about common data extraction problems along with potential solutions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Importance of data quality and consistency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Solutions for integrating data from diverse sources.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Overcoming technical challenges in data retrieval.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data is important for day-to-day business operations. Similarly, data extraction is critical to driving your business intelligence and analytics with the correct data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But there are a lot of things that can make this process difficult, tedious, and time-consuming. Your methods can be efficient, accurate, and secure if you understand the challenges and implement the correct solutions. <br>Let’s understand the key challenges and how <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction services</strong></a> can help you overcome them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Data Extraction?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Extracting data is like gathering all this stuff organized or not, and turning it into a format your computer can easily understand. Here, you take all the data and organize it into groups/formats to analyze it later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Challenges of Data Extraction and its Solutions</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organizations may face challenges while extracting different kinds of data. The following list of issues includes solutions you may get by outsourcing <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>data extraction services</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Data quality and consistency</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine a hospital with two systems: a digital one for meds and a paper one for allergies. A new doctor checks the digital system for meds but misses allergies in the paper files. As a result, this gap can lead to dangerous prescriptions. It hurts patients and their trust in the hospital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>To overcome the issue, quality checks throughout the ETL process, i.e., from grabbing the data (profiling) to cleaning it up, mapping it correctly, and loading it, are vital. Moreover, regularly checking and fixing data issues is also a crucial task.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Data integration</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The second challenge is integrating the data from different sources. It helps in creating a unified and coherent view.&nbsp; The issue arises when the names, dates, or even units are spelled differently across systems. Furthermore, this makes analysis messy and results in unreliability. Here’s when data integration can help.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>To solve this problem, you need to follow proper rules and regulations. This means using the same labels, codes, and units across everything. Also, double-checking this merging process ensures a smooth analysis without any missing pieces.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Scalability</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data scalability is an important part of every business. Businesses can grow and adapt to changes in the market with its help.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, it can be hard to add more data without slowing things down. To achieve data scalability, you need to make sure that your app can easily handle more data without slowing down or losing its usability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>The technology sector faces the problem of data scalability the most. The way to overcome this challenge is by implementing efficient data storage solutions and optimizing algorithms. Additionally, You can adopt data partitioning techniques to break down large datasets into manageable chunks.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Data security and compliance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another crucial challenge is data security. You won\'t take the risk of leaving your wallet lying around, right? Similarly, you would want to keep sensitive information like customer details or financial records private.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No doubt, data breaches can be devastating, which can lead to economic losses and damage the reputation. Also, it may cause legal trouble. That\'s why it\'s essential to have strong security measures. It can help you protect data from all these mishappenings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>First, ensure that you follow firm security measures. You may make use of secure protocols and tools for the process of extracting data, such as Web Scraper, Octoparse, and Hevo Data. It would help if you allowed only a few individuals to access specific pieces of data. Finally, for susceptible information, anonymize it by removing any personally identifiable details.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Technical Challenges</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine trying to understand an old filing cabinet - that\'s data in outdated formats! Extracting from websites can be tricky, too, with limits on how much data you can grab at once. Plus, making sure all this information from different sources connects to each other can be a headache.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>Keeping the process running requires technical know-how to fix problems without messing up the original systems. Additionally, a skilled team that focuses on continuous learning and adaptation may help face issues related to technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Data complexity and variety</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The sixth challenge is handling data complexity and variety. We know data can be extracted from structured, semi-structured, or unstructured sources, such as databases, files, web pages, social media, and more.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, each source and format may have its own features, which can make the process of extracting data more difficult and time-consuming.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution:</strong> The key is using the right tools for each type of data. This could be writing SQL queries for databases, using scripts to process files, or scraping information from websites. Consequently, once you have the data, it\'s important to make sure everything speaks the same language.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Data volume and velocity&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It can be challenging to deal with the volume and velocity of the data. For example, suppose a marketing manager wants to analyze customer data and needs info from website purchases, social media engagement, and loyalty programs. This practice may overwhelm the computer system and slow everything down. Accordingly, this leads to the problem of data volume and velocity in extraction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>What you can do is automate data retrieval. First, break down large data sets into manageable chunks and schedule regular updates (incremental loading) instead of trying to swallow everything at once. Plus, invest in a powerful computer system with enough resources to handle the information rush. Ultimately, this will keep things running smoothly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Automation and Maintenance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data requires automation and maintenance. However, when data sources change often, it can be not easy, and scripts need to be updated all the time. Possible data errors can lead to difficulty in finding and correcting mistakes. Furthermore, it can be a bigger problem to manage the computational load without compromising performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution: </strong>This problem requires regular updates of scripts to keep pace with changing data. Give a thought about investing in powerful computers to handle the workload. Lastly, offer training to your team to fix problems without messing things up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Closing Remarks</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data extraction can be tricky, but don\'t worry!  There are ways to overcome challenges and get the information you need. Think of it like fixing a leaky faucet.  With the right tools and some effort, you can stop the drips and get a smooth flow of data for better analysis and decisions!<br>For more information about the challenges of extracting data and its solutions, talk to our experts. Our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\"><strong>web</strong> <strong>data extraction services</strong> </a>might assist you with all the issues you are facing. Let our team help you optimize your data retrieval techniques. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Top-8-Data-Extraction-Issues-and-How-to-Solve-Them.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-25 08:20:18','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(138,'What are the challenges of outsourcing data entry and how can you overcome them?','the-challenges-of-outsourcing-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Outsourcing comes with several challenges that make you question whether you\'re doing it right or if it\'s a waste of time. However, with the right outsourcing provider, these challenges can seem distant. In this blog, learn about the challenges of <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\"><strong>data entry services</strong></a> and find solutions for each of them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Communication gaps arise due to language, time zone, and cultural differences, affecting efficiency.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure data security by checking BPO practices and signing a non-disclosure agreement.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose a provider with resources to meet your deadlines and urgent needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Several companies depend on data entry, which is a process of collecting and entering information into a computer system. Even though it sounds easy, it can be quite a challenge to keep up with the ever-increasing mountain of data. <strong>Data entry services</strong> have become much easier thanks to technology, but there are still some challenges that organizations must face and conquer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although outsourcing these services helps businesses cut expenses, there are certain negative considerations as well. Many times, companies look for ways to stay competitive by cutting expenses; outsourcing lets them do just that by freeing resources and saving money on salaries and infrastructure. However, issues like ensuring data security and maintaining quality control with an outside service provider call for careful preparation and honest communication. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Communication Challenge</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This challenge arises when the company is outsourcing the work (the client), and the data entry service provider cannot communicate clearly and effectively. Several aspects can cause these problems:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Language differences: The client and the service provider may not speak the same language perfectly, which could make it hard to understand what to do, how to send data, or what level of quality is expected.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time zone differences: When you work with an offshore provider, there may be big time zone gaps. This can make it hard to talk to each other in real time and add time to solving problems or answering questions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cultural nuances: Differences in culture can make it hard to understand how to communicate, what is expected, and when things need to be done. Direct speech, for example, might be seen as rude in some cultures.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fortunately, there are means to close these gaps in communication. Start with clear directions, including specifics and examples. Standardized procedures keep things in line. Video conferences and project management tools let everyone remain in touch. On every team, a committed contact person maintains harmony. Ultimately, frequent meetings—even via email—allow updates and problem-solving. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Data Security</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data entry outsourcing entails sharing private information—such as passwords or finances—with another company. This creates security issues since inadequate data security might result in leaks of your data. As a result, these invasions might compromise your reputation and cost you money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To protect your data, you should investigate the security measures and privacy practices that the BPO employs. Thus, make certain that their employees adhere to the regulations. Also, you should get a non-disclosure agreement (NDA) signed by them so that they are legally obligated to keep your information confidential. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Completion Time</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Indeed, getting data entry work done on time is very important, especially in fast-paced fields like healthcare. As a result, delays in entering data can slow down important tasks and affect the care of patients. However, managing in-house data entry for extensive work can use many resources. So, make sure you pick the right service provider that can meet your deadlines.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution: </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First, consider how much data you usually deal with and how quickly you need it processed. After that, look at the provider\'s resources. Check how many experienced employees they have and what kind of technology they use. If your company needs urgent data entry with quick turnaround times, ensure they have an emergency helpline. When you choose a provider of <strong>data entry services</strong>, be clear about this need. It could make a big difference. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Quality Control</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although outsourcing data entry increases efficiency and saves money, it separates your business from the actual work. This can make guaranteeing excellent quality more difficult. Your credibility and client satisfaction may suffer if the outsourced data contains mistakes. Thus, selecting a trustworthy supplier with high-quality control is essential!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution: </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Set quality standards for the data entry tasks that are clear and can be measured. This could include minimum levels of accuracy, formatting needs, and acceptable levels of error. Set up an intense screening process: Carefully look at potential outsourcing partners, how they control quality and how well they\'ve done in similar projects. Talk to the outsourcing partner about your quality standards and give them feedback regularly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Raised Error Rate</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One major concern about <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\"><strong>outsourcing data management services</strong></a> is the increased error rate. These typos and mistakes may affect reports, waste time and money correcting them, and even upset consumers. These errors are more likely to occur if the hired company needs to equip their employees or closely review their output properly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As mentioned earlier, clear communication is the key to outsourcing going well! Make it clear how you want the data to be formatted, define key terms, and even give examples to keep things simple. Talk to the company about how to train their staff to meet your needs, such as the type of data you need and the quality level you expect. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Cost Administration</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At first, hiring someone else to do your data entry might seem like an excellent way to save money, but extra costs often cancel out those savings. You should consider how much time and money it will cost to manage the outsourcing company and possibly have to return to the table later to change the contract terms. All of these can add up over time. That\'s why businesses should carefully think about all the costs before they choose to outsource.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Solution:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We suggest that you don\'t just look at the hourly rate. Consider the time it might take for management tasks like communicating, keeping an eye on the project, and ensuring good quality. To avoid unexpected cost increases in the future, make sure your contracts are clear and include pricing structures, service level agreements (SLAs) with precise quality standards, and terms for possible reconsideration. Keep track of all the costs of hiring someone else to do your data entry. This includes the provider\'s fees, the cost of running the business, other expenses, etc.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. Increasing workload</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another problem that can come up when you outsource data entry is how to handle situations where your workload suddenly grows. Consequently, your outsource provider must have the ability to scale resources up or down quickly. They should also know how to deal with these changes by planning ahead.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Solution</strong>: Look for a company with flexible staff that can expand rapidly as needed. Try to work out a contract where your payment will vary depending on the amount of work you assign them. If possible, start small projects with the company first to observe their handling of workload fluctuations. This will help you know they can keep up with hectic situations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clearly, outsourcing data entry will increase your general efficiency and save you a lot of money. Potential drawbacks, including data security concerns, poor communication, and maintaining quality control, should be known, though. Still, you can properly handle these obstacles with the correct outsourcing partner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsource data management services to us. Rest assured that our team is capable of handling all of your data needs precisely and discreetly. Our top priorities are meeting your specific quality standards, communicating clearly, and securely handling data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Challenges-of-Outsourcing-Data-Entry-Services.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-24 11:57:02','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(139,'Tech2Globe Celebrates Nomination for Small Business BC Awards!','tech2globe-celebrates-nomination-for-small-business-bc-awards','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being nominated for the Small Business BC Awards is mind-blowing, particularly for the Business Impact Award. Without the hard work of our team, none of this would have been possible, and this recognition only serves to increase our enthusiasm. Fortunately, it makes all the work we put into making a difference in our community worth it when we know it\'s working.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong> About Small Business BC Awards</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Small Business BC Awards are British Columbia\'s most significant small business honors. More than 6,600 businesses have been a part of it for more than 21 years. Regardless of a business\'s current stage in its journey, it can participate in these awards. The most important goal is to give businesses the services and connections they need to do well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is a separate, non-profit organization that provides assistance to all businesses in the province. They provide assistance and resources to business owners at all stages of their operations. There are also chances for sponsors to support the 2024 Small Business BC Awards. Furthermore, the organization acknowledges that its work takes place on the traditional lands of the Musqueam, Squamish, and Tsleil-Waututh Nations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Does “Business Impact Award” Represents?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In their award category of Business Impact, this award shows appreciation for businesses that go beyond just making a profit. These businesses showcase their commitment to bringing positive change in their communities. Moreover, they are mostly good at sales, marketing, logistics, finances, and operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most importantly, companies that value social responsibility as much as they value profit are the ones that this award goes to.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Are We Nominated?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We needed to hit a few strict benchmarks in order to be eligible for the nomination.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses must be operational for at least 12 months.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses must be located in British Columbia.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Businesses must have 50 employees or fewer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nominations must be submitted online by 11:59 p.m. on August 16, 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Previous Small Business BC Awards winners are prohibited from entering the category in which they won.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nominees may not run businesses that are sexually exploitative or offer sexually explicit entertainment, products, or services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nominees should not be associated with illegal activities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Inappropriate, disrespectful or offensive language will not be accepted as part of the SBBC Award.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why We Deserve “Business Impact Award”?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are a strong candidate for the Business Impact Award since we try hard to change things for the better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through outstanding IT solutions, we enable companies of all kinds to compete and fulfill their objectives. Our staff also always brings fresh ideas to our clients and is adaptable to new technologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are always here for the benefit of society. Through free seminars, events, and sponsorships teaching people how to use technology and assist local projects, we pay back to our community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finally, we advocate moral business conduct and search for long-term solutions for our customers and ourselves.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Winning this award would greatly honor our business and every employee here. It would demonstrate our desire to change things for the people we serve and motivate us to improve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Tech2Globe-Celebrates-Nomination-for-Small-Business-BC-Awards.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-24 10:09:19','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(140,'Beginner\'s Guide to YouTube Ads: Launch and Optimize Your Video Advertising Campaign','youtube-ads-guide-for-beginners-in-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Never run a YouTube ad Before? No problem! This blog explores the cost of YouTube ads, how to launch <strong>YouTube ad campaigns</strong>, and how to increase their effectiveness. Also, go through the simple steps to learn <strong>how to advertise on YouTube </strong>and optimize your campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>YouTube ads use Google\'s data to find and reach the right audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>YouTube ads are cost-effective, only charging per click or view.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Different types of<strong> YouTube ads on YouTube </strong>have various features and costs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you also noticing more <strong>ads on YouTube</strong>? To generate more revenue, YouTube often updates its strategies. Sure thing! It dominates the video-sharing industry and attracts over two billion unique monthly visitors, making it the second most popular website. Thus, brands rely on its immense reach to promote their offerings.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Several businesses, influencers, content creators, non-profit organizations, and even individuals are creating <strong>YouTube ad campaigns</strong>. Moreover, the reach of video content can effectively capture the audience\'s attention. However, excellent video ad campaigns require planning and execution.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are YouTube Ads? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube ads are video ads that appear on Google Display Network (GDN) partner sites, YouTube\'s website, and apps. Moreover, these ads use all of Google\'s user data to help advertisers find and reach the desired audience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Are YouTube Ads Worth the Investment? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, YouTube ads are worth the Investment, but only if you do it right. Also, YouTube advertising is one of the best strategies that businesses can consider. Find out why YouTube ads are worth it below:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> You know, PPC advertising is very cost-effective. YouTube advertising uses the same PPC model, making it very budget-friendly. PPC is profitable because you only pay when someone clicks your ad. Not only that, but you decide how much to pay per click. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Highly Targeted </strong>- For a YouTube ad campaign to work, granular targeting is needed. Additionally, you can reach people based on age, gender, interests, past purchases, video remarketing, customer matches, similar audiences, life events, and affinity audiences. This approach lets you reach specific groups of people interested in your products or services, thereby making the best use of the money you spend on ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Provide Fast Results: </strong>Unsurprisingly, YouTube has over 2 billion monthly users and produces fast results. More people seeing your ads means more clicks, website traffic, and sales. With such a large audience, YouTube guarantees fast results because more users are interested in your brand.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Types of YouTube Ads </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are different <strong>types of YouTube ad </strong>campaigns that you may choose on YouTube, such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Skippable in-stream ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Skippable in-stream ads—formerly TrueView ads—can run before, during, or after videos between 12 seconds and six minutes.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A side Skip Ads button appears after five seconds of the ad. Additionally, advertisers only pay for people who watch their YouTube ad for 30 seconds or more and are interested in what it promotes.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Non-skippable in-stream ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Non-skippable in-stream ads can precede, interrupt, or follow videos. They are non-skippable and have a maximum of 15 seconds. Instead of the Skip Ad button, viewers will see a countdown to know how long it will take to return to their video.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These short, non-skippable ads limit bidding. These are cost-per-mille (CPM), so advertisers pay per 1,000 YouTube views.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Bumper ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bump ads are almost identical to non-skippable ads except for length. Plus, these six-second ads can appear before, during, or after a video and cannot be skipped. Due to how quickly YouTube ads like this are viewed, use them to convey a concise message.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Masthead ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube homepage masthead ads run for 24 hours. This content plays silently for 30 seconds with a CTA or banner. Remember, you can only create this YouTube ad with a Google sales rep. However, it\'s great for brand awareness and reaching a large audience quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Discovery ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also referred to as in-feed video ads, this type of <strong>YouTube ad on YouTube</strong> aids users in finding video content within YouTube search results. For instance, consider searching \"learn how to bake a cake.\" The top result is a sponsored video that appears ahead of organic search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Display ads</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube desktop sidebar ads are display ads. Neither image nor video automatically plays when loaded. To hear the sound, hover the mouse over the display ad. Display ads are great because Google owns YouTube. Thus, you can show your YouTube campaign videos or images in unique placements across the Google Display Network.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How much do YouTube Ads cost?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The YouTube ads cost depends on many factors. However, cost depends on the audience, industry, ad watch time, campaign objective, and keywords. The average YouTube ad view or action costs $0.10 to $0.30. Spend as much or as little on YouTube ads. Lastly, Google will only charge you up to your daily budget, making YouTube ads a safe investment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to create YouTube Ads?  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, it\'s not about how much you spend on YouTube. Your video should be unique and high-quality to stand out from the millions of others. Therefore, if you want to increase your video platform visibility with fun, attractive, and captivating content, try these video styles:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Animations: Like TV commercials, these creative and entertaining pieces promote a product or service by engaging the audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Explainer videos: They introduce your brand and convey a message in seconds.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Videos promos: They show a product or service and encourage viewers to act with simple, bite-sized information.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to run a YouTube Ad? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After creating your YouTube channel, next, it is time to advertise. Below, we have provided a clear and simple step-by-step guide on <strong>how to advertise on YouTube</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create a Google Ads account.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Set your campaign goal.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Upload your video to YouTube.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Select your target audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Set your budget and bidding strategy</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Set Targeting and Keywords</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Review and launch your campaign.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Create a Google Ads account.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google owns YouTube, so you\'ll use the same Google Ads (formerly AdWords) dashboard for creating and managing ads. Create a business account on Google Ads. Registration requires business information such as its name, website, and YouTube account. Start by clicking New Campaign in your Google Ads dashboard after creation.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Set your campaign goal.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First, determine your campaign objectives when making a YouTube ad. What do you want from your ads? How does it fit your YouTube marketing?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube campaign goals often include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leads for sales</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Website Traffic Product/brand assessment</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reach and brand awareness </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>App Promotion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Local promotions and store visits</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Know your goals early to prepare your ad creative for launch. Also, you can also create a campaign without a goal, but knowing your objective can help you choose the best bidding strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Upload your video to YouTube.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After choosing a goal, make a YouTube advertising video. Best video ads:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality audio and video</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Appeal to your audience\'s frustrations </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Starting with a solid five-second hook </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tell a story to engage the audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Call for action at the end. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use a professional video editor to make static videos more engaging. In addition, descript is a tool that lets you add transitions, video templates, and animated subtitles to prevent YouTube “Skip ad” clicks.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you finish your video advertisement, navigate to your YouTube Studio and click Upload Video. You can use the video from your company\'s YouTube channel later when you set up your ad campaign.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Select your target audience.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After uploading your YouTube video, define your target audience in Google Ads Manager. Target similar people on YouTube:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Location,</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Language</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Demographics (age, gender, parental status) </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, you can target households by income in your campaign settings, but only in certain countries. Remember, your targeting parameters will affect your estimated weekly performance. Thus, you must target suitable viewers to avoid wasting YouTube ad money.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Set your budget and bidding strategy.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose how much your digital marketing budget will spend on YouTube ads on the next page. Select a billing currency and daily spending limit. Your ads will run daily until they reach that budget.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Similarly, schedule your campaign. Once you reach your end date, the campaign will end automatically.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Set Targeting and Keywords.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To reach the right audience, Google Ads for video offers many targeting options. Firstly, identify your potential customer\'s likes and interests. Also, examine all options and be specific. Here are the main approaches:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Interests and topics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Word or phrase keywords.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Placement, such as YouTube subscribers from other sites/channels.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Review and launch your campaign.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This final page lets you review your YouTube ads campaign setup:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Campaign name</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Video ad</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Landing page</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Button</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Headline</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Targeting options</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Budget</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, your billing information will be requested for your first campaign. If you\'ve advertised on YouTube and added billing information, your video will be creatively reviewed to meet advertising standards.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Optimize a YouTube Ad Campaign? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After creating a YouTube ad and launching it, it is vital to optimize your <strong>YouTube ad campaign</strong>. However, optimizing isn’t easy, which is why you can follow these easy tips to make sure you won’t waste your efforts:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Analyze and change targeting.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consequently, ensure you keep track of your bottom-line metrics and YouTube ads performance throughout your campaign. Additionally, remember that your YouTube advertisement’s CPC or CPM depends on its targeting and breadth. Similarly, experiment to find your best targeting option. For example, create different ad groups with slightly different targeting options to find the best clicks and conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improve your ads and messages.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>World-class YouTube campaigns aren\'t scientific. It\'s an art form—experiments can reveal which creatives make viewers click the call to action instead of skipping the video.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, test your YouTube ads by changing their elements. Also, keep your messaging consistent and avoid confusing potential customers with multiple messages.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use remarketing and special audiences.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, create a custom audience ad campaign to retarget audiences who may have subscribed to your channel, visited your website, or searched for your product. If sales and leads are your main goals, remarketing campaigns can be very effective. Plus, studies show that clicks on retargeting ads are eight times cheaper than generic campaigns.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pick the best tools to edit your video ads.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using the right editing tools helps create engaging video ads. As mentioned before, professional YouTube video editors can help you create engaging YouTube ads that keep viewers watching and taking action.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Try different bidding methods.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube offers several video advertising payment options. Therefore, return to your campaign settings and set a maximum bid per view or action. Choose from:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Target CPM: Set a price for 1,000 views.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Maximum CPV: Set your maximum per-view campaign price unless you have a low funnel audience and strict conversion goal.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Convert as many as possible within your budget.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Target CPA: Set a conversion price.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, you’ve learned every step of how to advertise YouTube ads. Thus, you should feel more confident about advertising in the second most popular search engine. However, the most important lesson is that no matter how much you pay for advertising, you must have outstanding content to succeed on any network.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ll gladly assist you with creating a high-quality and convincing commercial. Furthermore, just contact us and leverage our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/youtube-advertising-services\">YouTube Advertising Services</a></strong>. Moreover, our experts are here to help you with all your concerns regarding YouTube advertisements</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. Can I advertise my content on YouTube?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Advertising on YouTube is free for any business with a Google Ads account. So, with simple and easy steps, you can advertise your content. The first step is to upload your video to YouTube. Then, create a new campaign, select your target audience, and decide on a bidding strategy.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. How do you optimize your YouTube ads?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>In order to keep people engaged and coming back for more, it\'s a good idea to schedule your in-stream ad to run for a month. <strong>Ads on YouTube </strong>and other Google Display Network partners can have their frequency capped, allowing you to control how often users see your ads.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. How much does it cost to advertise on YouTube?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Advertisers pay for YouTube videos in several ways. Thus, you should budget $0.49 per click or $0.026 per video view.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4. How Much YouTube Pays You for 1,000 Views</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>The type of ad, the viewer\'s location, and the advertiser\'s budget all affect the significantly different amount of money a YouTuber earns per view. YouTube pays typically between $0.01 and $0.03 per view. A YouTuber should make between $10 and $30 for every 1,000 views.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/YouTube-Ads-Guide-for-Beginners.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-20 14:28:30','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(141,'How to write a Google Review?','write-a-review-on-google','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Are you looking to <strong>write a review on Google</strong> but unsure how? Or perhaps you\'re searching for ways to make your review more expressive? If so, explore our blog for a step-by-step guide on posting a Google review. Discover examples and learn how to post anonymously if you prefer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reviews on Google help businesses stand out and get more customers by making them more visible in search results, especially for \"near me\" searches. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It\'s easy to leave a review on Google: search for the business, click \"Write a Review,\" sign in, rate the company, and write about your experience. You can do this from both a computer and a phone.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can see reviews in Google Search and Google Maps. There is a summary with the number of reviews and star ratings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you using <strong>Google Reviews</strong> to their full potential for your company? Studies show that before deciding what to buy, a noteworthy 89% of consumers read reviews. Of those looking for reliable goods or services, 72% turn to reviews on Google for making decisions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, reviews can significantly affect a company\'s sales performance and reputation, particularly <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/local-seo\">local SEO</a> </strong>efforts. Additionally, maintaining an excellent online reputation depends on knowing how to handle and answer reviews. Positive reviews, for example, can influence a consumer\'s decision on a vacation rental or a new smartphone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is a Google Review? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google review is feedback that anyone can write based on their experience with a business. They help others decide whether to use their services. In addition, <strong>Google reviews</strong> include star ratings and comments, which show real customer opinions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the Benefits of Google Reviews for Businesses? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you ever stop to think about why so many companies want you to rate and review them on Google? This is because local businesses greatly value these reviews! Let us explain how they are useful:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Standing out from the crowd: </strong>Your company\'s search engine rankings can be significantly improved with a large number of positive reviews, particularly for \"near me\" searches. As a result, more people will be able to find you online!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Building trust: </strong>Friends and family have an uncanny knack for getting our trust. Similarly, customers\' positive experiences are similar to word-of-mouth in the real world; they let others know that they can trust your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Knowing what works (and what doesn\'t)</strong>: Customer reviews are a great way to get their opinions. Also, they tell you what customers adore about your company and where you can improve. This information is similar to a strategy for increasing customer satisfaction!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Turning browsers into buyers: </strong>A company with many positive reviews will likely have more customers. Thus, positive reviews demonstrate that you are an excellent choice, like social proof.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Post a Review on Google? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most common ways you can <strong>write a review on Google</strong> is through Google Search. Here’s how you can post a review:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to your internet browser.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Search for a local business on Google and click on its profile.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In the Business Listing, search for the Reviews section.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click \"Write a Review.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you are not currently signed in, a sign-in box will appear. To <strong>leave a Google review</strong>, you must first sign into your Google account.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Once signed in, you can rate the company and write about your experience(s).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>After deciding on a star rating, click Post (a description is optional).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Examples of Positive Reviews </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Getting good reviews is an important part of marketing a local business. So here we present some real examples of great customer reviews.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdvrd8JbO2gikv8eMYmiVdzcenOEBwo7U7OSMJFthCZr9YZZ6xjn8OYp7LMkX_7EmJz4c10zqV19RPhd_2fxf32sjpcIwd-Uw7NW7jyajy2nfD-U1JsVbalfPhdILV0yzW88BxFvdEJBLpGg1sk08XLUvsx?key=IfVv6VJ36b5J3xigGsSCdA\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Write a Google Review on the Phone? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since most of us have our phones with us at all times, here\'s how to <strong>leave a Google review</strong> on Google\'s search engine from your phone (iPhone/Android):</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First, log in to Google.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Then, find the company you want to review.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click on the Reviews tab when the box with your business information shows up at the top of the page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You\'ll see \"Rate and review\" below the title of the Google review.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Choose how many stars you want to give the business.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tell them about your own experience with the company.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you have any pictures that go with your post, add them.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, click on \"Post.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Where do Google Reviews show up? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Reviews are readily available in two key places:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google Search: </strong>When you search for a business online, their Google Business Profile might appear alongside the search results. Consequently, this profile often showcases their review summary, including star rating and number of reviews.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google Maps:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First, open Google Maps and search for the business you\'re interested in.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Next, click on the business listing to open their information panel.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Then, scroll down to the \"Reviews\" section. You\'ll see a summary with the average star rating and number of reviews.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, both locations offer options to see all the reviews:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Look for a \"More <strong>Google Reviews</strong>\" button to see a complete list.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Filter the reviews by \"Highest Rated,\" \"Lowest Rated,\" \"Most Recent,\" or search by keywords to find specific details mentioned by customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Are Google Reviews Anonymous? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While Google Reviews can be useful for consumers and businesses, anonymity is an option. Google stopped accepting completely anonymous reviews in 2018 to combat fake reviews and protect businesses from unfair practices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, this does not mean you must use your full name in every review. Here are some ways to leave a Google review with a little more privacy:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Create a pseudonym account: </strong>Create a new Google account specifically for leaving reviews. For added privacy, use a nickname or alias as your username.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Pseudonymize your existing account: </strong>If you don\'t want to go through the hassle of creating a new account, consider changing the name on your existing Google account to something less revealing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Generic usernames: </strong>Create a username that does not directly relate to you. This could be \"foodie fanatic\" or \"movie buff.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Delete a Review From Google? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While simple editing or deletion of a Google review can benefit the company, it can also ensure your feedback remains accurate. Use the steps listed here to remove or edit the review:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Go to Google Maps after logging into your Google account.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Next, access the menu and click the three horizontal lines in the upper left corner.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Then, from the list of options, choose \"Your Contributions.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To edit or remove a review, click the \"Reviews\" tab, scroll down, and select the one you wish to change or remove.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In the upper right corner, click the three vertical dots.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Finally, select \"Edit review\" or \"Delete review \" from the dropdown menu.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To edit the review or remove it, follow the prompt.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although, remember that once you delete a review, it cannot be recovered. Hence, deleting a review is permanent.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you follow these easy steps, leaving a Google review will be a breeze. First, jot down every detail of your experience, both the good and the bad. Was the customer service you received outstanding? Did you receive a high-quality product? By providing comprehensive information, you help future clients see the big picture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is acceptable to offer constructive criticism. Also, keep your comments focused on how the company can grow rather than making personal attacks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Was there anything bad that happened to you? Think of alternative ways the company could have dealt with it. All parties concerned may benefit from this. Honest criticism, whether good or bad, aids decision-making by others.<br>Improve your online presence and attract local customers with our <strong>local SEO packages</strong>. We\'ll make sure your business receives more positive reviews.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/How-to-write-a-Google-Review.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-19 12:23:14','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(142,'How to build AI chatbots in 10 minutes?','how-to-make-an-ai-chatbot','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>It doesn\'t matter what kind of business it is; more and more companies are turning to chatbots to improve customer service and help. Have you ever thought about making your own chatbot? In this blog, you can learn about the methods used to create and <strong>train AI chatbots </strong>for your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI chatbots are computer programs that pretend to talk to real people. By looking at a huge amount of data, they use machine learning to understand and answer user questions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Simpler chatbots rely on pre-written responses to solve specific problems; and advanced chatbots use AI to understand user intent and respond in a natural way, even learning from past interactions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can create your own AI chatbot in two ways: using a chatbot agency and using a chatbot platform.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To <strong>train AI chatbots</strong> on your own data (like with ChatGPT), you would require some technical expertise. This allows for more personalization but involves data preparation, coding skills, and significant computing power.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customer services nowadays have evolved from physical call centers to online chabots which use artificial intelligence to answer customers. This shift is mostly because of the convenience and efficiency it provides to businesses. Chatbots can answer customer queries 24/7 and give a customized answer to every query. However, it is a challenge to create and <strong>train</strong> <strong>AI chatbot</strong>. So, here’s a step-by-step guide to help you build and <strong>train your own AI </strong>chatbot. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is an AI Chatbot?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An AI chatbot is a computer program that is meant to talk to people like a real person. Imagine having a virtual helper that you can talk to or text as needed. Artificial intelligence powers these bots. This means that they have been taught to understand and answer user questions normally by accessing huge amounts of data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here\'s the detailed breakdown in simpler terms: AI robots use algorithms for machine learning. These systems look at huge amounts of text and conversation records. Based on this analysis, the robot learns to find trends in language and guess the best answer to a user\'s question. Although some robots may follow a scripted flow chart, more advanced ones can have real talks and even understand what is being said to give relevant and helpful answers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Does an AI Chatbot Work?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Think about having a virtual helper that you can talk to on the phone or computer, who will answer your questions and help you do your work. In fact, that\'s what robots are! These computer programs use AI to simulate conversations with humans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bots that talk to people come in two main types. Simpler chatbots rely on pre-written responses to address specific problems. They\'re kind of like a smart Frequently Asked Questions page. Smarter robots can understand your questions and answer naturally with the help of AI. They can get a lot of information and even learn from what you\'ve said in the past to give you the best answer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These smart robots are always learning and getting better, like little AI experts. By going through old talks and supporting papers, they can quickly find the information you need. This lets them quickly give you the best answer to your question.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Make an AI Chatbot?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>There are two options for Making an AI chatbot: Chatbot Agency and Chatbot Platforms.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Chatbot agencies design business-specific chatbots, provide custom AI chatbots for businesses, and consult. Hiring a chatbot company offers a customized chatbot fit for your needs and competent support throughout production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are expensive chatbot companies. Therefore, save money by using a chatbot platform. Online chatbot systems allow you to create artificial intelligence chatbots. Plus, they are less maintenance, faster, and less expensive. Chatbot systems could, however, restrict customizing and features, restricting the company. So, choose your chatbot platform deliberately.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether to choose a chatbot agency or platform depends on the company\'s needs and resources. A chatbot agency might be best if the company needs a totally customized and comprehensive chatbot and has the means to hire a chatbot provider. A chatbot platform might be ideal if the company needs more cash and time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Create AI For Your Chatbot</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Pick a Base Model -</strong> You can choose any base model you want, such as LLaMA, GPT4, or something else. These models are what your AI is made of; they give it a sense of structure and the ability to learn. When we have a GPT robot, we use either ChatGPT 3.5 or GPT4.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fine-Tune the Model - </strong>Now that you have a base model, you need to improve it. You can do this  by giving the model your own work. With this, the AI can learn more about your business, language, situation, etc. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Make Up Your Own Prompts - </strong>For the next step, you need to tell the AI how to talk. What kind of AI would you like? Would you like it to be fun, serious, or something else? All these decisions are up to you.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Put Your AI to Work by Making a Chatbot - </strong>The last step is to use your AI on any website you choose. This is where your hard work will pay off, whether it\'s on Slack, Microsoft Teams, your own website, tools for making plans, or something else. The AI answer you gave will come to life.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Make an AI Chatbot With a Chatbot Platform?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Get the Training Data Ready</strong>—There is a saying that goes, ‘It takes two to communicate.’ Well, in this case, it does, but the ‘two’ has to be tuned in heaven if you want a robot that can mimic human conversation like the GPT robot. A record of the conversation is required to let your GPT model learn.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is important to remember: in other words, the material requires editing to be presentable and usable. There are several ways you can tidy up and naively clean your data using natural computing resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Set Up and Train the Platform-</strong> The next process is setting up your GPT model training. It is also important to note that there may be a few procedures or actions that need to be followed by the user, based on the platform that was chosen earlier, when setting up the GPT model is being discussed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To train your model, this set of data you made in the first step will be useful for creating a training data set. Do not forget that, the training of the model may take time and it requires a large number of computations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Put the Chatbot to Work- </strong>The final step is when it is time to utilize your CHATBOT GPT Robot. After training your model, you can integrate it with any chatbot platform you choose. Also, you can integrate your robot into other messaging applications or platforms, including Slack, Teams, Facebook Messenger, and so on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You should take a trial on your chatbot as this will help you confirm its effectiveness, more so before deploying it for real use. See how your robot is performing with the help of analytics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Train ChatGPT on Your Own Data?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can also <strong>create your own GPT chatbot</strong> in the same way. You can also expand this further to create your own GPT chatbot. Moreover, ChatGPT is capable of being trained on your content so that you will be able to create a personalized chatbot with specifics of your requirements and your choice of words. But what is truly required is technological know-how.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before moving to the next step, you will need OpenAI’s API and your Python coding skills. This means that one may train ChatGPT using the API on their data. Such data could be from the website’s content, emails, documents, or product descriptions. That is why the results that your personalized chatbot will show will be much better with relevant and high-quality data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Second, prepare training data. This may be removing unnecessary information or formatting the information that ChatGPT will use in its output in a specific way. Platforms provide an opportunity to solve this with various tools available to a user. OpenAI API allows you to pipe ChatGPT and train it when the input data is ready. The training time can vary depending on the amount of data that it needs to process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training ChatGPT on your own data is more flexible and personalized, but it is technical knowledge to do so. Data can be fed into the models and one can build chatbots with applications and templates using the convenient interfaces. These platforms could assist non-coders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How </strong>to<strong> train an AI</strong> chatbot for your business? You should now have a good idea of the steps that you need to take. The right solution can help your customer service, whether you pick a chatbot office or a platform. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-support-ai-services\">Data support</a> for AI and <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/virtual-assistant-services\">virtual assistants</a> is something we offer to help businesses make their digital strategies better. Let us show you how to use these technologies to stay ahead in the online world, which keeps changing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. How can I train AI?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Depending on how hard it is, you can <strong>train your own AI</strong>. Simple chatbots are not as complex since they are built using user-friendly platforms. Thus, training them is fairly easy. But for advanced AI like GPT to work, you need strong computer skills and technical skills. For instance, one must have the knowledge of coding and data preparation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. Can I train GPT on my own data?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2.</strong> Yes, it is possible to train GPT with your data, but if you want to do that, it’s difficult. The techniques that you will be using include programming with coding skills and basic knowledge of working with OpenAI’s API, as mentioned earlier. This allows you to forward your data, which includes emails and documents, to GPT. While it enables you to fine-tune things more, it demands a great amount of calculations and formatted data.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. Are there any limitations to using GPT chatbots?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3.</strong> Like all other tools of conversational AI, using GPT chatbots has its pros and cons. Also, Bots are not completely polished, and many times, their answers are wrong or irrelevant. Furthermore, their teaching requires a lot of data and computer knowledge. Thus, not everybody can create and train a GPT chatbot.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4. How long does it take to train a GPT chatbot?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4.</strong> The GPT chatbot\'s training duration depends on the quantity put into it and the quantity of computation to be provided. However, the average time is not fixed, as it may take a few days or even a few hours if the chatbot is of good quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/How-to-build-AI-chatbots-in-10-minutes.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-15 13:50:32','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(143,'Tips To Improve SEO For ECommerce','tips-to-improve-seo-for-ecommerce','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> SEO has always been important for eCommerce sites as it drives more organic traffic and increases sales. This blog offers a complete guide on<strong> eCommerce website SEO</strong> and how you can implement different strategies to improve your site\'s visibility and attract more customers. Don’t miss out on checking the best tools for eCommerce SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Understand and use long-tail keywords for higher traffic and better conversions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure your e-commerce site is user-friendly with fast loading speeds and easy navigation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enhance efficiency and improve customer satisfaction by handling different tasks with the right eCommerce tool.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You still need people to find your website online, even if it is excellent. What are the best products and prices? It\'s irrelevant if no one notices them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As online shopping grows, more and more companies are trying to get the attention of people who are looking for products like yours. Strong <strong>SEO for ecommerce websites</strong>, on the other hand, makes your site much more visible in SERPs and brings more relevant visitors to your product pages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow these <strong>ecommerce search engine best practices </strong>and rank higher in search results so that more people can find you. And the more traffic you get, the more likely you are to make sales.&nbsp; </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is eCommerce SEO?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>SEO for Ecommerce</strong> is the process of optimizing your online store so that it shows up higher in search engine results pages (SERPs). This means that your store is more likely to appear at the top when people search for the products you sell. This brings more people to the website, which ultimately leads to more sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of SEO for eCommerce </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If your brand ranks high in search results, it shows that it is an expert in its field. People will begin to connect your name with the goods and services they require as they see it more often.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It is a long-term strategy that can bring in a steady flow of qualified leads. Additionally, you get the right customers by focusing on keywords that are relevant to your audience\'s search intent at all stages of the buying journey (from becoming part of your business to making a purchase).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An SEO-optimized website is naturally easy for people to use. Paying attention to your website\'s structure and user experience not only makes customers happier and increases sales, but it can also help your rankings on Google.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Best SEO Strategies for eCommerce Website </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Conduct Keyword Research Focused on Buyer Intent </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keywords are the words that people type into search engines like Google. You want these words and phrases to be linked to your ecommerce site so that they show up in search results when people look for your products. It\'s best to focus on a few keywords for each page when it comes to the <strong>best SEO for ecommerce sites</strong>. However, there is no hard and fast rule on how many keywords you can use for SEO. Furthermore, it\'s important to make it clear to Google what every web page is about so that it shows up in relevant searches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Enhance Product Pages for Better Rankings </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do keyword research to identify what customers search for, then optimize titles and descriptions to include those keywords naturally. To master <strong>SEO for ecommerce product pages,</strong> you may also create compelling product descriptions that highlight features and benefits. Speed and mobile friendliness are also very important, so aim for quick loading times and a responsive design. Lastly, get people to write reviews and rate your products to increase trust and rankings of your services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Ensure Your Website is User-Friendly </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good user experience (UX) is very important for ecommerce sites. It\'s the key to getting people to buy and keeping them interested. Furthermore, UX is the first thing people notice about your site. It\'s easy for shoppers to find what they need when the interface is well-designed and the navigation is clear. Focus on making sure your site loads quickly and works well on mobile devices to create a great UX and get noticed as the<strong> best SEO ecommerce platform</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Utilize Schema Markup for Better Content Understanding </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The next thing to focus on is schema Markup. What is it? It\'s the language that search engines read to figure out what your pages are about. Google will be able to understand your content better and show it more interestingly if this code is more detailed. Besides, Google has a useful tool called the Rich Result Test. So, you can be sure that your schema markup is implemented correctly and without any mistakes by running it through this tool.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Eliminate Duplicate Pages and Content </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>On page SEO for ecommerce </strong>is all about making sure that every page is unique and useful. Generally, search engines can get confused by duplicate content, which can hurt your site\'s ranking. You can, however, use different tools for this. Some examples are canonical tags and 301 redirects. Canonical tags let you know which version of a page is the most important. Last but not least, meta robots with no-index tags can help you stop search engines from indexing any duplicate pages.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. Upgrade Your ECommerce Content </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When working on <strong>SEO for ecommerce websites</strong>, it\'s especially important to know your audience well in order to write content that sticks with them. By making buyer personas, you can picture your ideal customers and find out what they like and what bothers them. Lastly, customers at all stages of their buying journey should be the focus of the best content strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. Include a Sitemap </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sitemap is a visual map that shows the order of all the pages, subcategories, products, and content on your website.&nbsp; You can make a sitemap manually, but you can also use tools like Google\'s Webmaster Tools, Lucky Sitemap Generator, or Powermapper to do it automatically.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Best ecommerce SEO tools </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managing SEO can be a difficult task, which is why a wealth tool exists. Here are the top tools for <strong>ecommerce website SEO</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Google Analytics - </strong>Google Analytics shows you organic traffic and site engagement. Moreover, this tool shows you website traffic sources and campaigns. Google Analytics lets you track:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Audience demographics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Traffic sources</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Site behavior and conversions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Google PageSpeed Insights - </strong>Did you know over $2.6 billion is lost annually due to slow-loading sites? Slow-loading websites don\'t rank in search results or attract visitors. Thus, Google PageSpeed Insights can help. This tool shows your site\'s mobile and desktop load time.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Screaming Frog -</strong> When it comes to evaluating your SEO approach, this is one of the best tools available. Moreover, to enhance your site\'s SEO and get better results, you can use this tool to analyze it. You can also use this tool to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Analyze title tags and meta descriptions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Discover duplicate content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Generate XML sitemaps</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find broken links&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to make your online store more visible, you can use these<strong> ecommerce SEO best practices</strong>. As a well-known<strong> ecommerce SEO agency</strong>, we have experts who can help you put these strategies into action. Our team will plan a strategy to boost your store\'s ranking, drive traffic, and increase sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. How is eCommerce SEO different from normal SEO?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>Regular SEO focuses on getting people to visit and spreading the word about your brand, but SEO for online stores is all about making sales. This means that eCommerce SEO emphasizes making sure that product pages are optimized, that keywords are used that are related to buying, and that users have a good experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. How do I find the best keywords for eCommerce optimization?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>To begin, make a list of words that describe what you sell and how it helps people. Then, use free search tools to find out what terms people are looking for and how much competition there is. Thus, look at the keywords that your competitors are ranking for. Also, don\'t forget to look through Amazon\'s best-selling items to see what people are looking for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. Is it worth pursuing an ecommerce SEO course?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Yes, taking SEO for ecommerce courses can be a great way to learn more SEO. Generally, it involves topics related to building e-commerce stores, improving a site\'s SEO, and conducting effective email marketing campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4. What is the cost of SEO for ecommerce site?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>The average cost of SEO for an eCommerce site can range around $2000. However, it depends upon various factors and the scope of the SEO services required. We offer <strong>SEO for online stores</strong> at affordable prices and service can be tailored to meet your specific needs and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Tips-To-Improve-SEO-For-ECommerce.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-11 06:49:59','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` VALUES (144,'How to Dropship on Amazon: A Step-by-Step Guide for 2024','how-to-dropship-on-amazon-a-step-by-step-guide-for-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This article offers a thorough walk-through on launching a dropship business on Amazon. It addresses everything from opening a seller account and sourcing vendors to developing product listings and offering first-rate customer care.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Choose a profitable niche:</strong> Investigate the market carefully to find low-competition, high demand niches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Source trustworthy vendors: </strong>Work with reliable suppliers that provide premium goods, reasonable rates, and first-rate customer service.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Refine your product listings. </strong>To raise search ranking and conversion rates, craft interesting product listings with concise descriptions, top-notch photos, and pertinent keywords.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Give customer happiness first priority: </strong>Respond quickly to questions, effectively handle returns, and follow Amazon\'s policies to deliver outstanding customer support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to kick off a profitable online business? Learning to dropship on Amazon might be your path to business success. Amazon\'s huge customer pool and strong setup make it a great place for drop shippers to reach many possible buyers without needing to store or manage stock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This guide provides a complete look at how to start dropshipping on Amazon. We\'ll show you each step, from setting up your account and finding suitable suppliers to making product listings that catch the eye and giving great customer service. If you\'re new and wondering about dropshipping on Amazon, or if you\'ve been selling for a while and want to grow, this article will give you the know-how and plans to do well in the challenging world of <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-dropshipping\"><strong>Amazon dropshipping</strong></a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Dropshipping on Amazon?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dropshipping on Amazon means selling products without keeping stock. When someone buys something, you get it from another supplier who sends it straight to the customer. This way, you can start an Amazon dropshipping business without spending much money upfront or taking significant risks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need to set up an Amazon seller account to start dropshipping with Amazon. Go to sellercentral.amazon.com and sign up. You\'ll have to provide details like your work email, credit card info, government ID, tax information, phone number, and bank account to receive payments from sales. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does Dropshipping on Amazon Work?</strong> </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4090,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/How-does-Dropshipping-on-Amazon-Work-1024x512.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4090\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let us explain how Amazon dropshipping works:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Customer Buys: Someone reads your listing on Amazon and decides to purchase your product.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You Receive the Order: The online sale is completed, and you receive payment from the consumer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You send an order to the supplier: Then, you buy the same product from your dropshipping provider. Most importantly, you give the supplier the customer\'s shipping details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ship to Customer: The supplier completes the order by sending the item directly to the customer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Legal Considerations and Amazon\'s Policies</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon permits dropshipping on its marketplace, but you must follow specific requirements to comply with their standards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You must be the only seller of record for your products.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your company\'s name should appear as the seller on all packing slips, invoices, and product-related documentation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Remove any information that identifies third-party sellers before mailing orders to customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accept and process returns responsibly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Follow the rules of your seller agreement and <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GWFZQ8U37JV9AUT5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amazon\'s drop shipment policy</a>.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follow these criteria to avoid the suspension of your Amazon selling rights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Top 10 Popular Dropshipping and Wholesale Tools</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4078,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Top-10-Popular-Dropshipping-and-Wholesale-Tools-1024x577.png\" alt=\"Popular Dropshipping and Wholesale Tools\" class=\"wp-image-4078\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. <a href=\"https://www.doba.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doba</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Provides access to millions of products, supplier management, inventory tracking, and direct integration with major eCommerce platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy product sourcing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offers multiple integrations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Real-time inventory updates.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Higher membership fees.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited product variety for some niches.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. <a href=\"https://www.sunrisewholesalemerchandise.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sunrise Wholesale</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Offers product catalog, shipping, and inventory management. Integrates with eBay, Amazon, and other platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Broad product range.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Competitive pricing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy platform integration.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>U.S.-based shipping only.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited customer support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. <a href=\"https://brybelly.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">BryBelly</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Specializes in toys, games, and fitness equipment, providing wholesale products for resellers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on high-demand categories.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bulk pricing discounts.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>U.S. warehouse for quick shipping.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited product categories.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No dropshipping service.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. <a href=\"https://www.nationaldropshippers.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">National Dropshippers</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong> Offers access to thousands of products, order fulfillment, and discounted shipping.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No minimum order requirements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low membership fees.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Supports various eCommerce platforms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Small product selection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>U.S.-based suppliers only.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. <a href=\"https://www.fragrancenet.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">FragranceNet</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Specializes in fragrances and beauty products for dropshipping and wholesale orders.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Established reputation in the beauty industry.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Competitive pricing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global shipping.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited product niche.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Less flexible for small businesses.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6. <a href=\"https://www.fragrancenet.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wholesale2B</a></strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Provides access to over 1 million products across multiple categories, inventory sync, and eCommerce platform integration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Large product selection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automatic order processing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No need to contact suppliers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Higher subscription fees.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited control over shipping times.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. <a href=\"http://AliExpress\" rel=\"nofollow\">AliExpress</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Marketplace offering a wide variety of products for dropshipping with global shipping options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Huge product variety.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Free to use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No minimum order requirements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long shipping times.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Quality control issues with some suppliers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. <a href=\"https://www.oberlo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oberlo</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>Integrates with Shopify, allowing users to import products from AliExpress and automate the dropshipping process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Easy-to-use interface.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Streamlined order fulfillment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Inventory tracking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited to Shopify users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dependence on AliExpress suppliers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>9. <a href=\"https://www.spocket.co/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spocket</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Features: Focuses on U.S. and EU-based suppliers, offering products for dropshipping with faster shipping times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Faster shipping for U.S. and EU customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality product selection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Integration with Shopify and WooCommerce.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited product range.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Premium products can be expensive.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>10. <a href=\"https://www.salehoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaleHoo</a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features: </strong>A directory of vetted suppliers offering dropshipping and wholesale products, with education and tools for new sellers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Vetted, reliable suppliers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Educational resources for beginners.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Global supplier network.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cons:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited direct integration with platforms.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Annual membership fee required.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These tools offer a range of features to help sellers find and manage products for dropshipping or wholesale, but each comes with its specific strengths and weaknesses depending on the business model and target audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Researching Potential Suppliers</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first step to kickstart your dropshipping journey on Amazon is to identify trustworthy suppliers. Exploring well-known platforms such as Alibaba, AliExpress, and Oberlo is a great way to begin. These marketplaces provide a vast selection of products and link you with manufacturers from around the globe. When evaluating potential suppliers, focusing on those with established reputations and positive customer feedback is essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another useful approach is to leverage online supplier directories like Inventory Source. These resources can assist you in locating wholesale suppliers explicitly tailored for dropshipping. Additionally, consider searching for suppliers on social media platforms like Instagram, Facebook, and LinkedIn. Many businesses utilize these channels to display their products and engage with potential partners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember to consider the effectiveness of a straightforward Google search. Seek out suppliers that cater to your specific niche and reach out to them directly. Keep in mind that selecting the right supplier is vital for the success of your Amazon dropshipping venture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Evaluating Product Quality and Pricing</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you have listed some potential suppliers, you have to compare their products in terms of quality and price. The average order value on Amazon is typically in line with historical data, which once estimated the figure to be around $47.31. However, recent trends suggest that this number has likely increased, with the current range now estimated to be between $50 and $55.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The ideal price range for products on Amazon generally falls between $10 and $70. Most sellers on the platform achieve a profit margin of around 15–20%, with anything above 20% being considered outstanding. To maintain a healthy profit margin, a good rule of thumb is to price products at least four times higher than their wholesale cost.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some of the top-performing categories on Amazon for 2024 include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Beauty and personal care</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Home and Kitchen</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Clothing, shoes, and jewelry</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Electronics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sports and outdoors</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Toys and games</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Negotiating Terms with Dropshipping Partners</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s time to negotiate conditions after deciding which providers are your top choices. Talk about crucial elements like return policies, shipping schedules, and minimum order amounts. To keep your seller rating high, be sure your selected suppliers can fulfill Amazon\'s demanding delivery standards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Negotiate pricing depending on your estimated sales volume. Larger orders sometimes qualify for discounts from suppliers, which can boost your profit margins. Talk about the potential for bespoke packaging or private labeling to set your items apart from rivals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t forget to inquire about the supplier\'s return and defective product handling procedures. Keeping a good reputation on Amazon and handling customer support both depend on this information. You may lay the groundwork for a profitable Amazon dropshipping business by carefully negotiating conditions with your dropshipping partners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Creating and Optimizing Amazon Listings</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As an official Amazon SPN (Service Provider Network) partner, we offer comprehensive support to Amazon sellers. We are here to help businesses enhance their Amazon presence through expert services like account setup, listing optimization, PPC management, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consequently, we can assist you with the following steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setting up your Seller Account</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To start dropshipping on Amazon, you need to set up a seller account. Go to sellercentral.amazon.com and create a Professional or Individual account. The Professional plan costs $39.99 a month, regardless of sales volume, while the Individual plan costs $0.99 for each item sold. In order to receive payments, please include necessary information such as your business email address, credit card details, government ID, tax information, phone number, and bank account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Crafting SEO-friendly Product Listings</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product listing is one of the most important aspects of Amazon dropshipping, as it determines the performance of a particular product. Begin with keyword research to determine the keywords that will help you to find customers for your products. Ensure that these keywords are used naturally within your product titles, bullet points, and descriptions to see better rankings in Amazon\'s search engine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When writing the title of your product, make sure to include features such as brand, type, color, and size, as well as if it has special features. It’s best to keep it brief but not boring; it should be about 200 characters long.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the bullet points section, make sure to feature all the attributes of your product and the relevant benefits. Make sure there is an easy-to-read layout, and concentrate on features that make your item unique. This is your opportunity to persuade potential customers that they should buy your product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the product description, please write a description of the item, pointing out more about its attributes, functions, and utilities. Use proper paragraphing and formatting to ensure that it can be easily read. Just a couple of notes: please avoid being too formal or, on the contrary, using lots of capitals or other punctuation marks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pricing Strategies for Maximum Profit</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pricing your products effectively is essential for a successful Amazon dropshipping business. Start by researching your competitors\' prices to understand the market rate. Consider using Amazon\'s Product Opportunity Explorer to analyze customer demand and pricing trends over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When setting your prices, factor in all costs, including Amazon\'s fees, your supplier\'s price, and shipping expenses. Aim for a healthy profit margin while remaining competitive. Remember that Amazon\'s seller fees typically range from 8% to 15%, depending on the product category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consider using dynamic pricing tools to automatically adjust your prices based on market conditions and competitor pricing. This can help you stay competitive and maximize profits without constant manual adjustments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experiment with different pricing strategies, such as offering introductory discounts or bundle deals, to attract customers and boost sales. However, always ensure that your pricing allows for a sustainable profit margin to keep your dropshipping business viable in the long run.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Fulfillment and Customer Service Strategies</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Understanding Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA) vs. Fulfillment by Merchant (FBM)</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When dropshipping on Amazon, you have two main fulfillment options: <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-fba-consulting\">Fulfillment by Amazon</a> (FBA) and Fulfillment by Merchant (FBM). FBA allows you to send your products to Amazon\'s warehouses, where they handle storage, packaging, and shipping to customers. This option can save you time and provide access to Amazon Prime shipping, which can boost your sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the other hand, FBM requires you to manage inventory, process orders, and handle packaging and shipping directly to customers. While this gives you more control over the fulfillment process, it also means more responsibility for customer service and returns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Order Management Tool</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To effectively manage orders and shipments when dropshipping on Amazon, it\'s crucial to have a streamlined system in place. Use Amazon\'s Seller Central dashboard to track orders and update shipping information. If you\'re using FBM, ensure a reliable process for forwarding orders to your suppliers and updating tracking information promptly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consider using dropshipping software or integrations to automate order processing and reduce the risk of errors. These tools can help you manage inventory levels, update product listings, and sync orders across multiple sales channels if you sell on other platforms besides Amazon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Handling Customer Inquiries and Returns</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Successfully managing customer service is essential for Amazon dropshipping businesses. Amazon responds to the majority of consumer questions and returns while using FBA. If you choose to use FBM, though, you\'ll need to be ready to handle these things on your own.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Set up a procedure to respond to client inquiries fast and properly. Make sure your providers can manage returns effectively and establish clear return policies that adhere to Amazon\'s rules. Keep in mind that even if you dropship, you still have responsibility for your customers\' happiness as an Amazon seller.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can deliver a great client experience and establish a solid basis for your Amazon dropshipping business by concentrating on these fulfillment and customer service tactics.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Analyzing Performance Metrics</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Monitoring your performance data closely is essential if you want to see growth in your Amazon dropshipping business. You can use the abundance of data that Amazon offers to make well-informed judgments. Start by routinely reviewing your sales records, which provide you with information on revenue patterns and your best-selling products. Keep an eye on your click-through and conversion rates to gauge how well your listings are performing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your customers\' comments and evaluations are a crucial additional measure to keep an eye on. These can offer insightful information about what aspects of your items customers find appealing and areas in need of development. Make better use of this information to improve your customer service and product offers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember to analyze your profit margins. While dropshipping on Amazon can be profitable, with margins reaching as high as 40%, it\'s essential to account for all costs, including Amazon\'s fees, which typically range from 8% to 15% depending on the product category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Is Amazon Dropshipping Legal?</strong> </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":4093,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Is-Amazon-Dropshipping-Legal-1024x512.png\" alt=\"Is Amazon Dropshipping Legal? \" class=\"wp-image-4093\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, but only if you do it ethically; Amazon dropshipping is legal and approved on the marketplace. However, dropshipping on Amazon comes with numerous requirements. You can ensure that you are correctly adhering to these guidelines by seeking advice from an Amazon marketing consultant:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>All documentation related to the product, such as packing slips, invoices, and external packaging, must list you as the seller. Don\'t mention your manufacturer or supplier.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure there are no indications of a third-party drop shipper, such as packing slips, invoices, or outside packaging, before shipping the box.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Receiving and managing returns is your duty.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>As specified in the seller agreement, you are required to abide by all of Amazon\'s terms of service.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Purchasing anything from Amazon, Walmart, or any other third-party seller on Amazon and asking the vendor to ship the item straight to the customer is strictly prohibited.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Starting an Amazon dropshipping business can lead to success for entrepreneurs. This guide outlines the steps to start and expand your operation, including creating a seller account and growing your business. To succeed in the Amazon market, choose profitable niches, form strong supplier relationships, and improve product listings. Continuous learning and adaptability are crucial. Stay updated with Amazon\'s rules, monitor market changes, and prioritize customer satisfaction. Your Amazon dropshipping business can thrive and generate good money by using the right plans and strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we recognize the challenges and opportunities that come with launching a dropshipping venture. Our dedicated team is here to support you every step of the way, from setting up your Amazon seller account to optimizing your product listings and managing your marketing strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Is engaging in dropshipping still a viable option in 2024?</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dropshipping continues to be a workable business model in 2024. It attracts people who want to enter the eCommerce world or grow their businesses. This appeal stems from its low startup costs and more negligible risk than traditional retail models.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>What initial investment is required to start dropshipping on Amazon?</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Starting a dropshipping business on Amazon doesn\'t involve specific fees for dropshipping itself. However, you should know about Amazon\'s standard selling fees. Also, if you choose to use services like Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA), consider possible costs for product storage and shipping.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Can you still make money by dropshipping on Amazon?</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, Amazon dropshipping can still bring in cash. Jungle Scout\'s State of the Amazon Seller Report shows that 94% of Amazon sellers using the dropshipping model say they\'re making money. Your success hinges on how much it costs to get products, what prices you set, and how well you handle Amazon\'s fees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Does Amazon allow dropshipping?</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon\'s okay with dropshipping as long as you follow their rules. You must be the official seller, meaning you own the stuff before it ships to the customer. Also, you have to clarify that you\'re the seller on all product paperwork and details.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Blog-Images-24.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-11 06:43:52','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(145,'Ranking Fluctuations? Here\'s Why (Google June 2024 Spam Update)','google-june-2024-spam-update','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Summary: Google is back again with its June rollout, targeting spammy practices and low-quality content. This blog includes insights on <strong>Google June 2024 spam update</strong>, its impact on SEO, and strategies to maintain or improve your search rankings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3914,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Google-Webmaster-2024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3914\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Key Takeaways</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google\'s spam updates penalize sites using manipulative SEO tactics, improving overall search quality.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The<strong> Google spam update June 2024</strong> targets low-quality, duplicated content, and spammy links, enhancing user experience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sites relying solely on AI-generated content must add human insights and original research to stay competitive.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refreshing old content and building online credibility are crucial for maintaining and improving search rankings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ranking has always been crucial online, with its constant ups and downs. However, <strong>ranking fluctuations June 2024 </strong>have introduced a new level of uncertainty following<strong> Google\'s latest algorithm update</strong>. These changes show that Google is always working to improve its ranking criteria.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, businesses and digital marketers are dealing with sudden changes in traffic and visibility, which is a result of Google\'s complex algorithm changes. It\'s important to understand the details of these <strong>Google ranking changes 2024 </strong>if you want to make the most of your SEO strategies. <br>After the <strong>Google algorithm update June 2024</strong>, the company advised websites experiencing ranking changes to review their compliance with the company\'s spam policies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Google Spam Update? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s spam update is a regular change to its algorithms that makes spammy content less likely to show up in search results. These updates, like <strong>Google search engine update June 2024,</strong> improve search results by penalizing sites that lie to get a higher rank. Also, sites that use keyword stuffing, cloaking, or low-quality content to get higher rankings might see some variation by the changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep in mind that Google doesn\'t always release spam updates at the same time. They do it when they need to. These updates keep search results useful and relevant for users by regularly getting rid of spammy or manipulative content.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Overview of Google June 2024 Spam Update</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s June 2024 Spam Update, which started on June 20 and ended on June 27, goes after websites that break Google\'s spam rules. Consequently, the goal of this standard update is to get rid of spammy and low-quality content and make search results better. Some important parts of the update are:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Focus Areas:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Low-Quality or Duplicated Content: Websites with content that is either low-quality or copied are targeted.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Spammy Links: This affects sites that buy or sell links to change their search rankings.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tricky Techniques: Methods like hidden redirects that deceive users are penalized.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated Content: Targeted content is content that is made just to improve rankings.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Timeline of the June 2024 Spam Update Rollout</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The June 2024 spam update was released and completed over a span of seven days. Below is the detailed timeline of the update:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Date</strong></td><td><strong>Time (PDT)</strong></td><td><strong>Description</strong></td></tr><tr><td>June 20, 2024</td><td>08:13 PDT</td><td>Released the June 2024 spam update. The rollout may take up to 1 week to complete.</td></tr><tr><td>June 27, 2024</td><td>09:10 PDT</td><td>The rollout was complete as of June 27, 2024.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>SEO Impact of June 2024 Google update </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The SEO impact of the June 2024 update reflects significant<strong> Google search algorithm changes 2024</strong>. Here’s what you should know:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Removal of Infinite Scroll Feature - </strong>One big change this update makes is that Google\'s desktop and soon mobile search results will no longer have the infinite scroll. Before, the endless scroll would load new search results automatically as users scrolled down. Now, Google uses a \"More Results\" button instead. This change is to give users more control over how content loads, which could change how people interact with search results. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Algorithm Leak and Its Ramifications - </strong>For the<strong> Google algorithm update June 2024</strong>, the leak of over 14,000 lines of code was a big surprise. Google quickly took down the data, but SEO professionals had a lot to say about it while it was up. This leak gave businesses a look at Google\'s ranking factors, which proved that domain authority, high-quality backlinks, and strong E-A-T are still very important for content success.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Search Ranking Fluctuations June 2024 - </strong>Are you noticing fluctuations in your search rankings but don’t understand why? These changes are often due to the <strong>Google June 2024 spam update</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During these updates, websites that follow Google\'s rules tend to do better, while websites that use spammy methods may see their rankings drop.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Deindexing of Low-Quality Content - </strong>Google’s recent changes made it harder for websites with poor content to rank well. Therefore, content that wasn\'t useful, wasn\'t relevant or was duplicated was removed from search results. This move also went after websites that used AI-generated content that wasn\'t updated with new information. Also, websites with old or broken content were either lowered in the search results or taken out of Google\'s index completely.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Penalty for Spammy Practices - </strong>Google\'s most recent spam update targets websites that use dishonest <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/technical-seo\"><strong>SEO techniques</strong></a>. Some of these strategies were scaled content abuse, expired domain abuse, and site reputation abuse. Moreover, these practices resulted in severe penalties, such as complete removal from Google\'s search index (also known as deindexing).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Impact on AI-Generated Content -</strong> It\'s important to remember that only using content made by AI can hurt your website. One example is that websites that only used AI content have seen their search rankings drop. For this reason, the content might not be very unique or interesting, and it might not sound like the brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, the<strong> Google search engine update June 2024</strong> puts more emphasis on high-quality content that\'s right for auidence. Also, Google likes content that is new, different, and true to the brand it comes from.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>SEO Strategies Post Google update </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Improving your rankings following Google\'s June updates is easier said than done, but with the right strategies, it is certainly possible.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improve Ad Placement - </strong>Google likes easily navigable and aesthetically pleasing websites. Thus, don\'t flood your site with annoying pop-up ads; they take away from the experience of your visitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Enhance Internal Links and SEO - </strong>Do you know your keywords\' main search intent? Your blog post should go beyond primary information. It should include links related to that topic. This approach ensures that the content addresses the direct query and addresses the underlying user concerns.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verify and Edit AI Content - </strong>Make sure that any of your AI-generated content is high-quality and not spammy or generic. Moreover, add your original research to make your posts more solid and trustworthy. Don’t forget to read Google Search\'s rules about content created by AI.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Refresh Old Content - </strong>Review your content often to see chances for improvements. Additionally, updating older and irrelevant content matches user expectations and present standards.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We advise looking over the search engine results page (SERPs) to find content opportunities to guide your updates. Additionally, compare the material ranking highly for the same subjects with your current blog entries. Inspired by the top-ranking results and <strong>Google ranking changes 2024</strong>, improve your old or outdated content to guarantee its competitiveness and relevance. Ultimately, create content that users want to read.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Build Online Credibility - </strong>Building online authority calls for a broad presence on several platforms. Google highly values your experience, expertise, authoritativeness, trustworthiness, and domain authority. Through this, you can establish yourself on many platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, Google evaluates domain authority depending on more than backlinks. Consider two ecommerce clothes companies with similar products. Google will view one as more reliable if it has more visibility, including in blogs, on YouTube, and via positive customer reviews. As a result, it supports the authority and reputation of your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In short, <strong>Google spam update June 2024</strong> is a reminder that SEO is constantly changing. Thus, we advise digital marketers to be flexible and stay up-to-date on the latest trends. Plus, it is crucial for businesses as well to make adjustments to their strategies based on these updates. Moreover, this approach is key to <strong>recovering from Google spam updates </strong>and avoiding setbacks caused by<strong> Google search algorithm changes 2024.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nevertheless, our team of specialists is available to assist you if you require more precise instructions for overcoming these SEO obstacles in view of the most recent <strong>Google updates</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Google-June-2024-Spam-Update-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-08 13:47:46','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(146,'How to Optimize for Featured Snippets: Boost Your SEO Visibility','optimize-for-featured-snippets','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Have you ever wished your content could appear as a featured snippet right at the top of Google\'s first page? In this blog, learn<strong> how to optimize for featured snippets</strong> and achieve this coveted spot. Discover strategies for crafting clear, concise answers that grab attention and drive traffic to your site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enhance visibility and place your content at the top of search results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Types of featured snippets, each suited for different content formats and search intents.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on clear, concise answers, and use structured data to improve your chances of securing highlighted results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every SEO expert dreams of having featured snippets (FS) as part of their strategy. In order to optimize your content for FS, you need to organize it in a way that gives easy responses to frequent search queries. Doing so raises the bar for Google to display your material as the top user search result.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Understanding <strong>how to get featured snippets</strong> can transform your SEO efforts, driving more traffic and establishing your website as a credible source of information. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is a featured Snippet? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Featured Snippet is a highlighted answer box appearing atop Google search results. It answers user queries quickly and concisely. It also increases your site\'s exposure and the number of clicks it receives. One way to improve your content and boost its chances of appearing in this prominent spot is by using clear and structured information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Featured snippets and voice search </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With FS, Google answers voice searches on phones and Google Home devices. They\'re kind of like little knowledge cards. Thus, it\'s really important how you write your content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you\'re optimizing, check to see if your answer sounds right when you say it out loud. Think about a friendly voice assistant reading it back to you. If you remember this, you\'ll definitely be able to get those featured snippets.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the Types of Featured Snippets? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Paragraph Snippets</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The majority of the featured snippets are of this type, with an average length of approximately 42 words and 250 characters. Moreover, the titles of paragraph snippets begin with \"What\" or \"Why,\" indicating that they are primarily informative in nature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. List Snippets</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Listicle-type snippets have an average of six items and 44 words. Furthermore, there are two types of listicle-featured snippets: ordered and unordered. These snippets are derived from the \"How\" and \"Why\" keywords.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Table Snippets</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Table snippets have an average of five rows and two columns, each containing 40 to 45 words. Thus, to optimize for this type of featured snippet, use HTML\'s table tags to format relevant content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Video Snippets</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Very few of the featured snippets are videos, with the average length being 6 minutes and 35 seconds. Consequently, if your target audience is heavily into video content, a video-featured snippet is your ticket to success.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of Google Featured Snippets </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The good news is that FS gets extra attention. They show up right at the top, above the regular search results. Consequently, this can greatly affect how many people see your content and click through to your site. Also, getting a featured snippet is like Google giving you the thumbs up. It lets people know that your content is excellent and reliable, which boosts your brand\'s credibility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That being said, top snippets do come with some problems. First, it can be very tough to get to the top spots. Another thing is that users might find all the information they need in the snippet and not visit your website at all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Featured Snippets vs Rich Snippets </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Basis of Comparison</strong></td><td><strong>Featured Snippets&nbsp;</strong></td><td><strong>Rich Snippets&nbsp;</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Structured Data Markup</strong></td><td>Don\'t need structured data. Google extracts relevant information directly from web content based on search queries.</td><td>Use structured data to enhance webpage content in search results. While not always necessary, Google can create them, like for local businesses.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tracking in Google Search Console</strong></td><td>It cannot be directly tracked in Google Search Console. It\'s uncertain if your website will be featured for a specific query.<br></td><td>Meanwhile, website owners can track rich snippet performance in Google Search Console. It shows when and how often snippets appear, which queries trigger them, and their click-through rates.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ranking on Page 1</strong></td><td>Consistently shown at the top of organic search results, above standard blue links.</td><td>Furthermore, it can appear in search results despite the webpage not ranking on the first page.&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Optimize For Featured Snippets </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whenever you see a competitor ranking on highlighted results, consider: What can I learn from their content to <strong>optimize for featured snippets</strong> on similar topics?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Analyze Competitors\' Featured Snippets </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Featured snippets are prime real estate, but don\'t just copy what others do. Instead, learn from them. Go through their websites and see which keywords landed them those top spots. Analyze the format (list, paragraph?) Google prefers those searches. Prioritize keywords with high search volume (more people searching) but also consider those with lower difficulty scores (easier to rank for). Ultimately, this practice will fuel your content strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Collect Keywords for Each FS-owned Content  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you\'ve decided on your content ideas, it\'s time to conduct further research. Take a look at the content that currently contains those featured snippets. Check out the keywords they\'ve used, not just the main ones but also related ones and questions that people might search for. Plan your content around these keywords. That way, you can make content that Google and people searching for it will like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Identify Searcher Intent  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What are people really looking for? They could be potential customers or even influential people who are researching your product or service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Featured snippets usually have one main goal, such as finding an answer, getting an overview quickly, or comparing different options. Understanding this goal will help you ensure that your content gives users the information they want in the format Google prefers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Create or Update the Content Outline  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make your content outline once you have all the information you need, like content topics, keywords, featured snippet types, user intent, and information about your competitors. These tips will help you write if you\'re starting from scratch. If you\'re changing old content, this research will help you make your outline better. Lastly, ensure it fits with what search engines and users want from a featured snippet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Structure the Content for Readers and Search Engines  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clear content structure makes your content shine for both users and search engines. Also, the structure can turn a long paragraph into a short list. That\'s its power! Thus, aim for short, easy-to-read sections that directly answer users\' questions. Ultimately, this puts your content in great shape for that coveted featured snippet spot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Include Question Keywords in Heading Tags </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Primarily, you need to organize your content and add question keywords to the heading tags to get featured snippets. Additionally, pick the question keywords that people are searching for a lot and put them in your heading tags. Mostly, Google\'s top snippet begins right after a heading tag.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Implement SEO Strategies </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use clear SEO tactics:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Simple URLs: Keep them short and descriptive (3-4 words).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Catchy Titles: Craft titles that are informative and fit Google\'s snippet preview.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Keyword-Rich Descriptions: Write clear descriptions using relevant keywords to entice clicks.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Image Labels: Use descriptive alt text for images to boost understanding.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Connect Your Pages: Link to relevant internal pages to showcase your website\'s structure.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Trustworthy Links: Cite credible external sources to build authority.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Schema Markup (optional): Use these tags to help Google understand specific elements on your page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Continuously Optimize Your Content for Featured Snippets </strong> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After setting up this optimization process for featured snippets, check the outcomes seven, fourteen, and twenty-one days later. Moreover, if you see that impressions go up, work harder to get clicks. Keep an eye on how impressions, rankings, and click-through rate (CTR) change in Google Search Console and how traffic and visibility change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why are Featured Snippets Important for SEO? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are various advantages to your SEO strategy when you optimize your content for a highlighted answer box. Here’s the reason it matters:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Stand Out in Search Results - </strong>With featured snippets, your content is right at the top of search results, in a box people can\'t miss. More people are likely to see your content because it\'s in this great spot, which can lead to a lot more clicks and website traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Build trust -</strong> Furthermore, getting a featured snippet is like getting a gold star from Google. This lets people know that your website has accurate and useful content that Google believes can directly answer their questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Make users happy - </strong>Featured snippets are all about making things easy for people. People can find the answer they need right on the search results page, saving them time and clicks. Also, you\'re giving visitors a better and smoother experience by making your content better for top snippets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Get ahead of the competition - </strong>If your content gets a featured snippet, it rises above all the other search results, even those from your competitors. This great spot can give you an edge and bring more free visitors to your site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Common Mistakes to Avoid when Aiming for Featured Snippets  </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some things to keep in mind as you try to get that coveted featured snippet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Firstly, avoid lengthy explanations. Search engines like short answers that people can quickly understand.  </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Another benefit of structured data is that it helps search engines better understand your content. Make sure you remember about it! </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, it\'s essential to be fresh. Adding new content to your site regularly shows search engines its trustworthiness and keeps people returning for more.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lastly, mastering <strong>how to get featured snippets </strong>can catapult your SEO visibility to new heights. These rules should hopefully assist you in optimizing featured snippets.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our skilled SEO team ensures that your website gets better search engine rankings and stands out. Additionally, our customized <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/seo-services\">SEO services</a> </strong>can help you improve your online presence as you watch your visibility and engagement soar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. What is the purpose of featured snippets?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1.</strong> Featured snippets are the highlighted parts of text that show up at the very top of a Google search results page. Specifically, the purpose of these snippets is to give people a quick answer to their search questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. How do featured snippets influence search and SEO?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2.</strong> Featured snippets enhance SEO. By putting short, sweet answers to search queries at the top of the list, you get people\'s attention and make your content more visible. Consequently, this will naturally increase the number of people who click on your link and visit your site.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. What is an example of a featured snippet?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3.</strong> For example, searching for \"common cold symptoms\" might see a bulleted list-style Featured Snippet at the top. This allows you to quickly read about cold symptoms like stuffy nose, sore throat, and stuffy head without having to click on a specific website.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4.&nbsp; How many characters in a featured snippet?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.4. </strong>A featured snippet paragraph should be between 40 and 50 words long, about 300 characters. Hence, try to completely explain the topic in 2-3 sentences.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/How-to-Optimize-for-Featured-Snippets.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-08 12:36:48','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(147,'A Tutorial on Add Me to Search: How to Create a People Card','add-me-to-search-engine','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> Creating a People Card with the <strong>add me to search engine</strong> feature is beneficial for reconnecting, networking, and finding contact information, which is why many people are now making their details easily accessible. In this blog, learn how you can create a people card and optimize it for discoverability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create a digital business card visible on Google search, showcasing your professional details.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Help others find and connect with you easily.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Build credibility and expertise by highlighting your skills, experience, and achievements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ensure accuracy and clarity before publishing to Google search.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managing your digital footprint is more crucial than ever in this day of online connections. Learn about <strong>Add Me to Search</strong> if you\'ve ever looked for <strong>Add Myself to Google Search</strong> and wished you could provide some context. Also known as \"Google People Cards\".</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine People Cards as your online business card. Easily make a card that includes your name, job title, brief bio, and even links to your websites, social media accounts, and contact information. Your People Card can show up in Google Search results after it\'s submitted anytime someone looks for your name or related terms. This is an amazing approach to presenting your personal brand and internet presence to the world. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are Google People Card?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3883,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/121-1024x498.png\" alt=\"What are Google People Card?\" class=\"wp-image-3883\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Google People Card </strong>is a free service that allows you to create a digital business card that shows up when someone searches for your name. You can put your name, job title, location, contact information, and a short bio on your Google People Card. Moreover, it can also have links to your website, social media pages, and other online profiles. To get started, you can search <strong>Add Myself to Google Search</strong> and follow the instructions from this blog.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Should You Create a People Card? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nowadays, a strong online presence is key. You can show off your skills and experience to everyone by making a Google People Card. Also, it will be easier for people to find you in searches, connect you with possible clients or coworkers, and help you become known as an expert in your field. It\'s a simple tool that can help you build your reputation and brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Setup Your Google Account </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating a Google People Card is not a difficult task. However, it does require a Google account. If you haven\'t already, head over to the Google Account signup page and follow the steps to set one up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>First, go to https://accounts.google.com/signin.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Click “Create account” and choose the type of account you\'re making (Personal/Business/Child account).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>\"Alternatively, click \'Use my current email address\' if you already have one and prefer not to create a Gmail address.\"</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Then, fill out the required information.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lastly, click on “I Agree” to the privacy policy. Your “My account” page is ready!</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember to use the right information about yourself during the account set up process, so Google can best represent you online.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Access Google’s People Card </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now that you have your Google account, let\'s see if it\'s time to claim your online identity. Open a web browser and search for yourself on Google. Check the sections like \"People also search for\" or \"Know this person?\" in the search results. If you see your name listed there, something exciting awaits! Click on the prompt that says \"Add yourself to Google\" – that\'s your chance to create your very own <strong>my People Card</strong> !</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Create a People Card? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3885,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/What-are-Google-People-Card.png\" alt=\"How to Create a People Card? \" class=\"wp-image-3885\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After clicking the \"add yourself to Google\" prompt or <strong>add me to the search engine</strong>, you\'ll be directed to a page to build your very own <strong>my People Card</strong>. Remember to make your card more engaging and informative.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Craft an Engaging Title </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with an attention-getting headline that fits with your professional brand. Use words and phrases that people would use to find someone like you. Additionally, for extra impact, make it bold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Add Your Personal Photo  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add the best photo of yours. Adding a professional headshot is key. Therefore, we advise you to choose a well-lit, clear photo that reflects your personality and work style.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Write an Interesting Introduction  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3893,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Highlight-Your-work-1.png\" alt=\"Write an Interesting Introduction  \" class=\"wp-image-3893\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The introduction should clearly define who you are, what’s your goal, or whatever things that best describe yourself. To do so, highlight your skills, achievements, and experience. Keep the language strong that resonates with your target audience and showcases your expertise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Include Contact Information </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, include your contact information, which can be your email address or phone number. You can add both or whichever you are comfortable with. Your target audience will reach out to you through this contact information, so don\'t skip this step!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Showcase Your Work Experience </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3891,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Highlight-Your-work.png\" alt=\"Showcase Your Work Experience \" class=\"wp-image-3891\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Work experience showcases your accomplishments and key responsibilities from current and past roles. Furthermore, keep this information clear and organized by detailing each position, tasks undertaken, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Highlight Your Education </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3890,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Highlight-Your-Education.png\" alt=\"Highlight Your Education \" class=\"wp-image-3890\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure to highlight your relevant training, degrees, and certifications. This is because it&nbsp; establishes your credibility and makes you seem like an expert in your industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>List Your Skills and Expertise </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find your most important skills and areas of expertise. Additionally, use specific keywords that are related to your business. This gives people who might hire you or work with you a quick idea of your strengths.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Share Your Online Profiles </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3887,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screenshot-2024-07-03-131038-ssss-1.png\" alt=\"Share Your Online Profiles \" class=\"wp-image-3887\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, share links to places you\'re online, like your blog, website, or social media accounts. Due to this, people will look at your work and find out more about what you\'ve done for the field. In turn, the target audience will know more about yourself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Reviewing and Publishing Your People Card </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3896,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Screenshot-2024-07-03-131249.png\" alt=\"Reviewing and Publishing Your People Card \" class=\"wp-image-3896\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After you have entered all the required information, please check your People Card—including <strong>Google people search</strong>—for accuracy and completeness. Verify that everything is properly organized and free of grammatical problems. When you\'re happy with your card, hit the \"Publish\" button to see it appear in Google search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Content Guidelines </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Regarding the People Card, it focuses on information about individuals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provide accurate details without comparing to others or making unsubstantiated claims.&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The emphasis should be on authenticity and relevance,&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Avoid promotional content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hope with these easy steps, we have answered your question - <strong>How To Create My Own People Card? </strong>Importantly, making a Google People Card is a strong approach to building your online presence. Plus, it guarantees that people can find correct and pertinent information about you. As such, be prepared to improve your visibility and raise your chances of reaching the right audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Need help setting up Google accounts or creating a People Card? Opt for our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">social media optimization services</a></strong>. Our experts will assist you with all your needs, ensuring successful creation of your People Card.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. How to edit people\'s cards for free?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.1. Visit google.com or launch the Google Search app to make or change your people card. Search for \"edit my people card.\" Click \"Edit\" at the upper right corner of your people card. Then, as necessary, you can change your contact information. Following your edits, scroll to the bottom, select \"Preview,\" and then \"Save.\" This will update your information and make it easier for people to find you when they search for<strong> add me to Google or edit my People Card</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. What are the benefits of Google\'s People Cards?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.2. Some of the key benefits of Google’s People Card are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>East way to make a name for yourself on search engines.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A simple and quick way to keep your professional information up to date.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google\'s safety measures to keep your info safe.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. Will my personal contact details be visible to everyone?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.3. It will be your decision,i.e., you have full freedom to choose the contact information you want to share. Also, you can decide how much information you want to make public.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.4. Do I need a Google account to view People Cards?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.4. No, People Cards on Google search results are viewable by anybody. To make and control your own card, though, you must have a Google account.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/A-Tutorial-on-Add-Me-to-Search-How-to-Create-a-People-Card.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-07-02 13:39:38','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(148,'LinkedIn’s New AI Features Makes Networking Easier','linkedins-new-ai-features-makes-networking-easier','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We all know how easy it is to build a friend list on social media — all it takes is just one click! But it feels like trying to hold up your end of the bargain in building a professional network on LinkedIn. Furthermore, trying to do it right is a bit like trying to climb Mount Everest. It would help if you learned to build and maintain a network to survive in the ever-competitive business landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well, guess what? The platform has grown, bringing out LinkedIn AI Premium and rolling out some pretty rad new features that cut through all the clutter. AI (Artificial Intelligence) can be used to put networking on autopilot for everyone!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Linkedin AI Premium?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn\'s AI Premium will help you do better at work! It makes your job search more targeted by suggesting jobs that are a good fit for your skills and experience. You\'ll also get a better idea of who is looking at your profile, which will help you tailor your approach and make stronger connections. Plus, AI enables you to stay competitive by giving you information about the pay ranges for different jobs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s not just about jobs, though. It also helps you save for the future by giving you access to courses on LinkedIn Learning that are tailored to your career goals. With data-driven insights, you can improve your networking skills, get your dream job, and keep your skills up to date as you work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of LinkedIn AI Premium Features</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Linkedin Generative AI</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine trying to write a friend request to someone cool at school, but your mind goes blank. That\'s what it can be like on LinkedIn when you want to connect with someone important. The new AI feature is like your own personal message-writing assistant! It checks out your profile and the profile of the person you want to connect with, and LinkedIn generative AI suggests a message that mentions things you have in common.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Maybe you both attended the same college or loved the same video game! This gives you a great starting point, and then you can add your personal touch to make the message extra friendly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Catching Up with Old Friends</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The new \"Catch Up\" tab is like a sorcerer\'s wand of LinkedIn AI Tools, which magically opens up conversation threads with those you\'ve ignored for quite some time. It leverages AI to surface these old relationships. It gives you valuable nuggets about what you may have in common with someone, such as a common interest in an industry or a recent accomplishment they shared in their profile. The \"Catch Up\" tab also prompts the conversation: congratulating your old contact on an accomplishment, offering to put them in touch with someone in your network who might be good for them, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>AI for LinkedIn: Professional Networking</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to a recent survey cited by LinkedIn, 85% of professionals plan to change employment by 2024.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nearly 25% of respondents to a LinkedIn poll said they dedicate 6–10 hours a week to networking, indicating the platform\'s recognition that creating and sustaining a professional network is a significant time investment. AI algorithms are used in the \"Grow\" page to assist users in managing connections and discovering new, relevant contacts. It offers tailored recommendations using the \"People You May Know\" function.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>LinkedIn AI Tools: Enhancing, Not Replacing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While these new features are great, you are irreplaceable! Treat them like assistants, not robots. The AI gets you closer to writing messages and finding them, but it is still up to you to be kind and act genuinely interested. The most robust connections are made when you are genuine and have actual conversations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Concluding Remarks</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even with that broadening of job descriptions, these new AI bits are the tip of the iceberg. Networking on LinkedIn will only get easier as technology gets even more brilliant. Be careful; these are starting points, not for abuse by contacting every recruiter, but for entrepreneurial outreach to real people who can help you get that successful career. So, get out there, start connecting, and watch your professional network grow like a supersized sunflower with LinkedIn AI Premium!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn more about such trends on social media and <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing services</a>; follow our blog section for comprehensive updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/LinkedIns-New-AI-Features-Makes-Networking-Easier.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-25 10:44:39','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(149,'LinkedIn Ads Get a Boost with New Generative AI Tools','linkedin-ads-get-a-boost-with-new-generative-ai-tools','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Explore how LinkedIn is quickly adding AI features to meet growing demand. As the AI revolution advances, LinkedIn is stepping up as a key player in enhancing ads.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leverage LinkedIn\'s AI tools to search for jobs, create content, and data analysis.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Create tailored ads and save time for strategic planning with AI Copy Suggestions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Microsoft\'s AI investment enhances LinkedIn\'s capabilities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>B2B marketers achieve better results with LinkedIn\'s AI-driven advertising.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn now has several AI tools to assist you, whether it\'s finding jobs, writing descriptions, generating content, or analyzing data. Similarly, you can use these generative tools to boost <strong>advertisements on LinkedIn.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn is the best site for business-to-business marketing because it has the most complete information on professionals. But what if smarter use of that data is what the future holds?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Copy Suggestions tool on LinkedIn can help you make ads that get better results faster. Due to this, you get more time to plan strategically and build relationships. As AI continues to evolve, expect <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services\"><strong>PPC management services</strong> </a>to become even more sophisticated, allowing B2B marketers to achieve even greater results. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>LinkedIn\'s AI Innovations</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI Copy Suggestions looks at information from millions of LinkedIn profiles to help you write ads that will reach your ideal customers. Think about being able to get advice from 930 million professionals. That\'s what AI Copy Suggestions can do.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let’s understand some of its key features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Specific to Your Brand</strong> - The tool also uses information from your campaign settings and the LinkedIn page for your business to make the ad copy suggestions more relevant to you. You can choose from up to five different headlines and other types of text so you can be sure that they fit your brand.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Option of Editing</strong> - You can change the suggested text to make it sound exactly like your brand. If you\'d rather write your own content from scratch, AI Copy Suggestions can help you get past writer\'s block and start coming up with new ideas.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Better Results and Consistent Branding </strong>- If you use AI Copy Suggestions, you can make sure that all of your ad campaigns have the same message. This makes it look more professional and gives you better value for your money.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Works for All Ad Types </strong>- AI Copy Suggestions can help you write more compelling copy faster, whether you\'re running video ads, message ads, or thought leader content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Microsoft\'s AI Influence</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Microsoft\'s ownership and investment in OpenAI positions LinkedIn to lead social AI advancements. AI Copy Suggestions advance LinkedIn\'s AI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, HR managers had a LinkedIn AI ‘copilot.’ Based on job title, company name, workplace type, job type, and location, an AI-powered <strong>LinkedIn bio generator</strong> writes descriptions. As a result, time saved on talent acquisition frees up HR professionals for other difficult tasks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Microsoft\'s products include generative AI models. Bing\'s chatbot, Edge, and 365 Copilot use AI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI impacts marketing worldwide. Due to this, more social media and ad services use AI to improve their services:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Meta (formerly Facebook) announced copywriting, background generation, image cropping, and ‘chat experiences’ generative AI tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>AI tool Google Product Studio helps advertisers create product images for more appealing ads.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The ‘new era of AI-powered ads’ from Google Search Ads adapts and transforms search results ads. It is based on user queries to appear and be relevant.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Given the rapid development of AI, B2B marketers must watch LinkedIn\'s AI strategy. Consequently, with competition rising, the company will innovate and develop advanced AI applications.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although, how can marketers use these new tools?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Role of AI in B2B Marketing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We don\'t believe that AI Copy Suggestions on marketing platforms will replace skilled marketers—not at all. AI is most useful when it makes people better at what they do.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, if you use it right, AI can help you be more productive and creative, but you need to know how to use it properly to make B2B content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AI tools can help with research, editing, coming up with ideas, and SEO optimization, but creativity, expertise, and empathy are what make marketing work. Website visits lead to results when they are useful and allow professionals to connect with each other.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With LinkedIn\'s new AI feature, marketers who have strong values and know their audience well can reach goals that were out of reach before. The key is to know how to use <strong>LinkedIn AI tools</strong> in your advertising and social media strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the new features that LinkedIn and other online media sites have added, B2B marketers can look forward to an exciting new era. As big media companies rush to use generative AI, marketers will have more chances to speed up processes, boost creativity, and get more people involved.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>AI-Driven Ad Creation on LinkedIn</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Business-to-business advertising has come a long way thanks to LinkedIn\'s AI Copy Suggestions. In addition, OpenAI\'s GPT and LinkedIn\'s huge collection of professional data are used together in this feature. It also writes ads that are specific to the campaign and audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are different versions of the copy that marketers can get and change to fit the voice of their brand. Thus, it helps to get past creative blocks, which makes ads work better and gets more engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Undoubtedly, LinkedIn\'s AI can improve targeting and suggest the best ad creative by looking at a brand\'s LinkedIn Page and Campaign Manager settings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, advertising is now based on data and works better, which leads to an increase in return on investment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, the future is here, and it\'s powered by AI. If you want to catch up with these changes and are looking to boost the visibility and performance of your business, then opt for our <strong>PPC Management Services</strong>. We have a team of professionals to make sure you get outstanding results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Q1. What are the new AI features on LinkedIn?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A1. LinkedIn\'s new generative AI features include tools to rewrite cover letters and resumes and chatbots modeled after well-known career coaches. Hiring a career coach or resume writer is something that many burned-out employees have fantasized about.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Q2. What are the effects of generative AI on advertising?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A2. Advertisers and marketers can benefit from generative AI marketing\'s enhanced targeting capabilities by pinpointing the most appropriate customer subsets. This improves campaign efficiency while decreasing expenditure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Q3. How can one activate AI on LinkedIn?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A3.&nbsp; You only need to sign in to LinkedIn and click the \"Profile\" tab to use the new AI features. A new button in the \"Profile Summary\" section says, \"Get AI-Powered Suggestions.\" To get started, simply click this button.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Q4. Does LinkedIn Sales Navigator utilize AI?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A4. Yes, it does. LinkedIn\'s new generative AI features for Sales Navigator aim to make it easier to manage the most important but time-consuming aspects of the sales process, i.e., finding leads and researching accounts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/LinkedIn-Ads-Get-a-Boost-with-New-Generative-AI-Tools.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-25 07:31:57','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(150,'SEO Strategy for Ecommerce Websites: Best Practices for 2024','seo-strategy-for-ecommerce-websites-best-practices-for-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>This blog is a comprehensive <strong>ecommerce SEO guide </strong>that includes key strategies like keyword research and on-page optimization and best practices to increase visibility and drive sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ecommerce SEO boosts visibility, increasing traffic and driving more sales effectively.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make sure your customers find the right products through the right keyword research.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Avoid duplicate content by writing unique product descriptions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Structured data improves search engine understanding, leading to richer results.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you have trouble attracting clients to your online shop? SEO for ecommerce can help! It raises your store\'s visibility in search results, which means more potential customers will see it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can attract more customers and significantly boost your store\'s visibility by utilizing smart <strong>ecommerce SEO strategies</strong>. The effect is the same as if a neon sign were flashing \"Shop Here!\" to all internet users. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is ECommerce SEO?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Increasing a website\'s visibility in search engine results is the goal of search engine optimization or SEO. Plus, any business can enjoy an increase in free visitors, and this is no exception. But for online stores, there\'s a special kind of SEO called ecommerce SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, is it completely distinct? Not quite. While both SEO and organic traffic generation have a common goal, ecommerce SEO works specifically to increase sales by driving visitors to your product pages.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Importance of SEO in Ecommerce</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s why it matters: It\'s a cost-effective way to reach more people and increase visibility. Did you know? Product-related research keywords are used 30% more recently than they were before. This implies more people than ever are taking the time to look for what they want online. If you have an optimized ecommerce site, you have a better chance of ranking higher in the search results. Thus, it doesn\'t matter what you are selling.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, it is important because potential customers only want to look at the first page of search engine results and don\'t want to scroll through a lot of options. In fact, 53.3% of all site traffic comes from organic search results. This shows how important SEO is for getting more than half of all site visits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>ECommerce SEO Strategies and Best Practices</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ECommerce SEO practices improve ecommerce keyword strategy visibility and ranking on search engine results pages.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s discuss the best <strong>SEO strategies for ecommerce sites</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Keyword Research</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to attract customers, you must be familiar with every search term they might use to find your store. Search engine optimization strategies for online stores are based on your keyword list. Due to this, you\'ll be thinking about new ecommerce keyword strategies all the time.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, it\'s never-ending, especially when you\'re adding new pages and products to your store. Given the dynamic nature of Google\'s search trends, all newly created pages must conduct fresh research.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO experts use tools to find the best keywords for your online store. But they don\'t just pick any keywords - they target keywords that show real buying intent. This means finding keywords that people use when they\'re ready to purchase, not just browsing. Similarly, by focusing on these high-value keywords, <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ecommerce-seo-services\">ecommerce SEO services</a></strong> can help your store attract more qualified leads.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. ECommerce SEO and Search Intent</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ever wonder what people are really looking for online? This is what is known as \"search intent.\" For instance, are they trying to find a specific product page, browse a category, or learn more about something before buying?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is why figuring out that intent and using the right keywords is crucial. Don\'t just target any random phrase. Instead, focus on keywords that show people are ready to buy, not just curious.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SEO masters this art. They use an effective <strong>ecommerce seo strategy</strong> to understand search intent, find keywords with buying power, and ultimately boost your website\'s ranking.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. On-Page Optimization for eCommerce SEO</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Content, headers, title tags, and meta descriptions are written, formatted, and organized during optimization. This process increases the page\'s ranking for keywords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some people decide to make a long list of 10 to several hundred keywords for their website. However, depending on the SEO work, this strategy might work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, to make a website work better, you need to find a focus keyword, secondary keywords, and LSI terms that qualify it. Smartly using these can help your search engine rankings. URLs, titles, and meta descriptions affect click-through rates in search results. Thus, they need to be interesting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, suppose the page in question is a Nike product page. In that scenario, the primary keyword could be \"Nike running shoes for sale,\" while the secondary keyword could be \"Nike Air Zoom Pegasus.\" The LSI may also include terms such as \"breathable mesh,\" \"cushioning support,\" and \"lightweight trainers,\" among others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Engaging Product Descriptions</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Writing unique product descriptions that build your brand and engage your audience is one of the perfect ways to use ecommerce SEO.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, people and search engines will notice your ecommerce implementation services more if you do this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online stores often copy and paste product descriptions from manufacturers, which leads to a lot of sites with duplicate content. To add, it\'s even more important to have a good product page copy if your items are on many eCommerce sites. Also, making sure products have unique, interesting descriptions can help your organic rankings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Focus on Store Navigation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even though user experience is essential, modern eCommerce stores don\'t put enough value on it. Accordingly, websites should be simple to navigate and use, especially on phones. It is key to make it easier to go from the home page to the checkout page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, this plan improves organic visibility and sales. Google tracks search engine returns and site visits, so making the site easy to use and navigate is very important.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Structured Data for eCommerce Websites</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the most imperative <strong>SEO strategy for ecommerce websites. </strong>It gives search engines a lot of information about a product page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Structured data lets businesses share product information with search engines. The information includes names, prices, availability, and reviews. Consequently, this makes the content more accessible and easy to understand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not only that, it makes eCommerce listings more visible and makes it easier for rich results. For example, product snippets and star ratings to show up on SERPs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, this strategic move makes the search more exciting and valuable. So, it increases the chances of clicks and stands out in the crowded digital market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Link Building and Off Page Optimization</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The two important strategies of <strong>ecommerce SEO are </strong>Link building and off-page optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Link building is the process of getting other trustworthy websites to link to yours. Google sees these links as signs of trust. Additionally, off-page optimization improves the user experience and your search engine rankings.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Good off-page SEO strategies include building backlinks, promoting on social media, monitoring reviews, and keeping up with local listings. Accordingly, all these strategies together can help your website\'s SERP ranking and reputation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Highlight Customer Reviews and Engagement</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Asking customers for detailed reviews can help you in two ways. First, more people will see your site because good reviews will make people trust you and bring new customers. Second, review posts are a great way to keep your content fresh for search engines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That\'s not all! Answering both good and bad reviews shows that you care about your customers. This helps people know and trust your business, which is great for SEO. It\'s good for everyone: customers are happy, search engines are happy, and your online store does well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are the <strong>ecommerce SEO best practices </strong>that can help your online store gain a potential audience, achieve higher visibility, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As one of the top SEO agencies, we know how to implement the strategies and best practices above. Thus, if you are considering an SEO audit or long-term SEO strategy for your eCommerce website, contact us for our <strong>ecommerce SEO services.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q1. What is the best SEO for ecommerce?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A1. </strong>Using long-tail keyword variations of your target keywords for products and categories is a great way to optimize your blog posts for eCommerce SEO. Moreover, articles on how to do things, reviews of products, etc., should be part of this.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q2. How does SEO work for ecommerce?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A2. </strong>Ecommerce search engine optimization means making small changes to your website to improve its performance with search engines and changing the content to match what your customers are looking for. <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/8-amazon-seo-tips-for-successful-operations-a-beginners-guide/\">SEO </a>can help store owners attract more visitors, raise awareness of their brand, and increase sales. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q3. What are the best ecommerce SEO tools?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A3. </strong>Best ecommerce SEO tools that is help in upgrading online Stores:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEMrush</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ahrefs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Moz Pro</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Yoast SEO</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Google Keyword Planner</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q4. How can SEO grow ecommerce site traffic?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A4. </strong>SEO brings more people to your site by using valuable keywords related to your products and matching what people are looking for. By strategically placing these keywords in your product descriptions, meta tags, and content, SEO experts help your site reach higher search results and attract the right kind of visitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/SEO-Strategy-for-Ecommerce-Websites-Best-Practices-for-2024.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-24 11:57:13','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(151,'What Sets the Best SMO Companies Apart from the Rest','what-sets-the-best-smo-companies-apart-from-the-rest','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>&nbsp;In \'Secrets of Success,\' we uncover the essence of Social Media Optimization (SMO) and its benefits. Learn how to identify the best SMO company and explore techniques to enhance your SMO strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media optimization strategies, including <strong>how to do SMO</strong>, will help you perform what you are currently doing more effectively through higher engagement and follower growth. Social media optimization, or SMO, enables business owners, content creators, and social media marketers to maximize their online visibility. Experienced SMO companies can guide businesses in optimizing profiles and posts for optimal results, simplifying the process without complex keyword research or technical expertise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learning how to improve your social media profiles and posts for the best results may seem scary, but we’ve put up a list of simple <strong>SMO techniques</strong> that don’t require difficult keyword research or technical know-how. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Exactly Is Social Media Optimization?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social Media Optimization is improving social media posts (or complete social media strategy) to produce better outcomes, such as faster follower development, greater engagement, a more significant number of clicks or conversions, etc. To maximize social media for business, various techniques and tactics with varied complexity and scope can be used, including simple changes to each post and High-level adjustments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In any case, the basis for social media optimization should be performance analysis, audience and competitor research, and social listening insights. You can consider an SMO Agency as an opportunity to assess and enhance your web presence for even better performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits Associated With Social Media Optimization</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The following are possible outcomes of employing good social media optimisation tactics for your social media campaigns:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Gain more followers faster.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improve your comprehension of your audience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increase brand awareness using social media.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Amplify social media presence.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The quality of the leads you receive from social media should be improved.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Utilize social media to boost the sales of your products and services.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increase the engagement rate.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Find the Best SMO Company?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wondering <strong>how to do SMO</strong> effectively? Start your search by exploring agencies with strong expertise and client satisfaction. Here are some key factors that set top SMO companies apart.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Industry expertise:</strong> Look for an SMO company with extensive knowledge in your sector. They will gain a deeper understanding of your target market and industry-specific trends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Proven Track Record:</strong> Examine the company\'s portfolio and client testimonials to determine its previous successes and the outcomes it has achieved for other clients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Multiple Services: </strong>Confirm that the SMO company offers a wide range of services, including content creation, community management, social media strategy development, and analytics tracking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Customized Approach:</strong> Choose an SMO firm to create a tailored strategy based on your target market, business objectives, and market research.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Transparency and Communication:</strong> Choose a company that prioritizes open communication and provides frequent updates on the status of your social media projects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use of Analytics:</strong> Look for a social media marketing company that uses data analytics to track the success of your social media initiatives and make educated decisions regarding future development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Value and Affordability:</strong> Evaluate SMO firms\' total value proposition, including the quality of their services, amount of experience, and chance of long-term success.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Techniques To Improve Social Media Optimization</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inexperienced observers might think that a company\'s social media presence is simple. Still, much effort goes into behind-the-scenes work to ensure social media accounts are used as efficiently as possible. Let\'s focus on some <strong>SMO techniques</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In your online presence efficiency approach, you should focus on the following 5 areas:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Engagement&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increased Followership</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conversions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accessibility&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>General Efficiency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Post At The Proper Times</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To flourish on social media, you must consistently provide high-quality content that your audience finds enjoyable. But did you know that you also need to release it at the time when your audience is most likely to respond to it? That is indeed true. At particular times of the day and week, your audience is more likely to be online and more inclined to like or comment on your social media postings. Selecting those beautiful moments to share on social media takes work, significantly when industry-specific audience preferences vary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Incorporate Questions Into Your Posts</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most straightforward engagement technique is to ask those you follow questions and request that they reply in comments. The secret is only to ask questions your audience would be interested in answering. Use a question sticker, take a quick poll, or add stimulating caption text to your Instagram story.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Turn Your Post Into A Carousel</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The carousel is one of the most intriguing post formats businesses may use on the site. According to data, their Instagram carousel posts typically get 1.4x more reach and 3.1x greater involvement than regular posts. Other social networking networks that support carousels, such as LinkedIn, Facebook, and Twitter, also provide equivalent results. When the cover slide is strong, resisting the urge to swipe left is challenging.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Type In The Right Amount</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Increased content consumption will inevitably result in lower engagement rates. Conversely, finding your appropriate social media posting schedule is essential for boosting engagement and brand dialogues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most prominent social media networks should be updated at these intervals, according to experts:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Between once and twice a day, post on Facebook.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tweet 1 to 5 times daily on Twitter.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>One to five posts should be made on LinkedIn every day.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember that finding the ideal posting place could take some time. Try out various cadences to determine which one best suits you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Improve The SEO Of Your Biography</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When someone visits your social network profile page, one of the first things they see is your bio. Therefore, it is necessary to use the best possible version of anything. In your social media profiles, you should always provide the following information:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Identify yourself</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What are you paid to do?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How do you behave?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The subjects you find interesting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The spokesperson for your business&nbsp;</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How to get in touch with someone?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Ensure That Your Captions Include Relevant Keywords</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Several social media platforms, including Instagram, now specifically advise using relevant keywords in post captions to boost discoverability. According to this, the more you post, the more likely it is that it will turn up in social search results. This enhances the possibility that people may discover your material without actively looking for your account name, which is good news for less well-known businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Optimize Your Connections By Using UTMs</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It would help if you used this action to enhance traffic to your online presence, content, or landing pages. Link optimization is essential since it lets you comprehend how your audience engages with your links. By monitoring your customer’s activity, you may find out which postings drive the most traffic to your website and which don’t. You can quickly and effectively track behavior by incorporating UTMs into your social media channels and postings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Check To See That Your Photos Are The Right Size</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nothing is more irritating than checking a social media profile and discovering terrible images. At best, your brand will come across as amateurish; at worst, it gives a phony and faulty appearance. As the <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">best SMO company in USA</a></strong>, we recommend using a high-resolution photograph that is relevant to your brand, not overly cropped, and clearly reflects your business as your profile picture. Doing this will help your audience recognize your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you looking for the <strong>best SMO company</strong> that can assist you in improving all elements of your performance, including engagement, the growth of your followers, revenue, accessibility, and availability? Our experience may be the most helpful source of support for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions(FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. What is the advantage of SMO?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1. </strong>The practice of boosting the exposure, engagement, and traffic of a website or brand via the use of social media platforms and methods is referred to as social media optimization or Social Media Optimization (SMO). Enhancing brand recognition, generating leads, and increasing sales are some of the goals that may be accomplished with the assistance of social media optimization (SMO).&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. What is SMO in a company?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>SMO uses social media to manage and improve an organization\'s messaging and online presence. Social media optimization may promote new goods and services, engage with customers, and offset negative news as a digital marketing technique.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. How is SEO different from SMO?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3.</strong> SMO is primarily concerned with driving traffic through social media platforms, in contrast to search engine optimization (SEO), which primarily focuses on boosting the ranking of your website and the capacity to draw visitors through search engines such as Google.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/What-Sets-the-Best-SMO-Companies-Apart-from-the-Rest.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-22 12:30:51','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(152,'Data Management: A Catalyst for Business Enhancement','data-management-a-catalyst-for-business-enhancement','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data management services</strong> are all you need if your business requires efficient handling of large volumes of data and ensuring its security and integrity. These services have become important because data is vital to making the right decisions, personalized customer experiences, and overall operational efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When we say data is a catalyst for business, we mean it acts as the fundamental element for organizations to succeed. How does it work? Imagine a retail company that collects vast amounts of customer transaction data. Data management done well entails classifying this data, putting procedures in place to safeguard private client information, and safely storing it in databases. Companies may use this data to examine buying trends and modify marketing plans accordingly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The more we understand this vital role inside businesses, the more there is to discover about data management.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Importance of Data Management for Business Growth </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data is increasingly viewed as a corporate asset that can be utilized to make more informed business choices, enhance marketing efforts, optimize business processes, and save expenses to boost revenue and profits. Inadequate data management can result in incompatible silos, inconsistent data sets, and poor data quality, hindering BI and analytics applications and perhaps leading to inaccurate results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data management has also become more relevant as firms face a growing number of regulatory compliance obligations, including data privacy and protection regulations like GDPR and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA). Companies are using big data platforms to capture increasingly enormous volumes and diverse data types. Without proper data management, these settings may become bulky and difficult to navigate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Overcoming Data Management Challenges</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the growing amount and speed of data and changing data privacy and safety rules, it takes a lot of work to maintain well-structured data management. These are some of the most common problems when managing data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Collecting and Safeguarding a Growing Amount of Data: </strong>As your business grows, the sheer amount of data it generates makes it harder to keep data quality high, keep an eye on the whole data lifecycle, and find value in data. You also need to know how to handle data to get valuable information; collecting and organizing it doesn\'t help. You can solve this problem using cloud-based scalable data storing options that can grow with your data needs. Additionally, to keep private data safe it’s essential to use data security tools like encryption, access limits, and regular security checks.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adding more Data Silos: </strong>A company may have many organized, semi-structured, and unstructured data in different areas or systems. If the data architecture isn\'t well thought out, this can create data silos that are hard to connect. That leads to duplicate data, making it harder to control and ensure data quality. Setting up a central data store, like a data warehouse, makes it easier for people from different departments to share and analyze data. Using data merging tools and best practices for data management can also help get rid of new silos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Needs for Compliance: </strong>Sticking to a standard data management strategy is hard when governmental compliance requirements constantly change. It even requires steady attention to avoid terrible judicial consequences. So, your company can either set up a compliance team or work with experts to monitor changes to the rules and make the necessary adjustments to meet the newest standards.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Management: Best Practices</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To overcome data management obstacles and guarantee the availability of trustworthy data, the following are essential data management best practices:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Get Clear about Your Objectives.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your firm\'s objectives can define data collection, storage, organization, cleaning, and analysis procedures. Well-defined corporate objectives also facilitate managing only the data necessary for decision-making.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Maintain Data Quality.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data quality is essential to ensure that your data management system gives your company accurate data. Try to make it easier to gather and store data while also ensuring that it is regularly checked for accuracy to ensure you have the correct data. Since data is constantly changing, like information about users and sellers, you should keep your system updated to ensure that data is always correct.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Implement Role-Based Access Controls.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to ensuring the quality of the data, role-based access control is a must for security and lowering the risk of data leaks. It is suggested that role-based access control (RBAC) be set up at a very detailed level to protect private information and essential programs. This keeps private data safe, supports data privacy, and makes sure that rules are followed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prioritize Data Security.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data security is of the utmost importance to prevent unwanted access and guarantee compliance. Encryption, identity, and access management (IAM) access restrictions and routine audits are all ways to keep your data safe and help you stay out of legal hot water. At a time when cyber threats and data breaches are on the rise, protecting your organization\'s critical information from possible breaches requires more stringent data control measures, which is where app data security comes in.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Revealing Our Unique Benefits </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With well-structured data management, you can satisfy regulatory standards, make well-informed decisions, and analyze your data for essential insights. Here’s how you can benefit from Tech2Globe’s <strong>data management services.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Security</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our team employs security measures to protect critical information from unauthorized access and cyber threats. By giving you more control over your data, we help you safeguard and avoid data breaches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Reliability</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data management helps avoid possible mistakes by developing use regulations and practices. Accuracy helps develop trust in the data needed to make enterprise-wide choices. With dependable and up-to-date data, you can respond more quickly to market developments and make better decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improves Decision-Making</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can help you minimize data silos and dependencies by integrating and combining data from several platforms. Thus, it allows for the organization, analysis, and maintenance of high-quality data to get significant insights. Our <strong>data management services</strong> improve decision-making by offering a single source of correct, up-to-date data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Visibility</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our data management service makes it easy for everyone to discover the correct information. This increased clarity enables teams throughout your organization to get valuable insights, improve organizational performance, and increase productivity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Help Comply with Regulations</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, with our dependable data management, we implement data governance best practices, making it easier to comply with complex regulatory settings. It thereby decreases the likelihood of non-compliance, penalties, and legal issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The idea is simple: you need to know everything about your consumers and forecast their behavior in order to increase their level of pleasure. How do you do this? The availability of data at the appropriate time and form is critical. Organizations must prepare their data houses to compete, prosper, and provide an amazing customer experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe uses renowned industry innovation in professional <strong>data extraction services</strong>, methodologies, and practices to assist organizations with diverse data management, extraction, and analytics requirements. Our data input, translation, and processing services are backed by years of expertise. Discover what our expert team and comprehensive service model have to offer and begin transforming your data objectives into tangible customer experience outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Data-Management-A-Catalyst-for-Business-Enhancement.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-20 12:24:46','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(153,'Amazon Marketing : What You Need to Know 2024','amazon-marketing-services-what-you-need-to-know-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> In this post, we will cover the advantages of using Amazon\'s Pay-Per-Click (PPC) advertising, emphasizing on the cost-effectiveness and high conversion rates of this service. In addition to selecting the appropriate AMS agency, you should educate yourself on the various forms of advertisements, product exposure, and customer support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has over 300 million active consumers globally, with 75% of shoppers using it to explore new items and brands.&nbsp; Have you ever given this number a moment of thought? They are all united by a single characteristic: a strong desire to make a purchase.&nbsp; With excellent conversion rates and cheap cost-per-clicks, a brilliant <strong>Amazon PPC strategy</strong> turns Amazon into an opportunity for marketers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, a significant number of Amazon sellers are not completely aware of the advertising opportunities available to them. The opportunities that can offer them substantial advantages, enhancing their visibility and sales on the platform. This article will provide you with all the information you want regarding<strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-ppc-services\"> Amazon PPC Services</a></strong>.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The need for Amazon Marketing Services </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has been adding marketing alternatives since its first advertising launch: Sponsored Products, Sponsored Brands (previously Headline search advertising), and Sponsored Display advertisements. Recently, ad varieties and targeting choices have increased. Campaigns include several beta possibilities. Growing on Amazon requires knowing all your alternatives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Global marketplaces like Amazon are competitive. Most advertising systems let you buy impressions and clicks. Amazon approaches it differently. You decide how much to pay when shoppers click advertisements, enabling you to customize your ad budget. Second is Amazon streamlined advertising reporting. While it may not be the ideal way to understand consumers\' search behaviors, it is crucial to understand what works and what doesn\'t.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Types of Advertising Options</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Sponsored Products</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sponsored Products allow vendors to promote specific products by highlighting them in search results and product detail pages. Your products will be seen by individuals actively searching for things linked to them since relevant terms trigger these ads.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Sponsored Brands</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A crucial component of <strong>Amazon PPC strategy</strong> is Sponsored Brands, which allows merchants to showcase products under a personalized brand logo. Advertisements like this are displayed at the top of search results, increasing the number of people who see your brand and directing them to a particular landing page or product page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Sponsored Display</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Regarding advertising, Sponsored Display is not exclusive to Amazon; it may also be displayed on other websites and mobile applications. By targeting consumers who are looking for things similar to what you sell, you will be able to reach more people and attract more customers back to your Amazon store.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How AMS Helps Improve Product Visibility</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>AMS increases product visibility by strategic placement in search results and relevant product pages. Because of this increased visibility, click-through rates, conversions, and overall revenues all rise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Keywords in AMS Campaigns:</strong> Keywords serve as the cornerstone for successful AMS campaigns. To reach the target audience, it is essential to do research and select appropriate keywords. Thanks to the clever use of keywords, you can be sure that your ads will appear when people search for products like yours,&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Effective Ad Campaigns: </strong>Before beginning any campaign, conduct extensive research to select high-impact keywords that align with your products and services. Tools such as Amazon\'s Keyword Tool may make finding appropriate search phrases easier.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the targeting tools provided by AMS to narrow down your audience. If you want to be sure that the most relevant customers see your advertisements, you may target them based on keywords, product categories, or even particular ASINs (Amazon Standard Identification Numbers).&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Enhancing Customer Service on Amazon</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Amazon prioritizes superior customer service. </strong>Several factors lead to outstanding customer experiences and long-term sustainability, including providing rapid responses to customer queries and concerns, addressing complaints, and ensuring that orders are fulfilled on time.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Fulfillment by Amazon: </strong>FBA is a service that helps businesses expedite the process of fulfilling customers\' orders. You have the option of storing your products in Amazon\'s warehouses and making use of the resources that Amazon offers for shipping and customer service in order to increase the efficiency of the order processing process.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Product Reviews and Ratings: </strong>Positive reviews and ratings of a product contribute to the product\'s legitimacy and affect consumers\' decisions to buy. Suppose you want to demonstrate that you are committed to ensuring your customers\' satisfaction. In that case, you can do so by encouraging satisfied customers to leave reviews and promptly reacting to any negative feedback they may offer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Selecting the Right AMS Agency</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Assessing the Expertise and Experience&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before selecting an AMS agency, conduct a thorough evaluation of the agency\'s experience handling Amazon campaigns. Look for agencies with a demonstrated history of successful campaigns and a comprehensive grasp of the AMS\'s components and upgrades.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Personalization of Advertising Campaigns</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An integrated marketing services firm should be able to personalize campaigns to your precise company goals and audience. If you customize your marketing initiatives, they will more likely resonate with your customers and match your brand identity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Considerations Regarding the Budget</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a conversation with potential agencies about their budget expectations. When you hire a trustworthy firm, they will operate within your budget\'s restrictions while increasing your campaigns\' effectiveness. Unambiguous communication on the distribution of funds is essential to the success of a partnership.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon advertising still transforms brands, which is one reason small firms expand easily. Although specific classic PPC campaign guidelines still apply, there is much room for experimentation and learning. Staying ahead in<strong> Amazon PPC</strong> and SEO has always been our goal. You may contact our experts to gain assistance in expanding your Amazon company if you are interested in more refined techniques.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions(FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. What are the marketing services offered by Amazon?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.1. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-marketing-services\">Amazon Marketing Services</a>/AMS offers several adverts to reach and engage your target audience. Amazon Sponsored Products, display advertisements, and brand ads are available depending on your goals, budget, and campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. How does Amazon do its marketing?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.2. Amazon markets its items using the high-runner method. This technique analyzes data to determine which items are in great demand in each category. Amazon\'s pricing algorithm then prices such items competitively and places high bids on adverts to attract customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. What are Amazon marketing tools?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A.3. Amazon marketing tools are software-as-a-service (SaaS) solutions provided by third parties that improve the capacity of Amazon sellers to operate pay-per-click and social media campaigns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Amazon-Marketing-Services-What-You-Need-to-Know-2024.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-19 12:24:54','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(154,'Decoding Website\'s insights with data extraction solution','decoding-websites-insights-with-data-extraction-solution','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Trust us; so many invaluable insights are waiting to be uncovered through <strong>data extraction</strong>. Yet, buried within the labyrinth of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript lies a wealth of information crucial for understanding customer behavior, market trends, and competitor strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine a retail giant monitoring user engagement on its e-commerce platform. Every click, hover, and scroll reveals consumer preferences, improves user experience, and boosts conversion rates. However, without a sophisticated data scraping solution, all the information remains trapped in the digital ether. This is where the art of decoding website insights with <strong>data extraction </strong>becomes pivotal. By employing advanced algorithms and automation techniques, businesses can efficiently extract and analyze data streams from websites.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s learn more <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\">data extraction services </a></strong>and how our experts can help your business to leverage its potential benefits. Whether it\'s tracking social media sentiment, monitoring competitor pricing strategies, or understanding customer demographics, we will help you decode website insights and empower businesses to make right decisions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Evolution of Data Extraction </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data extraction has evolved significantly over the years. Initially, it was about pulling data to help with decisions and efficiency. But now, it does a lot more. It helps with research, making sure companies follow rules, and even improving how they work with customers. It\'s become a one-stop shop for getting data from any document. With advanced technology, like generative AI, it\'s easier to use and more accurate than ever. And it keeps getting better over time. Plus, it\'s not just about the tech—it\'s also about providing great customer service. So, companies can focus on what they do best while Evolution AI takes care of the data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Examples of Data Extraction </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are several examples of web scraping, but here are a few of the most popular.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Web scraping</strong> is the extraction of data from numerous websites. It allows you to acquire product information, prices, and so on. Data-driven organizations may utilize this technique to learn about their competitors\' marketing, pricing, and product development strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Data Warehousing</strong> is a database that allows you to store data from several sources. Data warehouses are essential to commercial data storage because they allow businesses to consolidate data from several sources into a single location. As a result, data accessibility and sharing become more convenient.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Data mining</strong> is a method that enables organizations to extract all necessary information and features from enormous datasets. Data mining helps firms better understand their target audience by evaluating and analyzing their data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Does the Process of Extracting Data Work? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Find the right sources of data.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The initial step is to identify the most appropriate data sources (authoritative, internal, or external). Before you gather relevant data, you must identify the sources from which it may be obtained. The next stage is to categorize them to be easily organized, documented and used efficiently.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Check the quality of the data.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After finding the data sources, you must assess their quality to determine their usefulness. The data quality is critical since you can only perform a little with low-quality information other than exploratory analysis. You may use basic and advanced procedures to analyze the overall quality of the data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must obtain a sample from the source to conduct the analysis and determine the data quality. To collect data in essential circumstances, copy and paste the information. You may also collect samples using a data source\'s export capabilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Check how reliable the data is.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When determining the dependability of data, there are two primary considerations: the reliability of the extraction process and the reliability of the actual data. Businesses that obtain and extract data from credible sources might see a significant return on their investment. Companies that do not collect trustworthy data, on the other hand, will not get the same returns on their investment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Start with an automated extraction process.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When not using a data extraction service, it is critical to understand the necessary procedures, people, and technology for successful outcomes. Find out the procedure from beginning to conclusion. It will help you to simplify the entire process of extracting data. Identify the areas that can be automated and the tools needed to oversee the entire process. You must select communication channels, tools, and data destinations. Once completed, you should begin creating data transformation stages and determining which can be accomplished using ETL tools.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Create a QA process.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When extracting data, make sure the steps you take are free of mistakes. Because of this, a quality assurance (QA) method needs to be implemented. If you don\'t have this or the time to do it yourself, you might want to hire a professional data extraction service.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use the Data.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When everything is done, you\'ll have flawless data ready to utilize. You can gather and analyze it for any reason. This entire process may be difficult and demanding for certain businesses. As a consequence, it is critical to get assistance from a data scraping service that can walk you through the whole process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How Can Our Data Extraction Service Benefit Your Business?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improve Your Customer Support Services</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are committed to enhancing our customers\' experiences through effective support solutions, and extracting data is a vital tool in achieving this goal. Our customer service team uses this process to address customer issues and offer good answers quickly. Collecting and analyzing data teaches us about problems and trends that could negatively affect our customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Helps in Making Well-Informed Decisions</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By collecting and analyzing important data, we learn a lot about our target group\'s likes, dislikes, behaviors, and trends. Now that we know this, we can develop marketing plans that will appeal to possible buyers. Data gathering also helps us make choices about new products and prices so we can keep up with customers\' changing needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Enhances the Overall Productivity</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We extract relevant data from different sources without going through a lot of hassle. We collect the data,i.e., important data, and export it into a database or spreadsheet. The automated process allows your team to focus on other core aspects, leading to higher productivity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Provides Easy Accessibility to Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can effortlessly retrieve information stored in various formats, minimizing the risk of human error inherent in manual processes. We preserve data\'s integrity and dependability by lowering the chance of mistakes.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we consider <strong>data extraction</strong> a key player in our<strong> data management services</strong>. We\'ve helped various clients gain access to reliable data on their use cases, allowing them to translate it into relevant insights effortlessly. Furthermore, our data extraction outsourcing solutions save you time and money while ensuring the extracted data is accurate and appropriate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Decoding-Websites-insights-with-data-extraction-solution.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-17 14:09:46','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(155,'Elevate Your Data Analysis with the Top 8 Data Extraction Tools in 2024','elevate-your-data-analysis-with-the-top-8-data-extraction-tools-in-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data extraction </strong>tools have indeed become indispensable for businesses across various industries. Businesses are flooded with lots of information from places like websites, social media, and customer records. Getting the right data quickly and accurately is super important for understanding things better and making smart choices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data extraction </strong>becomes easy with the help of data extraction tools. They play the role of simplifying the process. For instance, you have an extensive list of customer reviews on your website and want to know what people say about your product. Instead of reading through each review one by one, a data extraction tool can automatically gather all the comments about a specific feature, like \"customer service,\" saving you a ton of time and effort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Performing data extraction in-house can present numerous challenges for businesses. It requires time, effort, and skilled manpower, which may strain internal capabilities. Here\'s when you can outsource <strong>web data extraction services</strong> to Tech2Globe, as we make things easier for you. Our experienced team utilizes the best automated tools and custom-built scripts to extract data from diverse sources efficiently and accurately.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With so many tools available on the market, we\'ve picked out some of the best ones to help you choose.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Best Data Extraction Tools</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Import.io</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Import.io provides information that may be utilized for machine learning, app development, market research, lead generation, pricing monitoring, and academic studies. It initially extracts data automatically using highly complex machine-learning methods. With the tool\'s URL generator, you may quickly create hundreds of URLs by looking for common patterns.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. OutWit Hub</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most widely used programs for web scraping and data extraction is OutWit Hub. It searches the Internet for information while concealing and organizing essential data from many online sources. The software dissects these web pages into manageable chunks before reviewing each separately. In addition, it can extract email addresses, tables, photos, URLs, and a host of other data.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Octoparse</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Octoparse, data extraction is as simple as pointing, clicking, and ad extracting—all without coding. To gather data, you first input the URL of the website you like to scrape and extract data from, click on the target data, and then run the extraction function!&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can easily scrape any webpage by using it. In addition to being very user-friendly, Octoparse has a lot of sophisticated capabilities, such as a scrape scheduler and a cloud platform available around the clock.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Web Scraper</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everyone may use this free and simple online data extraction tool. After setting up a scraper, extracting millions of records from a website takes a few minutes using a straightforward point-and-click interface. Web scrapers use a modular framework composed of selectors that tell the scraper where to go on the target site and what information to pull out. This format makes extracting data from well-known and less-known websites like eBay, Amazon, and TripAdvisor simple.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. ParseHub</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many people use ParseHub to scrape and pull data from websites. It only takes a few clicks to get the data you need. It can scrap complex websites using Ajax and JavaScript, as well as ones that need logins or endless scrolling to access content. For instance, you open a website and choose the data you want to get from it. The ML relationship engine at ParseHub can quickly retrieve the required data by scanning a page or website and determining the hierarchy of objects.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Diffbot</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Diffbot is an extraction tool made for big businesses that need to do specific things like screen scraping and data crawling. Diffbot\'s set of features can turn online data that isn\'t organized into organized, context-based databases. Blogs, news sites, shop pages, and boards can all be scraped with it. Clients say that Diffbot\'s advanced technology tools and APIs are great and that the program is great at gathering data from social media.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Scraper API</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ScraperAPI handles proxy rotation, browsers, and CAPTCHAs, allowing developers to scrape any page using a single API request. Because it is AI-driven and has many innovative features built-in, it can get public info from any web page in real-time and on a large scale. You don\'t have to build and manage your system for scraping.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. DocParser</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Docparser is a program that automates document processing and workflows. More specifically, Docparser facilitates the automated extraction of data from PDF documents and their subsequent placement in the appropriate location.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you frequently receive PDF files and realize that manually entering data costs you essential time? Okay, give up on it! Instead, utilize Docparser so that you may concentrate on more critical tasks. After Docparser has finished parsing your data, you may download it immediately in your chosen Excel, CSV, JSON, or XML file format.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Data Extraction Solutions</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some of the best services that our web data extraction business provides to clients all over the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Document Scanning</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With our quick document scanning services, you can convert your paper files into digital files. We guarantee high-quality digitization by using cutting-edge OCR technology and skilled techs. This will make your data more accessible and easy to reach and store more efficiently.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Capture</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our data capture services can help your business because they use the latest technology to collect data from various sources and forms. Our qualified professionals ensure that the data they collect is correct and safe, improving the efficiency of your operations and how you handle your data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prospect Data Extraction</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our potential data mining services can help you make more sales faster. We collect and analyze data from different sources to find possible leads. This lets you focus your sales efforts on high-potential buyers and raises the conversion rate.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, you know the best data extraction tools in the market. These tools can make the extraction process more accessible. However, Data extraction is an integral part of any business, and picking the right tool is a big part of that.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we have been striving to help clients around the world get their data quickly and easily for over 14 years with our web data extraction services. We know how necessary data extraction is for businesses and promise that the data we extract will be as accurate as possible at meager costs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Elevate-Your-Data-Analysis-with-the-Top-8-Data-Extraction-Tools-in-2024.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-14 11:49:36','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(156,'Choosing Wisely: 9 Ways to Pick the Best Data Management Service Providers','choosing-wisely-9-ways-to-pick-the-best-data-management-service-providers','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data management services are crucial for businesses, but the provider\'s expertise becomes even more critical when you need customized solutions that fit your needs perfectly. Businesses entrusted with sensitive data and information storage functions are increasingly turning to external experts for management solutions. This isn\'t just about cost reduction. Outsourcing unlocks efficient management and processing of high volumes of data, a task that can drain internal resources and slow down operations when done in-house.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">data management services</a> are more than just storage and processing.  The true value lies in the provider\'s expertise. When your needs are complex and require customized solutions, the right partner can offer more than just services; they can provide insights to optimize your data for maximum efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A successful outsourced data service requires careful selection of your outsourcing partner. When choosing an offshore <strong>data management company</strong> for your data service requirements, keep in mind the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Company with a Proven Track Record</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As data volume rises, data retrieval and storage become more challenging. Similarly, as your company expands, you will need a professional database management firm to create, maintain, and ensure it is continually fully operating. After all, you can only handle so much on your own. Look for a reputable business that regularly produces greatness. Make an informed choice by reviewing their website\'s services and client reviews.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verify functionality before outsourcing.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some database administration tasks include analysis, segmentation, automation, forecasting, results visualization, and ROI management. Before outsourcing database administration, confirm that the vendor can handle each of these features. Depending on the size of your organization, your firm may require all of these or even more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Check the Support Service.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For what duration do you want the assistance of experts in database administration each day? Examine their customer service and the length of time they stick by you. Additionally, ask them how they deliver their service—do they do it by phone or email? It is possible to make appropriate plans if you are aware of the firm beforehand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ensure Firm Security.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data security is the first consideration when selecting a database management (DBM) services provider. Every information you own, including personal and corporate data, should be kept secure and easily accessible. The organization you select to outsource your DBM must provide the highest security and defense against theft or hacking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Does the Business Offer Services for Data Extraction?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is yet another crucial point to remember. When dealing with a large amount of corporate data, extracting information from several sources can be a challenging task. For this reason, you will want the assistance of data specialists. Ask the business considering outsourcing your DBM if their data extraction service is included in the deal. If not, how much will it cost you?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Can the Firm Integrate your Databases with Other Systems?\"</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You have more control over the workflow and procedures by integrating your databases with email marketing, CRM, and other platforms and systems. Consequently, finding a supplier who can link your business systems is essential. But effective integration needs expertise, understanding, and a rare combination of honed abilities. Set aside some time to look into the top supplier of database management services.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ensure Scalability.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The database supplier should guarantee the system\'s scalability. Can he adjust to your expanding data and service requirements? Can the system handle large amounts of data without crashing? Before choosing a supplier, you need the answers to all these questions. Scalability is ensured by the top DBM service provider so that it can integrate smoothly with your expanding company.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cost Consideration</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find out if the price plan fits your budget and if data processing, storage, or transfers will cost extra. Find out whether your growing data quantities and processing needs may have any financial repercussions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Availability of Data Cleansing Services</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When choosing a data management provider, check if they also offer data cleansing services. Ensure the company provides data-cleaning services to increase the chances of the data being correct. The excellent data cleansing solutions in the business eliminate errors, inconsistencies, and duplications, thus guaranteeing that your data will be correct and readily available for decision-making.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why We\'re Your Data Management Partner of Choice. </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Information becomes power only if it is structured, safe, and user-friendly. That\'s where Tech2globe steps in.&nbsp; We are more than just a data management service provider; we are a trusted partner committed to opening up the hidden power in your information and helping you grow as a wise decision-maker. With a team of professionals, advanced tools and services, and a constant passion for innovation, the obstacles in your data will be changed into opportunities for growth.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Access to Expertise: </strong>At our <strong>data management company</strong>, we specialize in services that help organizations like yours thrive. We understand how essential it is to have industry know-how and skills to ensure your data is handled and optimized effectively. We want to help you make the right decisions by empowering your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Focus on Core Competencies: </strong>Outsourcing data management to our company comes with the benefits of focusing on the problems you wish to solve. We will take care of your data management needs with our complete <strong>data management services</strong>. This way, you can take back the time you waste on non-primary functions, making your business more efficient and productive.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Upfront Innovation: </strong>Partnering with us implies the possibility of using immediate technical solutions and learning about new technologies and software methods. R&amp;D is our priority, as we strive to stay ahead of the curve and ensure that your organization benefits from the latest advancements in the field.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While there are various options for selecting a supplier, these are some of the most crucial.&nbsp; Engaging those nine key factors will help you choose a data management service provider who will work closely with you to attain your objectives. Consider a supplier that has maintained its reputation as a top performer for a long time, employs advanced security technologies, and strives for constant development.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are an excellent option if you are seeking a top supplier to <strong>outsource data management services</strong>. Tech2globe provides competent data management services at competitive pricing. We specialize in offering e-commerce data management solutions and provide data conversion, processing, entry, and document management services that will exceed your expectations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Choosing-Wisely-9-Ways-to-Pick-the-Best-Data-Management-Service-Providers.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-13 11:02:31','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(157,'Improving E-commerce Performance through Outsourced Data Entry Strategies','improving-e-commerce-performance-through-outsourced-data-entry-strategies','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The way we shop is changing fast, with more businesses moving online. It\'s a big opportunity for entrepreneurs everywhere. Did you know that already a quarter of retail purchases happen online? And experts predict the online market will hit $8.1 trillion by 2026!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you take your business online, you have more significant profit potential since customers appreciate the ease of buying from home. However, managing an online store is not walking in the park. You must maintain inventory, update your product listings, and do much more.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That\'s where outsourcing <strong>data entry services</strong> prove to be beneficial. By getting experts to handle these tasks, you can focus on growing your business as they help you avoid mistakes, boosting your chances of success in the competitive world of e-commerce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>E-commerce Data Entry and Types of Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The foundation of any successful online store is e-commerce data entry. It entails entering and maintaining data regarding several Internet business-related topics. The many kinds of data vital to the industry are listed below.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Product Data Entry</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your online shop can boost conversion rates by providing customers with accurate information about its offers, such as titles, descriptions, specifications, size, color, prices, inventory levels, images, and SEO keywords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data entry is more than just entering the information on a list. It also involves controlling, editing, adding to, and removing product information.&nbsp; Customers with access to accurate data are more likely to make intelligent buying decisions. Additionally, it helps your items rank higher in search engine results pages (SERPs), which makes your shop more visible and attracts more customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Customer Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customer data entry includes information like contact information, interests, past purchases, and records of communications. But this job is more than just getting this information at the beginning of the exchange and writing it down. Also, your company needs to change records based on what happened and divide people into groups based on their likes and dislikes, gender, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have access to this kind of information, you can improve customer service for your e-commerce business. It keeps things running smoothly and prevents buyers from repeating themselves at all levels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website Content</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managing website menus, writing blog entries, and guaranteeing correct information on every online page depend heavily on data entry. This is entering data—text, graphics, and others—into a website code or content management system. While data entry professionals ensure this information is entered accurately to boost visibility and organic traffic, precise and optimized content helps rank better in search engines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Order Data</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data entry is critical to efficient and accurate order processing. However, it can be time-consuming and repetitive. Hence, many online retailers outsource <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">ecommerce product data entry services</a>. Online businesses of all sizes encounter fluctuating order volumes, which can be overwhelming for data encoders. They meticulously input the information, such as shipping data, order details, Payment information, and other particulars, such as tracking numbers and status updates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Order data entry processes also involve confirming product availability, applying for discounts and promotions, and sending order confirmations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Challenges of Performing Data Entry Internally</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As your e-commerce firm expands, so does the amount of data. This situation may hamper your capacity to scale and become profitable for several reasons, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time restrictions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limitations of resources</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>limits on staffing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limitations of training</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your internal staff is given extra work, they may be unable to keep up with demand. One way to lessen the emphasis on your store\'s essential elements would be to hire employees from other divisions. Due to high job loads, extended operating hours may also be necessary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These circumstances might result in employee burnout, decreased accuracy and productivity. Uneven and slow data entry means more complaints, refunds, returns, and lost business.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Data Entry Strategies We Employ To Improve Your Ecommerce Business</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover the data entry strategies we employ at Tech2Globe to enhance your e-commerce business, ensuring efficiency and success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Effective Price Comparison</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customers compare prices of the same product across platforms before deciding which one to buy because they want to get the best deal possible. If the pricing in your store isn\'t up-to-date and accurate, you can lose out on a potential selling opportunity. After comparing them across several retailers, we update the prices at the appropriate moment.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To address the rising environmental concerns, we promote sustainability through product listings that include eco-friendly qualities and certifications.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Superior Product Description Writing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our professionals recognize the importance of compelling product descriptions as the primary sales pitch for your items. Based on research, including a Google poll in which 85% of customers emphasized the significance of product information and photographs in their purchasing decisions, we prioritize creating high-quality descriptions. This attention to detail speeds up the lead conversion process, assuring maximum impact on your intended audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Accurate Product Categorization</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Grouping and placing products accurately based on their features is essential for better product finding. As a reputable ecommerce data entry company, we can help you choose the right product type. We do a lot of research on every item that is put into the store by using AI and automation to speed up and improve the accuracy of their work.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cross-platform Product Management</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By starting with a single standalone store, ecommerce companies are becoming increasingly common in various online marketplaces and platforms, such as Amazon, Target, Walmart, and eBay. Furthermore, with 37.8% of all e-commerce sales, Amazon has the largest market share of any company in the e-commerce industry. Which is why we perform all the required actions to effectively integrate product data across several channels to maximize this opportunity and increase sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mobile Optimization</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mobile devices\' online shipping cart abandonment rate is around 84%. Even though it is an incredible opportunity for customers, this flexibility can damage your e-commerce business, mainly if your website is not mobile-friendly. Thus, we prioritize making product listings mobile-friendly and visually appealing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your e-commerce company requires sufficient high-quality information, such as eye-catching photos, informative product descriptions, intriguing features, and thorough specs, to influence customers and support their choice to buy. Furthermore, maintaining precise and well-organized <strong>data entry services</strong> may improve the purchasing experience and build brand credibility.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It takes a lot of time and work to maintain the functioning of an online business. At Tech2Globe, we offer <strong>e-commerce product data entry services</strong> that are both versatile and cost-effective for managing and maintaining an online business. With our services, ecommerce enterprises benefit from double profits since they receive high-quality output on time and within budget. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Improving-E-commerce-Performance-through-Outsourced-Data-Entry-Strategies-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-12 11:16:37','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(158,'Efficient Product Data Entry Solutions for Business','efficient-product-data-entry-solutions-for-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Technology has revolutionized product data entry, offering solutions with incredible accuracy rates.&nbsp; Automated <strong>data entry services</strong>, for instance, ensure between 99.95% and 99.99% accuracy. This stands in stark contrast to the accuracy rate of human recording, which typically oscillates between 96% and 99%.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leveraging these advancements, Tech2Globe has been at the forefront of offering eCommerce <strong>product data entry services</strong> for over 14 years. Over the years, our experienced teams have helped several companies enhance the storage, enrichment, and analysis of their complicated product information. From inputting names, descriptions, and prices to handling product images, our team pays attention to detail so that everything is right and without errors. We succeed in educating visitors by providing accurate product and service information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our services include extracting, writing product descriptions, updating products, and managing categories. With strong quality control standards and a quick turnaround, you can count on your products to be listed rapidly and accurately. If you are searching for more information about <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">product data entry</a> services and how they can benefit your business, read on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Product Data Entry Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E-commerce product data entry services are different from conventional data entry projects. It takes greater attention to process every phase, such as collecting data from various sources and all the procedures necessary to import items into the store. As a result, quality control must be done before and after products are uploaded to the store to be highly mistake-free and enticing to clients.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product Data Entry Steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Collecting data from various sources like third-party vendors\' websites, digital catalogs, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Populating product data in an eCommerce platform template and uploading without errors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Accurately adding and updating products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Maintaining error-free data in the store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Regularly managing stock inventory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Arranging options and variants appropriately.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>• Managing all products across different eCommerce channels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Importance of Product Data Entry Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Enhanced Efficiency and Productivity:</strong> Repetitive data entry jobs constantly consume time and resources that could be used for more complex tasks. Delegating this element to external team expenses will allow your internal team to concentrate on core business functions such as marketing, sales and customer service. This means a better performance level, and the system runs everything smoothly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Accuracy You Can Trust:</strong> Human error is inevitable. Hence, they make mistakes, especially with that vast amount of data. Companies providing professional data entry services use automation tools and trained employees to offer similar, nearly perfect product information. This is essential in reducing mistakes, which may result in an annoyed customer base and loss of sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>SEO Optimization for Better Visibility:</strong> SEO now is the superpower that helps you rise above in online visibility. Product data entry services are important in optimizing product descriptions by providing keywords to ensure products have higher ranks in search engine results pages.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Compelling Product Descriptions that Convert:</strong> Undoubtedly, product descriptions of better quality do not consist of bare technical characteristics only. They are fascinating principal stories that tell your product\'s tale and unfold its benefits and possibilities. Data entry services can create adjectives and phrases to help you inspire your target audience and increase conversions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:</strong> An internal data entry team aims at high costs to employ and maintain. Engaging an outside service provider lets you utilize the knowledge of a group of experienced specialists without the financial burdens of building up an in-house team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Scalability for Growth:</strong> An accurate product data entry service will be an important part of scaling your business and growing your seamless product line. This way, you can stay effective enough in data recording and accuracy maintenance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of data-entry services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Catalog Data Entry</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Catalog Data Entry is a service designed for organizing products or services under specific categories or developing a catalog based on product information. Our team of expert data entry specialists ensures accurate and speedy data entry, ensuring precision and efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Job Registration &amp; Filing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Job Registration &amp; Filing, a service that encodes air and sea import and export data, is ideal for businesses primarily dealing with logistics. Recognizing the importance of data in the import and export industry, every entry will be completed as precisely as possible.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Order Tracking</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Does your company struggle to maintain current shipments and orders? You can stay on top of all incoming shipments with our order tracking<strong> online data entry</strong> service, which will give you status updates whenever needed.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Import &amp; Export Operations</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With our Import &amp; Export Operations data entry solution, logistics has never been simpler. We manage shipment document communication, warehouse inventory, and air/sea vessel registration and tracking.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Compile and Classification Services</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Preserve time by eliminating the need to arrange your arriving cargo. Compile and classification services entail listing the goods in your incoming shipments, classifying them according to the appropriate codes, and determining proper fees and taxes. Not only that, but we also classify the goods according to the relevant HS number codes for significant statistical data. Thus, our service goes much further.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Why Should You Consider Outsourcing Product Data Entry Services?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By outsourcing your store product’s <strong>online data entry</strong> to a BPO company, you expect the following benefits: improved efficiency, lower costs, and a more reliable database.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An experienced team always does quality work and handles all the data entry tasks like product listing, description creation, number coding, and proofreading. They have a knack for connecting and directing information, despite the platforms utilized. A BPO service provider well versed in product data entry also goes the extra mile to maintain quality by ensuring that the tasks are achieved and transformed to meet the highest standards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing data entry services to a BPO company allows your firm to devote resources to the key functions driving your growth and profitability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe offers a competent, experienced, and skilled team for product data entry jobs, reducing costs and allowing businesses to focus on earning profit. Our unwavering quest for perfection benefits operating procedures, as they continuously improve their company techniques.&nbsp;<br>To get more information about our <strong>data entry services,</strong> contact us today and discover how we can tailor a solution to meet your unique needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Efficient-Product-Data-Entry-Solutions-for-Business.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-11 13:00:55','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(159,'Data Extraction: Techniques and Best Practices for Data-driven Businesses','data-extraction-techniques-and-best-practices-for-data-driven-businesses','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What is the actual meaning of data? In simple terms, data is information. We collect and store the bits and pieces of facts, figures, and observations. Now, onto <strong>data extraction</strong>. It\'s the process of retrieving specific information from a dataset or database. This involves identifying and pulling out relevant data points for analysis. Because of this, data-driven businesses prioritize expansion and rely on data to support their choices. It should come as no surprise that 49.1% of companies now handle data as an asset. Statista reports that over 77% of firms use data to drive innovation, and 48.1% of organizations have established a data-driven structure.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recognizing that businesses thrive on insights drawn from vast pools of information, data extraction services have become a vital resource. Tech2Globe specializes in decoding the data maze; we are here to remove the burden of data extraction and provide precise and smooth <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\">data extraction services</a> that meet your business requirements. With professionals by your side, you don\'t have to worry, as we will handle your data extraction needs and provide insightful analysis that will advance your company.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is a Data-driven Business?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A data-driven business uses data to make the right decisions and streamline procedures for attracting and keeping clients. Through such work, an organization experiences sales spikes. Prominent examples of data-driven companies include Netflix, Uber, Coca-Cola, and Google. In addition, according to EY research, a data-driven business model underlines data as a primary factor in decision-making at a rate of 81%. However, the same study reveals a stark reality: only 31 % of existing companies have the needed facilities to conceptualize and implement this objective effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This conflict highlights the disconnect between desire and reality when properly exploiting data. Data extraction can help bridge this difference as businesses may establish the foundation for informed decision-making by quickly acquiring and analyzing data from different sources.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advantages of Data Extraction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Better Decision Making</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses may use the essential information provided by data extraction to make well-informed decisions about their operations, investments, and line of goods and services. It supports businesses in making strategic choices on advertising campaigns, creating new products, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Cost Saving</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data extraction offers significant cost-saving opportunities for businesses across various industries. By automating operations through data extraction, businesses may increase productivity, decrease human error, and save time and money.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Reduction of manual errors</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many businesses still rely on their staff to manually enter data into papers kept in their systems. Due to missing or inaccurate information, duplicate entries, and incomplete records, mistakes are the outcome. Business reports will be more accurate, and the structured data obtained will have fewer mistakes thanks to the automation of the data extraction procedure. According to Irislink, automated data extraction may avert 80% of these mistakes by supplying more precise data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Faster processes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Errors might occur, and manual <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">Product Data Entry</a> is time-consuming. By using auto-extracting data, companies might extract data more quickly and avoid wasting time reentering it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Employee motivation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Employees find manual <strong>data extraction</strong> tiring, even as the amount of unstructured data grows exponentially. This tedious procedure demotivates workers while they are at work and doesn\'t require advanced expertise. Automating data extraction would relieve workers of this tiresome chore and allow them to concentrate on their primary responsibilities. Reducing distractions raises their productivity even further.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best Practices in Data Extraction</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Employing the right techniques and practices in data extraction, data-driven businesses can get accuracy, efficiency, scalability, compliance, security, and cost-effectiveness in their data operations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Validation: </strong>Frequent data validation checks find errors and missing numbers, fix discrepancies, and correct the data. Implement a cleaning procedure to eliminate duplicates and standardize the data format.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Using Specialized Tools for Extraction: </strong>Make accurate and efficient use of AI-powered technologies to extract data from various unstructured documents. Among the main features provided by Tech2Globe are:&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pre-trained models are used to preprocess documents for common document categories.  </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Minimises mistakes and the requirement for human correction by locating and fixing problems in the extracted data.  </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Effortlessly integrates via API with several tools.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Using end-to-end encryption, SOC2 compliance, and GDPR adherence to prioritize data protection.   </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provides features for precise data extraction, such as OCR and ML techniques.  </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Adopting automation: </strong>Whenever feasible, promote the use of AI and automation in the data extraction process to minimize the possibility of human mistakes and to set off alarms in the event of security breaches or other dangers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Giving security priority: </strong>It is crucial to take care of security and compliance issues, guaranteeing that laws and data security protocols are followed. Strong encryption, access restrictions, and authentication procedures must be implemented to secure data without a reliable tool.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Constant observation and upkeep: </strong>Track and monitor the extraction activities to identify abnormalities. You should also routinely maintain the systems by upgrading extraction scripts, improving performance, and resolving issues to ensure seamless operation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data recordkeeping:</strong> Keep thorough records of all the procedures, data sources, quality controls, and transformations used in the extraction process. This will preserve uniformity and standardization and facilitate traceability and auditability.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Tech2Globe Can Help You in Data Extraction Requirements?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we excel in providing cutting-edge <strong>data extraction services</strong> with a range of key features.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Structured Data Extraction:</strong> At Tech2Globe, we specialize in extracting structured data from general document formats, including DOCX, PDF, and TXT. We ensure swift and efficient data extraction to maximize the received data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Export to Popular Applications:</strong> We enable users to seamlessly export extracted data to widely used applications like SAP, SQL Server, Oracle, or Tableau in various formats such as XML or JSON, facilitating easy access to valuable insights and saving time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Quality Improvement:</strong> Our software automatically cleans extracted data according to user-defined rules to enhance data quality. For example, we detect and erase negative quantity values from invoices, reducing human error and making the system more dependable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Advanced Processing and Enrichment:</strong> We provide increased processing capabilities for enriching extracted data using proprietary and publicly available sources, adding value and providing more profound insight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Real-Time Extraction:</strong> With our solutions, businesses can extract real-time data through automated workflows. We strive to provide you with up-to-date information to make the right decisions and respond promptly to customer needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong> Our software features an intuitive interface, making it easy for users to handle data without requiring extensive technical skills or coding knowledge. Our motto is to enhance usability and efficiency by following a user-friendly approach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your teams find obtaining a complete picture of your clients, rivals, or market trends challenging or spend time on repetitive chores like manually transferring data from different systems, you might need our expertise. Tech2Globe’s expert <strong>web data extraction services</strong> employ the best techniques and practices to automate data collection, gain a unified view of your information landscape, and empower your teams to make data-driven decisions. For more inquiries, contact us today and learn more about our services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Data-Extraction-Techniques-and-Best-Practices-for-Data-driven-Businesses.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-06-07 13:34:04','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(160,'Clutch Recognizes Tech2Globe as one of the top firms in Global Spring 2024','clutch-recognizes-tech2globe-as-one-of-the-top-firms-in-global-spring-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Summary: Discover how Tech2Globe Web Solutions stands out as a<strong> Global Springs 2024 Winner</strong>, acknowledged by Clutch, for excelling in services like digital marketing, SEO, influencer marketing, back-office outsourcing, and more. Also, learn about the significance of Clutch Awards and join us as we continue to innovate and strive for excellence alongside our valued clients. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are the Clutch Global Spring Awards?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clutch presents the Spring 2024 Awards to recognize business service providers from all around the world for their dedication to delivering exceptional outcomes. This is in comparison to other businesses operating within their service line. Companies must have obtained three or more new, verified client reviews during the last six months in order to be eligible for this award. This indicates the company\'s commitment to providing high-quality service and achieving excellence in its operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In line with these prestigious criteria, we are proud to announce that Tech2Globe Web Solutions has been recognized as one of the <strong>top firms on Clutch</strong>, a testament to the confidence and support our global clientele have in our ability to provide first-rate digital solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>About Clutch</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clutch, the world\'s premier global marketplace for B2B service providers, empowers more innovative business decisions. Every month, more than one million business leaders begin their journey at Clutch, where they read in-depth client interviews and locate trustworthy agency partners to fulfill their business requirements.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Being named as <strong>Global Springs 2024 Winner</strong> alongside other <strong>top firms on Clutch</strong>. It marks our position as a leader in our industry - it acknowledges all the hard work we have put in and proves that we are capable of delivering unparalleled digital solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Award-Winning Services: Recognized as a Global Springs 2024 Winner</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer the perfect blend of creativity and technology, from eCommerce solutions that scorch online businesses to SEO strategies that generate content; Our portfolio demonstrates versatility and expertise. Here are all our badges of honor from Clutch Global Spring 2024:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Yahoo PPC Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/insurance-claims-processing-services\">Claims Processing Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Back Office Outsourcing Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>International SEO</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/virtual-assistant-services\">Virtual Assistant Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/technical-seo\">Technical SEO</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Digital Marketing Company Financial Services</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ecommerce Marketing Agency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-package\">Influencer Campaign Reporting Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Influencer Identification &amp; Recruitment Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TikTok Influencer Marketing Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>PPC Company Financial Services</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/youtube-advertising-services\">YouTube Influencer Marketing Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Instagram Influencer Marketing Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TikTok Advertising Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\">Data Entry Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">Social Media Marketing Company</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Payment Processing Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Medical Billing Company</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clutch is a leading provider of B2B marketing research and reviews, and we have been awarded twenty badges due to our overall market presence and the feedback our customers have provided on the platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read More:  </strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/clutch-crowns-tech2globe-web-solutions-as-one-of-the-game-changing-seo-companies-in-new-york/\">Clutch Crowns Tech2Globe Web Solutions as one of the Game-Changing SEO Companies in New York</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Clients: The Foundation of Our Achievement</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client interactions and trust have become the pillars of our achievements. In terms of the combination of long-term partnerships and a partnership of values ​​and goals, the concept of engaging and inspiring digital experiences has been realized. Their criticism has been our guide, charting for our course and fueling the pursuit of excellence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Setting New Standards: Lessons from Top Firms on Clutch</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There’s no looking back as our achievements push us forward to achieve new heights and explore more and more opportunities. We are looking ahead while we enjoy this time of joy and gratitude. They say that familiarity breeds contempt, but one thing that we have never ignored is our focus on quality. Having grown up with the vision of producing digital masterpieces that will continue to diffuse boundaries and set new standards for all to follow, we are ready to proceed to the next level of our goal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We gratefully acknowledge Clutch for this well-publicized award, our clients for their confidence and trust. We further our gratitude to our crew for their never-ending commitment in this success story. Come along as we build the foundation that will reverberate through the centuries and investigate the boundless potential of digital innovation. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Clutch-Recognizes-Tech2Globe-as-one-of-the-top-firms-in-Global-Spring-2024.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-05-29 06:46:40','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(161,'The Impact of Data Conversion on Business Insights and Decision-Making','the-impact-of-data-conversion-on-business-insights-and-decision-making','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>Learn everything about data conversion and its role in helping you make the right decisions for business growth, along with tips to avoid mistakes in data transformation and more. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data conversion </strong>is a crucial step in data management. It refers to converting data into another format compatible with various systems and applications. Conversion is more than just converting numbers or characters from one format to another; it also involves transforming data into a machine-readable format that can be read by software or hardware.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may need to <strong>convert data</strong> from one format to another for several reasons, and the reasons for doing so vary based on the circumstances. Data is omnipresent in today’s digital world, but what use is it if we can’t use it to help our businesses? Data conversion can assist companies in consolidating data from several sources into a single repository.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Implementing the right reporting tools and accurately analyzing and measuring data can lead to decisions that drive your business forward, although this may seem like an incredible concept in theory. However, even if you have access to the world’s best data, making judgments based on intuition rather than tangible understanding is feasible. In most circumstances, this may be damaging to the business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While it is occasionally acceptable to trust your intuition, most company decisions should be supported by razor-sharp metrics, facts, statistics, or insights connected to your objectives, goals, or projects that may provide a strong foundation for your management reports and business operations. Tech2Globe Web Solutions is your ally in navigating the complex realm of data, ensuring that your business not only survives but thrives.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Enhancing Decision-Making</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enhancing Decision-Making using data leads to achieving business objectives. Collecting, extracting, structuring, and analyzing insights for improved data-driven decision-making in business was formerly a massive undertaking that naturally slowed down the entire data decision-making process. The current development of business intelligence tools and democratization allows individuals who are not particularly technically savvy to analyze their data and draw conclusions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, less IT help is required to provide reports, trends, and visualizations that aid data decision-making. Different companies can accelerate the process with sophisticated data transformation software to ensure data is correct and organized.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies that recognize the benefits of data transformation software, especially its ability to efficiently <strong>convert data</strong>, are freed from the limitations of technical complexity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Tips to Avoid Mistakes during Data Conversion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some tips to avoid in data transformation or conversion process:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Conversion Requirements:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The initial stage in conversion of data is to carefully establish the requirements. Later on, determine the source and destination formats, data types, and data components to be transformed. This will allow you to create a clear plan for your conversion process and avoid mistakes later on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Integrity:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can’t avoid data integrity if the discussion is regarding data conversion as data integrity is critical during the process. Validate your data to guarantee its completeness, accuracy, and consistency. Perform data cleaning to eliminate any duplicate or missing information. This will help you prevent mistakes and guarantee that your data is of the highest quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use of Data Mapping Tool:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A data mapping tool is required when translating data from one format to another. It aids in defining the relationship between the source and destination data items, data types, and data structures. This guarantees that the data is accurately transformed and prevents mistakes throughout the conversion process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Normalizing Data:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Normalization is organizing your data in a structured format to reduce redundancy and enhance data quality. Normalized data is easier to manage, search, as well as retrieve. Ensure that your data is normalized before transforming it to a new format.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Testing Conversion Process:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Testing is a critical step in any conversion process. Test your conversion process to ensure it works correctly and the data is converted accurately. Identify any errors or issues and correct them before the final conversion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Error Handling:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Error handling is essential during data transformation. A powerful error handling mechanism must be developed to detect, flag, and handle errors in turn. This will help in making the transition completed smoothly even if mistakes are made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use of Version Control:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Version control is essential when transforming data over time. It helps track changes to the data and ensures that the proper data version is utilized during the conversion process. This helps to prevent mistakes and ensures data integrity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Monitoring the Conversion Process:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Monitor the conversion process closely to confirm it is running smoothly. Identify any issues or errors and fix them as soon as possible. This helps avoid slips and ensures the conversion process is completed successfully.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Tailored Solutions for Diverse Business Needs</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Solutions that maximizes the data conversion’s potential analytics:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Standardization:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data conversion helps to normalize data by translating it from many forms into a standard one that can be evaluated more readily. This process guarantees that the analyzed data is correct and consistent. It also removes the flaws (if any) that might bias the study results. Making data follow the same criteria allows us to compare information from various sources and identify trends that might otherwise go unnoticed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Accessibility:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Conversion of data can make data more accessible by transforming it into a form easily analyzed using BI tools. When data is readily available, organizations can immediately analyze their performance, make more informed decisions, and modify fast to market changes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Improved Efficiency:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our <strong>database conversion</strong> services can improve the productivity of business intelligence tools by lowering the time and effort necessary to process data. In addition, organizations might save time and costs by transferring data from paper-based systems to digital forms. This decreases the possibility of mistakes and ensures that data is handled promptly and precisely.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Integration:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Database conversion</strong> can assist companies in consolidating data from several sources into a single repository. This gives firms a comprehensive perspective of their operations, consumer behavior, and industry trends. Organizations can detect trends and patterns that might go unnoticed if data were analyzed separately.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data Security:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last but not least is enhancing data security by converting data into a more secure format and making it less prone to data breaches. By employing data security firms, they, they can easily protect sensitive information against unwanted access and theft.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now we know how crucial <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-conversion-services\">data conversion</a> is, and we understand how turning data into valuable information can dramatically change a company’s learning and choices. It is not something to be taken lightly; It’s expensive. We know the marketplace is highly competitive; hence, an organization must have a clear and scalable strategy. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don’t let your data remain unused. Our professionals are ready to take you on a journey into data literacy, where insights drive decisions and success is predictable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs<strong>)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. How does data contribute to the decision-making process?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.1.</strong> Data-driven decision-making relies on analyzing acquired data, utilizing a variety of data-collecting methods to answer questions and discover insights that may help inform judgments, assist in determining the appropriate course of action, and guide overall strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. </strong><strong>Why is conversion data important?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.2. </strong>Converting data is done to prevent data loss or corruption by preserving its integrity and the structures inherent within it. Providing that the destination format supports the same features and data structures as the source data, this can be accomplished with relative ease.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. How do conversions increase corporate efficiency?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A.3. </strong>Utilizing conversion services allows organizations to swiftly access, analyze, and obtain insights from the data by combining data from several sources into a single format. This allows for the data to be processed more efficiently. The integration and accessibility of this system improve operational effectiveness and make it easier to make better decisions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/The-Impact-of-Data-Conversion-on-Business-Insights-and-Decision-Making.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-05-21 07:45:00','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(162,'Amazon launches Global Shopping Experience to South Africa','amazon-launches-global-shopping-experience-to-south-africa','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Summary: </strong>A detailed overview of<strong> Amazon\'s launch of Amazon.co.za in South Africa.</strong> Discover the benefits for customers and local businesses, and the impact on the e-commerce landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>South African customers now have access to a new online shopping platform that can compete with significant market players such as Takealot and Temu. Amazon.co.za has finally made its debut, which was widely awaited by the South African consumer community. The question is, what does this development mean for South Africa and for the e-commerce business worldwide?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>South Africa is one of the continent\'s most economically rich nations, with approximately 60 million potential customers. With an expanding middle class and internet penetration, Amazon may attract new customers to its economy. The companies there may access global markets like never before with Amazon.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continue reading to learn about the remarkable aspects of Amazon\'s presence. Also, discover the impact it has had on the economy and the nation\'s customers, and how collaborating with a reputable <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\"><strong>Amazon marketing consultant</strong></a><strong> </strong>firm like us may further improve this experience by providing expert guidance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Exploring the Impact of Amazon.co.za on South Africa </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon launched amazon.co.za, offering free delivery on first and subsequent orders that are more than 500 rands. Now giving customers the ability to receive their items the same day or the following day from over 3,000 pickup locations. Customers can select from a variety of local and international brands over twenty different product categories. These categories include consumer electronics, home and small kitchen equipment, and global brands like Apple. As the retail business grows, it has also attracted foreign fast fashion merchants such as Shein and Temu, passionate about selling inexpensive clothing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Growing Opportunities for Local Businesses</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Amazon, South African companies may reach a nationwide consumer base. Furthermore, easily increase sales using pre-made onboarding tools, payment processing solutions, promotional features, and analytics. As part of its continuous efforts to enhance the shopping experience, the platform is prepared to build a long-term partnership with South African companies and brands.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/RpoM5bDCnw8Z8roJpTecatf_PTkNsfsB16P-mDdgajG9UXUoeldIIN4knlxxslevDywAC5rK9UhYcNAMYzbZw6hFrfG13bGx2HlQsqlJ3zb_r8P9OMMD_T7QR3pQU-1VfuQe-vohHDNLqMiaW1K5tgg\" alt=\"Growing Opportunities for Local Businesses\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Supporting Independent Sellers</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Independent sellers sell more than sixty percent of the products offered in Amazon stores worldwide, most of which are small and medium-sized enterprises. The most effective method for attaining customer happiness is to provide clients with the opportunity to purchase a large quantity of items at a reduced cost and make the shopping process as easy as possible. As part of its objective to link customers with businesses nationwide, Amazon.co.za provides chances for small and independent sellers to launch their businesses, grow their businesses, and eventually become successful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Boosting Local Brands and Economic Growth</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are hundreds of independent sellers on Amazon.co.za, which provides a wide range of local brands. One of these companies is Nomakade, a specialist organic hair care brand. Noma Diko, the creator and CEO of Nomakade, emphasizes the prospect that Amazon would attract more South Africans to the platform. As a result, she can spread word-of-mouth marketing more than traditional marketing methods. In addition, by employing <strong>Amazon EBC services</strong>, these regional businesses can generate visually appealing product descriptions for better user experience. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read:- <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/amazon-launched-full-online-store-in-netherlands-amazon-nl/\">Amazon Launched Full Online Store In Netherlands – Amazon.nl </a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to AWS, a dedicated team of AWS developers and engineers in Cape Town, South Africa, constructed a single virtual server instance, allowing South African consumers to access nearly limitless cloud computing capacity without requiring an on-premises data center. The expansion of Amazon EC2 in South Africa will have a substantial economic impact.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Did you know? According to a new AWS EIS, Amazon has invested ZAR 15.6 billion in South Africa\'s data center infrastructure since 2020. The company plans to invest over R30 billion more by 2029 to meet customer demand for cloud computing services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/ZdyCob8rBlqhykHf7kK5v8q3h1aM8cR2PXcjBerhkVl0DRPDzUVTOur3tIs_C5tZzxLgxvcVUDxqRI6eqNZOv0MuptPzwy1DJk2sJYUuivPtDWxxG-kthZcrEG8CZyYWjFpZ1kSkX2SoLazuh_ciwnQ\" alt=\"Boosting Local Brands and Economic Growth\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How We Help You Perform Well on Amazon </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you just started using Amazon and need help boosting sales, or do you know where to begin? We are here to offer <strong>Amazon EBC services</strong> and more to businesses in South Africa. These services include guidance, logistics, marketing, and customer service assistance.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Consultation and Guidance:</strong> Whether you are seeking counsel or direction, we can provide both. Suppose you have any questions regarding the criteria for product listings, optimizing product pages, managing inventory, pricing strategies, or anything else. In that case, our team is available around the clock to answer them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Onboarding Assistance: </strong>Our <strong>Amazon store setup service </strong>will assist your company with establishing seller accounts, uploading product listings, and ensuring that the process is carried out according to Amazon\'s regulations and guidelines.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Marketing and Promotion: </strong>This is a vital Amazon task. We improve keyword searches to boost your products\' search rankings. Our Amazon marketing experts use discounts, freebies, and one-time promotions to win customers. Appealing ads that target the correct demographic may boost sales and traffic.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Customer Service Support: </strong>We pay attention to any questions or concerns your consumers may have regarding your company and the items you sell on Amazon. As part of our <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/store-creation\">Amazon store setup service</a></strong>, we can assist businesses with returns and refund procedures. In addition, we emphasize receiving positive reviews to enhance their reputation and reliability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Amazon, it is only the start of Amazon.co.za, and it will continue to improve and enhance the shopping experience to serve customers and sellers across South Africa. This defines the ongoing commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction that Amazon is known for worldwide. As more and more companies in the country realize the potential of doing business online, our <strong>Amazon marketing consultant</strong> experts offer a comprehensive solution. Obtain affordable solutions that may be tailored to your specific needs and budget.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.1. Does Amazon go to South Africa?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customers in South Africa may now purchase from an extensive range of local and worldwide brands, take advantage of low rates, and receive same-day or next-day delivery. Amazon has announced the opening of Amazon.co.za, providing South African customers a fresh online shopping experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.2. What are the advantages of Amazon going global?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Take your company to the next level by taking advantage of Amazon Global Selling. Increase sales, broaden your consumer base, and reduce the danger of experiencing times of poor sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Q.3. What competition does Amazon face in Africa?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result of Amazon\'s introduction into the South African market, competition has been introduced into an industry controlled mainly by Takealot. It is owned by Naspers and accounts for over half of all online sales in the southern African nation. Massmart, which Walmart owns, is also getting ready to launch its e-commerce initiative.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Amazon-launches-Global-Shopping-Experience-to-South-Africa.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-05-20 13:58:03','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(163,'How to set product prices on Amazon','how-to-set-product-prices-on-amazon','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pricing on Amazon </strong>focuses on keeping prices as low as possible. When doing business on Amazon, you must consider two crucial prices. These are the item and total prices. The item price is the one that the client sees. It excludes the cost of fulfilling the order. The total price includes things like shipping and handling fees, sales, and any savings or refunds that are offered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prices are clear, and the competition is strong on Amazon. You risk losing money if you set your prices too low and don\'t sell enough if they\'re too high. It is crucial for you to determine the sweet spot between client willingness to pay and your operating expenses when setting prices for your goods. To maximize revenues and attract clients, set your best pricing. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we understand how crucial it is to optimize your listing and adhere to the Amazon product detail listing requirements to decide a fair price.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>We Calculate the Best Price for your Product </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First, you need to know how much your goods cost before you can set prices. These might include the following:.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Charges for shipping, customs, and bank payments.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Amazon Commission and FBA Fees</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The cost of customer return. Don\'t forget to include the 20% Amazon will retain from the original commission paid.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>There are variable expenses for ordering and shipping the merchandise. </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The professionals at Tech2Globe are ready to help you manage these cost factors, making sure that you have a full picture of your costs before we perform <strong>pricing on Amazon</strong>. With our knowledge, we can help you carefully look at these things and figure out the best way to set your prices so that you can make the most money while still being competitive in the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Do Amazon Prices Change? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you stuck on the question, \"<strong>Do Amazon prices change</strong>?\" Then yes, they do. Prices on Amazon change about 2.5 million times a day, or once every 10 minutes. It happens because of how Amazon sets its prices. This method can change prices by as much as 20% so that Amazon stays competitive for sellers and buyers can get the best deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Implementing Amazon Pricing Strategies </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe, your reliable Amazon Consulting agency, employs the following pricing strategies:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Use the Amazon FBA product cost calculator</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the <strong>best Amazon pricing strategy</strong> anyone can employ. Our experts use the product cost-plus price calculator that Amazon has graciously made available. We use this tool to determine a price point for items that are comparable to ones in your niche or for products that you currently have in stock. We determine the base price and define the potential delivery charges using fairly flexible calculation parameters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, this is not our sole resource. The ultimate selling price of goods or services are determined by more precise computations, the state of the market, the expectations of our clients, and the growth targets they are aiming for.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Suggest the price taking profit margin into account</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We calculate your total earnings after deducting all fees, taxes, and additional manufacturing expenses to determine profit margin. It provides the appropriate profit margin for a product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Stay tuned to the competitor\'s pricing.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An everlasting tactic for any market is to be fully informed about the state of the competition. Therefore, enable your rivals to provide you with a solution on how to price a product to sell it well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make work more accessible and keep you informed on price changes made by your rivals. This solution will enable you to retain your market share by receiving fast notifications whenever your rivals modify their pricing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Launch price testing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An A/B or split test is an excellent approach to determining which pricing point your goods perform best. The A/B pricing test offers your products at two different prices for a set period of time and compares their performances. Running such a test enables vendors to make data-driven judgments about product prices rather than simply guessing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Build more trust and credibility.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We aim to increase your brand\'s credibility and reliability in the eyes of prospective buyers. Most customers are willing to spend a little extra for a high-quality product supported by past buyer feedback and sold by reputable merchants.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How To Get Amazon Items Cheaper? </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you buy frequently then you must be aware that locating the greatest deal is both an art and a science. Here are some tried-and-true methods that can help you save money on your next Amazon buy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Amazon Prime offers exclusive deals, free delivery, Prime Video streaming, Amazon Music, and discounts on Whole Foods Market, making it a cost-effective option for many.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Additionally, Amazon features a section called Bargain Finds that displays \"best sellers\" and \"highly rated\" products that people have been purchasing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited-edition products are available cheaper on the website than their usual price during Lightning Deals. Lightning Deals are available across Amazon.com and on the Today\'s Deals page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You may also save money by exchanging certain things through the Amazon Trade-In Programme.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you don’t mind pre-owned or open-box items, Amazon Warehouse is a great way to get those things for less money. In addition to electronics, some of the merchandise available on Amazon Warehouse includes Furniture, Small kitchen appliances, Tools, Pet supplies, Grocery items, Lawn and garden items.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Amazon Renewed, which offers used electronics and other items at lower rates than new ones, is comparable to Amazon Warehouse. The only distinction between Amazon Warehouse and Amazon Renewed is that the latter exclusively sells \"tested and certified\" goods. Usually, they have 90-day periods of protection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For us, achieving the <strong>best Amazon pricing strategy, </strong>optimizing your <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-ppc-services\">Amazon PPC service</a>,</strong> and determining the right price for your small business products are crucial. We stay updated on niche trends, changes, and updates to ensure competitive pricing and continuously enhance your store\'s reputation. Get the benefits of our expertise and take your online business to new heights. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read More </strong>: <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/important-issues-on-amazon-vendor-central-and-how-to-fix-them/\"><strong>Important Issues On Amazon Vendor Central And How To Fix Them</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/How-to-set-product-prices-on-Amazon.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2024-05-19 07:25:39','2026-06-01 11:30:28','2026-06-01 11:30:28'),(164,'Nine Predictions For Amazon In 2024','9-predictions-for-amazon-in-2024','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When we talk of technology, we are very well conversant with the fact that the people\'s needs and wants are being increasingly satisfied by the changes to the technology that are being registered with every passing day. The next day we wake up, we find something you are coming up in technology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The changes for drastic in every respect than they are now chances for the persons to understand the concern and at the same point of time realize that the needs and wants of the people are changing dynamically so, therefore, the technology which is utilized to serve two people much also change and it is changing with every passing day. It is important to note that in the present 