ies 7;&nbsp;</li><li>Diapers and wipes of Pampers and The Honest Company;&nbsp;</li><li>Kitchen items from Rachael Ray, Le Creuset, and Hamilton Beach; VTech and LeapFrog toys;&nbsp;</li><li>Vital Proteins Collagen Whey; Levi\'s apparel</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Accessories were mainly purchased from Chemical Guys car wash products</li><li>And lastly, pet products from NUTRO, TEMPTATIONS, and GREENIES.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since Prime Day shopping began, select Fire TV, Echo, and Blink devices were some of the most purchased items on Amazon. More than 60,000 participating pharmacies in the U.S participated in the event with the support of their <strong>Amazon store consultants.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>U.S. Prime Day Trend</strong>s</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Shopping</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Over 60,000 items were purchased per minute between 8 p.m.—9 p.m. PT from 13 July during the U.S. Prime Day event. Some of the best-selling categories in the U.S. this Prime Day were Consumer Electronics, Household Essentials, and Home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Small Businesses</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prime Day has given the <em>“Small Support Business”</em> to grow with better profits with the help of <strong>Amazon store consultant.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During the three weeks, customers invested their money shopping from small businesses across all 50 U.S. states. Additionally, Delaware, New York, and Wyoming saw the most extensive sales per capita.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You\'re a small busines with limited resource plans for <strong>Amazon store creation</strong>. Take advice from<strong> Amazon account management consulting companies</strong> to best use your resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Amazon Live</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has given a chance to thousands of creators to steam the Prime Day 2022, and not only this, Amazon got more than 100 million views from live streaming of the event. This has given the chance to<strong> Amazon marketing consultants </strong>to cater the Amazon Ads and promote the event.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Amazon Music&nbsp;</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon never forgets to entertain their users! Full-on entertainment was open to more than 200 million paid members worldwide.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the U.S., Amazon opened unlimited access to award-winning movies and series with Prime Video, ad-free listening of 2 million songs with thousands of stations and playlists, and a wide range of podcasts with Amazon Music.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Other Prime Benefits</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prime gaming provides free games and more than 3,000 books and magazines with Prime Reading, unlimited photo storage with Amazon Photos, and savings in your safes!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Similarly as Amazon, Tech2Globe- <strong>Amazon store setup services</strong> never make the user regret after choosing them. You can visit the website and check for the services for <strong>Amazon storefront design</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How Brands Can Continue Prime Day Success?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You don\'t need to be told if you missed this year\'s event. There\'s still a door of opportunity opened for you all. Amazon ads survey states that 52.5% of buyers are likely to join the prime day event to make more purchases than this year.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Three things can help you and the Prime Day event succeed together even if it\'s over:&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><em>First,</em> always stay active and have an always-on marketing campaign approach to stay in the words of audiences through Amazon Ads solutions. If you\'re not aware of Amazon ads and find challenging to run an ad campaign on Amazon! You can take help and guidance from the<strong> best Amazon marketing agency. </strong>These agencies have experts working with Amazon ads campaigns for years and can make your brand shine.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><em>Second,</em> don\'t feel guilty if you haven\'t invested in this year\'s prime day. You\'re not at all wasted. Amazon has some arrangements for<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/amazon-vendor-consultant/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon vendors accounts</a></strong> because, after the event,<strong> <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-marketing-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon marketing consultants </a></strong>have seen more people engaging with the end of the event.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><em>Third, </em>leverage our measurement solutions from <strong>Amazon marketing consultants</strong> to understand insights from your ongoing campaign. Find out what worked and did not, and use those insights for future campaigns.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Prime Has Made It Easier For The User To Access New Opportunities</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Post-Prime Day, brands can help drive incremental sales with sponsored products, work to build brand loyalty with Sponsored Brands, and remarket to high-intent audiences with Sponsored displays. This can also be an excellent time to update or create your store for the next season to further engage with new and existing customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tech2Globe Says, \"Prime Made It Easier.\"</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prime provides the best savings and shopping options with free shipping! Prime members have access to femtosecond grocery delivery and pickup from Amazon Fresh and Whole Foods Market in over 5,000 urban centres, free Same-Day Delivery on hundreds of thousands of items in over 90 major cities, and free One-Day Delivery on more than 20 million items worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, if you want to make your Amazon business with prime members and want to excel in your Amazon store, contact tech2Globe; they\'ll help you with<strong> Amazon store creation.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Contact Today For</em><strong><em> Amazon Store Creation Services.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Its-All-About-Amazon-Prime-Day-2022.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-25 10:35:32','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(365,'React Native vs Flutter: Which One To Choose For Mobile App Development?','react-native-vs-flutter-which-one-to-choose-for-mobile-app-development','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to the process of <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/mobile-application/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mobile app development</a></strong>, the options available are almost endless. From the Android platform to the iOS platform, there are many options. Depending on your business requirement, the choice is not that easy. React Native and <strong>Flutter app development</strong> are two of the most popular options available.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this blog, we will compare these two tools and discuss where each of them can benefit. Let\'s start with this!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>About React Native</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The open-source UI software framework React Native App Development was developed by Meta Platform, Inc. It enables developers to use React Framework along with native platform features to build applications for Android, Android TV, iOS, macOS, tvOS, Web, Windows , UWP, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"602\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/qFuNgL2gp3ABVWhmGIHFbtABccYVljrR2wZZfESgCKFlW8z7Uymsx7BVWDIa-NAjqJaZrXs63ilhQk65Xdawun_oDfHCdWhIykhXVOetmVEpr5WyleVnwFjc2nrzMIw_g2-TFsHcP7FqoCzV0Wimhw-9a5w7CQJ0UJ_36ybH6vMwNBIx7g-ccd1c7w\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What Makes React Native Sole Choice For Mobile App Development</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Available with complete third-party plugin support&nbsp;</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There may be a lack of features to suit some specific application requirements as many advanced features in React Native are currently under development. But to overcome this, React Native app development provides two categories of third-party plugins: Native modules and JavaScript-based modules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, React Native allows you to connect any plugin with native or third-party modules (if you need to integrate navigation sites into your applications).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Saves you money and time</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since JavaScript can be used for both iOS and Android, developers can use React Native without writing separate programs for each. Code reuse in particular increases productivity, leads to incredibly fast development and reduces costs. Furthermore, the existence of open-source libraries, especially UI ones, significantly accelerates the process of mobile app development.<br>Additionally, part of the code from an organization\'s existing <strong>React Native app development</strong> can  reuse to build another application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Live and hot reloading</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Live reloading makes it possible to refresh the code quickly. The developer experience is designed to be as smooth as possible with this functionality and the local state of the code is preserved by live reloading during refresh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another important advantage of <strong>React Native app development</strong> is hot reloading. Live and Hot Reloading are slightly different from each other. Hot reloading only updates a single file that has been edited or updated, while live reloading refreshes the entire application while preserving the initial state of the application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Now, let’s take a look at Flutter app development for a better comparison.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>About Flutter App Development</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google\'s open-source UI software development toolkit, called Flutter, is used to build cross-platform mobile, web, and desktop applications. The central concept of <strong>Flutter app development</strong> is the ability to develop native mobile applications for iOS and Android using a single codebase and programming language. Other operating systems such as Linux and Windows are supported.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><img width=\"602\" height=\"357\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Td-2u16G0tXbd1J2LnoEMRC6k_L_H0o_AbYq1U7uJ_DhB6RIo8h_bY2-q3SrvXM7WFMSHP9vCRGIlAQUkj373hz5tZRUkujVEB7x9Bk7YAiqESNUkru0KXsGS7hJVnAM4WUZ7mxJiCh7qYDFgyKzPveZ5cVqMKSWQwFsmn8TiffHp_9xzOw0h1a0TA\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>How does It Benefits With Mobile Applications Development?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Power pack performance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using the smooth motion of a mobile device, developers can use the Skia 2D graphics package to produce quick-responsive apps with flawless graphics in Flutter. A <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mobile app development</a></strong> team can guarantee near-native operating speed by using Dart and pre-compiling an application. Application performance is unaffected by server requests, file management, or platform APIs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Quick development process</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because the programmer has to compile the entire application every time a change is made, the development process can sometimes be lengthy. A developer can use Flutter\'s hot reload feature to quickly update an app after saving its state.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Adding, unlike any other programming, in <strong>Flutter app development</strong> developers work with a single codebase and do not need to add additional components to the interplay between the code thread and the native UI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Worth investment</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cost reduction is an important objective for every business. Business owners will have to pay twice when developing native apps: once for the iOS version and once for the Android version.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because Flutter is advanced, you only need one <strong>Flutter app development</strong> team to build and maintain your apps. As a result, it significantly reduces the cost and cuts down on the amount of time required to carry out development works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Coming To The Question: Flutter Or React Native App Development?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Particulars</strong></td><td><strong>React Native</strong></td><td><strong>Flutter</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>iOS</strong></td><td>✔</td><td>✖</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Android</strong></td><td>✖</td><td>✔</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cross Platform</strong></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Launch Date</strong></td><td>2015</td><td>2017</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Development Company</strong></td><td>Facebook</td><td>Google</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Documentation</strong></td><td>User-friendly but disorganised</td><td>Informative, and organised&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Performance&nbsp;</strong></td><td>Slow</td><td>Swift</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Latest Version</strong></td><td>React Native-v0.69.0</td><td>Flutter-v3.0.5<br></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For many years to come, there will be a conflict between native and cross-platform software. The decision is yours, what you find right as per your needs. We hope you enjoyed reading the blog where we tried to compare two incredible software React Native and <strong>Flutter app development</strong> for <strong>mobile app development</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any such requirements, please visit <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\"><strong>Tech2Globe</strong></a> for better assistance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/React-Native-vs-Flutter-Which-One-To-Choose-For-Mobile-App-Development.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-24 07:49:42','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(366,'Amazon Restricted Products: A Short Guide for Amazon Account Management','amazon-restricted-products-a-short-guide-for-amazon-account-management','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A big marketplace like amazon is working hard and systematically to create a user experience for their customers as well as the vendors. It becomes challenging if you don\'t have the knowledge about the products that can be sold on amazon.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, we have created this short guide for all the <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-account-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">amazon vendor services</a> </strong>to make them aware of the restricted products.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Let\'s start from the beginning!</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>What Are Gated Categories In Amazon?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has restricted some products from entering the market, but it is easy for<strong> Amazon vendor registration</strong> to take place. The only challenge is to market a successful amazon listing taking care of gated categories.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a result, the<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/amazon-vendor-consultant/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon vendor central</a></strong> needs approval from Amazon for such categories. You must meet certain conditions in addition to having Amazon\'s permission to publish listings in specific product categories. The vast array of different products available on Amazon is possibly the most appealing aspect of the platform from the buyer\'s perspective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, you should be aware of a wide range of Amazon-restricted products in the UK and elsewhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The majority of items can be sold by anyone, but some brands and categories are restricted. This means your<strong> Amazon seller account services</strong> need to obtain specific permission before selling those products or getting them unlocked.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Products are restricted for a reason on Amazon, and it reflects those; Amazon account management agency are providing three reasons for the Restriction of amazon products:</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Amazon Reputation</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We know Amazon is a big marketplace; its every action is being monitored creating a brand image. Therefore, it can\'t take a risk and put its brand reputation at stake, thus restricting the associated product that is subject to people damage.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Safeguard Customers&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not to mention that expired or old medicine is a matter of health risks, and so on. Amazon restricts access to some categories to safeguard its customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact<strong> Amazon vendor central consultant </strong>to manage your account and create the account that Amazon approves</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Reduce Fraud</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ecommerce is all online; therefore, the fraud chances could be higher. A company like Amazon is right in its place, and to reduce the risk rate, it reduces the items with greater risks and frauds. Amazon\'s gated categories restrict sellers from selling, but if you want to join amazon, all you need is Amazon\'s trust and suited customer experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thus, <strong>Amazon seller account management services</strong> are the best options to reduce the frauds and work more authentically.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Here are the gated categories on Amazon:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Collectible Coins</li><li>Personal Safety and Household products</li><li>Entertainment Collectibles</li><li>Fine Art</li><li>Holiday Selling Requirements in Toys &amp; Games</li><li>Jewelry</li><li>Join Amazon Handmade</li><li>Join Amazon Subscription Boxes</li><li>Made in Italy</li><li>Music &amp; DVD</li><li>Automotive &amp; Powersports</li><li>Services</li><li>Sports Collectibles</li><li>Streaming Media Players</li><li>Video, DVD, &amp; Blu-ray</li><li>Watches</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Ungated Subcategories Amazon Store Consultants Should Know.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon has recently unlocked some areas for the sellers, which is good news for <strong>Amazon seller account services.</strong> However, the challenging part is understanding the key areas and subcategories.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But don\'t you worry about it; <strong>Amazon vendor consulting </strong>has your back. They can take care of groceries, cosmetics, and health-related products or whatever product you\'re selling in particular.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, you must obtain permission to sell certain items that may fall into these categories but have distinct characteristics, such as topical beauty treatments, over-the-counter medications, and prescriptions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Amazon Store Creation Categories Requiring Amazon Approval</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The rules for gated categories distinguish from one another. Amazon does not have a set of common standards for determining the extent to which you can list in a specific category without providing additional data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you require Amazon\'s permission to sell in a specific category, you may go through an additional approval process. You may be required to pay additional fees, submit performance checks, and operate any other actions necessitated by Amazon. Therefore <strong>Amazon account management services</strong> is the best option to go for and get the things done with minimal burden.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Our Words&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As explained previously, Amazon is transitioning from placing limits on wide categories. It rather restricts access to subcategory specializations. As a matter of fact, the list of restricted categories is much narrower than the list of restricted Amazon products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And if you\'re still confuse and want to look for <strong>vendor account management</strong>, then Tech2Globe is the<strong> best Amazon vendor service</strong> that provides consulting, marketing and optimization solutions.&nbsp;<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Amazon-Restricted-Products-A-Short-Guide.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-19 05:56:19','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(367,'Woocommerce Vs Shopify: Who Stands Best For A Business?','woocommerce-vs-shopify-who-stands-best-for-a-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you compare WooCommerce vs. Shopify, you will find they both have a variety of advantages. These benefits may be the best choice for you to use when creating an online business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But who, ultimately, can be your ideal partner?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After reading this blog, you can choose the ideal e-commerce platform for your particular requirements. Therefore, let\'s contrast <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/woocommerce-development-services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Woocommerce website development</strong> </a>with Shopify to choose the best.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A Quick Introduction To Woocommerce Website Development</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Woocommerce website development </strong>is an open-source e-commerce plugin for WordPress and is intende for medium-sized to large-sized online retailers. When it was introduce on September 27, 2011, the plugin quickly gained popularity due to its easy installation and customized features.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, the base product was available as freeware (even though many of its optional extensions are paid and proprietary).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What Makes Woocommerce Website Development The Best Choice For Businesses?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s a known reality that WooCommerce is user-friendly, which makes it unique from other platforms for eCommerce development. WooCommerce is the best option for setting up your online store if you are new to the eCommerce sector with a limited budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, if you don\'t have previous expertise in web development, you won\'t need to worry about it; WooCommerce can handle all this. The user interface created with the least amount of technical knowledge; one can list store items, change and update details, or install and set up quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>So WooCommerce is terrific for you if you lack technical expertise and have a tight pocket!</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>About Shopify Ecommerce Development</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tobias Lütke and Scott Lake founded<strong> Shopify ecommerce development</strong> in 2006 after failing to launch Snowdevil, an online retailer of snowboarding gear. Shopify emphasizes online storefronts and retail point-of-sale systems.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online shops can access various services via the Shopify ecommerce development, including facilities for payments, marketing, shipping, and customer interaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Things That Catches Maximum Eyes For Shopify</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Web hosting can be tough when starting a new internet business. Startups  especially limited in free time, and hosting a shopping cart requires technical support. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-product-upload-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Shopify ecommerce development</a>,</strong> on the other hand, is a hosted solution that is cloud-based, so you don\'t need to bother about servers or databases. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Without any setup, you can access your store from anywhere using your admin login information &amp; an internet connection. The most crucial aspect is that it assists you in managing the payment gateway, which makes your work simple.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Answer To The Question</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/woocommerce-product-upload-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Woocommerce website development</a> </strong>promises total control over your online store with a large ecosystem of plugins, extensions, and themes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the other hand,<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/shopify-development-company/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Shopify\'s ecommerce development </a></strong>combines robust eCommerce functionality with an easy setup process if you want to start an online business swiftly. But, it almost doesn\'t require any specialized technical skills and costs money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, the decision to select the finest rests with the user. We could only provide a brief comparison, but in the end, it\'s your business, so you are better equipped to determine which one appears to be profitable to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Last Words!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building an effective online store demands advanced development support to make it more user-friendly and competitively superior to its competitors daily. This support is not just boosted by the store\'s extraordinary aesthetic and ease of browsing, but you need professional support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re looking for help setting up an internet store, the points mentioned above will clear some of your doubts regarding making the best choice. We hope you enjoyed reading this blog on Woocommerce Vs. Shopify, if you are looking for the same, please get in touch with us at Tech2Globe.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/How-Does-An-Amazon-Vendor-Consultant-Work-For-Your-Business.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-17 11:06:54','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(368,'How To Create An Influencer Marketing Strategy?','how-to-create-an-influencer-marketing-strategy','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the era of social media, it is pretty hard to scroll any website without spotting an influencer. There are just so many of them. It feels like almost every other person is an influencer.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is safe to say that not every influencer is a legitimate one. On the contrary, some are loved and followed by the masses. People who follow them tend to trust them now.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influencer marketing</strong> is currently the most successful marketing strategy because of this one simple point. These trustworthy messengers are in an ideal position to make product recommendations. People seek their opinions while making a purchase decision. Therefore, they are being chasedb by the marketers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s spend some time understanding how to develop a fruitful <strong>influencer marketing services </strong>strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">What Is An Influencer Marketing Services Strategy?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong> believe that, Influencer marketing, at its core, is a form of social media promotion that relies on recommendations and mentions of products from influencers—people who have a consistent following and are recognised by people for their expertise in a particular field. Influencer marketing is effective because social influencers have established a bond of trust with their followers, and recommendations from them provide validation to potential customers for a business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In layman\'s terms, influencer marketing is a marketing strategy when people seek opinions from influencers. On the other hand, brands pay those influencers to give a dedicated opinion to their niche followers about their products to attract customers.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Influencer Marketing Strategies For Brands</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before starting any marketing campaign, the brands usually form an outline of several strategies to be implemented.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But what do we have here?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have made a brief strategy guide for brands to follow for a successful marketing campaign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">1. Determine Your Goals</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For brands implementing <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">influencer marketing services</a></strong>, reaching new target audiences is the main objective. This makes sense, given that an influencer campaign increases your exposure to their followers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep in mind that getting new consumers is the main objective rather than closing the deal immediately.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">2. Know That Who Are You Trying To Influence</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong> believe that, the first step is to decide who your target audience for a particular campaign will be.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Making sure you know who you\'re attempting to target is easy by creating an audience target. Perhaps your major goal is to reach more to your present audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you\'ve chosen, develop a set of influencer personalities that match your expectations.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">3. Consider 3 Rs Of Influence</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Relevance</li><li>Reach</li><li>Resonance</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Relevance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Finding the most suitable influencer is the key to acing the marketing strategy. They must appeal to the same set of people and match your niche as your target market.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Reach</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The number of individuals you may appeal to by using an influencer\'s fan base is known as reach. It\'s important to remember that a tiny audience can still be beneficial if it has a strong enough following to support your objectives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Resonance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the potential level of audience the influencer will reach through the campaign along with the brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">4. Compilation Of A List</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The key is trust when choosing who you wish to collaborate with. Your target audience must respect and trust the opinions of the influencers you collaborate with. Any outcomes without the element of trust will be uncertain.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And to be sure about the trust, you must check with the engagement of your shortlisted influencers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">5. Do Your Research</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make a calendar about what you want your influencer to post. Even if a substantial salary accompanies your offer, the influencer will find it difficult to accept it if you request too many posts in a short period.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you are well aware of the interests covered on their channels and that it matches your brand\'s goals. <strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong> will do the work for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">6. Reach Out Privately And Personally</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong> believe that, an excellent place to start is by engaging with their previous work. When you think a cordial relationship is established, proceed with a direct message. You can also go for an email. It indicates professionalism and your seriousness towards them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Give as many details as you can about your company. Educate them about your Instagram campaign’s goal. Clearly state the advantages to the influencer, apart from their paycheck.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">7. Collaborate With Your Influencer To Develop Compelling Content</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The one thing that the audience catches up to instantly is authenticity.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The influencers create their following based on their authenticity. So make sure that the tasks and the work you assign your influencers are based on their niche and match their demographics. And one thing that must be kept in mind is that they must not be forced to post something.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">8. Measure Your Results</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You could feel a little overwhelmed by the enormous amount of likes that can accumulate if your influencer has a lot greater following than you do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But to gauge a campaign\'s success, you must check the insights and impressions they give you.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the eyes of <strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong>, for Instagram and YouTube influencers, you can keep a check on insights of their posts. But if you aim to increase sales, you can give your influencers a \"Discount Coupon\" so that you know how many sales are being directed.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Summing Up Our Findings</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencers prefer to be called \"Creators\". The reason is that they feel like their work is belittled by being called influencers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to master <strong>influencer marketing</strong> or need help in just making your brand campaign a success, contact Tech2globe,a <strong>top influencer marketing agency in Delhi</strong>. We provide top-notch <strong>influencer marketing services</strong> to our clients and ensure they make the most of their resources. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also: </strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/guide-to-social-media-marketing-strategy-2022/\">Guide to social media marketing strategy 2022</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/How-To-Create-An-Influencer-Marketing-Strategy.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-06 08:07:55','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(369,'Influencer Marketing Services: Best Strategies And Tips For 2022','influencer-marketing-services-best-strategies-and-tips-for-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influencer marketing services</strong> are now a mainstream channel in online marketing. It has been a buzzword for a while because, nowadays, most follow what their influencers look up to.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencer marketing is not as easy as some think; it is complex and requires expertise. More and more brands are exploring best practices to achieve the best results. Everyone should understand that there is no one-size-fits-all approach to<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\"> </a><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">influencer marketing services</a></strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\">.</a> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s pull off some excellent influencer marketing campaign tips. We always feel that our readers should know about these easy hinflacks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">A Quick Overview Of The Influencer Marketing Services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influencer marketing services</strong> combine traditional and modern marketing strategies, transforming the concept of celebrity endorsement into a content-driven marketing campaign for the contemporary era. This is because companies and influencers work together to create the campaign\'s results, influencer marketing\'s key differentiation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influencer marketing services</strong>, yet, don\'t obviously involve famous people. Instead, it centers on influencers, many of whom do not view themselves as prominent in a traditional sense.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Some Interesting Facts And Figures For Influencer Marketing Services:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>The global market value may reach 18 billion in the year 2022.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Almost every 1/3rd business earns $6 for every $1 spent on influencer marketing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>There has been almost a 500% jump in the search pattern for <strong>Influencer marketing services</strong>.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Instagram has been the favorite destination for brands for influencer marketing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>More than half of the global digital audience says it is the most effective form of marketing. Also, it will outperform all other marketing practices in the future.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">What Should You Avoid That Does Not Work With Influencer Marketing?&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">1. Partnering with top<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> influencer marketing agencies</a> based on their following.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing influencers with a significant following is one of the most typical errors in influencer marketing. A large following does not guarantee a high engagement rate; partnering with influencers with fewer followers but higher engagement is preferable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Collaborating with an influencer who only has a limited but the loyal following benefits both sides.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">2. Using the same obsoleted content tactics</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most typical influencer marketing mistakes is posting outdated content and expecting huge returns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Top influencer marketing agencies</strong> use recently introduced elements like video content to expand the effectiveness of their approach as the majority of social media users embrace video content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, you have even more reason to adapt your content strategies if your competitors create content to stay competitive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:24px\">3. Copying competitors while ignoring the audience.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Influencer marketing programs are designed to generate relevant content for your target audience. Brands should use influencers to connect with a particular audience instead of following the trends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It does not mean keeping an eye on what your competitors are doing on the platform is essential. Still, it is crucial to understand what your audience wants.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Now, Let\'s Go Through Some Useful Tips By Top Influencer Marketing Agencies To Improve Your Current Influencer Marketing Campaigns.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">1. Product launch by influencers</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Celebrities have long been used by brands as part of marketing strategies to position and introduce new items. But, working with a group of influential people may yield better results than assembling a superstar team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Huge celebrities work with a broad range of interests and are likely to have loyalty to a few brands. As a result, their recommendations are less beneficial.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">2. Brand-loyal influencers must be used.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Working with a group of influential individuals might produce better outcomes than putting together a superstar squad.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since celebrities usually collaborate with others with diverse interests and are likely to have large fan bases, their recommendations are less reliable. Consumers are today more conscious of it because they receive payment for their support of a product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:22px\">3. Focus on building long-term relationships</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best results can only be obtained through effective and efficient teamwork. One long-term top method by <strong>top influencer marketing agencies</strong> is to identify top influencers who can represent a business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many top businesses prefer relying on companies for years rather than switching to many options. It not only helps the brand to impact the customers but also builds up healthy long-term relations with the influencers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Last Words!</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The top <strong>Influencer marketing services </strong>strategies listed in the blog will help you develop effective marketing strategies in the future. We hope you had a great time reading this blog and if you need any help with your marketing needs, reach us at <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also:</strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/bpo-services-by-tech2globe-is-on-the-beam-to-dominate-its-competitors-goodfirms/\">BPO Services By Tech2Globe Is On The Beam To Dominate Its Competitors: GoodFirms</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Influencer-Marketing-Services-Best-Strategies-And-Tips-For-2022.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-08-02 06:09:00','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(370,'Why Is It Considered The Best To Choose FBA Consulting For Your Business?','why-is-it-considered-the-best-to-choose-fba-consulting-for-your-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Selling on Amazon is a dream for many online businesses. This online retail giant has millions of active customers, making it the best platform to sell your products. Here buyers are always ready to make a purchase from you. In addition, you can trust Amazon wholly as it has built a customer base that helps merchants gain more sales. Therefore, it is necessary for you to opt for <strong>amazon fba consulting</strong>, especially when you are a beginner or someone who wants to expand their business on the Amazon platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">All About Amazon FBA Consulting Services&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon is a great place to test new products. It gives you access to robust analysis and extensive consumer data. This means you can decide what product to sell in the market and charge accordingly. Additionally, <strong>fba consulting</strong> helps you sell your products immediately without needing to build an eCommerce store for it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Remember that going for <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-fba-consulting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">amazon fba consulting</a></strong> can make your brand stand out in this highly competitive market. They navigate the complicated rules and procedures of Amazon to build strong strategies.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">How Does It Benefit You In Selling?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Fba consulting</strong> helps you optimize the benefits of selling, mitigate the downsides, and stay competitive on Amazon. Sellers highly depend on the expertise of these consultants. Their services also include driving traffic, increasing sales, and managing rules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, let’s see the things that you need to observe while choosing amazon fba consulting services for your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Why Do You Need Amazon FBA Consulting Services For Your Business?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Amazon fba consulting services</strong> can provide you with multiple pieces of advice to boost your business on the Amazon platform. Hence, to ensure their features, go through the list given below showing some vital skills and expertise that <strong>fba consulting</strong> should provide you with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>They Use Product-Driven Approach</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>More than half percent of shoppers prefer reading online reviews before they make any purchase, and therefore, product reviews are evidence that uplift sales upto 20% in total. Meanwhile, displaying reviews can also help you increase conversion rates, &amp; showing only five reviews can increase the likelihood of a customer’s purchase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most of the products that are successful on Amazon have many excellent customer reviews. That is why you must get as many 4- and 5-star reviews as possible. <strong>Fba consulting </strong>helps you to implement a product-driven approach to your business. Therefore, stellar reviews are necessary for achieving high customer satisfaction &amp; increasing the likelihood of buyers. Amazon fba consulting services can help you understand market demand, identify high-quality products, create positive reviews, &amp; build brand reputation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>They Conduct A Competitive Strategy</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Fba consulting</strong> gives you accurate and comprehensive knowledge of the competitive landscape that can help you in multiple ways. With their assistance, you can select the best products for your business portfolio, devise a competitive pricing strategy, and position your products for the target audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-fba-consulting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon fba consulting services</a></strong> can bring a competitive analysis by completely identifying your competitors. This will help you look for improvement areas in your business. Some key metrics include the number of reviews, pricing, keyword optimization strategy, sales data, etc., to help you analyze the market and competitors’ strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>They Implement Amazon Paid Media Strategy</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>it can also help you in bringing the tagline of<strong> Amazon Sponsored Products</strong> which ultimately leads to a higher conversion rate as compared to Google Ads. It’s the best tactic to help your listings get the attention of more shoppers &amp; pull traction. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, they also assist you in coping with increased competition &amp; run Amazon Paid ads to fit into profit margins effectively. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Summary&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When going for <strong>fba consulting</strong> service for your business, always remember your needs &amp; business goals to find the right consultant with relevant experience and skill sets. This also includes many other services like PPC, SEO, reviews, legal services, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Amazon fba consulting services</strong> can help you in boosting your sales using an in-depth Amazon marketing analysis and customized management solutions. <strong>Services4Amazon</strong> is an award-winning agency that can make your Amazon seller strategy reach higher ends. They can also help you in creating visible sales with their proven Amazon marketing techniques and optimization expertise.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also: </strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/how-does-an-amazon-vendor-consultant-work-for-your-business/\">How Does An Amazon Vendor Consultant Work For Your Business?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Why-Is-It-Considered-The-Best-To-Choose-FBA-Consulting-For-Your.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-30 10:07:21','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` VALUES (371,'How Does An Amazon Vendor Consultant Work For Your Business?','how-does-an-amazon-vendor-consultant-work-for-your-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You might be wondering how to sell your products on Amazon… Right?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Running a business on Amazon is quite challenging, especially when you are a beginner!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you know, that seller interactive provides a guide to free resources like webinars, podcasts, and valuable content to benefit your businesses. But entirely relying on it is not enough if it does not tell you about the strategies of selling a product on Amazon.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That\'s why hiring an <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/vendor-account-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>amazon vendor central consultant</strong> </a>is preferred to help get personalized suggestions for your business model.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Why Should You Hire An Amazon Vendor Consultant?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As you can see, the eCommerce platforms are highly competitive and require you to compete with other brands. That\'s the main reason any business goes for <strong>amazon vendor consulting </strong>and helps their business with the best product selling strategies. They can also help in product listings and generating sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hiring an <strong>amazon vendor central consultant</strong> is a good investment. Partnering with them can give you more time which can be used to focus on other areas of your business. It means you not only save time but also increase the popularity and sales of your products.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">How To Select The Best Amazon Vendor Consultant For Your Business?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must select the best <strong>amazon vendor central consultant</strong> who thoroughly understands your products and business needs. So for this, you should be aware of their proven track records of success and up-to-date knowledge of the latest changes in the marketplace.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Therefore, we will provide the knowledge of opting for<strong> amazon vendor consulting </strong>and what to expect from them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Few Points To Notice In Amazon Vendor Central Consultant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to choosing the right <strong>amazon vendor consultant </strong>for your business, there are a lot of options to choose from. The following points should be kept in mind while planning to collaborate with one:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Their Experience</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is the top priority to know about your consultant\'s past record of experience. By this, you can be sure of giving your products to safer hands. It would be best if you make sure to look at Be sure to look at the portfolio of <strong>amazon vendor central consultants</strong> to check their recent works. Their experience and knowledge will be reflected better in their case studies or projects that they have worked on.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Their Services</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your <strong>amazon vendor consultant </strong>can offer you a lot of services. For instance, if you look at the seller interactive, you will get to know a list of Amazon-related services like Search Engine Optimization, Pay-Per-Click (PPC) advertisements, etc. So, you must check the list of services that your consultant provides you.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Their Resources</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When looking for <strong>amazon vendor consulting</strong>, always keep in mind that your consultant must have popular tools and other resources at their backend. There are multiple tools over the internet that exist for different services, so they should have access to all of them.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Suppose, while considering SEO, different tools like Moz or Buzzsumo are used for keyword research purposes. These are pretty necessary for creating content that can bring you clicks. But investing in these tools might cost you a lot. That\'s why investing in an <strong>amazon vendor central consultant</strong> who has these tools and knows their usage could be a wise choice.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Their Pricing Strategy</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No matter how excellent your <strong>amazon vendor consultant</strong> is, it will come down when they confirm their pricing strategy. It\'s vital for you to partner with one who completely understands your budget. Most of them would give you a quotation, which generally depends on the type of your services and the product line size.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Summary</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is better to prepare well before approaching an <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/vendor-account-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">amazon vendor central consultant</a></strong> to grow your business. And if you are still not clear on how to sell your product on Amazon, you can take the help of a services company!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Growing an eCommerce business on Amazon has been more accessible and profitable with the help of Tech2Globe! You can take their services to bring the right people to your brand and achieve the goals of your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also:</strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/amazon-account-suspension-yes-you-can-overcome-this-nightmare/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon Account Suspension: Yes! You Can Overcome This Nightmare</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/How-Does-An-Amazon-Vendor-Consultant-Work-For-Your-Business.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-29 08:53:36','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(372,'How Outsourcing Data Mining Services Can Help A Business?','how-outsourcing-data-mining-services-can-help-a-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Are you having millions of data?</em>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>And don\'t know how to use it?&nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies outsource a ton of client data but don\'t know how to use it effectively. The data is an important factor in taking the company to the top. Data mining techniques find what can make you different from your competitors. <strong>Data mining services </strong>can help you create this data into valuable leads and build customer trust. It plays an integral role in business, and it can make or dissolve a company easily.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>Do you want to know how?&nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read more to get a deeper insight into the topic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">1. Basket Analysis&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you ever opened Amazon or other eCommerce websites and noticed a personalized list popping on the screen even though you haven\'t created it ?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Basket analysis works here</strong>; it will see your customers\' last purchases and frequently buying things to determine their tastes, preferences, styles, and behavior<strong>. </strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Data mining service providers</strong> </a>use this analysis to find the business out of the customers\' lists or past preferences.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It will let you see how the people are using the products and what trends are ongoing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">2. Database Marketing&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When talking about your customers, you need to know what they want and how they feel while using a particular product or service—finding the customer data and monitoring their behaviors, tastes, trends, and reaction to using your service.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You need data that will help you determine the customers\' demographics, psychographics, how often they buy a particular product, and choices. That\'s why you need authentic and well-researched data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can hire <strong>data mining service providers</strong>  to get the updated data of both online and offline markets.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">3. Customer Loyalty&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customers are your primary stakeholders; therefore, checking your customers\' actions becomes vital. They will stay with your business for long if they get regular discounts, a good quality product at a reasonable price, and coupons or offers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To enhance customer loyalty, you must study the data thoroughly and find the best time to increase your users\' interests.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data mining services</a></strong> help minimize the risks and stay with your customers for a lifetime by using methods to analyze your data that will help you track why your customers are choosing you and other brands at one time. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">4. Market Segmentation&nbsp;</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the benefits of <strong>data mining services</strong> is that it helps in segmenting the customer data for the market. This market segmentation will help you in both email marketing and SEO Strategy.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Segmenting your data can help you increase conversion rates as you primarily focus on the market\'s promotions that have demand. Also, you can explore more about your competitors and mold your product or services as your audience expects.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:26px\">To&nbsp; Conclude:&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data mining services in India </strong>or any other country can help you identify the value and deliver the best service to your customers. The more you collect data from your users, the more it will help you generate revenue and sales.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data mining service providers</strong> are an essential part of every business field. The process, from collecting the data to customer acquisition and service delivery, helps you build healthy relationships.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/How-Outsourcing-Data-Mining-Services-Can-Help-A-Business.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-28 08:05:30','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(373,'BPO Services By Tech2Globe Is On The Beam To Dominate Its Competitors: GoodFirms','bpo-services-by-tech2globe-is-on-the-beam-to-dominate-its-competitors-goodfirms','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.goodfirms.co/company/tech2globe-web-solutions-llp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP</a> is a foremost software development company &amp; excels in BPO service providers based in Delhi, India. The company was founded in 2014 and is certified by ISO 9001 &amp; 27001 with 8+ years of experience in Information Technology solutions and consulting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Further, Tech2Globe is certified by Amazon and obtained prominent positions in the IT industry in India &amp; US. The company provides 360-degree BPO solutions for SMEs and enterprises. The expert team of Tech2Globe focuses on punctuality while executing the projects. They offer outstanding other IT services, including e-commerce Development, business services, digital marketing, software development, testing services, web development, artificial intelligence, and mobile app development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>The company aims to help startups; entrepreneurs grow exceptionally in their domain!</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2040,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Tech2Globe-Web-Solutions-LLP-Badge-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"BPO Services Award\" class=\"wp-image-2040\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Tech2Globe\'s facts &amp; figures:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>14+ Years of experience</li><li>7000+ Successful projects&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>99% Customer satisfaction score</li><li>25+ Countries based clientele</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The company\'s BPO (Business process outsourcing) service provides virtual assistants, google certified professionals, end-to-end solutions &amp; 24*7 support system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nowadays, online food delivery has become a vital service for restaurants. It has an immense scope that every category restraints hire outsourcing services to acquire customer satisfaction. Tech2Globe offers comprehensive BPO service for such an industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The dedicated BPO team delivers exceptional support through satisfactory answers to restaurant clients\' queries or issues. In addition, Tech2Globe supplies various BPO solutions for restaurants that include <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data entry services</a>, restaurant menu design, conversion, restaurant menu formatting, restaurant order management, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GoodFirms is a business-to-business company that connects IT service seekers with service provider firms. The platform helps service seekers collaborate with the most appropriate partner through exceptional research on IT firms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, the company\'s team of experienced researchers and reviewers seeks client satisfaction, market penetration, the overall experience in the market, and quality of deliverables. GoodFirms studied all the registered companies based on the three essential parameters: Quality, Reliability, and Ability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Similarly, GoodFirms also evaluated the services of Tech2Globe. According to researchers and analysts, the firm proves to be promising in providing exceptional IT outsourcing solutions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The team has expertise in English, German, French, and Spanish. They tend to work as a quintessential language service provider. The company offers excellent translation services globally. Their translation services are hired by well-established corporations, non-profit organizations, government sectors, and small businesses. Various international companies trust their multi- languages translation solutions from the US market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Why choose Tech2Globe for translation services:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>The translator translates up to 2000 words per day.</li><li>The translation service is according to the client\'s needs.</li><li>The translation service is online for international clients.</li><li>The industry\'s best linguists are available.</li><li>The cost is affordable &amp; reasonable.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe\'s translation-related services include content writing, localization, transcription, subtitling, voice-over, proofreading &amp; editing, desktop publishing, Amazon product listing, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The professional team has years of working experience in academic, advertising, automobile, banking, boutique, business, education, digital marketing, food and beverage, e-learning, fashion, government, healthcare, hospitality, manufacturing, marketing, B2B, eCommerce, medical, real estate, software, finance, information technology industries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The company specializes in CRM, ERP solutions, ASP .NET development, Java/J2EE applications, iPhone app development, Magento, CakePHP development, Microsoft SharePoint, e-commerce management, <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-analytics-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data analytics services</a>, online marketing services, menu entry services, <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">amazon consulting services</a>, IT staffing services, eBay store design, online business management, digital marketing services, <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/guest-posting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">guest posting</a>, lead management tool, HRMS, <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/seo-packages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO packages</a>, amazon certified partners and Content Marketing services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This expertise has allowed Tech2Globe to lead among <a href=\"https://www.goodfirms.co/bpo/delhi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Delhi\'s top BPO companies</a> at GoodFirms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">About the Author</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Working as a Content Writer at GoodFirms, Anna Stark bridges the gap between service seekers and service providers. Anna\'s dominant role is to figure out company achievements and critical attributes and put them into words. She strongly believes in the charm of words and leveraging new approaches that work, including new concepts that enhance the firm\'s identity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Tech2Globe-Web-Solution-LLP-Badge-GoodFirms-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-25 11:24:20','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(374,'Top Social Media Platforms And Their Trends 2022','top-social-media-platforms-and-their-trends-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Have you posted on your Instagram lately?</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Have you shared today\'s streak on Snapchat?&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Are you going to upload your status on Facebook?&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You know posting on<strong> social media platforms</strong> can benefit you and give your business a kick start. Several eCommerce sites provide 24x7 support to their clients and assure them that they\'ll not face any problems.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>All this is possible because of social media.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Social media apps </strong>have become a part of everyone\'s daily life; today, businesses are using social media to create a unique brand image. The competition is so tight today, so you should know where to post first before entering social media.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>So here are some</em><strong><em> social media platforms</em></strong><em> and their ongoing trends.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Top Social Media Platforms And Their Trends 2022</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">1. Facebook Now Meta&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Shopify\'s statistics, Facebook will be the most used<strong> social media application</strong> in 2022.<em> There are more than 2.9 billion active users on Meta</em>. Mark Zuckerberg has created an open platform for everyone to make friends, create businesses, connect with professionals and explore the world by sitting at their desks. Three out of four of the statistics spend <strong>an average of 19 hours per month </strong>on Facebook apps.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><em>Trends Followed</em></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Facebook has adapted AR/VR technology by adding filters to click images or create exciting videos. Millions of people use this technology to update profile photos with brand logos or mascots. Also, Facebook Is giving a feature of<strong> </strong><strong><em>\"Facebook spaces\"</em></strong> where three people can interact using VR devices.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong><em>Facebook Ads</em></strong> trend is said to be a downfall for <strong>social media businesses.</strong> As it is not cost-effective and decreases reach. The business needs to target users and create designed ads and quality content to achieve the best out of Facebook ads.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">2. Instagram&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram has made itself the star image among its users.<em> It is spotted at #1 in </em><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong><em>social media marketers.</em></strong> </a>Instagram has recorded around 1 billion monthly active users; <strong>500+ million people check their Instagram every day.</strong> It has earned a higher return on investment or bonus in the industries. About 90% of Instagram users use business profiles to market. Many startups were set up on Instagram only during the pandemic. 0% of users are planning B2B business from Instagram only.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><em>Trends Followed</em></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong><em>Instagram Link stickers</em></strong> are getting popular among <strong>social media marketers</strong>. This feature has rapidly helped businesses grow more by just clicking on the links. Although Instagram only allowed users with more than 10k followers to use Link stickers to accounts (the same criteria as the old Swipe Up feature), it was available to everybody with effect from October 2021.</li><li>Nearly 80% of brands believe that<strong><em> Instagram Stories</em></strong> have greatly impacted influencer content about their brand. Influencers publish content using Stories, with 63% of them saying they will use Stories \"much more frequently\" in the coming year. Instagram calculated that 500+ million accounts use Instagram Stories daily.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">3. Tik Tok&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tiktok is becoming a face of <strong>social media platforms</strong>. It is only two years old but has more than 1 billion downloads in the first year, making it a 7th world popular<strong> social media app.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the US, More than 50% of TikTok\'s audience is under 35.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tiktok lets you publish Entertaining, interesting, comedic, and sometimes nonsensical short-form videos, usually set to the tune of popular songs.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong><em>Trends Followed</em></strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Social media businesse</strong>s can use TikTok to feature short and creative video content to engage audiences and build brand awareness. In addition, they\'ve got the benefit that these videos can easily pitch users to their services in a short and simple sense.</li><li>Last two years, TikTok has launched many useful too<strong><em>ls, like ads and business profiles, aimed specifically at businesses to become the main platform that brands can use to reach millennials and Gen Z.</em></strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>Final Thoughts&nbsp;</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>We have discussed some trends influencing the </em><strong><em>social media platform in 2022</em></strong><em> and beyond. Using </em>these trends, you can be one step ahead of your competitors.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The rise of short-form video content can be a game-changer in the future and it will continue to be an important source for B2-B businesses. Also,<strong> social media marketing</strong> is proving itself to be mandatory for eCommerce businesses.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It would be best to keep in mind that social media is a large and competitive space. Therefore, it\'s important to remember that you have to go through the latest trends and use them in your social media strategy to grow faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Top-Social-Media-Platforms-And-Their-Trends-2022.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-25 06:59:51','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(375,'Guide to social media marketing strategy 2022','guide-to-social-media-marketing-strategy-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Social media platforms </strong>are now becoming a marketing hub, and marketing needs a strategy to work. A successful market is when they have the best marketing strategy to compete in today\'s world.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Do you need a social media marketing strategy?&nbsp;</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>If yes, go right through this blog. And make yourself an expert on social media by learning from scratch.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\"><strong>Why Do You Need To Create Your Strategy For Social Media Marketing?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re posting on the best<strong> social media platforms </strong>without having a strategy with you, you\'re in big trouble. You\'re wasting your time if you don\'t have a goal about what you\'re doing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media strategy gives you a clue and path to walk on and reach a certain amount of success. Whether you\'re marketing your brand as a <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">social media marketer</a></strong>, you need a strategy to gear up your business.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses that lack workforce or financial resources choose<strong> social media marketing.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Five Benefits Of Creating A Best Social Media Marketing Strategy</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li>Create customer loyalty</li><li>Rapid growth in business</li><li>Brand your business Globally&nbsp;</li><li>Building good client relationship&nbsp;</li><li>Get the right customer insights</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:26px\">Guide to Social media marketing strategy 2022</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 1: Set a SMART Goal</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Set a selected, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound goal. Your success and return on investment depend on the goal you\'re choosing. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>The question is: </em><strong><em>Why do you or your business want to be on social media?</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may create a short-term goal for the beginning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 2: Choose Your Target Audience </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are a large number of people out there who are using social media, and you\'ve to choose the audience which matches your goals.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose an audience with the same demographics, psychographics, geographics, and cultures.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Create different user personas and understand their needs and wants. Sort down the audience based on your goals.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 3: Showcase What You Have With Quality Content</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make a good content strategy, don\'t use heavy words in your content. Try to make it short and crisp.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Make content that completes your network\'s purpose and fulfills your current goal. Consider all the stakeholders\' needs and wants.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Create a content calendar for all<strong> social media platforms</strong>; this will help you stay consistent and punctual. Your business will never be outdated if you have a pre-planned calendar set. Your content creates a brand image of your business so try to make your posting consistent and unique.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By unique, it means making sure it is different from other competitors who are out there in the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here comes the next step.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 4: Never Forget Your Competitors </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before launching your brand on <strong>social media platforms</strong>, study your competitors well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Conduct a competitive analysis to study your competitors\' strategies to determine their strengths and weaknesses to make your company better. To stay in this competitive market, you should take care of what\'s new in the market? And what works in the market?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After SWOT analysis, you\'re ready with your strategy to deliver to the customers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 5: Deliver The Finest Piece Of Product Or Services</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here comes the last step but not the least. Now you\'ve got a roadmap to go, so gear up and deliver your finest piece to your users.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well, there\'s still a thing left to do after posting your material; see how it results?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Always check your performance and adjust your <strong>social media strategy </strong>accordingly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Evaluation is very important for a <strong>social media marketer</strong>. You need to check whether what you\'re uploading on your profile is customer engaging or not,&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Test your strategy, and if there are loopholes, Improve and come with iterations and now, finalize your strategy for the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Thus we can say,&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Social media marketing strategy</strong> places an important role in creating an effective social media profile or a brand image of your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This world is changing, and the taste and preferences of social media users will also change. Give a review of your strategy from time to time, and don\'t hesitate to do so. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Guide-to-social-media-marketing-strategy-2022.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-22 07:54:51','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(376,'How Business Incubators Help New Startups From Scratch?','how-business-incubators-help-new-startups-from-scratch','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Business accelerators</strong> have evolved as excellent support for almost every startup. Every second out of five new startups comes with direct backing from incubators.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Startups with any niche can leverage the support given by business incubators.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It doesn’t mean it can guarantee success, but you can definitely experience great exposure.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s read more about business incubation services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">About Business Incubators</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to understand <strong>business accelerators</strong>, understand them as initiators that offer direct help to new business ideas. It may be for startups or lone entrepreneurs.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we know, no support comes without a personal motive; the same is here. They, too, are involved with startups to increase their participation in new businesses.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Read a few examples below.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px\">Examples Of Business Incubators</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Promoting Growth - </strong>the motive that almost every <strong>business accelerator</strong> comes out with. While looking for <strong>an incubation program</strong>, you might come across the following types:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Institutions Of Higher Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Institutions run many business incubators with universities. Their <strong>incubation program</strong> caters to university students, focusing on welcoming groups of fledgling businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Development Corporations That Are Not For Profit</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These are generally government-funded business incubators. They target new business ideas that focus on public welfare but not profit generation.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Property Development Companies That Are For Profit</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Property corporations require a plethora of assistance for a variety of goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It includes startups targeting real estate. Here <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">business accelerators</a></strong> offer capital as a tool to develop technologies and alliances.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Firms That Invest In Startups</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As an investment opportunity, some venture capital firms construct incubators. For example, it includes incubators who help build new incubators with their resources. So, they fund other business ideas in the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px\">How Do They Help?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When starting a business, the biggest hurdle is often the lack of capital and viable funding. Even the most successful business ideas had some backing system in their past. We’ll discuss later the different support offerings. But you may learn more about it by looking down at a few points:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">There Are 3 Major Patterns Of Direct Help From Incubators To Startups:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h5 style=\"font-size:18px\">1. Providing Financial Investment In Startups</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As more and more startups are emerging almost all across the globe, business incubators find it more profitable, and many provide it as a grant or investment in exchange for equity.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is exciting that incubated firms don’t put money into expenses like office rent. Business incubators provide almost every direct or indirect support, giving them the freedom to operate in any region.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h5 style=\"font-size:18px\">2. Introducing Businesses To Potential Investors</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Startups must meet and win over elusive investors to raise funds.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, some spend months searching and scheduling meetings or for expensive intermediaries. Due to an extensive network of potential investors, it may be challenging to find out what suits you best. But <strong>startup incubators</strong> can help you connect with the most appropriate one.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>You’ll have a greater chance of making a winning one when you go into meetings with different minds.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h5 style=\"font-size:18px\">3. Offering Expert Guidance And Exposure</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Best Part! Successful entrepreneurs serve as mentors, guiding you through the fundamentals of business. You can attend startup events to pitch to different investors and partners.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:18px\">Pros Of Business Incubation Programs</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Provide Adequate Monetary And Other Support</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Equips With Wide Networking Opportunities</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Helps You Speed Your Business Growth</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You Learn And Grow From Other Examples</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Social Capital</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Future Opportunities</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"22px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:22px\">Our Words!</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a nutshell, <strong>startup incubators </strong>offer business owners the flexibility and resources they need to succeed. They provide low-rent leases with a minimum liability of owning the business space. <strong>Startup incubators</strong> are organizations/agencies that can take the leap of faith and build your business.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The lease amounts are locked in for a long term (5 – 10 years), so the businesses get time to establish themselves without worrying about rent increases or unexpected expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also:</strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/mvp-how-important-is-it-for-business-idea-implementation-in-2022/\">MVP: How Important Is It For Business Idea Implementation In 2022</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/How-Business-Incubators-Help-New-Startups-From-Scratch.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-15 13:06:27','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(377,'Advantages Of Automated Data Extraction Services In 2022','advantages-of-automated-data-extraction-services-in-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data extraction services are continuously gaining importance as more and more companies are emerging with a great volume of unstructured and semistructured data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is evident that if your data is structured, it can be processed and analyzed more precisely than an unstructured one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fortunately, we are available with <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data extraction automation</a> </strong>tools that help with fetching out data from multiple sources. Companies can use automated data extraction tools to pull data from various sources, and it helps them save their resources, efforts, and much more. Let\'s find out what else you can leverage.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First, we\'ll start with a quick introduction to <strong>data extraction services</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">What Are Data Extraction Services?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The process of converting unstructured or semistructured data into a structured manner is known as data extraction. And this structured data provides valuable insights that can be used for other purposes like reporting and analytics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data extraction, for example, can automate invoice processing and enable automatic payments, VAT compliance checks, record-keeping, or accounting.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Businesses can use this automation to conduct further analysis and include these findings in their reports.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">How Can Data Extraction Services Be Useful For Your Business?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Monitor Brand Reputation</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Comparative Advantage Analysis</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Conducting Comprehensive Researching</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Catalog New Product Listings</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Gathering Price Data</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This data helps with automation operations and valuable insights and analytics for decision-making.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To know it further, you should also be aware of <strong>data extraction automation.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:18px\">Why Is Data Extraction Automation Critical?</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Automated data extraction is a blessing for big businesses requiring minimal time but significant resources. Following are the most important advantages of practicing <strong>data extraction automation</strong>:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">1. Quick Processing</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Manual Data entry takes longer and is more prone to errors. Companies would save time by not having to re-enter data, and they would be able to extract data faster due to auto-extracting data with data extraction processing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">2. Low Risk Of Errors</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is a surprising yet realistic fact that automated data extraction can reduce the possibility of errors occurring up to 80% compared to manuals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">3. Cost Saver</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Manual processes are time-consuming and expensive. Today, more and more companies are tilting towards automation just for <strong>data extraction services</strong>. This change will surely take them away from the unnecessary wastage of resources and will work as a great alternative.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">4. Scalability</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data extraction automation</strong> is important for helping large-scale companies with data collection. Otherwise, users would have to manually filter through sources to gather this information if these tools are not used.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip -</strong><strong><em> </em></strong><em>Manual processing limits an organization\'s ability to dive into collected data, regardless of how much data it consumes.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses can improve the amount of data deployed for specific use cases by automating extraction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">5. Efficiency</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Efficiency is the key benefit of practicing automated <strong>data extraction services</strong>. Data extraction technologies with RPA, AI, and ML features to speed up the process of discovering and gathering relevant data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Note -</strong> Organizations that use data extraction technologies save time on data-driven operations, allowing them to spend more time extracting valuable insights from data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Let\'s Conclude</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data extraction automation</strong> should be a part of every business strategy. With this, companies can efficiently control and retrieve data from various origin systems into one central system. By using an automated tool, the information can further be used in future events.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hope you found this blog valuable and right to your expectations. If you have a query or urgent requirement for <strong>data extraction services</strong>, you can contact us.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Read Also:</strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/6-industries-that-need-to-outsource-data-entry-services/\">6 INDUSTRIES THAT NEED TO OUTSOURCE DATA ENTRY SERVICES</a> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Advantages-Of-Automated-Data-Extraction-Services-In-2022.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-11 07:43:15','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(378,'Avoid These Mistakes When Outsourcing Data Entry Services','avoid-these-mistakes-when-outsourcing-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses always look out for ways and means of cutting down on the costs of doing business, particularly in today’s economic climate. One of the ways to achieve this is to<strong> outsource data entry services</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>This is where you farm out the work that needs to be done to a third party and let them do it for you. Many elements make up a business, one of which is </em><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>online data entry services</em></a></strong><em><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">.</a></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You will find that there are different mistakes that you make when you <strong>outsource data entry service</strong>s to companies out there that offer <strong><em>online data entry services</em></strong>. Not all of them will turn out to be the best, and this is what this blog is all about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, let’s just start!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Mistakes You Must Avoid for a Better Outsourcing Experience</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">1. Jumping To Multiple Options Rather Than Addressing The Root Causes</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this digital age, companies realize the value of flexibility. Therefore, they cobble together their partnerships with small outsourcing agencies - usually with multiple suppliers - to maintain flexibility and efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the other hand, some outsourcing clients are only concerned about looking at multiple service providers rather than sticking to one option and resolving the issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip - </strong>Rather than reflexively criticizing the service provider, clients of <strong><em>online data entry services</em></strong> should take the time to look over real causes. Here working with one agency will also work out for your business in the long run.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">2. Thinking Only About Solutions But Not About Issues</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most prevalent error today is that everyone is focusing only on solutions, which is simple to do but an erroneous act when you <strong>outsource data entry services</strong>. However, this is an understanding among many that purchasing the latest technologies will only generate results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Note -</strong> Instead, before signing any service contracts; you should spend time understanding your business issues critical to addressing or the outcomes they can attain after getting resolved.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This not just entails conversing with business partners and users, but will also assist in re-imagining problems or allowing engagements in hitherto untapped business areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">3. Play Hardball On Terms And Conditions</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you <strong>outsource data entry service</strong>, your discussions should not be insisting on harsh conditions that might harm the provider’s business model and cause the customer to bite back.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Note -</strong> When negotiating, the goal should be to guarantee that the provider complies with the organization’s expectations while also ensuring to avoid putting the provider in the most difficult situation possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">4. Over Belief Over One Option</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you <strong>outsource data entry services</strong>, your approach should not be rigid but completely open. Many companies make the error of considering a single option rather than asking for multiple options available in the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even if you are sure about the partner you are working with, we will still suggest you go for more positives in other alternatives too. This can also bring that change in your performance&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>A single wrong act can ruin any intelligent work. </em>So be mindful when you choose the <strong><em>online data entry services</em></strong> provider.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">5. Fails To Come Up Full-Proof Strategy</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The transfer of information from a company to an <strong><em>online data entry services </em></strong><em>provider</em> is centered on a commitment, which necessitates extensive preparation and oversight. Companies that fail to implement a turnaround strategy for <strong><em>online data entry services</em></strong> are more likely to incur profit delays or losses, a loss of stakeholder trust and support, and business disruption.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:24px\">Let’s Wrap Up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customers and suppliers must comprehend any relationship with a clear and mutually agreed-upon baseline environment – encompassing procedures, systems, service levels, volumes, contracts, and exclusions – and accurate knowledge transfer planning.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>They should develop contingency preparations and mitigate the impact of significant company activities. But, most significantly, they should put together a competent transition team or program management that can deal with unexpected events for your <strong><em>online data entry services</em></strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Be inventive, and don’t get bogged down by constraints.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read:</strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/real-reason-for-failed-product-in-amazon-account-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Rea</a><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/real-reason-for-failed-product-in-amazon-account-management/\">l Reason For Failed Product In Amazon Account Management</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Avoid-These-Mistakes-When-Outsourcing-Data-Entry-Services.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-07-04 08:40:34','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(379,'Real Reason For Failed Product In Amazon Account Management','real-reason-for-failed-product-in-amazon-account-management','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Selling on Amazon might be a good decision, but it’s not always easy. If a seller doesn’t know what they are doing, then their business will drastically fail to thrive in the future.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to a study, only 48 percent of products launched with <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-advertising-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon PPC consulting</a></strong> succeed. It’s a high number, but it’s not as high as it should be. Amazon is the single largest marketplace in the world, and millions of products are being launched every year on the platform.<strong><em> But why are we seeing such a high failure rate of products on Amazon?</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this blog, we will look at some of the reasons why Amazon seller businesses fail and how we can avoid these problems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s read out the real ground behind your failure in product <strong>Amazon Account Management</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Not Clear With The Strategies</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Any product selling strategy on Amazon cannot survive or thrive without the proper understanding of the market basics and long-term visions. Some strategies like targeting a specific audience, when or how to run promotional ads, <strong>Amazon store consulting</strong>, etc., require a strong view from the seller or advertiser.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Thus, you need to be clear with your strategies for your futuristic goals if you want to make your product prevail across the platform.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Lack Of Market Research</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Products with high demand and little competition don’t just appear out of nowhere. Finding the most excellent Amazon items to sell takes time, and each decision you make should be based on reliable research, and that means a lot of market research.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Not Selling According To Your Specialization</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>If you try wearing someone else’s shoe, you will definitely fall over. </strong>Not selling as per your certain specifications will only lend you to significant problems as you do not own enough expertise.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>To avoid such scenarios, </strong>you can go for market research and choose your favorite item to sell on Amazon (if you are a beginner). Still, for the active Amazon sellers, we would recommend they reconsider their strategies related to their current products. And if nothing is working out, they can also switch to another product niche.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Not Having In-Depth Knowledge Of SEO For Amazon Account Management</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The A9 ranking algorithm’s primary goal is to increase the number of sales on Amazon. As a result, it suggests things that are most likely to be purchased by clients. The items with the highest purchase likelihood are ranked first, followed by those with lower buy likelihood, and so on. Still, many fail to leverage this worthy opportunity for their <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/store-creation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon store consulting.</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Standard Marketing Strategies</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All of your SEO efforts will be for naught if your marketing plan fails. It only causes hassles and income loss. That is to say, Amazon Ads. However, don’t just slap together a few ads, post them, and expect conversions to appear out of nowhere. Before your customers even realize it, you need to know what they want.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>You’re wasting time and money if you just randomly post Amazon advertising all over the place with no notion who your target buyer is.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Shipment Delays</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Delays in delivery might be disastrous for your <strong>Amazon store consulting</strong>. These ramifications affect not just you as a seller but also your warehouse personnel and, in the end, your customers. ‘<strong><em>Customer satisfaction is heavily influenced by how quickly you fulfill orders.’</em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to Amazon product performance, your active participation in the current products sets the different standards for your upcoming products. On-time deliveries keep your customers pleased and boost the performance of your <strong>Amazon store consulting</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Conclusion</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The easiest method to avoid the above scenarios for better <strong>amazon account management</strong> is to plan ahead of time so that your company is ready to pick up the slack if situations emerge that are beyond your control. If you can reduce the danger of delivery delays, your <strong>Amazon store consulting</strong> and conversion rates will likely increase, your rankings will improve, and your revenue will also get better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Real-Reason-For-Failed-Product-In-Amazon-Account-Management.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-29 07:30:27','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(380,'Why Go For Manual Transcription Services, But Not Automated?','why-go-for-manual-transcription-services-but-not-automated','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The significance of manual audio <strong>transcription services</strong> for the top marketing agencies will not fade away, that\'s for sure. As they are more accurate, people can feel more connected with its transcripted content than automated services, and that\'s why it is more expensive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can easily find reliable companies offering such services for your<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> <strong>social media marketing services.</strong> </a>But, it\'s a hassle if you go for a company that provides automated <strong>transcription services.</strong> You will have to pay a lot for the service but don\'t get the accuracy that you deserve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>First, let\'s make it clear for people who are unsure whether to go for automatic or manual transcription</em>.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Machine transcription always requires improvement, not just in terms of upgradation but also due to its limited understanding of given tasks. Sometimes its results can be disjointed and nonsensical, and if we talk worse, it is often misleading also.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While manual transcription comes with an in-depth understanding of the given context, for human transcription, bringing out the real root of the content becomes very easy compared to automated transcription.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>It\'s always better to outsource your transcription services to those agencies that mitigate problems with a hybrid transcription approach for your social media marketing services</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hybrid translation automation is a strategy that includes both automatic and human translation strategies. You could, for example, use automation to start work with a crawler. After that, you use a manual technique to assess and approve the job.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, you can use machine translation to assist linguists and improve results. Combining these three strategies helps you address the issues while also reaping the rewards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Here is more on the benefits of transcription services for social media marketing services:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">1. Increase Accessibility</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Transcripts can considerably speed up a video editor\'s process in industries where audio or video material plays a significant role for the top marketing agencies. Editors can designate areas of a written document where all revisions must be made at once and then return to editing. Dangling between different things consumes a lot of time and results in less productivity.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip -</strong> With a transcript, editors won\'t have to switch back and forth between viewing and editing during the process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">2. Boost The Value Of Your Content</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many firms use transcription services to make video information searchable for their <strong>social media marketing services</strong>. If a video is transcribed or captioned, Google algorithms can read the transcriptions and figure out what the video\'s content is.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Depending on the length of your video or audio, you may be able to include helpful information on a variety of topics in restricted content. Transcripts of these longer audios or videos may indicate natural dividing points between different themes. Each transcript may be divide into multiple pages or blog entries on your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">3. Improve Turnaround Time</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to <strong>product data entry services</strong>, they may respond quickly once researchers have the information. The figures are well-defined, and trends can be discerned, and this isn\'t always the case with qualitative <strong>product data entry services</strong>, especially when captured digitally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before evaluating qualitative research, a researcher needs to complete a large amount of labor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Outsource Your Transcription Services To Tech2Globe</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to transcribing outsourcing for top marketing agencies, error-free services are essential. We offer excellent and cost-effective <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/transcription-services\">transcription outsourcing at Tech2Globe</a> by leveraging the best transcription process through skilled personnel and cutting-edge technology. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We provide medical transcription, business transcription, legal transcription, video/audio transcription, market research transcription, and academic transcription, among other services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Let\'s Close It</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From an audio transcription point of view, automation is a blessing. But, when it comes to the final product and its quality, companies would prefer a manual service over an automated one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Why-Go-For-Manual-Transcription-Services-But-Not-Automated.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-28 13:01:36','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(381,'Know Why Do Reviews Matter For SEO Services India?','know-why-do-reviews-matter-for-seo-services-india','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have evidence from multiple studies that have been carried out to help determine the exact impact that both the positive and negative reviews have on <strong>SEO services</strong>, like the number of sales, product awareness, conversion rate, profitability of a business, etc.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Still, we say there is much more to it than just this, and we will try exploring some of them.<strong> So let’s start reading!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">How Do Google Reviews Influence Professional Seo Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well, what we have observed is that Google believes in the effectiveness of word-of-mouth marketing. The amount and quality of reviews are used to determine the search position. In addition, customers utilize internet reviews to confirm their buying decisions, and search engines like Google follow this suit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Considering that both users and search engines have almost the same purpose, it should not come as a shock. Google wants to sift through the vast internet in order to bring you the most relevant information, service, or product in the shortest time possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>In reality, reviews function almost identically to crowd-sourced recommendations.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Now let’s keep SEO expert services aside for a little while and see how reviews practically help the best SEO company in USA to grow.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Having four and five-star ratings demonstrates that your <strong>best SEO company in USA</strong> can be trusted to keep its commitments. </li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Customers can be more inclined to choose you over competitors as a result of this.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Having positive feedback increases your chances of convincing individuals to pay more for your products or services. In fact, research has found that consumers feel more secure about their investment and spend roughly 31% more on items and <strong>SEO expert services</strong> from companies with excellent ratings.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Note -</strong> It is evident that seven out of ten consumers trust an internet review as much as a personal recommendation, making reviews as effective as personal recommendations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Does that mean Negative Reviews can also pose a significant threat to a business’s reputation? </em></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Negative reviews can harm a company’s goodwill, profitability, and reliability. It is a surprising fact as a single poor review can turn away about 22% of clients, while three unfavorable reviews can turn away 59 percent of an <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/seo-for-small-business\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>SEO agency USA</strong>.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>A single negative review might cost you heavily on customer retention rate, with 40% of customers reporting that reading a negative review makes them want to shop somewhere else.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>People are hesitant to buy from companies that have poor or no ratings. Thus you can also go for the best <strong>SEO agency usa</strong> to get your reviews improved.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>According to research, about 86 percent of potential customers will not buy products from a <strong>SEO expert services </strong>company that has received poor evaluations. If these unfavorable evaluations appear in Google searches, a company could lose up to 70% of its future clients.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Online reviews are sure to lead people either towards or away from your business in an era when the internet has taken over the world.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip-<em> </em></strong><em>Making client happiness a priority in your business with the help of a </em><strong><em>SEO agency USA will</em></strong><em> only benefit your sales and profitability.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">OUR TAKE!</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>best SEO company in USA</strong> with a lot of positive reviews and ratings will likely rank higher in the SERPs. Whenever you plan, whether it is for marketing, selling, or making any goal projection, <strong>make sure you add focus on the reviews part too!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The removal of anonymous assessments by Google had a negative impact on many websites. This alone shows that the number of online reviews has a direct impact on a website’s rating. Furthermore, it highlights that the algorithms value both the amount and quality of reviews.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read:</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/10-benefits-of-social-media-for-business/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">10 BENEFITS OF SOCIAL MEDIA FOR BUSINESS</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Know-Why-Do-Reviews-Matter-For-SEO-Services-India.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-21 10:32:43','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(382,'Online Data Entry Services & Applications To Improve Healthcare Data Management?','online-data-entry-services-applications-to-improve-healthcare-data-management','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Online data entry services </strong>are becoming ubiquitous assets in the healthcare industry. The breadth, volume, and velocity of data must be managed efficiently to facilitate the management of processes and support decision-making in the health sector. It is an over-sensitive industry compared to others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Many applications facilitate health data management and aid the healthcare industry in granular data collection for improving outcomes.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Before we directly jump onto the applications, let’s first discuss the importance of outsourcing in the healthcare industry.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As health care companies look for affordable solutions for managing their data, some consider outsourcing as an option. While performing various data entry applications in-house, especially in the health industry, has its own set of challenges when it comes to online data entry services are expensive and time-consuming, the possibility of errors, missing deadlines, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Four data input outsourcing applications from online data entry services for better healthcare management.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">1. Data protection</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During these data transfers, many cyber-attacks have been documented as crooks stealing or manipulating the records. These threats are causing a lot of concern in the healthcare business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, it is very likely that patient information can be well exposed to hacker attacks, even when well-preserved. Given the amount of data in the information system, manually covering all of these attack points is unfeasible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Using outsourcing to secure health records from cyber-attacks, on the other hand, is promising and fruitful. It’s because they can spot potential access holes in the system. </em></strong>Furthermore, the outsourcing agencies have the ability to diagnose the system in order to find and repair faults that can affect a data management system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">2. Automation of Data Flow</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When patients enter a medical facility, the hospital takes their records on a regular basis. To avoid any error in the <strong>online data entry services</strong>, they base all of their information provided in the preceding stage. The number of patients at the hospital can be difficult to manage if the data is managed manually. Also, editing the data itself can be perplexing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Outsource data entry services</a></strong>, on the other hand, automates data flow from one point to another, making the entire process easier. The hospital’s office personnel will have access to the information once it has all the input in the system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">3. Decision-Making And Data Analysis</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When talking about dealing with large amounts of health data,<strong> outsourcing data entry services</strong> can help you out with its professional data analysis and interpretation. Critical data points from health records get extracted, analyzed, and then presented to help the user to comprehend the strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Outsourcing can aid in the decision-making process when it comes to medical operations or patient info mapping.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">4. Data Transmission Simplification</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Patients, hospitals, telephone employees, and other third parties, all share health records with legal rights on a regular basis. As a result, there should be a simple and convenient manner to reach all of the needed recipients on time while conveying this data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Outsourcing agencies ensure that they transfer records quickly and securely. Outsource data entry services can help to limit the number of times addresses are changed or sent to the wrong person.&nbsp;</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read</strong>: <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/6-industries-that-need-to-outsource-data-entry-services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">6 INDUSTRIES THAT NEED TO OUTSOURCE DATA ENTRY SERVICES</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Let’s Conclude</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we all are aware of the worth of medical data, the healthcare sector needs to be treated with utmost care. Thus, an effective data security system is required in data management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As discussed above, manual data processing has its drawbacks compared to <strong>outsourcing data entry services</strong>; a healthcare practitioner cannot bear any serious hole in the data management system as it is directly linked to the health information and privacy of its patients.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Applications-To-Improve-Healthcare-Data-Management.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-18 09:10:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(383,'Tech2Globe Web Solutions Records 100% Five-Star Rating for May on Clutch','tech2globe-web-solutions-records-100-five-star-rating-for-may','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe Web Solutions Records 100% Five-Star Rating for May on Clutch</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since we started our company back in 2014, our goals have always been to help companies make their digital products or services profitable. In order for us to accomplish this, we needed to know exactly what our clients think of our work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is why we created our profile on Clutch. The feedback we get will let us know whether or not we’re on the right track and what we can do to improve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re happy to see that our efforts have been generously rewarded by our ever-supportive partners. This is because we managed to close off the month of May with a 100% five-star rating.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below is the review from our last project of the month and we want to share it with all of you for two reasons. First, to show how far we’ve come since joining this platform to gain feedback. Second, to share the amazing development that’s come about because of the publication of this review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/nLvF_lM21_dRx9YQ4SbOuQghYyVQ5lNWfRr8yxqMXZH9Nonq3jyJFf9oxo1kafHI7kweoOBGBgrib-AxJHLgAv9yOzGA2QtP8evZZXUqLd_TAZtzUx_sKmA78ZhWvleoUDEq8Dn54hlyOLGWZg\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The company that we were working with was a business that manufactures lighting for vehicles. They were looking for a reliable partner that can provide graphics and web development services for their various projects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We went through a few test projects with them before they ultimately chose us to be their partner. While we can’t disclose any details regarding the engagement, those interested can get some information from the review itself on our Clutch profile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The one development that we can highlight as a result of this review’s publication is that we were mentioned quite favorably by The Manifest. For those unfamiliar with The Manifest, they’re another B2B platform that helps companies find their ideal project partners by ranking the top performers in every industry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://themanifest.com/in/bpo/medical-billing/companies/delhi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Manifest says that</a> Tech2Globe Web Solutions is the number one ranked service provider in Delhi. While this is an unexpected development, it is most certainly a welcome one. This ranking validates much of the work that goes into our projects and this ranking will serve as added motivation for our team.<br>If you’re interested in our services for your business\'s continued growth, please visit our website to get acquainted with everything we have to offer. We also encourage you to <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">get in touch</a> with our team directly for any questions or inquiries on how to begin a collaboration. We look forward to hearing from you soon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also Read: <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/clutch-recognizes-tech2globe-web-solutions-llp-as-indias-leading-digital-strategy-services-provider-for-2022/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Clutch Recognizes Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP as India’s Leading Digital Strategy Services Provider for 2022</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Tech2Globe-Web-Solutions-Records.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-17 11:09:45','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(384,'Store Creation On Shopify Development Company In 15 Minutes','store-creation-on-shopify-development-company-in-15-minutes','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Starting an internet business can be exciting for anyone, yet not so easy. You\'ll have to deal with a variety of issues, including how to avoid breaking down, how to optimize your landing pages, and what to call your company. However, <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify development company</a></strong> provides excellent solutions to all of these issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can use <strong>Shopify development company</strong> services, whether you\'re new to eCommerce and preparing to gear up with your first website, or <strong>hire Shopify experts</strong> seeking a unique design to beat your competition in 2022. Shopify has an excellent customer satisfaction record.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This guide will show you how to get started with Shopify Store development and start with your eCommerce website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">Step-By-Step Instructions For Creating A Website On Shopify Development Company</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 1: Sign Up On The Shopify Platform And Follow The Steps</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First and foremost, go to Shopify.com. Start by entering your personal information and clicking \"Start Free Trial.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After that, you\'ll be sent a questionnaire to assist you with the next steps. You must identify the size of your company and the category in which you sell. You\'re all set to begin your <strong>Shopify development company</strong> journey with just a bit more information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Stick with a store name that will allow consumers to grasp your website with just one glance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 2: Publish Your Products On The Internet</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To add products to your new eCommerce website, go to the left-hand menu and select the \"Products\" option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While building your store on <strong>Shopify development company</strong>, you\'ll need to fill in numerous details about the products you\'re adding, including the title, description, photos, and pricing. You can also include additional information such as the weight or the country of origin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> See how it functions; start by adding very few items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 3: Choose the Most Appropriate Theme For Your Company</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Currently, your site is utilizing the default theme, which you selected while filling out the questionnaire to establish your <strong>Shopify development company</strong>. You can improve the appearance of your Shopify website by going to \"Online Store\" and then selecting \"Themes\" from the left side.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may now see your current theme and browse a variety of other themes for your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Even if you are dissatisfied with the templates you have chosen from the free or paid alternatives, alter them to your liking, or you can <strong>hire Shopify experts </strong>for better suggestions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 4: Begin To Personalize Your Home Page And Other Pages</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The left-side menu allows you to change the header and footer of your home page. You have the option to rearrange, edit, or delete the parts. All of your changes will be reflected in the preview section once you\'ve saved them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find the \"Online Store\" option, pick it, and select \"Pages\" to add more pages to your Shopify store development website. You have the same editing options for the sections on the home page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Always include a FAQs page with all of the answers to your company\'s questions. This will not only improve user usability but will also address their concerns over their data. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hiring Shopify experts</a></strong> can also work positively for you in this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 5: Customize Shipping &amp; Delivery Options</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The next step is to navigate to the settings and select the \"Shipping &amp; Delivery\" option. This is required for a better user experience when purchasing a product. For your site development on <strong>Shopify development company</strong>, you may enter all of the details here to make it easier to calculate shipping charges and labels for every order placed by a customer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Set the best pricing for several destinations, whether domestic, local or worldwide.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 6: Purchase a Domain</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is the most crucial step in establishing your Shopify Store, as your domain name determines whether or not people will remember your company. So pick a domain (either buy it or connect to it) that is memorable and easily reflects the value of your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To do so, go to \"Domains.\" You\'ll have immediate access to a few options or <strong>hire Shopify experts</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most significant benefit of using Shopify for this stage is that you can either purchase a domain via the Shopify platform or transfer an existing domain.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> While searching for a domain name, you may come across alternatives that allow you to use your initials as the URL, but a professional name is suggested.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Step 7: Create a Business Plan and Launch It</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You won\'t be able to launch your Shopify eCommerce website until you choose a plan or without <strong>hiring a Shopify expert</strong>. However, this does not imply that all preceding steps were in vain. Of course, your website is up and running, but it still requires a password to access, and when someone attempts to visit it, a holding page appears.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip:</strong> To make Shopify store development fully accessible and visible to customers, you\'ll need to find a plan that fits within your financial constraints.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Let\'s Conclude</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building and running a successful and well-known internet store is no longer a pipe dream. <strong>Shopify development company</strong> is an incredible platform for getting your business up and running quickly without any programming experience, making it one of the top eCommerce platforms. It also builds up confidence based on the present figures provided above.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We summarized the benefits of the <strong>Shopify development company</strong> in this post, and we\'re confident that it will satisfy the demands of Shopify.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Store-Creation-On-Shopify-Development-Company-In-15-Minutes-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-06-04 03:17:45','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(385,'4 Tips on What To Know Before Applying Data Analytics','4-tips-on-what-to-know-before-applying-data-analytics','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>The world of data analytics is getting bigger day by day.</em></strong> Companies are investing billions of dollars in this field to get the best insights to make meaningful business decisions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, you must make sure that you are prepared before considering data analytics for getting the best <strong>data management solutions</strong> or even as an individual.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This blog looks at four tips that you need to keep in mind before using <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-analytics-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">big data analytics</a> </strong>and how top data management companies<strong> </strong>can give you a helping hand in this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let\'s get started!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">How Does Big Data Analytics Make The Difference?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data Analytics has become increasingly popular with companies wanting to know more about their customers. The process can be pretty daunting, but there are some key things that you can do to make your experience a positive one if you make use of <strong>data analysis in research</strong> precisely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Why Is It So Important For Businesses?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>Data analytics help businesses majorly in 2 ways:&nbsp;</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>They can identify trends and patterns, track customer behavior, and monitor performance.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Big data analytics</strong> can help businesses make better decisions by providing insights into marketing, product development, and customer service.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip - </strong><em>By understanding the data, businesses can make more informed decisions that improve their bottom line.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let\'s Jump on to the real tips listed by our data experts that can help you somewhere in your business journey:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Imagine Your Task To Be A Treasure Hunt</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Consider <strong>data analysis in research</strong> in the same way that you would seek buried gold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To put it another way, data mining is similar to gold mining, and you\'re sifting through granularity or bashing your way through data searching for valuable gems. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-management-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data management solutions</a> </strong>could take a long time and be exhausting, but eventually, it will help you lead your way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tip -</strong><em> With perseverance, you will be able to uncover valuable insights into both possibilities and risks that you may have otherwise overlooked.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>Try Not Delegating Big Data Analysis</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many managers and business owners may believe that hiring a young professional is the most incredible way to get excellent <strong>data analysis in research</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, as per our experts who perform a lot of <strong>data analysis in research</strong>. You\'ll almost certainly hear that what you want to do is allocate this project to the most competent, most experienced team member you can find. In other words, the people you want to undertake this work are the ones who are unlikely to have the time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>So, please consider this work to do with the best expertise as it is similar to searching for buried treasure. The knowledge you gain could be beneficial in the future.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Give Hands-On Experiments</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Experimenting with AB testing and pilot studies, for example, can yield data of outstanding worth at a low cost with<strong> </strong><strong>data management solutions</strong>. This will not just tell you discrepancies in your functions but will also improve your performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Spend Time Poring Over Useless Facts</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here\'s a unique notion. Perhaps you could spend some time looking at seemingly irrelevant data, such as cross-tabulations of time-stamped sales receipts, website analytics data, third-party transaction logs, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You never know what you\'re going to come across. And the best insights can occasionally come from the most unexpected places. Working with <strong>top data management companies</strong> can help you do this efficiently and effortlessly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Let\'s Wrap Up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses today have a lot of data at their fingertips. They have access to data from every department and industry, not to mention every customer who has interacted with their business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>It enables businesses to tap into their internal data and use it. Also, enterprises incorporate data into their operations to make the company more efficient and profitable. </strong>Eventually, <strong>big data analytics</strong> help businesses by providing them with every helpful service that a business requires the most to survive and thrive uninterruptedly. You can contact Tech2Globe <strong>top data management companies</strong> for any of such tasks for your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/4-Tips-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-28 12:42:43','2026-06-01 11:30:31','2026-06-01 11:30:31'),(386,'Amazon Account Suspension: Yes! You Can Overcome This Nightmare','amazon-account-suspension-yes-you-can-overcome-this-nightmare','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>\'An Amazon account suspension can be a nightmare for any seller\'.</em></strong><em> </em>You have worked hard to establish a successful business, and then suddenly, everything comes to a grinding halt.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During this event, Amazon will shut down your account, and you will lose access to all the data stored in your Amazon Seller Account.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Reviewing the Amazon marketplace for new products, updating HMAs, and pricing your products correctly are only a few things you have to do to keep your business running smoothly.&nbsp;</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Before delving into the topic deeply, we would clarify that a seller is not at all loss; after getting an amazon</strong><strong> account suspended</strong><strong>,</strong><strong> it still has some odds of retaining its credibility.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This blog will give you some insight into what you can do to get your account reinstated and some high-risk actions you might want to avoid to keep your account safe. <strong>Let\'s start without any postponement.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">When Can We Call An Account Suspension On Amazon?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Terms of Service (TOS) on Amazon define what merchants can and cannot do. Your account will be frozen if the platform finds you in violation. As it would be impractical to monitor millions of accounts physically, many <strong>amazon suspensions</strong> are handled by Amazon\'s AI bots, which can sometimes lead to erroneous <strong>amazon suspensions</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Beware, And Don\'t Mess Up The Difference Between The Below 3s</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Suspension</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It means an Amazon seller still has some scope to put forward an<strong> amazon suspension appeal</strong> for the account retention of the account.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>Denied</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This indicates that the <strong>amazon suspension appeal</strong> you had sent in the earlier stage (Suspension) has been rejected. But still, you own a chance to submit a revised plan of action within a specific period.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Banned</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Getting \"banned\" is the worst scenario for the sellers. In simple words- <strong>You\'re Out Now</strong>. All your <strong>Amazon suspension appeal</strong> has failed to satisfy the platform, not just once but several times. There is no point in sending any customized emails to them, as they will not be reading any of them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Note-</strong> <strong><em>\'A seller loses money every minute their amazon account is suspended! It can take weeks or months for sellers to be reinstated in such cases.\'</em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s not possible if you\'ve already been caught in a \"Banned\" situation for anyone to take you out of it.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>But if you are still at the very beginning, you can apply the below best practices suggested by our amazon experts that can help you come out of such a catastrophe.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Ask Amazon To Put An Annotation On Your Account</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>Read Your Listings To Check For Possible Flags</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Sellers On Amazon Should Archive And Close Old Listings.</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>Don\'t Sell Similar Items</strong>.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong>For Additional Assistance, You Can Download Amazon Seller App</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Let\'s Conclude</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even the most attentive Amazon sellers are subject to <strong>amazon suspension</strong>. If your Amazon vendor profile gets suspended, don\'t panic. You can rapidly have your <strong>amazon suspension</strong> lifted if you follow the appropriate steps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The experts at Tech2Globe can help you get your Amazon account back on track. Our experienced team will collaborate with you to design an effective, well-crafted <strong>amazon suspension appeal</strong> package that can be delivered in as little as 24 hours.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To safeguard your profits, reverse your <strong>amazon suspension</strong>, and keep your seller account operational, contact our dedicated Tech2Globe team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Must Read: <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon Consulting Services</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Amazon-Account-Suspension-Yes-You-Can-Overcome-This-Nightmare.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-24 13:49:59','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(387,'Q-Commerce: The Next Generation eCommerce Business Model','q-commerce-the-next-generation-ecommerce-business-model','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shoppers want to buy and have it delivered faster without paying heavily. Q-commerce meets precisely this type of standard requirements made by the customers using social media and other digital channels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Covid has aided consumers’ digital adoption in the retail business over the last two years. Thus, enterprises are increasingly attempting to embrace speedy delivery of commodities to their clients as a result of the shift in consumer behavior in the post covid world with their </em><strong><em>free online store services.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This type of <strong>eCommerce</strong> <strong>business</strong> is gaining traction in India’s burgeoning <strong>eCommerce market</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Here in this blog, we have tried giving you an overview of this modern Q-commerce meaning. Along with this, we will tell you its growing impact on the Indian eCommerce market and Economy.&nbsp;</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">What Does Q-Commerce Mean?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In other words, Quick or Q-commerce is define as a buy-to-delivery process that takes less than an hour.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This rapid <strong>eCommerce business</strong> model combines the advantages of the <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">eCommerce market</a> </strong>(doing business over the internet) to develop a new business model, and it meets the need for swift product delivery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">What’s Making Q-Commerce Attractive?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>It also boasts of a significantly higher NPS or net promoter score.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Provides a quick shopping experience to the customers</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Swift loading time for loading online shopping carts&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Requires few steps to make a purchase which ultimately helps the seller with additional transactions</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To serve orders in a short period of time, companies typically open up dark storefronts or partner with local grocery stores.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">How Is Indian Online Grocery Market Doing Currently, And What Scope Of Expansion Does It Hold?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From US$ 3.95 billion in FY21 to US$ 26.93 billion in 2027, the Indian online grocery market is predicted to develop at a CAGR of 33%. Thanks to the increased adoption of <strong>free online stores</strong> in online services such as e-commerce and edtech, India’s consumer digital economy is expected to grow from US$ 537.5 billion in 2020 to US$ 1 trillion by 2030.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Q-Commerce Influence In the Indian eCommerce Market</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Blinkit, Swiggy, Zomato, and Zepto are all successful instances of <strong>Indian q commerce</strong>. The total addressable market for fast commerce in India is expected to be over USD 45 billion, with large metros and tier 1 cities driving demand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>In a nutshell, if the entire procedure - purchase to delivery takes less than an hour, that can referre as Quick or Q-commerce.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Future Of Q-Commerce&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Q-commerce is a relatively new business strategy that is fast gaining traction. Since their inception, many companies have encountered numerous issues, but <strong>Indian Q-commerce</strong> has emerged as a long-term answer for them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Their success can be ascribed to the benefits that such business models provide, as well as the possibility for future expansion. Furthermore, the Covid pandemic has resulted in a consistent shift in customer shopping habits. They are now more oriented toward online, on-demand services, with a preference for convenience above loyalty.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Indian Q-commerce</em></strong><em> has opened up new frontiers in the market for companies to explore.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Such distribution systems can improve over time for increased efficiency and cost-effectiveness while also expanding the reach of these <strong>free online stores</strong> to more clients throughout the world. Still, this model’s potential also makes it one of the most profitable company models on the market today.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Let’s Wrap Up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Quick commerce is a relatively new notion in the<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development\"> <strong>eCommerce market</strong></a>, and it represents a largely untapped possibility. It is likely to grow in popularity as individuals seek more convenient alternatives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While judging whether it’s suitable for your firm right now can be difficult, it won’t cost you anything to try it out. You can begin by focusing on one region at a time, ironing out any bugs in the system, assessing the results, and adjusting your strategy to the needs of the area.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Q-Commerce.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-20 13:28:19','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(388,'All You Need To Know About Mobile IoT Apps','all-you-need-to-know-about-mobile-iot-apps','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How many times have you doubted whether you have switched off the dishwasher or not or wondered if you have logged out from the site or not? Now, it will be easier for you to check as devices will remind you of the action you have to take. You can control devices remotely from your workplace or anywhere you want. This post is all about<strong> IoT in <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mobile app development</a></strong> and everything you need to know about it.<strong> IoT technology</strong> is a fast emerging concept that affects our lives, how we live them, or how we work, and it is a way to grind the way we live.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Further, you will explain<strong> what IoT is</strong> and why we need <strong>IoT-based mobile</strong> apps. Let\'s get most of this trend.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:26px\">What Is IoT?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>IoT technology</strong> is a system of interconnected devices. They are tagged as unique identifiers and can transfer the data over any network with data collection and its distribution over a network. Embedded sensors, processors, and computing hardware made this possible in reality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The idea of IoT was introduced by John Romkey and Simon Hackett back in 1989 when they connected a toaster with the internet. But they later improved the system in 1991, removing all the drawbacks by inventing a robot that could be connected to the internet.<strong> IoT in mobile app development</strong>, such as sensors, medical devices, etc., have emerged as the most useful devices in the current time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s see what its scope is in the mobile app world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Scope Of IoT In Mobile Apps</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>IoT technology</strong> changed people\'s lives as so many devices have developed, which helps consumers make their lives simpler and easier using these devices through the internet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Communication, collection, and connection are the three main parts of IoT. These three C\'s are the backbone of all the procedures and processing behind the IoT.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The three C\'s defined below:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Communication: </strong>to help communicate with the smart devices to carry out the tasks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Connect: </strong>to connect the smart devices with the internet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Collection: </strong>to collect all the data from the connected devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you know why it is the hottest trend? Let\'s see.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Mobile IoT: Hottest Trend</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IoT has invaded all the phases of our life, and it has a significant role in the healthcare, environmental care, and logistics departments.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>IoT technology</strong> has helped people sa people by informing them of everything that happens in their absence. For example, there are fire alarms fitted in every working place, which alert people that something has gone wrong in the building so that they can run away from it safely. The detector has a sensor that tells how quickly fire spreads in the building.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies are also inventing smart locks, which will tell you who invaded your house in your absence. Some IoT devices and software also help you lock your door right from your phone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As we can see, social media has changed our lives, and these <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Social media marketing services</a></strong> are using IoT trends to make it better for their customers. Let\'s see the relationship between IoT and mobile apps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">IoT And Mobile Apps: How Are They Related To Each Other?</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A mobile app works as an intermediary between an IoT device and a Mobile Phone, and the app works as an interface to manage things smartly.<strong> IoT-based Mobile Apps</strong> improve the use of <strong>&nbsp;IoT technology</strong> to make it work more efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, the Nest Smoke Alarm is an incredibly clever gadget that functions as a smoke alarm and notifies your smartphone in the event of an emergency in your house.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although you may control IoT devices from a PC, it is better to have mobile apps that are based on IoT because you can access them remotely from any location.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Wrap-up&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>IoT software development is a significant strategic move for upcoming companies. Companies will not be able to compete with one another if they have not used IoT technologies. The best<strong> IoT-based Mobile Apps</strong> will help companies interact with their customers with a deeper understanding.<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/guide-to-social-media-marketing-strategy-2022/\">Social media marketing</a> services </strong>also use <strong>IoT in mobile app development </strong>for marketing in a better way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There is an excellent possibility of increased use of IoT apps in future markets. Prediction says that investment in IoT apps will help your company grow significantly more in the future. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\"} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/All-You-Need-To-Know-About-Mobile-IoT-Apps.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-18 13:16:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(389,'How To Sell Online With WooCommerce Development?','how-to-sell-online-with-woocommerce-development','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even if you provide delivery services or run a non-profit organization, you need an eCommerce platform for everything. <strong>WooCommerce Development</strong> is the most popular platform out there.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Research says about 8.7% of all the websites use WooCommerce, and it is one of the leading platforms with a 24% market share in the world.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this ultimate guide, you will get to know how to sell services using the plugin WooCommerce. It was created by entrepreneurs for other entrepreneurs and is free to get started. Moreover, <strong>WooCommerce development</strong> is enough to support any large store, and you can sell anything using it. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s see how to get started with your online business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:26px\">An Overview </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Entrepreneurs are the future of online business. We can say an online business is nothing but running your retail shop online using the internet. An entrepreneur like you knows how to crack it with new products and supplements on an online platform.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As per the calculations<em>, over 75% of the population prefer online shopping,</em> and this number is increasing rapidly. Here is a secret! Why don\'t you consult a<strong> WooCommerce Development Company in India </strong>to grow your <strong>online business</strong>?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:26px\">How To Choose Your Audience?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The first step you need to take is to find the right audience. This process will help you take your business to the other level by identifying the niche you need to improve to better your future business strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can choose a product you like the most in case you don\'t have a specific product in mind. Once you have identified what product to choose, you need to identify the audience\'s problems.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example: Are you passionate about cars? Or do you like to play video games? These things can blow up your business ideas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some key points to know your audience:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Spend time in their favorite spot.</li><li>Learn more about them through various surveys.</li><li>Take in-person interviews.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:26px\">How To Choose Your Product?</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The next step is to choose a product for your <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/woocommerce-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WooCommerce website development</a></strong> and see what people want in the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Handcrafted Items: </strong>There are some products that you make on your own such as aesthetic jewelry, paper goods, food items, etc. It is an excellent option for crafty people like you to sell these handcrafted products as a low-cost start-up business.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Digital products:</strong> Online products such as e-books, music, and online courses; do not require any physical format and have low start-up and production costs.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Manufactured Items:</strong> These are the products created, stored, sold, and shipped to you by an in-house or third party. This is a great choice to start your business of dinnerware, shoes, makeup, etc., but it requires high investment and start-up costs.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:26px\">How To Create Your Business?</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you have decided what product is best for you for <strong>WooCommerce website development</strong>, it is time to start your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Take all the legal actions that are necessary for your business. This includes business structure and registering your business. You also need to get tax IDs and essential licenses.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You also need to open a business bank account for professional purposes. This will provide protection, simplicity, and extra benefits to your account.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Then, you need to set up subscription and payment plans for your products.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:26px\">How To Build A Store?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After all these steps, you need to create a website for your online store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Start by creating your website. For this, you need to purchase a domain name and hosting services. Domain names should represent your business and must be easy to remember. Your host defines a place where your website lives and is displayed to the visitors.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Install WordPress, a free website building platform created for people to have all the technical experiences. It also has a highly visual editor that requires no coding experience. But here, a question appears: <strong>What is WooCommerce in WordPress?</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Install<strong> WooCommerce</strong>, an eCommerce platform designed for WordPress. <strong>WooCommerce development</strong> provides all the tools you need to have for selling online: add products, collect payments, set up shipping, create customer accounts, etc.; it can be extended and can help your business grow.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>WooCommerce works as a plugin for WordPress.<strong> WooCommerce Plugin</strong> helps you choose various themes- free or paid that are available on<strong> WooCommerce Website Development</strong>.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You also need to choose a payment gateway to transfer money to your bank account. For this, one great option is <strong>WooCommerce Payments</strong>. It is entirely a free tool and manages all your money transfers, refunds, etc.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Define your taxes rate using the extension<strong> WooCommerce Tax</strong> that automatically corrects your sales tax.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And that\'s all! If you follow these steps, you are not far away from building the online store of your dreams without any hustle and bustle. Let\'s start selling online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re an online store owner, you can do whatever you wish, solve customers\' problems, and you will be able to connect with the people who want to do the same things as you. And all of these things are possible only with the help of a platform called <strong>WooCommerce</strong>. With <strong> WooCommerce Website Development</strong>, you will get all the tools and information you need for your online store and to reach new customers. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":9,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/How-To-Sell-Online-With-WooCommerce-Development.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-13 10:18:09','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(390,'MVP: How Important Is It For Business Idea Implementation In 2022','mvp-how-important-is-it-for-business-idea-implementation-in-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The importance of minimum viable product (MVP) in business ideas is one of the critical concepts that differentiate between successful startups and unsuccessful ones.<strong> A Minimum Viable Product (MVP) is an excellent way to test your business idea on the actual market as early as possible.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>Setting up an </em><strong><em>MVP software</em></strong><em> for your business idea is to save resources, eliminate irrelevant features and rush to profits in a short period.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before you start looking at different avenues to make your concept a reality, you should first look at this blog. We will deeply discuss all the critical elements of <strong>MVP software</strong> related to the growth of any business. Along with a<strong> minimum viable product meaning</strong>, we have listed some tips for you to learn <strong>how to build a minimum viable product.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-large-font-size\">What Is Minimum Viable Product Meaning?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A minimum viable product (MVP) is a development strategy that involves creating a new product or website with just enough features to attract early users. After incorporating feedback from the product\'s initial consumers, the final, comprehensive set of factors is planned and created.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"26px\"}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:26px\">What Can Be The Hidden Purpose Of Creating MVPs?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The MVP\'s primary purpose is to save time and effort by testing how the market responds to your concept before constructing the entire product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>MVPs can assist your business with:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Verify hypotheses about product ideas with real-world data.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Reduce the entire time that it takes for new feature releases to reach the market.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Quickly provide value to your early adopters. The <strong>MVP software</strong> is the quickest path to provide the most value to your initial consumers while also providing you with valuable learnings.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>When you construct a full-fledged product, you can test your brand fit with MVP.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Collect data about user activity that can be used to define future product developments and marketing strategies.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>MVP software</strong> can help you make data-driven decisions by being a key component in your product selection process.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Build a user base before the launch.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>Let\'s talk about why the minimum viable product is important.</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>You can do the following by building and testing a minimum viable product:</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You can save and use your resources by ensuring that you\'re investing in a project that has a good chance of succeeding with <strong>MVP software</strong>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Test to see if the product appeals to potential customers.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Discover the trends you may use to help you design the final version of the product.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Find new buyers and build a potential user base.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Save time &amp; expense on the final product\'s development.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Attract investors sooner rather than later.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5><em>We have different types of MVPs:</em></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Piecemeal MVP</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Concierge MVP</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Wizard Of Oz MVP</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Landing Page MVP</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Email MVP</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4><em>Tips That You Can Follow To Know How To Build A Minimum Viable Product </em></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Identify And Evaluate The Challenges</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can begin by identifying the possible challenges and coming up with their solutions. Through surveys and interviews, learn more about this audience and their actual challenges. Analyzing the market as well. You\'ll ultimately better understand your target market, and your final product should meet their needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Analyze The Competitors</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Maybe there are identical products available that you can evaluate competitors using various techniques available on the market. Install a browser extension to learn about a web page\'s monthly volume, rank, user location, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Make A List Of MVP Features</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>You need to analyze how a user will interact with your product at this step.</em></strong> Build a feature list for each phase. Then highlight those elements and minimize waste, saving money and effort that would have otherwise been wasted on ineffective concepts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Testing</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Move on to developing the product once you\'ve determined the scope of work. You should test your product on a frequent basis while going through the lengthy development process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Let\'s Wrap Up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a nutshell, <strong>MVP software</strong> allows users to focus on the core features of the business, develop them quickly and release them into the market. It also allows you to test it out in real-world scenarios and alter aspects if required.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Till now, we hope that we have enough understanding about <strong>why the minimum viable product is important</strong> and <strong>how to build a minimum viable product </strong>for business idea implementation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>Also Read: </strong></em><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/business-research-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Business Research Services</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":6,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Building-The-Future-Workspace.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-05-12 12:29:26','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(391,'6 INDUSTRIES THAT NEED TO OUTSOURCE DATA ENTRY SERVICES','6-industries-that-need-to-outsource-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nowadays, <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\"><strong>data entry service</strong></a> has a huge demand worldwide and is among the biggest profit-earning outsourcing profiles. Depending on the category of business or industry that requires data entry services. The<strong> data entry services in USA</strong> make use of software, and tools with the latest technologies, which enable them to handle even an ample amount of data. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We all know <strong>product data entry services</strong> play an important role for a business which helps proliferate a company’s progress. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><em>Why is data entry service so crucial? How does it impact several industries? </em></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong><strong>These Industries Should Use Outsource Data Entry</strong> </strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-large-font-size\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-41a5beef-7fff-dddc-8ad5-0f47405dc008\" style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"></span></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have enlisted 6 key industries that are in extreme need to outsource<strong> online data entry services</strong> for their businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>1. RETAIL AND ECOMMERCE</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online stores require far-reaching eCommerce solutions like data entry to catalog procedures merged with image processing. It also manages bulk product uploads, which is what these <strong>online data entry services </strong>are best at.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>2. HEALTHCARE</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accuracy and efficiency are the main focus when you are working with the healthcare industry because medical data management includes the creation and maintenance of patient records, documentation of medical insurances, and needs a consistent eye on the details. Therefore, even a small error in the <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/data-entry-services/\">data entry services</a></strong> can lead to a big misfortune.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>3. IT ENABLED SERVICES</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From BPO to KPO, <strong>data entry services in India</strong> offer significant assistance to operating different B2C and B2B operations. A data entry service is maintained in most IT-enabled services to create and manage a store of digital data for business activities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\">4. <strong>BANKING AND FINANCIAL</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Soaring labor costs and the requirement of accuracy have forced banks to switch to outsourcing <strong>data entry services </strong>and experience regulating daily operations precisely. Professionals\' expertise and years of experience in data entry, provide data entry checks, account openings, and maintenance of various financial or digital records. <strong>Outsourcing data entry service</strong> enable banks and financial institutions to work smoothly and handle their finances and the other core business activities properly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\">5. <strong>TELECOM INDUSTRY</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Telecom is the most popular and easily accessible industry worldwide. As a result, they gather hundreds of confidential records. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Online data entry service</a></strong> assists the telecom industry by taking away their time-consuming work so that they can focus on their core business activities. In addition, they assist them with the expertise in the storage of their confidential records in the database to control the billing system. Therefore, the Telecom industry may find the data entry service an inexpensive and successful option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h4 style=\"font-size:16px\">6. <strong>REAL ESTATE</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The best <strong>data entry service providers</strong> can handle the evaluation of residential and commercial properties, create client databases, and consolidate the details and legal documents. With this, you will be able to put more focus on the real estate customers, and they will be taking care of information or data stored in the system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Why Tech2Globe for Data Entry Outsourcing Services?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Incorrect data entry or errors in data entry might result in wrong insights, potentially leading to bad business decisions. Whether it\'s plans for pricing, product development, or marketing efforts, proper data input ensures that choices are made on solid facts. Data entry accuracy measures how exact, consistent, and complete the information you enter is, which is significant for various reasons. Poor data quality can lead to poor judgments, whereas data security breaches can harm the data owner or user\'s compliance, reputation, or reliability.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Expert data specialists provide correct data entry and conduct frequent audits and inspections to guarantee data quality requirements. The correct way to do proper data entry is to use techniques such as data cleaning, standard data entry procedures, and to be consistent by using data entry procedures.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Faster Turnaround Time </strong> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most companies, whether small or big, confront circumstances in which time is critical. When it comes to data entry, time is a significant aspect since firms with vast volumes of data input need their data to be precisely entered and structured promptly. Most companies assess individual data input service providers based on delivery time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we ensure that our customers receive high-quality data entry services ahead of their deadlines. We have never overrun our clients\' deadlines by following clearly defined data input and labor allocation protocols.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing a data entry project to us involves providing a time estimate for delivery. The turnaround time depends on volume, complexity, and type of data entry. ​To ensure a short data entry turnaround, we have implemented several steps, including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Depending on the urgency of your assignment, we will assign competent data entry workers to accomplish it within a tight timeline.</li><li>We may also assign data entry specialists on concise notice for data entry assignments that must be finished within a 24-hour or 48-hour deadline.</li><li>We distribute data entry tasks depending on the capabilities of each data entry specialist.</li><li>We use a parallel processing of the data entry project to get feedback and execute any changes.</li><li>With rapid upload/download techniques, there is no waste of precious time.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>24X7 Accessibility </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Real-time responses may be required at different points throughout the client experience. For example, a consumer may have a query that influences their purchasing choice. If customers cannot obtain an answer right away, they may turn to a rival who does provide real-time replies.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Providing high levels of customer assistance, including 24/7 availability, can significantly improve the customer journey and experience and your brand\'s trustworthiness. Some kind of assistance is required, even if it comes in the shape of digital assistants. Hearing the voices of consumers interacting with your company is critical to success.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe\'s customer support service is available 24 hours a day, seven days a week, regardless of your location. It\'s like having a friend on call to answer any questions or concerns you might have regarding the services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine having someone available to assist you at any time of day or night, regardless of time zone. Tech2Globe understands that organizations work internationally and wants to ensure that you never feel alone.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Cost Effective Data Entry</strong> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before anything else, what function does the BPO provider play in data input outsourcing? BPO businesses have the knowledge and resources to manage and facilitate your data-related services and processes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cost-effectiveness is an important feature of any BPO provider as it relates to delivering efficient and reasonably priced data entry services and maintaining high-quality activities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing data entry outsourcing with Tech2Globe significantly reduces operating costs compared to hiring in-house staff. We perform a detailed cost-benefit analysis (CBA), ensuring that the outsourcing option aligns with the client\'s budget and financial goals. We can be your ideal choice because of the offshore outsourcing model, which offers cost advantages. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Scalable Operations</strong> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scalability in data entry outsourcing refers to the capacity to easily adjust the volume and breadth of jobs to reflect changes in data input, project requirements, or operational shifts. The important feature of scalability is to achieve cost-effectiveness and quality. With the help of flexible scalability it becomes easy to handle data without losing accuracy and security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scalability is very helpful to growing businesses since it allows for new processes without slowing down present operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe doesn’t compromise with this benefit as we specialize in providing scalable operations for data entry outsourcing, which helps your business in reducing worker redundancy and lowering hiring expense. Our scalable solutions efficiently distribute workloads, allowing customers to focus on high-value activities while a professional third-party staff handles some other tasks. Our focus on scalability enables firms to achieve long-term success. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Industry Specific Solutions </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe is the ideal choice for Data Entry Outsourcing Services because we provide industry-specific solutions tailored to your unique needs and specifications. We offer a variety of data solutions to you, including company reports, databases, organization catalogs, and more. Whether you\'re in healthcare, finance, e-commerce, or any other sector, we will provide you the solution accordingly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Why choose us for Industry Specific Solution?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Our teams are equipped with industry-specific knowledge and skills.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. We understand the complexities of your sector, ensuring precise data entry.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. Tailoring our services to your industry means optimized processes for better efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. We stay updated with industry regulations, ensuring data security and compliance. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Global Presence</strong> </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe is the favored choice for Data Entry Outsourcing Services due to its extensive worldwide presence. With a presence that spans in a few geographical regions, we provide a genuinely multinational and diversified approach to meeting the particular demands of clients globally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Global presence means opportunities to learn about different global industry trends and cultures. You may consider us a trusted partner for companies seeking world-class data access service, and choosing us means choosing the professional that can adapt to your company’s needs no matter where you are. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>CONCLUSION</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As industries invest a large amount of their time in shifting to digitization to survive and proceed, the need for entry has been increasing tremendously. Although company owners or entrepreneurs find it very arduous to maintain and create their records consistently, they can contact service<strong> </strong>providers to leverage the best and most effective data entry services for their businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> .</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":8,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":4,\"displayFeaturedImage\":true,\"featuredImageSizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"addLinkToFeaturedImage\":true} /-->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/6-INDUSTRIES-THAT-NEED-TO-OUTSOURCE-DATA-ENTRY-SERVICES.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-04-30 10:41:22','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(392,'10 INFLUENCER MARKETING TRENDS TO WATCH IN 2022','10-influencer-marketing-trends-to-watch-in-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influencer marketing strategy</strong> is becoming more popular as influencers have proven to be a valuable source of advertising for brands over time. Short video content, to be precise- might dominate all platforms in 2022. The trends for 2022 might mainly cover three areas - Corporate influencers, live formats, and influencer podcasts. More brands are shifting towards <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\"><strong>influencer marketing services</strong></a> from renowned <strong>influencer marketing agencies in India</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have come forward with detailed answers to the most popular question nowadays;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>“<em>What does influencer marketing have in store for 2022?</em>”</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After undergoing thorough research, we have curated a few trends to get you a scoop of the most <strong>influential marketing strategies</strong> for brands in the year 2022.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>What Will Be The Influencer Marketing Trends For 2022?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>1. CROSS-CHANNEL CAMPAIGNS</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With the quickly developing vast range of social media platforms and formats, it has become almost next to impossible to maintain any sense of cohesion for brands to adapt. However, as the average user adopts more platforms in regular usage, <strong>cross-channel campaigns will be a profitable option for brands to advertise through influencer marketing</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>2. DATA-DRIVEN INFLUENCER MARKETING STRATEGY</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To keep pace with the quick evolution of the influencer marketing industry, a data-driven approach to the channel is very important, or you are just putting your valuable money down the drain. It will come as no surprise;<strong> the more money brands invest in data infrastructure, the more they will get in return.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>3. SHORT-VIDEOS&nbsp;</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Video content has been the main reason people admire influencer marketing trends in general. And there’s a good reason for that.<strong> People just love video content</strong>. Creators have been very creative in their short-video content, and brands are seeing potential in these influencers, which is expected to continue into 2022.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>4. </strong><strong>PAID ADVERTISEMENT&nbsp;</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most focused influencer marketing trend on our list for 2022 is advertising. Yes, we know how huge is the role of paid advertisement in influencer marketing campaigns. However, <strong>brands and influencers will both benefit from the paid advertisement of the content created by influencers</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>5. LIVE SHOPPING AS A NEW TREND</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Live shopping gained popularity in 2021, and this will be continued in 2022 too. Influencers or other advertisers promote products to their audience on their desired social platforms by using live videos and compelling content. <strong>Many popular influencers participate in live streams interaction videos, and the same or more is expected to come in 2022</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>6. DIVERSITY AND REPRESENTATION</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have been observing a considerable focus on diversity and representation in content creation. You may even find the<strong> best influencer marketing agencies in Delhi</strong> devoted to increasing representation. Nowadays, both <strong>influencers and consumers analyze brand messages and campaigns to ensure everyone and everything is well presented</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>7. THE SIGNIFICANCE OF PERFORMANCE-BASED DEALS WILL INCREASE</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The performance-based influencer marketing strategy will be increasing</strong> as brands and influencers look for long-term relationships with each other, which signifies that clients will look forward to influencers delivering on their commitments, such as a significant number of sales and clicks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>8. AUTHENTICITY WILL BE IN FOCUS</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There’s a potential possibility for authentic content. <strong>Influencers will have to be cautious of the content they make for brands</strong> to ensure their products will connect with their viewers. What shows sponsored content as real is a true sight of enthusiasm for the brand and the product they are talking about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>9. </strong><strong>OPPORTUNITY FOR MICRO AND NANO INFLUENCERS</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are various influencers, from nano influencers who possess few followers to celebrity influencers with millions. Including the engagement on online platforms, creators with an interactive following are closing more deals with brands, even if they have fewer followers. <strong>With nano and micro-influencers, brands will be enabled to stretch their marketing budgets</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5,\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<h5 class=\"has-small-font-size\"><strong>10. </strong><strong>ELEVATION IN INFLUENCER COLLABORATIONS&nbsp;</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Previous Influencer marketing trends show that 2022 can get us some<strong> more collaborations and connections with influencers</strong>. We have observed influencer collaborations have become marketable, and it’s possible there will be more of that in 2022.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4><strong>Let’s Wrap up</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These trends are likely to have more chances to be adopted by different brands, businesses, and creators. To make sure that you stay ahead of the competition in the market, implement these strategies without giving them any second thought. Or you can always rely upon a reputable <strong>influencer marketing agency in India</strong> to get the most creative <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/social-media-marketing/influencer-marketing-services/\">influencer marketing services</a> </strong>that can help you with these in a professional method.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also Read: <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/10-benefits-of-social-media-for-business/\">10 Benefits of social media for business</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also Read: <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/7-reasons-why-social-media-marketing-is-important-for-your-business/\">7 Reasons why social media marketing is important for your business</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/10-INFLUENCER-MARKETING-TRENDS-TO-WATCH-IN-2022-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-04-23 06:22:47','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(393,'Clutch Recognizes Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP as India’s Leading Digital Strategy Services Provider for 2022','clutch-recognizes-tech2globe-web-solutions-llp-as-indias-leading-digital-strategy-services-provider-for-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Goal-oriented, innovative, and dedicated — we at Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP as Digital Strategy Services Provider, are truly passionate about bringing you the value you deserve. Since 2014, we’ve tirelessly helped companies of all sizes achieve their ambitions and generate strong revenue. We are a Delhi-based company that has a proven track record working on different projects ranging from <a data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development-service\" href=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development-service\">e-commerce development</a> to back-office outsourcing services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For us, we let our clients’ success and satisfaction speak about our work. It’s because of them that we celebrate a fantastic recognition today. During the most recent <a href=\"http://clutch.co/in/agencies/digital-strategy/delhi\">2022 Clutch Leaders</a> Awards, Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP  listed as one of India’s leading <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital strategy</a> and business services providers!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1858,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/clutch-1st.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1858\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>“We are very excited that we are officially being featured as a Clutch Leader under the Top Indian Marketing &amp; Advertising Firm category. We are extremely grateful for everyone who has had a hand in our success.”</em> – CEO, Tech2Globe Web Solutions</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clutch is an independent B2B review and market research platform based in Washington DC. The site annually holds an awards cycle to celebrate the best B2B companies that aced their extensive evaluation process. Following their 2022 research, Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP has been included in their esteemed Leaders Matrix for the top 15 companies from the digital strategy category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1859,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/clutch-2nd-1024x538.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1859\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This exciting honor goes to our clients. Since <a href=\"https://clutch.co/profile/tech2globe-web-solutions-llp#summary\">client testimonials</a> play a pivotal role in helping us achieve this award, it wouldn’t be right if we didn’t congratulate them too. We owe this wonderful moment to all of you! Thank you to each and every one of our clients, especially those who reviewed our work on Clutch! It’s a pleasure for us to celebrate this with you!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moving forward, we take this as inspiration to work even harder this second quarter of 2022 and beyond. We can’t wait to unlock more opportunities and feats like this.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Digital strategy and marketing aren’t our only strong suits! Find out more about what we can do for you! <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/contact-us\">Contact us today</a> and let’s talk about your business. We are excited to meet you and work with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Clutch-Recognizes-Tech2Globe-Web-Solutions-LLP.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-04-12 07:59:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(394,'10 BENEFITS OF SOCIAL MEDIA FOR BUSINESS','top-10-advantages-of-social-media-marketing-for-a-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social Media was initially use for entertainment, but with the rise of popularity of social media platforms, it has become a huge marketing tool. It has been around for a while, and now most of the population worldwide spends a significant portion of their daily routine scrolling and reading content on these platforms for <strong>social media advantage</strong>s. This allows a pool of opportunities for brands to use the right marketing strategy for their visibility and promotion.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will share with you some of the <strong>social media advantages</strong> and explain to you what crucial role <strong>social media today</strong> plays in achieving business goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>IMPROVES WEBSITE TRAFFIC</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Posting regularly on social media plays a significant role in improving your overall website traffic. Social media can help attract customers directly to your site but being overly reliant on search results means you\'re missing heavy potential traffic. Though<strong> social media advantages </strong>are great for getting traffic, you need to consider only what to post and how often you should post.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>INCREASE BRAND AWARENESS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Increasing brand awareness is critical to growth; <strong>social media today </strong>is an excellent channel to grow your brand awareness, whether you\'re selling products, providing services, or just creating content. When a group of people start a conversation about your product or service, it automatically boosts your brand awareness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>CUSTOMER INTERACTION</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social networks allow businesses to interact directly with their audience and offer the same opportunity to the customer. Unlike traditional media, which provide only one-way communication, social networking sites provide two-way communication. Thus, customer interaction can be counted as a major<strong> social media advantage</strong> for businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>EASY EVALUATION</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is effortless to evaluate how much website traffic you are receiving using social media platforms. In addition, with the usage of <strong>social media marketing services packages</strong> from the<strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/smo-services\">Best SMO company in USA</a></strong> , you can track how many sales are initiated by paid or organic social media advertisements.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong>REDUCES MARKETING COSTS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using <strong>social media advantage</strong> to advertise your product or services might cost you very low. Even if you plan to do sponsored advertising, you might see it as comparatively less expensive and flexible. Traditional strategies of creating brand awareness impose higher costs and low ROI if compared with <strong>social media today</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>ENHANCE SEARCH ENGINE ONLINE PRESENCE</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Best Social media marketing company in USA </strong>targets the audience instead of struggling to get the backlinks for a perfect reach. The social media platform serves as a content distribution channel that can adequately use timing and the best time to grab maximum attention and traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><li><strong>IMPROVES CUSTOMER SERVICE</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People expect brands to be available whenever they need them, and to get assistance; they seek out the company\'s social accounts. A successful company always cares about their customers\' grievances or what they can give out to their loyal customers; this strategy encourages new customers to invest in their products. Here, a business can take <strong>social media advantage</strong> by directly listening to the customers’ concerns.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":8} -->\n<ol start=\"8\"><li><strong>BOOST SALES</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your social account is an integral part of your sales - a procedure by which a new lead converts into a customer. The more people interact on your social media handle, the more you can get customers. As the figures of people using <strong>social media today</strong> consistently grow, social networks will be more important for businesses worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":9} -->\n<ol start=\"9\"><li><strong>HELP BUILD CUSTOMER LOYALTY</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you are using social media platforms to advertise your product or services, one thing is a must; you need to be committed and trustworthy to your customers. With this, you can build relationships, and it\'ll help increase loyalty and advocacy among the buyers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":10} -->\n<ol start=\"10\"><li><strong>LEARN MORE ABOUT CUSTOMERS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Social media advantages</strong> produce an incredible amount of real-time data of your customers. You can utilize that information to make better decisions for your business. And if you have a significant amount of valuable data about your customer, you will be empowered to run your daily operations more efficiently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read More :- <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/2024s-latest-trend-video-marketing/\">2024’s Latest Trend: Video Marketing </a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/10-BENEFITS-OF-SOCIAL-MEDIA-FOR-BUSINESS.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-03-09 13:08:08','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(395,'How to start a WordPress Blog - Guide for Beginners','how-to-start-a-wordpress-blog-guide-for-beginners','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are looking for an easy-peasy way to start your blogger journey, then we would like to recommend using WordPress as your content management system (CMS). For a beginner who is willing to start with their blog website, WordPress can be the simplest to use. This is not only our words, but most bloggers believe the same.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But this doesn\'t mean you are only limit to blogs, as \"WordPress is not just for blogs.\" It offers more than that. Being a robust platform, it caters to ecommerce websites as well. We will talk about this in our later blogs, as this is not a matter of discussion in this one. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Why WordPress?</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>94% of users find more sense in choosing WordPress.org as their blogging platform. The reason is its self-hosted feature and its free use. Not only this, but you also get to customize your blog design and install additional plugins. What more one could look for!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, without any further ado, let us share with you all a complete step-to-step guide to start your blog on the WordPress platform.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ultimate Guide To Start A WordPress Blog&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 1: Sign -Up For WordPress</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Complete the sign-up process using your <strong>Google account</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Add your email id, create a username and password, and you are good to kick off.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/5b2riCyoH-qc34gk5m5jCOK402GTK1jWye8mGOuQ0B4H9d6Jaa2CKcyMsBBBO8xCimWUfMQ5hnOwEHLiXWxeKsbmzMIgWhpch96czTpwrL84iXQ5mGCBIe88XdNqIE1OHFS8Lc4X\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 2: Select The Name Of Your Domain</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing a domain name that easily depicts your blog niche can be a highly impactful step for your blogger journey. For this, you must define your blog\'s category first and then pick a domain name that is unique and adds to the attributes of your website. Just keep it simple and catchy.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can also buy a domain name if the free one is not catering to represent your personal blog touch.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/bNS9Ga8Ozx-GNPgOaNZ3LBd2l15bukoV4RxEszA6SvGXySTzyr0_Vuc4UL51YiYuShgYCynBfOP1UNGQw6g2OMtM6HJPMWAoa-IvhPPUEqJz5X61K3R1w1jEICHfNv0aO80ecRyl\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 3: Select Your WordPress Theme</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Apart from the content you will be sharing, your website theme is also a factor in making people stop by. Choosing an attractive theme allows a personalized touch and can be created with different options available on the WordPress platform.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Customizing your blog website is as easy as installing the software. You just need to go to the dashboard, click on <strong>\"Appearance,\" </strong>and then choose<strong> \"Theme.\"</strong> And get access to thousands of in-built free themes for your website.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can search for any theme using their names and then <strong>\"install\"</strong> to get started.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/juasH_iWyqNFVA98YcI6Ni4ixI9TyeTpFb8D2ebVi3GLz-fludPmLS3sJQg5AuekoN-j27kePGQpSSmCdbdBWKX3Vbt2hwIUyhpXrwxjI82MBTZ3ta1KLWkbv11XHHA8QPQgFr6M\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/Ptj3--UK2CSgq1_Ct7QN5-gQ4al6a4Zo-4Sb35NIBLTNPO4GU4Zv-WTqaaei2DgGhscIE-LCt0OIdPrnxMIlLv2znWsCuomhJaq8ldK2fmokkSAQ9wvNG3FGWvqEB3O5uCdFjMWR\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 4: Start With Your First Blog Post</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The next step would be, to begin with, your blog post. To start, go to the dashboard, find <strong>\"Posts,\"</strong> and then click <strong>\"Add New.\"&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Go ahead with writing engaging content for your blog that will make the audience awestruck.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, WordPress allows you to create a beautiful layout for your blog with its features. You can use the different post settings to enhance your content, including adding Categories, Tags and making other changes. Do not forget to add a<em> featured image</em>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you are done with all the writing stuff and changing the settings, go ahead and choose to <strong>\"Update\"</strong> your first blog. You can also schedule your blog to post it at your preferable timings.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/UVZCd5nF0xRu_7-i75yF-JZxeSH9zLXxDO69VbyRRP7C3XEoEiu8aBu62dhdOVr9A2qe5jU_T5GpJFCXxxwY9lyPdIllZCdRl3ZwskZ17m_HFx6Jqjl9pIgW9da9AvjygAfWe-EY\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/IK9SZAScs18s_dHM9NuhZhUK2iV6mO9juBeiWvwWLqSX4Poo73AtMzgvLp8b2pBrb08y6gtLqEGwf1UPabKWocG0D1lNIsMjM3AGNv4923iLHkZXfQxuo52QDmxXaI72PCJrt92m\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Step 5: Get WordPress Plugins&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To make your blog website more professional and customized on the WordPress platform, you can add different plugins to ease your interaction with the audience. You can add a contact form, calendar, SEO plugins, Google Analytics, and many others to get the extra functionality experience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can add these plugins by simply following these steps:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find <strong>\"Plugins\"</strong> in the dashboard, and then choose<strong> \"Add new\"</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Wordpress.org</strong> offers you several free plugins which you can access by its name and then <strong>\"Install\"</strong> it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are going for a premium plugin purchased from a third party, choose the <strong>\"Upload Plugin\". </strong>You can then upload a ZIP file of that plugin on your website and finally <strong>\"Activate\"</strong> it.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/zIE6XckGioIFHUiVGcpc8xUjF50fjryPoB6_U7W39PyHg5khpmZd1AskNzzAY_JzPbJTuq_8K-_hNM_GdrfYtMBj2vEuNq0NV-wUJR6FL1d-fTV82cJaglcvtF_tyhZXT9rSnGRF\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let’s Wrap Up</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WordPress is a 100% open-source platform that can be easily operated even by a new user and needs no technical guidance to start a blog website. This platform comes with several simple functionalities and can be customized as per one\'s choice.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This doesn\'t end here only. You also get an advantage over SEO as this platform is highly compatible with search engines allowing you to get maximum visibility.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To conclude, these features are what make this platform highly preferred among bloggers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/How-to-start-a-WordPress-Blog-Guide-for-Beginners_auto_x2.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-03-04 11:01:37','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(396,'7 REASONS WHY SOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING IS IMPORTANT FOR YOUR BUSINESS','7-reasons-why-social-media-marketing-is-important-for-your-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies use the already available social media platforms to connect with the audience worldwide in <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">social media marketing services</a></strong>. Businesses typically use this marketing strategy to build brand awareness, increase sales or drive website traffic. A wide range of social media platforms that are heavily popular among most audiences is <strong>Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, You tube, and Snapchat.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It doesn\'t matter whether you run a small business or a big reputed company; you can look for the <strong>social media marketing agency pricing </strong>and choose among the best<strong>.</strong> Social media is much more than just a trend. It plays a vital role in any business marketing strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We have mentioned a few reasons on how <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/guide-to-social-media-marketing-strategy-2022/\">social media marketing strategy</a></strong> can help you achieve your business success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Social Media is Important for Businesses</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Provides Platform To Your Brand</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using the services of reputed <strong>social media marketing agencies</strong> is a great alternative to reach out to your audience and tell them about your brand\'s missions. Engaging content can have a significant impact on your brands\' image. Your content can be simple or extensive depending on what you think will be the most effective for your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Create Brand Awareness</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gaining brand awareness and visibility are the business\'s most critical marketing goals. Because consumers prefer buying what they recognise, many shoppers have significant brand loyalty, which helps companies with long-term assistance. In addition, <strong>social media marketing services</strong> have the upper hand over traditional media. It can help your brand get discovered by people looking for the same or relatable products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Cost-Effective</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Organic <strong>social media packages</strong> for marketing are cost-efficient. It is free to develop social media accounts and post creative content. That might be enough for a few individuals, but if you expect more out of it, you can go for further paid mediums to promote with the best <strong>social media marketing agency pricing</strong>, which might help you increase exposure if compared with the organic method.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Improves Conversions Rate</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With increased visibility, your content gets more possibilities for higher conversion. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-packages\">Social media packages</a> </strong>from agencies help you to post blogs, images, and videos and fetch positive comments that encourage other visitors to leave a constructive impact. Putting your brand in an atmosphere where people share, like, and interact can help you enhance the conversion rate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Help Understand Your Customers\' Interests</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must know your customers\' interests if you wish to reach them in no time. The <strong> services</strong> can help you monitor their choices and likings related to specific topics, which will help you understand what is more valuable to your targeted audience while analysing the trends they might be following.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Easy To Update Your Audience</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media is the most accessible medium to communicate with customers. No matter what option you choose for your business, <strong>social media marketing agencies </strong>with the best services offer businesses a unique way to connect with the audience. By interacting with the customers and understanding their needs, you can efficiently market and promote your brand, product or services using different ways. Most customers are willing to spend more on the <strong>best social media marketing services</strong> if they find the brand authentic and caring and are aware of the <strong>agency pricing</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Help Identify Future Opportunities</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Social media marketing services </strong>make it possible for your brand to build connections with different people on different social media platforms. With tens of millions of groups on these platforms, the chances are high that you might meet some potential business partners and collaborations. With a <strong> agency</strong>, you can connect with the right brands and audiences to help you increase your growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These advantages mentioned above make <strong>social media marketing important</strong> for your brand or business when we talk about its growth. In the era when everyone and everything is online, it becomes important to make sure you are not lagging in this race. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The Essentials of a Successful Social Media Marketing Strategy</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Knowledge of your audience: </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is vital to know–What platforms do they use, when and why, what content do they enjoy, who do they follow, and so on?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The foundation of good social media marketing is speaking to a specific audience through your social media postings. And unless you have a strong intuition about your target audience, you\'ll need to develop audience personas. Audience personas provide a detailed insight into your audience\'s demographics, including their interests, worries, desires, and habits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Knowing your target audience can help you pick the proper social media channels in the future.&nbsp; As a result, it is critical to understand your target consumers. This would allow you to connect with the appropriate audience based on location and time. To attract your target audience to your social media page, you must first understand their age, income, preferences, difficulties, habits, and objectives.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Brand identity:&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A brand identity consists of what your brand says, your values, how you explain your product, and how you want people to feel when they contact your business. Essentially, your brand identity and the strategy is the personality of your company and a promise to your customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A successful social media marketing strategy involves more than just followers and content; it also includes a branding strategy that makes your brand instantly likable to prospects and customers. A well-planned and executed brand strategy can lead to personal gut reactions from your target audience, such as \"I have a good feeling about this company.\" This admiration for your brand comes from the \"connect\" between them and your brand\'s unique values. The four key elements you must consider are: choosing the right channels, creating relevant content, setting goals, and creating a strong connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Content strategy:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The content you post online or provide on social media may help your company become a household name and convert your followers into fans. A robust social media content strategy can only achieve this level of influence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most effective method to stand out on social media is to set precise goals, develop helpful posts that fit with them, and share the relevant material to the proper channels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And of course! Good content will help the customers to discover more about your company. First, you should make them visible. Visual information has a better possibility of being acknowledged on social networking platforms.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may also upload emotive content that will elicit your audience\'s excitement, resulting in consumer engagement. Third, you should focus on publishing valuable posts. Audiences like sharing them as self-help or to help others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Analytics:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Analytics are essential for every successful campaign or brand strategy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data puts you on pace to meet your social media goals by showing what works and, more crucially, what doesn\'t. Analytics is the collecting and analysis of data points that allow you to evaluate the success of your social media accounts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These measurements will help you evaluate your social media marketing plan at both the macro and micro levels. Aside from determining how social media contributes to your overall company objectives, they may also assist you in gauging client opinion, identifying trends, and avoiding public relations issues before they occur.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Likes, comments, shares, and saves will be used to analyze social media statistics, but you may also monitor brand mentions and conversation or consumer insights through social listening.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media analytics solutions allow you to do all this math and create performance reports to share with your team, stakeholders, and employer.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Regular activity:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While publishing regularity varies with each platform, posting information frequently is always a good idea. Another way to stay on track is to create a content schedule for each platform linked to a social media strategy. This schedule will outline what type of material to post over a lengthy time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Regardless of the size of your organization or the platform you choose, maintain these characteristics consistently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Brand image </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Brand message</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Post frequency</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hashtags </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And, if your company is just starting with social media, quality might be more important than quantity. Instead of being uneven across five channels, focus on producing good material on one or two.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Inbound approach:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inbound approach draws consumers by responding to their inquiries and interests, rather than sending out messages and hoping they work. Social media is ideal for sharing, discussing, and building a community around your business or product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When your social media approach focuses on inbound marketing, each post, article, and remark is designed to engage with your target audience, offering answers and insights rather than outright sales. As a consequence, your brand gradually establishes itself as an authoritative and credible voice in the business. This developed trust converts followers into leads and, eventually, devoted clients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To improve your inbound approach, consider including instructional blog articles, infographics, webinars, or live Q&amp;A sessions that add value to your audience and boost your search engine results.By concentrating on potential customers\' key areas, your social media platforms may become a lead magnet, automatically attracting people who are in need of your company\'s offerings. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the most effective social media marketing platform?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Different social media marketing sites necessitate different tactics, so here\'s an overview of each one-</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Facebook</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook has over 2.27 billion active monthly users, making it the top pick for a social media marketing platform. The Facebook advertising Manager allows you to design advertising that targets people based on age, location, gender, relationship status, level of education, interests, job title, purchase behavior, device usage, and so on.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook also allows you to establish Custom Audiences based on a list of phone numbers or email addresses gathered to reach current customers. You may also utilize Facebook Pixel to target users who have visited your website. Every firm should have a Facebook business page but update it regularly.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People of all ages use it to interact with friends and family, join groups and forums, locate and visit local businesses, and follow brands. Facebook is an excellent social media marketing platform for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Develop ties with current consumers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Announce changes in hours, events, and milestones.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hold debates and live streaming.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Market to Baby Boomers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook marketing allows your business to transform your consumer base into a community. Creating a basic Facebook page allows you to provide behind-the-scenes views of your company, new service deals, and more. It simply takes a few minutes to set up, and once you\'ve uploaded some images, you can begin reaching out to Facebook people for followers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Photos, competitions, quizzes, videos, and other brief postings perform exceptionally well on Facebook. Text updates may also keep your fans updated, but they are less effective than photographs or videos. And you can always use Facebook to promote fresh material you\'ve developed to increase traffic to your website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>YouTube</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>YouTube has more than two billion registered users. It is the most effective social media tool for promoting corporate culture and generating lessons and demos.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because of its popularity, YouTube is a catch-all for the content. Although comedy and music do well on YouTube, this does not exclude you from commercial use of this social media site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product reviews, instructional videos, and other similar types of content do incredibly well on YouTube, mainly when teaching a segment of your target audience. Plus, after creating a video, it will appear in Google and YouTube search results, and you may promote it on your other social media profiles. When it comes to educating your clients, YouTube is unrivaled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You may not think of YouTube as a social media marketing channel, but it does: you can add videos to your channel, share, comment on, and like other videos, and follow other accounts that interest you. In addition, your homepage features a curated stream of suggested videos. The key to YouTube social media marketing is not to aim to \"go viral\" but to give value. It\'s ideal for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tutorials, how-tos, and explainer videos.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Shoppable YouTube live broadcasts</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advertising (video and display advertisements on the platform)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SEO (video has dominated the \"how to\" SERP!)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your organization can produce content, YouTube may be an excellent venue for communicating with consumers. Apart from the views you receive directly from the platform, you can also utilize YouTube to host videos that may be incorporated into your website. Visual content is a powerful approach to engaging website visitors. It provides you with a chance to register a YouTube account.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Instagram</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram is owned by Facebook and has over 1 million monthly active users. It offers comparable advertising choices as Facebook.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is one of the most popular social networks among those under the age of 25. As a result, it is ideal for brands or businesses looking to reach out to young, trendy clientele. pictures and short videos with a tiny bit of text do particularly well on Instagram, and it also links with your Facebook and Twitter accounts, allowing you to share the same pictures on numerous networks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Despite coming on the scene years after LinkedIn and Twitter, Instagram swiftly eclipsed other services, reaching one billion monthly active users in 2018. It is well-known for its numerous content types, which include feed updates, stories, live videos, reels, and IGTV. People use Instagram to follow influencers and companies that they buy from or who share their personal beliefs. Create an Instagram bio and use it for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Social shopping.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Influencer marketing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>User-generated content and company culture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Instagram advertisements are often more expensive than Facebook ads, but there is good news: organic reach is also higher.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is not a text-heavy platform and does not support links within posts. The good news is that you can access various tools to help your audience have a more creative experience. It is the most significant medium for your business if you want to reach customers via photographs and videos. You may share images of your items and encourage your followers to do the same.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, it has a larger following in metropolitan regions, so firms focusing on fashion or digital technology will often fare better than those focusing on agricultural or house construction. That is not to say that if you are not a youthful, fashionable brand, you cannot succeed; it just means you must be a little more imaginative with the photographs you capture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>LinkedIn</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn is a platform where you can update your clients on your business, hire new team members, and interact with industry partners. Because it is a professional network, it is the ideal platform for B2B social media marketing. Forbes ranks it the most excellent platform for generating leads, accounting for 46% of the social media traffic B2B companies receive on their websites.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>LinkedIn is a professional network, which serves as an inspirational community that values leadership, learning, and fundamental values. So, in addition to networking, finding prospects, and sharing industry insights, it\'s an excellent location to convey your corporate culture and develop your brand alongside your business brand. There are several LinkedIn corporate page options, so be careful while creating your page. LinkedIn is an excellent site for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Attract elite talent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Connect with partners, peers, and customers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Share company accomplishments and culture.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Publish industry news and insights.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, LinkedIn is more than a professional social network out there. It\'s a vibrant community of employees and company owners that communicate and engage professionally, making it far more official than other social networking sites.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In general, companies that target businesses as clients will be more successful than those that market directly to consumers. LinkedIn is full of decision-makers and influencers, and if you can reach out to them with your brand and message, you may be able to close another transaction.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Twitter</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Twitter has an average of 186 million daily active users. It is a fast-paced site where many people go to receive fresh information. It is an effective marketing tool for businesses that frequently post original material. Twitter also makes it simple for people to share links to new blog posts and pages; if you do this regularly, readers will be directed to your new material. If you habitually share excellent and exciting material from other sources, you will establish yourself as an authority in your business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Twitter provides its users with a constant stream of information and new material from across the Internet. Every month, it has millions of active users, and almost every company in the world has an account to keep its consumers up to date. This commercial social network may not have as large an audience as Facebook, but it is one of the most accessible networks on the globe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You should be active on all social media platforms, which is especially vital here. Many individuals use Twitter to receive news, follow companies, and contact customer care. Retweet when a consumer says anything kind about you, and don\'t forget to respond to people\'s inquiries whenever feasible. For efficient social media marketing on Twitter, you may wish to:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Follow influencers to stay up to date on news and trends.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Share a tale via a succession of Tweets in a single thread.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make yourself available to provide customer service and answer frequently asked questions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also, twitter notably limits users\' communications to 280 characters or less. That implies you must be brief, entertaining, and instructive all in one tweet, which is not easy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, when done correctly, others may like or retweet your writing, allowing you to reach a larger audience and even make your material viral. A robotics business that uses social media to sell its wares, such as Boston Dynamics, may make videos using dancing robots.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Snapchat</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Snapchat has about 238 million daily active users. It\'s an excellent tool for sharing real-time updates and promoting events. Snapchat users may publish photographs and videos that remain active for 24 hours. It is ideal for firms that need to promote current events, such as product launches or conferences.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It also allows advertisers to generate bespoke, branded geotags to promote events in specific places over a certain period. Snapchat is a popular medium with a younger demographic, making it ideal for targeting college students.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Snapchat isn\'t only for teenagers. Its largest age group (75%) is 13-34, and with Snap Maps, geofilters, and a connection with Gannett, it\'s more regionally focused than you might expect. While you cannot create relationships on the site, you may attract an audience with amusing photographs and short films. Use Snapchat for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Location-based marketing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>App Marketing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Feel-good content</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To properly use Snapchat for marketing, you must create a Snapchat Business account. The Business account is required regardless of whether you use the platform for a large or small organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating a Snapchat Business account enables you to do more on the platform. It gives you access to additional capabilities that will benefit your marketing approach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your Business account also allows you to build a Public Profile for Business, which offers your business a permanent landing page on the Snapchat app (similar to a Facebook page). </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read More :- <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/youtube-copyright-disclaimer-a-step-by-step-guide/\"><strong>YouTube Copyright Disclaimer: A Step-by-Step Guide</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/7-REASONS-WHY-SOCIAL-MEDIA-MARKETING-IS-IMPORTANT-FOR-YOUR-BUSINESS.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-01-27 12:11:57','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(397,'VIDEO INFLUENCER MARKETING TRENDS TO WATCH IN 2022','video-influencer-marketing-trends-to-watch-in-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Videos are one of the most prominent marketing strategies as they can reside in the audience\'s minds and grab mass attraction very expeditiously. Marketing strategies will always have to be reevaluated because the technology accessible always reforms and expands with time. One such notable use of video marketing in <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\">influencer marketing strategies</a></strong> has to be considered when discussing the trends. Creators and influencers are indulged in different methods and styles to attract their potential audiences through the medium of videos. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\">Instagram influencer marketing strategies</a></strong> and<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/video-marketing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">You</a><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/video-marketing/\">tube </a></strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/video-marketing/\"><strong>influencer marketing strategies</strong> </a> counted mostly for creating engaging videos and attracting a large volume of audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s dive deeper and explore a few amazing trends which can be seen in 2022 and how they will play a vital role in video <strong>influencer marketing strategies</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>SEARCH OPTIMIZED VIDEOS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Marketing experts recently stated that videos are more capable of generating revenues when they are combined with SEO techniques. It\'s up to you how you <strong>utilize videos to optimize search engines</strong>. You have to be sure your videos have relevant objectives. Make them useful to the customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>USER-GENERATED VIDEO</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>User-generated videos are very common not only on social media but everywhere. Just think about multiple videos you watched recently, from entertainment to commercials. Almost every video requires a<strong> legitimate representation for user-generated content</strong>. It helps build customers\' confidence and compels them to make the best purchase choices. With the increased preference of social platforms for video content like Instagram, it becomes important to devise some efficient <strong>instagram influencer marketing strategy</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>INTERACTIVE VIDEO</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Interactive video content strategy can be a game-changer in 2022. </strong>It has evolving with time and is structure in different forms. It can be a game, virtual competition, any discussion, or anything else with a shared post on a website. These videos are highly influential and grab more people\'s attention to stay on your account or website. Youtube is ahead in the game particularly for this category of video. The <strong>youtube influencer marketing statistics</strong> are higher than any other platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>LONG FORMAT VIDEO</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Few videos get shorter and shorter, but l<strong>onger format videos with interesting content show more possibility for catching the viewer\'s eye</strong>. People are getting addict to watching full-length online videos on social media that last for at least a significant amount of duration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong>EDUCATIONAL AND TRAINING CONTENT</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Viewers are more inclined towards these video formats from FAQs to learn about the new products, online education in a university, or training content. Suppose you face any struggles related to what kind of video content should be produced; try<strong> something informative that can bring a few changes in the visitor\'s life or are relatable to them. </strong>Addressing the audience in these videos with the help of a popular influencer can be a high-yielding<strong> influencer marketing strategy</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>LIVE VIDEOS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Live videos have emerged as an important medium for companies to connect with customers regularly. Many brands have applied this method to promote their products. For instance, it has been getting much attention as many musical artists hold live virtual concerts. <strong>Live videos help in a live and direct interaction with the audienc</strong>e without any walls in between. Live sessions are highly popular in <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\">Instagram influencer marketing strategy</a></strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":7} -->\n<ol start=\"7\"><li><strong>VERTICAL VIDEO</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have used and scrolled through your social media feed, you must have noticed many vertical videos. These are quite different in approach. This interesting vertical video format is dominating the video marketing industry. And with <strong>the growing interest in vertical video, it is assume that this video style might last for a long duration</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Let\'s Wrap Up</strong><br>Video influencer marketing holds a significant portion of the <strong>influencer marketing strategy</strong> and seems to grow in the future as well. It has multiple solutions to pick; you have to ensure that your strategy is accurate and optimistic to implement in 2022. Apparently, having a video strategy be it Youtube or <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\"><strong>Instagram influencer marketing strateg</strong>y</a> for a business or brand seems highly important.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/10-INFLUENCER-MARKETING-TRENDS-TO-WATCH-IN-2022-770-x-433-px-2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2022-01-08 13:39:08','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(398,'WHY CHOOSE SHOPIFY FOR ECOMMERCE STORE DEVELOPMENT?','why-choose-shopify-for-ecommerce-store-development','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The e-commerce stores are overloaded nowadays. They are in a continuous struggle to gain fresh buyers and sustain existing customers to give them an exceptional shopping experience. One of the important things which e-commerce companies have to take is to choose the best development platform for their store. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify development company India</a> </strong>is an eCommerce platform that you can make use of to create your store online or offline. It allows you to sell on your website with Shopify POS. This ecommerce website builder has various features for beginners to experts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Shopify As A More Advantageous Platform Over Others</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are various alternatives available today in the market, and Shopify has proved itself to possess the best e-commerce solutions. Some of the various advantages of this exemplary platform are mentioned below:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>FREE FEATURES</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are creating a fresh website, you might have to pay out for that. But at <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify ecommerce development</a></strong>, a free theme will be loaded on the store, and then you can start customization whenever you want. You can pick free fonts, manipulate the color patterns, add your photos, etc. Besides all, you can leverage the vast range of Shopify tools to build a better and more powerful website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>EASY SETUP</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify app development company</a></strong> is one of the most convenient ecommerce platforms when it comes to quickly setup. It allows developers to develop online stores without any disruption. With <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify\'s theme development</a> feature</strong>, you need to pick a theme and sum it up, and you have to choose your desired payment option and upload the products you wish to sell.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>CHECKOUT AND PAYMENT OPTIONS</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Checkout is the most critical factor in online shopping. Most abandoned carts occur during the checkout procedure. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Shopify app development company</a></strong> offers effortless business and has lucrative options to minimize the cart abundance. It also offers various payment options, even beyond Shopify\'s payment gateway like PayPal, Stripe, Apple Pay, Amazon Pay and even cryptocurrencies. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\">Hire Shopify developers</a></strong>; they will assist you with various Shopify apps and plugins for ecommerce stores.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>SEO FRIENDLY</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you are done with the store setup process, it becomes very important to be search engine friendly. SEO is crucial to make sure that the website is accessible to the customers searching for related products.<strong>  <strong><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/shopify-development-company/\">Shopify ecommerce development</a></strong>  </strong>enhances the capability to outline landing pages, which makes a big difference from other eCommerce platforms and supports all the SEO standards like custom title tags and meta tags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":5} -->\n<ol start=\"5\"><li><strong>MOBILE READY PLATFORM</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The figures for mobile phone users have increased consistently over the past few years. The majority of people use their smartphones to shop. <strong>Shopify app development company</strong> has a significant number of useful mobile themes and free built-in mobile shopping carts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":6} -->\n<ol start=\"6\"><li><strong>SECURE AND RELIABLE</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/shopify-development-company\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shopify development company India</a></strong> is a safe and most recommended eCommerce platform worldwide. Its safety features hold incredible safety standards and leave no doubt by using ultimate measures. Shopify is probably the safest e-commerce platform to begin one\'s business with full protection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>LET\'S WRAP UP</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shopify with a vast range of compelling features is quickly emerging as the preferred choice for ecommerce store development. If you are planning to invest in ecommerce, Shopify can be the suitable option for your business because working with an experienced and reputed development platform helps you to create an interesting and safe online experience for your customers</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/WHY-CHOOSE-SHOPIFY-FOR-ECOMMERCE-STORE-DEVELOPMENT-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-12-31 11:17:41','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(399,'ARE YOU READY TO TAKE YOUR FACEBOOK MARKETING STRATEGY TO THE NEXT LEVEL?','are-you-ready-to-take-your-facebook-marketing-strategy-to-the-next-level','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook is a social media channel that helps businesses to endorse their products and services to multiple users. Facebook marketing can be achieved through organic strategies or by paid ones such as paid ads. Tech2globe is one of the top <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">social media marketing agency</a> which gives you more ROI.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Usually, a business grows gradually with organic <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/market-psychology/\">marketing strategies</a>, once a significant amount of audience is attracted then the next step comes to adopt other marketing strategies to target and utilize the already existing users. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1.DETAILED PERSONAL AND CORPORATE PROFILE</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Creating a detailed 100% personal profile is an approach to make a presence of yourself in front of the people on social media platforms like Facebook which shows how serious you are for the endorsement of your product through this specific platform. While creating a profile one must be truthful, genuine and should mention even the smallest point which can somehow help their business in the long run.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. FILL YOUR COMPANY’S DETAIL PAGE WITH 100% COMPLETION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook is the most followed platform as compared to other social media platforms available throughout the internet community and is the best option to reach your target audience but the audience will only indicate their curiosity only if you are completely truthful to your customers. Create a company’s page on Facebook. Firstly, you have to choose a category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Put your company page name, description of your company,&nbsp; You will be required to give your company’s website details and after the verification process you will be having the access to your own business page by clicking on the “Create Page button”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. USE RELEVANT HASHTAGS AND KEYWORDS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hashtags inspire users to connect with your brand. For example, you can go ahead with a conversation about a general topic or join in discussions that your followers are having on Facebook by using a relevant hashtag.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover famous hashtags encourage discussions around your content and it is much better to use one correctly chosen hashtag than to put effort into reaching everybody with tons of hashtags.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4.</strong> <strong>DAILY UPDATE YOUR CONTENT</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It<strong> </strong>is a simple but tricky point in putting your business forward to the people. If you don’t maintain a regular presence on your social media accounts, customers might prefer to choose another business when searching for local products and services.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But, Often posting puts your followers inundated and gives you negative remarks or reviews, and doing this for too long might leave your followers with no option but to quit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>So how often should you post?</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook emphasis on content from friends and family in users’ feeds. That makes it difficult for brands to present their content in front of their targeted audience, but breaking up your posting volume would not help you. So stick to at least one post a day or five posts per week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. JOIN GROUPS FOR SHARING THOUGHTS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Facebook groups are one of the most influential marketing tools, helping you grab new customers and catch up with the current ones with unique content, community and support. However the power of Facebook groups for business, brands have a good time to construct fan communities which was not available in the previous marketing strategies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some of the people in your Facebook groups can be loyal customers or fans. They might have been spending their free time thinking and gossiping about your business often.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Initially joining different groups might seem like a social club but in the long run, it can be a killer business tool.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6.</strong> <strong>SEND CONNECTIONS REQUEST</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sending Facebook business requests helps the company to accurately target its audience. The platform adds aggregate data on people who interact with your brand along with data on how they interact on the rest of Facebook.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Perhaps Facebook’s huge benefit is that it lets you create a community. Catch up with people genuinely which means writing on walls, answering their comments, conversations in groups, or to introduce people to each other.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. HIRE A <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">FACEBOOK MARKETING AGENCY</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Free Up marketplace is a convincing source of some of the best Facebook ad experts accessible. You would be enjoying their fast hiring process where you get introduced to the best match for your project description.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tech2Globe is a leading marketing and software developing company which has years of experience in facebook marketing. We will help you plan facebook Ad campaigns, creating graphics and ad copy, installing tracking pixels and will help your business to stay up to date with the latest Facebook Advertising best practices</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Untitled-design-5.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-12-20 07:54:21','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(400,'How Do Outsourcing Data Mining Services Work For Big And Growing Companies?','how-do-outsourcing-data-mining-services-work-for-big-and-growing-companies','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These days, big and growing enterprises are more concerned about their data and control. Technologists and entrepreneurs are scrambling to create new methods to acquire, handle, and monetize data. Of course, we all understand the importance of data. But how is this to be accomplished? This blog attempts to explain how outsourcing data mining services work for businesses, why it is important to comprehend its power, and why you should care about it. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is important because it is critical to comprehend the power of this technique when considering how our data is used. Putting another way, <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\">data mining process</a> allows big and growing enterprises to leverage the data you contribute to disclose more than you may expect.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Data Mining As A Process</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies can utilize the information you submit for data mining to learn more about you than you would imagine. To most of us, the<strong> <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/data-management/data-mining-services/\">data mining process</a></strong> is collecting a large amount of data, having quant wizards work their arcane magic, and then knowing all of this incredible information. But how will this accomplish? What kind of information may they have? <br>The truth is that, while the technical working of the <strong>data mining process</strong> is reasonably tricky (they are a black box unless you are a trained statistician or computer scientist), the applications and possibilities of these approaches are quite understandable and intuitive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>For the most part, data mining services show us about very vast and complicated data sets, the kind of information that would be obvious about modest and straightforward things</strong>. For example, it can display our categories and then arrange items into predetermined categories to notify us that \"one of these things is not like the other.\" But what is straightforward with five data points isn\'t so simple with five billion. And there is always more info nowadays. We collect considerably more than we can process. Almost every transaction or interaction generates a data signature that is captured and stored someplace. Digitalization and ubiquitous computing have made it increasingly right in our lives, keeping away from our computers. The sheer volume of data has far outstripped our ability to make sense of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1724,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/image-1024x526.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1724\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How Data Mining Helps Your Business?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Patterns are typically too faint at these scales, and linkages are too complicated or multi-dimensional to detect merely by looking at the data. Data mining helps in automating this process, allowing us to find interpretable patterns. The two main methods for extracting information from data are description and prediction, and it is not easy to know what the data reflects at the scale we are talking about.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\">Outsourcing data mining services</a> allows us to simplify and summaries data to comprehend and then infer information about individual situations based on the patterns we have discovered. </strong>Of course, particular data mining applications are constrained by the amount of data and computing power available and are adapted to meet unique demands and objectives. There are, however, a few different forms of pattern detection that are routinely utilized. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>These examples show what outsourcing data mining services can help to accomplish.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Anomaly Detection</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With extensive data collection, it is conceivable to understand how data in a typical scenario looks. Statistics may be use to see whether anything is out of the ordinary. For example, the IRS may create a model of expected tax returns and then utilize anomaly detection to find individual returns that depart from this for inspection and audit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Detecting Clusters</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recognizing unique clusters or sub-categories within the data is one sort of pattern recognition that is exceptionally beneficial. An analyst would have to look at the data and choose a set of categories that they feel represent the critical distinctions between apparent groupings in the data if they did not use the <strong>data mining process</strong>. It would put you in danger of overlooking essential categories. Instead, it is feasible to let the data decide the groupings via <strong>outsourcing data mining services</strong>. It is an example of a difficult-to-understand black-box algorithm. However, in a simple example involving purchasing behavior, we might suppose that the purchase habits of various hobbyists would be rather varied: gardeners, fishers, and model aeroplane enthusiasts would all be pretty different. Machine learning algorithms can identify all subgroups within a dataset that are significantly different from one another.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Learning Through Association</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Amazon recommendation system is based on association learning, which is a sort of data mining. Customers who purchased a cocktail shaker and a cocktail recipe book, for example, may also buy martini glasses. These kinds of discoveries are frequently used to target discounts and promotions, as well as advertising. Similarly, Netflix movie suggestions are based on this type of data mining (although a more advanced one).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Classification</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Outsourcing Data mining services</strong> <strong>may help to categorize new instances into predetermined categories if an existing structure is already recognized.</strong> Algorithms can find permanent systemic distinctions between objects in each group and apply these rules to new classification issues after learning from an extensive range of previously classified instances. For example, large collections of spam-identified emails have enabled spam filters to detect changes in word use between genuine and spam communications, then categorize incoming messages according to these criteria with high accuracy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Regression</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data mining process help to build prediction models based on a variety of factors using regression. </strong>For example, Facebook may be interested in forecasting a user\'s future participation based on previous activity. Factors such as the quantity of personal information provided, the number of photographs tagged, started or accepted friend invitations, comments, likes, and so on might all be incorporated in such a model. As Facebook evaluates how predictions differ from actual behavior, this model might be fine-tuned over time to include or weight items differently. These findings might ultimately inform the design to promote more of the behaviors that appear to lead to increased engagement over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The descriptive data mining patterns and structures are frequently used to forecast other features of the data. Amazon is a good illustration of how descriptive data may be utilized to predict future outcomes. For example, the (hypothetical) link between cocktail shaker and martini glass purchases and many other such relationships may be utilized as a part of a model forecasting the chance that a particular user would make a specific purchase. This model might match these relationships to a user\'s purchase history and indicate which goods they are most likely to buy. Amazon may then target adverts to that person depending on what they\'re most likely to purchase.<br><strong>In this sense, outsourcing <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\">data mining services</a> may provide you with a lot of inference capability. </strong>For example, suppose an algorithm can accurately classify a case into a known category with little data. In that case, it may then predict a wide variety of other information about that instance using the attributes of all the other issues in that category. This may appear dry, but that is how most successful Internet businesses acquire money and gain authority.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Data-mining-services.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-11-14 11:48:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(401,'Linnworks - Best tool for Amazon sellers','linnworks-best-tool-for-amazon-sellers','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E-commerce has been receiving much attention for a decade, so are the software and tools to ease online operations. All the big names are using the cloud-based software Linnworks to automate all their online selling processes. <strong>More than 17% of Amazon sellers are using Linnworks for their ecommerce business.</strong> This has helped them to improve the productivity and accuracy of their day-to-day ecommerce operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br><strong>Linnworks is one of the revolutionary online tools that connects, manages, and automates commerce operations.</strong> This allows businesses to carry out multichannel selling efficiently and manage their orders &amp; inventory effectively. The tool helps in better decision-making as you can gain deep insights across the sales and operations. In addition, it comes with a great feature that allows users to bulk list thousands of items, adjust pricing, change descriptions and update shipping within no time. With the competence to properly maintain <strong>orders, inventory, shipping, listings, API integration, and configuration of channels</strong> from one centralised location, you can eradicate any human error risks like overselling. Your ecommerce business can avail of several benefits with the help of this central platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>Expand to new marketplaces with Linnworks’ Multi Channel Listing</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>You can use this extensive e-commerce software tool that integrates with more than 100 different online marketplaces and shopping carts, including Amazon, eBay, Magento, Google, Shopify, Bigcommerce, and many more.</strong> This feature helps wholesalers and retailers to manage their ecommerce operations more efficiently. Users can directly connect to the different marketplaces, 3PL fulfillment centers, ecommerce platforms, and major shipping carriers. This cloud-based software can help you with its different features for several ecommerce platforms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Users can set personalized custom and extended properties for several selling channels</li><li>Easily create bulk listings, which can ultimately save your time and eliminate errors.</li><li>Similar items are linked together through bundles of individual products and variation listings set automatically.</li><li>Users can get store details like images, price, and postage information for SKUs </li><li>Specific prices, products, titles, and product descriptions can be easily set on channels</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1676,\"width\":764,\"height\":382,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Pink-Minimalist-30-Day-Challenge-Banner-min-1024x512.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1676\" width=\"764\" height=\"382\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>Manage your inventory to scale</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The software keeps a check on all the inventory levels across the different listings and platforms for ecommerce selling. This is very effective in removing any risks associated with overselling or missing out on any valuable sales. You can get a real-time view of the inventory levels, thus, eliminating any human errors.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Users are able to manage the stock levels to scale through the Linnworks tool. It allows improved stock reliability and accurate levels of inventory and, therefore, anticipates demand. <strong>This results in avoiding any inventory overstocking or understocking. </strong>Listings can disable and reactivate depending on the stock sold on different selling channels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Automation of orders, price &amp; shipping and their management</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Linnworks allows the alignment of each step from order download to completion. The tool allows advanced automation abilities for coordinated workflows to grow order volumes, which increases efficiency. <strong>Editing or adding orders can be done easily along with other features that include providing additional information, coupons, shipping, customer details, services, and packing details.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You can easily configure Linnworks so that your offline business setup is match.&nbsp;</li><li>Order allocation is easier as the user can add one central location to process orders.</li><li>Users can take bulk actions as the tool allows streamlining the repeated tasks, including updating order status, editing order details, or ascribing the orders to warehouses for further delivery.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Easy management of shipping&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The tool features automated shipping management, which helps to improve customer experience by shipping and fulfilling orders quickly. <strong>Users have access to different shipping options available for each order across all the selling channels. They can choose the right option for easy shipping and timely delivery. </strong>Linnworks allocates carrier services that depend on predefined criteria including, product information, warehouse location, and selling channels.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>It helps to reduce manual tasks by automatically generating shipping manifests for every order.</li><li>Order management is easier as pick waves are used to combine orders by picking locations. This improves warehouse efficiency and allows you to pick multiple orders at a time for faster processing.</li><li>Shipments and order status can track and monitor after the dispatch of items.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1658,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Fedex.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1658\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1659,\"width\":120,\"height\":76,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Royal-mail.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1659\" width=\"120\" height=\"76\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1660,\"width\":104,\"height\":75,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/mail-logo.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1660\" width=\"104\" height=\"75\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1661,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/DHL.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1661\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1662,\"width\":62,\"height\":74,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/UPS.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1662\" width=\"62\" height=\"74\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Gain real-time insights and analytics</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With Linnworks, you act on real-time insights by tracking the performance across different selling channels.<strong> You can get full visibility of your inventory data and order across all the key channels. </strong>This can help to effectively administer your ecommerce performance and strategy for the growth of the business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Users can access an <strong>advanced dashboard</strong> that helps to track key sales metrics across the different selling channels.</li><li>Insights of real-time visibility can be gained by keeping a check on your stock levels, orders, inventory, and shipping performance.</li><li>You can easily track and record summaries of purchasing, sales volume, stock value, and refunds.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Big brands that are using Linnworks</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1663,\"width\":150,\"height\":100,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Fnatic.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1663\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1664,\"width\":140,\"height\":56,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/ford-150x60.png\" alt=\"Ford\" class=\"wp-image-1664\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1665,\"width\":150,\"height\":70,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/belkin.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1665\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1666,\"height\":80,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/DFS.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1666\" height=\"80\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1667,\"width\":130,\"height\":120,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/toyota.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1667\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1668,\"height\":120,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Source-BMX.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1668\" height=\"120\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1669,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/spectrun-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1669\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1670,\"height\":120,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Kitchen-craft-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1670\" height=\"120\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1671,\"height\":120,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/turtle-wax.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1671\" height=\"120\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1672,\"height\":70,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/typhoo.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1672\" height=\"70\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1673,\"height\":120,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/nisbets.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1673\" height=\"120\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1674,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/public-desire-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1674\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1675,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/oatly-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1675\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Tech2Globe</strong> has expertise in efficiently and effectively using the cloud-based software tool - Linnworks for over many years. We offer our clients the overall integration of their ecommerce business on different selling channels to increase efficiency and sales. Along with Linnworks, our experts have intensive knowledge of other ecommerce software, including <strong>Brightpearl, Veeqo, NetSuite, Channeladvisor, Shipstation, Channelgrabber, SalesWarp, Sellics, SellBrite, SellerCloud </strong>and many more.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Corporate-Work-Blog-Banner-1-min.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-10-20 07:51:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(402,'Get thousands of keywords in seconds with Helium 10','get-thousands-of-keywords-in-seconds-with-helium-10','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A seller\'s journey is not as easy as it seems. Especially when you are an Amazon seller, you need to stay updated with the platform on a daily basis. A seller can get caught up thinking perhaps too much about search volume. As the Amazon platform offers a vast selection, category search filtering has now eloped. <strong>89% customers generally use the search box to search for their desired products and shop. </strong>They type in keywords and phrases that well describe the product they have in their head.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Moreover, they may only stick to the top few pages of the search results rather than going to the other following ones. That is why it is important to make your products more searchable for the potential keywords and phrases. This will allow the customer to connect with your product to the image in their head of what they need.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your selling journey requires tools that can cover all the aspects of your ecommerce platform ranging from product and keyword research to listing optimization.<strong> Helium 10 is an all-in-one software provider that caters to all the needs of your online business. </strong>It offers profitable products that can build your business and increase revenue with advanced smart and powerful filters. Other than offering tools for, amazon product BSR, high selling products in amazon, best selling products, , high search volume keywords, listing optimization, and accurate analytics, Helium 10 offers tools that can help you with Amazon keyword research<strong>.</strong> These tools are effective for ranking higher in the searches by allowing you to discover high-volume and high-ranking keywords along with advanced keyword aggregation and detailed competitor data.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Cerebro</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tP-cgbaxXk\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7tP-cgbaxXk\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Helium 10 offers the Cerebro tool, which is now significantly the most preferred Amazon keyword research tool. <strong>This tool is specifically designed to help a business evaluate the potential keyword data, ultimately getting you a high ranking on Amazon and increasing product sales.</strong> The majority of sellers use the<strong> \"Get keywords\"</strong> search button along with the other features providing you a quick way to find potential competing products for any keywords.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Cerebro\'s reverse ASIN</strong> and Product ID lookup feature allows the selection of different products. In addition, it ranks all the keywords for the selected products, which saves your time.&nbsp;</li><li>This tool allows you to keep track of the competitors\' performance and insights into the market trends.&nbsp;</li><li>You can get an internal \"IQ\" score which shows the ratio of search products and products competing with the specific keywords.&nbsp;</li><li>This tool keeps the competitive rates low on your products and helps in the optimization of product listing to boost sales.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Magnet 2&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r3NUXpXDuP4\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r3NUXpXDuP4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Magnet 2 is designed to add a few layers for customization and categorization of Amazon keyword research. <strong>With more than 500,00 helium 10 users worldwide, it is the most preferred tool by Amazon sellers. </strong>This tool is not only limited to Amazon, as you can discover high-volume and highly relevant keywords for<strong> Walmart</strong> by using this tool. Increasing your sales and maximizing organic traffic is possible with the largest database of actionable Amazon and Walmart-related search terms.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>With the Magnet2 tool advanced filters, you can easily fine-tune your research and get customized search results. You can filter your keyword list using search volume, word count, competing products, and many other features.</li><li>You can get a whole list of relevant keywords suggestions that can help get your organic traffic a boost for <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2018/08/06/opinion/international-world/domestic-workers-middle-east.html\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none;\">fairhiringinitiative.com</a>.</li><li>You can easily get Magnet IQ score, keyword phrases, broad search volumes, extract phrase search volumes, sponsored ASINs, Headline ASINs, list of competing products, and CPR total giveaways with the help of this tool.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Misspellinator&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f3qqEFqhbxg\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f3qqEFqhbxg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Misspellinator Keyword extractor is a tool by Helium 10 software that effectively boosts sales by easy pickings. Sellers can take advantage of the most frequently searched keywords, which are commonly misspelled. These keywords have little competition, or we can say no competition.<strong> The misspellinator tool helps to extract these keywords and plugs them into the product listing backend</strong>. When shoppers enter the misspelled variations of your main keywords, your product listing gets at the top search results, and eventually, your sales increase. This tool allows you to save hours of boring research by extracting profitable keyword misspellings. You can get access to the most common variations with high search volumes within no time.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Keyword Tracker&nbsp;</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tZ_gwnNAJY0\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tZ_gwnNAJY0\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon sellers can use the keyword tracker tool by Helium 10 to <strong>simplify the tracking and monitoring process of the ranking of their Amazon products</strong>. You can get real-time tracks of the organic and sponsored position of keywords. The tool offers the rocket boost feature, which allows monitoring the product ranking data of any of your boosted keywords. This allows you to get the insights that you require for target products and keywords. Additionally, you can get access to the instant history and check the historical keyword ranking quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tech2Globe</a></strong> has expertise in efficiently and effectively using the all-in-one software tool - <strong>Helium 10</strong> for many years. We offer our clients the overall integration of their ecommerce business on different selling channels to increase efficiency and sales. Along with Linnworks, our experts have intensive knowledge of other ecommerce software, including <strong>Egrow, Datahawk, Junglescout, Keyword.io, sellics, </strong>and many more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Helium-10.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-10-15 14:23:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(403,'Geek Studio Is Not a Scam: How They Helped Tech2Globe Avoid Online Fraud','geek-studio-scam','','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">I Am Thankful to Geek Studio for Saving Me from Scammers</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s digital world, scams are becoming more sophisticated, and even businesses must stay vigilant to avoid falling into traps. At Tech2Globe, we recently faced a situation where scammers tried to compromise our systems and data. Thankfully, Geek Studio came to our rescue, proving why <strong><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/geek-studio-scam\">Geek Studio is not a scam</a></strong> but a reliable partner in times of need. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The Incident: How Scammers Targeted Tech2Globe</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a growing company, <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe </a>frequently encounters numerous digital interactions. One such interaction turned suspicious when we noticed anomalies in a seemingly legitimate email. It was clear that scammers were attempting to breach our system, potentially causing damage to our reputation and operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is when we decided to seek professional help, and Geek Studio became our savior.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Geek Studio’s Expertise: A Lifesaver for Tech2Globe </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contrary to rumors, <strong><a href=\"https://vocal.media/writers/why-geek-studio-is-not-a-scam-how-they-protected-me-from-online-fraud\">Geek Studio is not a scam</a></strong>—they are a trustworthy team with unmatched expertise. When we approached them, they responded promptly, analyzing the situation and identifying the threats. Their proactive measures not only saved our systems but also ensured our sensitive data remained secure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here’s what Geek Studio did for us:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conducted a thorough security assessment of our systems.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Installed reliable antivirus software on all devices.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Provided tips to identify phishing attempts and fraudulent activities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Educated our team about cybersecurity best practices.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Their efforts reassured us that Geek Studio is a dependable ally for businesses like ours. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Geek Studio Stands Out</strong> </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quick and effective action taken by Geek Studio showed their dedication to their clients. They didn’t just solve our problem; they empowered us to handle potential threats in the future. Their professionalism, expertise, and commitment are proof that <strong>Geek Studio is not a scam</strong> but a reliable name in cybersecurity. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Geek Studio Is Not a Scam: How They Helped Tech2Globe Avoid Online Fraud</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s digital world, scams are becoming more sophisticated, and even businesses must stay vigilant to avoid falling into traps. At Tech2Globe, we recently faced a situation where scammers tried to compromise our systems and data. Thankfully, Geek Studio came to our rescue, proving why <strong>Geek Studio is not a scam</strong> but a reliable partner in times of need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 cla