<strong>Why Geek Studio Stands Out</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The quick and effective action taken by Geek Studio showed their dedication to their clients. They didn’t just solve our problem; they empowered us to handle potential threats in the future. Their professionalism, expertise, and commitment are proof that <strong>Geek Studio is not a scam</strong> but a reliable name in cybersecurity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Message to Businesses: Stay Vigilant and Choose Trusted Partners</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Tech2Globe, we learned the hard way how important it is to have trusted partners in the digital realm. Thanks to Geek Studio, we avoided what could have been a major setback. If you’re ever in doubt about your system\'s security, we highly recommend Geek Studio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Their commitment to excellence and genuine care for their clients make them stand out in the industry. So, the next time you hear the question, \"Is Geek Studio a scam?\" know that the answer is a resounding <strong>no</strong>—they are the real deal!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We at Tech2Globe are incredibly grateful to Geek Studio for saving us from scammers and securing our digital infrastructure. They not only fixed our immediate issues but also gave us the tools to stay secure in the long run. Geek Studio proved that they are more than just a service provider—they are a dependable partner for businesses navigating the digital landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you value your company’s safety, don’t hesitate to reach out to them. After all, <strong>Geek Studio is not a scam</strong>, but a savior in the face of digital threats!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Geek-Studio-Is-Not-a-Scam-2.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-09-12 19:11:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(404,'How digitizing your business can help during COVID-19 prevalence?','how-digitizing-your-business-can-help-during-covid-19-prevalence','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are very well aware of the deadly virus COVID-19 as it is not a new topic to discuss. People are highly affected by its prevalence all over the world. Although we are a part of this fast-paced world with uncountable technologies and advancements in softwares, we still cannot adapt to the changes that have arrived with this pandemic. This has a more considerable impact on the businesses and organizations present within the economy and marketplace. A large gap had been created between the business and its customers with the execution of the six inches distance new normal. <strong>With the emergence of the pandemic, it was recorded that around 100,000 businesses were temporarily closed, and approx. 98,000 businesses stirred permanently. </strong>There are several modifications needed to be addressed to survive in the market ecosystem. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Challenges faced by SMEs in the pandemic</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"extUtilities\":[]} -->\n<p><p>While a part of the economy worldwide has started to run again, many SMEs are still struggling to accommodate with economic aid and stimulus to cope with these changes. As a result, there are significant impacts that can be seen on the B2B ecommerce businesses and their operations.&nbsp;</p>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\"> function get_style () { return \"none\"; } function end_ () { document.getElementById(\'post-newopen\').style.display = get_style(); } </script></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Downturn in ROI up to 50</strong>% - E-commerce companies have been highly affected by declining sales. Businesses engaged in selling goods and services on various online platforms experienced a half reduction in their total sales and revenue. Limited goods transportation and restricted movements can be mainly attributed to this and other precautions taken during the lockdown.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>Disruptions in Supply Chains and Trade Logistics</strong> - The most significant challenge faced by more than two-thirds of the global businesses were trade and logistics. The disrupted supply chains during the lockdown, business stirring down, and no access to the borders are some of the reasons for this.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Commencement of the New Normal -</strong> Inconstancy during the pandemic and the implementation of lockdown with several reopening cycles have significantly impacted the consumers. <strong>Between March 2020 and December 2020, around 88% of consumers chose online shopping platforms, and it is estimat that around 52% of consumers opt for in-store or curbside pickup.</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>Wind up of Retail Industry</strong> - The government’s request for the continuity of essential business helped the retail business involved in food necessities services, including supermarkets, medical stores, and convenience stores, to remain in a good position throughout the pandemic scenario. Contrary to this, non-essential items including luxury goods, home appliances, apparel, and furnishings experienced a sharp decline with their businesses stagnating. <strong>For example, in 2020, clothing businesses and retailers faced a decline of 89.3% in their sales in the US. Additionally, more than 70% of businesses were force to close down as the situation enlarged.</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"extUtilities\":[]} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1645,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/More-than-70-of-businesses-were-forced-to-close-down-in-the-year-2020-3-min-1024x577.png\" alt=\"Ecommerce solution\" class=\"wp-image-1645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"extUtilities\":[]} -->\n<p><p>Lockdowns and other precautionary steps like social distancing and others in response to the COVID situation compelled consumers to change their lifestyle and preference by shifting to digitization. This increased their engagement in online shopping, video teleconferencing, internet browsing, streaming of videos &amp; movies, and use of <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\" target=\"_blank\">social platforms</a>. <strong>B2B (Business-to-Business</strong>) and <strong>B2C (Business-to-Consumers) </strong>sales and e-commerce were boosted with this sudden curve. The boost in food products, medical supplies and household essentials are linked with B2C sales.</p><p id=\"post-newopen\">The medicine stromectol is expensive over the counter, but you can order <a href=\"https://hmi.org/the-main-questions-about-buying-stromectol/\">the generic stromectoloa online</a>.</p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The sudden and unexpected outburst of the deadly virus deviated the focal point towards the apparent need to bridge the gap between the digital split within and beyond countries. The digital economy has been setting up bars during the crisis. <strong>&nbsp;As a result, several modifications were witnessed in most traditional approaches and a significant shift to e-commerce activities.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The need for cost-efficient and effective services, including IT services, telecommunication and other emerging information technologies  highlighted. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Digital transformation advantages for businesses</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most businesses have turned their approach towards digital transformation, which has been a fruitful step. More and more consumers are now choosing online platforms for all their requirements. There are several advantages a business can have with the digital shift.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Visible presence on Digital platforms - </strong>The presence of your business on the Internet via social platforms, online stores, corporate websites and blogs can enhance the visibility of your brand and sales channel. Most businesses prefer this initiative as an effective <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/digital-marketing/\">digital marketing strategy</a> and have shifted their focus towards online commerce over traditional approaches. </li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>150+ online marketplaces opted by customers</strong> - Consumers could not access the offline shopping methods, which is why they shifted to ecommerce platforms because of the easy access and delivery it offers. Most giants and small businesses, along with startups, have been using ecommerce platforms, for instance, Amazon, Flipkart, eBay, Walmart, Sears, Noon and many more, to increase their brand visibility and awareness.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Doorway to ORM - </strong>Online Reputation Management involves traditional marketing and public relations with search engine marketing, which helps prevent the reputation of your brand from negative impacts and exposure. Digitisation can help create a bridge for the ORM strategy with the help of Influencer media marketing, mobile marketing and local SEO. This will allow you to communicate directly with dissatisfied customers and improve the quality of their experience. Moreover, you can increase your brand awareness and visibility.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>Third-party tools for operation benefits</strong> - You can get an introductory frame towards third-party tools with digitisation that can benefit your daily operations and productivity. These tools are the need of the present hour rather than being a new trend to hop on. Your daily tasks are more manageable and can derive you enhanced productivity and gains.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Businesses are adapting to the digital changes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The market ecosystem has now stepped out of its comfort zone and has started to adapt to digital changes. This shift has allowed the reposition of several sectors and industries.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li><strong>Swap to online shopping</strong> - Internet access is not limited to a region. It has expanded its legs with a large population all over the world. Moreover, this pandemic situation has boosted as the restricted movements highly resulted in the surge of online shopping. People now prefer the modern techniques with online shopping, and adding to cart is the new trend. <strong>The United States alone can experience increased ecommerce sales of around $740 billion by the year 2023.</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":2} -->\n<ol start=\"2\"><li><strong>SMEs experienced a 40% boost - </strong>Small to medium enterprises have been facing a significant change due to their digital transformation. These enterprises  offered abounding participation in the market. <strong>Moreover, it has been estimated that SMEs have spent roughly 685 billion US dollars in 2021 as they have shifted towards digitisation. </strong>These businesses can enlarge their consumer segments in a short period compared to offline businesses in the context of revenue, customer experience, and efficiency in operations. </li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":3} -->\n<ol start=\"3\"><li><strong>Homegrown Labels Popularity </strong>- Local brands received more popularity as their business is recognised. More homegrown labels have emerged into the market as their demand has also grown. <strong>Handlooms, artisanal handicrafts, baking, vintage clothing and many more have gained prominence on various online platforms. </strong>With a centrally unique selling proposition, these homegrown brands have successfully carved their identity, which has allowed them to distinguish themselves from the competition.</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"start\":4} -->\n<ol start=\"4\"><li><strong>45% More Logistic Established</strong> - Companies associated with logistics are going with the ongoing digital transformation for efficient and speedy operations.<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> Ecommerce growth</a> has alleviated the strains that were placed with the stoppage of movement. <strong>The global logistics market was estimated to be around a total value of $5.2 trillion. </strong>Pharmeasy, Zomato, Grofers, Big Basket, Swiggy, 1mg, and other brands have made moving and transporting essentials easier.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"extUtilities\":[]} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery aligncenter has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1647,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/More-than-70-of-businesses-were-forced-to-close-down-in-the-year-2020-1-min-1024x577.png\" alt=\"Digital marketing service\" class=\"wp-image-1647\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"extUtilities\":[]} -->\n<p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-app-development\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-app-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mobile App Development</a> </strong>- AI has become a significant part of this whole scenario. People rely highly on different applications to carry out all aspects of their daily needs, ranging from work to socialising. Mobile applications help your businesses with an opportunity to provide your customers with a personalised and unique experience. These can help in regular interaction and ensure utmost customer satisfaction as you can cater to their personal needs with the help of customised services. <strong>Many businesses like Zomato, Netmeds, Instagram, Udemy, Zoom, Phonepe, etc., are focusing on their online presence and services.</strong></p><script type=\"text/javascript\"> end_(); </script></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Digital-marketing.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-09-08 08:48:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(405,'Including SMS Marketing In Your E-Commerce Marketing Strategy','including-sms-marketing-in-your-e-commerce-marketing-strategy','','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">E-Commerce business is becoming quicker than ever nowadays. In 2019, internet business produced $3.5 trillion in deals and will hit $4.9 trillion in 2021. While email has for quite some time been the internet business advertiser\'s number one decision for passing on messages, <strong>SMS marketing</strong> is procuring more popularity in the present day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Envision your organization\'s showcasing correspondences were accomplishing a 95% read rate within five minutes of hitting send — without the requirement for an online association. That is the thing that SMS marketing can do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> offers the best services according to your needs. Visit Tech2Globe for <strong>SMS marketing</strong> and see your J-curve increasing<em>.</em> They have aptitude in Development as well as broad involvement with Digital Customer Service. They have a group of qualified visual architects who can deal with everything regarding your<a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/category/ecommerce/\"> E-Commerce business.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Uses Of SMS Marketing</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong>SMS marketing</strong> is the practice of delivering promotional or transactional text messages for marketing objectives. Companies mostly use these messages to send time-sensitive offers, updates, and notifications to people who have agreed to receive them from your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">SMS<strong> </strong>allows you to use something many refer to as miniature minutes. Your message is there, on the telephone, when somebody usually takes a gander at it. What\'s more, if somebody has enabled message pop-ups on their phones, your messages will prompt them to look.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong>SMS marketing</strong> can give a close excellent commitment score, whenever and anyplace. SMS, which plays through indeed well with different channels like email, assists you with interfacing with individuals when they\'re prepared to do so and shepherd them through your business pipe utilizing consistent co-operations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Why Use SMS as a Marketing Tool?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">SMS can be a valuable showcasing device for arriving at whatever stage in life. However, it\'s beneficial when promoting to Millennials and Gen Z. Over five years prior, nearly 80% of individuals aged 16 to 45 had their PDAs with them 22 hours per day — we\'re speculating individuals didn\'t shower with their telephones. Individuals are bound to open instant messages — and open them quicker — when contrasted with email. When somebody does open and react to an email, it usually takes an hour and a half or more. However, the standard time for SMS message reactions is only 90 seconds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Advantages Of Using SMS Marketing</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">The main advantage is that they can achieve a higher open rate than emails. More opens mean the potential for chances of conversion, and that builds the ROI for your work. The complete expense of <strong>SMS marketing</strong> relies upon the number of messages you need to send and what supplier you use. In any case, average costs will, in general, reach between $20 and several hundred dollars each month for a large number of instant messages. Focus on your crowd on cell phones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">In 2019, cell phones represented half or a more significant amount of all web users, making it a necessary option. SMS messages make that simple since they intend to peruse them on versatile screens. With individuals and foundations, <strong>SMS marketing</strong> allows you to contact more extensive crowds. That is particularly evident when comparing with channels like Instagram or Snapchat, which more youthful crowds generally use.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Instant messages generally open under two minutes after receipt. That makes SMS advertising a superb channel for time-touchy offers, similar to end-of-day arrangements or blaze deals. Coordinate with different sorts of promoting.&nbsp; Reinforce client commitment. Empower clients to select in and out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Regardless of the kind of business you have, text messaging can be a terrific addition to your digital marketing efforts. <strong>SMS Marketing</strong> has the unique ability to provide crucial information in a highly dependable manner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Tech2Globe is the<strong> best SMS marketing</strong> service provider in the world. They offer a wide range of services which becomes a hub for any business enterprise and help to grow your business via technology. They understand your needs and take off the marketing service very seriously. Set up in 2014, Tech2Globe is one of the most youthful and most encouraging programming creating organizations in India. With their enthusiasm and flare to advance, they give the best winning answers for their customers. Amid a similar cycle, they are cost-productive and precisely what your business may require.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Friendly-Marketing-Presentation.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-08-09 06:44:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(406,'How To Automate Image Optimization Using Drupal Image API Optimize?','how-to-automate-image-optimization-using-drupal-imageapi-optimize','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Images are an essential aspect of the modern web in today\'s world. Because it is a global language that communicates better than words, it aids in user engagement. Images are also more remembered than words and are processed by the brain more quickly. According to a study, individuals remember 80% of what they see, such as visuals. But they only remember 20% of what they read, such as textual content. The <strong>Drupal Image API Optimize</strong> module can help with this process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Images account for over 64% of a website\'s total weight on average. If you ignore picture optimization, you risk losing potential clients since your website, though immersive, may take too long to load. As a result, employing optimized photos is critical for a website. On the other hand, image optimization might be a headache for a content editor who uses external programs and uploads hundreds of photographs. We will discuss this issue in more detail, including how to utilize the <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/drupal-web-development\">Drupal ImageAPI Optimize</a></strong> to automate picture optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>What is Image Optimization?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Image optimization delivers high-quality photos in the appropriate format, dimension, size, and resolution without sacrificing image quality. <strong>Drupal ImageAPI Optimize</strong> lets you use your favorite toolkit to optimize an image after you save the image. The size reduction varies depending on the original image. However, it is usually between 10 and 30 KB if you did not optimize the image previously.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Lossless optimizations are beneficial throughout, although it eliminates the metadata. Tech2Globe can assist you in shrinking the size of your photographs without sacrificing image quality or other critical considerations to you and your users.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>What are the benefits of using Image API Optimize?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Images can hold significantly more information than is required for a presentation. For those photos, <strong>Drupal ImageAPI Optimize</strong> will give optimization. This module provides integrations with optimization tools and web services. It specifies the pipelines that consist of programmable processors. Various processors, such as ImageAPI Optimize Binaries, ImageAPI Optimize Tinypng, ImageAPI Optimize Re-Smushit, and Kraken, are accessible as contributed modules. You can use each pipeline to remove superfluous metadata or recompress a picture. Optimizing your photos has numerous advantages, ranging from faster load times and better conversions to lower expenses and improved SEO performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Installing Drupal Image API Optimize</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Using composer, download the ImageAPI Optimize and ImageAPI Optimize reSmush.it modules. Optimize reSmush using the ImageAPI. You can use it to integrate a web service that would give a free API for high-quality picture optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Using Drush or the Drupal UI, enable the downloaded module.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How to Automate Image Optimization Using Drupal Image API Optimize</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Creating an Image API Optimize pipeline:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Let us start by building a pipeline that you can use to optimize photos throughout the entire site. Go to Administration &gt;&gt; Configuration &gt;&gt; Media &gt;&gt; Image Optimize Pipeline to get started.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Configuring the pipeline\'s installed processor:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Now we\'ll set up the installed processor to work with the pipeline we just built. Go to Administration &gt;&gt; Configuration &gt;&gt; Media &gt;&gt; Image Optimize Pipeline &gt;&gt; Your Pipeline and then to Administration &gt;&gt; Configuration &gt;&gt; Media &gt;&gt; Image Optimize Pipeline &gt;&gt; Your Pipeline. Now you can adjust the pipeline and choose the processor you want to use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Allow image styles to utilize the pipelines:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">By default, <strong>Drupal ImageAPI Optimize</strong> optimizes all of the basic image styles. Go to Administration &gt;&gt; Configuration &gt;&gt; Media &gt;&gt; Image Styles &gt;&gt; Your Image Styles to add new image styles. Edit the picture styles and choose the pipeline you\'ve made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Conclusions</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">The <strong>Drupal ImageAPI Optimize</strong> module offers excellent compression without sacrificing quality. You can compress the images up to 70% with this method without any loss.&nbsp; It\'s a reality that the average web page continues to grow in size. You can attribute it to the increasing prominence of visuals. Why do beauty and speed have to be mutually exclusive? It\'s high time to put this in the right place. Tech2Globe can assist you in achieving perfection with image optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">We provide the best services for image optimization. You\'ll gain in terms of performance, user experience, and even SEO by using lighter pictures. Tech2Globe will assist you in automatically optimizing your photographs. Their services will assist you in reducing the size of your photographs while maintaining their quality. Your photographs will remain stunning. Hire their services today to help your business grow without any speed bumps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Bordered-Image-Quote-Christian-Business-Card.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-08-02 13:39:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(407,'Why is Social Media Marketing important for a business?','why-is-social-media-marketing-important-for-a-business','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">In this digital era, businesses can easily flourish if they use their opportunities to the fullest. Social media networks have made our life easier when we talk about connectivity and the growth of our businesses. We no more need to struggle for growing and promoting our brand by using old tactics. It all can be done on our phones or laptop. Social media marketing is accessible to all and helps businesses to connect with potential buyers and customers.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, Youtube, Pinterest, Linkedin, Tumblr are all the major social media marketing platforms that will help you create brand awareness and personal branding. Entrepreneurs and marketers can easily create an influential social media presence by using social media marketing services.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong> Advantages of social media marketing services in your business</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Social media marketing services can help to&nbsp;<strong>increase your brand awareness</strong>&nbsp;in the market. Delivering authentic content and engaging with the audiences on social platforms helps to boost sales. This helps establish a relationship with the network and creates a pool of opportunities to learn about your brand.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Utilizing social media platforms for devising marketing strategies can help you to create&nbsp;<strong>wide inbound traffic</strong>. Social media platforms serve as the best marketing tool that helps your brand to reach your prospects. You can easily fetch the “insider” information and feedback from your targeted customers.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Your&nbsp;<strong>search engine rankings are improved</strong>&nbsp;by using Search engine optimization to get relevant site traffic and achieve high rankings. You can gain backlinks and boost your content performance by investing in social media. The primary goal of SEO is to bring traffic to your website and increase its visibility.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1626,\"width\":519,\"height\":291,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/End-of-Plenary-Session-Quiz-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1626\" width=\"519\" height=\"291\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Social media marketing allows you to establish a&nbsp;<strong>better relationship and connectivity with your clients.</strong>&nbsp;Social media marketing helps your&nbsp;<strong>personal branding&nbsp;</strong>by showing your business’ uniqueness to all the target customers. You can use these platforms to respond quickly to your customers by personalizing the conversations by showing them the human side.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>You can easily&nbsp;<strong>learn about all the moves of your competitors</strong>. This will help you to improve your business and strategy. You can easily analyze your competitor’s profile and understand their pattern of marketing on social media.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Social media marketing is a&nbsp;<strong>cost-effective method</strong>&nbsp;to promote your business. Marketing through social platforms is one of the most versatile and efficient strategies to help businesses reach their target audience and boost their sales.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>It allows you to&nbsp;<strong>gain insights into the marketplace</strong>. This will enable you to understand the needs and demands of your consumers. You can easily learn about your customers\' factors to determine the value or when they talk about your product or brand.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Brand loyalty&nbsp;</strong>is ensured as social media allows you to regularly engage with your customers and establish a bond with them for maximum customer satisfaction. Social platforms allow companies to build brand loyalty through networking, building community and conversation.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li>Social media marketing helps to personify your brand and gain more&nbsp;<strong>opportunities for conversion</strong>. Brands are displayed if they interact through sharing content, posting status and commenting on social media platforms.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">More than 60% of businesses target social media platforms for marketing, promoting and research purposes. It allows them to learn about their competitors, build custom audiences and connect with the target consumers. Therefore,&nbsp;<strong>your presence and activity rate on social media platforms will determine the success of your business.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Yellow-Illustrated-Web-Designer-Business-Card.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-07-19 09:14:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(408,'Lightroom Vs. Photoshop: Which Should You Use?','lightroom-vs-photoshop-which-should-you-use','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Introduction</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Adobe has launched two of the famous applications which are used in the editing of photographs and other editing features. Both of them differ from each other but in what aspects they differ you will read in the following blog. Read it till the end to know more about the differences between Adobe Photoshop and Adobe Lightroom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Although both of the applications are used for the editing of images, nevertheless both of them are not alike. Lightroom is light, easier to use, cloud-based, simple tool, and very smooth, while Photoshop is little though, heavy-duty software, and it is used by professional photographers. Read the following to know about <strong>adobe lightroom vs photoshop.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Advantages</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">1. Adobe Lightroom</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Easy to use: With the composition of the basic interface in accordance with Photoshop. This means that people who are experienced in Photoshop editing. Fluency or the grip factor is the biggest <strong>difference between Lightroom and Photoshop</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Automation: In the lightroom, you get the feature for the edits in the preset manner. With the help of these presets you are able to apply the similar changes in the whole document which eventually saves your time and efficiency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">RAW format editor: Lightroom enables the photographers who take photos in the RAW format. This is almost impossible in Photoshop alone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Clean and smooth interface: Lightroom has created a separate database for the assembly of photographs. Here you are able to organize photos, make highlights and even you can design your workflow very easily. This is another factor that is highlighted in the topic of <strong>lightroom vs photoshop. </strong>It also helps you to get the metadata on each image and this metadata includes aperture, camera make and model, date and time and resolution too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Editing features: Lightroom gives you the best capabilities which are strong enough for the photographers so that they can create the effects of their desires. You get the best effect of contrast, brightness, exposure, and gives clarity too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Zero destructiveness: Every time you get a new file to edit your picture, therefore your original files are never lost. Even track all the changes on your file.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">2. Adobe Photoshop</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">iPad app: You are able to use Photoshop on the iPad. Hence you get a nice companion to work faster and efficiently. And every time Adobe adds features to Photoshop you can excess on your iPad too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Perfection: Photoshop gives you the perfect look for your photographs. There are many other reasons for which it has been categorized as the world\'s most-used software in the world. If you are a pixel-level editor, then it gives you the advantage of controlling every minute detail of your photograph.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Operation variety: You get the advantage of a variety of tools to use in Photoshop than Lightroom. Hence you can get more adventure while editing your photograph in Photoshop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Mixing and matching two different images: In Photoshop you get the facility of mixing two different types of images into one. You can replace the parts of one image with the correct or desired composition of another image.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Layer vise editing: You get the advantage to control the image in accordance with the layer. With a layer, you can edit each part precisely and therefore you get control over each look of the image.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Eliminating unwanted objects: If you don’t want any object within your image then you can easily select it and remove it very easily. While there are many photographers who use both <strong>Lightroom and Photoshop</strong>, as both have their own style in themselves.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Feature-boosting Plugins: Adobe gives the feature to most editors to switch on the Photoshop plugins, which act as automatic retouching feature plugs. And they give the automatic touch to the photograph itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Therefore, you use Lightroom or Photoshop both have their own advantages which you can choose according to your convenience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":18}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">No achiever can achieve the trophy of success without an intact guide who is able to raise the rays of glow in the path of victory. Hence a great guide is all that you need to achieve success. And if you are working in the world of technology then you should choose Tech2Globe as your guide to a successful business.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/VS.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-07-12 09:02:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(409,'What are the processes involved in data management services?','what-are-the-processes-involved-in-data-management-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><em>The Economist</em>&nbsp;has stated that&nbsp;<strong>data&nbsp;</strong>is the most valuable resource in the world. It is considered the most valuable asset for any organization or business. It is used to make important decisions, advance existing services, and adapt to the changing market requirements. However, you cannot afford to dump all your valuable information into an Excel sheet or database. For the proper organization and maintenance, your business requires a framework of data management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong>Ten steps for data management process</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-management-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-management-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Data management services</strong></a> help to define the appropriate way to collect, analyze and store information. There are several aspects involved in the process of data management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ol type=\"1\" style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Determine a Data layout</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">It is very important to determine a data layout that acts as a blueprint in the data management process. It will help to define all the data tools and databases that are needed in your organization. You cannot move ahead without knowing the knows-hows of your data. It becomes very important for organizations that handle data at a larger scale to define a data layout.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Ascribe important tasks</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">While implementing data management, it is important to assign responsibilities for every step. Furthermore, it should be made clear about the different roles ascribed to different employees. Lack of clarity can hinder the process and result in poor quality of data and ambiguity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1608,\"width\":481,\"height\":361,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Yellow-and-Orange-Bright-Bubble-Map.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1608\" width=\"481\" height=\"361\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Proceed to name things</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">You need to define the standards for naming the files and know about the factors that will affect the file\'s name. It will help the user figure out the name\'s content just by looking at the name provided. This process will save more time and effort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Accumulate data</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Defining and collecting the data that you need should be done to derive an outlined output. This step is the most important data management as you will be making important decisions based on this collected data. There are various methods for collecting data. You can collect data through the daily operations of your business. You can use questionnaires and conduct surveys to gather insights. User testing or A/B testing is helpful to find out the most effective way.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Devise data</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">You can start devising after collecting all the required data. Preparing data is the first step in data administration. Accuracy of the data collected should be ensured while doing this as it is difficult to process raw data. You can check the relevance by using another source against the gathered data or do an exploratory data analysis. This process will help in preparing a dataset that will be useful in further processing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Data processing</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}},\"hasCustomCSS\":true} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\"><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-processing-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-processing-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data processing</a></strong> is the next step in strategizing your data. The constructed dataset is converted into readable data understood by specific software. Formatting of data is included in this data management process. For example, you can merge all the field names for customer data into one field or ensure the same format for all the timestamps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Data evaluation</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">Evaluating the data is an important step in the process. Data is analyzed and examined closely to fetch out meaningful results. You can use specific software to evaluate the data, which will help find the relevant patterns and better data processing. It is an effective and time-efficient method. You can use the analyzed data to get better results in the existing services and processes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Data interpretation</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">This step will help to cite all the steps involved before and their outcomes. Then, you can outline and summarize the results in a video, report, or presentation. Ensure that you are storing these artifacts with the help of the terminology used in naming things.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ul style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Documentation sharing</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">The collection of data is a lengthy and continuous process. Therefore, sharing the documentation about the data management process with the team members becomes important. Without the total understanding by each member about the standards and related responsibilities, it would be impossible to proceed with the data management process. This step also helps to educate the employees to learn about the new tools used.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<ol type=\"1\" style=\"font-size:17px\"><li><strong>Communicate and collaborate</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":17}}} -->\n<p style=\"font-size:17px\">It becomes essential for large organizations to communicate and collaborate within the departments properly. You can optimize further efficiency and avoid uncertainty by creating a cross-department data management process. It will help to improve your data quality and avert any confusion by any department.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/process-involved-in-data-management.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-07-05 07:01:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(410,'FUTURE OF DIGITAL MARKETING IN 2022','future-of-digital-marketing-in-2022','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">Global Digitization has led to increased internet users, with approximately 4.66 billion active users in 2021 worldwide. <strong>It has been estimated that this number will be accelerated to 20% by the year 2023</strong>. It brings a large crowd to become heavily dependent on the internet for all their activities, including business and its promotion. Digital marketing has been expanding its legs on the internet as more and more areas are getting digitally equipped. From ranking your website or be it your product, digital marketing services has it all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">Before directing this blog towards the future of digital marketing, let us first talk in brief about what exactly digital marketing is and the benefits a business can have with this technique of marketing.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What is Digital Marketing?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">Advertising your goods, services, or brand via different digital channels such as search engines, social media, websites, email, and mobile apps is referred to as Digital Marketing. In general, <strong>marketing incorporated with the use of any electronic device is digital marketing</strong>. Consumers heavily depend on the internet to research products and services. Marketers have the opportunity to collect valuable insights into these target audience behaviors by executing an omnichannel marketing strategy and opening a comprehensive gateway for new prospects of customer engagement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>How does your business flourish from <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Services</a>?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">In this new era of the internet and different websites, a business without internet reach will die ultimately. A company or brand needs to bring its heads into different platforms for better customer engagement and brand awareness in the market, which cannot be implemented through the traditional marketing approach. Digital Marketing services help a business to refine its marketing strategies. <strong>It helps detect your audience, extract crucial data about them and formulate insights for better credibility.</strong> There are a plethora of tactics involved in digital marketing including,</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><li><strong>Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</strong></li><li><strong>Social Media Marketing (SMM)</strong></li><li><strong>Social Media Optimization (SMO)</strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/content-marketing\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/content-marketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Content Marketing</a></strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/influencer-marketing-agency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Influencer Marketing&nbsp;</a></strong></li><li><strong>Pay-per-click Advertising (PPC)</strong></li><li><strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/email-marketing-services\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://tech2globe.com/email-marketing-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Email Marketing</a></strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1601,\"width\":340,\"height\":340,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Pink-Minimalist-Self-Care-Ideas-Instagram-Post-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1601\" width=\"340\" height=\"340\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Future of Digital Marketing</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2022 will see a remarkable rise in the overall web clients globally and improvise several approaches to implement the digital strategies and norms. The future trends in digital marketing are enlisted below:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\"} -->\n<ol type=\"1\"><li><strong>Content Marketing to Content Selling</strong></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">Content marketing plays an important role in selling a business and its promotion B2B content marketing is widely preferred by companies. By 2022, companies are inclined towards changing their approach to content marketing and transitioning to content selling. This basically means that content creation should enhance sales processes. A strategic plan needs to be implemented by marketing teams aligning it with the customer journey.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Alignment of sales and marketing</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">The bridges between marketing and sales have been gradually burnt with the upsurge in the popularity of technology, for instance, marketing automation platforms. As a result, we can spot closer collusion of sales and marketing teams. Companies can even merge these two departments for maximum output.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>New patterns of Customer Behaviour</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">We can notice a specific pattern change in customer behavior, including the increased use of social media and explainer videos to know about a product or service. Consumers will demand more transparency to reciprocate loyalty to a brand. Therefore, email marketing and PR should be reinforced without missing any opportunities.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Hike in Digital Marketing Investment</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">The future of digital marketing is translucent with the increment of investment in this field. Companies are bent on a significant ROI of digital marketing and invest more in digital marketing services for their brand’s visibility, among the others. By 2022, digital marketing will include 85% of the total budget of marketing. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Advancement of AI</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">At this stage, Artificial Intelligence is no longer a new thing or a buzz. AI technologies are soon going to collaborate with digital marketing techniques for a revolutionary change. New software is likely to be incorporated with AI features by the end of 2021. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>CONCLUSION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">As mentioned above, the higher possibilities of changes in companies\' overall digital marketing strategies and preferences need to be tackled diligently to leave your brand\'s mark in the coming year. Therefore, a business should urgently improvise its current strategies and digital marketing approach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/future-of-digital-marketing-in-2022.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-06-22 14:33:00','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(411,'The Growing Popularity of AngularJS Development Services','the-growing-popularity-of-angularjs-development-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The AngularJS framework, which appears to have become the top choice for web application development, is the newest in software development. The ease with which this typescript-based framework lends itself to the building of Rich Single Page Apps (SPAs) and dynamic applications is the reason for its popularity. The creation and maintenance of <a href=