arget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">eCommerce Development</a></strong> is to have a simple but responsive design that provides a seamless and error-free digital experience. The design for your WordPress should consider all the factors of user experience including the kind of device they use, its screen size, its operating system, the type of browser the user is searching from, and much more. Tech2globe can help you choose a responsive theme for your WordPress and ultimately save your maintenance costs as well the time you would have spent on dealing with issues related with website designing.  </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":488,\"height\":378} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/84j0TZUMeUP9lFCmTKrUYUbb1KA5nLtam3hk5umqctna0ewsycPoYwJYV2JMvSYGNuM4mCBg_iuSpgeJZ4gptJtduvaYJinp7MPylke5YWm3tec2tmFS9mTTm5zHtQ\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"378\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Payment Gateway</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The whole idea of how successful an <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">eCommerce store</a></strong> will get revolves around how secure and convenient their payment options are. The payment gateways you choose to incorporate in your website must make sure that it protects your customers as well as your business from chances of fraud, ensures that the transaction is legitimate and occurs properly, and also, keep the customer’s information and personal details safe. Tech2globe can properly integrate different payment gateways in your WordPress eCommerce site and provide optimal user experience for your customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":520,\"height\":292} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/TAEW9a-HE0fxnwrfsBTmrW5eL-RsN5R1TPXh6QEs2AL7FloGGuS_n_knN0R_eZ2_SupK1FZAHRdbzx8dpK7sp0_dY7-7EEtYlxGTemWb86MJEDT7_24TPymUa9_S0w\" alt=\"\" width=\"520\" height=\"292\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>SEO</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even with the best designs in your WordPress and impressive products of your business, if users cannot find your website or do not know about it, you will not see growth in your business as you had probably expected. SEO increases visibility for your website and gives your business the needed exposure for better sales. Our team can tailor an <strong>SEO strategy</strong> that is catered to your business’ needs, target audience, market, and competitors. While there are several SEO plugins available for your WordPress, hiring a professional to optimize your website has a more prominent effect on its performance than any plugin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Tax and Shipping</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ECommerce becomes more and more complicated as your business grows and the area that you have to ship your products to gets bigger and bigger. Taxes for different regions differ and so do the charges for shipping for each nation. Calculating such extensive shipping charges and tax costs can be easily done with the help of numerous plugins that WordPress supports. These plugins can solve complicated issues without any hassles. Make sure that you check a few of them out before deciding on one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":514,\"height\":312} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/LxWoVd3nfapVJ0lIs5Kv8uu_m5QP1d1xH72QxnI6nbwBmdgvQsp6NQ1uHeRZeyXS74fjATTzFQGVQ2Ouaa2FTgQ0J0FM1v6KAGo4V-hHF1bFOzg0PVZfjmB7ymlO4w\" alt=\"\" width=\"514\" height=\"312\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong><br></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The ideal tool in any digital commerce strategy has always been WordPress. While there are many ecommerce sites for you to choose from, WordPress is one of the best ones out of them for quite a few good reasons. To begin with, WordPress is free to use, and for the ones who need to upgrade, it has reasonable rates according to the type of update the user needs. With a user-friendly interface and developer-friendly tools, WordPress can be the quintessential platform for your ecommerce website. We at Tech2globe<strong> </strong>can help your business reach the full potential by guiding you through the process of <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/wordPress-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WordPress</a> <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/e-commerce-development\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">eCommerce Development</a></strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/wordpress-ecommerce-development-considerations-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-05-19 16:25:18','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(423,'Covid Pandemic, Mobile App Development, and A Silver Lining of Opportunities','covid-pandemic-mobile-app-development-and-a-silver-lining-of-opportunities','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s take a look back at the first seven months of 2020! An unexpected and unwanted visitor marked the beginning of a new chapter of our lives. The Coronavirus, of course! The virus spread like wildfire, with negative consequences in almost every country on the planet. In most countries, social distancing standards were implemented, and a lockout was implemented. COVID-19 has been around for about eleven months, and we are still fighting the pandemic. A huge number of people have already been infected with the virus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The COVID-19 crisis has resulted in more than just a health tragedy. Our general life has also been sucked up as a result of it. Many of us have been confined to our homes in recent months. Many of our daily habits came to a halt, including dining out, shopping, exercising, and traveling. While the virus is increasingly becoming a part of a new routine, there is still a long way to go until it is fully recovered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mobile apps are among the most dependable warriors in our battle against COVID-19. Mobile applications and new networking technologies provided by Tech2Globe give a silver lining during the dark days. The majority of <strong>mobile app development companies </strong>believe that mobile applications have helped to alleviate the Corona chaos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":570,\"height\":381} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/X0t0SDPsUbSoDrkX9Ps8Jy7VZBr2D33bdNj1Wea6ttZw6hcA4Ft1fMUnRKe7FamEifAtioQRAwdvIikyVUYNMF8HS08v-1N2XqHXxMym6CsQ_COqGXBrZD70zW1KUQ\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"381\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Contract testing with the help of mobile apps</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The government has received a lot of help from mobile applications in many parts of the world to monitor the COVID-19 situation. Many health authorities recommend contact tracing apps as a common medium. These apps assist in determining each individual\'s health status in any given location. Keeping track of app users who may have come into contact with an infected person is beneficial to health workers. The apps are simple to use and can be used to get COVID-19 updates from any place.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>It helps in tracking the patients</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is impossible to treat any patient in hospitals as the number of infected cases grows. Many patients who have only minor symptoms are confined to their homes. To keep track of such patients, medical professionals use IoT-based applications and computers. Daily reports of such patients\' health vitals are readily accessible to doctors. The risk of infection for medical personnel is also reduced when patients are monitored remotely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":525,\"height\":320} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/TqKcKZrQp59TXoXVYA06TgapA1czBnYZhOCczXvFCSAKovtDK-womY3lQu7Xk8o6cojl7-pmKYreEtZD3arlx075ENSZq_oDuCQi3tz4UnM1L3dJKlbgGjxOhXjERA\" alt=\"\" width=\"525\" height=\"320\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Learning spirit with the e-learning apps</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>COVID-19 has forced most countries\' schools and colleges to remain closed. E-learning applications like Udemy, Coursera, Google Classroom, and others, on the other hand, were our instructors. To perform virtual classrooms for pupils, educational institutions are using video conferencing and e-learning software. Many people are turning to e-learning software to make better use of their spare time at home by learning new skills and information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":556,\"height\":292} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/3SmNOBcgR-Df961Na1PjmiGKSru8yG_hZKjLIg0SUtTX0vj8xS2fq3MKOFxw97d_N0Btn1T094qJ9mglfVAdabPEjrCcJfh2b_Sic5eKoH3nr9gZz7yQPrq22OUeGg\" alt=\"\" width=\"556\" height=\"292\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Food delivery apps help in quick deliveries</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Food lovers may not be able to visit their favorite restaurants and cafés due to the courtesy of COVID-19. However, the food from those establishments will undoubtedly be delivered to their homes. Apps for food distribution have seen a significant increase in popularity. Uber Eats, DoorDash, and GrubHub are just a few of the many apps that allow us to enjoy our favorite cuisines from the comfort of our own homes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1405,\"width\":572,\"height\":321,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/movie-apps-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"movie-apps\" class=\"wp-image-1405\" width=\"572\" height=\"321\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Enjoying favorite movies on mobile streaming</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During the entire duration of the pandemic, video streaming apps have seen a surge in demand. Netflix, Disney+ Hotstar, and Amazon Prime have all become the most common entertainment options. People are binge-watching shows using streaming software. The corona crisis has been made a bit more bearable thanks to these applications. According to a report, the COVID-19 outbreak generated 20% of revenue for media streaming apps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>The messaging apps keep the bonds intact with loved ones.</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The majority of people stayed away from their families during the lockdown. They couldn\'t even catch up with their families. Facebook, Instagram, and WhatsApp have all become trusted platforms for communicating with loved ones. Many lonely, housebound souls are finding comfort in these applications. Digital connectivity remains unaffected, giving people hope in these trying times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":580,\"height\":326} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/XfEGqpHYPllphiv5Xjc74oS823-OumiWb3TXPLmbYQrLVbDISydGrvpGHI1-xUhRD3ylbauLnINB8srWfnkAtGUiaXzgTslXVyvwCvDhV9MEUTPKP94y0WK6PIA0kQ\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through the development of legendary <strong>mobile applications</strong>, Tech2globe continues to improve the lives of smartphone users. We are excited to be able to assist more organizations with the deployment of superior mobile apps to meet their various needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/TrackTrace.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-05-18 08:46:50','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(424,'How To Track Employee Performance The Right Way?','how-to-track-employee-performance-the-right-way','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have you ever used the expression \"you don\'t know until you know\"? They hold a lot of truth for such an obnoxious collection of terms, particularly when it comes to monitoring employee performance and productivity at your company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Measuring how well the team performs is more than just eye-opening: it\'s critical to the company\'s success. What\'s the connection between your employees\' training metrics and their productivity? What was the effectiveness of their training? How long would it take to completely integrate a new employee? Is it true that more experienced workers are putting in extra effort and progressing over time? Efficient <strong>employee performance monitoring</strong> from tech2globe will address both of these questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":509,\"height\":285} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/b_7baYj1iwUtbpI3rHUqEqEvXS7WyohPAy8IXbCssqV1mJ3g8bVdy4ALBCAXWB1eW8Q6_uY2fSEtqOz6JkqpkS7WK2Y3vhtgCQtEhsoP9Apz4wRE-L8W4HA9m1Hrqw\" alt=\"\" width=\"509\" height=\"285\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>First set your goals</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>First and foremost, do your workers understand what is expected of them? Overall efficiency and output will suffer if this is not done. In addition to ensuring that each employee knows their high-level job description, make sure they understand exactly what is required of them within each project, including strict deadlines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another way to ensure that the workers know exactly what they\'re going to be doing is to have them sign a contract. Encourage them to set personal goals for themselves, along with a timetable for achieving each one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Keep your long term and short term goals clear</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short-term task completion and long-term success are the most important performance measures, with the latter painting a more striking image of true effects. Find an online portal that allows you to easily monitor short- and long-term objectives, such as individual KPIs that can rise or fall over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The online training software makes it simple to assess each employee\'s effect, especially in relation to the training they\'ve undergone. The platform allows users to compare specific KPIs with key training statistics to quickly assess the connection between training and business results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":508,\"height\":285} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/qMcD0RttaqpPLyHcfuo6TpBQuLLC96tVmF2n5n3maSM-Ehyz9D7XZuKMbYUc3IkTQKS0ABoUY7bxLSdOfRJtPSUlzS0iL-oZoepUbnZ3y2ugDJKvdfwyMFzI8BwApQ\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"285\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Research from the past</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One smart way to monitor employee performance is to start with the customer and work backwards. Identifying what prompted them to use (and continue to use) your product or service might reveal which employees were responsible for bringing in (and keeping) the customer. This data can also be supplemented with input from co-workers. But be cautious! Take employee input with a grain of salt because it could be distorted or subjective due to personal or relational issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":488,\"height\":324} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/r2_-HdNNr6LXxHtbKkEVNTW9zcPrkTMU0afhGAi81JNYLNzrSMOgpyhZLYmCIi1qMKNkAk7OdKVbzwBRZThHPeaLokBFD45fhxIXGAlMnqwbAh4ZwjwfvarwgSDrsA\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"324\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Mark them on performance basis parameters</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your team can appear to be performing well and at breakneck pace according to performance metrics, but do your profit margins reflect this? It\'s important to equate your employees\' productivity to your total income on a regular basis because, at the end of the day, this is what matters most. Keeping a close eye on high-level business success will help you avoid the temptation to micromanage and monitor every small detail that occurs on a daily basis.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":492,\"height\":328} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/xyKmSLpnMf96XSKd0538RDV5j4dkVqkiHxvs2aB4L97o_gmSCQ2rFN8BNVYCH2pNiOkvoApnl2UP8QpP8wJoybJo_eyo-cRJt7FOe3h9QXYhdlb4v13G5NwZeOso0w\" alt=\"\" width=\"492\" height=\"328\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Check in regularly</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s important to check in with each of your team members on a regular basis, whether in person or through the use of employee training or coaching apps. Although once a week is the perfect pace, make sure to do it at least once a month. Inquire about the particular project they\'re working on, if they need additional support, and whether they\'re experiencing any issues or difficulties, and have them include a very direct, informative, and explicit response about their progress on the project. Another option is to make each employee submit an end-of-week report on their accomplishments for the week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>You must value smart work</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many businesses, especially young startups, are beginning to take the phrase \"work the job, not the clock\" to its logical conclusion. Tracking job completion, milestones, and deadlines is now the rule, rather than logging minutes and hours. Is the work getting done? This is the most important question to ask (and track).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many successful companies are discovering that it is less important how, where, or where tasks are performed (at the workplace, at home, in a café), and more important that they are completed and results are achieved. This sense of independence is enabled by using an online task platform with mobility and versatility.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":508,\"height\":337} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/sjxFQSMauab5Wada6JwBbYmYveC2QhQbPETZ-nQII9x1gJ145jz6OiFO85DLJL9CqGc30OZX_lKHG253K8-Wc386-GxT8yKpfu-liLvmW1FDccFCblsOadt_0gDA9Q\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"337\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t be so preoccupied with monitoring your employees\' success that you forget to give them an opportunity to test you and your management skills. Offer each member of your team the opportunity to describe what they think of their jobs, work conditions, resources, training, and so on, whether in person or through an online survey. This information can then be compared to their own performance statistics to provide an objective and eye-opening image. If you feel like you are having issues then tech2globe can be your best companion.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Untitled-1-1-1024x538-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-05-17 06:27:36','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(425,'Three Most Coveted Amazon Badges & The Secret Recipe To Get Them','three-most-coveted-amazon-badges-the-secret-recipe-to-get-them','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you planning to shop online but are not feeling comfortable in placing your order? There are a lot of times this happens with many of us. We like a product, but then suddenly we think that getting it delivered might not be a good option as no one knows what will be the quality of the product. This leads to the customers losing interest in a brand.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you want to <strong>keep your customers connected</strong> and give them the best services to trust you need to make sure that<strong> you have the badge </strong>that <strong>makes you a verified and reliable seller.</strong> If you are a seller, you need to understand that badges\' importance plays a vital role. It helps your customers understand that you are a reliable businessman, and they can shop with your brand without giving it another thought.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":633,\"height\":329} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/6qab6T2E4--cLSVO6kZxyP-p5dIlV22trhu680UjlUhOTSMNA-3VPi0nKO1SoMo0whptC1HpfJ6M1XCFMipeDXfl9-Id5lqwfiyrD830WDDZ5w-3VMKK1pcMO4Vw2Q\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"329\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>A<strong>mazon\'s choice badge</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2015, Amazon unveiled the Amazon\'s Choice badge to make voice shopping with Alexa more convenient. When Alexa is asked to do a voice search, she will reveal matching items already in the shopper\'s order history or items with the Amazon\'s Choice badge. You will be Amazon\'s Option for a particular keyword. You need to keep in mind that this badge is keyword-specific. You can, for example, be Amazon\'s first option for \"Milton bottles\" rather than \"water bottles\" – or you can be for both keywords.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>What is the criteria for getting the badge?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Low Return Rate: Compared to equivalent goods, there are 53 percent fewer returns.</li><li>High Review Rate: More than 80% of people gave it a high rating. Reviews between 4 and 5 stars</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Interested in the badge? Here is how you can get it</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There have already been questions about the algorithm used and the conditions that must be met to get the Amazon\'s Choice sticker on a page. \"Amazon\'s Choice\" recommends high-quality, well-priced brands that are ready to ship instantly, according to Amazon.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1382,\"width\":512,\"height\":348,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/jpg-amazon-bestseller-500x340-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1382\" width=\"512\" height=\"348\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>The best seller badge</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are the most favorite one of many out there, you need to earn this badge. It is a game of winning reviews and getting the maximum stars so that your products are purchased and liked by most of the audience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Best Seller badge is given to the most popular items in a given category or subcategory, as the name implies. A segment will include up to 100 best-selling brands. Since any shopper will probably prefer to buy a product that sells better, brands with the Best Seller badge would appear first in organic search results and will get the most exposure relative to other items.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The more rating you get and the better keywords you use will automatically increase your organic ranks and will get to a lot of sellers. You need to keep in mind that you do not run out of stock else you will lose the race.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>What is the criteria for getting this badge?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Use appropriate keywords: Yes! Just like your website needs keywords to grow, the same way your amazon pages also need keywords to get ranked.&nbsp;</li><li>Attention of people: Run campaigns and get noticed by many buyers out there to increase your chances of giving a sale.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Want to know how to get this badge? Read on</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s as simple as that: <strong>boost your sales</strong>. But saying it is better than doing it. The Amazon Best Sellers calculation is based on Amazon purchases and is updated hourly to represent recent and historical sales of any item sold on Amazon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Boost your organic rating and conversion rate by fine-tuning your page with Amazon Listing Optimization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shift the category to something more unique. Since the competition is smaller, this will improve the odds of receiving the badge for that category.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":455,\"height\":267} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/J-sqqXHh8wyFk40Ga1XlWikZ6TP7B4toFhy-eidI5n7BpCn505TL9VN-5r1kvY4uuItdoY86NjV1ZkU-5BZBIWreqtW6VJnaE6UbBs8-hcpm1vTdbn9dFaIGKr4wkg\" alt=\"\" width=\"455\" height=\"267\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>New release badge</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The \"Fresh Release\" badge is for new Amazon retailers, and its primary aim is to attract shoppers\' interest to new product releases. It\'s free for the first 90 days after you list the item and begin the sale. Like the Best Seller badge, this pin is prominently displayed on the search result page and the product description page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>How to get the badge?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While Amazon has not yet included any clear guidelines for earning the #1 New Release sticker, there are a few tips that will help you improve your chances:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>For the main keyword, your product should be on page one.</li><li>The best keyword, material, and, most notably, Amazon infographic photos should all be included in your listing.</li><li>You can sell more units than the category\'s bestseller.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While acquiring one of Amazon\'s badges seems to be an exhausting mission, it is eventually worthwhile. These seals of approval signify high-quality and reliable goods to customers. As a result, <strong>every product bearing these badges stands out from the crowd and receives higher click-through and conversion rates</strong>. Congratulations on your achievement. The cornerstone in obtaining every sticker, be it Amazon\'s Choice, Best Seller, or New Release, is Amazon SEO.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Badges-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-05-14 08:00:16','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(426,'Ultimate Amazon Product Listing Optimization Guide 2021','ultimate-amazon-product-listing-optimization-guide-2021','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re an Amazon vendor, you\'ll definitely need to build an integrated Amazon product listing at some point. This may be for a private label item, a new retail arbitrage item, or a one-of-a-kind kit. Brand lists that are both insightful and convincing will help you maximise revenue and enhance your product rating.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you shop on Amazon often, you\'ve certainly seen instances of bad product listings from which you can learn. Keyword-stuffed names, perplexing photos, and mediocre product descriptions are all common product listing mistakes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When we think back on Amazon\'s Marketplace launch in 2000, we\'re always surprised by how many individuals it helped become full-fledged eCommerce entrepreneurs. Amazon has undeniably been a driver for eCommerce\'s growth, from stay-at-home parents with small companies to household names whom people have grown to know and enjoy. The Marketplace now has 2.5 million sellers due to the success of <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon SEO</a></strong> as an important advertisement driver for targeting consumers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1369,\"width\":491,\"height\":264,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Screenshot-1-1024x551.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1369\" width=\"491\" height=\"264\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Amazon optimization</strong> listing&nbsp; includes creating a tailored product listing that draws viewers, increases conversions, and eventually increases revenue. It is necessary, though, to recognize that Amazon and Google are different organizations. In other words, for the latter, the optimization technique you use is different and the other way round.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon is a closed-off site that is a digital marketplace without any external influence. Sellers, therefore, ought to develop a<strong> customized Amazon listing</strong> approach to optimize their products to get top search results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":742,\"height\":194,\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-SlcooaN_o6QqtcRa5d9QaqvybzZRS20efay0sabbbAy0v3soogQYy-CXO29Dbarft7dB2yXq27SOaHlJyTNWpoJSlW4zEbMH_F10-dKHS2_O3akOJ8Hs3IF487eZw\" alt=\"Amazon SEO\" width=\"742\" height=\"194\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>What is Amazon SEO?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Buyers also do not look through the first search results page. You need a powerful arsenal to stand out as a company owner and earn additional profits with the market full of promises and competition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It means that you have to refine your search listings. It\'s the SEO of Amazon. It <strong>structures a product listing</strong> so that the right audience is attracted, conversions increment, and sales increment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>How to&nbsp;Optimize Amazon Listing in 2021?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To increase sales on Amazon, you should be both competitive and wise. By enhancing product listings with Tech2globe, you must update your marketing strategy. Here are a few tips and tricks to encourage and optimize conversion opportunities for your brand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":578,\"height\":281} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/Nz0xjjuTW3bsVnsR_vvHMESBdhRCHnIYLnjtQOp4MuvZaU6Q8gbVi_T9MYY1O5YnmlFc1OZMAbda-UYQ9bPLfaDO22mho-jGOq59t5-GONDG4-1aJKVy7uzb8BTKVQ\" alt=\"Amazon Product titles\" width=\"578\" height=\"281\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Focus on Product Title</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s the first thing that consumers discover as they browse a catalog of their brands. Amazon offers<strong> 250 characters</strong> to most categories of the product names. You would intelligently use all the characters to make the most of it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Some key things to remember for someone looking to improve their product\'s name:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><em>Primary keyword included</em><strong>:</strong> The product title must have keywords attracting the consumers\' interest. You should add 1-3 keywords in your title that match the sentence you create.</li><li><em>Write for existing customers</em>: Don\'t add to the title having too many keywords. Be careful and pick the products specific.</li><li><em>Add Right Information</em>: attributes and information to the heading should use. Consider the lines of details you want to see in your product search. It can include color, size, model, brand, quantity, respectively.</li><li><em>Mention your product USP</em>: Enter product-specific information, details that differentiate you from your rival. Think of your audience and how your product can be bought..</li><li><em>Brand Name mention</em>: this helps attract repeat buyers who recognize your product and are prepared to buy from you again.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":585,\"height\":305} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UjKAhRPxgrSngSv0IHt33DHIfboHXOBa0X72Ih_1rUugHTHBppyuBPbp4wre1_83VztMNXbo9NtCYtpIJIE5LXBvrAijeWlI7gia-LHdrNfsU5JM5Lno60maXauOLg\" alt=\"Amazon Seo\" width=\"585\" height=\"305\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Optimize Product Description</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It&nbsp;is the segment where you can <strong>read more about your product</strong>. You get 2000 words from Amazon to carefully clarify why your product is special and superior to other products. Some rules to maximize this area are given here that Tech2globe and help you with:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><em>Use Minimal Keywords</em>: in summary, you should apply keywords to them, but don\'t use too many, or you may not read them properly.&nbsp;</li><li><em>Use bullet points</em>: Break down information into bullet points that you\'d like to reveal. You can read and search even better. The customer can see the details quicker and is more informed about purchasing.</li><li><em>Creating A narrative story</em>: a story about the product or the brand may also reveal. Using brief phrases and paragraphs for that purpose.</li><li><em>Add correct details</em>: see your product summary as specifics about your product\'s simulated packaging. Explain all the right product styles, models, and specifications information.</li><li><em>Keep it simple</em>: Do not go into particulars too much and aim instead to clarify why and how the product can change your life.&nbsp;</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":518,\"height\":389} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/iblXZHCWLUtM33mvkrMlAZjuxPESIKUj9iT1WzWqY8oBC4BfTiuTOGiUpaz5P0p3bc4blofg95wi2gpxi2Ac3Oe0dkbrKWO5yGSWyKkRlSfsvQBK5n6yxXiVYxiYqw\" alt=\"Amazon Product Listing and image boost\" width=\"518\" height=\"389\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Use High-Quality Images and Videos</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A customer does not touch products personally as shops on-line. The advertising photos can grab the eye of consumers and <strong>enable them to display the product</strong> with their hands. They will also fully display the product, allowing them to understand what the product is.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Amazon product listing optimization</strong> is like tuning the website for Google to be better. If you find it difficult, you should choose to hire <strong>Amazon SEO specialists</strong> from Tech2globe to optimize your product listing. We will help you gain some main tips and tricks to increase your purchase orders, improve sales and broaden your market.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/ZSKcF8q-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-05-13 11:31:39','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(427,'Top Selling Items on Amazon India in 2021','top-selling-items-on-amazon-india-in-2021','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s a little difficult to figure out what to sell on Amazon in 2021. Because no one knows how the coronavirus pandemic will play out, shoppers will not spend as much money on personal items or gifts. Given the rapid growth of the e-commerce industry, finding the <strong>best-selling product on amazon, India</strong> becomes extremely difficult. We\'ve included some <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/portfolio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">highest selling products for the amazon marketplace</a></strong> that produce good profits for their sellers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Toys and Games:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Toys &amp; Games continues to be one of the <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">most popular product categories on Amazon today</a>. It\'s no surprise that it consistently ranks at the top of best-seller lists. This category has a lot of potential because kids are one of the most excessive market customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, since it is a dynamic category, it is critical to stay updated with current fads. Gaming accessories, video games, cricket bats, golf balls, chess, ludo, brain games, learning games, and other games are all popular children\'s choices. As a result, it\'s essential to customize the Amazon store with trendy, educational, and innovative games to ensure a high return on investment (Return On Investment).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Also Read:</span></strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/what-is-amazon-enhanced-brand-content-and-how-sellers-can-access-to-it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Looking to improve your Amazon Product Listings, and get access of Amazon Enhanced Brand Content.</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Camera &amp; Photo Accessories:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The digital camera industry has risen to prominence due to the growing <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/image-photo-editing-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">popularity of Amazon photography</a> and its promotion on social media. On the other hand, demand has been supported by apps and <a href=\"https://zphotoedit.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">services photo editors</a>. At the moment, interchangeable lens cameras have a significant influence on this market. While DSLR camera sales fell by 9%, non-reflex bodies (rangefinders, compact cameras, and mirrorless cameras) saw a 50.6 percent increase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Books:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Of course, we live in a digital age, but that doesn\'t mean \"hardcover books\'\' are obsolete. They are timeless classics that will continue no matter how digitized the world becomes. Unless you\'re a bookworm, you won\'t learn.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are more readers in the world than one might imagine, so it\'s no surprise that physical books sell not only well but also consistently rank among <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/portfolio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon\'s best-selling products by categories</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Clothes, Shoes, and Jewelry:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If categories like clothes, jewelry, and shoes aren\'t included, the list of Amazon\'s best-selling products is incomplete. They are one of the reasons for Amazon\'s extraordinary revenue. Clothing is one of the most basic needs in a person\'s life, so it has taken up too much space in terms of revenue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Also Read:</span></strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/9-predictions-for-amazon-in-2021/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">09 predictions of Amazon in 2021</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Beauty And Personal Care:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Men and women alike search out natural products to integrate into their daily skincare routines. It\'s no surprise that the beauty industry is one of the most powerful retail market forces, both offline and online. This domain has a lot of interest, but people are buying it from a reputable source.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon is a dominant retailer of beauty products, like any product category. Although they are among <a href=\"https://www.junglescout.com/jungle-scout-top-10000-product-ideas-for-amazon-sellers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amazon\'s best-selling products</a> and revenue-generating categories, quality and safety are essential.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Home and Kitchen Furnishing:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The overall demand for home décor and kitchenware is expected to skyrocket in the coming years, with the furniture and home market expected to cross 40,000 crores by 2020. The mass interest in all of these services from an online marketplace has grown significantly in a short period due to higher interior design innovation and the continued development of newer and more exquisite furniture designs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Home Appliances:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Microwaves, washing machines, vacuum cleaners, food processors, and many other household appliances are available on online marketplaces such as Amazon. Home appliances are sure to remain a stable fixture on every list of trending products in 2020 due to easy purchasing and delivery options creating growing interest.<strong> </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Also Read:</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/ecommerce-seo-services-for-your-ecommerce-store/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> Ecommerce SEO - Best practices for your ecommerce store</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Home Fitness:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When spring arrives, people begin to remember that summer is around the corner and that summer means going to the beach and wearing revealing clothes such as swimsuits. People who are short on time begin searching the internet for home exercise equipment and gadgets in a last-ditch effort to get in shape for beach season.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Conclusion:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amazon, without question, has the most <strong>seller registration on easy cart</strong> strategies for making its goods sell. When consumers check out their items from the cart, Amazon shows a section called – Customers who purchased it also bought – that shows a few items that complement the ones being considered by the buyer. Tech2Globe has a best Amazon marketplace team that works hard to deliver best solutions to our clients that ensures the timely execution of projects and a collective effort to form long lasting relations with clients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/TOP-SELLING-ITEMS-ON-AMAZON-INDIA-in-2021.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-04-22 14:15:12','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(428,'April Fools’ Day: Origins & 5 Facts about April Fools’ Day that you didn’t know','april-fools-day-facts-and-origin','','<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1322,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/April-Fools-Day-1024x532.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1322\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is Fools’ Day! April Fools’ Day also know as All Fools’ Day celebrated on every April 1<sup>st</sup> which means it is the day when you set some pranks on others and crack jokes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Its exact origins remain a mystery, we are going to embrace the light in hope to find the origin of April Fools’ Day by the media, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Main_Page\">Wikipedia</a> and different sources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Origins of April Fools’ Day</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to the <a href=\"https://www.history.com/topics/holidays/april-fools-day\">History.com</a>, <em>Some historians speculate that April Fools’ Day dates back to 1582, when France switched from the Julian calendar to the&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://www.history.com/news/6-things-you-may-not-know-about-the-gregorian-calendar\"><em>Gregorian calendar</em></a><em>, as called for by the Council of Trent in 1563. In the Julian Calendar, as in the Hindu calendar, the new year began with the spring equinox around April 1.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And people who did not have any idea about the new year had shift to the January 01 and celebrate it during through April 01 became the butt of jokes and hoaxes and were called “April Fools”.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wikipedia has their own version of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/April_Fools%27_Day\">the origin of April Fools’ Day</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Read more:</span></strong> <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/what-key-areas-to-consider-before-starting-dropshipping-business-in-2021/\" target=\"_blank\">Start your own Dropshipping business and earn</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>5 Facts about April Fools’ Day</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1323,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/April-Fools-Facts-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1323\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong><em>Fact #1:</em></strong> Many countries celebrate April Fools’ but in a different style.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Russia, they have different version to celebrate this day, tossed person from the Palace Bridge into the River Neva. If the person survives, pulled-out, given a paper crown and a penny whistle, tossed again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong><em>Fact #2:</em></strong> Fools’ Mail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Google Mail was launched at the April 1<sup>st</sup>, 2004 and as it offered the super-cool mailing features that consider as a prank.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Also Read:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/ecommerce-seo-services-for-your-ecommerce-store/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ecommerce SEO: Best practise for your ecommerce store</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong><em>Fact #3:</em></strong> Scotland 2 days of celebration</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Scotland, the April Fools’ Day celebrated for 2 days which is called “hunting the gowls”. They’ve used the “Gowks” words for the people who are the victims of the pranks, means a cuckoo-symbol for fool. On the second day, pranks involve the backside which is might be the origin of “kick me” sign.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong><em>Fact #4:</em></strong> Korean Celebrations</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>April 1<sup>st</sup>; it’s the only day when Korean Royal Family is allowed to lie and set pranks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong><em>Fact #5:</em></strong> Unpredictable Weather</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was also linked to the first day of spring, when the weather is unpredictable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/April-Fools-Day.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-04-01 12:34:20','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(429,'Brief Knowledge About Data Conversions','brief-knowledge-about-data-conversions','','<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1332,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Data-Conversions.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1332\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Conversion of documents and data to a digital format and structure is the procedure to create and compile information and data which are mainly organised, kept as stored and provided without using a paper.  Software of digital document allows you for converting paper formed documents into digital documents easily. At the Rely Services the first thing which is done is the analysis of the Data Needs and is presented with a detailed elaborated plan to, set index, image, and to project the management and at the same time eliminate all the worries about the qualities of the completed products, costs that are hidden, and project status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-conversion-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">professionals data conversation agents</a> know the data conversion and management of documents inside and out, this way experts work attentively from day one. <strong>Data conversion</strong> is a proper effective path to manage  and convert data and information, where organisations do systemize their information and convert them to a structure, which are used across variety of platforms. The procedure is about converting the data from one medium (paper) to another (digital) to involve unique demands of various organisations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Also Read:</span></strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/outsource-data-entry-service-for-business-growth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best ways to outsource data entry to a remote service provider: How it fuels the business growth?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Services of Outsourcing Data Conversation:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/tips-to-efficiently-outsourcing-e-commerce-product-data-entry-services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Outsource Data Conversion Services</strong> </a>are Collecting, analysing, storing, distributing, and using data is now a digital process. Today’s business world runs on digital. Why? Because information converted from any format- paper documents, artwork, graphs and mathematical charts, handwritten documents, photographs and engineering drawings or plans- can now all be edited on a single digital platform. Gigabits of information can be used without ever being printed. And even more importantly, that information can be edited, shared, examined and collected by any number of people simultaneously. At Rely Services, one can find skilled manpower, latest technology, and a huge years of experience in digitization to deliver seamless <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-conversion-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data conversion services</a> across all industry verticals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The blockage for the modern day’s flow of work for business procedures and operations is unorganised information. When someone outsource the  service of <strong>data conversation</strong>, the data is compressed and modified into a portable and handy easily stored and shared structure. All redundant information will be extracted, making documents easy to manage. Rely Services can handle all your data conversion, saving you both time and money. At Rely Services, the expert professional offer the complete spectrum of <strong>data conversion solutions for enterprises</strong>, corporations, universities, libraries, publishers, and academic institutions both international and domestic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1334,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/contact-us\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Free-Amazon-Consulting.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1334\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The experts in converting complex documents, data, and digitization of hard copy files, and they do guaranteed delivery in a format that is easy to edit and store. And most importantly, we eliminate all possibilities of data loss in the conversion process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Procedure of Outsourcing Data Conversion:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are many steps in which data is converted within the computer surface. Usually, data conversion efforts  require <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-extraction-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">data manipulation</a> with the use of special conversion programs:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Move the data from each disparate source into a central stage environment to process the conversion scripts.</li><li>Convert flat files and different data types from each of the source environment into a central repository.</li><li>Once data is staged, program logic is developed to translate the data into the new output format.</li><li>The target object is then exported to the new system utilising the API of the system or direct database loads.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In an agile and iterative development lifecycle, the above 4 steps are repeated in small iterations moving data one subject area at a time. For applications of moderate to high complexity are commonly repeated several times before data from the old system is converted to the new system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Also Read:</span></strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/tips-to-efficiently-outsourcing-e-commerce-product-data-entry-services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tips to efficiently outsourcing ecommerce product data entry services</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Specialities of Data Conversion</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Data Conversion is  the <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-management-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">process of viewing the data in a different format</a>, which can help to unblock new insights that may go unnoticed. While data is not necessarily hidden  in any format, by converting and restructuring data into something new, one is often exposed to the equivalent of a new perspective. It is the  unique perspective, of data conversion procedure which makes it special.  <strong>Data conversation specialists </strong>can give a better and more well-rounded understanding and visualisation of the data one has.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Data conversion</strong> is widely used for reasons related to accessibility. Often data is kept in a specific file structure that only certain software can access and read. This is due to the innate structure of the file itself. While this was once a limitation, there are now many strategies for converting data which allows for greater flexibility and enables you to use the data in any way one would like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With more and more data being collected, it is inevitable that data conversion will be a task that one will complete, no matter how simple or complex the conversion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4><strong><u>Data Conversion Error</u></strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A Data Conversion error occurs when the input not matches with the expected data, as described in the WEB SERVICE resource. Data conversion error takes place when a value is out of it\'s valid range.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This mismatch can occur for any of the following reasons:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>A SOAP message that is received by CICS is not well formed and valid when checked against the web service description (WSDL) associated with the WEB SERVICE resource.</li><li>A SOAP message that is received by CICS is well formed and valid but contains values that are out of range for the WEB SERVICE resource.</li><li>The contents of a COMMAREA or container are not consistent with the WEBSERVICE resource and the language structure from which the web service was generated.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>How to Avoid Data Conversion Errors</strong>?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>process of data conversion</strong> is a complicated one. It is important that utmost care is taken while dealing with the different formats of data. A lot of errors can creep in the data conversion process if not handled by the right people. Some of the key ways to <strong>avoid data conversion errors </strong>are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Extract, Clean and Transform Data</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most available data always have some issue regarding accuracy. Some of the data may not be organized but can prove to be very useful if processed in an efficient manner. The process of data conversion must be taken as an opportunity to extract the relevant data, cleanse and refine it and change it into a suitable format which can be used in the future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Understand the Data to be Converted</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When a company takes decision on conducting a data conversion drive it is important for them to understand the different types of data formats, where the data exists, which format is the existing data and which is most suitable format that it will be useful in.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Enforce Data Conversion Policies</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Companies should ensure that the data conversion process does not interfere with other project purposes. For instance, the data conversion process can be restricted to only overnight hours when the network usage is less and the main project processes are not hit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Convert Selected Data</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start off the data conversion procedure (done) by just selecting a limited amount of data instead of converting the entire pile of data. Select the asked amount of data such as primary demographic and status information before selecting the entire amount of data to be converted.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Testing and Validation</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The data which is converted must be valid and tested. For checking ,if the data is accurate and is in the right form. It is difficult to be confident of the converted data if it is not correctly tested and validated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Document the Process</strong></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The entire data conversion process should be monitored, audited, and suitably documented. Documentation must be done at each level and it should have a record of who did the data conversion of which information and the time which is very helpful in creating a proper audit trail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\">Conclusion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Businesses&nbsp; and corporate sectors through out the word are quickly getting to the point that there is a huge significance of the Data Conversation process. With business and commercial personalities actively investing in this, will soon become a business necessity to cut through the competition. Some of the factual and logical reasons to invest in data conversion are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>This ensures faster services and provides quicker solutions that are highly accurate.</li><li>This Cuts down on huge operational costs.</li><li>This also ensures uncompromised quality with zero errors. It makes organisational data easily accessible to everyone.</li><li>This ensures complete confidentiality of the segregated data.</li><li>The best way to save more time and gain further control over operational expenses is to offshore data conversion. This enables businesses and commercial personalities to focus on core business aspects by maximizing resources and improving efficiency. Besides outsourcing Data conversion allows businesses to gain access to exceptional capabilities, which might not be available internally. Therefore, outsourcing data conversion needs serves as a easy fixing to get the job done and gain maximum benefits.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Data-Conversions.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-03-31 12:10:09','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(430,'Ecommerce SEO: SEO best practices for your ecommerce store','ecommerce-seo-services-for-your-ecommerce-store','','<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1328,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Ecommerce-SEO-1024x371.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1328\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E-Commerce aka electronic commerce is referred to the selling and buying of products electronically over the internet or online services. The <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/ecommerce-seo-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO e-commerce services</a> which deals with the E-Commerce are known as <strong>Ecommerce Development Services </strong>which draws on the technologies such as mobile commerce, supply chain management, electronic funds transfer, online transaction processing, internet marketing, electronic data interchange, has automatic data collection system and inventory management system