:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Guess what, our excellent advertising services are our second best thing. It means that you will get a unique shop and fantastic marketing services to support it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Scalability &amp; Cash Flow&nbsp;</strong>- </li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now, once it sells, there is no need to pay for the web, awesome right. Yeah, that\'s just what our Dropshipping Business knew. WorkLooper enables you to grow your business without needing a lot of investment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li><strong>Effective Customer Engagement&nbsp;</strong>- </li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not so unexpectedly, customers are attracted to the sites of eCommerce. Websites for eCommerce make it a quick shop with plenty of options. In terms of customer retention, we can introduce new products and services to keep current customers engaged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong> - </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You will have to do company digital marketing such as Google advertising, PPC, and much more to promote your company. After that, you are building consumer trust is also essential. An essential task in dropshipping is also to find a successful supplier. But if you find it successfully, you can find ways to market your product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/01.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2021-01-21 05:38:12','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(436,'How To Upgrade Google Analytics 4? Learn New Analytics 4 Powerful Features','how-to-setup-google-analytics-4-learn-new-analytics-4-powerful-features','','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">What is GA4?</span></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>GA4 is based on the Google Analytics application + web application spine (Firebase). In information assortment and detailing, GA4 adopts an alternate strategy from what you used to find in Universal Analytics (UA).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through progressing to an \'occasion\'- based model, Google is pushing promoters to re-examine how they see client information. In GA4, information is assembled and deciphered in an unexpected way, as it centers fundamentally around the exercises and encounters of the client\'s excursion.<br><br>Identify that this will end up being the most recent Google Analytics default, as new Google Analytics designs normally empower you to set up GA4 and not UA. Luckily, we can run GA4 corresponding with the current UA arrangement to tell you the best way to set this up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New arrangements for UA Property are as yet accessible. Subsequent to clicking \'Make Land,\' search for the connection \'Show Advanced Options.\' You will have the alternative to make GA4 and UA or make UA as it were.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>The Most Effective Method To Set Up GA4 -</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How about we begin by exploring inside your Google Analytics record to your Admin Settings. Search for the <strong>Upgrade to Google Analytics 4</strong> Property connect under Property Settings.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1221,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Picture1-1024x390.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1221\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the off chance that you don\'t have an updated alternative accessible, you can click “Create Property” to make another GA4 Property and jump to stage 4 subsequent to setting up Create Property.<br><br>To start the arrangement cycle with the Google Analytics arrangement wizard, click \'Begin.\' Then, contingent upon your present <strong>Google Analytics 4 setup.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1222,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Picture2.gif\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1222\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><br><strong>You Will Have Numerous Options -</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the off chance that you use Google Site Tag to implement UA, the wizard will permit your current labels to gather information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>You\'ll have to make an estimation ID for your new GA4 property to begin information assortment. The Measurement ID is indistinguishable from the UA ID. By tapping the correct bolt demonstrated as follows, enter the \'Label establishment\' menu.</li><li>GA4 has no perspectives as predecessor its. It has Data Streams all things being equal. As it consequently tracks such occasions, for example, Scrolls, Outbound Connection Clicks, Site Search, File Downloads, and the sky is the limit from there, the Data Stream reaches out past the Pageview Request. Extend the Add Stream drop-down and pick the application that you need to follow.</li><li>Set up your information source by entering the URL of your site and the name of the stream. At the point when done, press \'Make Stream.\'</li><li>You have your Measurement ID now. Duplicate or observe the Measurement ID varying in Google Tag Manager to set up the GA4 Configuration Tag.</li><li>Explore your Google Tag Manager Dashboard, make another tag, select \'Label Configuration\' and pick \'Google Analytics: <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/9744165?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>GA4 Settings</strong></a> as the label type.</li><li>Next, add the Measurement ID. Rather than entering it physically, it is recommended to make a Constant Variable for the Measurement ID. It will permit you to reference and keep away from future irregularities with the Measurement ID for different labels.<br><br></li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Here Are The New Google Analytics 4 Features</strong>:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>Smarter Insight -</u></strong><br><br>New <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/9164320?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong></a> is currently fit for making advertisers aware of significant information patterns. This is made conceivable by using Google\'s current AI models.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For instance, Google Analytics can utilize site information to recognize items ascending sought after due to new client needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These capacities can help advertisers be proactive, just as responsive, by anticipating future moves clients may make.<br><br><strong><u>Deeper Ads Integration -</u><br></strong><br>Google Analytics now quantifies communications across the web and applications, which implies it can give an account of transformations, for example, YouTube drew in perspectives that happen in-application and on the web.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Advertisers currently have a more all-encompassing perspective on their outcomes with the capacity to see changes from YouTube video perspectives, Google and non-Google paid channels, Google Search, web-based media, and email.<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Customer-Centric<u> Data -</u></span><br><br></strong>New Google Analytics 4 has evolved from measurement fragmented by device or platform to customer-centric measurement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Again, this change is designed to give marketers a more complete view of how customers interact with a business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Google Analytics customer-centric measurement uses multiple identity spaces, including marketer-provided User IDs and unique Google signals from users opted into ads personalization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>End -</strong> <br><br>Google Analytics 4 (GA4) instrument permits a brought together estimation between your site and application of client communications and occasions. You can utilize GA4 Properties for your Google Analytics estimation technique if your portable application incorporates implanted web sees, a comparative web application, or site pages that imitate or in any case extend the versatile experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/20-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-12-16 11:19:40','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(437,'TIPS TO EFFICIENTLY OUTSOURCING E-COMMERCE PRODUCT DATA ENTRY SERVICES','tips-to-efficiently-outsourcing-e-commerce-product-data-entry-services','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Outsourcing e-commerce product data entry services are very beneficial. e-commerce services are getting bigger with each passing year. big companies like Amazon, 3d cart, and many others are becoming more successful for this. as all e-commerce involves lots of data management for task listing and uploading products, this made e-commerce data entry services more demanding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>but if you are thinking about opening an e-commerce store today,&nbsp;chances are high that you will be overwhelmed by the amount of data on a daily basis. simple things like e-commerce data entry tasks, uploading products, uploading images will be overwhelmingly tough for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So now what can you do? in order to save your precious time and money for your business,&nbsp;data entry service providers can be your helping hand. so now the question is how you can make sure about an efficient outsourcing process for your e-commerce business?&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Here Are Your Answer &amp; Some Tips For An Efficient Outsourcing Process For Your E-commerce Business -  </strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>1. E-commerce Product Upload Services</u></strong> - </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>to enhance your quality you have to update important information about your product on your website. to grab any customer’s attention you will need to precisely notice details like size, SKU, image, color, etc.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>outsourcing those tasks can help you to save lots of time which you can use to make your business more successful.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>2. Editing Images</u></strong> - </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To make your e-commerce service more appealing to the customers, attractive images are very important.&nbsp; a team or a person who can edit your images with the proper guidelines of the e-commerce store is the best to enhance the appearance of your store. and also for this, your customers end up making a purchase.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>so hire a team or <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">product data entry services</a> </strong>who can help you to do things like image cropping,&nbsp; image resizing, color grading etc. always remember the images on your e-commerce site is very important to determine the quality of your store.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>3. Use Simple Language </u></strong>- </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When your customers don’t get what you are saying,&nbsp;they will be very confused. using simple language on your website is very important. so that the customers, no matter where they come from will be able to understand everything written on the website. always highlight the product\'s benefits and simple fronts for that to do all this hectic work you can hire a product data entry specialist.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>4. Compare Prices With Other Services</u> </strong>- </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most important thing that can really help your customers to make a purchase is an affordable price range. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">product data entry company</a></strong> can find out the pricing range of the other companies to check your products are overpriced or not. trust me this can change the whole game. increasing a purchase prospect and making good money in the process is the best thing you could ever get.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>5. 24/7 Customer Service &amp; Support -  </u></strong><br><br>Many data product entry services offer virtual assistance 24/7 with e-commerce owners. they take care of every order\'s processing, tracking, shipping, interacting with customers, and most importantly they also help customers with any product-related quarry. basically, they will be the watching eyes for your store and your customers as well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>6. Writing a Product Review </u></strong> - <br><br>To increase your sales product reviews are very critical factors. when bad reviews can be a deal-breaker, then the good reviews will be a deal maker. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/product-data-entry-services\">product data entry services</a></strong> can offer a store owner the option of providing positive reviews to make your business more successful. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><u>Conclusion</u></strong> - <br><br>A successful e-commerce service always needs many people to work for the company.  with the help of data entry services, you don’t need to hire too many people because their remote workers will help you to make your business more successful.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Data-entry-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-12-05 13:01:58','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(438,'Top 10 Social Media Marketing Strategies To Effectively Market Your Small Business On Social Media','top-10-social-media-marketing-strategies-to-effectively-market-your-small-business-on-social-media','','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Introduction</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social Media is a wonderful platform to gain recognition. You can easily flourish your small business with the help of social media. Nowadays, social media possesses immense power as it spreads anything in just a fraction of a second. This can be very helpful for the business, be it a large scale or small business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As for a business attracting new customers is the most essential as well as difficult tasks. But with the right strategies, you might succeed in acquiring new customers.<br><br>Strategies are the foremost step to run a business smoothly. The strength of your planning and strategy determines the survival of your business. There are various <strong>social media marketing agencies</strong> as well who can look after this matter. This strategy is very popular for <strong>Social media marketing services in Delhi</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Here are the top 10 strategies to effectively market your small business on social media &nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Open your business to different social media platforms. Opening your profiles in different types of social handles might increase your Brand Recognition. It can increase brand awareness in the users and eventually attracts new customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Defining your marketing goal is another necessary step. Before spreading your business any further, you must define your marketing goal. It helps in increasing your chances of succeeding in your marketing plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No one likes an irregular seller. Especially when you have a small scale or start-up business, customers may find it suspicious. Try answering every query of the customer. You may hire <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">social media marketing companies</a></strong> for this purpose.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It helps in attracting customer’s attention. It can bring more and more new customers. Be active on social media and be aware of trends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As for Business’s the foremost priority is to satisfy their customers. Try to gather information about their preferences. Give more focus on customer feedback. <strong>Social media marketing companies</strong> can be a great help for this purpose.<br><br>Collaboration with social media influencers might help in spreading your brand awareness. It helps in finding a lead in the market. It might increase sales and traffic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Helping others can sometimes refer to smart business. You can use a little amount of profit for small donations and charity purposes. When you involve your business in donation and charity, customers lend a helping hand via purchasing your products more. Furthermore, this strategy can provide profitable results. This strategy is favorable for <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">Social media marketing services in India</a></strong>. India has many needy people. We have found that this strategy was very fortunate for <strong>social media marketing services in Delhi</strong>. When you market your product, try to mention your donation and charity purposes too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Social media platforms are the best and easiest way to gain brand recognition and build a reputation. Social media like Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, Pinterest, Youtube, and Linkedin are top platforms to spread your business. <strong>Social media marketing services in India</strong> are growing rapidly through these platforms.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sometimes <strong>Social Media marketing agencies</strong> provide services to manage a business in social media. <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-packages\">Social Media services provider management</a></strong> to manage your business. It helps in running a business very smoothly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Always monitor your content if people are finding it helpful or not. Website traffic might be essential but remember this is not it. Discover if they are responding to it or not.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/02.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-11-17 09:36:34','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(439,'“GOOGLE PLAY OR APPLE APP STORE: WHICH PLATFORM SHOULD YOU CHOOSE FIRST TO LAUNCH YOUR APP”','google-play-or-apple-app-store-which-platform-should-you-choose-first-to-launch-your-app','','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have finally decided it is the time to build a mobile app, there are some more decisions you need to be made.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most important decision is choosing which operating system you are going to launch on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You must decide between the two most popular app store - 1. Apple App Store and 2. Google Play Store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is not an easy decision to make.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Why?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well, for new starters, App Store and Play store users act differently. So, if you launch your app on the wrong platform, you can lose your primary targeted audience.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Now if you want to have an app which is available on both stores, you will require to develop two different stores in order to fulfil the requirements for each operating system. Trust me it is a hard and long process. For starter it will be expensive too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This post will give you all information’s so that you can make an informed decision before you dive into the wrong app store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Here is what you need to know before you choose the stores:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. KNOW YOUR AUDIENCE:</strong> First thing first, you should know your targeted audience. These points have some sub points as well.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>A. Geological location -</strong> Think about where you want to focus more - global audience or a particular area. If you want to focus more on global market, then obviously Play store is the best. Because Google Play Store dominate most of the global market where iOS does not even in the competition. But if you are focusing on area then you must choose according the market\'s demand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>B. Age of the audience - </strong>iOS device users are younger and higher educated people than android and most of them are in the age brackets of 18-25. So, if you are launching any chatting, social Networking, or a dating app then App Store is best for you.<strong><br><br>2. FEATURE SETS:</strong> The feature sets are basically the basic function of your app. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>What is the actual purpose of your app? The answer will depend on the code that gets Written for development.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Apple is restricted to a closed ecosystem, that means developer must write a code for device specific application. On the other side, Android play store is open source ecosystem where developer have freedom for customising or modifying as user want.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, in that case Google Play Store offers more flexibility for being an open-source Ecosystem. But the iOS makes sure your security and stability services for being a Closed Ecosystem.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3.MONEY/MONETIZATION:</strong> The reason behind every <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\">mobile application app</a></strong> is to make more money.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How you could make money through App?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here is some common business model</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>a. Subscription&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>b. In-app purchases</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>c. Advertisements&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>d. Pay per download</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If your strategy is to charge users to get your application, App Store should be your priority. iOS users are more likely to pay for an application than Android users. If the users are willing to pay for it then you will make more money at once, your users will be more engaged in your app and lastly, they probably will not abandon it really quick.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>But if your strategy is to make money by the advertisements and in-app purchase then Android is the best for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. RELEASE CYCLES:</strong> When you are making an app, you need to be written in code that is compatible with the most up-to-date versions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>95% of Apple users have the latest operating systems installed on their devices. Where less than 25% of Android users are using the latest version of Android software.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So, this makes your decision more complicated because you must build your app in a such a wide range of versions.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. TABLET USERS:</strong>&nbsp; Not only cell phones you have to take tablets into consideration when you are building a <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\">mobile application</a></strong>. Apple iPad is popular in young generations as well as older generations for its user-friendliness. On the other hand, Android tablets owners are more technical.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>CONCLUSION:</strong> So, Which platform should you choose first to launch your app?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It depends on your goal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/01-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-10-27 06:32:20','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(440,'THINGS YOU SHOULD CONSIDER WHILE HIRING ANY DIGITAL MARKETING AGENCY','things-you-should-consider-while-hiring-any-digital-marketing-agency','','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Introduction</strong> - </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In today’s time, dynamic changes are happening regularly. With these rapid changes in human lives, businesses have also evolved from offline to online, and digitalization is the main pillar. Digital marketing is considered to be the most growing field and is also helping almost every small- and large-scale business. So, if you want to learn more about digital marketing and make your brand reach great heights in the market, you should hire the topmost digital marketing agency to help you out. So, before you start receiving any kind of <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing services</a> </strong>from any digital marketing agency, let’s see what you should look for before hiring any digital marketing agency.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Things to be taken into consideration before selecting any Digital Marketing Agency</strong> - </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before selecting any <a href=\"https://www.cloudways.com/blog/best-digital-marketing-agencies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>digital marketing agency</strong> </a>there are some important things you should keep in mind because it can help your business gain good recognition in the online market. So, the important things you should look at any digital marketing agency are:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Explain the services you require to achieve your goals: Before you starting finding any digital marketing agency, look at what your business requires the most so that your marketing increases. Discuss with the employees what needs to be done to achieve the set goals and then plan the marketing strategy accordingly. Because consulting with the employees provides you the best information that your business needs shortly.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Look for the background and reputation of the agency: If you are hiring a digital marketing service for the first time then you should be very much conscious because fake companies are also there. So, before you start taking any kind of digital marketing service from any digital marketing agency, look for some information that can build your trust like:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\"} -->\n<ol type=\"1\"><li>Add-on services after the company started</li><li>Partnerships with different companies and certificates</li><li>Awards gained by the company</li><li>Different kinds of news media are used by the company<br></li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Check the location of the company: Many business professionals prefer discussing important decisions physically rather than over a video call. Because face-to-face meetings are much more productive and can be easily understandable. Close relationship matters the most for many business professionals. So, if the distance is not a problem you can hire any digital marketing agency from any state or region of your choice.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Check the company’s successful services: Do not go with the brand name of any company, check the services offered to the clients are up to the mark or not, and try to look at the company’s portfolio. If you are not satisfied with the information available on the company’s site do not hesitate to contact the company directly. Because it’s your business, so you have to be a bit professional.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Try to talk with other clients of the company: If you want to know more about the agency, try connecting with the clients who take services from the particular agency and fix a meeting with them to discuss the agency more deeply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Examine what communication channels does the agency use: Search for the company’s ad, what platforms they use to promote themselves like:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"type\":\"1\"} -->\n<ol type=\"1\"><li>Website</li><li>Blog posts</li><li>Social media posts.</li><li>Use of SEO</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Try to meet with the professionals of the company: To obtain better information about the agency fix a meeting with the in-house professionals of the company so that you can get high <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing solutions</a></strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The amount charged by the company: At last, when you have gathered all the relevant information about the company, and you are ready to hire a digital marketing agency, fix a meeting and complete all the monetary dealings.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong> - </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To wrap up, we have provided a compact guide about what you need to gather before hiring any digital marketing agency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/001-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-10-15 08:28:18','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(441,'10 BEST & SIMPLE MOBILE APP IDEAS FOR STARTUPS THAT COULD CHANGE THE WORLD IN 2020','10-best-simple-mobile-app-ideas-for-startups-that-could-change-the-world-in-2020','','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2020 has been a year full of lockdowns, anxiety, sufferings, and a lot of negativity so far. However, amidst all such gloominess, there\'s one bright spot.  That\'s the ray of hope for a successful startup. And can you guess how? It\'s with the help of some great mobile apps that can boost your startup or at least instill in you the confidence of running a successful business. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is a wide range of </span><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\"><b>mobile app development services </b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">that can help you build an app to track your services, promote your brand, and in turn, set a benchmark in the ever-growing business arena. All you need is to have that spot-on app development idea and a </span>custom mobile app development company.\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Although, nowadays, most of the services are backed by a mobile app for their customer\'s ease, yet most of the time, they aren\'t that useful or compatible as it is supposed to be. Thus, it is essential, particularly for the healthcare, food, transport, and logistics services to deploy the best </span>mobile application developers <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">to get a flawless app for themselves.</span>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Here’s a list of 10 best mobile app ideas that could help you become a dream entrepreneur. </strong></span></h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Health &amp; Nutrition Evaluating Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Combatting with the life-threatening coronavirus calls for an immunity booster. And it is needless to say that a healthy &amp; nutritious diet is what provides you maximum immunity than any artificial supplement. However, at the same time, it is also essential to maintain a proper balance of nutrition in your body. And for this, health &amp; nutrition evaluating apps are the best ones to assess the right level of nutrition required by your body to fight the disease. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So, if you are planning to open a health &amp; nutrition based startup, you need to hire a </span><b><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\">mobile app development company</a>. </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It would help users to check their calorie intake, diet plan according to their bodyweight &amp; vital statistics as well as take away healthy food tips that are necessary during the flu season.</span>\r\n\r\n<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Features to be considered:</span></strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food intake tracker.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Health and immunity building advice from experts.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Water and calorie counter function.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compatibility with a wearable device.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Video conferencing facility with nutritionists, health &amp; fitness experts. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Food Delivery and Ordering Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">During this pandemic times, when people are reluctant to dine out, cloud kitchen facilities have become indispensable for us. Although home cooking is the best thing for most people, there are the ones who don\'t have the time or option to cook at home. In such a situation, ordering food is a great choice. So, for all the food business owners, it is essential to have a good food delivery &amp; ordering app. It would let users order food, customize their food preference, track orders, and ensure a secure payment &amp; hassle-free delivery. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multi-lingual support.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dish recommendation according to mealtime.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fuss-free payment integration.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customer feedback option.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Advance meal booking facility.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Business Investment Plans Apps -</b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Amidst the deteriorating global economy, businesses are eyeing on the best investment plan to stand out in the 2020s already trembling market. Thus, with the help of the </span><b><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/mobile-app-development\">mobile application development services</a>,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> you can develop an app that provides the perfect plan and resources for a business to flourish. It just requires creating an investor’s profile and allowing them to submit their basic information &amp; investment details. This way, the investment planners can provide the right plan that matches up to the needs.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Profile creating facility.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Expert’s discussion facility.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Investor collaborations.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compatibility with investor budgets limits.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thoughts &amp; plan sharing access.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Telemedicine Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Telemedicine apps are of immense importance during the COVID times as most of the patients are either facing denial of admission in hospitals. Besides, they lack special care from doctors due to the overflowing of COVID patients. Thus, telemedicine apps serve to be a reliable source of remote healthcare services in such a condition. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Virtual assistance window &amp; chatbox.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In-app appointment scheduling facility.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pharmacy collaborations.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Availability of certified doctors.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Push notification for the addition of new features.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Supermarket Finding Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Such an app helps users in finding the exact location of nearby supermarkets. During this pandemic, it is recommended to purchase online. However, the supermarkets finding apps are useful in case you need to buy essentials. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Easy user interface.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Useful recommendations.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Collaboration with leading supermarkets and product brands.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Consumer feedback and query facility.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A detailed map or route of the destination.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Logistics Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Delivering goods is an integral part of any service. However, there are times when it is difficult to find the right transport facilities at the right time. On the contrary, some vehicles run empty after unloading. Thus, there\'s a communication gap between the process. In such a situation, logistics apps are helpful. They provide the right vehicle information and bridge that gap. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Real-time tracking.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Collation with registered and certified vehicles.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Client feedback.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Traffic information.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goods information.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Doctor Consulting Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is also one of the essential apps of all times, and the present pandemic situation has further raised the demand. It lets users get detailed information about the best doctors at your place and consult them for all critical and non-critical health issues.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered in-app:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Video chatting facility.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Doctors list and their address.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Expert guidance.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Online booking of appointments.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2487 helpline.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Task Planning &amp; Motivation Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this lockdown, almost all of us are facing the consequences of a disordered lifestyle. Our timetables have changed, leading to mismanagement of time and work. Moreover, anxiety, stress, and boredom have become a regular companion. It is where task planning &amp; motivation apps come to rescue.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Expert tips and ideas.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Personal problem-solving sessions.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chat window.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Effective strategies for time-management.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multi-lingual support.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Disaster Management Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It makes the users aware of the possible natural disasters in their area and tells the ways to tackle them. It also helps people to assist the rescue operation teams with the necessary information to detect the intensity of the disaster and the damage caused.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered</b><b>:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Location tracer.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Detailed analysis of risks.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Video information on how to manage the situation.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instant rescue team alert.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Preventive tips.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><b>Location Tracing Apps - </b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In the world of Google maps and mSpy, it\'s time to think something out of the box. And to make it happen, you can hire an app developer who will provide you an app with an instant location access facility. With the help of just a mobile Bluetooth or wifi, you can trace the location through such apps up to greater distances. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Features to be considered:</b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Live location sharing option.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Messaging through AI chatbot.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tracking of all check-ins.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google services integration.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Perfect time details of check-ins.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thus, these latest app ideas raise the bar on your startup performance and help you own a distinguished business empire. </span>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Mobile-app-Ideas.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-09-24 06:45:53','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(442,'THE FUTURE OF e-LEARNING – TOP e-LEARNING TRENDS FOR 2020','the-future-of-e-learning-top-e-learning-trends-for-2020','','<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">E-Learning is based on the utilization of electronics technology and formalized teaching with the help of electronic resources to get access to educational curriculum, outside of a traditional classroom. E-Learning has been trending for its efficient way of delivering courses online along with linking to various resources in several varying formats. The resources of e-Learning are available anytime and anywhere because of its flexibility and convenience. The main purpose of e-learning is to provide people the essence of learning to a professional degree or for personal accomplishment without physically attending traditional Universities or schools.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Benefits of e-Learning -</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li>E-Learning helps in saving time and money as you can easily access your classes online anywhere and anytime and is also cost-effective.</li>\n 	<li>E-Learning leads to better retention as modern learners prefer interactive and engaging content.</li>\n 	<li>E-Learning provides you standardized and consistent training every time as regardless of when and where the person is, each learner goes to the same experiences.</li>\n 	<li>E-Learning is scalable as with one-time investment you can roll it out to as many employees you need.</li>\n 	<li>E-Learning provides personalization as each learner has unique learning goals and preferences.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>E-Learning during 2020 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">Due to the global pandemic situation of Covid-19 virus, there has been lockdown over many places and social distancing is maintained for which schools and colleges and many other educational institutes have been closed down. But this may hamper the studies of students.\n\nSo to avoid this e-learning is the best option which provides online classes using technology were sitting at home a student can connect with their teacher and learn the same subjects and course easily even being away. This has been the major use of e-learning during this pandemic situation for which it has been trending.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Top e-Learning trends for 2020 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>1.</strong> Microlearning is the most talked-about training approach which is action-oriented and helps learners to meet, explore, and learn specific job needs. Due to versatility, it has been a great choice to use for just in time job aids, formal training, and learning.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>2.</strong> Artificial intelligence and learning assistance has been trending and has enhanced learning in 2020. It has offered and provided huge value add to the connected, engaged, and personalized learning that is wanted by today\'s learner.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>3.</strong> Mobile-Learning has also been trending in 2020 which allows the learners to access materials wherever and whenever they want to and also helps the instructor to monitor the learner’s performance.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>4.</strong><span class=\"q-inline\"><a class=\"q-box qu-cursor--pointer qu-hover--textDecoration--underline\" title=\"bityl.co\" href=\"https://bityl.co/3Wda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"> Video-based learning</a></span> has been prevailing in recent years and has allowed the learners to engage in interactive and visually appealing content that provides attraction and interest in the educational system.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>5.</strong> Gamification is the use of game mechanics to boost and improve retention rate which allows institutions and businesses to create both intangible and tangible incentives to drag successful training results which help to improve the learner’s engagement and motivation.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>6.</strong> Big data is another trending e-Learning which is referring to the huge number of data that has been collected from student performances and activities and is used to analyze their learning habit and behavior.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>7.</strong> Immersive Learning includes virtual reality, augmented reality, and mixed reality and will help the educator to provide more adaptive teaching to the students for better preservation and retained learning material.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>8.</strong> Blended learning uses a combination of different learning formats which makes e-Learning more effective and ensures the instructor to maximize their resources to help the learner grasp the material.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>9.</strong> Self-directed learning is a type of e-Learning that gives all the-Learning power to the learner and helps them to acquire knowledge without the support of any instructor.\n\nThis is a new way of accelerating the way of learning and has helped the learner to control over formulating, diagnosing, implementing, evaluating, and identifying material sources, strategies, and possible outcomes.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><strong>10.</strong> The debut of the voice of the learner is a form of e-Learning that has aimed to increase the quality of knowledge provided to the learners. They provide e-Learning experience to the learners and help to improve it by properly tracking the learner’s work assessments, course rating, and course completion rate.</p>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Final-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-09-17 10:06:08','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(443,'HOW BIG DATA & ANALYTICS CAN HELP YOU DO WONDERS IN YOUR BUSINESS VENTURES','how-big-data-analytics-can-help-you-do-wonders-in-your-business-ventures','','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Data and analytics have become an essential tool for business ventures to measure the impact of an online campaign. In an age of digital society and electronic media, it is necessary to know how a campaign or a venture affects the shareholders or potential customers.\n\n</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Through data and analytics of the digital campaign, you can analyze, predict, and prepare for your next step. It is imperative to know the effects of data and analytics to new business and how it can change the process of doing business at this time and age.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Getting Hold of Customer’s Needs - </b></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The needs of the customer and the prediction of consumer behavior are essential for a new business venture. The predictive analysis tool of a website can track the digital footprints of your customers and give you the relevant data like purchase history, buying habits, and usage frequency through which you can prepare your next strategy.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Identifying Potential Threats - </b></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cyberworld is not short of its share of problems like fake accounts and hackers. To determine the risks and imminent threats, you can merge your business with valid data and analytics tools. You will be provided with real-time data to work on your business to prevent any kinds of untoward incidents.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Improve Work Process - </b></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Without an increase in your budget or significant changes in your system, you can improve the working process of your business just by simple means of data and analytics. You can gather a large amount of data through proper tools that you can analyze. The analyses of these data will enhance your decision making procedure and improve the working process with efficiency and reliability of your business.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Enhance User Experience - </b></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you are trying to make big with your business, the primary thing to take care of is the user experience. <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-analytics-services\"><strong>Big data and analytics</strong></a> will try to identify the communication points where the company can make improvements. Consumers like a bit of personal touch while purchasing from a business.\n\nAnd you can do that through simple means of digital data analytics. You can communicate with your consumers through various means like social media feedbacks, comments, and phone calls.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>The platform for Your Product Launches - </b></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can use techniques like <strong><a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/data-mining-services\">data mining</a></strong> and predictive analysis with the help of big data and analysis to make your business website the ultimate launching ground of your new product or inform your customers about new offers. It will also improve customer involvement and tell your potential and regular customers about big announcements.</span>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Conclusion - </strong></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrepreneurship requires a strong vision for the future and a good sense of the business. With the help of big data and analytics, you can be one step ahead in your field of business.\n\nAll kinds of business persons can use big data and analytics to create a productive work environment and a fantastic customer relation.</span>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/T2G-Blog-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-09-07 11:20:20','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(444,'10 GOOGLE SHOPPING ADS STRATEGIES TO UP YOUR GAME IN 2020','10-google-shopping-ads-strategies-to-up-your-your-game-in-2020','','Undeniably, you would have come across the Google Shopping Ads. With every online search, these advertisements appear. This means you cannot ignore the presence of Google shopping Ads. Also, this gives businesses another reason to try the platform. When compared to traditional advertisements, <strong><a href=\"https://www.adnabu.com/the-beginners-guide-google-shopping-ads\">Google Shopping Ads</a></strong> are highly effective.\n\nThis is mainly because the products are displayed against high-quality images, and details that really matter to customers. Moreover, these advertisements appear in the topmost section of search results. This means potential customers are bound to see your business, at least once.\n\nWhen you wish to boost the sales of your business online, Google Shopping Ads can help in multiple ways.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>What are Google Shopping Ads?</strong></span></h3>\nThe Google Shopping Ads Network has two platforms that are dominant since the e-commerce revolution came into being - The Google Merchant Center and Google Adwords. The Merchant Center is the platform in which you can create the shopping feed.\n\nGoogle Ads is a platform where all of the marketing campaigns for the shopping feed are managed. Think of it as the dashboard or the backend, where you create budgets, manage bids, make optimizations, and gain insights as well. The Google Shopping Network helps online merchants work with a great way of selling products and advertising them to increase the reach.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Why should you use your Google Ads?</strong></span></h3>\nGoogle Ads is one of the most comprehensive ad networks available in the e-commerce sphere. It allows you to use its vast repositories of ecommerce marketing tools and features so you’ll be able to create an ecommerce business of your liking. The tools and services are also super intuitive and smart, and ensure you get all your doubts cleared with their team.\n\nFurther, you’ll be able to scale up your business on the network and also hyper-target customers based on their preferences, demographics, and more. This makes it one of the best networks on the internet, and one you must surely try and use to grow.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How does Google Shopping work?</strong></span></h3>\nGoogle Shopping allows you to create shopping campaigns via Google ads and showcase these ads to the users, related to their search query. Whenever a user searches for a product-related term, the image, title, and price will be displayed on the search results.\n\nA lot of the searches that end up triggering these ads come with high intent to purchase. This is one of the main reasons advertisers see great results from the<strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services\"> Google Ads</a></strong> campaigns.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Top 10 Google Shopping Campaign Strategies -</strong></span></h3>\n<strong>Here are some of the best strategies that can be used to improve the Google Shopping Campaign strategies -</strong>\n<ol>\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Optimize the product titles - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nThe product titles are one of the best areas to start if you’d like to see better results in the product feed optimization. There are a number of optimizations to a product feed and you can receive almost 10x the volume of traffic.\n\nYou need to spend a decent amount of time and effort in ensuring the product titles become as relevant as possible and users can search your products with ease too. There are search query reports that can show the kind of keywords users is searching for.\n\nYou’ll also need to pay attention to the words’ order along with the search terms that are driving the most revenue. Then, it’s time to incorporate the same into the beginning of the product titles too.\n\nThis is an ongoing exercise and you need to find the term that suits your customer searches perfectly. With them, you’ll be able to optimize the overall query issue and get more people to subscribe.\n<ol start=\"2\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Optimize your Product Feed Descriptions and Categories - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nYou can also optimize the product feed descriptions and categories as well. These are the descriptions that your audience will see and use to engage and understand your brand better. The categories must be simple enough to understand and the split between products too can be made easier.\n\nThe descriptions and the categories have to be properly aligned with the product being sold and its title. You can take time out once a week to complete this process in a more streamlined manner.\n<ol start=\"3\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Optimizing your product images - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nThe product images play such a big role when it comes to standing out from the rest of the competition. They give the product life and also help the customer understand the entire dynamics and dimensions of the product. By doing so, they will be able to also understand if a product suits the requirements as well.\n\nUp to 82% of people answered they were most likely to click on a shopping ad if the image had someone wearing the product rather than just an image of the product itself. It’s best to have a use-case of the product rather than just a simple image of the same.\n\nThis too is an ongoing process and requires you to constantly optimize the images and ensure they look good on the site as well as the ads.\n<ol start=\"4\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Use Google Shopping Ad Extensions - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-1144 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/02.png\" alt=\"Google shopping ads guide, Google shopping ads, 10 advanced google shopping strategies\" width=\"793\" height=\"492\" />\n\nAd Extensions are one of the biggest assets when it comes to text ads. In Google Shopping Ads, they can take the game to a whole other level as they can complement and enhance the existing text ads.\n\n<strong>There are generally two types of ad extensions for Google Shopping - </strong>\n<ol>\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Automated Extensions - </strong></span></h3>\nThese contain Tax information or shipping displayed in a PLA</li>\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Merchant Center Programs - </strong></span></h3>\nThis includes the Google Customer Review, Product Ratings, and Merchant Promotions among others.</li>\n</ol>\nExtensions are extremely effective in driving the conversion rates and the CTR as well. They are based purely on the information you provide in the Merchant Center. You can see these examples in different ads where additional texts generally appear. These include “90-day returns” and “Free shipping” among others.\n\nIt’s one of the best ways to go about keeping your ads relevant and also interesting and engaging enough for them to keep shopping with your brand on the Google network.\n<ol start=\"5\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Use Product ratings and reviews - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nThis is one of the most important steps you can follow in order to drive your Shopify sales. As a large chunk of people purchases their products only after reading reviews and ratings, you need to constantly highlight the best ones on your page.\n\nBy providing the right amount of flexibility in terms of honest reviews, people will shop more and look to buy more of your products.\n\nThe product ratings and reviews need to be highlighted at some part of the Google ad and there are options to do this too.\n\nThere’s a reason why most of the ads talk about their recommended and featured products, with reviews. 88% of online shoppers trust a product based purely on the review alone. It works in the same way a personal recommendation would and it is one of the strongest ways of product communication out there.\n\nListings that don’t have a review or a rating look much incomplete and not very compelling when they are displayed beside listings that come with a review of the product. Product ratings can make your product not just stand out, but also build trust among many potential customers. It improves all of the visibility on search and also increases the CTR and conversion rates too.\n\nIn order to qualify for the Product Ratings, you need to have enough reviews. When there are reviews, a few negative ones pop up too, but that’s fine.\n\nWhy?\n\nThis is because potential customers would prefer reading negative reviews as well, as it adds a layer of belief. The optimum rating for any product is 4.7 stars and not 5, as a perfect product is deemed unbelievable and fake.\n\nAdding the seller rating is also a beneficial step. It boosts the overall quality and effectiveness of the product listing too.\n<ol start=\"6\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Implement a negative keywords strategy - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nNegative keywords can play a big role in making your ads show up only in relevant searches. As there aren’t any prospects of adding the keywords in the Google Shopping ecosystem, retailers have to believe Google to help them find the most relevant keywords.\n\nDespite writing near-perfect titles and descriptions, the Google algorithm doesn’t work 100%. It’s human (part-machine) after all. It can show your ads for search terms that are irrelevant. This can be problematic as your ad can pop up on an irrelevant search term and you can lose money for that. If the ads don’t get clicked, then Google will drop your quality score and not show your ads with the same frequency as before.\n\nNegative keywords are one way to resolve the issue by making the ads not show up on irrelevant search terms. Google won’t shop your ads against the search terms that contain the negative keywords. These negative keywords can save a large amount of money and also get rid of any unwanted clicks as well.  It will increase the quality score and improve the CTR of ads. It’s a simple and straightforward process that you can implement with relative ease.\n<ol start=\"7\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Adjust bids by device performance - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nWhen the campaign is at the Ad group level, you should be able to adjust the device bids based on performance. It’s always better to track the ROAS when the account is being optimized as this allows you to do so for the content that brings you the best return for your business. In order to get this report, select the devices option that’s present in the navigation at the ad group level or campaign level.\n<ol start=\"8\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Optimize by Geo Location - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nNormally, a customer’s location will play a role in the conversion rate. You can optimize this by placing modified bids based on the user location. It is important to increase the visibility of the ads and choose the ones that make a better return.\n\nThis can be done at a campaign level and to discover the Geolocation, you’ll have to go to the locations tab in the campaign view.\n<ol start=\"9\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Increase bids for high-performance products - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nAs the campaigns are structured properly, you can also increase the visibility of products that seem to be performing better for you. You can do this by:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Adjusting bids by the device.</li>\n 	<li>Increasing bids.</li>\n 	<li>Create a Remarketing strategy</li>\n</ul>\nThis is a practice where you can target a previous visitor to your store and re-deliver ads to them. You need to add a remarketing code or tracking code and this is a simple process. Through remarketing, you can track customers based on their behavior and build audiences accordingly.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>There are two types -</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Dynamic Remarketing - </strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nIn order to remarket, you can use the Display Ad campaign that’s available on Google.\n\nOnce enabled, it uses the information from the Merchant Center and bulbs ads that are customized to the products the customers previously viewed.\n<ol start=\"2\">\n 	<li>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> Remarketing Lists for Search/Shopping Ads -</strong></span></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\nRemarketing lists are not an actual campaign and they are easily produced. Instead of having to build a total campaign, you can attach the audiences built with <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services\">Google Ads</a></strong> or Google Analytics to the campaign.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>To conclude - </strong></span></h3>\nThese are some of the best and user-friendly ways with which you can increase your Shopify sales. Keep experimenting and you’ll find the right ways to go about the different steps.\n\nGood luck!\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Guest Post by AdNabu - </strong></span></h3>\nAdNabu helps improve sales in Google Ads for eCommerce companies. If you are running the search, <strong><a href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/google-shopping-feed-2\">google shopping</a></strong>, or display campaigns in Google Ads, This software will be able to increase your sales.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Shopping-ads-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-08-26 05:33:37','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(445,'IS IT WORTHWHILE TO INVEST IN HEALTH CARE APP DEVELOPMENT','is-it-worthwhile-to-invest-in-health-care-app-development','','Mobile technology has literally changed the scenario of the healthcare industry. Visiting a hospital or a health care center is crucial as health check-ups are essential. During regular days it’s okay to wait in the waiting rooms but when it’s an emergency case it is frustrating to wait for your number.\n\nLet me tell you the technology has improved a lot and thanks to the mobile application these days, which has improved getting care from the doctors.\n\nThe mobile app companies brought the healthcare industry as your mobile apps or we can say they introduced healthcare apps for your betterment.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><u>ADVANTAGES of USING A HEALTHCARE APP -\n</u></strong></span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>The most important benefit of using these healthcare apps is to schedule your appointment. Patients also can choose their preferred doctors from the slot.</li>\n 	<li>It has reduced the diagnostic errors. Doctors can track their patients with several files as carrying files are a huge burden to the patients. The Healthcare app keeps an accurate record with no risk and errors.</li>\n 	<li>It also helps to monitor the health of the patients like measuring body weight, sugar level check, count on calorie burns during jogging, etc. Your healthcare app is your fitness app which can do everything to give you steady and fit.</li>\n 	<li>Healthcare app also allows you for quick booking of a doctor appointment during the time of emergency.\n\nIt also helps to review your medical reports and buying medicines.</li>\n 	<li>Both doctors and patients can share information without visiting the clinic. You can also take video consultations for a quick solution to your health problem.</li>\n 	<li>Medical treatments are increasing day to day and bills are a serious concern to the patients. Some tasks can be done through these healthcare apps which can save your pocket from an expensive cost. Also, it helps you check and clear your due bills without standing in a long line.</li>\n 	<li>Healthcare apps also help patients and doctors build a good relationship between them. It makes collaboration and health problem solving easier than usual.</li>\n 	<li>Healthcare apps are a blessing to all. It also helps people living in remote areas, providing them the best service during emergencies. You can also order medicines and get more health tips.</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><u>IT IS WORTHWHILE INVESTING IN HEALTH CARE APPS -\n</u></strong></span>\n\nAs you have read the above facts, you must have come to know the benefits of using healthcare apps. Technology is still contributing more to improve health care services worldwide.\n\nCurrently, the healthcare industry has made a lot of achievements with its services. It is a huge cost saver while being available in urgent healthcare centers. It has also reduced the number of paper works digital insurance card works instead of that.\n\nIt is a perfect time investing in healthcare apps to start a genuine innovation across the sector. Pharmaceutical companies manufacture several medical products; it will drive the returns of those companies who are at the forefront of innovation. Investing in healthcare stocks can give you generous returns too. But it will be better if you analyze more and be smart while investing.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Health-Care-App-Final-.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-08-17 12:12:46','2026-06-01 11:30:32','2026-06-01 11:30:32'),(446,'SHOPIFY VS MAGENTO VS WOOCOMMERCE – AN INTRODUCTION TO BEST ECOMMERCE PLATFORM','shopify-vs-magento-vs-woocommerce-an-introdduction-to-best-ecommerce-platforms-which-is-best-for-you','','Are you planning on launching an eCommerce store of your own? If so, you need to know all about the best platforms to figure out which one of them is the best for you. So here is giving you an introduction to the best eCommerce platforms.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/shopify-development\">Shopify</a><strong> - </strong></span></h3>\nFounded in the year 2004, Shopify is one of the old and worthy eCommerce platforms that started off as an online store named Snowdevil. For the past few years it has been growing rapidly and at present, holding more than 21% of the eCommerce websites’ market share is one of the most powerful eCommerce platforms.\n\nShopify stands out from the other eCommerce platforms in the market because of the streamlined approach it offers in setting up an online store. Moreover, it supports and boosts the profit of businesses of all types and volumes, and is ideal for both beginners as well as experienced users.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Some of the features of this eCommerce platform are - </strong></span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Highly responsive customer support never fails to provide the perfect solution to problems.</li>\n 	<li>Top-notch hosting services that allow every business to serve safely and securely.</li>\n 	<li>Updates and maintains the software.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>\n<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/magento-development\">Magento</a> - </strong></span></h3>\nFounded in the year 2008, Magento is an eCommerce platform that has been passed on from one owner to another before it was finally taken up bu Adobe in the year 2018. It ranks third in the top eCommerce sites after Shopify and WooCommerce. At present, holding around 9% of the eCommerce websites’ market share is the third most powerful eCommerce platform after WooComerce and Shopify.\n\nMagento stands out from the other eCommerce platforms in the market for being one of the most customized ones. Besides, it is also open-source, which allows single-click installation, and very flexible, which allows the users a lot of freedom in designing their online eCommerce store.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Some of the features of this eCommerce platform are - </strong></span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Loaded with impressive featured solutions that help you design an attractive online store.</li>\n 	<li>Allows rewriting URLs and meta descriptions for search engine optimization.</li>\n 	<li>Built-in core functionality which helps in handling multiple stores or websites easily.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>\nWooCommerce - </strong></span></h3>\nFounded in the year 2011 and acquired by Automattic in the year 2015, WooCommerce is actually a WordPress plugin that is the most popular way to make your own online store. At present, holding around 22% of the eCommerce websites’ market share is the most powerful eCommerce platform.\n\nWooCommerce stands out from the eCommerce platforms in the market for being a WordPress plugin instead of being an eCommerce platform that provides an all-in-one solution. It gives unique eCommerce functionalities to your website.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Some of the features of this eCommerce platform are - </strong></span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Offers several payment gateways and extensions that make launching an online store simple and easy.</li>\n 	<li>Easy installation and compatibility with most of the WordPress versions.</li>\n 	<li>Simple yet powerful solutions that help your store appear in the first pages of search engines.</li>\n</ul>\nAfter comparing all the three mentioned above, the question that arises is which one will be the best for you. Well, honestly, it depends on a lot of factors. While Magento can suit you the best if you are experienced, Shopify is ideal for beginners and WooCommerce will be the best for WordPress websites.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Shopify-magento-woocommerce.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-08-05 06:32:21','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(447,'TECH2GLOBE WEB SOLUTIONS LLP REFLECTS ON SUCCESS AND GIVE ADVICE TO OTHERS','tech2globe-web-solutions-llp-reflects-on-success-and-give-advice-to-others','','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We started Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP back in 2014, focusing on certified software development. We have a passion for creating web and mobile applications for all companies — be it a startup, an enterprise corporation, or a digital agency. We set out with a simple goal: to help companies, startups, entrepreneurs make their digital product or service global and profitable.\n\n</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tech2Globe is now one of the youngest and most promising software developing companies incorporated in the world. With our passion and flair to innovate and create, we provide the best winning solutions to our clients.\n\nAmidst the same process, we continue to be cost-efficient understanding what exactly your business requires to grow. In order to make every venture we undertake a success, we have a team of experienced and skilled experts.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’re honored that Tech2Globe is a name that stands for reliability, efficiency, and trust. Nowhere is that more apparent than in our reviews on The Manifest. The Manifest, home to </span><a href=\"https://themanifest.com/in/ecommerce-development/companies#tech2globewebsolutionsllp\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">business ratings and projects</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, features us as a leader on the site with a perfect 5.0-store average! </span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our profile includes reviews from satisfied clients like Laura Hackett, the customer service manager for Berlin-based hungryhouse who praised our data entry and translation work for her food ordering service!</span>\n\n<i></i><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\"I got to know them as an extension of our team, without the normal complications involved with large BPO firms.\"</span></i>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With all of our success, and being listed as a leader on The Manifest, we frequently receive requests for advice on how to emulate success. We have five main pieces of advice:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Build a support network </span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Be very specific with your goals </span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Develop a culture that people understand the main goal of the company and feel a strong connection in growing within a team </span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reduce your activity and increase your productivity </span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a look at your day to day tasks or projects and evaluate in terms of importance vs urgency What do you think your company most excels in? </span></li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Since 2014, we have achieved many things. Our core expertise part is Data Management Services (In multilingual), S/w development, Ecommerce Services in all platforms.\n\nWe are also </span><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/partners/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Amazon Certified partners</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, Digital Marketing Services provider as well we have team professional photo editors. If you want to see how our team can assist you, please contact us today!</span>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/T2G-llp1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-07-30 08:21:41','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(448,'Top 10 Best E-commerce Websites','top-10-best-e-commerce-websites','','With the inception of Covid19, the world is facing a terrible crisis. No one can go outside of their homes, and thus the importance of online shopping is increasing with each passing day. Lots of e-commerce websites are getting popular. With many shops out there, you must be wondering which is the best online shopping store!\n\nWe have listed out the best among the top 10 best online shopping sites for your convenience.\n\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.amazon.in/\">Amazon</a>: </strong>Amazon is one of the Best Online Shopping Store. From shoes to dresses, books to electronics, grocery to sanitizing products, everything is available on this website. The prices are very competitive. The consumer gets a lot of paid options here. If someone pays through the amazon pay app, he might get a decent cashback. The Prime members can bag free deliveries on most of the products. Regular customers also get free deliveries after a certain amount of purchase. The branding and promotions of this company are the best in the entire world!\n\n<strong><a href=\"https://bit.ly/2CB6YJc\">Flipkart</a>: </strong>Based in Bangalore, India, Flipkart is one of the most popular e-commerce websites available in the world. Founded in 2007, this website serves most of the southeast Asian countries. If you purchase a product in Flipkart, you can collect coins. These coins can be used for further shopping on Flipkart.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Snapdeal: </strong></span>This site is famous for flash sales. Especially mobile phones and other electronic goods are available in the flash sale here. COD is possible for the clients. Founded in 2014, this Delhi based e-commerce company is famous for providing gift cards to its customers. If you go through the app, you can find out several products at a very competitive price.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>eBay: </strong></span>From brand new products to not-so-used second-hand products, eBay can offer you a lot. The price varies over time. You can keep a tab on the products you wish to buy. The Paypal payment option is very secure. This website has a vast range of sellers listed. They can provide international products as well as locally made products as per your requirements. If you are wondering <strong>how to sell online</strong> then you can go through the seller policy in detail.\n\n<strong>Getkart: </strong>The US-based company is a popular Best online shopping store that offers a lot of products. From home decor to electronics, you can expect everything at a very competitive price. This website is also offering an excellent feature for the sellers. The company is waving off the monthly payments of the sellers.\n\nThey are going for zero commission charges. Some bonuses will be given to their sellers to fight the pandemic Covid19. This certainly makes them one of the most sensible e-commerce websites on this list. In case you are planning to start selling online<strong>,</strong> this is probably the best option for you.\n\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.myntra.com/\">Myntra</a>: </strong>The Indian fashion e-commerce company is ready to equip you with the latest fashion trends in the world. This is the child company of Flipkart and also based in Karnataka, India. You can quickly return your package without answering the delivery agent. You can get attractive discounts and gift cards. They will offer free shipping over 1199 INR purchase. This website has more than 400 top-notch fashion brands listed.\n\nSo, you are going to stay trendy with them.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Shopclues: </strong></span>Another Bangalore based Indian company that is famous for offering a lot of products to its clients. Everything you can imagine, you will get that on Shopclues. They offer free shipping and a trustworthy payment option for their clients. More than two crores of products are listed on the website.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Nykaa: </strong></span>If you are looking for authentic cosmetic products, Nykaa is the best option for you. More than 850 top cosmetic brands are associated with this website. They are offering free shipping over INR 500 purchase. From your hair to toe and beyond, you can get anything related to beauty and hygiene from this e-commerce website.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Homeshop 18: </strong></span>This particular e-commerce company is famous for providing high-end discounts. If you want to try leisure shopping, try this website. You will get lots of deals that offer more than 88% discount on many products. Every day this company comes up with a new agreement for its clients. A diverse catalog of products is waiting there for you.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Koovs: </strong></span>This e-commerce website deals with clothing and other fashion products. Based in India and headquartered in London, this website has a 15 days return policy. This also offered free shipping over INR 500. This website provides international, local, and their own branded products to its consumers. They have a trendy set of products from their own house.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/Ecommerce-Sites-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-07-22 09:08:24','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(449,'5 REASONS WHY YOUR WEBSITE ISN’T GENERATING LEADS DURING COVID-19','5-reasons-why-your-website-isnt-generating-leads-during-covid-19','','During the prevailing pandemic situation, both small and large firms are struggling to enhance their sales. Whether it is a simple static site or a dynamic one, the current lockdown situation affects all. The common problem which is being faced by these is in generating leads for their websites. The main reason behind their websites not generating leads is that while purchasing the site, they select it based on the price without bothering about what they will get from it as a return in the future. Every business person should consider their website as an investment.\n\nHere are some of the reasons why the websites are not generating leads during the pandemic situation:\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Lack of Visibility - </strong></span></h2>\nOne of the most common reasons behind the site not generating leads is a lack of visibility or meager viewers. The lack of clarity is due to the non-appearance of the site in the top pages of search engines like Google or Bing. People who already know about the business or who have the business card only know about the company, and only go to the website, which is very few.\n\nThat\'s why the site is not enhancing sales.\n\nAs a business owner, if you want to drive traffic to your websites, you must opt-in for Search Engine Optimization (SEO) so that your website will appear among the top pages when someone finds related business.<strong> <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">Digital marketing services</a></strong> include SEO, pay per click, and <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\"><strong>social media marketing services</strong></a><strong>.</strong>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Unprofessional or Lacking Portfolio Photos - </strong></span></h2>\nA website is the first impression of the business, and many users judge the versatility of the market based on their websites. But still, many companies don\'t make their websites seriously and do not put much effort into it to make it advanced. There are many cases where the website is ranked on the top page of the search engine and has a good number of viewers of the site, but still, it lags in generating leads. It is because of the unprofessional photographs on the portfolio. Some people capture the photo of whatever their business is about by their phone and directly upload it to their website, which in turn fetches customers a loss.\n\nEvery business person should keep a well-trained photographer who can nicely click and edit the picture to upload it on the website and making it attractive for the viewers.\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Lack of Call-to-Action Feature - </strong></span></h2>\nIn almost every website, there is a specific section where there are the business\'s contact information and details on how to reach out to them. Still, the UI of the website should be user-friendly and easily understandable.\n\nVisitors should not struggle to find what they are looking for in your business.\n\nThe Call - to- action should be set up on the website so that visitor can either fill out a simple form and get an immediate call back from the company or there should be a click-to-call feature enabled in the contact detail so that the visitor could click on the contact number and make a call or click on email id. It should take him to the emailing page directly.\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Misaligned Content - </strong></span></h2>\nThese days, customers start to research everything they are planning to purchase in the future to get a brief idea about the product, estimate the cost, and compare the offers of different websites. So, the business owner or the website should not think that they will share the details with the customers after they contact them. Instead, there should be every detail of the products listed on their website to generate better leads. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing\"><strong>Content Marketing</strong></a> is an essential strategy to <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/how-to-increase-brand-awareness/\"><strong>increase brand awareness</strong></a><strong>. </strong>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Lack of Attention - </strong></span></h2>\nThe main reason behind a website not generating leads is the lack of attention. Many business owners get their website functional, leave it, and expect it to give them a considerable amount of sales.\n\nTo generate better leads, the business owner always has to keep a keen eye on the website, get it frequently tested, and keep comparing with the market.\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Conclusion - </strong></span></h2>\nWe have always heard that great things take time. Didn\'t we? So, a business owner should be patient and always try to make their website better. They need to figure out where they are lagging behind and what is preventing the website from generating better leads.\n\nOnce a businessman figures out the flaw in the workflow, it would be easy to develop better solutions for high sales.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/5-Reasons-Why-Your-Website-isnt-Generating-Leads-During-covid19.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-07-17 06:45:28','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(450,'10 DIGITAL MARKETING TRENDS YOU CAN’T IGNORE IN 2020','10-digital-marketing-trends-you-cant-ignore-in-2020','','The landscape of digital marketing is kept on changing, there are lots of new Software’s which help the marketer to stay ahead in the competitive market. Every year the companies bring new Digital marketing trends and strategies, if any company or any Digital Marketing agency wants to stay longer then they have to adopt the <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/digital-marketing-trends-in-2020/\">new digital marketing trends</a></strong>. If you won\'t adopt the change you will not stay longer in this field.\n\nNowadays, marketing technology changes very frequently and consumer\'s interest is very hard to predict. At this time, you can\'t stick to the same old marketing method, to attract the new audience you have to follow the trend and the new strategies. There are hundreds of digital marketing agencies that are bringing new strategies so that they can provide better digital marketing services than their competitors. So here are the new Digital Marketing trends that you can\'t ignore in 2020.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>1. Artificial Intelligence - </strong></span></h3>\nArtificial Intelligence is one of the most trending and demanding technology. Artificial Intelligence has changed the user experience. Companies like <strong>Mastercard and Alibaba</strong> has taken advantage of AI Technology.\n\nMost of the companies are adopting <strong><a href=\"https://www.zdnet.com/article/what-is-ai-everything-you-need-to-know-about-artificial-intelligence/\">AI technology</a></strong> as it reduces their costs and increases efficiency. Companies using AI technology have cut the staffing cost and have accelerated their growth.\n\nArtificial Intelligence can be implemented in many areas like:\n<ul>\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing\"><strong>Creating Content</strong></a></li>\n 	<li>Sending Personalized Email</li>\n 	<li>Communication with Customers to solve their basic queries</li>\n 	<li>Recommending products to customers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>2. Voice Search and Digital Assistants</strong></span></h3>\nIf you own a <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">Digital Marketing Agency</a></strong> then you know how Important Voice searches are. Last year voice searches have increased rapidly and which led companies to rethink their digital marketing strategies. Here are some reasons why you should look for Voice searches in 2020:\n<ul>\n 	<li>In 2020, more than 55% of searches are going to be voice searches.</li>\n 	<li>By 2022, more than 45% of all American homes will own a smart speaker.</li>\n 	<li>More than 60% of all individuals who own voice-activated speakers say that their devices are used as a part of their daily routine.</li>\n 	<li>By 2022, voice shopping will increase to $60 Billion.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>3. Chatbots – Increase length - </strong></span></h3>\nChatbots are basically the bots based on AI Technology used by the companies to instant messaging to talk in Real-time visitors. If you use Chatbots properly you can easily change your customer experience. Chatbots can be used to interact with the user and help the user to solve basic queries.\n\nThese Chatbots are used by every business Like Facebook, Snapchat, HealthifyMe and many others are using chatbots. Here are some of the reason why you should consider Chatbots in 2020:\n<ul>\n 	<li>By 2020, more than 80% of Customer service will be power by Chatbots</li>\n 	<li>Chatbots will save more than $10 Billion by 2020</li>\n 	<li>By 2020, More than 70% of businesses will use Chatbots.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>4. Video Marketing is the new king - </strong></span></h3>\nNowadays, the audience has been shifted towards Mobile devices and as compared to laptops and desktop mobile has smaller screens so reading in mobile devices is quite difficult. So, Now Video Marketing has become a real king. Video marketing helps businesses to deliver all information in a creative manner.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Almost 39% call a seller after viewing a video.</li>\n 	<li>More than 50% of buyers say that the product video before buying a product.</li>\n 	<li>60% of consumers say that they watched a brand\'s video first.</li>\n 	<li>Almost 60% company says that video has enhanced their conversation rate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>5. Influencer Marketing - </strong></span></h3>\nInfluencer marketing has been one of the most successful digital marketing trends, It\'s so successful that big influencers are now a commodity. Influencers are usually Instagram and YouTube personalities with a huge fan following who can help businesses to promote their product to their audience through their social media channels.\n<ul>\n 	<li>More than 50% of audience trust influencers review more than the brand\'s Review</li>\n 	<li>More than 55% of the audience bought a product in the past 6 months because of an Influencer\'s recommendation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>6. Email Marketing - </strong></span></h3>\nIf you provide <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\"><strong>Digital Marketing services</strong></a> or any other services then you would focus on Email Marketing. Email Marketing is getting smarter day-by-day, Every Digital marketing agency is giving priority to the active subscribers. The one who has submitted his or her mail address should be given more importance. Companies can send those Newsletters and can keep them updated with their new products, event, and more.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>7. Interactive Content – Increase length</strong></span></h3>\nInteractive content basically means the type of content which encourages the audience to interact online. The Interactive content catches the user\'s eyes and pushes the user to engage directly with the business. These interaction helps you to <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/how-to-increase-brand-awareness/\"><strong>increase brand awareness</strong></a> and increase your Brand Reputation. Interactive Content helps businesses to grow brand awareness without paying for any ad. These types of content help the brand to connect with the audience directly.\n\nHere are some of the examples of interactive content types:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Quizzes and Polls</li>\n 	<li>360-degree videos</li>\n 	<li>Embedded Calculators</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>8. Social Media Ads – Add pointers</strong></span></h3>\nNow everybody is on Social Media and they usually spend more than an hour a day on social media channels like Facebook and Instagram. So if you want to target a huge number of Audience then <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">Social Media Marketing services</a></strong> or Ads are great. These social media channels have Billions of audience that\'s why most of the brands using these channels\n\nThese Channels helps the business to increase awareness and also increases the trust of the brand. Businesses can also connect with the audience and can easily build a good relationship.\n<ul>\n 	<li>More than 65% of Social Media users say that they discover new products on Social Media Channels</li>\n 	<li>According to a study, 45% of Adult do not trust a brand who doesn’t have Social Media Pages</li>\n 	<li>Absolute Vodka ran an Advertisement on Social Media and they saw a 5-time growth in Brand Awareness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>9. Browser Push Notifications Push</strong></span></h3>\nBrowser Push notifications are a great action offering direct engagement. More and more companies are adopting the Push notifications. If users click on the allow button then whenever you post something new the notification will be shown on the user device.\n<ul>\n 	<li>As compared to the newsletter subscribers browser push notification provides more engagement.</li>\n 	<li>Only 10% of businesses achieve newsletter subscribers that match the number of Push Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>10. Messaging Apps</strong></span></h3>\nEveryone uses Social messaging apps like Facebook, WhatsApp, Wechat, etc. These apps will definitely grow in the future and will attract billions of audience. Users spend more than 2-3 hours a day on these apps.\n\nAs these apps have Billions of active users who spend hours in these apps so targeting the audience in these Apps will provide more engagement. These Apps allow you to send a personalized message to the users, these give your business a great value.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/10-Digital-Marketing-trends-you-cant-ignore-in-2020.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-07-06 07:55:08','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(451,'MAJOR REASONS WHY DATA MANAGEMENT SERVICES ARE IMPORTANT TO ANY BUSINESS OR ORGANIZATION','major-reasons-why-data-management-services-are-important-to-any-business-or-organization','','Data in today\'s global environment is the most pivotal key for any organization or business.\n\nData is the king and solution for each problem that arises in the generation. People tend to make life-changing decisions with the help of data and that being so <strong><span class=\"q-inline\"><a class=\"q-box qu-cursor--pointer qu-hover--textDecoration--underline\" title=\"www.tech2globe.com\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Data entry services</a></span></strong> are cardinal and of the essence. A word of importance, the data should be secure, complete, constructive, and accurate in order to enhance and enlarge the organization.\n\nIn opposite, if the data is not wholly liable it can lead to certain baleful decisions that can change situations upside down. Data management services are all-important when the information can be processed or managed manually, therefore comes the decision to invest in an effective Data management system.\n<h2 class=\"q-text qu-display--block\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Some of the prime reasons as to why data management services are important are as follows -</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"q-box\">\n 	<li class=\"q-relative\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Heightens organization productivity - </strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">If the companies data can be acquired or examined easily without cumbersome procedures or issues then it is noted that the efficiency and effectiveness of the business surge, especially in the larger organization. The company will be termed as more successful and organized with the help of better communication between the employees.\n\nIn truth, there will be lesser chaos and loss. That being the case it is pertinent to hire the best <strong><span class=\"q-inline\"><a class=\"q-box qu-cursor--pointer qu-hover--textDecoration--underline\" title=\"www.tech2globe.com\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-entry-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">data entry outsourcing company</a></span></strong>.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"q-box\">\n 	<li class=\"q-relative\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Resolved and better operations - </strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">Superior and improved business operations are a symbol of organizations\' potent and powerful performance which is attained with the help of offline and online data entry when done convincingly. With the assistance of smooth operations, you\'ll be able to step up the ladder of success and be unsurpassable in comparison with your contenders.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"q-box\">\n 	<li class=\"q-relative\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Improved decision making - </strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">When all and sundry are aware of each and everything in the organization and are well known as to were to look without creating disarray, the organization can be notified as effectual and in addition to that, all the decision that is taken in the meantime are productive and best. One should <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">hire Data Management service provider</a></strong> for looking into this subject which will in turn lead to cut above feedback, fine delegation process ana long term profits.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"q-box\">\n 	<li class=\"q-relative\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Less data wastage - </strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">Quality <span class=\"q-inline\">data management services</span> do a strong job when it comes to saving companies\' vital and all-important information and reduces the risk of massive loss and best of all it makes sure that all data is backed uprightly so that in case any technical glitch occurs, we all are safe and secure.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"q-box\">\n 	<li class=\"q-relative\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Cost-effective - </strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">With a good and proper working system, you\'ll be saved when the situation arises that off to spend a huge amount in fixing unnecessary faults as now you are much devoted to your <span class=\"q-inline\">data management services </span>which will save you from that occurring problems.</p>\n<p class=\"q-text qu-display--block\">Round the clock, the world is growing and with it, the data, details, and information are also heightening to a massive extent and at times it becomes complex to save that information from the ones that can misuse it. In light of this, it is fundamental to invest in <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">outsourcing data management services</a> </strong>to stay ahead and to have a strong presence.</p>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/007-min.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-06-11 05:43:47','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(452,'HOW COVID-19 IMPACT ON ECOMMERCE BUSINESS','how-covid-19-impact-on-ecommece-business','','As we all are aware of the factuality that <strong><a href=\"https://www.worldometers.info/coronavirus/\">Covid-19 cases</a></strong> and deaths are heightening to a great extent and this pandemic is considered to be out the most vicious to life and economy, there\'s a major impact this has caused explicitly to the e-commerce business. E-commerce this time is experiencing a huge fluctuation as some retailers are undergoing profits whereas some are just tipping down to enormous losses. The scenario revolves around the fact that many Ecommerce Business or Stores have seen an increase in sales and customers due to this Lockdown situation since people are adopting online shopping due to the restrictions. But there is more to this, quite a few stores have not seen many shifts towards profits. It\'s a muddled and uncertain situation for E-commerce.\n\nGoing into the depth of the topic it explains that it has both a good and bad version of itself like starting with the good effects-\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Growth in Hygiene related items</strong></li>\n</ol>\nHygiene products in Covid-19 are in substantial demand daily which accumulates items like sanitizer, masks, sprays, etc for safeguarding oneself and family. Therefore all the <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Ecommerce Businesses or Stores</a></strong> that deal with hygiene products and services are taking immense profits so much so that there is an 817% approximate increase in purchases.\n<ol start=\"2\">\n 	<li><strong>Profile for online medicines store</strong></li>\n</ol>\nBusinesses that work by offering online medicines have also seen a rise in their growth tremendously as people are buying and stocking up the cough and flu-related medicines to be on a safer point. The online purchases are noticed to have risen by 198% approximately in these hard times.\n<ol start=\"3\">\n 	<li><strong>Heightening sales of Groceries</strong></li>\n</ol>\nSales of groceries have also reached great heights principally for non-perishable items like pasta, rice and more. These items are of great help in these times and hence have seen a good growth of around 69%.\n\n<strong>Categories that are having a bad time includes-</strong>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Fashion related commodities</strong></li>\n</ol>\nIn these times consumers major focus is on the most vital items that are needed for survival. Therefore countless fashion brands have seen a gigantic downfall as they don\'t wish to trust the items which can be for some time delayed.\n<ol start=\"2\">\n 	<li><strong>Technology related products</strong></li>\n</ol>\nE-commerce stores that succor at providing technology-related items like laptops, cell phones, chargers, and more have experienced substantial decreasing growth as people don\'t run after buying these products but indispensable items as their consumption can happen later when needed.\n\nThere is no manufacturing process that is being conducted in the factories due to the Covid-19 spread. Production and supply of nearly each and every item is on a standstill. Distribution channels are also struggling in just offering the essential items.\n\nAs a consequence the e-commerce industries are also racking with pain and utmost loss, being on a complete verge of shutting down.\n\nIt was sensed that due to people staying up in their homes constantly there will be a leap up in the activities and transactions of e-commerce, but it wasn\'t the truth as people have wholly been uninterested in these specific times. People are all occupied in Covid-19 related news and announcements and being involved in caring for the family.\n\nWith being busy people are also more cautioned owing to the fact of how much havoc this virus has resulted in lives. Public is alarmed and petrified to come in touch with outside products as it may result in the virus transmission. Directly it has carried out extensive deprivation for the e-commerce business.\n\nChange in the customer\'s behavior, supply chain disruptions are also some of the grounds for shrinking growth of businesses. All the instances are meant to bring unquestionable changes, then there\'s no point in such a big instance not leading to a gross loss.\n\nSome of the tips from<strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\"> e-commerce experts</a></strong> say that the industry will bring a pragmatic change in the customer consumption pattern by assisting them, we as a citizen just need to stop hoarding the items as it will badly affect someone who is in genuine need. The only tip is to be all together in the crisis.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/How-COVID-19-Impact-on-Ecommerce-Business.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-05-19 08:39:35','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(453,'DIGITAL MARKETING INNOVATIONS TO CONSIDER DURING CORONAVIRUS PANDEMIC','digital-marketing-innovations-to-consider-during-coronavirus-pandemic','','There are innumerable Digital marketing innovations that need to be planned out, analyzed, and implemented impressively and conclusively as each of innovations lies in the notable priority of the business owners.\n\nOn that account Tech2Globe is a veritable and authentic Digital marketing agency, which strives towards offering digital marketing services at great ease, to be ahead of the contender\'s every time and to remain stable and mobile during this coronavirus pandemic.\n\nExploiting the <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">Digital marketing services</a></strong> in the most superlative manner these are some of the innovations needed to be addressed-\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Extremely innovative content</strong></li>\n</ul>\nDigital marketing or innovations are customarily getting more and more advanced with new strategies popping up straight away. Hence it is of utmost importance to deal and engage with high-quality innovative content keeping all the changes and preferences in mind owing to the fact that today\'s audience prefers video Content.\n\nOur digital marketing agency also offers Ephemeral content like that of Instagram stories which are more meaningful these days.\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Improved Personalization </strong></li>\n</ul>\nProfessional personalization girdles around making strategies or content keeping in the thought of individual requirements to achieve ameliorated customer satisfaction. Precisely in this Coronavirus pandemic, it is vital to create user experiences through the way of segmentation or Content targeting as the public in these times expect an Engaging content.\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Video marketing</strong></li>\n</ul>\nNot only does video marketing is relevant and salient in this specific time but it is also pivotal for the next 10 years or more, the reason being that many professionals convey that video marketing leads to untold conversion rates. Therefore it\'s the choice of the public to consume data through video and it\'s our responsibility to deliver it without fading its importance.\n<ul>\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services\"><strong>Pay-Per-Click Marketing</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\nDigital marketing or innovations succor you at maintaining a pragmatic relationship with your customer by making them aware of each and every detail related to the product or service by driving them to websites efficiently. They gather the information through diverse ways, one being the ads that show up during research and this is the specific time when it\'s a higher chance for the ads to get noticed and appreciated through the Pay-Per-Click marketing which helps in knowing about variegated interests. Accordingly, work should be managed to reap the benefits of innovations in these times to get the traffic as desired.\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Observing marketing metrics</strong></li>\n</ul>\nIn order to be in contact with the performance and improvements, a <strong><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing-services\">digital marketing agency</a></strong> should without exception monitor these metrics which includes the number of visitors, the conversion rates, and more like these. This individual and discrete innovation will help you gather knowledge about which area is not h9elping you earn in this time and hence all the individuals can work towards it or can keep it at a standstill for some time.\n\nWith these there are countless more dynamic innovations that are right next to you, like being in routine touch with the consumers, offering specific offers, knowing the acts of your relevant competitors, and plenty of others. It\'s our task and duty to use these innovations to a good advantage.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/FINAL-1-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-05-05 13:02:20','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(454,'Tech2Globe Launched Free Amazon Online Training Program to Become Amazon Seller','tech2globe-launched-free-amazon-online-training-program-to-become-amazon-seller','','<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">AMAZON FREE TRAINING</span></h2>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Tech2Globe Initiative</strong></span></h4>\nNursing the E-commerce industry from past decade and now partner with Amazon since 2015. Tech2Globe has took initiative to spread awareness of starting with business Amazon.\n\nGet Video version: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUhq_fAGzR8\">Click Here</a>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Training Index</span></h2>\n<table style=\"height: 397px;\" width=\"817\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"309\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Basic Training </span></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"131\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Page Number </span></td>\n<td width=\"214\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Time Allotted  </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"214\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">(in min) </span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Seller Central Setup - Documents needed</td>\n<td width=\"131\">2</td>\n<td width=\"214\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Gated and Ungated Categories</td>\n<td width=\"131\">2</td>\n<td width=\"214\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Brand Registry on Amazon.in</td>\n<td width=\"131\">3</td>\n<td width=\"214\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">GTIN Exemption</td>\n<td width=\"131\">6</td>\n<td width=\"214\">5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Products you can sell</td>\n<td width=\"131\">7</td>\n<td width=\"214\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Preparing Product Details, Image Guideline &amp; Understanding</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"131\">9</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"214\">20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Prohibited Content</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Product Listing (Single/Bulk)</td>\n<td width=\"131\">10</td>\n<td width=\"214\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Importance of Maintaining Seller Performance</td>\n<td width=\"131\">13</td>\n<td width=\"214\">10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"309\">Sellers Questionnaire</td>\n<td width=\"131\">14</td>\n<td width=\"214\">15</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1. Seller Central Setup - Documents Needed</span></h2>\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-978\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-1.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"741\" height=\"284\" />\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">REGISTER YOUR SELLER ACCOUNT</span>\n\na) Email Address\n\nb) Company Name\n\nc) GST Number\n\nd) PAN Details of the Company\n\ne) Bank Account Details along with IFSC Code\n\nf) Mobile number for Phone verification\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">If you don\'t have GST?</span>\n<ol>\n 	<li>Register your GST: <a href=\"https://cleartax.in/s/amazon-partnership?ref=AZGST_SOAHIW&amp;ld=NSGoogle\">Click Here</a></li>\n 	<li>Complete your required details of registration: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1BRyJEdFrE-t5Kfdd2GwMtBpZvTzqQv6FjW9fuCKNB0g/edit#gid=0\">Click Here</a></li>\n 	<li>Step by Step Process\n<ol>\n 	<li><a href=\"https://imtips.co/register-seller-amazon-india.html\">Amazon India</a></li>\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.junglescout.com/blog/amazon-seller-registration-create-account/\">Amazon Global</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2. Gated and Ungated Categories</span></h2>\n<strong>UNGATED CATEGORIES</strong>\n\nungated categories are those categories for which we don’t have to take approval from the Amazon to sell on Amazon.\n\nFew categories which lies under <strong>Ungated Category</strong> are\n<ul>\n 	<li>Appliances</li>\n 	<li>Baby</li>\n 	<li>Bags Wallet and Luggage</li>\n 	<li>Beauty</li>\n 	<li>Books</li>\n 	<li>Car and Motorbike</li>\n 	<li>Home Improvements</li>\n 	<li>Home &amp; Kitchen, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>GATED CATEGORIES</strong>\n\nGated Categories are those categories which we can’t sell on Amazon without taking its approval. We can’t sell drugs on amazon and crime scene images also.\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-983\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/02.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"927\" height=\"282\" />\n\nFew categories which lies under <strong>Gated Category</strong> are:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Coins and Paper Money Collectibles</li>\n 	<li>Disposable Face Masks</li>\n 	<li>Hand Sanitizers</li>\n 	<li>Hygienic Alcohol</li>\n 	<li>Disinfecting Wipes and Sprays</li>\n 	<li>Entertainment Collectibles</li>\n 	<li>Fine Art</li>\n 	<li>Beauty</li>\n 	<li>Clothing &amp; Accessories Sunglasses</li>\n 	<li>Sports Collectibles</li>\n 	<li>Streaming Media Players</li>\n 	<li>Watches</li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"https://sellercentral.amazon.in/ap/signin?openid.pape.max_auth_age=0&amp;openid.return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsellercentral.amazon.in%2Fgp%2Fhelp%2Fhelp.html%3FitemID%3DG200332540%26ref_%3Dxx_G200332540_a_r43_cont_sgsearch&amp;openid.identity=http%3A%2F%2Fspecs.openid.net%2Fauth%2F2.0%2Fidentifier_select&amp;openid.assoc_handle=sc_in_amazon_v2&amp;openid.mode=checkid_setup&amp;language=en_IN&amp;openid.claimed_id=http%3A%2F%2Fspecs.openid.net%2Fauth%2F2.0%2Fidentifier_select&amp;pageId=sc_in_amazon_v2&amp;openid.ns=http%3A%2F%2Fspecs.openid.net%2Fauth%2F2.0&amp;ssoResponse=eyJ6aXAiOiJERUYiLCJlbmMiOiJBMjU2R0NNIiwiYWxnIjoiQTI1NktXIn0.d0YpF3g6jCzSrJzO1Xs1VjYvap_TAHDSHGArVLdM2NHTK3ftYFCD9g.ildUf_ZpY8BfhZW4.gCbbOgJ28aOhc_pus7vs5KaHy0Cv6nuBq0OhnkPEpiLwQlJJ_YeW2HeegwCqmThL06PXv03OJgYbWbxWrT4cCw2VEuzdcJlTobtyoRFM_67UliHjnNXtWItE-gQJeEbIvdfoNOHz_2gV66V-GX-6_FROlPnKQtokNHqgNfUBYXp2cKH8_CDAX5bBikSA97tD3caeR44r__uKsRxD7GS8U8p33TqHKb9pOhqDHgJvUcet6EqjNT6S5owkpK9uSlLVP-WV.eywl9fqtbZkzDQF1UKUywA\">OVERVIEW OF PRODUCT TYPES AND CATEGORIES REQUIRING APPROVAL PRODUCTS YOU CAN’T SELL ON AMAZON INDIA</a>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">3. Brand Registry on Amazon.in</span></h2>\nThe Amazon Brand Registry helps you protect your registered trademarks on Amazon and create an accurate and trusted experience for customers.\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-1:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Login into amazon seller central.</li>\n 	<li>Click on Advertising Tab and select A+ Content manager or simple go to URL: <a href=\"https://brandregistry.amazon.in/?ref=asin_abr_home_enrol&amp;ld=undefined_null\">https://brandregistry.amazon.in/?ref=asin_abr_home_enrol&amp;ld=undefined_null</a></li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-2:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Form will appear after clicking above URL</li>\n 	<li>Fill according to your brand and business</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-984\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/03.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"923\" height=\"434\" />\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-3:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Select your trademark type</li>\n 	<li>Then enter your trademark number on the blank cell</li>\n 	<li>After that select your country</li>\n 	<li>And click on next tab for proceed further</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-985\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/04.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"545\" height=\"575\" />\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-4:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>After click on next tab you have to fill all the details in new opened page on your browser.</li>\n 	<li>Select all the option and fill the details according to your trademark certificate and business details, category carefully.</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-986\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/05.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"1166\" height=\"838\" />\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Final Step-5:</span>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Once you submit the application, case id will be created on Amazon seller account.</li>\n 	<li>Once all shared details verified by the “Amazon brand registry team” then they will notify you by the “verification code” (see example below) and reply to brand registry case id in your case log within 30 days provide with the verification code and case ID for this application. *</li>\n</ul>\nVerification code example:\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-987\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/06.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"327\" height=\"62\" />\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4. GTIN Exemption</span></h2>\nHow to list products that do not have a Product ID (GTIN - UPC, EAN, JAN or ISBN) or don’t have brand registry on Amazon India?\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Answer</span>, <em>GTIN Exemption</em>, it is also required if you are not a brand owner and still want to sell your products. You need to obtain exemption for a brand in a specific product category.\n\nNote: If you are selling any non-branded products or bundles, you can use \"<strong>Generic</strong>\" in the brand name field while listing products in Amazon.\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-988\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/07.jpg\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"706\" height=\"394\" />\n\nAPPLY FOR GTIN EXEMPTION\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-1:</span>\n\nSelect the category in which want to sell on and enter the Brand Name.\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-989\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/08.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"961\" height=\"285\" />\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step2:</span>\n\nIf yes, upload Support Letter Format:\n\n<a href=\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/gtin-exemption-templates/IN-EN/Support_Letter_Publisher_Sample.doc\">Publisher Support</a> Letter\n\n<a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/31/rainier/help/Support_Letter_Brand_sample.doc\">Owner/</a> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/31/rainier/help/Support_Letter_Brand_sample.doc\">Manufacturer Supp</a>\n\nIf No, upload product raw image with brand name:\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-991\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Free-Amazon-Online-Training.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"292\" height=\"114\" />\n\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Step-3:</span>\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-992\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-2.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"962\" height=\"360\" />\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">5. Products You Can Sell</span></h2>\n<h6><a href=\"https://sellercentral.amazon.in/gp/help/help.html/?itemID=G200336920&amp;ref_=xx_G200336920_a_r3_cont_sgsearch\">(Amazon Rate Card)</a></h6>\nYou can sell any of the product on amazon panel. In amazon 32 types of category available for selling on panel.\n\nWe’re all looking to become the next big company - like some of the most popular brands today. but truth is, in today’s saturated product market, it’s difficult to generate product ideas.\n\nLucky for you, we’ve compiled a product brainstorm checklist to help you unlock your entrepreneurial spirit and drive.\n\nA) PRODUCT OPPORTUNITIES can exist in an area like:\n<ol>\n 	<li>PRODUCT PRICE UNDER 1000</li>\n 	<li>LIGHTWEIGHT IN SHIPPING</li>\n 	<li>CHOOSE LESS AMAZON COMMISSION CATEGORY</li>\n 	<li>LESS COMPETITIVE PRODUCTS</li>\n 	<li>EASY TO SOURCE OR EASILY AVAILABLE</li>\n</ol>\nB) Products you can starts with:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Plastic water bottles</li>\n 	<li>Handkerchief</li>\n 	<li>Socks</li>\n 	<li>Key chains</li>\n 	<li>Toys</li>\n 	<li>Women’s scarf</li>\n 	<li>Artificial jewelry</li>\n 	<li>Sunglasses</li>\n 	<li>Winter gloves, caps, mufflers</li>\n 	<li>Disposables</li>\n 	<li>Mobile accessories: earphone, back cover, data cable, protection glasses, etc.</li>\n 	<li>Home decor: cushion covers, bedsheet, handicraft, photo frames, etc.</li>\n 	<li>Men’s tie, bow tie, cravat, etc.</li>\n 	<li>Kitchen accessories: knife, lunch box, etc.</li>\n</ul>\nC) Categories on amazon with referral Fee &amp; Fee rate card:\n\nYou can also check product referral fee and calculate other amazon charges with below link:\n\n<a href=\"https://services.amazon.in/services/sell-on-amazon/pricing.html\">https://services.amazon.in/services/sell-on-amazon/pricing.html</a>\n\nD) Sale Calculator by Tech2Globe\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EEqjL9ab2yqlgL47dg25eMiYBk1gS0qt/view\">Amazon Sale Calculator</a>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">6. Preparing Product Details, Image Guidelines &amp; Understanding Prohibited Content</span></h2>\nA) PREPARING PRODUCT DETAILS\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Title: </strong>Title will show first on the Amazon Buyer’s Page so choose the Title of the product very carefully and choose the Title which will show a short description of your product. Example (brand name, <em>what is your product for? Material? Color? Size? Who can use? Weight? Etc)</em></li>\n 	<li><strong>Description: </strong>Choose the Description very wisely as it will reflect your product. The font of the description should be attractive.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bullet Points: </strong>The Bullet Points are very important as it is that section which will highlight your product and you can add more details in Bullet Points rather than the Title and Description.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Keywords: </strong>Keywords are those words which the buyers use to search the product example <em>(belts, leather belts, belts for men).</em></li>\n</ul>\nFew examples product listing by <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\">Tech2Globe </a>team\n<table style=\"height: 223px;\" width=\"370\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"331\">CATALOGUING</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">https://www.amazon.in/dp/B07SV45NND</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">https://www.amazon.in/dp/B083TZCVH7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">https://www.amazon.in/dp/B084T54Q6L</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">https://www.amazon.in/dp/B085TFRH88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">https://www.amazon.in/dp/B085H6ZLK1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01BGBJ8Y0\">https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01BGBJ8Y0</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\nB) IMAGE GUIDELINES (click here)\n<ul>\n 	<li>The primary image of your item is called the \"MAIN\" image. You can provide 1 main product image and up to 8 additional images.</li>\n 	<li>Images must accurately represent the product and show only the product that\'s for sale, with minimal or no propping.</li>\n 	<li>Products must fill at least 85% of the image. Images must show only the product that is for sale, with few or no props and with no logos, watermarks, or inset images.</li>\n 	<li>Main images must have a pure white background, must be a photo (not a drawing), and must not contain excluded accessories.</li>\n 	<li>Images must be at least 1000 pixels on the longest side and at least 500 pixels on the shortest side to be zoom-able.</li>\n 	<li>Images must not exceed 10000 pixels on the longest side.</li>\n 	<li>JPEG is the preferred image format, but you also may use TIFF and GIF files.</li>\n</ul>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-994\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"503\" />\n\nC) PROHIBITED CONTENT (click here)\n\nSellers are expected to conduct proper research to ensure that the items posted to our Amazon site follow all applicable laws. If Amazon determine that the content of a product detail page or listing is prohibited, potentially illegal, or inappropriate, Amazon may remove or alter it without prior notice. Amazon reserves the right to make judgments about whether or not content is appropriate.\n\nExamples: - Alcohol, Sexual, Drugs, Abusive words etc.\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">7. Product Listing (Single / Bulk)</span></h2>\nPRODUCT LISTING\n\nWe can do listing with the 2 ways on Amazon seller central:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Manual Listing</li>\n 	<li>Bulk Listing</li>\n</ul>\nMANUAL LISTING\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-995\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-5.png\" alt=\"Free Amazon Online Training\" width=\"711\" height=\"337\" />\n\nStep-1: go to “Catalogue &gt; Add Products”\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-996\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\" height=\"101\" />\n\nStep-2: find suitable category and select\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-997\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"221\" />\n\nStep-3: Fill all mandatories details or highlighted in red and click “Submit”\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-998\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"790\" height=\"399\" />\n\nBULK LISTING\n\nStep-1: go to “Inventory &gt; Add Products via Upload”\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-999\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"231\" height=\"323\" />\n\nStep-2: choose “template/feed file/bulk upload file” after clicking “Download an Inventory File” and select category and download the template (Recommended: Advanced).\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1000\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1112\" height=\"677\" />\n\nStep-3: fill the details as per Amazon guidelines and upload. Example template:\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10GduxLmxcq5LfPhkQF9sqFM-7Qwooj6Q/view\">T-Shirt Amazon Template</a>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">8. Importance of Maintaining Seller Performance</span></h2>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1001\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1207\" height=\"436\" />\n\nACCOUNT HEALTH\n\nTo sell on Amazon, you must adhere to the below performance targets and policies. Amazon policies maintain a marketplace that is safe for buyers and fair to sellers. Violations of these policies may result in content removal or account deactivation.\n\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1002\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01-12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"723\" height=\"451\" />\n\nSellers Questionnaire\n\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1004\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/01.png.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"92\" height=\"92\" />\n\nSEND YOUR ENQUIRY/QUESTIONS/SUGGESTION/FEEDBACK\n\nEmail: Amazon.spn@tech2globe.com\n\nPhone: 011-430-10-700 / +91-98-99-67-5039','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Amazon-Free-Online-Training-Thumbnail.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-05-02 09:49:17','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(455,'CORONAVIRUS: Tech2Globe Strategies to Manage Remote Work Easier From Home to Fight Against COVID-19','coronavirus-tech2globe-strategies-to-manage-remote-work-easier-from-home-to-fight-against-covid-19','','<h2><img class=\"size-full wp-image-964 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Coronavirus-Pandemic.png\" alt=\"Coronavirus Pandemic\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" /></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Companies around the world have announced remote work facility for Employees to ensure their safety</span></h2>\nStarted from the Wuhan City of China in December 2019, now it has continuously spread all over the globe and affects more than 200 countries. The situation is getting worse day-by-day and many government bodies have announced the lockdown state completely.\n\nAs due to COVID-19 is spreading frequently, forcing many companies to shut down their office hours and introduced the “Work from Home” policy. Google, Apple, Facebook, and even <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> are such companies who already rolled out “work from home” facility to prevent the spread of the virus and protect their Employees.\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Why Work From Home Policy Needed?</strong></span></h2>\nThe coronavirus (COVID-19) outbreak has officially been categorized by the World Health Organization (WHO) as a pandemic, meaning infection is accelerating in multiple countries concurrently. And, according to the “Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)” the main reason for spread the virus is from person-to-person;\n<ul>\n 	<li>Between people who are in close contact with one another.</li>\n 	<li>Through respiratory droplets produced when an infected person coughs or sneezes.</li>\n</ul>\nThese droplets can land in the mouths or noses of people who are nearby or possibly be inhaled into the lungs.\n\nRead from here: How COVID-19 Spreads\n\nSo, it is more to maintain social distancing as our maximum employees used metro’s and buses to present in the office. That’s why Tech2Globe’s Management (and worldwide companies) introduced work from home policy.\n\nWe have already started taken some <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/coronavirus-tech2globe-is-taking-some-steps-to-protect-its-employees/\">steps to maintain a safe workplace</a> and protect our employees from getting infectious by distributing Hand Sanitizers, Face Masks to all and check regular body temperature as well as advice from the medical expert.\n\nAlso, Tech2Globe’s Chief Operating Officer (COO), Mr. Harpreet Singh Sethi shared his words:\n\n<em>“We have taken this step to ensure you all are safe so does your family.</em>\n\n<em>We request support from everyone in this planning. Now, health should be a priority for everyone so do not have a second thought so please make sure you guys stay at home and work efficiently. This is a tough time for everyone across the globe and we need to come over it. Once this phase will pass, we will come out even stronger.</em>\n\n<em>Take care guys and stay safe!”</em>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Our Practices When Creating Work From Home Program</strong></span></h2>\nTech2Globe introduces a work from the home program that should create specific guidelines to ensure all employees understand what is required from them when they work remotely. However, remote working is probably limited to a few, when work can be performed from home, there is a range of things that business to consider as the workplace expands.\n\nWe’ve found the list of things, here are some items to consider when implementing a work-from-home policy.\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Measure the Resources, Policies &amp; Expense Reimbursement</span></h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Review existing resources, applicable policies, and customer agreements to determine if remote work is feasible, prudent, and contractually permissible.</li>\n 	<li>Create a proper plan for resources, communication ways, expense reimbursement, etc.</li>\n 	<li>Stay on top of developments and plans may need to be changed.</li>\n 	<li>Provide secure Systems &amp; Laptops to our Employees to work efficiently.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Check Internet Connectivity &amp; Speed</span></h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Measure the proper Internet Connectivity at every Employee place.</li>\n 	<li>If occur any internet issue, the company takes the responsibility to work efficiently without any hindrance.</li>\n 	<li>We also calculate employee’s extra expenses related to the internet and connectivity that will be reimbursed.</li>\n 	<li>We monitor the internet speed and If need to increase or double the internet speed we will ready to support them.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Build Virtual Network for Communicate &amp; Meetings</span></h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Ensure critical lines of communication between management and the employees.</li>\n 	<li>Provide employee system access to operate and easily communicate.</li>\n 	<li>Outline best practices for maintaining a safe “workspace”.</li>\n 	<li>Build regular meetings, proper communication channels and support each other.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Provide 24/7 IT Team Support</span></h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li>IT team always ready to address employee’s equipment issues.</li>\n 	<li>Solve systems error and set up to work from home by the availability of 24/7.</li>\n 	<li>Use proper channels to solve issues on calls (video &amp; voice) and by visiting the employee’s place.</li>\n 	<li>Be understanding and solution-oriented.</li>\n</ul>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/COVID-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-03-24 05:14:02','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(456,'Amazon Launched Full Online Store In Netherlands – Amazon.nl','amazon-launched-full-online-store-in-netherlands','','As reported in January 2020, the e-commerce giant Amazon was planning to launch a complete marketplace in Netherlands, i.e. <a href=\"https://www.amazon.nl/\">Amazon.nl</a> to offer wide variety of product categories.\n\nNow the news is in the highlight again, on Tuesday (March 10, 2020), Amazon officially launched a full operating online store in Netherlands (amazon.nl) as a marketplace and offering more than 100 million of products across over 30 categories.\n\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-954 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Amazon-Netherlands.png\" alt=\"Amazon Netherlands - Tech2Globe\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" />\n\nPreviously Amazon.nl only offer e-books for Amazon Kindle in the Netherlands since 2014 and provided 3 million products from Amazon.de since 2016. Although, Amazon.nl exceeding its limits now and will be offering more than 30 products categories, including Consumer Electronics, Sports &amp; Outdoors, Home Improvements, Beauty, Fashion, Shoes, Home &amp; Kitchen as well as Fire TV Stick devices.\n\n<strong>Read More :- <a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/amazon-launches-global-shopping-experience-to-south-africa/\">Amazon launches Global Shopping Experience to South Africa </a></strong>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>New Growth Opportunities – Big &amp; Small Businesses</strong></span></h2>\nWith the launch of <a href=\"https://services.amazon.nl/\">Amazon.nl</a>, opens new growth opportunities for Dutch businesses. It will be easier for them to expand their businesses and reach millions of customers.\n\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Roeland Donker, Country Manager of Amazon.nl said:</strong></span>\n\n<em>“Today, thousands of local selling partners are offering their products on Amazon.nl and on our other Amazon stores across the EU as well as in the US. We hope that international customers will come to enjoy this Dutch selection and help grow these businesses with every purchase they make. Small and medium sized companies selling in Amazon stores created an estimate 1.6 million jobs worldwide and we hope to see Dutch companies prosper in the same way.”</em>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">How Tech2Globe Help Amazon.nl Sellers?</span></h2>\nNew marketplace would likely to introduced new opportunities and new challenges and create enough concern amongst in Amazon.nl Sellers for Amazon Guidelines.\n\nAs, we (Tech2Globe) are <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services\">Certified Amazon Consultant</a> and Global Services Provider to provide finest Amazon services from store setup to list products to manage account health and many more.\n\nWith the profound years of experience on <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com\">Amazon Global Marketplaces</a> such as Amazon.de, Amazon.ca Amazon.com, Amazon.fr, etc. and deeply understand Amazon features &amp; specifications, we can help Amazon Sellers in to migrate and manage Seller Account on Amazon.nl on the basis of below features:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Setup an Amazon Storefront</li>\n 	<li>Product Listing Optimization</li>\n 	<li>List Product Images according to Amazon Standard &amp; Guidelines</li>\n 	<li>Optimized Products &amp; SEO Content</li>\n 	<li>Recover all the Data</li>\n 	<li>Integrate Payment Options</li>\n 	<li>Amazon Product Marketing Services</li>\n 	<li>Amazon Sales Boost Services</li>\n 	<li>Amazon Account Management &amp; Support Services &amp; many more.</li>\n</ul>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Amazon-Netherlands-Amazon.nl-Tech2gGlobe.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-03-13 09:15:55','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(457,'TOP 5 IMPORTANT SOCIAL MEDIA TRENDS IN 2020','top-5-important-social-media-trends-in-2020','','It\'s the idea of social media life that once in a while remains the equivalent from year to year and in the event that you need to be fruitful in online life, at that point you must be centered on the most recent internet based life patterns.\n\nSocial networking is the source to connect with companions anyway it\'s made an altogether better approach to devour a wide range of substance that incorporates news, photography, design and even verse.\n\nIf you want to build stronger and <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing\">get more engaged audiences</a> then you have to enter into some new social media trends. These are some top 6 important social media trends of 2020<strong>. </strong>\n\n<strong>1) Video Content is the King:</strong>  In 2019, approx. 92% of users watched a video on mobile. However, this video content is shared more as compared to the combined content of text and image. Many of the customers (72% approx.) learn about the products and services completely through video and 88% approx. people spend more time on that kind of website which has more videos. After analysis in 2019, it found that 54% of customers want to see more <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services\">video content from brands</a>. According to the HubSpot report, 85% of the businesses use video as a marketing tool and by 2022 as much as 82% of all internet traffic will be video content. So, these stats proved that Video Content is going to be the next trend in the upcoming time.\n\nAs we discussed in the above point that 82% of traffic coming from video content and it became one of the essential strategies in the field of marketing. These live videos are being broadcast on Twitter, Facebook, YouTube, Instagram, and Tumblr. Video marketing is the way to tell the story in a more entertaining, educational and inspiring way.\n\n<strong>2) Post Social Media Stories:</strong>  Snapchat is the first platform where users post short stories which are automatically deleted after 24 hours. After looking at this feature in Snapchat, Both Facebook and Instagram decided to add this feature. You can add hashtags to both Instagram and Facebook posts by using the targeted keywords so that users find you on the network easily. Tags should clickable so that <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">you can target your brand more effectively</a>.\n\n<strong>3) Instant Messaging:</strong> The main focus of all the brands is to connect with users on social media networks because over 2 billion people use messaging platforms around the globe. To connect with users through messaging brands would invest more time and money.\n\n<strong>4) Increasing Popularity of Tik Tok:</strong> As we all know that, Tik Tok is the most popular platform from 2019 and social media is changing at a fast rate every day just because of its dynamic nature. Many of the marketers saw the rise in popularity of Tik Tok so much so that it became the No. 1 most downloaded social media app and it has the potential to be an absolute game-changer for social media marketers in the upcoming years.\n\n<strong>5) Shopping Through Social Media:</strong> Yes, you heard right, you can shop a lot whatever you want through social media channels as well you can call this social commerce. Thus brands and marketers will influence and incorporate these into their marketing/sales strategies to make the most out of traffic.\n\n<strong>Conclusion:</strong>  The year 2020 will be tied in with instilling some new patterns that will change the elements of social media. Simultaneously, some different trends, for example, live videos and Instagram stories will keep on being top online social media practices in 2020.\n\nThe ability to connect with consumers, listen to their pain points, identify gaps in the market, and drive sales makes social media an essential pillar of your marketing strategy.\n\nSocial media is always evolving and changing with consumer behavior and technological advancements.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/007-1.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-03-13 07:06:07','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(458,'CORONAVIRUS – Precaution Steps for Employees','coronavirus-tech2globe-is-taking-some-steps-to-protect-its-employees','','<h2><img class=\" wp-image-934 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Tech2Globe-Prevention-Steps-for-Employees-from-Coronavirus.png\" alt=\"Tech2Globe - Prevention Steps for Employees from Coronavirus\" width=\"1073\" height=\"606\" /></h2>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Safety and Readiness Tips to Maintain a Safe Workplace</span></h2>\r\nThe novel <strong><em>coronavirus</em></strong> (COVID-19) outbreak, first identified in Wuhan, China, has spread beyond China’s borders to dozens of countries, infecting tens of thousands of people and causing a mounting number of fatalities. The coronavirus crisis presents complex legal issues for companies, including insurance, disclosure, and other considerations.\r\n\r\nAs the coronavirus continues to spread from country to country, and now state to state, many independent business owners are starting to feel its effects, both indirectly and directly. All over the world affect from this disease and only in China reported 3,158 deaths and India reported 50 coronavirus cases.\r\n\r\nHere, you can check the live status <a href=\"https://infographics.channelnewsasia.com/covid-19/map.html\">Coronavirus Live Cases &amp; Deaths</a>\r\n\r\n<em><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> also takes initiative and taking some steps to protect its employees from getting infectious, so we have been closely monitoring, researching, educating and preparing our employees for what could be done to protect by following some steps (below):</em>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Say No To Handshakes</strong></h3>\r\nThe handshake is the official business greeting in the corporate world but now it has become the awkward. As the COVID-19 transfer from the physical contact as there are a bunch of alternatives have tried, you may have seen in the videos like foot shakes in China and elbow bumps in Silicon Valley.\r\n\r\nApart from that, Indians have their own traditional and sweet gesture for welcoming someone is “<strong><em>NAMASTE</em></strong>” and it conveys the same welcoming message of a handshake.\r\n\r\nBy following the same, Tech2Globe explained their staff to say <strong><em>#NoHandshakes</em></strong> and start adopting Namaste habit for welcoming our clients and associates.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-938 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Tech2Globe.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe - #NoHandshakes\" width=\"768\" height=\"511\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Distributed Masks &amp; Hand Sanitizers</strong></h3>\r\nAs our (Tech2Globe) most of the employees used public transports to mark their presence in the office. There is having unnecessary contact with many people in the metros or buses even if they do not want, due to which the risk of bacterial transfer increases.\r\n\r\nTo prevent this to some extent we have distributed a complete hygiene kit including <strong><em>Face Masks</em></strong> and <strong><em>Hand Sanitizers</em></strong> to all our employees.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-940 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Tech2Globe-Face-Masks-and-Hand-Sanitizer.jpg\" alt=\"Face Masks and Hand Sanitizer\" width=\"783\" height=\"587\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Monitoring Body Temperature</strong></h3>\r\nChecking the body temperature of every employee is the necessary activity that we have follow on a regular basis. If any employee has reached the undesirable body temperature or having fever than we will immediately be called up for a medical emergency and ensure to provide the proper treatment, and advice to take rest until he/she will not feel better.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Work from Home</strong></h3>\r\nRecently, we have come up with the “<strong><em>work from home</em></strong>” benefit for our employees especially for those who used public transport or travel from a long distance.  We have given the advice to stay at home even if you are not feeling better and take complete precautions.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Avoid Using Biometric</strong></h3>\r\nIt is the corporate culture of using <strong>biometric</strong> highlights of employees’ attendance but as per the critical situation, we have stopped using biometric as it possible to transfer harmful bacteria.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Awareness Program</strong></h3>\r\nIn addition, Tech2Globe organized an “<strong><em>awareness program</em></strong>” with physicians or concern doctors for basic protective measures against COVID-19 by following some hygiene and protection steps.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Tech2Globe-Prevention-Steps-for-Employees-from-Coronavirus.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-03-10 15:22:27','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(459,'TECH2GLOBE WEB SOLUTIONS LLP IS A TOP E-COMMERCE DEVELOPER ACCORDING TO CLUTCH!','tech2globe-web-solutions-llp-is-a-top-e-commerce-developer-according-to-clutch','','At Tech2Globe Web Solutions LLP, we get it: taking on an outsourced developer sounds like a risky proposition. Trusting anyone with building a digital solution that provides a key source of income for your business — such as an <a href=\"http://customerthink.com/outsourcing-work-benefits-e-commerce-business/\">e-commerce storefront</a> — inherently holds some risk.\r\n\r\nThat’s why our team makes it as easy as possible for our customers — who come from all around the world to work we us. Not only do our English-speaking developers and designers have a diverse skill set for what projects you throw at us, but we also offer transparent project estimates, upfront business analyses, and Agile-oriented processes.\r\n\r\nYou can even hear about our own customers’ experience on Clutch, a database of case study-like reviews of <a href=\"https://clutch.co/in/developers/ecommerce/delhi\">the best agencies and developers</a> in the B2B market.\r\n\r\nClutch ranks each agency through special criteria. It gives weight to honest testimonials from verified customers, meaning that clients effectively give their approval or disapproval of the vendors they work with.\r\n\r\nAccording to Clutch’s methodology — and our own customers’ words — we’re one of the best e-commerce developers in India!\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-928 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMAGE-02.png\" alt=\"tech2globe web solutions LLP, Web Portal &amp; Software Development Company, tech2globe , clutch2020, ecomerce developers\" width=\"1238\" height=\"501\" />\r\n\r\nWe are very glad to have been chosen as one of Clutch’s leaders. In a field with hundreds of firms, that’s no small feat. We’re proud to have earned this award for completing so many top-notch projects with international clients, which includes enterprises, agencies, and startups!\r\n\r\nWithout our clients, we wouldn’t be here today. Without their feedback on Clutch, we wouldn’t be able to get better at what we do. That’s why this award means so much to our team.\r\n\r\nReady to start your next digital project? <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/contact-us\">Consider</a> our award-winning team!','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/CLUTCH-IMAGE-2020.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-03-06 08:52:32','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(460,'DIGITAL MARKETING TRENDS IN 2020','digital-marketing-trends-in-2020','','In just a few decades, Digital Marketing became a more integral part of the business. The influence of the digital landscape with ever-changing trends and new technologies.\r\n\r\nIf you are using the same marketing strategy as you used in previous years then you should change this strategy. In this New Year, new marketing trends come and it’s very necessary to follow these trends to appeal to consumers and keep up with the competition.\r\n\r\nAccording to the study of Smart Insights 4 to 10 businesses don\'t have a defined digital marketing strategy. On the basis of reports provided by CNBC, many billion dollars of Digital Marketing are being wasted as online adverts miss their intended targets.\r\n\r\nA perfect <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing\">Digital Marketing Strategy</a> will show what marketing channels to invest in based on industry trends:-\r\n\r\n<strong>1) Streaming Video Ad Engagement</strong>: It’s essential to create a video ad strategy. Businesses should focus on creating a video ad strategy because it gives a chance to know and identify the audience and present your brand image.\r\n\r\nYou should initially warm up your audience so that they get to know about you and your brand and if your target audience is accurate they will like you and your message so that they will trust you well enough to act upon your call to action.\r\n\r\n<strong>2) Bilateral Content</strong>: As compared to traditional content it would be smart to focus on <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing\">interactive content</a>. There are many examples of interactive content like;\r\n\r\nShoppable Posts: It means customers directly jump at your online store through your social media pages like Facebook Instagram and many more so businesses can tag their products from an e-commerce platform such as Shopify.\r\n\r\n<strong>Polls and Quizzes:</strong>  If you can create a poll and quiz contest then your audience will love this and it’s a funny way to speaks to them and also the best way to bolster your email list for future campaigns. You should create the unique engaging content that will help your audience to remember your brand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Artificial Intelligence:</strong> AI is the way to improve the data in a unique way which you can collect by modern marketing methods. AI also helps to enhance the personalization of your marketing and advertising efforts.\r\n\r\n<strong>Voice Search:</strong> Twenty percent of voice searches conducted on Google. You should use long-tail keywords that are worded more like phrases and people are more likely to speak rather than type. With the popularity of smart devices such as Alexa this trend will only continue growing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Social Media Stories:</strong> You should focus on Facebook stories as compared to normal posting because it is a carousel of uploads that last 24 hours. You can include text, images, video and even URLs depending on the social media platform and how many followers you have. Facebook stories can better help brands get in front of younger audiences.\r\n\r\n<strong>Smart Bidding:</strong> Google implemented an update called smart bidding which optimizes your bids using machine learning. You can set your bids automatically especially during sales.\r\n\r\n<strong>3) Social Media Influencer Marketing:</strong> By using this marketing, you can build the best and more relationships with the people. Influencer audiences could be little or enormous and an influencer can arrive at shoppers through their <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">social media networks</a> and blogs that your brand will most likely be unable to. There are some elements of influencer marketing like Identity, Vet, Relate, Measure and Repeat.\r\n\r\nTo keep your brand up you should always engage with your audience that must be your main goal in 2020. These tips will help you to where you need to be moving forward.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/01.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-02-18 07:20:27','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(461,'India IT Show – Meet Us at IndiaSoft 2020','india-it-show-meet-us-at-indiasoft-2020','','<h3><img class=\" wp-image-906 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Featured-Image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"959\" height=\"365\" /></h3>\r\n<h3></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\">IndiaSoft 2020 Global Networking IT Event for the growth of your enterprise</span></h3>\r\nThe 2 days of flagship IT event, <em>IndiaSoft 2020</em> will be held in Hyderabad on March 03 to 04, 2020 by Electronics and Computer Software Expert Promotion Council (ESC), with the support of Ministry of Commerce and Industry, Government of India will set the stage to meet the global aspirants and to promote the Indian Software Industry, and their capabilities automation, Internet of Things (IoT) and robotics are such focus sectors.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.indiasoft.org/\">IndiaSoft</a> is a truly B2B event which brings value for exhibitors and delegates with its unique business-like character. The main focus to build Networking with the Global Buyers and encouraging their fruitful conglomeration with Indian IT Companies.\r\n\r\n<strong>Explore the Business Growth with Tech2Globe</strong>\r\n\r\nOver 200 Indian IT firms will be participating in the event who will ready to meet the global buyers’ demand in verticals including <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/software-development\">Web &amp; Mobile App Development</a>, Artificial Intelligent, Information &amp; Cyber Security, Animation, IoT, etc.  At this 20th edition of IndiaSoft, <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> is also be the part of this journey as an Exhibitor, to contribute and showcase our expertise on various sectors:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Complete <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services\">Data Management Solutions</a>, from Data Mining to Data Processing, from Data Product Entry to Data Conversion and much more.</li>\r\n 	<li>BPO/KPO Services to <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/HR-solutions\">HRO Solutions</a> to <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/photo-editing-services\">Photo Editing Services</a> for Real Estate &amp; Fashion Industries.</li>\r\n 	<li>Offer major CMS solutions like; Shopify, Magento, nopCommerce, etc. to build an online store and start selling online.</li>\r\n 	<li>Software &amp; Mobile App Development Solutions by our professionals who have rich experience in the field of development.</li>\r\n 	<li>Showcase our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing\">Digital Marketing</a> skills that helps businesses to gain maximum exposure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Connect Us at IndiaSoft 2020</strong>\r\n\r\nAs an IT Outsourcing Organization, we are very pleased to announce that we are going to be part of INDIASOFT 2020 and present our best work to promote &amp; offers the best IT related solutions. This is going to be an amazing opportunity to meet and build networks with global investors, exhibitors, buyers, tech innovators, and decision-makers.\r\n\r\nIt would be a great pleasure to meet you at the event. We expect to establish a long-term win-win relationship with you.\r\n\r\n<u>Visit Our Booth:</u> IS 73\r\n\r\n<u>Drop Us an Email to Connect:</u>\r\n\r\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a>\r\nCall: +91-99998-75038\r\nSkype: info.tech2globe\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Featured-Image.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-02-15 08:41:28','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(462,'How to Complete Registration Process on Amazon\'s North America Marketplaces','how-to-complete-registration-process-on-amazons-north-america-marketplaces','','<strong>Choose a Selling Plan</strong>\r\n\r\nBe sure to read the “Before Your Register” section. It provides info about the two types of Amazon Seller accounts, Professional and Individual.\r\n\r\nDon’t know which account type to use? The answer is simple - if you’re going to sell more than 40 items a month, use a Professional account; otherwise, select an Individual account.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong><u>Profession Account Vs Individual Account</u></strong>\r\n<table style=\"height: 1009px;\" width=\"879\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\"><strong>Feature</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"184\"><strong>Amazon Pro Seller</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"175\"><strong>Amazon Individual Seller</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Monthly Fee</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">$39.99</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">$0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Product listing fee - charged when sold</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">None</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">0.99/sale</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Number of product listings/sales</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">Unlimited</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">40/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Amazon product-related fees</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">Same</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">Same</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Access to Fulfilment by Amazon</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✓</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Access to Amazon Seller App</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✓</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Sell existing Amazon products</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✓</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Add new products to Amazon</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Listings eligible for the Buy Box</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Offer coupons, shipping specials, and gift wrap</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Can apply to sell in restricted categories</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Bulk upload products or feeds to Amazon</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Access to inventory reports</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"321\">Connect with 3rd-party services &amp; product feeds</td>\r\n<td width=\"184\">✓</td>\r\n<td width=\"175\">✗</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Documents Required in case of Individual or a Proprietor</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Passport of the proprietor</li>\r\n 	<li>GST registration number-Received</li>\r\n 	<li>PAN Card copy-Received</li>\r\n 	<li>Voter’s ID/ Driving License-Received</li>\r\n 	<li>A declaration by the proprietor declaring that the business account is operated by himself</li>\r\n 	<li>License or lease agreement</li>\r\n 	<li>Bank Account Statement</li>\r\n 	<li>Telephone bill/ Electricity bill pertaining to the proprietor</li>\r\n 	<li>Credit Card details (Card Number, Valid Through, Year, and Cardholders Name)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Documents Required in case of LLP or a Partnership</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Partnership or LLP Registration Certificate</li>\r\n 	<li>Partnership Deed-Received</li>\r\n 	<li>Power of Attorney granted to a partner or an employee of the firm to transact the business</li>\r\n 	<li>PAN Card of the partnership or the LLP-Received</li>\r\n 	<li>Document validating the address of the partners and the person holding the power of attorney</li>\r\n 	<li>Lease or Rental Agreement</li>\r\n 	<li>License Agreement</li>\r\n 	<li>Firm’s or partner’s Electricity Bill / Telephone Bill</li>\r\n 	<li>GST Registration Number</li>\r\n 	<li>Credit Card details (Card Number, Valid Through, Year, Cardholders Name)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Documents Required in case of Private Limited Company</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong> </strong>Copy of Certificate of Incorporation</li>\r\n 	<li>Copy of Memorandum of Association</li>\r\n 	<li>Company’s PAN Card</li>\r\n 	<li>Company’s Telephone Bill / Electricity Bill</li>\r\n 	<li>Lease or Rental Agreement</li>\r\n 	<li>GST registration number</li>\r\n 	<li>Credit Card details (Card Number, Valid Through, Year, Cardholders Name)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>For Identity Information required any of the following Document</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Passport</li>\r\n 	<li>Driver Licence</li>\r\n 	<li>Pan Card</li>\r\n 	<li>Aadhar Card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong> </strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>For Additional Proof document Bank account or credit card statements:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Must match the name of the business or point of contact provided during registration (KRISHIV EXIM)</li>\r\n 	<li>Must contain the business address and show customer transactions</li>\r\n 	<li>Must be dated within the past three calendar months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong> </strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Document Uploading Instructions:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The name of the company or point of contact mentioned on the statement should either match the business name or point of contact name provided during registration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Hide the account number and monetary amounts, but the rest of the document must be visible.</li>\r\n 	<li>Scan the original document in color or take a picture using your mobile device. Do not submit a screenshot.</li>\r\n 	<li>The document should be easily readable and must have been issued within the past 180 days.</li>\r\n 	<li>Your document must be in one of the following languages: Chinese, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese, or Spanish. If it is not in one of these languages, provide a notarized translation of your document into one of these supported languages.</li>\r\n 	<li>The document should be less than 10MB in size.</li>\r\n 	<li>Accepted formats are *.png, *.tiff, *.tif, *.jpg, *.jpeg, and *.pdf.</li>\r\n</ul>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Tech2Globe-How-to-Complete-Registration-Process-on-Amazons-North-America-Marketplaces.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-02-12 09:10:02','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(463,'Tech2Globe Recognized As Top Software Development Company In New York 2020','tech2globe-recognized-as-top-software-development-company-in-new-york-2020','','With the aim to reduce the business cost and increase work efficiency that motivate us to create robust and diverse software solutions for any business around the globe. Tech2Globe is always pushing their limits to meet the most challenging technology concepts and that helps several businesses by built some of the analytics and reporting software, whether it’s <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/human-resource-management-system.php\">Human Resource Management System</a> (HRMS), Salary Calculator, <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/lead-management-tool.php\">Lead Management Tool</a> (LMT) and more.\r\n\r\nAnd, with our innovative mindset today Tech2Globe stand in the front of the row and recognized as Top <a href=\"https://www.softwaredevelopmentcompany.co/software-development-companies-new-york/\">Software Development Company</a> in the New York 2020.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Overview of the Company</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> incorporated in 2014 based in New Delhi, India to not only provides Software &amp; IT solutions but also hands on experience in Data Management, E-Commerce, Digital Marketing and Photo Editing. In order to make every venture we undertake a success, we have a team of experienced and skilled experts. We have key certifications in technologies like .NET, PHP and SharePoint. With our passion and flare to innovate and create, we provide the best winning solutions to our clients. Amidst the same process, we continue to be cost efficient understanding what exactly your business requires to grow.\r\n\r\nIn your journey to success, we not only give you technical support through our work and management, but also stand by you in that path because Tech2Globe believes that every step and effort we make will make your business flourish and grow to new heights.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Enhance the Work Quality with a Superior Software</strong>\r\n\r\nAs a growing IT &amp; <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Software Development Agency</a>, our strength is to offering custom software solutions, the developers and engineers at Tech2Globe suited with the unique software package that can boost the company’s performance as well as reduce the business cost. In addition, the team is well-proficient on various programming languages and platforms including a front end and back end to provide all the structural needs.','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Top-Software-Development-Company-2020.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-01-31 06:04:44','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(464,'Amazon Smbhav – Amazon announced to invest $1 billion to digitize SMB across India','amazon-smbhav-amazon-announced-to-invest-1-billion-to-digitize-smb-across-india','','India welcomed Amazon Inc chief Jeff Bezos, especially came to be part of the mega summit for small and medium businesses; Amazon Smbhav. This whole event is specially designed for small and medium businesses to discover how you can open your business to infinite possibilities by embracing the latest business and tech innovations along with share learnings, understand new growth opportunities that industry offers.\r\n\r\nThis seems an opportunity to grow especially for small &amp; medium enterprises that are ready to expand their businesses around the globe. And, as <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> is a Certified Amazon SPN to take a step forward and our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\">Amazon Seller Central Consultants</a> help businesses and share our insights on how to use the Amazon platform to grow and build a business. By follow Amazon Smbhav model, our Amazon Consultants guide sellers and covers wide range of topics from Amazon Product Entry, Amazon Enhanced Brand Content (EBC), Amazon Dropshipping to Amazon Sales Boosting, Buy-Box Winning to <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\">Sell on Amazon Globally</a>.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\"><img class=\" wp-image-884 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Day-02-Amazon-Smbhav..jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe Amazon Consultants at the Amazon Smbhav 2020\" width=\"554\" height=\"415\" /></a>\r\n\r\n“Small businesses are the backbone of the Indian economy, contributing to the growth, and embodying the entrepreneurial spirit of Indians. It is imperative that all key stakeholders come together to support the growth and scale of these businesses. Amazon India is committed to helping these businesses achieve access to a larger audience, thus empowering them to grow and succeed at a fast pace. Amazon Smbhav will serve as a platform for them to gain the knowledge and achieve that scale - directly from successful industry leaders,” says Gopal Pillai, VP, Seller Services, Amazon India on the event.\r\n\r\nJeff Bezos said at the Amazon SMBhav conference that the company wants to scale up the local manufacturing in India to promote the “Make in India” initiative by Indian Government which will help the company increase its export to $10 billion by 2025.\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-885 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Amazon-Smbhav.jpg\" alt=\"Amazon Smbhav - Jeff Bezos\" width=\"575\" height=\"431\" />\r\n\r\nAnd, that’s why Bezos announced to invest $1 billion (approx. Rs. 7,092 crores) to digitally enable micro, small and medium enterprises (MSMEs) and traders across India including manufacturers, resellers, local offline shops, and brand, previously the company invested around $5.5 billion in India. Also, the company has collected over 500,000 sellers and thousands of merchants in the country that are currently selling on 12 Amazon marketplaces around the world.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.in/b/?node=20391471031\"><img class=\" wp-image-886 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Amazon-Smbhav-1.jpg\" alt=\"Amazon Smbhav 2020\" width=\"580\" height=\"387\" /></a>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><u>Main Highlights of the Event</u></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Inspirational journeys of high achievers from the SMB ecosystem in India.</li>\r\n 	<li>Learn from Amazon leaders about the opportunities that open up with the adoption of technology.</li>\r\n 	<li>Discussion between policymakers, industry SMEs &amp; Amazon leadership on key topics/debates related to Indian SMBs.</li>\r\n 	<li>In-depth master-classes/educational sessions provided by subject matter experts on areas that help SMBs grow/scale.</li>\r\n 	<li>Engage with exhibitors to discover products and solutions to drive ease of business for SMBs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhile, few kilometers away from the conference protests are being held by the Confederation of All India Traders (CAIT), a trade group that represents more than 60 million merchants in the country, said it has organized protests in 300 cities in India.\r\n\r\nFor more information on how to use Amazon to grow and build around the globe, contact us at;\r\n\r\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> | Visit: <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">www.tech2globe.com</a>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Tech2Globe-Amazon-Smbhav.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2020-01-15 12:20:08','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(465,'Tech2Globe Web Solutions Named Global Leader by Clutch for Business Services','tech2globe-web-solutions-named-global-leader-by-clutch-for-business-services','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-844\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/0011.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe Web Solutions Named Global Leader by Clutch for Business Services\" width=\"1753\" height=\"1342\" />\r\n\r\nSince our start in 2014, our team has been committed to providing our clients with premier business services that lead companies into success and prosperity.  Our dedication this year with <u><a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/allbusiness/2019/04/10/customer-service-expectations/\">HR consulting and business services</a></u> has earned us the title of Global Leader for our efforts this year and we couldn’t be more thrilled.\r\n\r\nClutch is the B2B ratings and reviews platform that <u><a href=\"https://clutch.co/in/developers/ecommerce/delhi\">connects businesses</a></u> that best meet their needs for projects. They recently published their list of the top B2B companies from varying industries that excel in providing the results and commitment to their clients.\r\n\r\n<strong>“We are very excited that we are officially be featured as a Clutch Global Leader under the IT &amp; Business Services category. We are extremely grateful for everyone who has had a hand in our success.” – CEO, Tech2Globe Web Solutions</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-845\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/022.png\" alt=\"tech2globe web solutions LLP, Web Portal &amp; Software Development Company, tech2globe \" width=\"1704\" height=\"1140\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTech2Globe is proud to officially be a part of the Clutch community and all the services they offer to help companies find their perfect match for their projects. Sister-sites, The Manifest and Visual Objects, find clients that are <u><a href=\"https://themanifest.com/in/ecommerce-development/companies#tech2globewebsolutionsllp\">considered a leading</a></u> company in their industry and showcase <u><a href=\"https://visualobjects.com/in/ecommerce-development/top-ecommerce-developers\">portfolio-based work</a></u> to show what we can offer them.\r\n\r\nWe’re proud of this accomplishment and what it means for the Tech2Globe team moving forward in the future. Without our client’s support and feedback, we wouldn’t be named a global leader in the business services segment. This recognition will help us meet more prospective buyers to help them be successful.\r\n\r\nIf you’re ready to be successful in your industry with your next project, <u><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/contact-us\">connect</a></u> with the Tech2Globe team to get started today!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/0011.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-12-05 10:29:07','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(466,'Google’s BERT Update – Should you have to ignore the update?','googles-bert-update-should-you-have-to-ignore-the-update','','<span style=\"color: #000000;\">At the last week of October month, Google introduced a massive changed in its algorithm after last 5 years and rolled out <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://blog.google/products/search/search-language-understanding-bert\">BERT update</a> </span>with the motive to improve the search queries and ranking system. The intent to introduce of this new algorithm, will help search system to better understand the context of user’s search queries and provide the relevant results as per the searches.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">But there’s a bit of confusion among the <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/seo-services.php\">SEO professionals</a> </span>about the real impact of BERT and how it affects the searches.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">So, by this blog we’ll uncover the layer and provide you the right answer; should you have to ignore the BERT update or not? Before get dive into this let’s first understand what exactly is BERT?</span>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>What is BERT?</strong></span></h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">BERT stands for Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, is an open-source pre-trained Natural Language Processing (NLP) system designed from Google to understand the real nuances of search queries. Simply, it’s a technique that help Google to figure out the real intent and context behind the search queries. BERT model tries to understand the context of a word based on all of the other surrounding words, making the search results of conversational queries more accurate.</span>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How BERT Works?</strong></span></h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Google wrote in its blog post BERT particularly for longer, more conventional queries and search will be able to understand the context of the words in your query. But many SEOs and many of the tracking tools didn’t notice massive changes in the Google search results while this algorithm rolled out in Search after launched of first week.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Even Google’s Public Search Liaison; Danny Sullivan highlights that <em>“there’s nothing new with this update”</em>, you just have to focus on to drive the user-centric content.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Here’s the Danny Sullivan tweet;</span>\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-890 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/T2G-Google-BERT-300x136.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe - Google BERT\" width=\"719\" height=\"326\" />\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">The real motive of this update to make improvement in Google search system to crack the intent of search queries. Also, Google gave some examples of:</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">In one of the examples, the search query <em>“math practice books for adults”</em> – previously Google show the search results for <em>“Math Practice for Grade 6 -8”</em>. But after applied the BERT, the results has some changes in to <em>“Math for Grownups”</em> at the top of the SERP.</span>\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-891 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Google-BERT-300x162.png\" alt=\"Tech2Globe - Google BERT\" width=\"702\" height=\"379\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Clearly shown in the search result the book for Grade 6 – 8 still rank on the SERPs and the second book especially aimed for adult that is also rank. Here, after applied the BERT the query became more personalized and measure the each nuances that includes in the searches.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">You’ll be better understanding by this example that Google explained, in the phrases “nine to five” and “a quarter to five,” the word “to” has two different meanings, which may be obvious to humans but less so to search engines. So, here works BERT that especially designed to distinguish between such nuances to facilitate more relevant results.</span>\r\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Should have to care of that!</strong></span></h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">Umm! Not exactly.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">As Google explained that BERT models to do a much better job helping you find useful information and will help Search better for people across the world. A powerful characteristic of these systems is that they can take learnings from one language and apply them to others. So we can take models that learn from improvements in English (a language where the vast majority of web content exists) and apply them to other languages. This helps us better return relevant results in the many languages that Search is offered in.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">So the conclusion, the primary focus of an <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing.php\">SEO professional</a> </span>should be to generate user-centric content rather than trying to manipulate searches. As Google says, “user is the first priority” &amp; whenever the content drives the user interest the more rankings you achieved.</span>','https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Google-BERT.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-11-15 12:41:06','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(467,'Short Tour of Tech2Globe at 88th Izmir International Fair 2019','short-tour-of-tech2globe-at-88th-izmir-international-fair-2019','','The 5 days of full-packed <strong><em>“88<sup>th</sup> Izmir International Fair” </em></strong>in the land of Turkey to promoted trade between both the countries, organized by <em>Department of Commerce, Government of India</em>. That was an epic platform where businesses started to build networks with international delegates, promoted trade and generate leads.\r\n\r\nThe event was inaugurated by the Indian Deputy Chief of Mission, Smt. Vanaja K Thekkat and welcoming to global businesses to be participated in this <a href=\"https://www.tpci.in/\">TPCI Event</a> to built relations and encourage to do business. The event was not only to promoted trade but also a platform for Buyers &amp; Sellers where both can met and established a long business relations that benefits and facilitate business.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> was also the part of the “Izmir International Fair” and presented our skills and projects in the event. The COO of Tech2Globe Mr. <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/harpreet-singh-sethi/\">Harpreet Singh Sethi</a> represented Tech2Globe and showcased our solutions and how we work to generate better results.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-807 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/1.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe -Izmir International Fair 2019\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" />\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Results that we generated @ TPCI 2019</strong></span></h2>\r\nThe TPCI tour generated very effective results for us. Started with so many visitors to build healthy connections, met marvelous crowd and at the event, we invited for multiple meet-ups that would organized in the different locations in Turkey.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-808 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/2.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe attended Meet-ups at Turkey\" width=\"1416\" height=\"1062\" />\r\n\r\nMr. Harpreet Singh Sethi (COO) with the team attended different meet-ups and sessions to present our solutions and services and to grab more future opportunities. In this whole journey, our representatives showcased our varied range of work or services in front of the International Visitors and Clients.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-809 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/3.jpg\" alt=\"Mr. Harpreet Singh Sethi presented Tech2Globe\" width=\"1600\" height=\"816\" />\r\n<h3>Our main points to present our solutions on:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ecommerce-marketplace-management.php\">eCommerce Marketplace Solutions</a> that help businesses to achieve growth on multiple eCommerce platform such as Amazon, Flipkart, eBay and much more.</li>\r\n 	<li>Offer Data Management Services that fulfill all data related needs from Data Processing to Data Mining, from Data Product Entry to Data Conversion, from Excel Automation, MIS Reporting and Web Research to Data Transformation Services.</li>\r\n 	<li>Along with, <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/software-development.php\">Software Development Services</a> is one of our core focused solutions to provide effective and affordable Software along with <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/mobile-app-development.php\">Mobile App Development Services</a> to fulfill multiple sector need or requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing.php\">Digital Marketing Solutions</a> from Search Engine Optimization (SEO) to Search Engine Marketing (SEM) to generate traffic &amp; build brand awareness by organically and paid advertisement. Along with, offer Social Media Optimization &amp; Marketing Solutions to optimize all Social Media handles and run paid ads campaigns to target targeted users.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-810 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/4.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe\'s COO represented Solutions to International Delegates\" width=\"1416\" height=\"1062\" />\r\n\r\nThis tour came with lots of opportunities to build networks, maintain relations with international delegates and find more business opportunities. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a> thanks to the management or team of TPCI, other businesses and to the crowd for made TPCI a successful event and opening a new door to do business.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/TPCI-1.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-09-23 08:16:44','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(468,'GITEX Technology Week – Catch up at the GITEX 2019','gitex-technology-week-catch-up-at-the-gitex-2019','','<img class=\"wp-image-795 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/GITEX-2019-Tech2Globe-BPO-KPO-Data-Management-Digital-Marketing-Software-Development.jpg\" alt=\"Tech2Globe | GITEX 2019 | GITEX Future Stars\" width=\"373\" height=\"373\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The biggest tech show in the Middle East, North Africa &amp; South Asia</span></h3>\r\nYes! <a href=\"https://www.gitex.com/\">GITEX 2019</a>, is one of the biggest tech show in the Middle East, North Africa &amp; South Asia that synergizing the mind and technology economy. The all new way is set to go at October 06 to October 10 at Dubai World Trade Center to experience the future technology. This 39<sup>th</sup> edition of GITEX will be showcasing the new future trends, presenting high caliber speakers and revealing latest product innovations and <a href=\"https://www.gitex.com/conference_gitex/5g-countdown\">discussing on 5G</a>, Future Mobility, Artificial Intelligence, Smart Cities and so on.\r\n\r\nThe week-long exhibition is the massive opportunities to meet and mingle with global business leaders, renowned innovators, high profile investors, key decision makers and to build networks with them. Alongside, it also brings the <a href=\"https://www.gitex.com/conference_gitex/growth-game\">Growth Game</a> segment, provides an awesome opportunity to more than 750+ innovative tech startups from 75 countries to showcasing their skills and products in front of the 400+ Global Investors &amp; Accelerators.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000000;\">Discover New Business Growth with Tech2Globe</span></h2>\r\nEvery year, global business leaders, investors, tech innovators, influential journalists and media organizations participated in the GITEX to covers all the aspects and access to a fast-growing market. This time, at 39<sup>th</sup> edition of GITEX, Tech2Globe is also be the part of this journey to visit and will be covering conference tracks on 5G Countdown, Growth Game, Money Talk &amp; so on.\r\n\r\nWe’re all set to go to be participate in GITEX to meet-up with businesses, 7 attend schedule meetings and showcasing our work and products. Our main element to focus on and present the solutions of:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Complete <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/data-management-services.php\">Data Management Solutions</a>, from Data Mining to Data Processing, from Data Product Entry to Data Conversion and much more.</li>\r\n 	<li>BPO/KPO Services to HRO Solutions to Photo Editing Services for Real Estate &amp; Fashion Industries.</li>\r\n 	<li>Offer major CMS solutions like; Shopify, Magento, nopCommerce, etc. to build an online store and start selling online.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/software-development.php\">Software &amp; Mobile App Development Solutions</a> by our professionals who have rich experience in the field of development.</li>\r\n 	<li>Showcase our Digital Marketing skills that helps businesses to gain maximum exposure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000000;\">The Countdown Begins! Let\'s Meet at GITEX</span></h2>\r\nAs an <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/\">IT Outsourcing Organization</a>, we are very pleased to announce that we are going to be part of GITEX 2019 and present our best work to promote &amp; offers the best IT related solutions. This is going to be an amazing opportunity to meet and build networks with global investors, exhibitors, buyers, tech innovators, and decision-makers.\r\n\r\nIt would be a great pleasure to meet you at the exhibition. We expect to establish a long-term win-win relationship with you.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<u>Drop an Email to meet with Tech2Globe:\r\n</u>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a><u>\r\n</u>Call @ +91-9999875038','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/GITEX-2019-Tech2Globe-BPO-KPO-Data-Management-Digital-Marketing-Software-Development.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-09-21 10:13:28','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(469,'The way to Turkey @ 88th Izmir International Fair','the-way-to-turkey-trade-promotion-council-of-india-tpci','','&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-787\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/turkey.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"790\" height=\"454\" />\r\n\r\nTPCI 2019 – Trade show-cum Buyer-Seller Meet. Trade Promotion Council of India (TPCI) is organizing the <em><strong>“Izmir International Fair”</strong></em> in Turkey from September 06 to September 10. Several successful editions of TPCI across the globe have recognized the platform where encourage the trade between both the countries as well as the place where Buyer-Seller Meet (BSM). The main focus of this event is to promote trade with a focus on the cost-effective promotion of Indian exporters in Turkey and to facilitate direct access to potential buyers and influential decision-makers.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>Tech2Globe contribution in 88th Izmir International Fair</u></strong>\r\n\r\nAs India’s exports to Turkey reached US$ 5.1 billion in 2017-18, growing by 10% YoY as it is one of the major platforms to promote trade between the countries and guess what? Tech2globe is also the part of TPCI - Izmir International Fair to showcase our work, skills, and knowledge.\r\n\r\n<u>Our main element to focus and presents solutions of:</u>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Complete Data Management Services, from Data Mining to Data Processing, from Data Product Entry to Data Conversion and much more.</li>\r\n 	<li>Offer major CMS services like; Shopify, Magento, nopCommerce, etc. to build an online store and start selling online.</li>\r\n 	<li>Restaurant <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/restaurant-menu-entry-services\">Menu Entry Services </a>helps to reduce the workloads of all Menu Entry in multiple languages under an affordable cost with 100% effectiveness.</li>\r\n 	<li>Accounting Data Entry Services deals with daily finance &amp; accounts statements with no errors by our skilled and experienced teams of Accounting Data Operators.</li>\r\n 	<li>Provides complete solutions of Ecommerce by our skilled and experienced <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\">eCommerce </a>experts from front to end e-commerce solutions or services.</li>\r\n 	<li>Offer <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/translation-services.php\">Translation Services</a> in multiple languages like German, French, Spanish and more for complete your all translation works such as Data Entry, Content Writing, Customer Services, replying to an email, managing cases &amp; claims and many more.</li>\r\n 	<li>BPO/KPO Services to HRO Solutions to Photo Editing Services for Real Estate &amp; Fashion Industries.</li>\r\n 	<li>Software Development Services by our professionals who have rich experience in the field of development.\r\nAnd, Oracle Solutions and Digital Marketing Services.<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-789\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Turkey-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"626\" height=\"518\" /></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAs an <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/\">IT Outsourcing Organization</a>, we are very pleased to announce that we are going to be part of 88th Izmir International Fair in Turkey and present our best work to promote trading and offers the best IT related services. This is going to be an amazing opportunity to meet and build networks with global investors, exhibitors, buyers, tech innovators, and decision-makers.\r\n\r\nIt would be a great pleasure to meet you at the exhibition. We expect to establish a long-term win-win relationship with you.\r\n\r\nLet’s meet at the Event @ Hall 1A, Stand 32.\r\n<u>Location:</u> Kulturpark, Izmir, Turkey\r\n<u>Date:</u> From 6<sup>th</sup>-10<sup>th</sup> September 2019','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/turkey.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-09-02 12:28:17','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(470,'How Tech2globe Helped A Client Boost Sales And Promote Online Business?','how-tech2globe-helped-a-client-boost-sales-and-promote-online-business','','<img class=\" wp-image-777 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/r1-300x169.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"479\" height=\"269\" />\r\n\r\nOur client was a US Based startup that had just stepped in the market place. The client approached us to help them increase their online sales by choosing the correct market place and boost online visibility.\r\n\r\nThe challenge, in this case, was the fact that the client was present on various <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">market places</a> but not on the correct ones. Another challenge was that the client wanted results in a short period of time, which meant that the time they invest in our service should have a strong likelihood of producing results in the specified timeframe. There’s not much to waste.\r\n\r\nWe started off by testing a variety of different market places best suited, analyzed the present scenario which helped us to find out the areas of improvements for the present inventory. Once the best market place was established, we started working rigorously on the same.\r\n\r\nAfter consulting our experts we suggested the client about the best-suited marketplace. Keeping every little detail in mind we introduced the client to our <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Amazon Consulting Services</a><strong>.</strong> According to the needs of the client, they wanted to boost their sales and get visibility in a short span so we suggested the given two Amazon services which is <strong>Amazon sales boost consulting</strong> and <strong>Amazon PPC Consulting</strong>.\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-778 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/r2-300x157.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"265\" />\r\n\r\nBy opting for Amazon Sales Boost Consulting, we promised to provide the following services.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Guaranteed sales increase up to 30%</li>\r\n 	<li>Competitive pricing</li>\r\n 	<li>Optimizing content and adding SEO friendly details</li>\r\n 	<li>Sponsored campaigns with less ACoS and focused on high Return Of Investment</li>\r\n 	<li>Monitoring performance and boosting sales on all channels</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nFor Amazon PPC Consulting we worked on the following services\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Setting up the Campaign</li>\r\n 	<li>Negative keyword research</li>\r\n 	<li>Creation of the Ad</li>\r\n 	<li>Help with the Bid adjustments</li>\r\n 	<li>Managing automatic and manual campaigns</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Now, let’s talk results!</p>\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-779 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/r3-300x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"309\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>An average ROI in sales by Google Ads turned to 30.00%</li>\r\n 	<li>We drove 15,000 people by a single campaign.</li>\r\n 	<li>We also doubled Facebook reach within six months and monetized new fans.</li>\r\n 	<li>We also boosted post engagement by 400%.</li>\r\n 	<li>Lowered the cost of click by 55% by continuous optimization</li>\r\n 	<li>Google Ad conversion turned out to be 60% bigger than the organic traffic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<em><strong>Client words</strong></em>\r\n\r\n<strong><em>“My experience with <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tech2Globe</a> was ABSOLUTELY AWESOME! Not too long ago, I used another IT Outsourcing company and was “not” satisfied with the results (seeing their expensive &amp; slow service), but you guys here knocked the ball completely out of the park. I am still amazed at the amount of exposure I received from your service. Needless to say, Tech2Globe has a new regular. Keep up the EXCELLENT work!”</em></strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/online.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-08-17 10:06:30','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(471,'Face-off: Google Ads vs Facebook Ads','face-off-google-ads-vs-facebook-ads','','&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-772\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/facebook-vs-adwords-ads-300x158.jpg\" alt=\"facebook-vs-adwords-ads\" width=\"465\" height=\"244\" />\r\n\r\nGoogle is known as the world’s largest search engine whereas Facebook is known as the social network with the world’s largest user base. These giants have moved mountains in the field of <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/digital-marketing.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Digital Advertising</a>. Since then the digital form of advertising has been evolved whereas traditional advertising has been adrift.\r\n\r\nThe advertising model for both Google and Facebook is different from each other. Each varies according to the designed model. It is important to understand Google or Facebook if we want to advertise in these places.\r\n\r\nSo the very first step and important step is to find out how do these platforms work and which platform is best for your business? We will discuss the differences here.\r\n\r\nBoth of these networks are great when it comes to delivering results. These both are two totally different platforms with their own benefits.\r\n\r\nThe first question which we need to ask is What is your end goal?\r\n\r\n★ Brand Awareness: If you are looking for Brand Awareness or Social Following then you should go for Facebook Ads.\r\n\r\n★ Engagement: If you are looking for Engagement then you should go for Facebook Ads.\r\n\r\n★ Sales/Leads/Consultation: Both Google Ads and Facebook Ads should be considered.\r\n\r\nHow Google Ad is different from Facebook Ads?\r\n\r\nAs we know, Google users are driven and Facebook users are browsing.\r\n\r\n★ Push &amp; Pull Marketing:\r\n\r\nGoogle Ads follows Pull Marketing strategy which means that the ads are shown to the users who are already interested in your product or service or are more likely to show interest in the same. Google ads are more accurate as the ads which are being shown to people are because they had searched or have been searching for related queries. Facebook uses a push marketing approach here which is totally the opposite of Google Ads here the users are not necessarily searching for your product or service. Facebook advertising uses online behavior and facebook profile to know more about them.\r\n\r\n★ Targetting:\r\n\r\nUser intent is another important factor. Both of these follow the Cost-per-click method also known as the CPC pricing system however the process of targetting differs. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Facebook Ads</a> are shown on the basis of individual qualities. Demographics, Interests, and behavior are taken into account while targetting on Facebook. Google Ads are being targetted on the basis of age, location, gender, language. Google Ads are dependent on the keywords that the users are supposed to search.\r\n\r\n★ Cost per click:\r\n\r\nAs we know from the above points that the user intent changes for both the ad delivery platforms. As Google is focused on the real intent whereas the facebook guesses the intent, therefore, the cost also differs accordingly. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/ppc-management-services.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Ads</a> is expensive than Facebook Ads. Adwords cost per click is higher.\r\n\r\n★ Conversion:\r\n\r\nIf we talk about conversion rate, The conversion of facebook is expected to be less than that of Google Ads. That being said Facebook is best to generate the awareness, getting people to visit your website, sign up for the service but the conversions are rare. Expectations shouldn\'t be high for conversions from facebook feeds.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-770\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/pull-marketing-tactics-300x149.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"425\" height=\"211\" />\r\n\r\nKeeping the above points into consideration we think Google Ads and Facebook Ads both work really good together. Push and pull marketing together is a successful hit. If a business wants to grow and succeed in the deadly combination of both Facebook Ads and Google Ads are the best combination one can ever think of!','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/google-ads-vs-fb-ads.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-08-17 08:50:07','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(472,'Link Building – A Penalty is waiting for you?','link-building-a-penalty-is-waiting-for-you','','Generate high-quality backlinks is one of the important aspects to perform effective SEO, it helps you to get the higher rankings on SERPs, increase your website authority and boost traffic. Simply says, Link Building is the process of linking other’s websites with your website. Many Digital Marketers or marketing agencies outlined different strategies to generate high-quality backlinks from different sources. They invest lots of bucks to execute their plan in the form of building their own Private Blog Network (PBN), which helps to increase backlinks with the help of other numerous websites.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-752 size-medium\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/pic4-300x169.png\" alt=\"Link Building Services, Link Building Packages\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" />\r\n\r\nAlong with, there is a myth that many users tend to believe that “the more you can generate backlinks, the more you can get the rankings”.\r\n\r\nAnd, that’s why Google constantly bring out new updates to protect search results from spammers. Google’s Penguin is one of the updates from Google to detect spammers who perform spamming activities to increase backlinks from junky sites. So, here plays Google Penguin Update to expose spamming sites and penalize them and remove those sites permanently from Google’s Search Engine (and other search engines like Bing, Yahoo, etc. also perform the same activity).\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-753 size-medium\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/pic1-300x218.jpg\" alt=\"Link Building Services, Link Building Packages\" width=\"300\" height=\"218\" />\r\n\r\nSo, <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/link-building.php\">increase backlinks</a> from different sources is not the key to unlock the door to achieving high ranks. The thing just needs to increase Quality Backlinks from the Quality Sources.\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>How Search Engines works on Links</strong></h2>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-754 size-medium\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/pic2-300x101.jpg\" alt=\"Link Building Services, Link Building Packages\" width=\"300\" height=\"101\" />\r\n\r\nWhen Google’s Spider bot start crawling and indexing on web pages, they’re not only to reviewing the content; they’re also noticing the links that placed on the content, whether it’s Internal Links or External Links.\r\n\r\nHigh-quality links from the quality websites are providing a way to Google to reaching out on your website and increase your chances to get the higher ranks on Search Results on a particular keyword. It creates a hierarchy to insist on Google’s bot or Search Engines to come and crawling your site and make a positive perspective about your site that you\'ve got the quality links.\r\n\r\nAs many digital marketers create PBNs in this hope to increase backlinks, they purchase expired domains which having high-domain authority. And build varied sites – properly maintain and upload content, to get the links from one and provide to another, repeat the process again and again until it creates the cycle which connects all sites with the main site.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-755 size-full\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/pic3.png\" alt=\"Link Building Services, Link Building Packages\" width=\"726\" height=\"529\" />But, there is a bitter truth as well –\r\n\r\nThis trick helps to improve SEO and increase links as well as traffic until Google catches you. Neil Patel (<a href=\"https://neilpatel.com/blog/private-blog-networks/\">https://neilpatel.com/blog/private-blog-networks/</a>), explaining this in his blog post.\r\n\r\nBecause Google hates PBNs. Google starts penalized those sites who performed overuse of generating links. To protect search results Google changes their algorithms to hook spammers, we don’t know Google’s complete algorithms – that’s the company secret sauce.\r\n\r\nHowever, the thing is, Google considers links but very strict to the spamming activities to increase traffic. Google created a short video (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BNHR6IQJGZs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BNHR6IQJGZs</a>) to explain how search engines work.\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Pros – The benefits of Link Building</strong></span></h2>\r\nThere are such numbers of benefits of Link Building that helps your SEO.\r\n\r\n<strong>1.Domain &amp; Page Authority</strong>\r\n\r\nThe maximum you gain DA &amp; PA, the maximum chances to get the higher rankings on SERPs. Domain Authority is a search engine ranking score that predicts how a website will rank on SERPs developed by Moz, similarly, Page Authority predicts how a specific page will rank on SERPs. <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/link-building.php\">Generating quality links</a> from popular website helps to increase domain authority as well as page authority and it is one the crucial factor to improves rankings and build trust too.\r\n\r\n<strong>2. Referral Traffic</strong>\r\n\r\nTo increase traffic on own site is the very first motive for every online entrepreneur. When you submit your materials on other’s website with a do-follow link, users read your content and want to get more info about the topic, they follow your link and come to the landing page of your website. Even, many bloggers perform the same activity to increase traffic on their blog’s site.\r\n\r\n<strong>3. Brand Visibility</strong>\r\n\r\nNo doubt! With every content that you published on other websites with a link placed that increase your brand visibility. It helps you to gain the maximum exposure of your brand along with users remind you and help to get the direct traffic in the future.\r\n\r\n<strong>4.Conversion Rate</strong>\r\n\r\nYou created and published your content on a topic – “<strong>Helping hand for HRs</strong>”. When user read your content and he/she might be interested in services that you mentioned in your guest post that he/she follows the link that comes to your desired landing page and makes the desired action that you want. So, this activity can generate a lead for your business.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Link-BuildingBANNER.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-06-20 13:34:11','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(473,'How Social Media Drives Website Traffic: Exploring the Impact and Strategies','how-social-media-drives-website-traffic','','<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-738 size-full\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/1a1797d2a04f9de434c25a7f2aa3f02d-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Social Media is one of the effective way to increase your website traffic in more possible way, it has lots of the audience that you can convert into your website traffic. Through market your products or goods on social media you can easily get the desired results but yes, firstly you have to better understand your business. Confused, right! I will be elaborating this in below point.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Many brands use social media to launch or to promote their products by using different social media channels, you must have seen any product launch video on YouTube or to publish any product information on Facebook or on Twitter.</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Learn the best way to promote your brand on Social Media</span></h2>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-739 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/tempsnip.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"232\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Happiness” with “Taste the Feeling” at the time of 2014 FIFA World Cup. It created the impactful and impressive social media strategy that bring maximum involvement of audience. Coca Cola used multiple social media channels such as – Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, Tumblr, etc., used paid campaigns, attractive content and so on that helped to maximize their ROI and increased the sales as well. And yes, Coca Cola was also the official partner of the 2014 World Cup, it was another a great move.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Don’t worry! I am not telling you to sponsor any big event in your initial stage. You just have to use better social media strategy to increase your website traffic and guess what, it’s free to promote your brand on social media, right, isn’t it!</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000;\">So, let’s get started… Importance of social media in driving website traffic</span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>#1. Create Effective Social Media Strategy</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">First step is, you have to create an effective strategy that which social media audience you want to target. Remember firstly you should have to know your business as I said that above. Let the more light on this – you have to clear points of understand your business nature, needs and requirements. Is your business a technology type or is your business related to the health industry or linked with the food industry – business nature. After that, another step is to find out your business needs and your targeted audience, what your targeted audience and what your targeted audience will be. You cannot offer your sweets type of business to an athlete or you cannot explain your technology business in front of the Luddite (person who hates technology). And finally, choose right social media platform that more beneficial for your business. You can also use multiple social platforms to drive your website traffic.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For an example – if you have a business of making and selling Sweets like – cakes or pastry or something related. Then you should have to research on that which age of people are more passionate about the sweets. Not just by the age but location and income as well. After completed the research then you’re ready to choose social media platform. You can use Facebook &amp; post about your products as well as use Instagram and social bookmarking site i.e. Pinterest, just clicking the photos of cakes, pastry or donuts and publish them with an attractive line. Here, Attractive line refers an appealing and fun-loving content that directly relate with the audience. Dk’s Donuts is one of the most favorite donuts shop in Santa Monica, CA and they use an attractive tagline on their website i.e. Welcome To Donut Heaven – when you first time visit to their website you see this welcoming line. So, my concern is to use effective social media strategy that helps to</span> <strong>increase the traffic</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">on your website.</span></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-740 size-large aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/social-media-marketing-strategy-template-1024x653.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"408\" /></p>\n<h3><strong>#2. Good Content Creation</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Second point to consider is to create appealing and engaging content. Content is not just by write something on some topics but it is also include images, videos and visual graphics. Simply, content is all about to deliver your message and build a communication relationships with your audience. For whichever you create <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/content-marketing.php\">content</a> for social networks, web, blogs and whatever, your content should not to be directly advertise your products or services and that’s why Neil Patel explaining that “Your content type shouldn’t be designed to sell directly to readers. Content may well be the new ad but your focus must be to create original content”.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">So, good and appealing content always generate effective results and yes, don’t forget to use images or videos with your post. It will be more helpful to deliver your message and connect with the audience. Along with you have to always remember that your content must be shareable easily, if any user wants to share your content then you have to give them power to share easily. And in next point you’ll get a better understanding view to use Hashtags in your post.</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>#3. Use Hashtags</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Don’t underestimate the power of Hashtags. By using hashtags in your post can more explaining of your social media posts whatever you posting. It will catch the reader’s attention and helps people to find, follow and contribute to a conversation.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Whenever a user use hashtags in their post on some specific words then it will become the easy searchable on that particular social media platform. Yeah! It is similar to a keyword and when you search something on Google or any other search engines with a specific keyword, let’s take an example of Software then the endless results are showing on that, some may be relate with Software Development agencies, some may be history or definition of software and so on.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Similarly, Hashtags can enhance the engagement on social platform and helps to drive your website traffic by just clicking on the link of your website that you provided in your post. Always provided links of your website along with your post. But yes, one thing about the Hashtags that not to use over excessive of hashtags, target only those words that describe your services or products, that’s it. And, on different social media platforms, hashtags can perform on different ways. Like on Twitter, hashtags are mostly used to start a conversation and on Pinterest, hashtags defines the description and board title and some different kind of use on different social media platform.</span></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-741 size-large aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Understanding-Hashtags-on-Social-Media-1038x611-1024x603.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"377\" /></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>#4. Use Ads &amp; Shop</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Have you heard about the Facebook Ads or Twitter Ads? I am sure, you did and if you not, doesn’t matter. Why not you use it? By run a campaign on Facebook in the form of Facebook Ads that helps to promote your brand or business on Facebook and it also build your credibility as well as increase your website traffic under a minimal costs. Many big brands are now using</span> <strong>Facebook Ads</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">features to promote their services or products. Even, in our (Tech2Globe) initial stage, we used Facebook Ads to get the more visibility about our brand and to get the more traffic on our website and we got the desired results too.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">There is another feature of Facebook which helps to promote and selling your products on Facebook by using Shop by Facebook but it is only for those entrepreneurs or businesses who have not their eCommerce site to sell products and yes, those entrepreneurs also use this who have their eCommerce site. By using this, you can sell your products and increase the chance to build the awareness of your business.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">And, on different social media platforms such as – LinkedIn or YouTube or any other, the process and cost of running an ad campaign may be different. You just have to choose those platform which have maximum potential to generate effective results and Facebook is one with have the largest social users. But, LinkedIn has more genuine users. You can use each one of them or you can use both. My concern is to use both in fact use every social platform.</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>#5. Join &amp; Share</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Joining and Sharing refers to join the groups on social media platforms according to your business nature. If you have a health related business then join health related groups on Facebook, Google+, LinkedIn and on other social network platforms. After joining multiple groups then start sharing your posts on those groups. But, you have to be very careful while sharing post on groups because if you sharing post over then it will be increasing the chance of block of your social account and then start again from the zero. So, keep sharing your post but in a limit.</span></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-742 size-large aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/12-1024x512.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"320\" /></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>#6. Comment &amp; Reply &amp; Analysis</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Last but not least that helps to drive your website traffic. Joining groups and sharing your post on it – is one side and another side is to share your words on other post. I know this is indigestible to share your words on other post. Read carefully, I am not saying to share your post on other’s post, I am saying to share your “Words” on other’s post. Means – you can start a conversation on other’s post by commenting on it from your social account and then slowly share your services or share about your organization without giving any clue to them that you’re trying to present your business. Another thing is – always reply to users who comment on your post, yeah! I know this is not a new thing to tell but it is important. You have to keep maintain an eagle eye on comment section and on inbox area and always reply to them.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Along with, Analysis your whole</span> <strong>social media strategy</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">that it really works or not. If it works and increase the traffic on your website then it’s time to try some new things in the content of your post. Suppose – your social strategy works then you have to try more engagement of your active users by posting questions about technology, if you have a technology business then or post questions about your business related. It helps to generate more engagement of your active users by comment answers of your questions. And you have a chance to start the conversation and offer them a valuable results. And, don’t worry about the one percent of chance that your Social Media strategy doesn’t work. It will be working.</span></p>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read More :- </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.tech2globe.com/top-10-advantages-of-social-media-marketing-for-a-business/\"><strong>10 BENEFITS OF SOCIAL MEDIA FOR BUSINESS </strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/l.0.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-06-19 10:00:24','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(474,'What is Amazon Enhanced Brand Content? And, How Sellers can access to it?','what-is-amazon-enhanced-brand-content-and-how-sellers-can-access-to-it','','<img class=\"wp-image-727 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/BLOG.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"658\" height=\"490\" />\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\"><strong>Amazon Enhanced Brand Content</strong></a> (or simply EBC) is a feature of Amazon that allow certain business owners or brands to list their products as uniquely and completely different from other Amazon Sellers. By using this feature, sellers can create attractive product pages that grab users’ attention, by adding enhanced product images, infographics, product videos, text style &amp; placement and use to tell their brand story while eliminating distractions and visual clutter.\r\n\r\nEnhanced Brand Content also known as Amazon EBC &amp; <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\"><strong>Amazon A+ Content</strong></a>. Below are some examples of EBC that designed by our team.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-728\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/ebc_tech2globe.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1080\" />\r\n\r\nIn the above EBC templates, we used multiple images of products, banners, rich content and describe the right use that help your customers to better understand your offers and answers of their questions. EBC can help to build engagement and keeping your consumers on your product pages longer. It drives more traffic and improve the sales graph.\r\n\r\n<strong>How Sellers can access EBC?</strong>\r\n\r\nEBC can access by only those sellers who have been approved as a brand owners through Amazon Brand Registry. Once you register yourself as a Brand Owner you can access the EBC feature by your Seller Central Account.\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-729\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Brand-Registry_tech2globe.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"310\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nGo to the “<strong><em>Advertising</em></strong>” tab and click on “<strong><em>Enhanced Brand Content”,</em></strong>\r\n\r\nSelect SKU of product for which you want to create EBC.\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-730\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/ebc_tech2globe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"781\" height=\"258\" />\r\n\r\nThen, you’re promoting to the next step where you can select any template that you want to use. Amazon offers some pre-defined templates with image sizes and text placement.\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-731\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/ebc-template_tech2globe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"339\" />\r\n\r\nYou can use any one of the above templates, which will showcase your products more appealing and catching. Before selecting any one, explore every template that perfectly fit for your product. Then, upload enhanced images or banners, add rich content and place a video (if available) and submitted.\r\n\r\nBefore going to make it live Amazon review the whole content and verify your EBC. This process will take up to 1 week. Once, verification will done it will be live on your product page. And, customers can able to see your updated product EBC.\r\n\r\n<strong>How much Amazon charge for Enhanced Brand Content?</strong>\r\n\r\nAmazon doesn’t implement any charges for EBC, it’s totally free for now. But, as its gain the maximum hits, Amazon will soon start charging some fee for Enhanced Brand Content listings. So, we encourage sellers to take the advantage of EBC and make your product listing more attractive before it get paid.\r\n\r\nEven, if you want to outsource your EBC work to design, approved and live, that benefits will surely deliver the desired result. This is the reasons why many businesses are using EBC in their listings.\r\n\r\nLet’s explore the real benefits of using Enhanced Brand Content (EBC).\r\n\r\n<strong>Benefits of Enhanced Brand Content (EBC)\r\n\r\n</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><u>Neglect Bounce Rates</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nCustomers hardly spend their time on reading the title or description of the product. They immediately bounces off your competitor pages, if they catches some convincing details. So, you only have some seconds to engage with your customers and make the first impression first. People are more attracted towards visuals and that’s why EBC play here to engage them, increasing the user session time and help to reduce bounce rates.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><u>Appealing Infographics</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAs I already said in above point that people are naturally visuals and attracted towards graphics. Images play a major role to create an emotional connection and it is the first thing when a customer interact. Appealing infographics can describe your products well and answer all the questions of your customer. And, it’s more likely to make a purchase.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><u>Sets a Brand Value</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you’re a customer and searching for a product on Amazon, what presentation will you choose to get the more product information, you have two options: ordinary typical information or the information which have infographics, videos &amp; having all the elements that connects you.\r\n\r\nObviously, you’re going with the second one. EBC set a positive image and enhance the brand value in the customer’s mind.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><u>Reduce the Negative Graph</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nEnhance Brand Content can deliver the better information to the customers and provide almost all the information. A customer who already knows the things what he/she expect from the product is less likely to post a negative review and ask for a return.\r\n\r\n<strong>Hire an Agency to design your EBC that engage…</strong>\r\n\r\n<em>What is the need to hire an agency</em> – this is the very first question click in the seller mind.\r\n\r\n“Getting the things done from experts or working as own” – both are different. The benefit of hire an agency is the expertise level of understanding the Amazon algorithms and is the quality of deliver the services.\r\n\r\nKeep the above point in mind, Tech2Globe brings all the solutions of Amazon at one-stop destination. As we are certified <strong>Amazon Consultants</strong> &amp; <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/\"><strong>Amazon Global Selling</strong></a> Services Provider, to offers premium Amazon services globally.\r\n\r\nIn line with our vision, to support Amazon Sellers in to handle their Sellers Account, improve the account health, setup new storefront, advertise and market their products to generate impressive ROI, create A+ Content, <strong>amazon buy box consulting</strong> and design an appealing EBC, off course that engage and <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\"><strong>Amazon</strong> <strong>Dropshipping consulting</strong> </a>as well.\r\n\r\nWorking with specialized experts can definitely provide the fruitful results under the following TAT.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, Tech2Globe also arrange Free Seminars / Webinars especially for Amazon Sellers and for newbies who interested to take the advantage of Amazon, to educate them and share relevant insights that help to better understand the Amazon platform. Just simply write to us at <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/ebc_tech2globe.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-05-24 11:35:35','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(475,'HOW TO INCREASE BRAND AWARENESS?','how-to-increase-brand-awareness','','Increase Brand Awareness is important for any business. Everyone wants to enhance their brand awareness for target more customers and increase sales too. But when we are talking about small business then it is more difficult for them to compete with other big companies who spent many dollars on to <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\">enhanced brand awareness</a>. But the truth is after spending enough dollars they didn’t get enough effective results.\r\n\r\nSo, the question is how to increase brand awareness effectively. This article is all about to give you knowledge that how to enhance brand awareness in more possible audience.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Use the power of Social Media</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-714 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Social_Media_Power_Tech2Globe.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"669\" height=\"372\" />\r\n\r\nAccording to the Statista, approx. 2.50 billion of active users are on the social media in 2017 and expected to reach 3.02 billion monthly active social media users by 2021. Social Media is the <a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-packages.php\">best and effective way to increase brand awareness.</a> You can hire any agency to perform Social Media activity or you can done by yourself. You have to keep people aware about your services or products on daily basis by posting. Shared different things that attracts more people attention.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h4><strong>The way of Guest Blogging</strong></h4>\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-715 alignright\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Guest-Posting.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"492\" height=\"278\" />\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://tech2globe.com/guest-posting-packages.php\">Guest Blogging</a> is one of the best and easy way to enhance brand awareness in more audience. Simply, guest posting or guest blogging means writing and publishing an article on other’s websites. You can submitting your blogs according to your niche on different websites. It will helps your business to get more aware in the eyes of the people.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h4><strong>Local Partnerships and Sponsorships</strong></h4>\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-716 alignleft\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/download.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"417\" height=\"229\" />\r\n\r\nPartnerships with local business is the another brand building strategy to get the more awareness. Even many reputed brands use this brand building strategy by providing sponsorship to the international sports tournament. Yes they spent a lot on sponsorship programs. You don’t have to be spent lot money, just sponsor local sports programs, partnerships with local business and organize and donate charity events. This activity will definitely make a positive impact on people’s mind and helps to increase brand awareness.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Radio and Podcasts</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-717 alignright\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/podcast-advertising-illustration-2x.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"226\" />\r\n\r\nYes, you can enhance your brand awareness by giving ads or podcasts on radio. Many people deny this strategy, they think that giving ads or podcasts on radio is obsolete to add in the marketing campaign. But if you get the desired results then why don’t you use. And even this strategy is beneficial for Startups or less invisible business without hardly effect to your pocket.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Last Words…</strong>\r\n\r\nThere are many ways to increase the brand awareness or get the more visibility. You just have to find out different possible ways that actually helps your business to get more popularity. You can use Email Marketing to keep aware audience about your new products or services. And use whole Digital Marketing program.\r\n\r\nBut you have to make sure about the content that you created for any brand strategy. If your content is not relevant to the customers or if your content will not attract audience then your whole campaign will backfire or you can say ruin your whole efforts.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/social-media-plattformen-t.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-05-22 14:02:18','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(476,'Tech2Globe Recognized as a Leading B2B Company in India by Clutch','tech2globe-recognized-as-a-leading-b2b-company-in-india-by-clutch','','Clutch has recognized Tech2Globe as a top B2B company in India. The full list of leaders (about 891) were selected and then published by Clutch on 29 April 2019. <img class=\"wp-image-709 alignleft\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/clutch-tech2globe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"235\" height=\"254\" />\n\nClutch is a B2B ratings and reviews firm based in Washington DC’s DuPont Circle. The platform connects small, mid-market, and large enterprises alike to business services that match their business needs and budget. Clutch’s uses a unique methodology to measure a firm’s ability to deliver, and awards the best of the best every month according to how they measure up against their evaluation process.\n\nAn <a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/46486.html\">ISO 9001:2008 certified</a> software development company, Tech2Globe is passionate about creating web and mobile applications. We help companies of all sizes, including enterprises, digital agencies, and startups. We have proven expertise in IT and a portfolio of successfully completed international projects.\n\nWe’ve compiled a few <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/case-studies.php\">case studies</a> of our successful projects for a quick review as well.\n\nClutch features companies with various expertise, and is comprehensive in this way. We are listed among the top eCommerce developers and even among the top HR consulting firms. It’s exciting to be able to highlight the versatility of our skills in one place, and we hope to connect with businesses who can see the value of working with a one-stop shop for all of these needs.\n\nOur <a href=\"https://clutch.co/profile/what-story\">Clutch profile</a> has our reviews, and resulted in our 4.9-out of 5-stars! The customer service manager at hungry house, when interviewed by a Clutch analyst, had the following to say:\n\n<strong><em>\"I got to know them as an extension of our team, without the normal complications involved with large BPO firms.\"</em></strong>\n\nWith every review, we learn more about our notable strengths and areas where we can improve. In addition to being recognized on Clutch, we are also featured on The Manifest as a top provider of <a href=\"https://themanifest.com/hr/services#tech2globewebsolutionsllp\">HR services</a>. The Manifest is Clutch’s business news and how-to sister-website who provides industry reports and other metrics to help businesses narrow their search for their next business partner.\n\nFor more examples of our work, our portfolio also featured on Visual Objects among other top <a href=\"https://visualobjects.com/in/ecommerce-development/top-ecommerce-developers\">ecommerce developers</a> and creative agencies. As a portfolio website, Visual Objects showcases work from top agencies across the globe.\n\nWe are extremely grateful for everyone who has had a hand in our success – both Clutch and our supportive clients. Up until this point, 2019 has proven rewarding. With this award, we can’t help but feel even more motivated to set our goals even higher, and provide our current and future clients with ambitious solutions. In general, we’re looking forward to both continuing and surpassing this level of success.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/clutch-tech2globe.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-05-14 12:09:39','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(477,'SOUQ.com is now Amazon.ae – What this mean for UAE?','souq-com-is-now-amazon-ae-what-this-mean-for-uae','','<h3>Amazon.ae has plenty of features for customers as well as the favorite platform for Advertisers</h3>\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-699 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/souq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"355\" />\r\n\r\nAfter capturing so many impressions, the eCommerce giant finally re-brands SOUQ.com into Amazon.ae: the new marketplace for United Arab Emirates.\r\n\r\nOn Tuesday (May 01, 2019), Amazon announced the launch of a new marketplace targeting the Middle Eastern market in replace of SOUQ.com, which was acquire nearly two years back for $580 million (Dh2.13 billion).\r\n\r\nThe SOUQ.com URL automatically redirected customers to the <a href=\"https://www.amazon.ae/ref=nav_logo\">Amazon.ae</a> with the message of, “<strong><em>Shop millions of your favorite products from your new local shopping destination”.</em></strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-700 alignright\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/s2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"334\" />\r\n\r\nThis move comes after losses international operations for Amazon and unable to compete with local eCommerce platforms in UAE, first noted at <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2019/01/29/amazon-new-middle-east-marketplace-rivals-souq.html\">CNBC report</a>. Amazon already gave some signs that it has something big plan for Middle Eastern Marketplace, back in 2017 when acquired Souq.com. However, Souq remains available in Saudi Arabia &amp; Egypt.\r\n\r\nWith this launch, Ronaldo Mouchawar (Souq Co-founder &amp; Vice President of Amazon Mena) highlighted that,\r\n\r\n<strong><em>“Since the acquisition, we’ve always looked at what’s best for our customers. A lot of customers trusted the Amazon brand – they love Souq, but they also wanted most of the features.”</em></strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-701 alignleft\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/s3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"435\" height=\"245\" />\r\n\r\nMr. Mouchawar’s added, <strong><em>“Consumers can also expect to see features, like recommendations and wish lists, and faster shipping options. And, we put together what is best for our local customers, but with global capability.”</em></strong>\r\n\r\nLet’s take a closer look at the store and find the opportunities that new marketplace have, for UAE.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h4><u>New Marketplace comes with New Opportunities</u></h4>\r\n“The UAE becomes the first to transition to the Amazon marketplace in the region, and the focus had been on achieving that in the most painless manner possible,” said Ronaldo Mouchawar. What this means is all our regional vendors can migrate to the global platform and with all the benefits that come with it.\r\n<h5>Localized Language</h5>\r\nNew marketplace enables with the need of localization support – for the very first time Amazon introduced Arabic language to serve customers a reliable option who prefer to shop in Arabic, for both the mobile app and the website users. This step clearly shows that Amazon never going to take UAE market as lightly.\r\n<h5>Extreme Advertising</h5>\r\nWith this marketplace, advertising on this also be in the limelight for many advertisers. As Souq.com was already one of the most popular advertising platforms in the region because of its direct targeted alongside with Google &amp; Facebook, and with Amazon, it will be going far more engaging.\r\n<h5>Customer Experience</h5>\r\nThere is something customers too. UAE customers can shop over 30 million products choices from local &amp; international businesses, including products previously available on Souq and 5 million products from Amazon US and experience the rich browsing, accurate results, wishlists, product reviews and reliable delivery with the trusted Amazon name.\r\n<h5>Payment Options</h5>\r\nThere are plenty of options. Consumers can search on the platform for their desired products and pay in AED by using local and international debit card, credit card, cash on delivery (COD) and by Amazon Gift Card. Even customers can enjoy the next day of delivery on orders above Dh100 as well as same day delivery to select areas in the UAE.\r\n<h4>Will Amazon Prime be offered?</h4>\r\n“At this stage we don’t have yet a plan to launch Amazon Prime. We’ll be launching different services at different times”, said Mr. Mouchawar.\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">\"How Tech2Globe helps Souq Sellers for Amazon.ae\"</h4>\r\nAs a certified <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/amazon-consulting-services.php\">Amazon Consultant</a> &amp; Amazon Global Selling Services Provider, we have been focused on to provide the finest <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\">Amazon Services</a> from account setup to product &amp; images optimization to product marketing services and from account management to sales boost and to data recovery, for all the specialized domain (such as, amazon.com, amazon.fr, amazon.de &amp; etc.).\r\n\r\nAs part of our commitment to support Souq Sellers swiftly over to the Amazon.ae (UAE) system, we are helping you to move your account details, inventory or catalogue or all your data from Souq to the new Amazon Seller Central Account.\r\n\r\nJust simply write to us at <em><strong>info@tech2globe.com</strong></em> &amp; the rest things keep aside to handling for us. You can also visit our website @ <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe.com</a>\r\n\r\nAdditionally, Tech2Globe also organize Free Seminars / Webinars only on Amazon Middle Eastern Marketplace for Sellers to educate them and share relevant insights that help to better understand the Amazon algorithms.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/s2.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-05-13 10:58:26','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(478,'Selling on Amazon is now open for UAE','selling-on-amazon-is-now-open-for-uae','','<h4>Amazon now open the doors to sell products on its brand new marketplace i.e., “Amazon.ae” for UAE</h4>\r\nOn January 2019, Amazon planned to launch a new Middle East Marketplace only for UAE sellers in replace of Souq.com.\r\n\r\nNow, it has been official! Selling on Amazon is now available in the UAE.\r\n\r\nThis news came into existence at January 2019, when the two screenshots of new marketplace has gone viral on the internet that we already shared in our previous <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/migrate-your-existing-souq-sellers-account-on-amazon-ae/\">blog post</a>.\r\n\r\nBut, the <a href=\"https://services.amazon.ae/\">new marketplace</a> has the brand new home interface (screenshots below) that completely different from the previous screenshots. It enables more features to educate sellers and encourage them to become familiar with the platform before start offerings products.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-687 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/ae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"530\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAlso, on the same page has the “<a href=\"https://services.amazon.ae/\">Start Selling</a>” button on the top of the page, to get register first. Though you will not be able to list your products and start selling immediately so you are ready once the migrating is complete.\r\n\r\nAmazon also states that, “we are in the process of replacing Souq Selling Center with Amazon Seller Central. Our aim is to simplify the process for sellers, and not ask you to learn two systems in quick succession”.\r\n\r\nHowever, it still a question that Amazon is going to shutting down Souq.com or not?\r\n\r\nAmazon also launch Tutorials and Training program, named <strong><em>“</em></strong><a href=\"https://services.amazon.ae/tutorials-and-training.html/ref=asae_tut_fnav\"><strong><em>Seller University</em></strong></a><strong><em>”</em></strong> for the sellers to make them familiar with the platform. Its offer a variety of resources to help sellers to get started as well as grow your business with Amazon.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-688\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/ae1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"327\" />\r\n\r\nThe page also contains some introductory videos to aware about the basics of Selling on Amazon, How FBA Works, Brand Registry and covers more topics.\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-689 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/ae2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"675\" height=\"351\" />\r\n\r\nOnce migrating process will complete then sellers able to list and sell their products on the platform.\r\n\r\n<strong>Is New Marketplace comes with New Challenges?</strong>\r\n\r\nNew Marketplace definitely comes with new challenges as many Souq sellers are familiar to Souq.com as they are not familiar with the Amazon. There are lots of new features associate with Amazon that helps sellers to promote their products and boost sales. So, it’s pretty challenging for new sellers to get familiar with until/unless they didn’t get the proper support. However, this new move unlock the new opportunities.\r\n\r\n<strong>How Tech2Globe help Souq Sellers?</strong>\r\n\r\nAs, we (<a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/\">Tech2Globe</a>) are Certified Amazon Consultant and Global Services Provider to provide finest Amazon Services from store setup to list products to manage account health and many more.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-690 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/n.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"748\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWith the profound years of experience on <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com.php\">Amazon Global Marketplaces</a> such as Amazon.de, Amazon.ca Amazon.com, Amazon.fr, etc. to handling accounts and deeply understand Amazon features &amp; specifications, we can help Souq Sellers in to migrate their existing Souq Seller Account on Amazon.ae with the existing data as well as help them to list products, run campaigns and manage their seller accounts.\r\n\r\nWe offer multiple services, from account setup, product listings &amp; images, SEO optimized to data recovery to create Amazon rich content, Amazon marketing services and so on.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, Tech2Globe arrange Free Seminars / Webinars on Amazon Middle East Marketplace for Souq Sellers and provides valuable insights to use Amazon as experienced.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/2019-01-31T142409Z_235166432_RC15B2D3A630_RTRMADP_3_INDIA-ECOMMERCE.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-04-26 13:17:04','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(479,'Amazon soon close its Chinese Ecommerce Marketplace at July 18','amazon-soon-close-its-chinese-ecommerce-marketplace-at-july-18','','The eCommerce giant Amazon soon close its Chinese Ecommerce Marketplace, Amazon.\n\ncn by July 18. In order to disastrous to defeat local Chinese eCommerce rivals in the country such as Alibaba and JD.\n\ncom\n\nA report revealed at Thursday that Amazon plan to close down its online retail services to consumers in China.\n\nFrom July 18, Chinese shoppers will no longer to use Amazon services to buy products or goods from their third-party merchants in the country. Amazon plans to move its focus to offering Chinese mainland consumers overseas products rather than goods from local sellers, company said in a statement.\n\nMeanwhile, Company will continue its other operations in China such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Kindle e-books and cross border team that help ship goods from Chinese merchants to customers abroad, Bloomberg News said.\n\nAmazon has struggled to set a benchmark in the country as the increasing number of likes of local retailers such as Alibaba and JD.com in the country, occupied over two-thirds of the whole sector, which increased 20 to 30 percent since 2016, said Li Yongjian, director of the National Academy of Economic Strategy.\n\nHe also said, that Amazon’s decision will not affect the Chinese eCommerce sector.\n\nAn Amazon spokesperson did not explicitly confirm the pull-out plans, but said the company was looking to focus more on cross-border sales.\n\n“Over the past few years, we have been evolving our China <a href=\"https://www.tech2globe.com/blog/how-to-sell-products-internationally-via-amazon-global-selling/\">online retail business</a> to increasingly emphasize cross-border sales, and in return we\'ve seen a very strong response from Chinese customers,\" the spokesperson said in a statement emailed to AFP.\n\nThe company was making “operational adjustments to focus our efforts on cross-border sales in China, the statement said.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/skynews-amazon-china_4643367.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-04-19 10:42:08','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(480,'Life@Tech2Globe – Employee Engagement & Corporate Culture & Responsibilities','lifetech2globe-employee-engagement-corporate-culture-responsibilities','','&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-671\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/51.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"851\" height=\"315\" />\r\n\r\nEmployees are the biggest asset of any organization and without them, you cannot imagine the workplace. Employees Engagement and Corporate Culture is as much important to generate productivity.\r\n\r\nIn this modern era, where the primary focus of every employer is to generate effective results, achieve organization and personal goals too. They heard about how important employee engagement is? And, read all of the benefits of corporate culture. But, unfortunately, most companies still get it wrong.\r\n\r\n<strong>Achieving Goals can be Fun too!</strong>\r\n\r\nAppreciate your teams, organize get-together, engage them with fun-activity, celebrate every single festival, help needy community and much more activity that help to engage employees with the company, it is the commitment and loyalty an employee towards their work, even in a research found the more engagement of employees with the company, the more chances to put their efforts to provide better results.\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><em>Life@Tech2Globe</em></span></h2>\r\nTo keep this concept alive, Tech2Globe take an initiative to follow the corporate culture, engage employees with and encourage them.\r\n\r\nAt Tech2Globe, we believe in to establish an environment where work and life equally balanced and fun too. Our management always focuses to motivate employees and support them to get the things done.\r\n\r\nSome of our glimpses that Tech2Globe share with you:\r\n\r\n<strong>5 Years of Completion</strong>\r\n\r\nRecent days back, Tech2Globe completed its 5 Years of work journey. In this entire journey, we set the bar high by served the best quality product or services to the customers. Our efforts became true when we recognized 2018 Global Leaders of 250+ IT &amp; Business Services Companies by Clutch report. Along with, we were also the part of GES (Global Exhibition on Services) in Mumbai, CEBIT in Germany and GISEC, Future Blockchain Summit and International Apparel &amp; Textile Fair in Dubai, to gain some valuable insights, build networks and serve multiple clients globally.\r\n\r\n<strong>Yearly Annual Party</strong>\r\n\r\nAt every year, we’re increasing our family and one step forward to reach globally. Tech2Gloe organized yearly annual party, where we celebrated and enjoyed every aspect of the function. At that shining evening, started with the short speech about the journey of Tech2Globe and appreciated employees’ hard work, also employees participated in multiple performances such as dance, singing, acting, mimicry and much more. Then, we honored employees’ dedication and hard work with multiple awards category as well as some funny categorize awards with the motive to the described funnies and weirdest side of our team.\r\n\r\n<strong>Candle n’ Cake Cutting</strong>\r\n\r\nWith the help of the technology, our system always updates about the employees’ special days and management planned to wish them. Candle blowing, cake cutting is the part of this celebration and make their born day into more special. Including, there is a custom in Tech2Globe that explain to showcase any talent in front of all the management that nobody ever seen before which should be something different, with the motive to pump-up their confidence and encourage to do something different.\r\n\r\n<strong>Festive Celebrations</strong>\r\n\r\nFestivals are always the happiest time, not only to celebrate but it also attracts the whole community towards the good hopes and fills up with the positive energy, forget the past bad events, and the time to start a new &amp; fresh beginning. Tech2Globe always celebrate every festival whether it is Diwali, Eid, Christmas, Lohri, etc., decorated the whole workplace, ordered snacks and encourage employees to have faith in the honesty and hard work.\r\n\r\n<strong>Friday Fun-Activity</strong>\r\n\r\nThis is the time to pick up the train towards the Fun-Activity area, where all the employees together from seniors to juniors, from managers to colleagues, to take the break from the work on every Friday evening, participate in the multiple indoor games and a chance to win several prizes.\r\n\r\n<strong>Monthly Awards</strong>\r\n\r\nThere are the multiple monthly awards that we honored employees’ hard work and their best work. It includes many categories such as “best performer of the month”, “best team of the month” and “best team lead of the month” too, “wall of fame”, “platinum service award”, “best trainee award” &amp; much more categories, along with, also appreciated them with gift vouchers.\r\n\r\n<strong>CSR Initiative</strong>\r\n\r\nWe understand our responsibilities towards the society, that’s why, from the establishment of Tech2Globe, we take an initiative to help needy peoples and communities to improve their living standard and for the education of needy children. With this concept, we invited the special community in our workplace and educate them by our industry experts as well as make donations. We also organized Free Education Seminars for everyone where we shared insights on various topics.\r\n\r\n<strong>Outdoor Activities</strong>\r\n\r\nOutdoor Activities describes to take break from the office culture and work and enjoyed the outdoor activities, includes to participate at the local cricket tournament as a Tech2Globe’s Team – named TechGlobians. Although we didn’t won the tournament but at least we enjoyed.\r\n\r\nAlong with, we also invested effort in greenery and make environment greener, also participated in marathons for health and more. Our motive is to increase employee engagement and make society a better place to live.\r\n\r\n<strong>In The End…</strong>\r\n\r\nDoing work is necessary to fulfill needs but entertainment is also important &amp; it’s a part of work. In Tech2Globe, we make sure that our employees are always energetic and motivated. Regarding this, we organize social gathering events time-to-time and ensure that our employees are up-to-date as per the market and social requirement and to fulfill the client’s need.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/51.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2019-04-16 12:56:19','2026-06-01 11:30:33','2026-06-01 11:30:33'),(481,'Th