are solutions firms, they have many experienced professionals and the results is “Quality with Efficient”.\r\n<h4><strong>Advanced Technology</strong></h4>\r\nIf you work on any development project then you have to use latest and advanced technology to complete the work on time and with 100% effectiveness but if you don’t have right technology then what? Think to establish? Not a good option because it’s hike your organization goals and there is very less probability that you’re aware or use latest technology but Software Development Solutions firms, they only have expertise in technology and they have many connections in the market to get the latest and advanced technology.\r\n<h4><strong>From Business Prospective</strong></h4>\r\nIf you hire any software solutions firms to meet your objectives and to meet your customer’s goals, you have to think from your business prospective to generate profits because first step is to hire any solutions firm and get the work done but if your product doesn’t meet your marketing goals or difficult to marketed then the whole process is waste. Therefore, you have to use that software solutions provider, which will make the product by keeping marketing in mind.\r\n<h3><strong>Final Words…</strong></h3>\r\nOutsource your software development work, a better option to generate profits rather than establish an environment or infrastructure. It saves your organization cost and money. We hope that this article has helped you to better understand why outsource your software development work give benefit to your organization.\r\n\r\nIf you like this article or want to know about our software development services, please write to us @ <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> or click on <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">www.tech2globe.com</a>','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/vf960v2.png','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-19 06:30:29','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(520,'Email Marketing- A Better Option?','email-marketing-a-better-option','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-354\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Beginners-Guide-To-Email-Marketing.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"300\" />\n\nEmail Marketing is the most important tool for very marketer. Not only because, it’s cheaper but it is also very effective tool for targeting the potential customers.\n\nEmail is the best way for communicating to others, it shows professionalism and more private, that’s why it has number one rank.\n\nEmail marketing is quite effective for advertising your brand or product in front of the people, it is the effective strategy for every business especially for startups or small business entities. According to Statista, in 2017 approx. 269 billion of emails were sent and received in a day and it is expected to increase 306 billion in 2020.\n\nThis article gives you complete overview what email marketing is? Why it is important? And how it is use?\n<h3><strong>WHY EMAIL MARKETING IS IMPORTANT?</strong></h3>\n<img class=\" wp-image-355 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Email-marketing-image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"312\" />\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Cost-Effective </strong>– The cost of email marketing is much lower than any other marketing campaigns. It reduced lots of the additional costs which is implemented at the time of perform like- it cuts the printing, publishing or media cost.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Reduced time and energy</strong> – In any other marketing campaigns, you have to give time and energy, if you are running print postal campaigns then you have to invest to hire a designer and allow for printing after than postal service takes some time to deliver.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Easy-to-create</strong> – You don’t have to require a skilled team for creating emails. There is no need to create a special effect or animation in email marketing. You can use plain or simple text, attach photos, use logos and in fact, there are lots of the successful email campaigns use simple and plain text.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Easy to Share</strong> – It is easy for customer to share your emails with others rather than a verbal communication.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Easy to measure</strong> – To calculate your growth there are lots of the email marketing software you use for check your campaigns growth and improve your productivity.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Friendly by Nature</strong> – Email is also beneficial for our environment. It doesn’t support to cut trees for printing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>DRAWBACKS</strong></h3>\nAdvantages is one side of email marketing and it also has some of the drawbacks, you shouldn’t have to ignore these points (below):-\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Spam</strong> – It is the biggest drawbacks of email marketing because in some countries, spam mail is illegal, if you send any spam mail then you are liable to pay penalty.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Designing Issue</strong> – Designing is the major factor, it could enhance your brand and also make a negative impression. An email should reflect your business in front of the readers.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Size problem</strong> – If your email is longer, readers are not interested as much to read your email. You have to choose images, fonts or videos carefully because if any images or videos takes longer time than you’ll get a negative point.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>HOW IT WORKS?</strong></h3>\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-356 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/is-email-marketing-dead-statistics.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"300\" />\n\nIf you understand the whole concept of email marketing what is it? And why is it important for your business or for generate leads:-\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Use Subject lines</strong> – Subject lines or taglines are really catchy for enhance your brand name. Apple is the biggest examples to use tagline of “Think Different”. You should have to use some subject lines but it will directly connected with your content.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Rich Content</strong> – Content is another way to running a successful email campaigns. Your content should be presentable and easy to read. Avoid unnecessary or heavy words. Use simple and clean content.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Give Offers</strong> – To give offers is best tactic to attract consumers, offers will encourage customers to open and read your email, it will enhance the chance of your successful <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/email-marketing-services\">email marketing</a></strong> campaigns and you could give promotional offer to them.</li>\n</ul>\nSo, you are ready now to set the best email marketing campaigns and give your business a hike. Email Marketing is the golden weapon to hit the success goal.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Email-Marketing.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-18 10:45:55','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(521,'Time to turn your Business into an Application','time-to-turn-your-business-into-an-application','','<img class=\" wp-image-344\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Apps-300x235.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"574\" />\r\n\r\nIn this era, mobile phone used by everyone. Research says, more than 4 billion mobile phones users are available in the world and it is expected to touch more than 5 billion in 2019. Mobile Phones or Smartphones has changed the world completely and now, people used their mobile phones for every purpose. They used mobile phones for complete their various purpose, they shop, communicate, chat, get the directions and so on by just pressing a single button just sitting into their home.\r\n\r\nAnd, today’s smartphone are more advanced and have more computing power than the computers used for the Apollo 11 to land on the moon. It will not be wrong to say that\r\n<h3><strong>Everything is in our Pocket…</strong></h3>\r\nEven, business also affect by smart-phones. Many brand or companies understand the power of smartphones. Their business is not just limited on the web but also in the form of <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\"><strong>Mobile Application</strong></a>. People actually spend 90% of their time on mobile application. You can’t neglect the power of mobile application which actually helps your business to grow longer.\r\n\r\nThrough this article you’ll understand the power of mobile application and why it is important for business.\r\n<h3><strong>Customers Prefer Mobile</strong></h3>\r\nNear about 70% of customers used their mobile phones for shop or buy something. Mobile App give your customers more power to operate your ecommerce store in more effective and easily rather than to go the browser, put your domain and open your site. You have to understand customer’s needs and target it.\r\n<h3><strong>E-commerce Growth</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-342 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/growth_hacking-300x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"505\" height=\"316\" />\r\n\r\nE-commerce growth increases rapidly and targeted local customers as well as global, there is no doubt and cover mostly corner which helps your business to grow. But with mobile application you can target those corners, where your online business has not been.\r\n<h3><strong>Push Notifications</strong></h3>\r\nMobile Application is the most effective way to notify customers about new products, deal of the day, latest news and discounts and so on rather than website. If you’re not upgrade your business into mobile application then maybe you lose customers.\r\n<h3><strong>Better Experience</strong></h3>\r\nMobile Application gives your customers a better user experience rather than website. Your customers can access your ecommerce anywhere, anytime without using browser and it helps to generate more productivity.\r\n<h3><strong>New Generation Audience</strong></h3>\r\nEverything is in the form of application and mostly youngsters are more likely to spend their time by using apps to connect with the world. With the help of application, you can target new generation customers to generate effective results.\r\n<h3><strong>Increase Visibility</strong></h3>\r\n<h3><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-348\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/mobile-app-visibility.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"550\" /></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nStatista says, total 197 billion mobile applications downloaded in 2017 and it is expected to touch 352 billion in 2021. A mobile application can increase your business visibility in more targeted audience because so many peoples using applications to save their time than use a website.\r\n\r\n<strong>Final Thoughts…</strong>\r\n\r\nThere are lots of the different types of mobile applications available in the market. A mobile application could help your business to target customers and can enhance your business activity. You have to use those technology which helps your ecommerce to get effective results. So, what are you waiting for? Take a step in mobile application world with <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\"><strong>Tech2Globe</strong></a>, is an IT Outsourcing Solutions Partner that provide you full <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/mobile-application-development-services\">mobile application development services</a></strong> whether is for iOS, Android, Windows and many more.\r\n\r\nIf you like this article or want to hire Tech2Globe to complete your Application Development needs. So, please contact our technical support team via mail <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> or via skype info.tech2globe.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/AAEAAQAAAAAAAAI-AAAAJDE1OTUyMGRiLWQ5ZDItNDUyOS05Mjc4LWQ3MDBlMzIyZDE4Nw.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-17 11:36:38','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(522,'Facebook vs. LinkedIn: Which is better for B2B Marketing','facebook-vs-linkedin-which-is-better-for-b2b-marketing','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-331\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/fbvsli.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1024\" />\nMarketing is a most important factor to build any brand’s reputation or awareness in front of the needy customers and it is not much as easy as sound. It is more crucial, when we are using social media for marketing. You could use different types of marketing strategy for enhance the brand’s awareness.\n\nBut, today we are talking about B2B Marketing through Facebook and LinkedIn. And, also evaluate which is the best for doing B2B marketing and for your business?\n<h3><strong>Personal vs. Professional</strong></h3>\nPersonal and Professional things both are different, you cannot merge your personal life with professional. On one side, Facebook is mostly use for personal activity or having fun, you can post, share or like as you know that and sometimes you can also use for professional purpose to generate lead. And, other side, LinkedIn is only and only for your professional life and most of the professionals use this or it is a serious business too, you cannot link your personal activity with it.\n\nThat doesn’t mean LinkedIn has better user interface. Many companies focus to targeting audience on Facebook. They are running many campaigns on Facebook. However, Facebook and LinkedIn, both are Social Media giants.\n<h3><strong>NUMBER GAME</strong></h3>\nAccording to the report, Facebook has cross 2 billion of active users and it is expected to increase more than 3 billion users and LinkedIn has almost 470 million users. Yes! Facebook wins the number game. It holds more quantity of users or customer database but it is also difficult to target the productive crowd for B2B while LinkedIn has less quantity of users but you could target the right audience for B2B. Mostly people think that Facebook is better than LinkedIn for b2b, for b2c also or for generate leads and I think they are right.\n\nI know, I choose Quantity over Quality.\n\nBut, you tell me, how many Facebook users use LinkedIn? A few and how many LinkedIn users use Facebook? All of them. You just have to find those LinkedIn users on Facebook for getting the accurate results.\n<h3><strong>STRATEGY TO FOLLOW</strong></h3>\nTo target the audience, it is most important to make a strategy first then hit. Any marketing strategy only works if you know who is your targeting audience? How to reach them with cost effective? If you’re targeting audience is on Facebook then you only just have to find genuine profiles for your business firstly because there are lots of the fake accounts on Facebook for misconduct and Facebook admit 270 million fake or clone accounts exist.\n\nWhile, LinkedIn has more genuine accounts of working professionals, some may be CEO or Marketing Analyst or real b2b companies for ready to do business.\n<h3><strong>TARGETING THE AUDIENCE</strong></h3>\n<img class=\" wp-image-333 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Programmatic-TV-Optimized-Audience-Targeting.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"391\" />\n\nFacebook has more active users than LinkedIn. People spent more time on Facebook to post or chat and it is the number one social media platform. It holds the largest market share. There are 201 million of United States population uses Facebook most by any other country and after that India is the second highest rate of population uses Facebook with 157 million of users.\n\nSo, target the audience on Facebook easy rather than LinkedIn and it is cheaper. According to a survey:-\n<ul>\n 	<li>At the age of 18-26, more than 80% of internet users use Facebook vs. LinkedIn only has more than 22%</li>\n 	<li>At the age of 27-45, 75% of internet users use Facebook while LinkedIn has 30%</li>\n 	<li>At the age of 46-60, 60% of internet users use Facebook and LinkedIn has 26%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3></h3>\n<h3><strong>PAID AD CAMPAIGNS</strong></h3>\nRunning paid ad campaigns is more beneficial rather than to pick one by one profile and offer. Facebook has a wide range and much experienced of running ad campaigns. And, it is more beneficial for <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\"><strong>ecommerce business</strong></a>, if you have any ecommerce business for selling any goods or products then Facebook Ad campaign is for you because it a cheaper one and target the more audience or generate more traffic on your ecommerce site just one click. It has more option like- Video Ads or Carousel Ads or Slideshow. But, LinkedIn has just simple ads or basic displays.\n\nIf you want to some simple ads to your business then LinkedIn is the best option to you but if you want to something more optic than Facebook is right choice for you.\n<h3><strong>IN THE END…</strong></h3>\nIn the End, Facebook or LinkedIn, which is best for your business? It totally depends on you and your business.\n\nBoth are best platform to hit the productive audience.\n\nIf you are focusing on quantity then you are the Facebook one and if your target on quality then LinkedIn is the best choice. Yes! Facebook has the good and advanced marketing strategy but LinkedIn has the genuine user database.\n\n<strong>Social Media</strong> is a great tool of marketing for enhance the awareness of your brand. Whatever social channel you use for marketing, you just have to make sure that you have to choose wisely according to your business and according to your target audience.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/facebook-vs-linkedin.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-11 11:31:48','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(523,'A Better Software Makes a Better Salary Solution','a-better-software-makes-a-better-salary-solution','','<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><em>SALARY IS IMPORTANT TO SURVIVE BUT WITH RIGHT CALCULATION.\r\n</em></strong><strong><em>YES! WE  </em></strong><strong><em>HAVE THE SALARY CALCULATOR TOOL…</em></strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-325 \" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Salary-Negociating-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"430\" height=\"286\" />\r\n\r\nIn all organization, Employees is the major factor for generating the productivity. They give there 100% work support, available 24/7 for increases productivity for their organization or firm. Off course there is no doubt at all. But, Productivity with latest and modern techniques or Software is also provide a hike in your business.\r\n\r\nAnd, instead of 100% availability, employees get a remuneration in the form of <strong>SALARY</strong>. For calculating exact Salary of Employees in manually or with old and obsolete techniques is very difficult work. Firstly, “You have to calculate how many days they worked?”, “How many leaves they taken?”, “How much Incentives or allowances for them” and so on. There are lots of problem with out-of-date techniques for calculating the exact Salary of the Employees. Everyone wants their wage against the hard work. After all, it is all about the Survival.\r\n<h3><strong>ARE YOU STRUGGLING?</strong></h3>\r\nThere is a very famous quotes that “If there is no struggle, there is no progress” but you have to make sure that struggling in a right and effective way. Struggling is ineffective way is totally waste of time and off course, there is no progress at all. So, here is the solution of your Struggling needs and i.e. the SALARY CALCULATOR with 100% accuracy and reliability. Get a <strong>Free Demo version</strong> of this tool. In this modern era, Business wants to become modern in any possible way with different types of techniques or software for increases the productivity and for convert from the Hard Work to Smart Work.\r\n<h3><strong>WHAT EXACTLY IS SAL