dual easily who is working in your organization.</li>\r\n 	<li>It helps you in making know the working status.</li>\r\n 	<li>You can easily check the attendance of your employees with their time which they do access in a day.</li>\r\n 	<li>You can easily use this software not only for an organizational purpose but for also small shops too.</li>\r\n 	<li>Index Page- AT INDEX you can find multiple features also make changes and set few alignments like MONTH DATE, BASIC SALARY, HRA,TRANSPORT ALLOWANCES, OT, ETC. You can adjust it as per your convenience as if you set the parameter once it will help you in getting reports easily within seconds and make you work more easily.</li>\r\n 	<li>It provides you 100% accuracy than any other.</li>\r\n 	<li>Monthly Allowances Calculations with Date and Day calculations.</li>\r\n 	<li>Employees Details and their Leave and Bank Details.</li>\r\n 	<li>You can also make the Individual Report as well.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>FREE DOWNLOADED VERSION OF OUR SALARY CALCULATOR</strong></h3>\r\nWe made the Salary Calculator for enhance the business activity with smart work instead of hard work. Tech2Globe provides you the <strong>FREE DOWNLOADED VERSION</strong> of Salary Calculator up to 10 Employees benefit and we can also customized or upgrade Salary Calculator as per your company’s requirements. You can download this software from this link <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?v=gTWniSME960&amp;event=video_description&amp;redir_token=CR_yXoyS4Q8Ayh59NHdvz7ETQU18MTUxOTI4NzU3M0AxNTE5MjAxMTcz&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fgoo.gl%2FYJpfkw\">https://goo.gl/YJpfkw</a>. For full versions or any customization, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> or you can call at 011-43010700.\r\n\r\nWe can understand the situation of any business economically and professionally as well. Our motive is not only just to make our brand name but we also care you and we always stand behind you for supporting to you in each and every way. This thing makes us different from our competitors, from others or from the Crowd, who is only to earn profit.\r\n\r\n<strong>We really appreciated</strong> for giving us positive results from your side. We always offer you useful technology. If you really like our effort, please write us at <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> and you can also share us your feedback or suggestion for improving the productivity, we take this on priority basis. We are giving you right guidance with 100% accuracy and reliability or in Future also, please! Feel free to contact us problem or query related to our work or services or just knowing the market requirements. You can also join us on Facebook. Thank You!','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/images.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-10 10:07:31','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(524,'Interesting Facts About E-commerce','interesting-facts-about-e-commerce','','<p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. More than 65% of people globally love to shop through their Mobile Phones rather than any other                laptop or system because it is more convenient and easy to travel to anywhere.</p>\n2. Apparel and accessories are the top selling things in ecommerce.\n\n3. 40% of people worldwide uses Internet to buy goods or products.\n\n4. Indian Men shop 3x more than women on ecommerce.\n\n5. Amazon is the second largest online retailer in the world after Alibaba Group.\n\n6. More than 70% of people believe that they got a better deal online than offline.\n\n7. China is the one of the fastest growing ecommerce market in the world.\n\n8. China is the number one ecommerce market in the world, US and UK are the 3<sup>rd</sup> and 4th\n\n9. Top 10 ecommerce sites in the world-\n\n1) Amazon 2) Alibaba 3) Walmart 4) Otto 5) JD 6) Priceline 7) eBay 8) Rakuten 9) Zalando 10) GroupOn\n\n10. According to a research, more than 60% of Parents spend online rather than non-parents.\n\n11. According to a report, in 2017, ecommerce sales achieved $2.2 trillion and it is expected that it will be $4.4 trillion in 2021.\n\n12. According to a research, India will become the top 5 largest ecommerce market in 2021.\n\n13. More than 60% people worldwide prefer Cash on Delivery.\n\n14. According to a research, it is expected that in 2021 only 45% of people worldwide prefer Cash on                 Delivery.\n\n15. Report says, in 2021, credit card will become the first choice to pay the bills.\n\n16. Research says, more than 50% people admitted that online reviews influence their shopping                         decision.\n\n17. What is CYBER MONDAY? Cyber Monday is the marketing term to influence people for shop online more.\n\n18. According to a report, total net income Amazon in 2017 is $3 billion.\n\n19. Report says, it is expected that in 2018, India will spend Rs.875 Crore on online shopping.\n\n20. India’s Ecommerce sector in small but it is still Growing. Report-\n<table width=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><u>YEAR</u></strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"179\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong><u>PERCENTAGE RATE</u></strong><strong>  (Growing)</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2014</td>\n<td width=\"179\">0.80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2015</td>\n<td width=\"179\">1.70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2016</td>\n<td width=\"179\">2.60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2017</td>\n<td width=\"179\">3.60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2018</td>\n<td width=\"179\">4.40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"111\">2019</td>\n<td width=\"179\">4.80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\nIt is clearly shown in the above chart that in 2018, it is expected that Indian Ecommerce percentage rate will be 4.40% and in 2019, it will be 4.80%.\n\n21. Most used Ecommerce sites for shopping in India-\n\nFlipkart, Amazon, PayTM Mall, Snapdeal, Shopclues, Infibeam','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/did-you-know-graphic.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-09 12:01:33','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` VALUES (525,'Redesign Your Marketing To Build Your Brand','redesign-your-marketing-to-build-your-brand','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-286\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/tkgvi1p1-Personal-branding.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1976\" height=\"988\" />\r\n\r\nBrand! We all heard about the ‘Brand’ word but how many knows that ‘what exactly is brand?’ Simply, Brand is not your face, identity card or pictures, it represents your company in front of the customers. Brand is a psychological term, which represents the “Trust Building” in the mind of people or consumers in fact it automatically generated “Trust Building” whenever we talk about brand. And even it also represents the “Quality” of the company, product or services, whatever you buy from them. In simple term, Brand shows the quality and trust.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>MARKETING</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-283 \" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/marketing-planning-700x447-300x192.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"269\" />\r\n\r\nMarketing is a very crucial thing to do and complicated also because you have to take the “right marketing strategy on the right platform for the right customers to target with the right market research”. Mostly people think that marketing is just a common thing to do or everyone can do marketing for any company. But no, it’s not as easy as listening to marketing. There are several companies available in the market, which have spent lots of money and energy to do the perfect marketing for their product or services. Some failed, some succeeded. But they all still try, because marketing is the only way, which helps to enhance your brand’s image.\r\n\r\n<strong>REPORT SAYS</strong>\r\n\r\nAccording to a report, in 2017 the total amount spent on marketing worldwide is almost 590 billion US dollars which increase from 550 billion US dollars in 2016 and it is expected that it will be more increasing to 640 billion US dollars in 2018 and 724 billion US dollars in 2020. Windows Animator Company Microsoft, total spent almost 15 billion US dollar on marketing activity in 2017. It proves that “Marketing is not just a Myth to perform”.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>How to do MARKETING for enhance the Brand?</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-285 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/imgpsh_fullsize-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"638\" height=\"347\" />\r\n\r\nThere are many ways to marketing for your product or services but yes, with the right one. You have to do research on this. Suppose if you want to do marketing for any men’s grooming product so, you have to do R&amp;D (research and development) on like what types of grooming product mostly use by men? Which they mostly prefer? And many more, you just have to research on this firstly and then prepare your right marketing strategy according to the research and target to the right consumers.\r\n\r\n<strong>Most popular ways to do marketing:-</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>   1.Commercials on T.V.</strong>\r\n\r\nTV is the most viewed and loving thing by people. You can give your brand or product on television in the form of ads. You can make ads by yourself and broadcast on any local channel as well as any popular channel or hire any advertising agencies; they can make your product ad in an effective way and broadcast on TV. You just have to give any specific amount to them. You can also make a tagline which helps to build your brand. You can select any specific genre and channels where you can give ad and select package that how much time your ad will shown on the TV. You just have to decide your budget. Genre refers the categories of art, music, entertainment, kids and many more. You can also hire any famous face for your brand or product marketing as a brand ambassador but yes you just have to perform according to your budget.\r\n\r\n<strong>    2. Digital Marketing</strong>\r\n\r\nSimply, digital marketing is the marketing of your brand, product or services with the help of the Internet. In this era, Digitalization is the main factor of developing. Everything is become digital then why not Marketing. Through digital marketing you can easily target customers as well on the Internet. One side, commercial on TV has a limit to attract the audience as per your budget and on the other side, internet has no limit, you can make customers out from your locality, state and countries as well. You can hire any <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">digital marketing agencies</a>.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>It includes:-</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<h3><strong>Social Media Marketing</strong></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSocial Media is a platform where you can chat, make friends, sharing your ideas, update your lifestyle and much more. It is the top 5 most done activity on the internet. It is growing day by day. One of the most favorite social media platforms is Facebook; you can give your ads on this and buy paid campaigns which are operated by Facebook. You can make your YouTube channel and post your promotional video of your product or any new product. You can use more <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/social-media-marketing-services\">social media platform for marketing</a></strong> of your product.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<h3><strong>Content Marketing</strong></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nContent Marketing is also a form of marketing of creating and distributing of fresh and valuable content to attract the audience. You can write fresh content by yourself but you have to make sure the content is not copying from any other website or source because it is illegal, if you do these kinds of activities then you should have to be ready for penalty or you can also hire any content writers.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<h3><strong>Influencer Marketing</strong></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nInfluencer marketing is also the form of marketing, in which focus is on those people, who really interested in your services rather than the whole market. Suppose, if your business is only focus to Women’s Apparels then your mainly focus to target only women. These are the top 3 digital marketing activities but you can also do other things like- <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/email-marketing-services\">email marketing</a></strong>, paid campaigns, mobile marketing and many more.\r\n<h3><strong>     3. Social Values</strong></h3>\r\nSome people have made joke on this topic. They told that how you can do marketing with social values. Social Values is not just to write or discuss rather you have to take a step towards. It is the responsibility of all of us that we help needy peoples and needy children’s for their development and education as well. With these kinds of activities the marketing will automatically generated for your brand or product and it will also enhance your brand’s positive image in the eyes of people.\r\n<h3><strong>     4. Quality</strong></h3>\r\nIf you give your clients some quality goods or services then it will also enhance your brand’s image, there is no doubt. You just have to focus to provide some quality materials to your clients or customers instead of quantity because if customer happy then your business is also happy.\r\n<h3><strong>    5. Psychology Study</strong></h3>\r\nConsumer Psychology is the most effective tactic to influence consumer’s mind to surf on your web and to increase your productivity, it is the study of mind and how it affects our behavior. With some simple hacks your business attracts the more consumers. Firstly, you have to redesign your website according to your business nature and yes! With colors, also plays a major role to target more consumers. Suppose, if you have a beauty product’s business then which color should you use on your ecommerce? Pink! Off course. You just to read article on how colors influence more customers?\r\n\r\nThese are the top 4 marketing strategies which you can do apply. But yes, make your right budget and then perform.\r\n<h3><strong>FROM THE EDITOR’s DESK</strong></h3>\r\nMarketing Strategy is not just a cup of tea to drink and you’re the king\r\n\r\nTo running a successful marketing campaigns you have to study on various topics to influence more customers according to your business nature. Suppose, if your business is only focus to Women’s Apparels then your mainly focus to target only women. Your marketing campaigns should be present your business in front of the world. If you have a startup or small enterprise then you have to give more effort to research on customer’s needs. Take some time, review your budget and resources and plan your marketing platform to hit. Startups can start with <strong>Digital Marketing</strong> in their initial stage because it is the effective marketing tool to <strong>enhance your brand’s name</strong> and you can also invest in Commercials on local channel rather than any well know channel.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/business-brand.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-08 12:42:41','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(526,'SELLER ON FLIPKART ?','seller-on-flipkart','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-275\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/sel-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1350\" height=\"470\" />\r\n\r\nThe Indian E-commerce industry is booming as compared to previous Financial Year. Now in India, online shopping is a basic thing that every age group of people loves to do and it basically made the easy way for buyers to get all the product from online and even for sellers also it is a best platform as they don’t have to struggle a lot and can easily make their product to be reached to the customer.\r\n\r\nAmong the many online sites in India, Flipkart is one of them and it is one of the largest and most popular option. It was founded in October 2007 by Sachin Bansal and Binny Bansal and headquartered in Bengaluru, India. Flipkart gives an option to sell your products. Merchants can now tie up with Flipkart offering to sell their goods through Flipkart.\r\n<h3><strong>How to become a Seller on Flipkart after implemented GST</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-277 size-full aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/stamp-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1.</strong>  First of all, you have to get GSTIN number. Go to the official site of GST and register. Fill all the details and upload all the required documents.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2.</strong> Business Registration for LLP or Private Limited with Bank Statement of your company.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3.</strong> You have to get the Brand Registration with Trademark, if you are selling own products. Or, you have to get the Brand Authorization Letter, if you are selling any other brand’s products.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4.</strong> Go to Flipkart Seller Portal i.e. <a href=\"https://seller.flipkart.com/\">https://seller.flipkart.com/</a> and Register yourself with email and phone number and click on “Start Selling”.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5.</strong> Fill all the personal details and upload all the required documents like- Pan Card, Aadhar Card, Bank Account Details, Address Proof, Photographs and Tax Registration documents.\r\n\r\nAfter you verified by the Flipkart then you are ready for Selling Online. Sell your products on Flipkart and generate more income as well as more customers and brand name. If you faced any problems regarding selling online so, please <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\"><strong>contact us</strong></a> because we (Tech2Globe) are one of them to provide all the <strong><a href=\"https://goo.gl/zy1rM3\">ecommerce solution</a>s</strong> to helping inventory levels and managing Cash Flows, calculating Pricing Policy, Product Placing Techniques and all the support from zero to end, you need to be seller and make you be the perfect seller to get your work done comfortably with all loyalty and support.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nYou know all the things to be seller on Flipkart, it’s time to upgrade your business into an online world and earn more. If you think this article is helpful for you or any queries then please write to us <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a>','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/how-to-sell-on-flipkart.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-05-07 13:14:53','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(527,'Boost Your Sale Upto 30% by Outsourcing Product Uploading Services To Tech2Globe','boost-your-sale-upto-30-by-outsourcing-product-uploading-services-to-tech2globe','','<img class=\"size-full wp-image-250 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Outsourcing-product-listing.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"710\" height=\"399\" />\r\n\r\nE-commerce plays an important role in every way of life. It gives us freedom to buy or shop products online without investing time in physical store. This industry’s growth increases rapidly, report says that global E-commerce sales expected to cross 4 trillion US dollars in 2021. Mostly business owners or entrepreneurs are looking to invest in e-commerce and make a profitability business. Whatever we shop through e-commerce, each and every information regarding products like- product’s image, description, keywords, price, stock availability, etc. All are the part of Product Management.\r\n\r\nWebsite making is not enough to start selling online or generate revenue from online sales, product management is also the factor to generate productivity. Here, Product Management plays a very important role to any seller who’s selling their products or goods on any e-commerce because it helps consumers to find more easily your products on any ecommerce. It includes Category Management, Multiple Images, Inventory Management, and Tax Management, Custom Tagging and Featured Products and many more things to manage. To handle product management is not an easy task, you have to understand customer’s requirements and use product management skills in more effective way.\r\n\r\nProduct Management requires specialist and experienced manpower to handle and understand customer’s needs. Here, Tech2Globe offers a wide scope to enhance your product management quality. We have a skilled and experienced team to solve your all product management related problems and give best and better results. <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">Tech2Globe</a></strong> works on Amazon, eBay, Flipkart, Shopclues, Snapdeal, Sears, Newegg, Rakuten and many more.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong><u>OUR PRODUCT UPLOADING TASKS TO PERFORM</u></strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>PRODUCT TITLE AND DESCRIPTION</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nProduct Title provides the information of your product that what product is and Description is the most important factor because a customer firstly read a product description and on the behalf of they made a purchase.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>PRODUCT IMAGES</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nA good image always attract consumers to check out that particular product. If your product’s image is not attractive as much then it badly affects your brand. We (<strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">Tech2Globe</a></strong>) have a team of trained professionals who enhance your product’s image quality and give a better interface with different angles.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>PRODUCT VARIANTS AND KEYWORDS</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nProduct Variant is a variant of a particular product grouped with other related item. A product variant with their size (like- S, M, L, XL or XXL) and color (like- Red, Green, Blue, etc.). We also generate unique keywords for your product which helps to describe your product best.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>PRODUCT ATTRIBUTES</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nProduct Attributes gives an additional information about your products like for color of a shirt, you can add red, green or blue (whatever the color of your shirt) and for size, you can create S, M, L, XL or XXL according to your stock.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>IMAGE PROCESSING</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAnalysis your whole product’s image and improve your product’s image quality. We have a team of experienced photo editors who have skilled to find out the patterns that cannot be seen by human eye and done work on image sharpening, image recognition and complete restoration.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>IMAGE RESIZING</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nResizing your product’s image and spread from length and wide according to the requirement without changing the pixels of the image. Our professionals deliver the best work without affect the image quality.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>INVENTORY MANAGEMENT</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nOur team handle the whole Inventory Management process of ordering, storing and final delivery of the stock. Manage an Inventory is not an easy task to perform that’s why we have a specialist team to manage your inventory and our effective Inventory Management services will also help you to save time from order to deliver.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><u>PRODUCT REPORTING</u></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nProduct Reporting is main factor of any business and for any seller. Our team provide you complete reporting of your stock that how much product has sold and how much products has left to order.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTech2Globe always ensure to use effective and efficient techniques and tactics to deliver the better results. Our professionally trained experts covers each and every point to improve image quality, product pricing, product description and title, product pricing and keyword generation and managing stock to generate more productivity. Our <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/online-business-management-amazon-com\">Product Uploading Services</a></strong> could boost your sales up to 30% and enhance your brand’s visibility in more customers.\r\n\r\nSo, Stop! Investing in a wrong way. Come! Join Tech2Globe to improve your business visibility and sales as well. We are here to solve your Product Uploading problems. Feel Free to contact us via mail <a href=\"mailto:info@tech2globe.com\">info@tech2globe.com</a> and via Skype <strong>info.tech2globe</strong>.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/boost-your-sale.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-04-20 12:09:12','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(528,'Come Fast! Don\'t Miss! Catch the flight of Ecommerce Event before it goes out...','come-fast-dont-miss-catch-the-flight-of-ecommerce-event-before-it-goes-out','','<img class=\" wp-image-223 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/13-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"345\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTech2Globe is one of the leading organization to provide the effective <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/complete-ecommerce-solution-india\">eCommerce solutions</a></strong> with an affordable price. Since 2014, we are providing best eCommerce services which helps to enhance your e-commerce business from $10 to $100 million. And, in our journey from starting to now, we have many satisfied clients from India and Internationally as well especially from US, UK, Germany.\r\n\r\nNow in 2018, Tech2Globe is a part of world’s leading Event on Services i.e. Global Exhibition on Services 2018 conducting at Mumbai in Bombay Exhibition Centre from May 15 to 18. It’s a 4 days of Global Event with more than 450 organizations participate and buyers.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>HIGHLIGHTS</u></strong>\r\n\r\nEcommerce Market is one of the fastest growing industry, especially in developing countries like- India, is the greatest market to target eConsumers and it is expected to touch $200 billion by 2026, according to Morgan Stanley report (a global financial services firm).\r\n\r\nGES 2018, is the biggest event on Services firstly inaugurated by India in 2015 to boost service sector. This event gives a deep knowledge of ecommerce sector and helps to improve your product quality for running a profitable business. More than 60 country’s Business Delegations and Buyers will be participating to focus on 20 ecommerce sector, they will share their thoughts and solutions to resolve the problems and also share their experience that they faced at the time of entering in eCommerce field. Now in days, Ecommerce Sector is improving day-by-day and contributing almost 62% GVA (gross value added) in India’s growth, said by Economic Survey.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>ROLE OF TECH2GLOBE</u></strong>\r\n\r\nIndian Government always focus to promote Service Sector, that’s why started <strong>Global Exhibition on Service</strong>s. <strong><a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com\">Tech2Globe</a></strong> is about to come in GES 2018 for promote our <strong>eCommerce services</strong> and we always focus to deliver our best skills, experience and knowledge to our clients. Our aim is not only to contribute in eCommerce service sector but we work in multiple services related to Software Development Services, Data Management Services, KPO Services, Digital Marketing Services, Photo Editing Services and many, in our whole contribution journey started from 2014, we made many healthy relationships with our clients and globally as well and even with others service providers, we always ensure that every client is satisfied with our services.\r\n\r\nAnd, last but not least, talking about GES 2018, again it is a great effort by Indian Government in this way (service sector) in the form of GES event to provide best solutions, to give better guidance, to meet global business associations or vendors or buyers, to generate on the spot leads, to eliminate eRetailer’s and eConsumer’s fear at the time of entering in eCommerce. This Event will focus on ecommerce service sector through roundtables, celebrity talk, cultural evening, food festival and state sessions. Tech2Globe also to showcase their skills and whole journey in GES 2018 about ecommerce sector. So, Come! Join and explore the success journey with Tech2Globe give you an invitation to be a part of this greatest event GES 2018.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/13.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-04-13 08:05:20','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(529,'Save around 60% cost by outsourcing Restaurant Data Menu Services – Tech2Globe','save-around-60-cost-by-outsourcing-restaurant-data-menu-services-tech2globe','','<img class=\" wp-image-213 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/10-techs-300x146.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"321\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-231 size-full\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/menu-entry-sercices.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"934\" />\r\n\r\nRestaurant industry is one of the fastest growing industry and most favorite by the consumers. Food industry has spread all over the world, you must have seen a western restaurant in eastern countries or an eastern restaurant in western countries. In results, Restaurant Menu Data Entry Services enhance day by day. More than 75% of consumers likely to check menu online before ordering or book a table reservation. Restaurant’s owners didn’t have any specialized resources/team to provide accurate Menu Entry Service that’s why restaurant’s owners outsource their menu data entry work to <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/\">outsourcing companies</a></span> and it also helps to provide accurate work and enhance customers.\r\n\r\nTech2Globe is one of them to provide effective and accurate <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/restaurant-menu-entry-services\">menu data entry services</a></span>. We have a specialized team, who have experienced in this field. They work on client back end system to enter their complex Menu’s. During our existence in a market we didn’t receive any negative feedback from our customers.\r\n<h4><strong>OUR PROCESS</strong></h4>\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-214 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/food-menu-5-e1469612476613-300x157.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\nCustomers always wants more, they always try to experience new things. They gets bored fast if you always serve one thing. And, we understand, it’s very difficult for any restaurant owner to change menu online on daily basis instead you have many other important works to perform. That’s why, Tech2Globe works here to provide 100% accurate Restaurant Menu Data Entry Services with Zero Error. Our ideal process of Menu Data Entry as mentioned below:-\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Data Entry</strong> – Tech2Globe provides you the effective menu entry services in the form of both Manual Data Entry and Optical Character Recognition Data Entry (OCR) for fulfill your needs.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Input Files</strong> – PDF’s, images and scanned documents is also the part of menu entry services and we can also work on this.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Output Files</strong> – Files like-MS EXCEL, CSV, XML, HTML and MS WORD, Tech2Globe works on these files as well.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Zero Error</strong> – An error is never be ignore in menu entry process because one error can ruin your business and it also can ruin your goodwill that’ why Tech2Globe provides you 100% error free services.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Custom Services</strong> – Tech2Globe provides you the separate files options for your menu like- for main menu, combo menu, daily or special menu.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Turn Around Time - </strong>We follow 24 - 48 hour’s turnaround time for each menu</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong> </strong></h4>\r\n<h4><strong>MAIN KEY TO FOCUS</strong></h4>\r\nFrom 2014, Tech2Globe is the name of efficiency and trust. In our whole journey till now, we always ensure that we have provided one of the best and effective services to our client’s and we believe in customer satisfaction is our first priority. As a result, we are the part of global restaurant food chain to provide our services, we have many satisfy clients globally especially from US &amp; UK and we still works for them. Here, the main key points of Tech2Globe to focus:-\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fully experienced team:</strong> Experienced is the main factor to generate profitable productivity. We have fully experienced team, who have several years of experience in this field.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Access to skilled resources</strong>: After outsourcing your business you no longer need to invest in recruiting and training expensive resources for your business as we already have highly skilled resources</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Restaurant Data Management</strong> – A good presentation attracts the customer in more possible way. Tech2Globe is the one-stop platform to complete your all restaurant menu entry needs in the form of menu design, menu formatting, menu conversion, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Confidentiality</strong> – Privacy Policy is the main key when we talk about restaurant food chain. Tech2Globe secure your menu data from theft or misuse with Security Management System, we also made a Non-Disclosure Agreement.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cost-effective Prices</strong> – Your Company can save around 60% by outsourcing your work to Tech2globe. We care your pocket because we believe in to build better relations with our clients.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quality Check</strong> – Tech2Globe always ensure to do ISO standards quality check at each and every stage of work.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heavy Volumes Data</strong> – We have a specialized team for manage heavy volumes data.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Increased Efficiency</strong>: We can do the job better with our knowledge and understanding of this domain. This leads to an increase in productivity and efficiency in the process thereby contributing to the bottom-line of your company.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4></h4>\r\n<h4><strong>CHOOSE TECH2GLOBE</strong></h4>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-246\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/menu-entry-banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" />\r\n\r\nTech2Globe is reliable and affordable for complete all your <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/restaurant-menu-entry-services\">menu data entry problems</a></span>. We have experienced and well trained workforce for handle large volumes data with accuracy and Zero errors. You can save around 60% of cost by outsourcing your work to Tech2Globe. Also, you can send us 1-2 samples (with instructions) which we will do in free and give you the prices based on the work required. WE always ensure to complete your restaurant menu data entry needs within time-period.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/menu-entry-sercices.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-04-10 10:38:03','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(530,'Why Choosing Different Type OF Events Is Important For Startup Companies OR Has Less Visibility In Market?','why-choosing-different-type-of-events-is-important-for-startup-companies-or-has-less-visibility-in-market','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-236\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/resize.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"934\" />\r\n\r\nProductivity is the main factor for enhance the business, off course, no doubt at all and this becomes even more important when your business has a less visibility in the market or if you have a startup firm. So, <em>how can you increase your business productivity?</em>\r\n\r\nThis article relates to different types of Professional Events, you should have to attend because if being Startup you’re facing a lots of fluctuation then professional events could save your business to become insolvent and give you stability. But yes, there is also a bitter truth about startup companies that they don’t think events is crucial for their business. Recently, one of our client, he has a startup online fashion firm and some physical store in different locations, so, in a conversation, “our experts suggest to him to attend a fashion trade show, it could be more enhance your business productivity and give your business more visibility”. But he refused, he said that events is just a waste of time. Don’t know why lots of peoples and <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/contact-us\">Startup companies</a> don’t think there is a number of opportunities are comes from a professional events.\r\n\r\n<strong>Did You Know?</strong>\r\n\r\nAccording to a research, the whole meeting industry spent more than 125 US billion dollars in a professional MICE (Meetings, Incentives, Conferences, Events) and research said that more than 70% of people changed their perspective about a brand after attending events. So, how could you say events is just a waste of time? It could be provide you more opportunities, you can make clients, and you can make networks with other business entrepreneurs. Lots of the examples, Head Blade is one of them, founded by Todd Greene, he also started his business of head shaving equipment from events and even from the street, he approached people and present his head shave equipment on the street as well. And, now his business is become the most creative business idea. And, mostly Hollywood celebrities men use head shaving equipment.\r\n\r\nNow, come back to the topic there are many Corporate Events or Professional Events, you should have to attend in 2018, where you can join different community, participate in the discussions, attend the workshops and give your business a turning point. Firstly, we are talking about:-\r\n\r\n<strong><u>INDUSTRY EVENTS</u></strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-244\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/industry.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"710\" height=\"270\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-205\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Industry-events-710x270-300x114.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"114\" />\r\n\r\nMost of the best industries professional and business owners are gathered here! Attending an Industry Events is one of the best option to give a hike to your business according to your industry. It provides to you the best quality of market requirements. Most of the professionals ignore these valuable thing. Industry Events is not just only to share thoughts with the speaker but it also give you the brief knowledge of the market changes and customer’s needs.\r\n\r\nThis event allows you to share your problems and thoughts, you can build connections with others business entrepreneurs and you can make customers as well. You can’t ignore these industry events. You get the benefits from different company’s experience, it could give you another opportunity to make an empire.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>E-COMMERCE EXPO EVENTS</u></strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-206\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/ecommerce-expo-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-237\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/xpo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"708\" height=\"473\" />\r\n\r\nEcommerce is one of the fastest industry in the world and mostly in developing countries. Ecommerce events is not only for those startups who’s have an online presence but it is also beneficial for offline industry too. Ecommerce Events would guide you the whole knowledge of ecommerce and covers all the topics from beginner to advance. Speakers give you the brief guidance from website designing and hosting, themes, plugins, product management to future requirements and changes of this (ecommerce) industry. Mostly people have fear to enter in ecommerce world, they think there are lots of the drawbacks of this industry i.e. fraud, hacking, hard to manage and many more.\r\n\r\nBut they don’t even realize that most of the big ecommerce companies (like- Amazon, Flipkart) is depending on this structure. From ecommerce events, you will get the complete knowledge of how to start and what precautions should you take? You could also meet lots of the <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/ebay-store-design-services\">ecommerce solutions service providers</a> in this event.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>TRADE SHOWS</u></strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-207\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/TradeShowIdealCandidate-300x198.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"198\" />\r\n\r\nThere are lots of things to explore in Trade Show. Generally in trade events, many companies showcase their products or services, it could be anything like- cosmetic, electronics, books and services like- ecommerce solutions, shipping, and finance. Mostly trade shows reserved for business or company’s representatives, only some trade shows are open for public.\r\n\r\nResearch shows that about 70% of people are buying any products in the end of the event. Trade shows is most important for every startups because it has a lots of business varieties under a one roof along with different people. There is some fees to participate in this event, gives your business a new start, you can present your products, services or experience, and you can target the variety of future customers. Consumer Electronic Trade Show is one of the example.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>GLOBAL EXHIBITION ON SERVICES</u></strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-238\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/ges.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"565\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-208\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/ges-0-300x170.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" />\r\n\r\nGES is one of the best events you should have to attend in 2018, which will held in Mumbai, India on 15-18 May, 2018. This event mostly focus on services sector. Global event is such an event where gather many international business giants from different sectors from across the world. Lots of the best industry experts will presents different types of services like- banking and finance, education, IT and telecom, health care, hospitality services and many more along with discussions on how to improve? Or how to solve problems?\r\n\r\nIf you’re in service sector then this event will give you the deep knowledge to understand your business nature and target the potential customer and make connections with different service providers. Along with, there will be a cultural evening, celebrity talk, state sessions, seminars and much more to explore.\r\n<h4><strong><u>POSITIVE IMPACT TO ATTEND AN EVENT</u></strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>NETWORKING AND RELATIONSHIPS OPPORTUNITIES</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAccording to you, which is the best way for making connections with other persons? Attending an event provides you the wings to build relationships with new person and new business vendors, it gives you the wide opportunity to enhance your business activity from outside of your locality and even out from your country. With a cup of coffee, you can make long-lasting relationships with suppliers, your future customers or different industry experts, they’ll help you to grow your business with right and effective market strategies.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>NEW STRATEGIES</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nReading any blog and article is the easiest way to learn something new thing or new strategies but in an event you can more personalize with the speakers. According to a research, while you’re seeing any live thing or event you are making more personal relationship with the speakers. Let’s take an example of a movie, have you noticed ever, while you are watching any movie you are getting more personalized with the movies character, you begin to imagine yourself in place of them (movie’s characters) and you are more focusing towards. That’s why an event is more effective way to learn something new strategies in an effective way that will help to grow longer.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>AWARENESS OF YOUR BRAND</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you are participating in the events, discussions with the professionals, attend the workshops or share your thoughts, it could enhance your business brand. There are lots of the attendees over there, all are the business professionals, and they watch you and your business and what can be better opportunity from an event? This is the opportunity what you’re looking for, it will 100% enhance your brand awareness and set a positive impact on other’s mind.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>SOLUTIONS TO THE PROBLEM</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nMany people search on the internet to find out the solutions of their problems. I am sure, you’re the one of them, they read articles, magazines or watch videos to get the solutions but you cannot ask to a question from these things. Question/Answer round give you the opportunity to ask the questions related to your industry or market requirements and changes or customer’s needs to the speaker and you can get the best solutions from the industries best professionals.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>TAKE A BREAK</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nEvents is the effective way to gaining knowledge and the solutions of your problems but you cannot neglect, this is also a better opportunity to having fun. How many events are organized in your place or locality? A Few. To attend an event which is held in different cities is the great way to explore new things and to explore new place from work schedule.\r\n<h4><strong><u>FROM THE EDITIOR’S DESK</u></strong></h4>\r\nFrom an event you get the benefits in every possible way. You cannot refused above points of positive impact of an event. You’ll get the solutions from all your problems. Event is not just a professional thing, it also a type of knowledge fest, entertainment activity and to see new technologies.\r\n\r\nOver the brunch or a tea, you’ll get all the answers, tips, strategies and tactics from the professional who already make many mistakes in their initial business stage. There are many types of events are exist in the world. All are the best and knowledgeable but yes you cannot attend all of these.\r\n\r\nLast but not least, always try to attend global events as well because globally events give guidance to running a profitable business and yes! It is also a house of international professionals or business giants. You can see most famous faces in global events.','http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/resize.jpg','publish','Tech2globe',1,'2018-04-06 07:33:35','2026-06-01 11:30:34','2026-06-01 11:30:34'),(531,'Single Platform for Multiple Language Translations','single-platform-for-multiple-language-translations','','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-233\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/imgpsh_fullsize-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1021\" height=\"612\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-190 aligncenter\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/Translation-Service-Tech2Globe-300x78.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"706\" height=\"183\" />\r\n\r\nTech2globe, a German, French &amp; Spanish Translation Company, in Delhi India is ISO 9001:2008 certified. We provide well qualified native <strong>German translators</strong>. Well, a translation can be done through a machine as well but why we need human translation? As a machine translation cannot be replaced 