ontent Management Marketing</strong>\r\n\r\nSoftware that promote creating, editing organizing and publishing content. Content Management System used for controlling files documents also on design and display and help in creating and publishing the content. Integrated document management. <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/content-management-system\"><strong>Content Management System</strong></a> comes up with different forms with prices and organization must figure out the most essential one.\r\n\r\nTech2Globe lean on your concern, we integrated set of modules that will take you to new level of information and manage your data efficiently. It includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Web Content Management</li>\r\n 	<li>Document Management</li>\r\n 	<li>Knowledge Management</li>\r\n 	<li>Media and Digital Asset Management</li>\r\n 	<li>Business Process Management</li>\r\n 	<li>Collaboration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>      Web Application Development</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/web-application-1-300x226.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" />\r\n\r\nWeb application development is the process and practice where client–server software application in which the client (or user interface) runs in a web browser. Web application often interpreted by open source network. Without even installing it on local hard drive program allow the user to pay monthly or yearly fee for use of a software application.\r\n\r\nTech2Globe professional’s state-for-art technologies and latest industry trends deliver to technically complex and foolproof solutions with flawless performance ratio.\r\n<h3>LAMP (PHP/MySQL)</h3>\r\nPHP (very common Server Side Scripting language - Linux / Unix based Open Source - free redistribution, usually combines with MySQL database)\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>FRAMEWORKS: CakePHP, CodeIgniter (CI), Zend, Symfony, YII</li>\r\n 	<li>OPEN SOURCE: Joomla, Magento, Drupal, WordPress</li>\r\n 	<li>DATABASES MySQL 5.x</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Microsoft ASP.NET (C# &amp; VB.NET)</h3>\r\nASP.NET (Microsoft\'s Web Application Framework - successor of ASP)\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>OPEN SOURCE: NHibernate, Log4Net, Spring.NET, Quartz.NET</li>\r\n 	<li>DATABASES: SQL Server 2005/2008</li>\r\n 	<li>WEB AND DESKTOP APPLICATIONS: ASP.NET (MVC3), ASP.NET 3.5/4.0 (C# / VB.NET) Web Services, AJAX, Windows Work flow Foundation, Silverlight, Sharepoint.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>    SharePoint Web Development</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-8\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/sharepoint-web-development-1-300x72.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"72\" />\r\n\r\nSharePoint allow you to add applications and features as required to meet rising demands providing extensible framework. Its services encourages the limits of program to create robust solutions that are secured, standard, instantaneous, easy to use and leading services. SharePoint also includes CAL (client access license).\r\n\r\nTech2Globe provides an array of services on SharePoint with the assistance of our rich <a href=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/sharePoint-web-development-services\">SharePoint Development</a> skilled and years of development experience with many other services:\r\n\r\n<strong>SharePoint Services</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Application Development</li>\r\n 	<li>Web Part Development</li>\r\n 	<li>Web Development</li>\r\n 	<li>Portal Design</li>\r\n 	<li>Website Design</li>\r\n 	<li>SharePoint Development</li>\r\n 	<li>Custom Sharepoint Development</li>\r\n 	<li>Sharepoint Consultancy</li>\r\n 	<li>Sharepoint Deployment</li>\r\n 	<li>Migration to Sharepoint 2010</li>\r\n 	<li>Sharepoint Integration</li>\r\n 	<li>Sharepoint Maintenance Services</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Ruby on Rails Development</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9\" src=\"http://www.tech2globe.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/ruby-on-rails-applicati